DEFINE	How light is reflected, transmitted, absorbed, and preserved	How light is reflected, transmitted, absorbed, and preserved
RECORD	para 4	A research-led guide to the OpenPBR Surface model,
RECORD	para 5	microfacet reflection, Fresnel, layered materials,
RECORD	para 6	diffuse/specular energy sharing, transmission,
RECORD	para 7	multiple-scattering compensation, and white-furnace tests.
