DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v2	-even so, if you are not accepted in the Court of the Lord, then all this adoration is false. ||2||
RECORD	para 734	ijn kau siqguir QwipAw iqn myit n skY koie ] (17-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) jin ka-o satgur thaapi-aa tin mayt na sakai ko-ay. No one can overthrow those who have been established by the True Guru.
RECORD	para 735	Enw AMdir nwmu inDwnu hY nwmo prgtu hoie ] (17-7, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) onaa andar naam niDhaan hai naamo pargat ho-ay. The Treasure of the Naam, the Name of the Lord, is within them, and through the Naam, they are radiant and famous.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v3	nwau pUjIAY nwau mMnIAY AKMfu sdw scu soie ]3] (17-7, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) naa-o poojee-ai naa-o mannee-ai akhand sadaa sach so-ay. ||3||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v3	They worship the Naam, and they believe in the Naam. The True One is forever Intact and Unbroken. ||3||
