RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v1	nw byVI nw qulhVw nw pweIAY ipru dUir ]1] (17-10, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) naa bayrhee naa tulharhaa naa paa-ee-ai pir door. ||1||
