DEFINE	para 744	myry Twkur pUrY qKiq Afolu ] (17-11, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) mayray thaakur poorai takhat adol. My Lord and Master is Perfect; His Throne is Eternal and Immovable.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v1	gurmuiK pUrw jy kry pweIAY swcu Aqolu ]1] rhwau ] (17-11, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) gurmukh pooraa jay karay paa-ee-ai saach atol. ||1||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v1	rahaa-o. One who attains perfection as Gurmukh, obtains the Immeasurable True Lord. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 746	pRBu hirmMdru sohxw iqsu mih mwxk lwl ] moqI hIrw inrmlw kMcn kot rIswl ] (17-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) parabh harmandar sohnaa tis meh maanak laal. motee heeraa nirmalaa kanchan kot reesaal. The Palace of the Lord God is so beautiful. Within it, there are gems, rubies, pearls and flawless diamonds. A fortress of gold surrounds this Source of Nectar.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v2	ibnu pauVI giV ikau cVau gur hir iDAwn inhwl ]2] (17-13, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) bin pa-orhee garh ki-o charha-o gur har Dhi-aan nihaal. ||2||
UPHOLD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v2	How can I climb up to the Fortress without a ladder? By meditating on the Lord, through the Guru, I am blessed and exalted. ||2||
DEFINE	para 748	guru pauVI byVI gurU guru qulhw hir nwau ] (17-13, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) gur pa-orhee bayrhee guroo gur tulhaa har naa-o. The Guru is the Ladder, the Guru is the Boat, and the Guru is the Raft to take me to the Lord's Name.
RECORD	para 749	guru sru swgru boihQo guru qIrQu drIAwau ] (17-14, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) gur sar saagar bohitho gur tirath daree-aa-o. The Guru is the Boat to carry me across the world-ocean; the Guru is the Sacred Shrine of Pilgrimage, the Guru is the Holy River.
