DEFINE	para 751	pUro pUro AwKIAY pUrY qKiq invws ] (17-15, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) pooro pooro aakhee-ai poorai takhat nivaas. He is called the Most Perfect of the Perfect. He sits upon His Perfect Throne.
RECORD	para 752	pUrY Qwin suhwvxY pUrY Aws inrws ] (17-15, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) poorai thaan suhaavnai poorai aas niraas. He looks so Beautiful in His Perfect Place. He fulfills the hopes of the hopeless.
