DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v1	rahaa-o. I dwell upon the One Word of the Shabad. You are mine-what else do I need? ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 760	jwie puChu sohwgxI qusI rwivAw iknI guxˆØI ] (17-19, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) jaa-ay puchhahu sohaaganee tusee raavi-aa kinee gunee. Go, and ask the happy soul-brides, "By what virtuous qualities do you enjoy your Husband Lord?"
