RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v3	jo iqsu Bwxw so QIAY Avru n krxw jwie ]3] (18-9, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) jo tis bhaanaa so thee-ai avar na karnaa jaa-ay. ||3||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v3	Whatever pleases Him comes to pass; nothing else can be done. ||3||
