RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v4	nwnk vsqu pCwxsI scu saudw ijsu pwis ]4]11] (18-10, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) naanak vasat pachhaansee sach sa-udaa jis paas. ||4||
