DEFINE	para 787	lwlu gulwlu ghbrw scw rMgu cVwau ] (18-11, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) laal gulaal gahbaraa sachaa rang charhaa-o. Like the poppies, they are dyed in the deep crimson color of Truthfulness.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlu 1 v1	scu imlY sMqoKIAw hir jip eykY Bwie ]1] (18-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) sach milai santokhee-aa har jap aykai bhaa-ay. ||1||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlu 1 v1	Those contented souls who meditate on the Lord with single-minded love, meet the True Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 789	BweI ry sMq jnw kI ryxu ] (18-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) bhaa-ee ray sant janaa kee rayn. O Siblings of Destiny, become the dust of the feet of the humble Saints.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlu 1 v1	sMq sBw guru pweIAY mukiq pdwrQu Dyxu ]1] rhwau ] (18-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) sant sabhaa gur paa-ee-ai mukat padaarath Dhayn. ||1||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlu 1 v1	rahaa-o. In the Society of the Saints, the Guru is found. He is the Treasure of Liberation, the Source of all good fortune. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 791	aUcau Qwnu suhwvxw aUpir mhlu murwir ] (18-13, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) oocha-o thaan suhaavanaa oopar mahal muraar. Upon that Highest Plane of Sublime Beauty, stands the Mansion of the Lord.
RECORD	para 792	scu krxI dy pweIAY dru Gru mhlu ipAwir ] (18-14, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) sach karnee day paa-ee-ai dar ghar mahal pi-aar. By true actions, this human body is obtained, and the door within ourselves which leads to the Mansion of the Beloved, is found.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlu 1 v2	gurmuiK mnu smJweIAY Awqm rwmu bIcwir ]2] (18-14, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) gurmukh man samjaa-ee-ai aatam raam beechaar. ||2||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlu 1 v2	The Gurmukhs train their minds to contemplate the Lord, the Supreme Soul. ||2||
RECORD	para 794	iqRibiD krm kmweIAih Aws AMdysw hoie ] (18-15, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) taribaDh karam kamaa-ee-ahi aas andaysaa ho-ay. By actions committed under the influence of the three qualities, hope and anxiety are produced.
