RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlu 1 v3	inj Gir mhlu pCwxIAY ndir kry mlu Doie ]3] (18-16, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) nij ghar mahal pachhaanee-ai nadar karay mal Dho-ay. ||3||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlu 1 v3	Within the home of the self, the Mansion of His Presence is realized when He bestows His Glance of Grace and washes away our pollution. ||3||
DEFINE	para 797	ibnu gur mYlu n auqrY ibnu hir ikau Gr vwsu ] (18-16, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) bin gur mail na utrai bin har ki-o ghar vaas. Without the Guru, this pollution is not removed. Without the Lord, how can there be any homecoming?
RECORD	para 798	eyko sbdu vIcwrIAY Avr iqAwgY Aws ] (18-17, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) ayko sabad veechaaree-ai avar ti-aagai aas. Contemplate the One Word of the Shabad, and abandon other hopes.
