DEFINE	para 801	iDRgu jIvxu dohwgxI muTI dUjY Bwie ] (18-18, isrIrwgu, mhl 1) Dharig jeevan duhaaganee muthee doojai bhaa-ay. The life of the discarded bride is cursed. She is deceived by the love of duality.
