RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v1	Without the Word of the Shabad, peace does not come. Without her Husband Lord, her suffering does not end. ||1||
DEFINE	para 804	muMDy ipr ibnu ikAw sIgwru ] (18-19, isrIrwgu, mhl 1) munDhay pir bin ki-aa seegaar. O soul-bride, without your Husband Lord, what good are your decorations?
