DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v2	He Himself unites us in Union with Himself; the True Mansion of His Presence is close at hand. ||2||
REQUIRE	para 859	swih swih quJu sMmlw kdy n ivswryau ] (20-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) saahi saahi tujh sammlaa kaday na vaysaara-o. With each and every breath, I dwell upon You; I shall never forget You.
RECORD	para 860	ijau ijau swhbu min vsY gurmuiK AMimRqu pyau ] (20-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) ji-o ji-o saahab man vasai gurmukh amrit pay-o. The more the Lord and Master dwells within the mind, the more the Gurmukh drinks in the Ambrosial Nectar.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v3	mnu qnu qyrw qU DxI grbu invwir smyau ]3] (20-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) man tan tayraa too Dhanee garab nivaar samay-o. ||3||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v3	Mind and body are Yours; You are my Master. Please rid me of my pride, and let me merge with You. ||3||
