RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v4	Git Git joiq inrMqrI bUJY gurmiq swru ]4] (20-8, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) ghat ghat jot nirantree boojhai gurmat saar. ||4||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v4	One who sees that Light within each and every heart understands the Essence of the Guru's Teachings. ||4||
DEFINE	para 865	gurmuiK ijnI jwixAw iqn kIcY swbwis ] (20-9, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) gurmukh jinee jaani-aa tin keechai saabaas. Those who understand are Gurmukh; recognize and applaud them.
RECORD	para 866	scy syqI ril imly scy gux prgwis ] (20-9, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) sachay saytee ral milay sachay gun pargaas. They meet and merge with the True One. They become the Radiant Manifestation of the Excellence of the True One.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v5	nwnk nwim sMqoKIAw jIau ipMfu pRB pwis ]5]16] (20-9, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) naanak naam santokhee-aa jee-o pind parabh paas. ||5||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v5	16|| O Nanak, they are contented with the Naam, the Name of the Lord. They offer their bodies and souls to God. ||5||16||
DEFINE	para 869	suix mn imqR ipAwirAw imlu vylw hY eyh ] (20-10, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) sun man mitar pi-aari-aa mil vaylaa hai ayh. Listen, O my mind, my friend, my darling: now is the time to meet the Lord.
DEFINE	para 870	jb lgu jobin swsu hY qb lgu iehu qnu dyh ] (20-11, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) jab lag joban saas hai tab lag ih tan dayh. As long as there is youth and breath, give this body to Him.
