REQUIRE	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v3	Chanting the Name of the Lord, O my soul, you shall be emancipated; as Gurmukh, you shall come to understand your own self. ||3||
RECORD	para 880	qnu mnu gur pih vyicAw mnu dIAw isru nwil ] (20-16, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) tan man gur peh vaychi-aa man dee-aa sir naal. I have sold my body and mind to the Guru, and I have given my mind and head as well.
