DEFINE	para 1086	Awpy nyVY dUir Awpy hI Awpy mMiJ imAwnuo ] (25-10, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) aapay nayrhai door aapay hee aapay manjh mi-aano. He Himself is near, and He Himself is far away; He Himself is in-between.
