DEFINE	para 1123	mn icMidAw vru pwvxw jo ieCY so Plu pwie ] (26-5, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) man chindi-aa var paavnaa jo ichhai so fal paa-ay. The blessings of the wishes of the mind are obtained, and the fruits of one's desires.
