RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 Gru 1 v2	mnu inrmlu hir riv rihAw pwieAw drgih mwnu ]2] (26-8, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) man nirmal har rav rahi-aa paa-i-aa dargahi maan. ||2||
