RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 Gru 1 v3	Those who attain the Inexhaustible Name of the Infinite Lord remain happy throughout the four ages. ||3||
DEFINE	para 1135	gur imilAY nwmu pweIAY cUkY moh ipAws ] (26-11, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gur mili-ai naam paa-ee-ai chookai moh pi-aas. Meeting with the Guru, the Naam is obtained, and the thirst of emotional attachment departs.
