RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v2	Gr hI ivic mhlu pwieAw gur sbdI vIcwir ]2] (30-2, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) ghar hee vich mahal paa-i-aa gur sabdee veechaar. ||2||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v2	Within the home of their own inner being, they obtain the Mansion of the Lord's Presence, reflecting on the Guru's Shabad. ||2||
