RECORD	para 1272	Anidnu duK kmwvdy inq johy jm jwly ] (30-3, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) an-din dukh kamaavday nit johay jam jaalay. Night and day, they suffer in pain; they see the noose of Death always hovering above them.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v3	supnY suKu n dyKnI bhu icMqw prjwly ]3] (30-4, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) supnai sukh na daykhnee baho chintaa parjaalay. ||3||
