DEFINE	para 1274	sBnw kw dwqw eyku hY Awpy bKs kryie ] (30-4, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) sabhnaa kaa daataa ayk hai aapay bakhas karay-i. The One Lord is the Giver of all; He Himself bestows all blessings.
RECORD	para 1275	khxw ikCU n jwveI ijsu BwvY iqsu dyie ] (30-5, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) kahnaa kichhoo na jaav-ee jis bhaavai tis day-ay. No one else has any say in this; He gives just as He pleases.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v4	nwnk gurmuiK pweIAY Awpy jwxY soie ]4]9]42] (30-5, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) naanak gurmukh paa-ee-ai aapay jaanai so-ay. ||4||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v4	O Nanak, the Gurmukhs obtain Him; He Himself knows Himself. ||4||
