DEFINE	para 1279	gur prswdI min vsY haumY dUir kryie ] (30-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee man vasai ha-umai door karay-i. By Guru's Grace, He abides in the mind, and egotism is driven out.
