DEFINE	para 1290	bwJhu gurU Acyqu hY sB bDI jmkwil ] (30-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) baajhahu guroo achayt hai sabh baDhee jamkaal. Without the Guru, all are unconscious; they are held in bondage by the Messenger of Death.
