RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v1	She does not attain the Mansion of His Presence; she does not find the door to His House. ||1||
RECORD	para 1327	BweI ry iek min nwmu iDAwie ] (31-10, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) bhaa-ee ray ik man naam Dhi-aa-ay. O Siblings of Destiny, meditate on the Naam with one-pointed mind.
