RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v2	soBwvMqI sohwgxI ijn gur kw hyqu Apwru ]2] (31-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) sobhaavantee sohaaganee jin gur kaa hayt apaar. ||2||
