RECORD	para 1652	krxY vwlw ivsirAw dUjY Bwie ipAwru ] (39-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) karnai vaalaa visri-aa doojai bhaa-ay pi-aar. I have forgotten the Doer of all; I am caught in the love of duality.
