RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v3	gurmqI suKu pweIAY scu nwmu aur Dwir ]3] (39-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gurmatee sukh paa-ee-ai sach naam ur Dhaar. ||3||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v3	Through the Guru's Teachings, peace is found, with the True Name enshrined in the heart. ||3||
