DEFINE	para 1661	jw dyKw pRBu Awpxw pRiB dyiKAY duKu jwie ] (39-16, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) jaa daykhaa parabh aapnaa parabh daykhi-ai dukh jaa-ay. When I see my God, seeing God Himself, my pain is taken away.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v1	jwie puCw iqn sjxw pRBu ikqu ibiD imlY imlwie ]1] (39-16, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) jaa-ay puchhaa tin sajnaa parabh kit biDh milai milaa-ay. ||1||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v1	I go and ask my friends, "How can I meet and merge with God?"||1||
RECORD	para 1663	myry siqgurw mY quJ ibnu Avru n koie ] (39-17, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) mayray satiguraa mai tujh bin avar na ko-ay. O my True Guru, without You I have no other at all.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v1	hm mUrK mugD srxwgqI kir ikrpw myly hir soie ]1] rhwau ] (39-17, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) ham moorakh mugaDh sarnaagatee kar kirpaa maylay har so-ay. ||1||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v1	rahaa-o. I am foolish and ignorant; I seek Your Sanctuary. Please be Merciful and unite me with the Lord. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 1665	siqguru dwqw hir nwm kw pRBu Awip imlwvY soie ] (39-18, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) satgur daataa har naam kaa parabh aap milaavai so-ay. The True Guru is the Giver of the Name of the Lord. God Himself causes us to meet Him.
