RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v2	hau gur srxweI Fih pvw kir dieAw myly pRBu soie ]2] (39-19, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) ha-o gur sarnaa-ee dheh pavaa kar da-i-aa maylay parabh so-ay. ||2||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v2	I have come and collapsed in the Guru's Sanctuary. In His Kindness, He has united me with God. ||2||
RECORD	para 1668	mnhiT iknY n pwieAw kir aupwv Qky sBu koie ] (39-19, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) manhath kinai na paa-i-aa kar upaav thakay sabh ko-ay. No one has found Him by stubborn-mindedness. All have grown weary of the effort.
RECORD	para 1670	shs isAwxp kir rhy min korY rMgu n hoie ] (40-1, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) sahas si-aanap kar rahay man korai rang na ho-ay. Thousands of clever mental tricks have been tried, but still, the raw and undisciplined mind does not absorb the Color of the Lord's Love.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v3	kUiV kpit iknY n pwieE jo bIjY KwvY soie ]3] (40-1, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) koorh kapat kinai na paa-i-o jo beejai khaavai so-ay. ||3||
REQUIRE	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v3	By falsehood and deception, none have found Him. Whatever you plant, you shall eat. ||3||
DEFINE	para 1672	sBnw qyrI Aws pRBu sB jIA qyry qUM rwis ] (40-2, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) sabhnaa tayree aas parabh sabh jee-a tayray tooN raas. O God, You are the Hope of all. All beings are Yours; You are the Wealth of all.
