DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 Gru 1 v4	In the terrifying world-ocean of poison, people are drowning-please lift them up and save them! This is servant Nanak's humble prayer. ||4||
RECORD	para 1675	sireeraag mehlaa 4. Siree Raag, Fourth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 1676	nwmu imlY mnu iqRpqIAY ibnu nwmY iDRgu jIvwsu ] (40-4, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) naam milai man taripat-ee-ai bin naamai Dharig jeevaas. Receiving the Naam, the mind is satisfied; without the Naam, life is cursed.
