DEFINE	para 1688	aun jnm jnm kI mYlu auqrY inrml nwmu idRVwie ] (40-10, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) un janam janam kee mail utrai nirmal naam drirh-aa-ay. The filth of many incarnations is washed away, and the Immaculate Naam is implanted within.
