RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v4	Servant Nanak has obtained the most exalted state, lovingly attuned to the True Guru. ||4||
RECORD	para 1691	gux gwvw gux ivQrw gux bolI myrI mwie ] (40-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) gun gaavaa gun vithraa gun bolee mayree maa-ay. I sing His Glories, I describe His Glories, I speak of His Glories, O my mother.
RECORD	para 1692	gurmuiK sjxu guxkwrIAw imil sjx hir gux gwie ] (40-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) gurmukh sajan gunkaaree-aa mil sajan har gun gaa-ay. The Gurmukhs, my spiritual friends, bestow virtue. Meeting with my spiritual friends, I sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v1	hIrY hIru imil byiDAw rMig clUlY nwie ]1] (40-13, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) heerai heer mil bayDhi-aa rang chaloolai naa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v1	The Diamond of the Guru has pierced the diamond of my mind, which is now dyed in the deep crimson color of the Name. ||1||
DEFINE	para 1694	myry goivMdw gux gwvw iqRpiq min hoie ] (40-13, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) mayray govindaa gun gaavaa taripat man ho-ay. O my Lord of the Universe, singing Your Glorious Praises, my mind is satisfied.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v1	AMqir ipAws hir nwm kI guru quis imlwvY soie ]1] rhwau ] (40-14, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) antar pi-aas har naam kee gur tus milaavai so-ay. ||1||
