RECORD	para 1708	ijnI myrw ipAwrw rwivAw iqn pICY lwig iPrwau ] (41-1, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) jinee mayraa pi-aaraa raavi-aa tin peechhai laag firaa-o. I follow in the footsteps of those who enjoy the Love of my Beloved.
