RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v1	hau siqgur ivthu vwirAw ijin hir pRBu dIAw idKwie ]1] rhwau ] (41-3, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) ha-o satgur vitahu vaari-aa jin har parabh dee-aa dikhaa-ay. ||1||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. I am a sacrifice to the True Guru, who has shown me the Lord God. ||1||Pause||
