RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v2	hau guru swlwih n rjaU mY myly hir pRBu pwis ]2] (41-5, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) ha-o gur saalaahi na raj-oo mai maylay har parabh paas. ||2||
