RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v3	jo hir pRB Bwxw so QIAw Duir iliKAw n mytY koie ]3] (41-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) jo har parabh bhaanaa so thee-aa Dhur likhi-aa na maytai ko-ay. ||3||
