RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v1	sjxu siqguru purKu hY duKu kFY haumY mwir ]1] rhwau ] (41-11, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) sajan satgur purakh hai dukh kadhai ha-umai maar. ||1||
