DEFINE	para 1731	ibnu siqgur plY nw pvY mnmuK rhy ibllwie ] (41-14, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) bin satgur palai naa pavai manmukh rahay billaa-ay. Without the True Guru, it is not obtained. The self-willed manmukhs continue to cry in misery.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v3	Eie siqgur AwgY nw invih Enw AMqir k®oDu blwie ]3] (41-14, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) o-ay satgur aagai naa niveh onaa antar kroDh balaa-ay. ||3||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v3	They do not bow before the True Guru; the demon of anger is within them. ||3||
