RECORD	para 1738	Awv GtY nru nw buJY iniq mUsw lwju tukwie ] (41-17, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) aav ghatai nar naa bujhai nit moosaa laaj tukaa-ay. Man's life is diminishing, but he does not understand. Each day, the mouse of death is gnawing away at the rope of life.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v1	guVu imTw mwieAw psirAw mnmuKu lig mwKI pcY pcwie ]1] (41-18, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) gurh mithaa maa-i-aa pasri-aa manmukh lag maakhee pachai pachaa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v1	Maya spreads out like sweet molasses; the self-willed manmukh is stuck like a fly, rotting away. ||1||
DEFINE	para 1740	BweI ry mY mIqu sKw pRBu soie ] (41-19, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) bhaa-ee ray mai meet sakhaa parabh so-ay. O Siblings of Destiny, God is my Friend and Companion.
