RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v4	nwnk Bwg vfy iqnw gurmuKw ijn AMqir nwmu prgwis ]4]33]31]6]70] (42-5, isrIrwgu, mÚ 4) naanak bhaag vaday tinaa gurmukhaa jin antar naam pargaas. ||4||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 4 v4	O Nanak, great is the good fortune of those Gurmukhs, who are filled with the Light of the Naam within. ||4||
