RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 5 Gru 1 v1	The Creator does not come into the mind of the blind, idiotic, self-willed manmukh. ||1||
DEFINE	para 1757	myry mn suKdwqw hir soie ] (42-8, isrIrwgu, mÚ 5) mayray man sukh-daata har so-ay. O my mind, the Lord is the Giver of peace.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 5 Gru 1 v1	gur prswdI pweIAY krim prwpiq hoie ]1] rhwau ] (42-8, isrIrwgu, mÚ 5) gur parsaadee paa-ee-ai karam paraapat ho-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 5 Gru 1 v1	rahaa-o. By Guru's Grace, He is found. By His Mercy, He is obtained. ||1||Pause||
