RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 1 v6	mnmuiK nwmu ivswirAw ijau fiv dDw kwnu ]6] (63-19, isrIrwgu, mÚ 1) manmukh naam visaari-aa ji-o dav daDhaa kaan. ||6||
