REQUIRE	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v4	If the Lord, the Giver of Peace, does not dwell within the mind, then they shall depart with regret in the end. ||4||
RECORD	para 2696	pyeIAVY jgjIvnu dwqw gurmiq mMin vswieAw ] (65-3, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) pay-ee-arhai jagjeevan daataa gurmat man vasaa-i-aa. In this world of my father's house, through the Guru's Teachings, I have cultivated within my mind the Great Giver, the Life of the World.
