RECORD	para 2700	siqguru syivAY shju aUpjY haumY iqRsnw mwir ] (65-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) satgur sayvi-ai sahj oopjai ha-umai tarisnaa maar. Serving the True Guru, intuitive peace wells up, and ego and desire die.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v6	hir guxdwqw sd min vsY scu riKAw aur Dwir ]6] (65-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) har gundaataa sad man vasai sach rakhi-aa ur Dhaar. ||6||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v6	The Lord, the Giver of Virtue, dwells forever within the minds of those who keep Truth enshrined within their hearts. ||6||
DEFINE	para 2702	pRBu myrw sdw inrmlw min inrmil pwieAw jwie ] (65-7, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) parabh mayraa sadaa nirmalaa man nirmal paa-i-aa jaa-ay. My God is forever Immaculate and Pure; with a pure mind, He can be found.
WHEN	para 2703	nwmu inDwnu hir min vsY haumY duKu sBu jwie ] (65-7, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) naam niDhaan har man vasai ha-umai dukh sabh jaa-ay. If the Treasure of the Name of the Lord abides within the mind, egotism and pain are totally eliminated.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v7	siqguir sbdu suxwieAw hau sd bilhwrY jwau ]7] (65-8, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) satgur sabad sunaa-i-aa ha-o sad balihaarai jaa-o. ||7||
