RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v8	nwnk soBw suriq dyie pRBu Awpy gurmuiK dy vifAweI ]8]1]18] (65-9, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) naanak sobhaa surat day-ay parabh aapay gurmukh day vadi-aa-ee. ||8||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v8	O Nanak, God blesses us with the sublime awakening of consciousness; He Himself grants glorious greatness to the Gurmukh. ||8||
