DEFINE	para 2719	sy jn scy inrmly ijn siqgur nwil ipAwru ] (65-16, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) say jan sachay nirmalay jin satgur naal pi-aar. Those humble beings who are in love with the True Guru are pure and true.
