DEFINE	para 2723	hir kw nwmu inDwnu hY ijsu AMqu n pwrwvwru ] (65-18, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) har kaa naam niDhaan hai jis ant na paaraavaar. The Name of the Lord is the Treasure, which has no end or limitation.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v7	gurmuiK syeI sohdy ijn ikrpw kry krqwru ]7] (65-18, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gurmukh say-ee sohday jin kirpaa karay kartaar. ||7||
