DEFINE	para 2725	nwnk dwqw eyku hY dUjw Aauru n koie ] (65-19, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) naanak daataa ayk hai doojaa a-or na ko-ay. O Nanak, the One Lord alone is the Giver; there is no other at all.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v8	gur prswdI pweIAY krim prwpiq hoie ]8]2]19] (65-19, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee paa-ee-ai karam paraapat ho-ay. ||8||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v8	By Guru's Grace, He is obtained. By His Mercy, He is found. ||8||
