RECORD	para 2730	hir rsu pIvY shij rhY aufY n AwvY jwie ] (66-2, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) har ras peevai sahj rahai udai na aavai jaa-ay. She drinks in the Sublime Essence of the Lord, and abides in intuitive ease; she does not fly around coming and going.
