DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v1	She obtains her home within her own heart; she is absorbed into the Name of the Lord, Har, Har. ||1||
RECORD	para 2732	mn ry gur kI kwr kmwie ] (66-3, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) man ray gur kee kaar kamaa-ay. O mind, work to serve the Guru.
