RECORD	para 2735	jyqw aUfih duK Gxy inq dwJih qY ibllwih ] (66-4, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) jaytaa oodeh dukh ghanay nit daajheh tai billaahi. The more they fly around, the more they suffer; they burn and cry out in pain.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v2	ibnu gur mhlu n jwpeI nw AMimRq Pl pwih ]2] (66-4, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) bin gur mahal na jaap-ee naa amrit fal paahi. ||2||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v2	Without the Guru, they do not find the Mansion of the Lord's Presence, and they do not obtain the Ambrosial Fruit. ||2||
UPHOLD	para 2737	gurmuiK bRhmu hrIAwvlw swcY shij suBwie ] (66-5, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gurmukh barahm haree-aavlaa saachai sahj subhaa-ay. The Gurmukh is like God's tree, always green, blessed with the Sublime Love of the True One, with intuitive peace and poise.
RECORD	para 2738	swKw qIin invwrIAw eyk sbid ilv lwie ] (66-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) saakhaa teen nivaaree-aa ayk sabad liv laa-ay. He cuts off the three branches of the three qualities, and embraces love for the One Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v3	AMimRq Plu hir eyku hY Awpy dyie Kvwie ]3] (66-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) amrit fal har ayk hai aapay day-ay khavaa-ay. ||3||
