RECORD	para 2741	iqMnw pwis n bYsIAY Enw Gru n igrwau ] (66-7, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) tinnaa paas na baisee-ai onaa ghar na giraa-o. Don't even bother to sit near them-they have no home or village.
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v4	ktIAih qY inq jwlIAih Enw sbdu n nwau ]4] (66-7, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) katee-ah tai nit jaalee-ah onaa sabad na naa-o. ||4||
