RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v8	nwnk nwim vfweIAw krim prwpiq hoie ]8]3]20] (66-13, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) naanak naam vadaa-ee-aa karam paraapat ho-ay. ||8||
