RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v3	gurmqI hir sdw pwieAw rsnw hir rsu smwie ]3] (66-19, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gurmatee har sadaa paa-i-aa rasnaa har ras samaa-ay. ||3||
