RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v6	ibnu sbdY Brmu n cUkeI nw ivchu haumY jwie ]6] (67-4, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) bin sabdai bharam na chook-ee naa vichahu ha-umai jaa-ay. ||6||
