DEFINE	para 2778	sbdy haumY mwrIAY mwieAw kw BRmu jwie ] (67-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) sabday ha-umai maaree-ai maa-i-aa kaa bharam jaa-ay. Through the Shabad, egotism is conquered and subdued, and the illusion of Maya is dispelled.
