RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v7	The Gurmukh obtains the Treasure of the Naam with intuitive ease. ||7||
DEFINE	para 2780	ibnu gur gux n jwpnI ibnu gux Bgiq n hoie ] (67-7, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) bin gur gun na jaapnee bin gun bhagat na ho-ay. Without the Guru, one's virtues do not shine forth; without virtue, there is no devotional worship.
