DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v1	gurbwxI iesu jg mih cwnxu krim vsY min Awey ]1] (67-10, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gurbaanee is jag meh chaanan karam vasai man aa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v1	Gurbani is the Light to illuminate this world; by His Grace, it comes to abide within the mind. ||1||
