RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v1	guru pUrw swlwhIAY shij imlY pRBu soie ]1] rhwau ] (67-11, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gur pooraa salaahee-ai sahj milai parabh so-ay. ||1||
REQUIRE	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. Praising the Perfect Guru, you shall easily meet with that God. ||1||Pause||
