RECORD	para 2790	gurmuiK sbdu kmweIAY hir vsY min Awie ] (67-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) gurmukh sabad kamaa-ee-ai har vasai man aa-ay. The Gurmukh practices the Shabad, and the Lord comes to dwell within the mind.
