RECORD	para 2793	bRhm ky byqy sbdu pCwxih haumY jwiq gvweI ] (67-13, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) barahm kay baytay sabad pachhaaneh ha-umai jaat gavaa-ee. Those who know God and recognize His Shabad lose their ego and class consciousness.
