RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v4	eyko pVY eyko nwau bUJY dUjw Avru n jwxY ]4] (67-15, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) ayko parhai ayko naa-o boojhai doojaa avar na jaanai. ||4||
RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v4	He read only of the One and he understood only the One Name; he knew no other at all. ||4||
