DEFINE	para 2815	BweI ry gur ibnu shju n hoie ] (68-6, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) bhaa-ee ray gur bin sahj na ho-ay. O Siblings of Destiny, without the Guru, intuitive balance is not obtained.
