RECORD	isrIrwgu mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. Serving the True Guru, the Lord abides within the mind, and no trace of filth shall attach itself to you. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 2870	scY sbid piq aUpjY scy scw nwau ] (69-14, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) sachai sabad pat oopjai sachay sachaa naa-o. From the True Word of the Shabad comes honor. True is the Name of the True One.
