RECORD	para 3323	min srb suK vuTy goivd quTy jnm mrxw siB imit gey ] (81-7, isrIrwgu, mÚ 5) man sarab sukh vuthay govid tuthay janam marnaa sabh mit ga-ay. All pleasures have come to dwell in the mind; the Lord of the Universe is pleased and appeased. Birth and death have been totally eliminated.
