RECORD	isrIrwg kI vwr mhlw 4 slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, they merge imperceptibly into the Lord, who has bestowed His Favor upon them. ||2||
RECORD	para 3730	pauVI ] (90-19) pa-orhee. Pauree:
