RECORD	para 3734	hir Bgqw no dyie Anµdu iQru GrI bhwilAnu ] (91-1, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) har bhagtaa no day-ay anand thir gharee bahaali-an. The Lord bestows bliss upon His devotees, and gives them a seat in the eternal home.
RECORD	para 3735	pwpIAw no n dyeI iQru rhix cuix nrk Goir cwilAnu ] (91-1, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) paapee-aa no na day-ee thir rahan chun narak ghor chaali-an. He does not give the sinners any stability or place of rest; He consigns them to the depths of hell.
RECORD	isrIrwg kI vwr mhlw 4 slokw nwil v19	hir Bgqw no dyie ipAwru kir AMgu insqwirAnu ]19] (91-2, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) har bhagtaa no day-ay pi-aar kar ang nistaari-an. ||19||
