RECORD	isrIrwg kI vwr mhlw 4 slokw nwil v20	O Nanak, sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord, and see the Unseen Lord God. ||20||
RECORD	para 3751	slok mÚ 3 ] (91-8) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
