DEFINE	isrIrwg kI vwr mhlw 4 slokw nwil v1	Their faces are forever radiant, and the whole world bows in reverence to them. ||1||
RECORD	para 3756	mÚ 3 ] (91-10) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
