RECORD	isrIrwg kI vwr mhlw 4 slokw nwil v2	nwnk hir Bgiq iqnw kY min vsY ijn msqik iliKAw Duir pwie ]2] (91-12, isrIrwgu, mÚ 3) naanak har bhagat tinaa kai man vasai jin mastak likhi-aa Dhur paa-ay. ||2||
RECORD	isrIrwg kI vwr mhlw 4 slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, devotion to the Lord abides within the minds of those who have such pre- ordained destiny written on their foreheads. ||2||
RECORD	para 3761	pauVI ] (91-13) pa-orhee. Pauree:
