RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v1	sB ikCu qUMhY qUMhY myry ipAwry qyrI kudriq kau bil jweI jIau ]1] (98-13, mwJ, mÚ 5) sabh kichh tooNhai tooNhai mayray pi-aaray tayree kudrat ka-o bal jaa-ee jee-o. ||1||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v1	You are everything; You are my Beloved. I am a sacrifice to Your Creative Power. ||1||
