RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v1	Highest of the High, Unfathomable, Infinite Lord and Master: continually remembering You in deep meditation, I live. ||1||
RECORD	para 4053	duK BMjn inDwn Amoly ] (99-6, mwJ, mÚ 5) dukh bhanjan niDhaan amolay. O Destroyer of pain, Priceless Treasure,
