DEFINE	para 4142	iniD isiD iriD hir hir hir myrY ] (101-5, mwJ, mÚ 5) niDh siDh riDh har har har mayrai. My Lord, Har, Har, Har, is the nine treasures, the supernatural spiritual powers of the Siddhas, wealth and prosperity.
