DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v1	Hundreds of thousands, even millions of pleasures and delights are enjoyed by one who falls at the Guru's Feet. ||1||
DEFINE	para 4145	drsnu pyKq Bey punIqw ] (101-7, mwJ, mÚ 5) darsan paykhat bha-ay puneetaa. Gazing upon the Blessed Vision of His Darshan, all are sanctified,
