DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v3	His Place is lofty, infinite and unfathomable; the Guru has shown me that palace. ||3||
DEFINE	para 4150	gihr gMBIr AMimRq nwmu qyrw ] (101-9, mwJ, mÚ 5) gahir gambheer amrit naam tayraa. Your Ambrosial Name is deep and profound.
DEFINE	para 4151	mukiq BieAw ijsu irdY vsyrw ] (101-10, mwJ, mÚ 5) mukat bha-i-aa jis ridai vasayraa. That person is liberated, in whose heart You dwell.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v4	guir bMDn iqn ky sgly kwty jn nwnk shij smweI jIau ]4]16]23] (101-10, mwJ, mÚ 5) gur banDhan tin kay saglay kaatay jan naanak sahj samaa-ee jee-o. ||4||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v4	The Guru cuts away all his bonds; O Servant Nanak, he is absorbed in the poise of intuitive peace. ||4||
RECORD	para 4154	pRB ikrpw qy hir hir iDAwvau ] (101-11, mwJ, mÚ 5) parabh kirpaa tay har har Dhi-aava-o. By God's Grace, I meditate on the Lord, Har, Har.
RECORD	para 4155	pRBU dieAw qy mMglu gwvau ] (101-11, mwJ, mÚ 5) parabhoo da-i-aa tay mangal gaava-o. By God's Kindness, I sing the songs of joy.
