RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v1	While standing and sitting, while sleeping and while awake, meditate on the Lord, all your life. ||1||
RECORD	para 4157	nwmu AauKDu mo kau swDU dIAw ] (101-12, mwJ, mÚ 5) naam a-ukhaDh mo ka-o saaDhoo dee-aa. The Holy Saint has given me the Medicine of the Naam.
RECORD	para 4158	iklibK kwty inrmlu QIAw ] (101-13, mwJ, mÚ 5) kilbikh kaatay nirmal thee-aa. My sins have been cut out, and I have become pure.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v2	Andu BieAw inksI sB pIrw sgl ibnwsy drdw jIau ]2] (101-13, mwJ, mÚ 5) anad bha-i-aa niksee sabh peeraa sagal binaasay dardaa jee-o. ||2||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v2	I am filled with bliss, and all my pains have been taken away. All my suffering has been dispelled. ||2||
DEFINE	para 4160	ijs kw AMgu kry myrw ipAwrw ] so mukqw swgr sMswrw ] (101-14, mwJ, mÚ 5) jis kaa ang karay mayraa pi-aaraa. so muktaa saagar sansaaraa. One who has my Beloved on his side, is liberated from the world-ocean.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v3	siq kry ijin gurU pCwqw so kwhy kau frdw jIau ]3] (101-14, mwJ, mÚ 5) sat karay jin guroo pachhaataa so kaahay ka-o dardaa jee-o. ||3||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v3	One who recognizes the Guru practices Truth; why should he be afraid? ||3||
RECORD	para 4162	jb qy swDU sMgiq pwey ] gur Bytq hau geI blwey ] (101-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) jab tay saaDhoo sangat paa-ay. gur bhaytat ha-o ga-ee balaa-ay. Since I found the Company of the Holy and met the Guru, the demon of pride has departed.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v4	swis swis hir gwvY nwnku siqgur Fwik lIAw myrw pVdw jIau ]4]17]24] (101-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) saas saas har gaavai naanak satgur dhaak lee-aa mayraa parh-daa jee-o. ||4||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v4	With each and every breath, Nanak sings the Lord's Praises. The True Guru has covered my sins. ||4||
DEFINE	para 4165	Eiq poiq syvk sMig rwqw ] (101-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) ot pot sayvak sang raataa. Through and through, the Lord is intermingled with His servant.
RECORD	para 4166	pRB pRiqpwly syvk suKdwqw ] (101-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) parabh partipaalay sayvak sukh-daata. God, the Giver of Peace, cherishes His servant.
