RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v2	soeI kmwvY jo swihb BwvY syvku AMqir bwhir mwhru jIau ]2] (101-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) so-ee kamaavai jo saahib bhaavai sayvak antar baahar maahar jee-o. ||2||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v2	He does that which pleases his Lord and Master. Inwardly and outwardly, the servant knows his Lord. ||2||
