RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v3	jo ikCu Twkur kw so syvk kw syvku Twkur hI sMig jwhru jIau ]3] (102-1, mwJ, mÚ 5) jo kichh thaakur kaa so sayvak kaa sayvak thaakur hee sang jaahar jee-o. ||3||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v3	That which belongs to the Lord and Master, belongs to His servant. The servant becomes distinguished in association with his Lord and Master. ||3||
