RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v4	Please bless Nanak with the Gift of the Naam, the Name of the Inaccessible and Unfathomable God. ||4||
DEFINE	para 4204	qUM pyfu swK qyrI PUlI ] (102-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN payd saakh tayree foolee. You are the tree; Your branches have blossomed forth.
RECORD	para 4205	qUM sUKmu hoAw AsQUlI ] (102-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN sookham ho-aa asthoolee. From the very small and subtle, You have become huge and manifest.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v1	qUM jliniD qUM Pynu budbudw quDu ibnu Avru n BwlIAY jIau ]1] (102-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN jalniDh tooN fayn budbudaa tuDh bin avar na bhaalee-ai jee-o. ||1||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v1	You are the Ocean of Water, and You are the foam and the bubbles on its surface. I cannot see any other except You, Lord. ||1||
DEFINE	para 4207	qUM sUqu mxIey BI qUMhY ] (102-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN soot manee-ay bhee tooNhai. You are the thread, and You are also the beads.
DEFINE	para 4208	qUM gMTI myru isir qUMhY ] (102-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN ganthee mayr sir tooNhai. You are the knot, and You are the primary bead of the maalaa.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v2	Awid miD AMiq pRBu soeI Avru n koie idKwlIAY jIau ]2] (102-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) aad maDh ant parabh so-ee avar na ko-ay dikhaalee-ai jee-o. ||2||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v2	In the beginning, in the middle and in the end, there is God. I cannot see any other except You, Lord. ||2||
DEFINE	para 4210	qUM inrguxu srguxu suKdwqw ] (102-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN nirgun sargun sukh-daata. You transcend all qualities, and You possess the supreme qualities. You are the Giver of peace.
DEFINE	para 4211	qUM inrbwxu rsIAw rMig rwqw ] (102-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN nirbaan rasee-aa rang raataa. You are detached in Nirvaanaa, and You are the Enjoyer, imbued with love.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v3	Apxy krqb Awpy jwxih Awpy quDu smwlIAY jIau ]3] (102-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) apnay kartab aapay jaaneh aapay tuDh samaalee-ai jee-o. ||3||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v3	You Yourself know Your Own Ways; You dwell upon Yourself. ||3||
DEFINE	para 4213	qUM Twkuru syvku Puin Awpy ] (102-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN thaakur sayvak fun aapay. You are the Master, and then again, You are the servant.
DEFINE	para 4214	qUM gupqu prgtu pRB Awpy ] (102-19, mwJ, mÚ 5) tooN gupat pargat parabh aapay. O God, You Yourself are the Manifest and the Unmanifest.
