DEFINE	para 4219	gur prswid iknY ivrlY jwxI ] (103-1, mwJ, mÚ 5) gur parsaad kinai virlai jaanee. Rare are those who know this, by Guru's Grace.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v1	DMnu su vylw ijqu hir gwvq sunxw Awey qy prvwnw jIau ]1] (103-2, mwJ, mÚ 5) Dhan so vaylaa jit har gaavat sunnaa aa-ay tay parvaanaa jee-o. ||1||
