RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v4	nwnk kau pRB Bey ik®pwlw pRB nwnk min Bwxw jIau ]4]22]29] (103-6, mwJ, mÚ 5) naanak ka-o parabh bha-ay kirpaalaa parabh naanak man bhaanaa jee-o. ||4||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v4	God has become merciful to Nanak; God is pleasing to Nanak's mind. ||4||
