RECORD	para 4542	Dwvqu rwKY Twik rhwey ] (110-3, mwJ, mÚ 3) Dhaavat raakhai thaak rahaa-ay. Restrain your wandering mind, and keep it in check.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v2	gur kI bwxI Anidnu gwvY shjy Bgiq krwvixAw ]2] (110-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur kee banee an-din gaavai sehjay bhagat karaavani-aa. ||2||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v2	Night and day, sing the Songs of the Guru's Bani; worship the Lord with intuitive devotion. ||2||
DEFINE	para 4544	iesu kwieAw AMdir vsqu AsMKw ] (110-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) is kaa-i-aa andar vasat asankhaa. Within this body are countless objects.
RECORD	para 4545	gurmuiK swcu imlY qw vyKw ] (110-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh saach milai taa vaykhaa. The Gurmukh attains Truth, and comes to see them.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v3	nau drvwjy dsvY mukqw Anhd sbdu vjwvixAw ]3] (110-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) na-o darvaajay dasvai muktaa anhad sabad vajaavani-aa. ||3||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v3	Beyond the nine gates, the Tenth Gate is found, and liberation is obtained. The Unstruck Melody of the Shabad vibrates. ||3||
DEFINE	para 4547	scw swihbu scI nweI ] (110-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) sachaa saahib sachee naa-ee. True is the Master, and True is His Name.
RECORD	para 4548	gur prswdI mMin vsweI ] (110-6, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee man vasaa-ee. By Guru's Grace, He comes to dwell within the mind.
