REQUIRE	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v4	Night and day, remain attuned to the Lord's Love forever, and you shall obtain understanding in the True Court. ||4||
RECORD	para 4550	pwp puMn kI swr n jwxI ] (110-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) paap punn kee saar na jaanee. Those who do not understand the nature of sin and virtue
RECORD	para 4551	dUjY lwgI Brim BulwxI ] (110-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) doojai laagee bharam bhulaanee. are attached to duality; they wander around deluded.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v5	AigAwnI AMDw mgu n jwxY iPir iPir Awvx jwvixAw ]5] (110-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) agi-aanee anDhaa mag na jaanai fir fir aavan jaavani-aa. ||5||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v5	The ignorant and blind people do not know the way; they come and go in reincarnation over and over again. ||5||
RECORD	para 4553	gur syvw qy sdw suKu pwieAw ] (110-8, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur sayvaa tay sadaa sukh paa-i-aa. Serving the Guru, I have found eternal peace;
RECORD	para 4554	haumY myrw Twik rhwieAw ] (110-8, mwJ, mÚ 3) ha-umai mayraa thaak rahaa-i-aa. my ego has been silenced and subdued.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v6	gur swKI imitAw AMiDAwrw bjr kpwt KulwvixAw ]6] (110-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur saakhee miti-aa anDhi-aaraa bajar kapaat khulaavani-aa. ||6||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v6	Through the Guru's Teachings, the darkness has been dispelled, and the heavy doors have been opened. ||6||
RECORD	para 4556	haumY mwir mMin vswieAw ] (110-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) ha-umai maar man vasaa-i-aa. Subduing my ego, I have enshrined the Lord within my mind.
RECORD	para 4557	gur crxI sdw icqu lwieAw ] (110-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur charnee sadaa chit laa-i-aa. I focus my consciousness on the Guru's Feet forever.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v7	gur ikrpw qy mnu qnu inrmlu inrml nwmu iDAwvixAw ]7] (110-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur kirpaa tay man tan nirmal nirmal naam Dhi-aavani-aa. ||7||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v7	By Guru's Grace, my mind and body are immaculate and pure; I meditate on the Immaculate Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||7||
DEFINE	para 4559	jIvxu mrxw sBu quDY qweI ] (110-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) jeevan marnaa sabh tuDhai taa-ee. From birth to death, everything is for You.
RECORD	para 4560	ijsu bKsy iqsu dy vifAweI ] (110-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) jis bakhsay tis day vadi-aa-ee. You bestow greatness upon those whom You have forgiven.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v8	nwnk nwmu iDAwie sdw qUM jMmxu mrxu svwrixAw ]8]1]2] (110-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) naanak naam Dhi-aa-ay sadaa tooN jaman maran savaarni-aa. ||8||
REQUIRE	mwJ mhlw 3 Gru 1 v8	O Nanak, meditating forever on the Naam, you shall be blessed in both birth and death. ||8||
RECORD	para 4562	maajh mehlaa 3. Maajh, Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 4563	myrw pRBu inrmlu Agm Apwrw ] (110-12, mwJ, mÚ 3) mayraa parabh nirmal agam apaaraa. My God is Immaculate, Inaccessible and Infinite.
RECORD	para 4564	ibnu qkVI qolY sMswrw ] (110-13, mwJ, mÚ 3) bin takrhee tolai sansaaraa. Without a scale, He weighs the universe.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	gurmuiK hovY soeI bUJY gux kih guxI smwvixAw ]1] (110-13, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh hovai so-ee boojhai gun kahi gunee samaavani-aa. ||1||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	One who becomes Gurmukh, understands. Chanting His Glorious Praises, he is absorbed into the Lord of Virtue. ||1||
RECORD	para 4566	hau vwrI jIau vwrI hir kw nwmu mMin vswvixAw ] (110-13, mwJ, mÚ 3) ha-o vaaree jee-o vaaree har kaa naam man vasaavani-aa. I am a sacrifice, my soul is a sacrifice, to those whose minds are filled with the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	jo sic lwgy sy Anidnu jwgy dir scY soBw pwvixAw ]1] rhwau ] (110-14, mwJ, mÚ 3) jo sach laagay say an-din jaagay dar sachai sobhaa paavni-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. Those who are committed to Truth remain awake and aware night and day. They are honored in the True Court. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 4568	Awip suxY qY Awpy vyKY ] (110-15, mwJ, mÚ 3) aap sunai tai aapay vaykhai. He Himself hears, and He Himself sees.
RECORD	para 4569	ijs no ndir kry soeI jnu lyKY ] (110-15, mwJ, mÚ 3) jis no nadar karay so-ee jan laykhai. Those, upon whom He casts His Glance of Grace, become acceptable.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	Awpy lwie ley so lwgY gurmuiK scu kmwvixAw ]2] (110-15, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay laa-ay la-ay so laagai gurmukh sach kamaavani-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	They are attached, whom the Lord Himself attaches; as Gurmukh, they live the Truth. ||2||
RECORD	para 4571	ijsu Awip Bulwey su ikQY hQu pwey ] (110-16, mwJ, mÚ 3) jis aap bhulaa-ay so kithai hath paa-ay. Those whom the Lord Himself misleads-whose hand can they take?
DEFINE	para 4572	pUrib iliKAw su mytxw n jwey ] (110-16, mwJ, mÚ 3) poorab likhi-aa so maytnaa na jaa-ay. That which is pre-ordained, cannot be erased.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v3	ijn siqguru imilAw sy vfBwgI pUrY krim imlwvixAw ]3] (110-17, mwJ, mÚ 3) jin satgur mili-aa say vadbhaagee poorai karam milaavani-aa. ||3||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v3	Those who meet the True Guru are very fortunate and blessed; through perfect karma, He is met. ||3||
DEFINE	para 4574	pyeIAVY Dn Anidnu suqI ] (110-17, mwJ, mÚ 3) pay-ee-arhai Dhan an-din sutee. The young bride is fast asleep in her parents' home, night and day.
RECORD	para 4575	kMiq ivswrI Avgix muqI ] (110-18, mwJ, mÚ 3) kant visaaree avgan mutee. She has forgotten her Husband Lord; because of her faults and demerits, she is abandoned.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	Anidnu sdw iPrY ibllwdI ibnu ipr nId n pwvixAw ]4] (110-18, mwJ, mÚ 3) an-din sadaa firai billaadee bin pir need na paavni-aa. ||4||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	She wanders around continually, crying out, night and day. Without her Husband Lord, she cannot get any sleep. ||4||
ALLOW	para 4577	pyeIAVY suKdwqw jwqw ] (110-19, mwJ, mÚ 3) pay-ee-arhai sukh-daata jaataa. In this world of her parents' home, she may come to know the Giver of peace,
WHEN	para 4578	haumY mwir gur sbid pCwqw ] (110-19, mwJ, mÚ 3) ha-umai maar gur sabad pachhaataa. if she subdues her ego, and recognizes the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	syj suhwvI sdw ipru rwvy scu sIgwru bxwvixAw ]5] (110-19, mwJ, mÚ 3) sayj suhaavee sadaa pir raavay sach seegaar banaavani-aa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	Her bed is beautiful; she ravishes and enjoys her Husband Lord forever. She is adorned with the Decorations of Truth. ||5||
RECORD	para 4581	lK caurwsIh jIA aupwey ] (111-1, mwJ, mÚ 3) lakh cha-oraaseeh jee-a upaa-ay. He created the 8.4 million species of beings.
RECORD	para 4582	ijs no ndir kry iqsu gurU imlwey ] (111-1, mwJ, mÚ 3) jis no nadar karay tis guroo milaa-ay. Those, upon whom He casts His Glance of Grace, come to meet the Guru.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	iklibK kwit sdw jn inrml dir scY nwim suhwvixAw ]6] (111-2, mwJ, mÚ 3) kilbikh kaat sadaa jan nirmal dar sachai naam suhaavani-aa. ||6||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	Shedding their sins, His servants are forever pure; at the True Court, they are beautified by the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||6||
DEFINE	para 4584	lyKw mwgY qw ikin dIAY ] (111-2, mwJ, mÚ 3) laykhaa maagai taa kin dee-ai. When they are called to settle their accounts, who will answer then?
