RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	nwnk nwmu imlY vifAweI Awpy myil imlwvixAw ]8]2]3] (111-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) naanak naam milai vadi-aa-ee aapay mayl milaavani-aa. ||8||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	O Nanak, through the Naam, greatness is obtained. He Himself unites in His Union. ||8||
RECORD	para 4591	ieko Awip iPrY prCMnw ] (111-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) iko aap firai parchhannaa. The One Lord Himself moves about imperceptibly.
DEFINE	para 4592	gurmuiK vyKw qw iehu mnu iBMnw ] (111-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh vaykhaa taa ih man bhinnaa. As Gurmukh, I see Him, and then this mind is pleased and uplifted.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	iqRsnw qij shj suKu pwieAw eyko mMin vswvixAw ]1] (111-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) tarisnaa taj sahj sukh paa-i-aa ayko man vasaavani-aa. ||1||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	Renouncing desire, I have found intuitive peace and poise; I have enshrined the One within my mind. ||1||
DEFINE	para 4594	hau vwrI jIau vwrI ieksu isau icqu lwvixAw ] (111-6, mwJ, mÚ 3) ha-o vaaree jee-o vaaree ikas si-o chit laavani-aa. I am a sacrifice, my soul is a sacrifice, to those who focus their consciousness on the One.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	gurmqI mnu iekqu Gir AwieAw scY rMig rMgwvixAw ]1] rhwau ] (111-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmatee man ikat ghar aa-i-aa sachai rang rangaavin-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. Through the Guru's Teachings, my mind has come to its only home; it is imbued with the True Color of the Lord's Love. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 4596	iehu jgu BUlw qYN Awip BulwieAw ] (111-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) ih jag bhoolaa taiN aap bhulaa-i-aa. This world is deluded; You Yourself have deluded it.
