DEFINE	para 4599	jo rMig rwqy krm ibDwqy ] (111-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) jo rang raatay karam biDhaatay. Those who are attuned to the Love of the Lord, the Architect of Destiny
DEFINE	para 4600	gur syvw qy jug cwry jwqy ] (111-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur sayvaa tay jug chaaray jaatay. -by serving the Guru, they are known throughout the four ages.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v3	ijs no Awip dyie vifAweI hir kY nwim smwvixAw ]3] (111-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) jis no aap day-ay vadi-aa-ee har kai naam samaavani-aa. ||3||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v3	Those, upon whom the Lord bestows greatness, are absorbed in the Name of the Lord. ||3||
RECORD	para 4602	mwieAw moih hir cyqY nwhI ] (111-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa mohi har chaytai naahee. Being in love with Maya, they do not think of the Lord.
RECORD	para 4603	jmpuir bDw duK shwhI ] (111-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) jampur baDhaa dukh sahaahee. Bound and gagged in the City of Death, they suffer in terrible pain.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	AMnw bolw ikCu ndir n AwvY mnmuK pwip pcwvixAw ]4] (111-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) annaa bolaa kichh nadar na aavai manmukh paap pachaavani-aa. ||4||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	Blind and deaf, they see nothing at all; the self-willed manmukhs rot away in sin. ||4||
DEFINE	para 4605	ieik rMig rwqy jo quDu Awip ilv lwey ] (111-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) ik rang raatay jo tuDh aap liv laa-ay. Those, whom You attach to Your Love, are attuned to Your Love.
RECORD	para 4606	Bwie Bgiq qyrY min Bwey ] (111-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) bhaa-ay bhagat tayrai man bhaa-ay. Through loving devotional worship, they become pleasing to Your Mind.
