DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v7	Night and day, he is imbued with the Lord's Love. He sings the Lord's Glorious Praises, and he is called to the Mansion of His Presence. ||7||
DEFINE	para 4780	siqguru dwqw imlY imlwieAw ] (115-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) satgur daataa milai milaa-i-aa. The True Guru, the Giver, is met when the Lord leads us to meet Him.
DEFINE	para 4781	pUrY Bwig min sbdu vswieAw ] (115-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) poorai bhaag man sabad vasaa-i-aa. Through perfect destiny, the Shabad is enshrined in the mind.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	nwnk nwmu imlY vifAweI hir scy ky gux gwvixAw ]8]9]10] (115-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) naanak naam milai vadi-aa-ee har sachay kay gun gaavani-aa. ||8||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	O Nanak, the greatness of the Naam, the Name of the Lord, is obtained by chanting the Glorious Praises of the True Lord. ||8||
RECORD	para 4784	Awpu vM\wey qw sB ikCu pwey ] (115-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) aap vanjaa-ay taa sabh kichh paa-ay. Those who lose their own selves obtain everything.
RECORD	para 4785	gur sbdI scI ilv lwey ] (115-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur sabdee sachee liv laa-ay. Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, they enshrine Love for the True one.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	scu vxMjih scu sMGrih scu vwpwru krwvixAw ]1] (115-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) sach vana Njahi sach sanghrahi sach vaapaar karaavani-aa. ||1||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	They trade in Truth, they gather in Truth, and they deal only in Truth. ||1||
RECORD	para 4787	hau vwrI jIau vwrI hir gux Anidnu gwvixAw ] (115-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) ha-o vaaree jee-o vaaree har gun an-din gaavani-aa. I am a sacrifice, my soul is a sacrifice, to those who sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord, night and day.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	hau qyrw qUM Twkuru myrw sbid vifAweI dyvixAw ]1] rhwau ] (115-12, mwJ, mÚ 3) ha-o tayraa tooN thaakur mayraa sabad vadi-aa-ee dayvani-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. I am Yours, You are my Lord and Master. You bestow greatness through the Word of Your Shabad. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 4789	vylw vKq siB suhwieAw ] (115-13, mwJ, mÚ 3) vaylaa vakhat sabh suhaa-i-aa. That time, that moment is totally beautiful,
WHEN	para 4790	ijqu scw myry min BwieAw ] (115-13, mwJ, mÚ 3) jit sachaa mayray man bhaa-i-aa. when the True One becomes pleasing to my mind.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	scy syivAY scu vifAweI gur ikrpw qy scu pwvixAw ]2] (115-13, mwJ, mÚ 3) sachay sayvi-ai sach vadi-aa-ee gur kirpaa tay sach paavni-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	Serving the True One, true greatness is obtained. By Guru's Grace, the True One is obtained. ||2||
