REQUIRE	para 5065	gur kY BY aUjl haumY mlu jwey ] (121-17, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur kai bhai oojal ha-umai mal jaa-ay. in the Fear of the Guru; you shall become radiant, and the filth of egotism shall depart.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	sdw Anµid rhih Bgiq krih idnu rwqI suix goibd gux gwvixAw ]2] (121-17, mwJ, mÚ 3) sadaa anand raheh bhagat karahi din raatee sun gobid gun gaavani-aa. ||2||
