REQUIRE	para 5071	mwieAw moih joihAw jmkwly ] (121-19, mwJ, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa mohi johi-aa jamkaalay. but if they are emotionally attached to Maya, then the Messenger of Death shall hunt them down.
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	mwieAw mohu iesu mnih ncwey AMqir kptu duKu pwvixAw ]4] (122-1, mwJ, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa moh is maneh nachaa-ay antar kapat dukh paavni-aa. ||4||
