DEFINE	para 5075	qnu mnu rwqw shij suBwey ] (122-2, mwJ, mÚ 3) tan man raataa sahj subhaa-ay. then his body and mind are attuned to His Love with intuitive ease.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	bwxI vjY sbid vjwey gurmuiK Bgiq Qwie pwvixAw ]5] (122-2, mwJ, mÚ 3) banee vajai sabad vajaa-ay gurmukh bhagat thaa-ay paavni-aa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	The Word of His Bani vibrates, and the Word of His Shabad resounds, for the Gurmukh whose devotional worship is accepted. ||5||
ALLOW	para 5077	bhu qwl pUry vwjy vjwey ] (122-3, mwJ, mÚ 3) baho taal pooray vaajay vajaa-ay. One may beat upon and play all sorts of instruments,
RECORD	para 5078	nw ko suxy n mMin vswey ] (122-3, mwJ, mÚ 3) naa ko sunay na man vasaa-ay. but no one will listen, and no one will enshrine it in the mind.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	mwieAw kwrix ipV bMiD nwcY dUjY Bwie duKu pwvixAw ]6] (122-3, mwJ, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa kaaran pirh banDh naachai doojai bhaa-ay dukh paavni-aa. ||6||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	For the sake of Maya, they set the stage and dance, but they are in love with duality, and they obtain only sorrow. ||6||
DEFINE	para 5080	ijsu AMqir pRIiq lgY so mukqw ] (122-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) jis antar pareet lagai so muktaa. Those whose inner beings are attached to the Lord's Love are liberated.
DEFINE	para 5081	ieMdRI vis sc sMjim jugqw ] (122-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) indree vas sach sanjam jugtaa. They control their sexual desires, and their lifestyle is the self-discipline of Truth.
