DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v7	Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, they meditate forever on the Lord. This devotional worship is pleasing to the Lord. ||7||
DEFINE	para 5083	gurmuiK Bgiq jug cwry hoeI ] (122-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh bhagat jug chaaray ho-ee. To live as Gurmukh is devotional worship, throughout the four ages.
DEFINE	para 5084	horqu Bgiq n pwey koeI ] (122-6, mwJ, mÚ 3) horat bhagat na paa-ay ko-ee. This devotional worship is not obtained by any other means.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	nwnk nwmu gur BgqI pweIAY gur crxI icqu lwvixAw ]8]20]21] (122-6, mwJ, mÚ 3) naanak naam gur bhagtee paa-ee-ai gur charnee chit laavani-aa. ||8||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	O Nanak, the Naam, the Name of the Lord, is obtained only through devotion to the Guru. So focus your consciousness on the Guru's Feet. ||8||
RECORD	para 5087	scw syvI scu swlwhI ] (122-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) sachaa sayvee sach saalaahee. Serve the True One, and praise the True One.
REQUIRE	para 5088	scY nwie duKu kb hI nwhI ] (122-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) sachai naa-ay dukh kab hee naahee. With the True Name, pain shall never afflict you.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	suKdwqw syvin suKu pwiein gurmiq mMin vswvixAw ]1] (122-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) sukh-daata sayvan sukh paa-in gurmat man vasaavani-aa. ||1||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	Those who serve the Giver of peace find peace. They enshrine the Guru's Teachings within their minds. ||1||
RECORD	para 5090	hau vwrI jIau vwrI suK shij smwiD lgwvixAw ] (122-8, mwJ, mÚ 3) ha-o vaaree jee-o vaaree sukh sahj samaaDh lagaavani-aa. I am a sacrifice, my soul is a sacrifice, to those who intuitively enter into the peace of Samaadhi.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	jo hir syvih sy sdw sohih soBw suriq suhwvixAw ]1] rhwau ] (122-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) jo har sayveh say sadaa soheh sobhaa surat suhaavani-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. Those who serve the Lord are always beautiful. The glory of their intuitive awareness is beautiful. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 5092	sBu ko qyrw Bgqu khwey ] (122-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) sabh ko tayraa bhagat kahaa-ay. All call themselves Your devotees,
DEFINE	para 5093	syeI Bgq qyrY min Bwey ] (122-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) say-ee bhagat tayrai man bhaa-ay. but they alone are Your devotees, who are pleasing to Your mind.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	scu bwxI quDY swlwhin rMig rwqy Bgiq krwvixAw ]2] (122-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) sach banee tuDhai saalaahan rang raatay bhagat karaavani-aa. ||2||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	Through the True Word of Your Bani, they praise You; attuned to Your Love, they worship You with devotion. ||2||
DEFINE	para 5095	sBu ko scy hir jIau qyrw ] (122-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) sabh ko sachay har jee-o tayraa. All are Yours, O Dear True Lord.
RECORD	para 5096	gurmuiK imlY qw cUkY Pyrw ] (122-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh milai taa chookai fayraa. Meeting the Gurmukh, this cycle of reincarnation comes to an end.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v3	jw quDu BwvY qw nwie rcwvih qUM Awpy nwau jpwvixAw ]3] (122-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) jaa tuDh bhaavai taa naa-ay rachaaveh tooN aapay naa-o japaavani-aa. ||3||
WHEN	mwJ mhlw 3 v3	When it pleases Your Will, then we merge in the Name. You Yourself inspire us to chant the Name. ||3||
RECORD	para 5098	gurmqI hir mMin vswieAw ] (122-12, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmatee har man vasaa-i-aa. Through the Guru's Teachings, I enshrine the Lord within my mind.
DEFINE	para 5099	hrKu sogu sBu mohu gvwieAw ] (122-12, mwJ, mÚ 3) harakh sog sabh moh gavaa-i-aa. Pleasure and pain, and all emotional attachments are gone.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	ieksu isau ilv lwgI sd hI hir nwmu mMin vswvixAw ]4] (122-12, mwJ, mÚ 3) ikas si-o liv laagee sad hee har naam man vasaavani-aa. ||4||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	I am lovingly centered on the One Lord forever. I enshrine the Lord's Name within my mind. ||4||
DEFINE	para 5101	Bgq rMig rwqy sdw qyrY cwey ] (122-13, mwJ, mÚ 3) bhagat rang raatay sadaa tayrai chaa-ay. Your devotees are attuned to Your Love; they are always joyful.
RECORD	para 5102	nau iniD nwmu visAw min Awey ] (122-13, mwJ, mÚ 3) na-o niDh naam vasi-aa man aa-ay. The nine treasures of the Naam come to dwell within their minds.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	pUrY Bwig siqguru pwieAw sbdy myil imlwvixAw ]5] (122-14, mwJ, mÚ 3) poorai bhaag satgur paa-i-aa sabday mayl milaavani-aa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	By perfect destiny, they find the True Guru, and through the Word of the Shabad, they are united in the Lord's Union. ||5||
DEFINE	para 5104	qUM dieAwlu sdw suKdwqw ] (122-14, mwJ, mÚ 3) tooN da-i-aal sadaa sukh-daata. You are Merciful, and always the Giver of peace.
DEFINE	para 5105	qUM Awpy myilih gurmuiK jwqw ] (122-15, mwJ, mÚ 3) tooN aapay mayleh gurmukh jaataa. You Yourself unite us; You are known only to the Gurmukhs.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	qUM Awpy dyvih nwmu vfweI nwim rqy suKu pwvixAw ]6] (122-15, mwJ, mÚ 3) tooN aapay dayveh naam vadaa-ee naam ratay sukh paavni-aa. ||6||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	You Yourself bestow the glorious greatness of the Naam; attuned to the Naam, we find peace. ||6||
RECORD	para 5107	sdw sdw swcy quDu swlwhI ] (122-16, mwJ, mÚ 3) sadaa sadaa saachay tuDh saalaahee. Forever and ever, O True Lord, I praise You.
RECORD	para 5108	gurmuiK jwqw dUjw ko nwhI ] (122-16, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh jaataa doojaa ko naahee. As Gurmukh, I know no other at all.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v7	eyksu isau mnu rihAw smwey min mMinAY mnih imlwvixAw ]7] (122-16, mwJ, mÚ 3) aykas si-o man rahi-aa samaa-ay man mani-ai maneh milaavani-aa. ||7||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v7	My mind remains immersed in the One Lord; my mind surrenders to Him, and in my mind I meet Him. ||7||
RECORD	para 5110	gurmuiK hovY so swlwhy ] (122-17, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh hovai so saalaahay. One who becomes Gurmukh, praises the Lord.
DEFINE	para 5111	swcy Twkur vyprvwhy ] (122-17, mwJ, mÚ 3) saachay thaakur vayparvaahay. Our True Lord and Master is Carefree.
