RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	O Nanak, the Naam, the Name of the Lord, abides deep within the mind; through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, we merge with the Lord. ||8||
RECORD	para 5114	qyry Bgq sohih swcY drbwry ] (122-18, mwJ, mÚ 3) tayray bhagat soheh saachai darbaaray. Your devotees look beautiful in the True Court.
