DEFINE	para 5130	BRim BUly ijau suM\Y Gir kwau ] (123-6, mwJ, mÚ 3) bharam bhoolay ji-o sunjai ghar kaa-o. They are deluded by doubt, like a crow in a deserted house.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	hlqu plqu iqnI dovY gvwey duKy duiK ivhwvixAw ]5] (123-6, mwJ, mÚ 3) halat palat tinee dovai gavaa-ay dukhay dukh vihaavani-aa. ||5||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	They forfeit both this world and the next, and they pass their lives suffering in pain and misery. ||5||
RECORD	para 5132	ilKidAw ilKidAw kwgd msu KoeI ] (123-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) likh-di-aa likh-di-aa kaagad mas kho-ee. Writing on and on endlessly, they run out of paper and ink.
RECORD	para 5133	dUjY Bwie suKu pwey n koeI ] (123-7, mwJ, mÚ 3) doojai bhaa-ay sukh paa-ay na ko-ee. Through the love with duality, no one has found peace.
