DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v7	True is their paper, pen and ink; writing Truth, they are absorbed in the True One. ||7||
RECORD	para 5138	myrw pRBu AMqir bYTw vyKY ] (123-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) mayraa parabh antar baithaa vaykhai. My God sits deep within the self; He watches over us.
