RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	mnmuK AMDy sUJY nwhI iPir iGir Awie gurmuiK vQu pwvixAw ]4] (124-11, mwJ, mÚ 3) manmukh anDhay soojhai naahee fir ghir aa-ay gurmukh vath paavni-aa. ||4||
