DEFINE	para 5203	Awrjw n CIjY sbdu pCwxu ] (125-1, mwJ, mÚ 3) aarjaa na chheejai sabad pachhaan. Their lives are not wasted; they realize the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	gurmuiK mrY n kwlu n Kwey gurmuiK sic smwvixAw ]2] (125-2, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh marai na kaal na khaa-ay gurmukh sach samaavani-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v2	The Gurmukhs do not die; they are not consumed by death. The Gurmukhs are absorbed in the True Lord. ||2||
