RECORD	para 5209	gurmuiK haumY cUkY pIr ] (125-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh ha-umai chookai peer. The Gurmukhs have the pain of egotism taken away.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	gurmuiK mnu inrmlu iPir mYlu n lwgY gurmuiK shij smwvixAw ]4] (125-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh man nirmal fir mail na laagai gurmukh sahj samaavani-aa. ||4||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	The minds of the Gurmukhs are immaculate and pure; no filth ever sticks to them again. The Gurmukhs merge in celestial peace. ||4||
