RECORD	para 5212	gurmuiK gux gwvY soBw pweI ] (125-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh gun gaavai sobhaa paa-ee. The Gurmukhs sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord, and obtain honor.
