DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v7	Night and day, they are diseased, like maggots in manure, and in manure they endure agony. ||7||
RECORD	para 5220	gurmuiK Awpy kry krwey ] (125-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh aapay karay karaa-ay. The Gurmukhs know that the Lord alone acts, and causes others to act.
RECORD	para 5221	gurmuiK ihrdY vuTw Awip Awey ] (125-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) gurmukh hirdai vuthaa aap aa-ay. In the hearts of the Gurmukhs, the Lord Himself comes to dwell.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	nwnk nwim imlY vifAweI pUry gur qy pwvixAw ]8]25]26] (125-9, mwJ, mÚ 3) naanak naam milai vadi-aa-ee pooray gur tay paavni-aa. ||8||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	O Nanak, through the Naam, greatness is obtained. It is received from the Perfect Guru. ||8||
DEFINE	para 5224	eykw joiq joiq hY srIrw ] (125-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) aykaa jot jot hai sareeraa. The One Light is the light of all bodies.
