DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v4	The True Lord is liberated forever. The Unseen Lord causes Himself to be seen. ||4||
DEFINE	para 5238	Awpy mwieAw Awpy CwieAw ] (125-16, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay maa-i-aa aapay chhaa-i-aa. He Himself is Maya, and He Himself is the Illusion.
RECORD	para 5239	Awpy mohu sBu jgqu aupwieAw ] (125-16, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay moh sabh jagat upaa-i-aa. He Himself has generated emotional attachment throughout the entire universe.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	Awpy guxdwqw gux gwvY Awpy AwiK suxwvixAw ]5] (125-17, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay gundaataa gun gaavai aapay aakh sunaavni-aa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v5	He Himself is the Giver of Virtue; He Himself sings the Lord's Glorious Praises. He chants them and causes them to be heard. ||5||
RECORD	para 5241	Awpy kry krwey Awpy ] (125-17, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay karay karaa-ay aapay. He Himself acts, and causes others to act.
RECORD	para 5242	Awpy Qwip auQwpy Awpy ] (125-18, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay thaap uthaapay aapay. He Himself establishes and disestablishes.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	quJ qy bwhir kCU n hovY qUM Awpy kwrY lwvixAw ]6] (125-18, mwJ, mÚ 3) tujh tay baahar kachhoo na hovai tooN aapay kaarai laavani-aa. ||6||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	Without You, nothing can be done. You Yourself have engaged all in their tasks. ||6||
RECORD	para 5244	Awpy mwry Awip jIvwey ] (125-19, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay maaray aap jeevaa-ay. He Himself kills, and He Himself revives.
RECORD	para 5245	Awpy myly myil imlwey ] (125-19, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay maylay mayl milaa-ay. He Himself unites us, and unites us in Union with Himself.
