DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 3 v7	Through selfless service, eternal peace is obtained. The Gurmukh is absorbed in intuitive peace. ||7||
DEFINE	para 5248	Awpy aUcw aUco hoeI ] (126-1, mwJ, mÚ 3) aapay oochaa oocho ho-ee. He Himself is the Highest of the High.
DEFINE	para 5249	ijsu Awip ivKwly su vyKY koeI ] (126-1, mwJ, mÚ 3) jis aap vikhaalay so vaykhai ko-ee. How rare are those who behold Him. He causes Himself to be seen.
