RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v8	O Nanak, the Naam, the Name of the Lord, abides deep within the hearts of those who see the Lord themselves, and inspire others to see Him as well. ||8||
DEFINE	para 5252	myrw pRBu BrpUir rihAw sB QweI ] (126-2, mwJ, mÚ 3) mayraa parabh bharpoor rahi-aa sabh thaa-ee. My God is pervading and permeating all places.
RECORD	para 5253	gur prswdI Gr hI mih pweI ] (126-3, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee ghar hee meh paa-ee. By Guru's Grace, I have found Him within the home of my own heart.
