RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	hir jgjIvnu inrBau dwqw gurmiq shij smwvixAw ]1] rhwau ] (126-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) har jagjeevan nirbha-o daataa gurmat sahj samaavani-aa. ||1||
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. Through the Guru's Teachings, I merge with intuitive ease into the Lord, the Life of the World, the Fearless One, the Great Giver. ||1||Pause||
