DEFINE	para 5270	gur swKI imitAw AMiDAwrw ] (126-10, mwJ, mÚ 3) gur saakhee miti-aa anDhi-aaraa. Through the Guru's Teachings, the darkness of spiritual ignorance is dispelled.
