RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v1	scw nwmu sdw hY inrmlu gur sbdI mMin vswvixAw ]1] rhwau ] (126-16, mwJ, mÚ 3) sachaa naam sadaa hai nirmal gur sabdee man vasaavani-aa. ||1||
