RECORD	mwJ mhlw 3 v6	KrI kuAwilE kurUip kulKxI supnY ipru nhI pwvixAw ]6] (127-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) kharee ku-aali-o kuroop kulkhanee supnai pir nahee paavni-aa. ||6||
