RECORD	para 5299	pyeIAVY ipru mMin vswieAw ] (127-4, mwJ, mÚ 3) pay-ee-arhai pir man vasaa-i-aa. She who enshrines her Husband Lord in her mind in this world
DEFINE	para 5300	pUrY guir hdUir idKwieAw ] (127-5, mwJ, mÚ 3) poorai gur hadoor dikhaa-i-aa. -His Presence is revealed to her by the Perfect Guru.
