DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v3	How can one meet the Lord? How is one separated from Him? Who can reveal the way to me? ||3||
DEFINE	para 5480	kauxu su AKru ijqu Dwvqu rhqw ] (131-6, mwJ, mÚ 5) ka-un so akhar jit Dhaavat rahtaa. What is that Word, by which the wandering mind can be restrained?
