RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v9	From oneness, He has brought forth the countless multitudes. O Nanak, they shall merge into the One once again. ||9||
DEFINE	para 5499	pRBu AibnwsI qw ikAw kwVw ] (131-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) parabh abhinaasee taa ki-aa kaarhaa. God is Eternal and Imperishable, so why should anyone be anxious?
