RECORD	para 5504	qyrw kIqw ijsu lwgY mITw ] (131-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) tayraa keetaa jis laagai meethaa. That person, unto whom Your actions seem sweet,
RECORD	para 5505	Git Git pwrbRhmu iqin jin fITw ] (131-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) ghat ghat paarbarahm tin jan deethaa. comes to see the Supreme Lord God in each and every heart.
RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v2	Qwin Qnµqir qUMhY qUMhY ieko ieku vrqwvixAw ]2] (131-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) thaan thanantar tooNhai tooNhai iko ik vartaavani-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwJ mhlw 5 v2	In all places and interspaces, You exist. You are the One and Only Lord, pervading everywhere. ||2||
DEFINE	para 5507	sgl mnorQ qUM dyvxhwrw ] (131-19, mwJ, mÚ 5) sagal manorath too N dayvanhaaraa. You are the Fulfiller of all the mind's desires.
DEFINE	para 5508	BgqI Bwie Bry BMfwrw ] (131-19, mwJ, mÚ 5) bhagtee bhaa-ay bharay bhandaaraa. Your treasures are overflowing with love and devotion.
