RECORD	mwJ mhlw 5 v4	gux gwvih pUrn AibnwsI kih suix qoit n AwvixAw ]4] (132-2, mwJ, mÚ 5) gun gaavahi pooran abhinaasee kahi sun tot na aavani-aa. ||4||
