RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v2	I touch the feet of one who unites me with God in the month of Chayt. ||2||
DEFINE	para 5585	vYswiK DIrin ikau vwFIAw ijnw pRym ibCohu ] (133-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) vaisaakh Dheeran ki-o vaadhee-aa jinaa paraym bichhohu. In the month of Vaisaakh, how can the bride be patient? She is separated from her Beloved.
RECORD	para 5586	hir swjnu purKu ivswir kY lgI mwieAw Dohu ] (133-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) har saajan purakh visaar kai lagee maa-i-aa Dhohu. She has forgotten the Lord, her Life-companion, her Master; she has become attached to Maya, the deceitful one.
REQUIRE	para 5587	puqR klqR n sMig Dnw hir AivnwsI Ehu ] (133-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) putar kaltar na sang Dhanaa har avinaasee oh. Neither son, nor spouse, nor wealth shall go along with you-only the Eternal Lord.
RECORD	para 5588	plic plic sglI mueI JUTY DMDY mohu ] (133-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) palach palach saglee mu-ee jhoothai DhanDhai moh. Entangled and enmeshed in the love of false occupations, the whole world is perishing.
RECORD	para 5589	ieksu hir ky nwm ibnu AgY leIAih Koih ] (133-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) ikas har kay naam bin agai la-ee-ah khohi. Without the Naam, the Name of the One Lord, they lose their lives in the hereafter.
DEFINE	para 5590	dXu ivswir ivgucxw pRB ibnu Avru n koie ] (133-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) da-yu visaar viguchnaa parabh bin avar na ko-ay. Forgetting the Merciful Lord, they are ruined. Without God, there is no other at all.
DEFINE	para 5591	pRIqm crxI jo lgy iqn kI inrml soie ] (133-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) pareetam charnee jo lagay tin kee nirmal so-ay. Pure is the reputation of those who are attached to the Feet of the Beloved Lord.
RECORD	para 5593	nwnk kI pRB bynqI pRB imlhu prwpiq hoie ] (134-1, mwJ, mÚ 5) naanak kee parabh bayntee parabh milhu paraapat ho-ay. Nanak makes this prayer to God: "Please, come and unite me with Yourself."
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v3	vYswKu suhwvw qW lgY jw sMqu BytY hir soie ]3] (134-1, mwJ, mÚ 5) vaisaakh suhaavaa taaN lagai jaa sant bhaytai har so-ay. ||3||
DEFINE	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v3	The month of Vaisaakh is beautiful and pleasant, when the Saint causes me to meet the Lord. ||3||
RECORD	para 5595	hir jyiT juVMdw loVIAY ijsu AgY siB invMin ] (134-2, mwJ, mÚ 5) har jayth jurhandaa lorhee-ai jis agai sabh nivann. In the month of Jayt'h, the bride longs to meet with the Lord. All bow in humility before Him.
RECORD	para 5596	hir sjx dwvix ligAw iksY n dyeI bMin ] (134-2, mwJ, mÚ 5) har sajan daavan lagi-aa kisai na day-ee bann. One who has grasped the hem of the robe of the Lord, the True Friend-no one can keep him in bondage.
DEFINE	para 5597	mwxk moqI nwmu pRB aun lgY nwhI sMin ] (134-3, mwJ, mÚ 5) maanak motee naam parabh un lagai naahee sann. God's Name is the Jewel, the Pearl. It cannot be stolen or taken away.
DEFINE	para 5598	rMg sBy nwrwiexY jyqy min BwvMin ] (134-3, mwJ, mÚ 5) rang sabhay naaraa-inai jaytay man bhaavann. In the Lord are all pleasures which please the mind.
RECORD	para 5599	jo hir loVy so kry soeI jIA krMin ] (134-3, mwJ, mÚ 5) jo har lorhay so karay so-ee jee-a karann. As the Lord wishes, so He acts, and so His creatures act.
DEFINE	para 5600	jo pRiB kIqy Awpxy syeI khIAih DMin ] (134-4, mwJ, mÚ 5) jo parabh keetay aapnay say-ee kahee-ahi Dhan. They alone are called blessed, whom God has made His Own.
WHEN	para 5601	Awpx lIAw jy imlY ivCuiV ikau rovMin ] (134-4, mwJ, mÚ 5) aapan lee-aa jay milai vichhurh ki-o rovann. If people could meet the Lord by their own efforts, why would they be crying out in the pain of separation?
RECORD	para 5602	swDU sMgu prwpqy nwnk rMg mwxMin ] (134-5, mwJ, mÚ 5) saaDhoo sang paraapatay naanak rang maanan. Meeting Him in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, O Nanak, celestial bliss is enjoyed.
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v4	hir jyTu rMgIlw iqsu DxI ijs kY Bwgu mQMin ]4] (134-5, mwJ, mÚ 5) har jayth rangeelaa tis Dhanee jis kai bhaag mathann. ||4||
DEFINE	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v4	In the month of Jayt'h, the playful Husband Lord meets her, upon whose forehead such good destiny is recorded. ||4||
DEFINE	para 5604	AwswVu qpMdw iqsu lgY hir nwhu n ijMnw pwis ] (134-6, mwJ, mÚ 5) aasaarh tapandaa tis lagai har naahu na jinna paas. The month of Aasaarh seems burning hot, to those who are not close to their Husband Lord.
RECORD	para 5605	jgjIvn purKu iqAwig kY mwxs sMdI Aws ] (134-6, mwJ, mÚ 5) jagjeevan purakh ti-aag kai maanas sandee aas. They have forsaken God the Primal Being, the Life of the World, and they have come to rely upon mere mortals.
DEFINE	para 5606	duXY Bwie ivgucIAY gil peIsu jm kI Pws ] (134-7, mwJ, mÚ 5) duyai bhaa-ay viguchee-ai gal pa-ees jam kee faas. In the love of duality, the soul-bride is ruined; around her neck she wears the noose of Death.
REQUIRE	para 5607	jyhw bIjY so luxY mQY jo iliKAwsu ] (134-7, mwJ, mÚ 5) jayhaa beejai so lunai mathai jo likhi-aas. As you plant, so shall you harvest; your destiny is recorded on your forehead.
RECORD	para 5608	rYix ivhwxI pCuqwxI auiT clI geI inrws ] (134-8, mwJ, mÚ 5) rain vihaanee pachhutaanee uth chalee ga-ee niraas. The life-night passes away, and in the end, one comes to regret and repent, and then depart with no hope at all.
DEFINE	para 5609	ijn kO swDU BytIAY so drgh hoie Klwsu ] (134-8, mwJ, mÚ 5) jin kou saaDhoo bhaytee-ai so dargeh ho-ay khalaas. Those who meet with the Holy Saints are liberated in the Court of the Lord.
UPHOLD	para 5610	kir ikrpw pRB AwpxI qyry drsn hoie ipAws ] (134-9, mwJ, mÚ 5) kar kirpaa parabh aapnee tayray darsan ho-ay pi-aas. Show Your Mercy to me, O God; I am thirsty for the Blessed Vision of Your Darshan.
DEFINE	para 5611	pRB quDu ibnu dUjw ko nhI nwnk kI Ardwis ] (134-9, mwJ, mÚ 5) parabh tuDh bin doojaa ko nahee naanak kee ardaas. Without You, God, there is no other at all. This is Nanak's humble prayer.
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v5	AwswVu suhMdw iqsu lgY ijsu min hir crx invws ]5] (134-10, mwJ, mÚ 5) aasaarh suhandaa tis lagai jis man har charan nivaas. ||5||
DEFINE	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v5	The month of Aasaarh is pleasant, when the Feet of the Lord abide in the mind. ||5||
DEFINE	para 5613	swvix srsI kwmxI crn kml isau ipAwru ] (134-10, mwJ, mÚ 5) saavan sarsee kaamnee charan kamal si-o pi-aar. In the month of Saawan, the soul-bride is happy, if she falls in love with the Lotus Feet of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 5614	mnu qnu rqw sc rMig ieko nwmu ADwru ] (134-11, mwJ, mÚ 5) man tan rataa sach rang iko naam aDhaar. Her mind and body are imbued with the Love of the True One; His Name is her only Support.
REQUIRE	para 5615	ibiKAw rMg kUVwivAw idsin sBy Cwru ] (134-11, mwJ, mÚ 5) bikhi-aa rang koorhaavi-aa disan sabhay chhaar. The pleasures of corruption are false. All that is seen shall turn to ashes.
DEFINE	para 5616	hir AMimRq bUMd suhwvxI imil swDU pIvxhwru ] (134-12, mwJ, mÚ 5) har amrit boond suhaavanee mil saaDhoo peevanhaar. The drops of the Lord's Nectar are so beautiful! Meeting the Holy Saint, we drink these in.
RECORD	para 5617	vxu iqxu pRB sMig mauilAw sMmRQ purK Apwru ] (134-12, mwJ, mÚ 5) van tin parabh sang ma-oli-aa samrath purakh apaar. The forests and the meadows are rejuvenated and refreshed with the Love of God, the All-powerful, Infinite Primal Being.
WHEN	para 5618	hir imlxY no mnu locdw krim imlwvxhwru ] (134-13, mwJ, mÚ 5) har milnai no man lochdaa karam milaavanhaar. My mind yearns to meet the Lord. If only He would show His Mercy, and unite me with Himself!
RECORD	para 5619	ijnI sKIey pRBu pwieAw hMau iqn kY sd bilhwr ] (134-13, mwJ, mÚ 5) jinee sakhee-ay parabh paa-i-aa ha N-u tin kai sad balihaar. Those brides who have obtained God-I am forever a sacrifice to them.
WHEN	para 5620	nwnk hir jI mieAw kir sbid svwrxhwru ] (134-14, mwJ, mÚ 5) naanak har jee ma-i-aa kar sabad savaaranhaar. O Nanak, when the Dear Lord shows kindness, He adorns His bride with the Word of His Shabad.
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v6	swvxu iqnw suhwgxI ijn rwm nwmu auir hwru ]6] (134-14, mwJ, mÚ 5) saavan tinaa suhaaganee jin raam naam ur haar. ||6||
DEFINE	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v6	Saawan is delightful for those happy soul-brides whose hearts are adorned with the Necklace of the Lord's Name. ||6||
DEFINE	para 5622	Bwduie Brim BulwxIAw dUjY lgw hyqu ] (134-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) bhaadu-ay bharam bhulaanee-aa doojai lagaa hayt. In the month of Bhaadon, she is deluded by doubt, because of her attachment to duality.
ALLOW	para 5623	lK sIgwr bxwieAw kwrij nwhI kyqu ] (134-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) lakh seegaar banaa-i-aa kaaraj naahee kayt. She may wear thousands of ornaments, but they are of no use at all.
WHEN	para 5624	ijqu idin dyh ibnssI iqqu vylY khsin pRyqu ] (134-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) jit din dayh binsasee tit vaylai kahsan parayt. On that day when the body perishes-at that time, she becomes a ghost.
RECORD	para 5625	pkiV clwiein dUq jm iksY n dynI Byqu ] (134-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) pakarh chalaa-in doot jam kisai na daynee bhayt. The Messenger of Death seizes and holds her, and does not tell anyone his secret.
WHEN	para 5626	Cif KVoqy iKnY mwih ijn isau lgw hyqu ] (134-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) chhad kharhotay khinai maahi jin si-o lagaa hayt. And her loved ones-in an instant, they move on, leaving her all alone.
RECORD	para 5627	hQ mroVY qnu kpy isAwhhu hoAw syqu ] (134-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) hath marorhai tan kapay si-aahhu ho-aa sayt. She wrings her hands, her body writhes in pain, and she turns from black to white.
DEFINE	para 5628	jyhw bIjY so luxY krmw sMdVw Kyqu ] (134-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) jayhaa beejai so lunai karmaa sand-rhaa khayt. As she has planted, so does she harvest; such is the field of karma.
RECORD	para 5629	nwnk pRB srxwgqI crx boihQ pRB dyqu ] (134-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) naanak parabh sarnaagatee charan bohith parabh dayt. Nanak seeks God's Sanctuary; God has given him the Boat of His Feet.
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v7	sy Bwduie nrik n pweIAih guru rKx vwlw hyqu ]7] (134-19, mwJ, mÚ 5) say bhaadu-ay narak na paa-ee-ah gur rakhan vaalaa hayt. ||7||
FORBID	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v7	Those who love the Guru, the Protector and Savior, in Bhaadon, shall not be thrown down into hell. ||7||
RECORD	para 5631	Asuin pRym aumwhVw ikau imlIAY hir jwie ] (134-19, mwJ, mÚ 5) asun paraym umaahrhaa ki-o milee-ai har jaa-ay. In the month of Assu, my love for the Lord overwhelms me. How can I go and meet the Lord?
UPHOLD	para 5633	min qin ipAws drsn GxI koeI Awix imlwvY mwie ] (135-1, mwJ, mÚ 5) man tan pi-aas darsan ghanee ko-ee aan milaavai maa-ay. My mind and body are so thirsty for the Blessed Vision of His Darshan. Won't someone please come and lead me to him, O my mother.
DEFINE	para 5634	sMq shweI pRym ky hau iqn kY lwgw pwie ] (135-1, mwJ, mÚ 5) sant sahaa-ee paraym kay ha-o tin kai laagaa paa-ay. The Saints are the helpers of the Lord's lovers; I fall and touch their feet.
DEFINE	para 5635	ivxu pRB ikau suKu pweIAY dUjI nwhI jwie ] (135-2, mwJ, mÚ 5) vin parabh ki-o sukh paa-ee-ai doojee naahee jaa-ay. Without God, how can I find peace? There is nowhere else to go.
RECORD	para 5636	ijMn@I cwiKAw pRym rsu sy iqRpiq rhy AwGwie ] (135-2, mwJ, mÚ 5) jin Hee chaakhi-aa paraym ras say taripat rahay aaghaa-ay. Those who have tasted the sublime essence of His Love, remain satisfied and fulfilled.
RECORD	para 5637	Awpu iqAwig ibnqI krih lyhu pRBU liV lwie ] (135-3, mwJ, mÚ 5) aap ti-aag bintee karahi layho parabhoo larh laa-ay. They renounce their selfishness and conceit, and they pray, "God, please attach me to the hem of Your robe."
FORBID	para 5638	jo hir kMiq imlweIAw is ivCuiV kqih n jwie ] (135-3, mwJ, mÚ 5) jo har kant milaa-ee-aa se vichhurh kateh na jaa-ay. Those whom the Husband Lord has united with Himself, shall not be separated from Him again.
DEFINE	para 5639	pRB ivxu dUjw ko nhI nwnk hir srxwie ] (135-4, mwJ, mÚ 5) parabh vin doojaa ko nahee naanak har sarnaa-ay. Without God, there is no other at all. Nanak has entered the Sanctuary of the Lord.
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v8	AsU suKI vsMdIAw ijnw mieAw hir rwie ]8] (135-4, mwJ, mÚ 5) asoo sukhee vasandee-aa jinaa ma-i-aa har raa-ay. ||8||
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v8	In Assu, the Lord, the Sovereign King, has granted His Mercy, and they dwell in peace. ||8||
RECORD	para 5641	kiqik krm kmwvxy dosu n kwhU jogu ] (135-5, mwJ, mÚ 5) katik karam kamaavnay dos na kaahoo jog. In the month of Katak, do good deeds. Do not try to blame anyone else.
DEFINE	para 5642	prmysr qy BuilAW ivAwpin sBy rog ] (135-5, mwJ, mÚ 5) parmaysar tay bhuli-aa N vi-aapan sabhay rog. Forgetting the Transcendent Lord, all sorts of illnesses are contracted.
REQUIRE	para 5643	vymuK hoey rwm qy lgin jnm ivjog ] (135-6, mwJ, mÚ 5) vaimukh ho-ay raam tay lagan janam vijog. Those who turn their backs on the Lord shall be separated from Him and consigned to reincarnation, over and over again.
RECORD	para 5644	iKn mih kauVy hoie gey ijqVy mwieAw Bog ] (135-6, mwJ, mÚ 5) khin meh ka-urhay ho-ay ga-ay jit-rhay maa-i-aa bhog. In an instant, all of Maya's sensual pleasures turn bitter.
RECORD	para 5645	ivcu n koeI kir skY iks QY rovih roj ] (135-7, mwJ, mÚ 5) vich na ko-ee kar sakai kis thai roveh roj. No one can then serve as your intermediary. Unto whom can we turn and cry?
RECORD	para 5646	kIqw ikCU n hoveI iliKAw Duir sMjog ] (135-7, mwJ, mÚ 5) keetaa kichhoo na hova-ee likhi-aa Dhur sanjog. By one's own actions, nothing can be done; destiny was pre-determined from the very beginning.
RECORD	para 5647	vfBwgI myrw pRBu imlY qW auqrih siB ibEg ] (135-7, mwJ, mÚ 5) vadbhaagee mayraa parabh milai taaN utreh sabh bi-og. By great good fortune, I meet my God, and then all pain of separation departs.
RECORD	para 5648	nwnk kau pRB rwiK lyih myry swihb bMdI moc ] (135-8, mwJ, mÚ 5) naanak ka-o parabh raakh layhi mayray saahib bandee moch. Please protect Nanak, God; O my Lord and Master, please release me from bondage.
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v9	kiqk hovY swDsMgu ibnsih sBy soc ]9] (135-8, mwJ, mÚ 5) katik hovai saaDhsang binsahi sabhay soch. ||9||
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v9	In Katak, in the Company of the Holy, all anxiety vanishes. ||9||
DEFINE	para 5650	mMiGir mwih sohMdIAw hir ipr sMig bYTVIAwh ] (135-9, mwJ, mÚ 5) manghir maahi sohandee-aa har pir sang baith-rhee-aah. In the month of Maghar, those who sit with their Beloved Husband Lord are beautiful.
RECORD	para 5651	iqn kI soBw ikAw gxI ij swihib mylVIAwh ] (135-9, mwJ, mÚ 5) tin kee sobhaa ki-aa ganee je saahib maylrhee-aah. How can their glory be measured? Their Lord and Master blends them with Himself.
RECORD	para 5652	qnu mnu mauilAw rwm isau sMig swD shylVIAwh ] (135-10, mwJ, mÚ 5) tan man ma-oli-aa raam si-o sang saaDh sahaylrhee-aah. Their bodies and minds blossom forth in the Lord; they have the companionship of the Holy Saints.
RECORD	para 5653	swD jnw qy bwhrI sy rhin iekylVIAwh ] (135-10, mwJ, mÚ 5) saaDh janaa tay baahree say rahan ikaylarhee-aah. Those who lack the Company of the Holy, remain all alone.
RECORD	para 5654	iqn duKu n kbhU auqrY sy jm kY vis pVIAwh ] (135-11, mwJ, mÚ 5) tin dukh na kabhoo utrai say jam kai vas parhee-aah. Their pain never departs, and they fall into the grip of the Messenger of Death.
DEFINE	para 5655	ijnI rwivAw pRBu Awpxw sy idsin inq KVIAwh ] (135-11, mwJ, mÚ 5) jinee raavi-aa parabh aapnaa say disan nit kharhee-aah. Those who have ravished and enjoyed their God, are seen to be continually exalted and uplifted.
RECORD	para 5656	rqn jvyhr lwl hir kMiT iqnw jVIAwh ] (135-12, mwJ, mÚ 5) ratan javayhar laal har kanth tinaa jarhee-aah. They wear the Necklace of the jewels, emeralds and rubies of the Lord's Name.
RECORD	para 5657	nwnk bWCY DUiV iqn pRB srxI dir pVIAwh ] (135-13, mwJ, mÚ 5) naanak baa Nchhai Dhoorh tin parabh sarnee dar parhee-aah. Nanak seeks the dust of the feet of those who take to the Sanctuary of the Lord's Door.
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v10	mMiGir pRBu AwrwDxw bhuiV n jnmVIAwh ]10] (135-13, mwJ, mÚ 5) manghir parabh aaraaDhanaa bahurh na janamrhee-aah. ||10||
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v10	Those who worship and adore God in Maghar, do not suffer the cycle of reincarnation ever again. ||10||
RECORD	para 5659	poiK quKwru n ivAwpeI kMiT imilAw hir nwhu ] (135-14, mwJ, mÚ 5) pokh tukhaar na vi-aapa-ee kanth mili-aa har naahu. In the month of Poh, the cold does not touch those, whom the Husband Lord hugs close in His Embrace.
DEFINE	para 5660	mnu byiDAw crnwribMd drsin lgVw swhu ] (135-14, mwJ, mÚ 5) man bayDhi-aa charnaarbind darsan lagrhaa saahu. Their minds are transfixed by His Lotus Feet. They are attached to the Blessed Vision of the Lord's Darshan.
DEFINE	para 5661	Et goivMd gopwl rwie syvw suAwmI lwhu ] (135-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) ot govind gopaal raa-ay sayvaa su-aamee laahu. Seek the Protection of the Lord of the Universe; His service is truly profitable.
FORBID	para 5662	ibiKAw poih n skeI imil swDU gux gwhu ] (135-15, mwJ, mÚ 5) bikhi-aa pohi na sak-ee mil saaDhoo gun gaahu. Corruption shall not touch you, when you join the Holy Saints and sing the Lord's Praises.
DEFINE	para 5663	jh qy aupjI qh imlI scI pRIiq smwhu ] (135-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) jah tay upjee tah milee sachee pareet samaahu. From where it originated, there the soul is blended again. It is absorbed in the Love of the True Lord.
REQUIRE	para 5664	kru gih lInI pwrbRhim bhuiV n ivCuVIAwhu ] (135-16, mwJ, mÚ 5) kar geh leenee paarbarahm bahurh na vichhurhi-aahu. When the Supreme Lord God grasps someone's hand, he shall never again suffer separation from Him.
RECORD	para 5665	bwir jwau lK byrIAw hir sjxu Agm Agwhu ] (135-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) baar jaa-o lakh bayree-aa har sajan agam agaahu. I am a sacrifice, 100,000 times, to the Lord, my Friend, the Unapproachable and Unfathomable.
RECORD	para 5666	srm peI nwrwiexY nwnk dir peIAwhu ] (135-17, mwJ, mÚ 5) saram pa-ee naaraa-inai naanak dar pa-ee-aahu. Please preserve my honor, Lord; Nanak begs at Your Door.
RECORD	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v11	poKu suohMdw srb suK ijsu bKsy vyprvwhu ]11] (135-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) pokh sohandaa sarab sukh jis bakhsay vayparvaahu. ||11||
DEFINE	bwrh mwhw mWJ mhlw 5 Gru 4 v11	Poh is beautiful, and all comforts come to that one, whom the Carefree Lord has forgiven. ||11||
RECORD	para 5668	mwiG mjnu sMig swDUAw DUVI kir iesnwnu ] (135-18, mwJ, mÚ 5) maagh majan sang saaDhoo-aa Dhoorhee kar isnaan. In the month of Maagh, let your cleansing bath be the dust of the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy.
RECORD	para 5669	hir kw nwmu iDAwie suix sBnw no kir dwnu ] (135-19, mwJ, mÚ 5) har kaa naam Dhi-aa-ay sun sabhnaa no kar daan. Meditate and listen to the Name of the Lord, and give it to everyone.
REQUIRE	para 5670	jnm krm mlu auqrY mn qy jwie gumwnu ] (135-19, mwJ, mÚ 5) janam karam mal utrai man tay jaa-ay gumaan. In this way, the filth of lifetimes of karma shall be removed, and egotistical pride shall vanish from your mind.
FORBID	para 5672	kwim kroiD n mohIAY ibnsY loBu suAwnu ] (136-1, mwJ, mÚ 5) kaam karoDh na mohee-ai binsai lobh su-aan. Sexual desire and anger shall not seduce you, and the dog of greed shall depart.
REQUIRE	para 5673	scY mwrig clidAw ausqiq kry jhwnu ] (136-1, mwJ, mÚ 5) sachai maarag chaldi-aa ustat karay jahaan. Those who walk on the Path of Truth shall be praised throughout the world.
RECORD	para 5674	ATsiT qIrQ sgl puMn jIA dieAw prvwnu ] (136-2, mwJ, mÚ 5) athsath tirath sagal punn jee-a da-i-aa parvaan. Be kind to all beings-this is more meritorious than bathing at the sixty-eight sacred shrines of pilgrimage and the giving of charity.
DEFINE	para 5675	ijs no dyvY dieAw kir soeI purKu sujwnu ] (136-2, mwJ, mÚ 5) jis no dayvai da-i-aa kar so-ee purakh sujaan. That person, upon whom the Lord bestows His Mercy, is a wise person.
DEFINE	para 5676	ijnw imilAw pRBu Awpxw nwnk iqn kurbwnu ] (136-3, mwJ, mÚ 5) jinaa mili-aa parabh aapnaa naanak tin kurbaan. Nanak is a sacrifice to those who have merged with God.
