DEFINE	para 6144	bhuqu pey Asgwh goqy Kwih n inklih ] (145-19, mwJ, mÚ 1) bahut pa-ay asgaah gotay khaahi na niklahi. So many fall into the bottomless pit; they are dragged under, and they cannot get out again.
