WHEN	mwJ mhlw 5 idn rYix v2	O Nanak, when the Guru makes one perfect, one's weight does not decrease. ||2||
RECORD	para 6158	pauVI ] (146-5) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 6159	jw qUM qw ikAw hoir mY scu suxweIAY ] (146-5, mwJ, mÚ 2) jaa tooN taa ki-aa hor mai sach sunaa-ee-ai. When You are with me, what more could I want? I speak only the Truth.
