DEFINE	para 6794	qw iesu mn kI soJI pwvY ] (159-6, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) taa is man kee sojhee paavai. thus he comes to understand this mind.
DEFINE	para 6795	mnu mY mqu mYgl imkdwrw ] (159-7, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) man mai mat maigal mikdaaraa. The mind is like an elephant, drunk with wine.
