DEFINE	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 v2	The Guru is the rod which controls it, and shows it the way. ||2||
DEFINE	para 6797	mnu AswDu swDY jnu koie ] (159-7, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) man asaaDh saaDhai jan ko-ay. The mind is uncontrollable; how rare are those who subdue it.
