RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 v3	haumY ivchu qjy ivkwr ]3] (159-8, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) ha-umai vichahu tajay vikaar. ||3||
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 v3	They eradicate egotism and corruption from within. ||3||
DEFINE	para 6801	jo Duir rwiKAnu myil imlwie ] (159-9, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) jo Dhur raakhi-an mayl milaa-ay. Those who, by pre-ordained destiny, are united in the Lord's Union,
DEFINE	para 6802	kdy n ivCuVih sbid smwie ] (159-9, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) kaday na vichhurheh sabad samaa-ay. are never separated from Him again; they are absorbed in the Shabad.
RECORD	para 6803	AwpxI klw Awpy hI jwxY ] (159-9, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) aapnee kalaa aapay hee jaanai. He Himself knows His Own Almighty Power.
