RECORD	para 6806	haumY ivic sBu jgu baurwnw ] (159-10, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) ha-umai vich sabh jag ba-uraanaa. The entire world has gone insane in egotism.
RECORD	para 6807	dUjY Bwie Brim Bulwnw ] (159-11, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) doojai bhaa-ay bharam bhulaanaa. In the love of duality, it wanders deluded by doubt.
