RECORD	para 6820	rwm rwm kriqAw suKu sWiq srIr ] (159-15, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) raam raam karti-aa sukh saa Nt sareer. Chanting the Name of the Lord, Raam, Raam, the body becomes peaceful and tranquil.
RECORD	para 6821	AMqir vsY n lwgY jm pIr ] (159-16, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) antar vasai na laagai jam peer. He dwells deep within - the pain of death does not touch Him.
