DEFINE	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 v4	O Nanak, serve the Lord forever; He is the treasure of glorious virtue. ||4||
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 ] (159-17)
RECORD	para 6825	so ikau ivsrY ijs ky jIA prwnw ] (159-17, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) so ki-o visrai jis kay jee-a paraanaa. Why forget Him, unto whom the soul and the breath of life belong?
DEFINE	para 6826	so ikau ivsrY sB mwih smwnw ] (159-18, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) so ki-o visrai sabh maahi samaanaa. Why forget Him, who is all-pervading?
