DEFINE	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 v1	Serving Him, one is honored and accepted in the Court of the Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 6828	hir ky nwm ivthu bil jwau ] (159-18, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) har kay naam vitahu bal jaa-o. I am a sacrifice to the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 v1	qUM ivsrih qid hI mir jwau ]1] rhwau ] (159-19, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) tooN visrahi tad hee mar jaa-o. ||1||
WHEN	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. If I were to forget You, at that very instant, I would die. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 6830	iqn qUM ivsrih ij quDu Awip Bulwey ] (159-19, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) tin tooN visrahi je tuDh aap bhulaa-ay. Those whom You Yourself have led astray, forget You.
