DEFINE	para 6858	eyku Acrju eyko hY soeI ] (160-11, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) ayk achraj ayko hai so-ee. The One Lord is wondrous and amazing! He is the One, the One and Only.
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 3 v1	gurmuiK vIcwry ivrlw koeI ]1] rhwau ] (160-11, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) gurmukh veechaaray virlaa ko-ee. ||1||
