DEFINE	para 6870	mnmuiK sUqw mwieAw moih ipAwir ] (160-15, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) manmukh sootaa maa-i-aa mohi pi-aar. The self-willed manmukhs are asleep, in love and attachment to Maya.
