RECORD	para 6878	iesu jug mih rwm nwim insqwrw ] (160-18, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) is jug meh raam naam nistaaraa. In this age, salvation comes only from the Lord's Name.
DEFINE	para 6879	ivrlw ko pwey gur sbid vIcwrw ] (160-19, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 3) virlaa ko paa-ay gur sabad veechaaraa. How rare are those who contemplate the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
