DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 9 v1	rahaa-o. One person passes away, and another thinks that he will live forever - this is a wonder beyond understanding! ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 9608	kwm k®oD moh bis pRwnI hir mUriq ibsrweI ] (219-5, gauVI, mÚ 9) kaam kroDh moh bas paraanee har moorat bisraa-ee. The mortal beings are held in the power of sexual desire, anger and emotional attachment; they have forgotten the Lord, the Immortal Form.
