RECORD	para 9681	rsu sMgRih ibKu prhir iqAwigAw ] (221-4, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) ras sangrahi bikh parhar ti-aagi-aa. I have gathered in the Lord's sublime essence, and cast out the poison.
RECORD	rwgu gauVI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 gauVI guAwryrI v3	Bwie bsy jm kw Bau BwigAw ]3] (221-4, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) bhaa-ay basay jam kaa bha-o bhaagi-aa. ||3||
RECORD	rwgu gauVI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 gauVI guAwryrI v3	Abiding in His Love, the fear of death has run away. ||3||
