RECORD	para 9689	iksu pUCau iksu lwgau pwie ] (221-7, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) kis poochha-o kis laaga-o paa-ay. Whom should I ask? At whose feet should I fall?
RECORD	rwgu gauVI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 gauVI guAwryrI v5	iksu aupdyis rhw ilv lwie ]5] (221-7, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) kis updays rahaa liv laa-ay. ||5||
