RECORD	rwgu gauVI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 gauVI guAwryrI v6	hukim sMjogI inj Gir jwau ]6] (221-8, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) hukam sanjogee nij ghar jaa-o. ||6||
RECORD	rwgu gauVI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 gauVI guAwryrI v6	Enjoined to the Lord's Command, I have entered the home of my inner self. ||6||
RECORD	para 9695	grb gqM suK Awqm iDAwnw ] (221-9, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) garab gata N sukh aatam Dhi-aanaa. With the extinction of pride, my soul has found peace and meditation.
RECORD	para 9696	joiq BeI joqI mwih smwnw ] (221-9, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) jot bha-ee jotee maahi samaanaa. The Divine Light has dawned, and I am absorbed in the Light.
