RECORD	rwgu gauVI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 gauVI guAwryrI v7	krqw krxw krqw jwnw ]7] (221-10, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) kartaa karnaa kartaa jaanaa. ||7||
RECORD	rwgu gauVI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 gauVI guAwryrI v7	I know the Creator, the Creator of His Creation. ||7||
RECORD	para 9699	nh pMifqu nh cquru isAwnw ] (221-10, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) nah pandit nah chatur si-aanaa. I am not a learned Pandit, I am not clever or wise.
RECORD	para 9700	nh BUlo nh Brim Bulwnw ] (221-10, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) nah bhoolo nah bharam bhulaanaa. I do not wander; I am not deluded by doubt.
RECORD	para 9701	kQau n kQnI hukmu pCwnw ] (221-10, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) katha-o na kathnee hukam pachhaanaa. I do not speak empty speech; I have recognized the Hukam of His Command.
