RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 1 v1	rahaa-o. Without subduing the mind, how can His value be estimated? ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 9708	Gr mih AMimRqu qskru lyeI ] (221-13, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) ghar meh amrit taskar lay-ee. In the house of the self is the Ambrosial Nectar, which is being stolen by the thieves.
RECORD	para 9709	nµnwkwru n koie kryeI ] (221-14, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) nannaakaar na ko-ay karay-ee. No one can say no to them.
