RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 1 v2	He Himself protects us, and blesses us with greatness. ||2||
DEFINE	para 9711	nIl AnIl Agin iek TweI ] (221-14, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) neel aneel agan ik thaa-ee. There are billions, countless billions of fires of desire at the seat of the mind.
DEFINE	para 9712	jil invrI guir bUJ buJweI ] (221-14, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) jal nivree gur boojh bujhaa-ee. They are extinguished only with the water of understanding, imparted by the Guru.
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 1 v3	mnu dy lIAw rhis gux gweI ]3] (221-15, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) man day lee-aa rahas gun gaa-ee. ||3||
