RECORD	para 9721	ijin bUiJAw iqin shij pCwinAw ] (221-17, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) jin boojhi-aa tin sahj pachhaani-aa. But one who understands, intuitively realizes.
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 1 v6	dyiK bIcwir myrw mnu mwinAw ]6] (221-18, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) daykh beechaar mayraa man maani-aa. ||6||
