DEFINE	para 9732	mnu vis dUqw durmiq doie ] (222-2, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) man vas dootaa durmat do-ay. The mind is under the power of the demons of evil intellect and duality.
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 1 v1	mnu mwnY gur qy ieku hoie ]1] (222-2, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) man maanai gur tay ik ho-ay. ||1||
