RECORD	para 9762	AYsw jgu dyiKAw jUAwrI ] (222-11, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) aisaa jag daykhi-aa joo-aaree. I have seen the world to be such a gambler;
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 1 v1	siB suK mwgY nwmu ibswrI ]1] rhwau ] (222-12, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) sabh sukh maagai naam bisaaree. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 1 v1	rahaa-o. all beg for peace, but they forget the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||1||Pause||
WHEN	para 9764	Aidstu idsY qw kihAw jwie ] (222-12, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) adisat disai taa kahi-aa jaa-ay. If the Unseen Lord could be seen, then He could be described.
