RECORD	gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 1 v3	The Creator created the creation, and He watches over it. ||3||
DEFINE	para 9772	iqRsnw Agin sbid buJwey ] (222-14, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) tarisnaa agan sabad bujhaa-ay. The fire of desire is quenched by the Word of the Shabad.
DEFINE	para 9773	dUjw Brmu shij suBwey ] (222-15, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) doojaa bharam sahj subhaa-ay. Duality and doubt are automatically eliminated.
RECORD	para 9774	gurmqI nwmu irdY vswey ] (222-15, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 1) gurmatee naam ridai vasaa-ay. Following the Guru's Teachings, the Naam abides in the heart.
