RECORD	para 10108	jh dyKau qh riv rhy rKu rwKnhwrw ] (228-13, gauVI bYrwgix, mÚ 1) jah daykh-a-u tah rav rahay rakh raakhanhaaraa. Wherever I look, there You are. Save me, O Savior Lord!
