WHEN	para 10110	ikrqu pieAw AD aUrDI ibnu igAwn bIcwrw ] (228-14, gauVI bYrwgix, mÚ 1) kirat pa-i-aa aDh oorDhee bin gi-aan beechaaraa. According to the karma of past actions, people descend to the depths or rise to the heights, unless they contemplate spiritual wisdom.
