DEFINE	gauVI bYrwgix mhlw 1 v3	Without the Praises of the Lord of the Universe, the darkness is not dispelled. ||3||
RECORD	para 10112	jgu ibnsq hm dyiKAw loBy AhMkwrw ] (228-15, gauVI bYrwgix, mÚ 1) jag binsat ham daykhi-aa lobhay aha Nkaaraa. I have seen the world being destroyed by greed and egotism.
