DEFINE	para 10114	inj Gir mhlu Apwr ko AprMpru soeI ] (228-16, gauVI bYrwgix, mÚ 1) nij ghar mahal apaar ko aprampar so-ee. The Mansion of the Infinite Lord's Presence is within the home of one's own being. He is beyond any boundaries.
RECORD	gauVI bYrwgix mhlw 1 v5	ibnu sbdY iQru ko nhI bUJY suKu hoeI ]5] (228-17, gauVI bYrwgix, mÚ 1) bin sabdai thir ko nahee boojhai sukh ho-ee. ||5||
