DEFINE	gauVI bYrwgix mhlw 1 v8	O Nanak, this Union cannot be broken; the true profit is obtained. ||8||
DEFINE	para 10124	gur prswdI bUiJ ly qau hoie inbyrw ] (229-1, gauVI, mÚ 1) gur parsaadee boojh lay ta-o ho-ay nibayraa. By Guru's Grace, one comes to understand, and then, the account is settled.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 1 v1	Gir Gir nwmu inrMjnw so Twkuru myrw ]1] (229-2, gauVI, mÚ 1) ghar ghar naam niranjanaa so thaakur mayraa. ||1||
DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 1 v1	In each and every heart is the Name of the Immaculate Lord; He is my Lord and Master. ||1||
