DEFINE	para 10128	AMDy AklI bwhry ikAw iqn isau khIAY ] (229-3, gauVI, mÚ 1) anDhay aklee baahray ki-aa tin si-o kahee-ai. What can you say, to one who is blind and without wisdom?
