DEFINE	para 10132	sUqy kau jwgqu khY jwgq kau sUqw ] (229-5, gauVI, mÚ 1) sootay ka-o jaagat kahai jaagat ka-o sootaa. The sleeper is said to be awake, and those who are awake are like sleepers.
