RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v7	The unstruck melody of the Shabad vibrates for them. ||7||
RECORD	para 10271	siqgur qy kvnu kvnu n sIDo myry BweI ] (231-16, gauVI, mÚ 3) satgur tay kavan kavan na seeDho mayray bhaa-ee. Who - who has not been purified by the True Guru, O my Siblings of Destiny?
DEFINE	para 10272	BgqI sIDy dir soBw pweI ] (231-17, gauVI, mÚ 3) bhagtee seeDhay dar sobhaa paa-ee. The devotees are purified, and honored in His Court.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v8	nwnk rwm nwim vifAweI ]8]5] (231-17, gauVI, mÚ 3) naanak raam naam vadi-aa-ee. ||8||
DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 3 v8	5|| O Nanak, greatness is in the Lord's Name. ||8||5||
RECORD	para 10275	qRY gux vKwxY Brmu n jwie ] (231-17, gauVI, mÚ 3) tarai gun vakhaanai bharam na jaa-ay. Those who speak of the three qualities - their doubts do not depart.
DEFINE	para 10276	bMDn n qUtih mukiq n pwie ] (231-18, gauVI, mÚ 3) banDhan na tooteh mukat na paa-ay. Their bonds are not broken, and they do not obtain liberation.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v1	mukiq dwqw siqguru jug mwih ]1] (231-18, gauVI, mÚ 3) mukat daataa satgur jug maahi. ||1||
DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 3 v1	The True Guru is the Bestower of liberation in this age. ||1||
RECORD	para 10278	gurmuiK pRwxI Brmu gvwie ] (231-19, gauVI, mÚ 3) gurmukh paraanee bharam gavaa-ay. Those mortals who become Gurmukh give up their doubts.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v1	shj Duin aupjY hir ilv lwie ]1] rhwau ] (231-19, gauVI, mÚ 3) sahj Dhun upjai har liv laa-ay. ||1||
WHEN	gauVI mhlw 3 v1	rahaa-o. The celestial music wells up, when they lovingly attune their consciousness to the Lord. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 10280	qRY gux kwlY kI isir kwrw ] (231-19, gauVI, mÚ 3) tarai gun kaalai kee sir kaaraa. Those who are controlled by the three qualities have death hovering over their heads.
RECORD	para 10282	nwmu n cyqih aupwvxhwrw ] (232-1, gauVI, mÚ 3) naam na cheeteh upaavanhaaraa. They do not remember the Name of the Creator Lord.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v2	mir jMmih iPir vwro vwrw ]2] (232-1, gauVI, mÚ 3) mar jameh fir vaaro vaaraa. ||2||
DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 3 v2	They die, and are reborn, over and over, again and again. ||2||
DEFINE	para 10284	AMDy gurU qy Brmu n jweI ] (232-1, gauVI, mÚ 3) anDhay guroo tay bharam na jaa-ee. Those whose guru is spiritually blind - their doubts are not dispelled.
WHEN	para 10285	mUlu Coif lwgy dUjY BweI ] (232-2, gauVI, mÚ 3) mool chhod laagay doojai bhaa-ee. Abandoning the Source of all, they have become attached to the love of duality.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v3	ibKu kw mwqw ibKu mwih smweI ]3] (232-2, gauVI, mÚ 3) bikh kaa maataa bikh maahi samaa-ee. ||3||
DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 3 v3	Infected with poison, they are immersed in poison. ||3||
RECORD	para 10287	mwieAw kir mUlu jMqR Brmwey ] (232-2, gauVI, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa kar mool jantar bharmaa-ay. Believing Maya to be the source of all, they wander in doubt.
DEFINE	para 10288	hir jIau ivsirAw dUjY Bwey ] (232-3, gauVI, mÚ 3) har jee-o visri-aa doojai bhaa-ay. They have forgotten the Dear Lord, and they are in love with duality.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v4	ijsu ndir kry so prm giq pwey ]4] (232-3, gauVI, mÚ 3) jis nadar karay so param gat paa-ay. ||4||
DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 3 v4	The supreme status is obtained only by those who are blessed with His Glance of Grace. ||4||
RECORD	para 10290	AMqir swcu bwhir swcu vrqwey ] (232-3, gauVI, mÚ 3) antar saach baahar saach vartaa-ay. One who has Truth pervading within, radiates Truth outwardly as well.
ALLOW	para 10291	swcu n CpY jy ko rKY Cpwey ] (232-4, gauVI, mÚ 3) saach na chhapai jay ko rakhai chhapaa-ay. The Truth does not remain hidden, even though one may try to hide it.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v5	igAwnI bUJih shij suBwey ]5] (232-4, gauVI, mÚ 3) gi-aanee boojheh sahj subhaa-ay. ||5||
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v5	The spiritually wise know this intuitively. ||5||
RECORD	para 10293	gurmuiK swic rihAw ilv lwey ] (232-4, gauVI, mÚ 3) gurmukh saach rahi-aa liv laa-ay. The Gurmukhs keep their consciousness lovingly centered on the Lord.
DEFINE	para 10294	haumY mwieAw sbid jlwey ] (232-5, gauVI, mÚ 3) ha-umai maa-i-aa sabad jalaa-ay. Ego and Maya are burned away by the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v6	myrw pRBu swcw myil imlwey ]6] (232-5, gauVI, mÚ 3) mayraa parabh saachaa mayl milaa-ay. ||6||
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v6	My True God unites them in His Union. ||6||
RECORD	para 10296	siqguru dwqw sbdu suxwey ] (232-5, gauVI, mÚ 3) satgur daataa sabad sunaa-ay. The True Guru, The Giver, preaches the Shabad.
RECORD	para 10297	Dwvqu rwKY Twik rhwey ] (232-6, gauVI, mÚ 3) Dhaavat raakhai thaak rahaa-ay. He controls, and restrains, and holds still the wandering mind.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v7	pUry gur qy soJI pwey ]7] (232-6, gauVI, mÚ 3) pooray gur tay sojhee paa-ay. ||7||
DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 3 v7	Understanding is obtained through the Perfect Guru. ||7||
REQUIRE	para 10299	Awpy krqw isRsit isrij ijin goeI ] (232-6, gauVI, mÚ 3) aapay kartaa sarisat siraj jin go-ee. The Creator Himself has created the universe; He Himself shall destroy it.
DEFINE	para 10300	iqsu ibnu dUjw Avru n koeI ] (232-7, gauVI, mÚ 3) tis bin doojaa avar na ko-ee. Without Him, there is no other at all.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 3 v8	nwnk gurmuiK bUJY koeI ]8]6] (232-7, gauVI, mÚ 3) naanak gurmukh boojhai ko-ee. ||8||
DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 3 v8	6|| O Nanak, how rare are those who, as Gurmukh, understand this! ||8||6||
RECORD	para 10303	nwmu Amolku gurmuiK pwvY ] (232-8, gauVI, mÚ 3) naam amolak gurmukh paavai. The Gurmukhs obtain the Naam, the Priceless Name of the Lord.
