RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v1	then it recognizes the Lord in each and every heart. ||1||
DEFINE	para 10438	shj suhylw Plu mskInI ] (235-11, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) sahj suhaylaa fal maskeenee. The fruit of humility is intuitive peace and pleasure.
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v1	siqgur ApunY moih dwnu dInI ]1] rhwau ] (235-11, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) satgur apunai mohi daan deenee. ||1||
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v1	rahaa-o. My True Guru has given me this gift. ||1||Pause||
