WHEN	para 10442	myr qyr jb ienih cukweI ] (235-12, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) mayr tayr jab ineh chukaa-ee. But when he stops thinking in terms of 'mine' and 'yours',
DEFINE	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v2	qw qy iesu sMig nhI bYrweI ]2] (235-13, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) taa tay is sang nahee bairaa-ee. ||2||
DEFINE	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v2	then no one is angry with him. ||2||
WHEN	para 10444	jb iein ApunI ApnI DwrI ] (235-13, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jab in apunee apnee Dhaaree. When he clings to 'my own, my own',
DEFINE	para 10445	qb ies kau hY musklu BwrI ] (235-13, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) tab is ka-o hai muskal bhaaree. then he is in deep trouble.
WHEN	para 10446	jb iein krxYhwru pCwqw ] (235-14, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jab in karnaihaar pachhaataa. But when he recognizes the Creator Lord,
DEFINE	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v3	qb ies no nwhI ikCu qwqw ]3] (235-14, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) tab is no naahee kichh taataa. ||3||
DEFINE	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v3	then he is free of torment. ||3||
WHEN	para 10448	jb iein Apuno bwiDE mohw ] (235-14, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jab in apuno baaDhi-o mohaa. When he entangles himself in emotional attachment,
RECORD	para 10449	AwvY jwie sdw jim johw ] (235-15, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) aavai jaa-ay sadaa jam johaa. he comes and goes in reincarnation, under the constant gaze of Death.
DEFINE	para 10450	jb ies qy sB ibnsy Brmw ] (235-15, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jab is tay sabh binsay bharmaa. But when all his doubts are removed,
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v4	Bydu nwhI hY pwrbRhmw ]4] (235-15, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) bhayd naahee hai paarbrahmaa. ||4||
DEFINE	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v4	then there is no difference between him and the Supreme Lord God. ||4||
WHEN	para 10452	jb iein ikCu kir mwny Bydw ] (235-16, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jab in kichh kar maanay bhaydaa. When he perceives differences,
RECORD	para 10453	qb qy dUK fMf Aru Kydw ] (235-16, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) tab tay dookh dand ar khaydaa. then he suffers pain, punishment and sorrow.
WHEN	para 10454	jb iein eyko eykI bUiJAw ] (235-16, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jab in ayko aykee boojhi-aa. But when he recognizes the One and Only Lord,
DEFINE	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v5	qb qy ies no sBu ikCu sUiJAw ]5] (235-17, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) tab tay is no sabh kichh soojhi-aa. ||5||
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v5	he understands everything. ||5||
WHEN	para 10456	jb iehu DwvY mwieAw ArQI ] (235-17, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jab ih Dhaavai maa-i-aa arthee. When he runs around for the sake of Maya and riches,
DEFINE	para 10457	nh iqRpqwvY nh iqs lwQI ] (235-17, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) nah tariptaavai nah tis laathee. he is not satisfied, and his desires are not quenched.
DEFINE	para 10458	jb ies qy iehu hoieE jaulw ] (235-18, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jab is tay ih ho-i-o ja-ulaa. But when he runs away from Maya,
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v6	pICY lwig clI auiT kaulw ]6] (235-18, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) peechhai laag chalee uth ka-ulaa. ||6||
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v6	then the Goddess of Wealth gets up and follows him. ||6||
DEFINE	para 10460	kir ikrpw jau siqguru imilE ] (235-18, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) kar kirpaa ja-o satgur mili-o. When, by His Grace, the True Guru is met,
DEFINE	para 10461	mn mMdr mih dIpku jilE ] (235-19, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) man mandar meh deepak jali-o. the lamp is lit within the temple of the mind.
WHEN	para 10462	jIq hwr kI soJI krI ] (235-19, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) jeet haar kee sojhee karee. When he realizes what victory and defeat really are,
DEFINE	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v7	qau iesu Gr kI kImiq prI ]7] (235-19, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) ta-o is ghar kee keemat paree. ||7||
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v7	then he comes to appreciate the true value of his own home. ||7||
DEFINE	para 10465	krn krwvn sBu ikCu eykY ] (236-1, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) karan karaavan sabh kichh aykai. The One Lord is the Creator of all things, the Cause of causes.
DEFINE	para 10466	Awpy buiD bIcwir ibbykY ] (236-1, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) aapay buDh beechaar bibaykai. He Himself is wisdom, contemplation and discerning understanding.
DEFINE	para 10467	dUir n nyrY sB kY sMgw ] (236-1, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) door na nayrai sabh kai sangaa. He is not far away; He is near at hand, with all.
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v8	scu swlwhxu nwnk hir rMgw ]8]1] (236-2, gauVI guAwryrI, mÚ 5) sach saalaahan naanak har rangaa. ||8||
RECORD	rwgu gauVI guAwryrI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v8	1|| So praise the True One, O Nanak, with love! ||8||1||
ALLOW	para 10470	gur syvw qy nwmy lwgw ] (236-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) gur sayvaa tay naamay laagaa. Serving the Guru, one is committed to the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 10471	iqs kau imilAw ijsu msqik Bwgw ] (236-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) tis ka-o mili-aa jis mastak bhaagaa. It is received only by those who have such good destiny inscribed upon their foreheads.
RECORD	para 10472	iqs kY ihrdY rivAw soie ] (236-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) tis kai hirdai ravi-aa so-ay. The Lord dwells within their hearts.
