RECORD	gauVI mhlw 5 v1	Their minds and bodies become peaceful and stable. ||1||
RECORD	para 10474	AYsw kIrqnu kir mn myry ] (236-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) aisaa keertan kar man mayray. O my mind, sing such Praises of the Lord,
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 5 v1	eIhw aUhw jo kwim qyrY ]1] rhwau ] (236-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) eehaa oohaa jo kaam tayrai. ||1||
REQUIRE	gauVI mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. which shall be of use to you here and hereafter. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 10476	jwsu jpq Bau Apdw jwie ] (236-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaas japat bha-o apdaa jaa-ay. Meditating on Him, fear and misfortune depart,
