REQUIRE	para 10478	jwsu jpq iPir dUKu n lwgY ] (236-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaas japat fir dookh na laagai. Meditating on Him, suffering shall never again overtake you.
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 5 v2	jwsu jpq ieh haumY BwgY ]2] (236-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaas japat ih ha-umai bhaagai. ||2||
RECORD	gauVI mhlw 5 v2	Meditating on Him, this ego runs away. ||2||
DEFINE	para 10480	jwsu jpq vis Awvih pMcw ] (236-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaas japat vas aavahi panchaa. Meditating on Him, the five passions are overcome.
DEFINE	para 10481	jwsu jpq irdY AMimRqu sMcw ] (236-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaas japat ridai amrit sanchaa. Meditating on Him, Ambrosial Nectar is collected in the heart.
DEFINE	para 10482	jwsu jpq ieh iqRsnw buJY ] (236-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaas japat ih tarisnaa bujhai. Meditating on Him, this desire is quenched.
