DEFINE	gauVI mhlw 5 v4	Meditating on Him, all filth is washed away. ||4||
DEFINE	para 10488	jwsu jpq rqnu hir imlY ] (236-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaas japat ratan har milai. Meditating on Him, the jewel of the Lord is obtained.
