RECORD	para 10912	rYix suiK suqI jIau AMqir auir Dwry ] (245-7, gauVI, mÚ 3) rain sukh sutee jee-o antar ur Dhaaray. She passes her life-night sleeping in peace, enshrining the Lord in her heart.
RECORD	para 10913	AMqir auir Dwry imlIAY ipAwry Anidnu duKu invwry ] (245-7, gauVI, mÚ 3) antar ur Dhaaray milee-ai pi-aaray an-din dukh nivaaray. Enshrining Him deep within her heart night and day, she meets her Beloved, and her pains depart.
