RECORD	para 10959	gur kI syvw KrI suKwlI ijs no Awip krwey ] (246-13, gauVI, mÚ 3) gur kee sayvaa kharee sukhaalee jis no aap karaa-ay. Serving the Guru brings great peace; they alone do it, whom the Lord inspires to do so.
