RECORD	para 10965	nwmu iDAwey sdw suKu pwey nwim rhY ilv lwey ] (246-16, gauVI, mÚ 3) naam Dhi-aa-ay sadaa sukh paa-ay naam rahai liv laa-ay. Meditating on the Naam, the Name of the Lord, a lasting peace is obtained; so remain lovingly focused on the Naam.
