DEFINE	para 10973	mwieAw bMDn itkY nwhI iKnu iKnu duKu sMqwey ] (247-1, gauVI, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa banDhan tikai naahee khin khin dukh santaa-ay. Bound by Maya, the mind is not stable. Each and every moment, it suffers in pain.
