RECORD	para 10976	mwieAw kw BRmu AMDu iprw jIau hir mwrgu ikau pwey ] (247-2, gauVI, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa kaa bharam anDh piraa jee-o har maarag ki-o paa-ay. The delusion of Maya has made them blind, O my dear; how can they find the Way of the Lord?
