RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Pleasure and pain, liberation and reincarnation, O Nanak, come according to one's pre-ordained destiny. ||1||
RECORD	para 11289	pvVI ] (253-13) pavrhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 11290	kkw kwrn krqw soaU ] (253-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) kakaa kaaran kartaa so-oo. KAKKA: He is the Creator, the Cause of causes.
RECORD	para 11291	iliKE lyKu n mytq koaU ] (253-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) likhi-o laykh na maytat ko-oo. No one can erase His pre-ordained plan.
RECORD	para 11292	nhI hoq kCu doaU bwrw ] (253-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) nahee hot kachh do-oo baaraa. Nothing can be done a second time.
RECORD	para 11293	krnYhwru n BUlnhwrw ] (253-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) karnaihaar na bhoolanhaaraa. The Creator Lord does not make mistakes.
RECORD	para 11294	kwhU pMQu idKwrY AwpY ] (253-14, gauVI, mÚ 5) kaahoo panth dikhaarai aapai. To some, He Himself shows the Way.
RECORD	para 11295	kwhU auidAwn BRmq pCuqwpY ] (253-14, gauVI, mÚ 5) kaahoo udi-aan bharmat pachhutaapai. While He causes others to wander miserably in the wilderness.
RECORD	para 11296	Awpn Kylu Awp hI kIno ] (253-14, gauVI, mÚ 5) aapan khayl aap hee keeno. He Himself has set His own play in motion.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v17	jo jo dIno su nwnk lIno ]17] (253-15, gauVI, mÚ 5) jo jo deeno so naanak leeno. ||17||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v17	Whatever He gives, O Nanak, that is what we receive. ||17||
RECORD	para 11298	sloku ] (253-15) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 11299	Kwq Krcq iblCq rhy tUit n jwih BMfwr ] (253-15, gauVI, mÚ 5) khaat kharchat bilchhat rahay toot na jaahi bhandaar. People continue to eat and consume and enjoy, but the Lord's warehouses are never exhausted.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	hir hir jpq Anyk jn nwnk nwih sumwr ]1] (253-15, gauVI, mÚ 5) har har japat anayk jan naanak naahi sumaar. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	So many chant the Name of the Lord, Har, Har; O Nanak, they cannot be counted. ||1||
RECORD	para 11301	pauVI ] (253-16) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 11302	KKw KUnw kCu nhI iqsu sMmRQ kY pwih ] (253-16, gauVI, mÚ 5) khakhaa khoonaa kachh nahee tis samrath kai paahi. KHAKHA: The All-powerful Lord lacks nothing;
DEFINE	para 11303	jo dynw so dy rihE BwvY qh qh jwih ] (253-16, gauVI, mÚ 5) jo daynaa so day rahi-o bhaavai tah tah jaahi. whatever He is to give, He continues to give - let anyone go anywhere he pleases.
DEFINE	para 11304	Krcu Kjwnw nwm Dnu ieAw Bgqn kI rwis ] (253-17, gauVI, mÚ 5) kharach khajaanaa naam Dhan i-aa bhagtan kee raas. The wealth of the Naam, the Name of the Lord, is a treasure to spend; it is the capital of His devotees.
RECORD	para 11305	iKmw grIbI And shj jpq rhih guxqws ] (253-17, gauVI, mÚ 5) khimaa gareebee anad sahj japat raheh guntaas. With tolerance, humility, bliss and intuitive poise, they continue to meditate on the Lord, the Treasure of excellence.
RECORD	para 11306	Kylih ibgsih And isau jw kau hoq ik®pwl ] (253-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) khayleh bigsahi anad si-o jaa ka-o hot kirpaal. Those, unto whom the Lord shows His Mercy, play happily and blossom forth.
DEFINE	para 11307	sdIv gnIv suhwvny rwm nwm igRih mwl ] (253-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) sadeev ganeev suhaavanay raam naam garihi maal. Those who have the wealth of the Lord's Name in their homes are forever wealthy and beautiful.
DEFINE	para 11308	Kydu n dUKu n fwnu iqh jw kau ndir krI ] (253-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) khayd na dookh na daan tih jaa ka-o nadar karee. Those who are blessed with the Lord's Glance of Grace suffer neither torture, nor pain, nor punishment.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v18	nwnk jo pRB BwixAw pUrI iqnw prI ]18] (253-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak jo parabh bhaani-aa pooree tinaa paree. ||18||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v18	O Nanak, those who are pleasing to God become perfectly successful. ||18||
RECORD	para 11311	sloku ] (254-1) salok. Shalok:
REQUIRE	para 11312	gin imin dyKhu mnY mwih srpr clno log ] (254-1, gauVI, mÚ 5) gan min daykhhu manai maahi sarpar chalno log. See, that even by calculating and scheming in their minds, people must surely depart in the end.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Aws Ainq gurmuiK imtY nwnk nwm Arog ]1] (254-1, gauVI, mÚ 5) aas anit gurmukh mitai naanak naam arog. ||1||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Hopes and desires for transitory things are erased for the Gurmukh; O Nanak, the Name alone brings true health. ||1||
RECORD	para 11314	pauVI ] (254-2) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 11315	ggw goibd gux rvhu swis swis jip nIq ] (254-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) gagaa gobid gun ravhu saas saas jap neet. GAGGA: Chant the Glorious Praises of the Lord of the Universe with each and every breath; meditate on Him forever.
RECORD	para 11316	khw ibswsw dyh kw iblm n kirho mIq ] (254-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) kahaa bisaasaa dayh kaa bilam na kariho meet. How can you rely on the body? Do not delay, my friend;
DEFINE	para 11317	nh bwirk nh jobnY nh ibrDI kCu bMDu ] (254-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) nah baarik nah jobnai nah birDhee kachh banDh. there is nothing to stand in Death's way - neither in childhood, nor in youth, nor in old age.
REQUIRE	para 11318	Eh byrw nh bUJIAY jau Awie prY jm PMDu ] (254-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) oh bayraa nah boojhee-ai ja-o aa-ay parai jam fanDh. That time is not known, when the noose of Death shall come and fall on you.
RECORD	para 11319	igAwnI iDAwnI cqur pyiK rhnu nhI ieh Twie ] (254-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) gi-aanee Dhi-aanee chatur paykh rahan nahee ih thaa-ay. See, that even spiritual scholars, those who meditate, and those who are clever shall not stay in this place.
WHEN	para 11320	Cwif Cwif sglI geI mUV qhw lptwih ] (254-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) chhaad chhaad saglee ga-ee moorh tahaa laptaahi. Only the fool clings to that, which everyone else has abandoned and left behind.
RECORD	para 11321	gur pRswid ismrq rhY jwhU msqik Bwg ] (254-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) gur parsaad simrat rahai jaahoo mastak bhaag. By Guru's Grace, one who has such good destiny written on his forehead remembers the Lord in meditation.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v19	nwnk Awey sPl qy jw kau ipRAih suhwg ]19] (254-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak aa-ay safal tay jaa ka-o pari-ahi suhaag. ||19||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v19	O Nanak, blessed and fruitful is the coming of those who obtain the Beloved Lord as their Husband. ||19||
RECORD	para 11323	sloku ] (254-6) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11324	GoKy swsqR byd sB Awn n kQqau koie ] (254-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) ghokhay saastar bayd sabh aan na khathata-o ko-ay. I have searched all the Shaastras and the Vedas, and they say nothing except this:
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Awid jugwdI huix hovq nwnk eykY soie ]1] (254-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) aad jugaadee hun hovat naanak aykai so-ay. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	"In the beginning, throughout the ages, now and forevermore, O Nanak, the One Lord alone exists."||1||
RECORD	para 11326	pauVI ] (254-7) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 11327	GGw Gwlhu mnih eyh ibnu hir dUsr nwih ] (254-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) ghaghaa ghaalhu maneh ayh bin har doosar naahi. GHAGHA: Put this into your mind, that there is no one except the Lord.
REQUIRE	para 11328	nh hoAw nh hovnw jq kq EhI smwih ] (254-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) nah ho-aa nah hovnaa jat kat ohee samaahi. There never was, and there never shall be. He is pervading everywhere.
REQUIRE	para 11329	GUlih qau mn jau Awvih srnw ] (254-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) ghooleh ta-o man ja-o aavahi sarnaa. You shall be absorbed into Him, O mind, if you come to His Sanctuary.
REQUIRE	para 11330	nwm qqu kil mih punhcrnw ] (254-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) naam tat kal meh punharchanaa. In this Dark Age of Kali Yuga, only the Naam, the Name of the Lord, shall be of any real use to you.
RECORD	para 11331	Gwil Gwil Aink pCuqwvih ] (254-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) ghaal ghaal anik pachhutaavahi. So many work and slave continually, but they come to regret and repent in the end.
RECORD	para 11332	ibnu hir Bgiq khw iQiq pwvih ] (254-9, gauVI, mÚ 5) bin har bhagat kahaa thit paavahi. Without devotional worship of the Lord, how can they find stability?
RECORD	para 11333	Goil mhw rsu AMimRqu iqh pIAw ] (254-9, gauVI, mÚ 5) ghol mahaa ras amrit tih pee-aa. They alone taste the supreme essence, and drink in the Ambrosial Nectar,
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v20	nwnk hir guir jw kau dIAw ]20] (254-10, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak har gur jaa ka-o dee-aa. ||20||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v20	O Nanak, unto whom the Lord, the Guru, gives it. ||20||
RECORD	para 11335	sloku ] (254-10) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11336	|ix Gwly sB idvs sws nh bFn Gtn iqlu swr ] (254-10, gauVI, mÚ 5) nyan ghaalay sabh divas saas nah badhan ghatan til saar. He has counted all the days and the breaths, and placed them in people's destiny; they do not increase or decrease one little bit.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	jIvn lorih Brm moh nwnk qyaU gvwr ]1] (254-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) jeevan loreh bharam moh naanak tay-oo gavaar. ||1||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Those who long to live in doubt and emotional attachment, O Nanak, are total fools. ||1||
RECORD	para 11338	pauVI ] (254-11) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 11339	|M|w |RwsY kwlu iqh jo swkq pRiB kIn ] (254-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) nyanyaa nyaraasai kaal tih jo saakat parabh keen. NGANGA: Death seizes those whom God has made into faithless cynics.
DEFINE	para 11340	Aink join jnmih mrih Awqm rwmu n cIn ] (254-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) anik jon janmeh mareh aatam raam na cheen. They are born and they die, enduring countless incarnations; they do not realize the Lord, the Supreme Soul.
UPHOLD	para 11341	i|Awn iDAwn qwhU kau Awey ] (254-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) nyi-aan Dhi-aan taahoo ka-o aa-ay. They alone find spiritual wisdom and meditation,
RECORD	para 11342	kir ikrpw ijh Awip idvwey ] (254-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) kar kirpaa jih aap divaa-ay. whom the Lord blesses with His Mercy;
DEFINE	para 11343	|xqI |xI nhI koaU CUtY ] (254-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) nyantee nyanee nahee ko-oo chhootai. no one is emancipated by counting and calculating.
REQUIRE	para 11344	kwcI gwgir srpr PUtY ] (254-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) kaachee gaagar sarpar footai. The vessel of clay shall surely break.
RECORD	para 11345	so jIvq ijh jIvq jipAw ] (254-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) so jeevat jih jeevat japi-aa. They alone live, who, while alive, meditate on the Lord.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v21	pRgt Bey nwnk nh CipAw ]21] (254-14, gauVI, mÚ 5) pargat bha-ay naanak nah chhapi-aa. ||21||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v21	They are respected, O Nanak, and do not remain hidden. ||21||
RECORD	para 11347	sloku ] (254-14) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11348	iciq icqvau crxwribMd aUD kvl ibgsWq ] (254-14, gauVI, mÚ 5) chit chitva-o charnaarbind ooDh kaval bigsaa Nt. Focus your consciousness on His Lotus Feet, and the inverted lotus of your heart shall blossom forth.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	pRgt Bey Awpih guoibMd nwnk sMq mqWq ]1] (254-15, gauVI, mÚ 5) pargat bha-ay aapeh gobind naanak sant mataaNt. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	The Lord of the Universe Himself becomes manifest, O Nanak, through the Teachings of the Saints. ||1||
RECORD	para 11350	pauVI ] (254-15) pa-orhee. Pauree:
WHEN	para 11351	ccw crn kml gur lwgw ] Din Din auAw idn sMjog sBwgw ] (254-15, gauVI, mÚ 5) chachaa charan kamal gur laagaa. Dhan Dhan u-aa din sanjog sabhaagaa. CHACHA: Blessed, blessed is that day, when I became attached to the Lord's Lotus Feet.
RECORD	para 11352	cwir kuMt dh idis BRim AwieE ] (254-16, gauVI, mÚ 5) chaar kunt dah dis bharam aa-i-o. After wandering around in the four quarters and the ten directions,
UPHOLD	para 11353	BeI ik®pw qb drsnu pwieE ] (254-16, gauVI, mÚ 5) bha-ee kirpaa tab darsan paa-i-o. God showed His Mercy to me, and then I obtained the Blessed Vision of His Darshan.
DEFINE	para 11354	cwr ibcwr ibnisE sB dUAw ] (254-16, gauVI, mÚ 5) chaar bichaar binsi-o sabh doo-aa. By pure lifestyle and meditation, all duality is removed.
RECORD	para 11355	swDsMig mnu inrml hUAw ] (254-17, gauVI, mÚ 5) saaDhsang man nirmal hoo-aa. In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, the mind becomes immaculate.
DEFINE	para 11356	icMq ibswrI eyk idRstyqw ] (254-17, gauVI, mÚ 5) chint bisaaree ayk daristaytaa. Anxieties are forgotten, and the One Lord alone is seen,
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v22	nwnk igAwn AMjnu ijh nyqRw ]22] (254-17, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak gi-aan anjan jih naytaraa. ||22||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v22	O Nanak, by those whose eyes are anointed with the ointment of spiritual wisdom. ||22||
RECORD	para 11358	sloku ] (254-18) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11359	CwqI sIql mnu suKI CMq goibd gun gwie ] (254-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) chhaatee seetal man sukhee chhant gobid gun gaa-ay. The heart is cooled and soothed, and the mind is at peace, chanting and singing the Glorious Praises of the Lord of the Universe.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	AYsI ikrpw krhu pRB nwnk dws dswie ]1] (254-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) aisee kirpaa karahu parabh naanak daas dasaa-ay. ||1||
ALLOW	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Show such Mercy, O God, that Nanak may become the slave of Your slaves. ||1||
RECORD	para 11361	pauVI ] (254-19) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 11362	CCw Cohry dws qumwry ] (254-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) chhachhaa chhohray daas tumaaray. CHHACHHA: I am Your child-slave.
RECORD	para 11363	dws dwsn ky pwnIhwry ] (254-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) daas daasan kay paaneehaaray. I am the water-carrier of the slave of Your slaves.
RECORD	para 11364	CCw Cwru hoq qyry sMqw ] (254-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) chhachhaa chhaar hot tayray santaa. Chhachha: I long to become the dust under the feet of Your Saints.
