WHEN	para 11367	Cwif isAwnp bhu cqurweI ] (255-1, gauVI, mÚ 5) chhaad si-aanap baho chaturaa-ee. I have given up my excessive cleverness and scheming,
RECORD	para 11368	sMqn kI mn tyk itkweI ] (255-1, gauVI, mÚ 5) santan kee man tayk tikaa-ee. and I have taken the support of the Saints as my mind's support.
RECORD	para 11369	Cwru kI puqrI prm giq pweI ] (255-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) chhaar kee putree param gat paa-ee. Even a puppet of ashes attains the supreme status,
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v23	nwnk jw kau sMq shweI ]23] (255-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak jaa ka-o sant sahaa-ee. ||23||
WHEN	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v23	O Nanak, if it has the help and support of the Saints. ||23||
RECORD	para 11371	sloku ] (255-2) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11372	jor julm PUlih Gno kwcI dyh ibkwr ] (255-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) jor julam fooleh ghano kaachee dayh bikaar. Practicing oppression and tyranny, he puffs himself up; he acts in corruption with his frail, perishable body.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	AhMbuiD bMDn pry nwnk nwm Cutwr ]1] (255-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) aha N-buDh banDhan paray naanak naam chhutaar. ||1||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	He is bound by his egotistical intellect; O Nanak, salvation comes only through the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 11374	pauVI ] (255-3) pa-orhee. Pauree:
WHEN	para 11375	jjw jwnY hau kCu hUAw ] (255-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) jajaa jaanai ha-o kachh hoo-aa. JAJJA: When someone, in his ego, believes that he has become something,
DEFINE	para 11376	bwiDE ijau nilnI BRim sUAw ] (255-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) baaDhi-o ji-o nalinee bharam soo-aa. he is caught in his error, like a parrot in a trap.
DEFINE	para 11377	jau jwnY hau Bgqu igAwnI ] (255-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) ja-o jaanai ha-o bhagat gi-aanee. When he believes, in his ego, that he is a devotee and a spiritual teacher,
