WHEN	para 11379	jau jwnY mY kQnI krqw ] (255-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) ja-o jaanai mai kathnee kartaa. When he believes himself to be a preacher,
DEFINE	para 11380	ibAwpwrI bsuDw ijau iPrqw ] (255-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) bi-aapaaree basuDhaa ji-o firtaa. he is merely a peddler wandering over the earth.
RECORD	para 11381	swDsMig ijh haumY mwrI ] (255-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) saaDhsang jih ha-umai maaree. But one who conquers his ego in the Company of the Holy,
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v24	nwnk qw kau imly murwrI ]24] (255-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak taa ka-o milay muraaree. ||24||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v24	O Nanak, meets the Lord. ||24||
RECORD	para 11383	sloku ] (255-6) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11384	JwlwGy auiT nwmu jip inis bwsur AwrwiD ] (255-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) jhaalaaghay uth naam jap nis baasur aaraaDh. Rise early in the morning, and chant the Naam; worship and adore the Lord, night and day.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	kwrHw quJY n ibAwpeI nwnk imtY aupwiD ]1] (255-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) kaar Haa tujhai na bi-aapa-ee naanak mitai upaaDh. ||1||
FORBID	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Anxiety shall not afflict you, O Nanak, and your misfortune shall vanish. ||1||
RECORD	para 11386	pauVI ] (255-7) pa-orhee. Pauree:
REQUIRE	para 11387	JJw JUrnu imtY qumwro ] (255-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) jhajhaa jhooran mitai tumaaro. JHAJHA: Your sorrows shall depart,
WHEN	para 11388	rwm nwm isau kir ibauhwro ] (255-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) raam naam si-o kar bi-uhaaro. when you deal with the Lord's Name.
RECORD	para 11389	JUrq JUrq swkq mUAw ] (255-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) jhoorat jhoorat saakat moo-aa. The faithless cynic dies in sorrow and pain;
DEFINE	para 11390	jw kY irdY hoq Bwau bIAw ] (255-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaa kai ridai hot bhaa-o bee-aa. his heart is filled with the love of duality.
REQUIRE	para 11391	Jrih ksMml pwp qyry mnUAw ] (255-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) jhareh kasamal paap tayray manoo-aa. Your evil deeds and sins shall fall away, O my mind,
RECORD	para 11392	AMimRq kQw sMqsMig sunUAw ] (255-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) amrit kathaa satsang sunoo-aa. listening to the ambrosial speech in the Society of the Saints.
RECORD	para 11393	Jrih kwm k®oD dRüstweI ] (255-9, gauVI, mÚ 5) jhareh kaam kroDh darustaa-ee. Sexual desire, anger and wickedness fall away,
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v25	nwnk jw kau ik®pw gusweI ]25] (255-9, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak jaa ka-o kirpaa gusaa-ee. ||25||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v25	O Nanak, from those who are blessed by the Mercy of the Lord of the World. ||25||
RECORD	para 11395	sloku ] (255-9) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11396	\qn krhu qum Aink ibiD rhnu n pwvhu mIq ] (255-9, gauVI, mÚ 5) njatan karahu tum anik biDh rahan na paavhu meet. You can try all sorts of things, but you still cannot remain here, my friend.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	jIvq rhhu hir hir Bjhu nwnk nwm prIiq ]1] (255-10, gauVI, mÚ 5) jeevat rahhu har har bhajahu naanak naam pareet. ||1||
REQUIRE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	But you shall live forevermore, O Nanak, if you vibrate and love the Naam, the Name of the Lord, Har, Har. ||1||
RECORD	para 11398	pvVI ] (255-10) pavrhee. Pauree:
REQUIRE	para 11399	\M\w \wxhu idRVu shI ibnis jwq eyh hyq ] (255-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) njanjaa njaanaho darirh sahee binas jaat ayh hayt. NYANYA: Know this as absolutely correct, that that this ordinary love shall come to an end.
ALLOW	para 11400	gxqI gxau n gix skau aUiT isDwry kyq ] (255-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) gantee gana-o na gan saka-o ooth siDhaaray kayt. You may count and calculate as much as you want, but you cannot count how many have arisen and departed.
REQUIRE	para 11401	\o pyKau so ibnsqau kw isau krIAY sMgu ] (255-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) njo paykha-o so binasta-o kaa si-o karee-ai sang. Whoever I see shall perish. With whom should I associate?
DEFINE	para 11402	\wxhu ieAw ibiD shI icq JUTau mwieAw rMgu ] (255-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) njaanaho i-aa biDh sahee chit jhooth-o maa-i-aa rang. Know this as true in your consciousness, that the love of Maya is false.
DEFINE	para 11403	\wxq soeI sMqu suie BRm qy kIicq iBMn ] (255-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) njanat so-ee sant su-ay bharam tay keechit bhinn. He alone knows, and he alone is a Saint, who is free of doubt.
DEFINE	para 11404	AMD kUp qy iqh kFhu ijh hovhu supRsMn ] (255-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) anDh koop tay tih kadhahu jih hovhu suparsan. He is lifted up and out of the deep dark pit; the Lord is totally pleased with him.
DEFINE	para 11405	\w kY hwiQ smrQ qy kwrn krnY jog ] (255-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) njaa kai haath samrath tay kaaran karnai jog. God's Hand is All-powerful; He is the Creator, the Cause of causes.
