ALLOW	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, may I never forget from my mind, the Treasure of Virtue, the Sovereign Lord of the Universe. ||1||
RECORD	para 11410	pauVI ] (255-15) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 11411	thl krhu qau eyk kI jw qy ibRQw n koie ] (255-15, gauVI, mÚ 5) tahal karahu ta-o ayk kee jaa tay baritha na ko-ay. Work for the One Lord; no one returns empty-handed from Him.
REQUIRE	para 11412	min qin muiK hIAY bsY jo cwhhu so hoie ] (255-16, gauVI, mÚ 5) man tan mukh hee-ai basai jo chaahhu so ho-ay. When the Lord abides within your mind, body, mouth and heart, then whatever you desire shall come to pass.
RECORD	para 11413	thl mhl qw kau imlY jw kau swD ik®pwl ] (255-16, gauVI, mÚ 5) tahal mahal taa ka-o milai jaa ka-o saaDh kirpaal. He alone obtains the Lord's service, and the Mansion of His Presence, unto whom the Holy Saint is compassionate.
WHEN	para 11414	swDU sMgiq qau bsY jau Awpn hoih dieAwl ] (255-17, gauVI, mÚ 5) saaDhoo sangat ta-o basai ja-o aapan hohi da-i-aal. He joins the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, only when the Lord Himself shows His Mercy.
RECORD	para 11415	tohy twhy bhu Bvn ibnu nwvY suKu nwih ] (255-17, gauVI, mÚ 5) tohay taahay baho bhavan bin naavai sukh naahi. I have searched and searched, across so many worlds, but without the Name, there is no peace.
RECORD	para 11416	tlih jwm ky dUq iqh ju swDU sMig smwih ] (255-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) taleh jaam kay doot tih jo saaDhoo sang samaahi. The Messenger of Death retreats from those who dwell in the Saadh Sangat.
RECORD	para 11417	bwir bwir jwau sMq sdky ] (255-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) baar baar jaa-o sant sadkay. Again and again, I am forever devoted to the Saints.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v27	nwnk pwp ibnwsy kid ky ]27] (255-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak paap binaasay kad kay. ||27||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v27	O Nanak, my sins from so long ago have been erased. ||27||
RECORD	para 11419	sloku ] (255-19) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 11420	Twk n hoqI iqnhu dir ijh hovhu supRsMn ] (255-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) thaak na hotee tinhu dar jih hovhu suparsan. Those beings, with whom the Lord is thoroughly pleased, meet with no obstacles at His Door.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	jo jn pRiB Apuny kry nwnk qy Din DMin ]1] (255-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) jo jan parabh apunay karay naanak tay Dhan Dhan. ||1||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Those humble beings whom God has made His own, O Nanak, are blessed, so very blessed. ||1||
RECORD	para 11423	pauVI ] (256-1) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 11424	TTw mnUAw Twhih nwhI ] jo sgl iqAwig eykih lptwhI ] (256-1, gauVI, mÚ 5) thathaa manoo-aa thaaheh naahee. jo sagal ti-aag aykeh laptaahee. T'HAT'HA: Those who have abandoned all else, and who cling to the One Lord alone, do not make trouble for anyone's mind.
DEFINE	para 11425	Thik Thik mwieAw sMig mUey ] (256-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) thahak thahak maa-i-aa sang moo-ay. Those who are totally absorbed and preoccupied with Maya are dead;
RECORD	para 11426	auAw kY kusl n kqhU hUey ] (256-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) u-aa kai kusal na kathoo hoo-ay. they do not find happiness anywhere.
WHEN	para 11427	TWiF prI sMqh sMig bisAw ] (256-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) thaaNdh paree santeh sang basi-aa. One who dwells in the Society of the Saints finds a great peace;
RECORD	para 11428	AMimRq nwmu qhw jIA risAw ] (256-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) amrit naam tahaa jee-a rasi-aa. the Ambrosial Nectar of the Naam becomes sweet to his soul.
DEFINE	para 11429	Twkur Apuny jo jnu BwieAw ] (256-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) thaakur apunay jo jan bhaa-i-aa. That humble being, who is pleasing to his Lord and Master
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v28	nwnk auAw kw mnu sIqlwieAw ]28] (256-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak u-aa kaa man seetlaa-i-aa. ||28||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v28	- O Nanak, his mind is cooled and soothed. ||28||
RECORD	para 11431	sloku ] (256-4) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11432	fMfauiq bMdn Aink bwr srb klw smrQ ] (256-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) dand-ut bandan anik baar sarab kalaa samrath. I bow down, and fall to the ground in humble adoration, countless times, to the All- powerful Lord, who possesses all powers.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	foln qy rwKhu pRBU nwnk dy kir hQ ]1] (256-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) dolan tay raakho parabhoo naanak day kar hath. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Please protect me, and save me from wandering, God. Reach out and give Nanak Your Hand. ||1||
RECORD	para 11434	pauVI ] (256-5) pa-orhee. Pauree:
REQUIRE	para 11435	ffw fyrw iehu nhI jh fyrw qh jwnu ] (256-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) dadaa dayraa ih nahee jah dayraa tah jaan. DADDA: This is not your true place; you must know where that place really is.
REQUIRE	para 11436	auAw fyrw kw sMjmo gur kY sbid pCwnu ] (256-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) u-aa dayraa kaa sanjamo gur kai sabad pachhaan. You shall come to realize the way to that place, through the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
DEFINE	para 11437	ieAw fyrw kau sRmu kir GwlY ] (256-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) i-aa dayraa ka-o saram kar ghaalai. This place, here, is established by hard work,
REQUIRE	para 11438	jw kw qsU nhI sMig cwlY ] (256-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaa kaa tasoo nahee sang chaalai. but not one iota of this shall go there with you.
DEFINE	para 11439	auAw fyrw kI so imiq jwnY ] (256-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) u-aa dayraa kee so mit jaanai. The value of that place beyond is known only to those,
RECORD	para 11440	jw kau idRsit pUrn BgvwnY ] (256-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) jaa ka-o darisat pooran bhagvaanai. upon whom the Perfect Lord God casts His Glance of Grace.
DEFINE	para 11441	fyrw inhclu scu swDsMg pwieAw ] (256-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) dayraa nihchal sach saaDhsang paa-i-aa. That permanent and true place is obtained in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy;
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v29	nwnk qy jn nh folwieAw ]29] (256-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak tay jan nah dolaa-i-aa. ||29||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v29	O Nanak, those humble beings do not waver or wander. ||29||
RECORD	para 11443	sloku ] (256-8) salok. Shalok:
