RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	nwnk aubry jip hrI swDsMig snbMD ]1] (256-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak ubray jap haree saaDhsang san-banDh. ||1||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, those who join the Saadh Sangat and meditate on the Lord are saved. ||1||
RECORD	para 11446	pauVI ] (256-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 11447	FFw FUFq kh iPrhu FUFnu ieAw mn mwih ] (256-9, gauVI, mÚ 5) dhadhaa dhoodhat kah firahu dhoodhan i-aa man maahi. DHADHA: Where are you going, wandering and searching? Search instead within your own mind.
DEFINE	para 11448	sMig quhwrY pRBu bsY bnu bnu khw iPrwih ] (256-9, gauVI, mÚ 5) sang tuhaarai parabh basai ban ban kahaa firaahi. God is with you, so why do you wander around from forest to forest?
RECORD	para 11449	FyrI Fwhhu swDsMig AhMbuiD ibkrwl ] (256-10, gauVI, mÚ 5) dhayree Dhahhu saaDhsang aha N-buDh bikraal. In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, tear down the mound of your frightful, egotistical pride.
REQUIRE	para 11450	suKu pwvhu shjy bshu drsnu dyiK inhwl ] (256-10, gauVI, mÚ 5) sukh paavhu sehjay bashu darsan daykh nihaal. You shall find peace, and abide in intuitive bliss; gazing upon the Blessed Vision of God's Darshan, you shall be delighted.
RECORD	para 11451	FyrI jwmY jim mrY grB join duK pwie ] (256-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) dhayree jaamai jam marai garabh jon dukh paa-ay. One who has such a mound as this, dies and suffers the pain of reincarnation through the womb.
REQUIRE	para 11452	moh mgn lptq rhY hau hau AwvY jwie ] (256-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) moh magan laptat rahai ha-o ha-o aavai jaa-ay. One who is intoxicated by emotional attachment, entangled in egotism, selfishness and conceit, shall continue coming and going in reincarnation.
RECORD	para 11453	Fhq Fhq Ab Fih pry swD jnw srnwie ] (256-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) dhahat dhahat ab dheh paray saaDh janaa sarnaa-ay. Slowly and steadily, I have now surrendered to the Holy Saints; I have come to their Sanctuary.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v30	duK ky Pwhy kwitAw nwnk lIey smwie ]30] (256-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) dukh kay faahay kaati-aa naanak lee-ay samaa-ay. ||30||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v30	God has cut away the noose of my pain; O Nanak, He has merged me into Himself. ||30||
RECORD	para 11455	sloku ] (256-13) salok. Shalok:
