DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v31	Understanding the Hukam of the Lord's Command, he attains everlasting peace. O Nanak, such is his pre-ordained destiny. ||31||
RECORD	para 11467	sloku ] (256-18) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11468	qnu mnu Dnu Arpau iqsY pRBU imlwvY moih ] (256-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) tan man Dhan arpa-o tisai parabhoo milaavai mohi. I offer my body, mind and wealth to anyone who can unite me with God.
