RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, my doubts and fears have been dispelled, and the Messenger of Death does not see me any longer. ||1||
RECORD	para 11470	pauVI ] (256-19) pa-orhee. Pauree:
