REQUIRE	para 11476	qwhU sMig n Dnu clY igRh jobn nh rwj ] (257-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) taahoo sang na Dhan chalai garih joban nah raaj. Neither wealth, nor household, nor youth, nor power shall go along with you.
REQUIRE	para 11477	sMqsMig ismrq rhhu iehY quhwrY kwj ] (257-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) satsang simrat rahhu ihai tuhaarai kaaj. In the Society of the Saints, meditate in remembrance on the Lord. This alone shall be of use to you.
WHEN	para 11478	qwqw kCU n hoeI hY jau qwp invwrY Awp ] (257-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) taataa kachhoo na ho-ee hai ja-o taap nivaarai aap. There will be no burning at all, when He Himself takes away your fever.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v32	pRiqpwlY nwnk hmih Awpih mweI bwp ]32] (257-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) paratipaalai naanak hameh aapeh maa-ee baap. ||32||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v32	O Nanak, the Lord Himself cherishes us; He is our Mother and Father. ||32||
RECORD	para 11480	sloku ] (257-4) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 11481	Qwky bhu ibiD Gwlqy iqRpiq n iqRsnw lwQ ] (257-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) thaakay baho biDh ghaaltay taripat na tarisnaa laath. They have grown weary, struggling in all sorts of ways; but they are not satisfied, and their thirst is not quenched.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	sMic sMic swkq mUey nwnk mwieAw n swQ ]1] (257-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) sanch sanch saakat moo-ay naanak maa-i-aa na saath. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Gathering in and hoarding what they can, the faithless cynics die, O Nanak, but the wealth of Maya does not go with them in the end. ||1||
RECORD	para 11483	pauVI ] (257-5) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 11484	QQw iQru koaU nhI kwie pswrhu pwv ] (257-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) thathaa thir ko-oo nahee kaa-ay pasaarahu paav. T'HAT'HA: Nothing is permanent - why do you stretch out your feet?
RECORD	para 11485	Aink bMc bl Cl krhu mwieAw eyk aupwv ] (257-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) anik banch bal chhal karahu maa-i-aa ayk upaav. You commit so many fraudulent and deceitful actions as you chase after Maya.
RECORD	para 11486	QYlI sMchu sRmu krhu Qwik prhu gwvwr ] (257-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) thailee sanchahu saram karahu thaak parahu gaavaar. You work to fill up your bag, you fool, and then you fall down exhausted.
REQUIRE	para 11487	mn kY kwim n AwveI AMqy Aausr bwr ] (257-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) man kai kaam na aavee antay a-osar baar. But this shall be of no use to you at all at that very last instant.
REQUIRE	para 11488	iQiq pwvhu goibd Bjhu sMqh kI isK lyhu ] (257-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) thit paavhu gobid bhajahu santeh kee sikh layho. You shall find stability only by vibrating upon the Lord of the Universe, and accepting the Teachings of the Saints.
DEFINE	para 11489	pRIiq krhu sd eyk isau ieAw swcw Asnyhu ] (257-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) pareet karahu sad ayk si-o i-aa saachaa asnayhu. Embrace love for the One Lord forever - this is true love!
DEFINE	para 11490	kwrn krn krwvno sB ibiD eykY hwQ ] (257-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) kaaran karan karaavano sabh biDh aykai haath. He is the Doer, the Cause of causes. All ways and means are in His Hands alone.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v33	ijqu ijqu lwvhu iqqu iqqu lgih nwnk jMq AnwQ ]33] (257-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) jit jit laavhu tit tit lageh naanak jant anaath. ||33||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v33	Whatever You attach me to, to that I am attached; O Nanak, I am just a helpless creature. ||33||
RECORD	para 11492	sloku ] (257-9) salok. Shalok:
