DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	They continue to contemplate Him with each and every breath; O Nanak, the Blessed Vision of His Darshan is their Support. ||1||
RECORD	para 11495	pauVI ] (257-10) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 11496	ddw dwqw eyku hY sB kau dyvnhwr ] (257-10, gauVI, mÚ 5) dadaa daataa ayk hai sabh ka-o dayvanhaar. DADDA: The One Lord is the Great Giver; He is the Giver to all.
DEFINE	para 11497	dyNdy qoit n AwveI Agnq Bry BMfwr ] (257-10, gauVI, mÚ 5) day Nday tot na aavee agnat bharay bhandaar. There is no limit to His Giving. His countless warehouses are filled to overflowing.
DEFINE	para 11498	dYnhwru sd jIvnhwrw ] (257-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) dainhaar sad jeevanhaaraa. The Great Giver is alive forever.
RECORD	para 11499	mn mUrK ikau qwih ibswrw ] (257-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) man moorakh ki-o taahi bisaaraa. O foolish mind, why have you forgotten Him?
DEFINE	para 11500	dosu nhI kwhU kau mIqw ] (257-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) dos nahee kaahoo ka-o meetaa. No one is at fault, my friend.
RECORD	para 11501	mwieAw moh bMDu pRiB kIqw ] (257-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) maa-i-aa moh banDh parabh keetaa. God created the bondage of emotional attachment to Maya.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v34	drd invwrih jw ky Awpy ] nwnk qy qy gurmuiK DRwpy ]34] (257-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) darad nivaareh jaa kay aapay. naanak tay tay gurmukh Dharaapay. ||34||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v34	He Himself removes the pains of the Gurmukh; O Nanak, he is fulfilled. ||34||
