RECORD	para 12076	Cpis nwih kCu krY CpwieAw ] (267-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) chhapas naahi kachh karai chhapaa-i-aa. They cannot conceal this, no matter how hard they try.
RECORD	para 12077	bwhir igAwn iDAwn iesnwn ] (267-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) baahar gi-aan Dhi-aan isnaan. Outwardly, they display knowledge, meditation and purification,
RECORD	para 12078	AMqir ibAwpY loBu suAwnu ] (267-13, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) antar bi-aapai lobh su-aan. but within clings the dog of greed.
RECORD	para 12079	AMqir Agin bwhir qnu suAwh ] (267-13, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) antar agan baahar tan su-aah. The fire of desire rages within; outwardly they apply ashes to their bodies.
DEFINE	para 12080	gil pwQr kYsy qrY AQwh ] (267-13, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gal paathar kaisay tarai athaah. There is a stone around their neck - how can they cross the unfathomable ocean?
RECORD	para 12081	jw kY AMqir bsY pRBu Awip ] (267-13, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jaa kai antar basai parabh aap. Those, within whom God Himself abides
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v5	nwnk qy jn shij smwiq ]5] (267-14, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak tay jan sahj samaat. ||5||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v5	- O Nanak, those humble beings are intuitively absorbed in the Lord. ||5||
RECORD	para 12083	suin AMDw kYsy mwrgu pwvY ] (267-14, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sun anDhaa kaisay maarag paavai. By listening, how can the blind find the path?
RECORD	para 12084	kru gih lyhu EiV inbhwvY ] (267-14, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kar geh layho orh nibhaavai. Take hold of his hand, and then he can reach his destination.
