RECORD	para 12089	kh ipMgul prbq pr Bvn ] (267-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kah pingul parbat par bhavan. How can the cripple climb up the mountain?
RECORD	para 12090	nhI hoq aUhw ausu gvn ] (267-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) nahee hot oohaa us gavan. He simply cannot go there.
RECORD	para 12091	krqwr kruxw mY dInu bynqI krY ] (267-17, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kartaar karunaa mai deen bayntee karai. O Creator, Lord of Mercy - Your humble servant prays;
