RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v6	Nanak: by Your Grace, please save me. ||6||
DEFINE	para 12093	sMig shweI su AwvY n cIiq ] (267-17, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sang sahaa-ee so aavai na cheet. The Lord, our Help and Support, is always with us, but the mortal does not remember Him.
RECORD	para 12094	jo bYrweI qw isau pRIiq ] (267-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jo bairaa-ee taa si-o pareet. He shows love to his enemies.
RECORD	para 12095	blUAw ky igRh BIqir bsY ] (267-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) baloo-aa kay garih bheetar basai. He lives in a castle of sand.
RECORD	para 12096	And kyl mwieAw rMig rsY ] (267-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) anad kayl maa-i-aa rang rasai. He enjoys the games of pleasure and the tastes of Maya.
DEFINE	para 12097	idRVu kir mwnY mnih pRqIiq ] (267-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) darirh kar maanai maneh parteet. He believes them to be permanent - this is the belief of his mind.
RECORD	para 12098	kwlu n AwvY mUVy cIiq ] (267-19, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kaal na aavai moorhay cheet. Death does not even come to mind for the fool.
RECORD	para 12099	bYr ibroD kwm k®oD moh ] (267-19, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) bair biroDh kaam kroDh moh. Hate, conflict, sexual desire, anger, emotional attachment,
RECORD	para 12100	JUT ibkwr mhw loB DRoh ] (267-19, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jhooth bikaar mahaa lobh Dharoh. falsehood, corruption, immense greed and deceit:
DEFINE	para 12102	ieAwhU jugiq ibhwny keI jnm ] (268-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) i-aahoo jugat bihaanay ka-ee janam. So many lifetimes are wasted in these ways.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v7	nwnk rwiK lyhu Awpn kir krm ]7] (268-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak raakh layho aapan kar karam. ||7||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v7	Nanak: uplift them, and redeem them, O Lord - show Your Mercy! ||7||
DEFINE	para 12104	qU Twkuru qum pih Ardwis ] (268-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) too thaakur tum peh ardaas. You are our Lord and Master; to You, I offer this prayer.
DEFINE	para 12105	jIau ipMfu sBu qyrI rwis ] (268-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jee-o pind sabh tayree raas. This body and soul are all Your property.
DEFINE	para 12106	qum mwq ipqw hm bwirk qyry ] (268-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tum maat pitaa ham baarik tayray. You are our mother and father; we are Your children.
DEFINE	para 12107	qumrI ik®pw mih sUK Gnyry ] (268-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tumree kirpaa meh sookh ghanayray. In Your Grace, there are so many joys!
RECORD	para 12108	koie n jwnY qumrw AMqu ] (268-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ko-ay na jaanai tumraa ant. No one knows Your limits.
RECORD	para 12109	aUcy qy aUcw BgvMq ] (268-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) oochay tay oochaa bhagvant. O Highest of the High, Most Generous God,
DEFINE	para 12110	sgl smgRI qumrY sUiqR DwrI ] (268-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sagal samagree tumrai sutir Dhaaree. the whole creation is strung on Your thread.
DEFINE	para 12111	qum qy hoie su AwigAwkwrI ] (268-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tum tay ho-ay so aagi-aakaaree. That which has come from You is under Your Command.
RECORD	para 12112	qumrI giq imiq qum hI jwnI ] (268-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tumree gat mit tum hee jaanee. You alone know Your state and extent.
