RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	nwnk khU n sIJeI ibnu nwvY piq jwie ]1] (268-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak kahoo na seejh-ee bin naavai pat jaa-ay. ||1||
REQUIRE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	- O Nanak, he shall never succeed. Without the Name, he shall lose his honor. ||1||
RECORD	para 12117	AstpdI ] (268-6) asatpadee. Ashtapadee:
RECORD	para 12118	ds bsqU ly pwCY pwvY ] (268-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) das bastoo lay paachhai paavai. He obtains ten things, and puts them behind him;
RECORD	para 12119	eyk bsqu kwrin ibKoit gvwvY ] (268-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ayk basat kaaran bikhot gavaavai. for the sake of one thing withheld, he forfeits his faith.
WHEN	para 12120	eyk BI n dyie ds BI ihir lyie ] (268-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ayk bhee na day-ay das bhee hir lay-ay. But what if that one thing were not given, and the ten were taken away?
RECORD	para 12121	qau mUVw khu khw kryie ] (268-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ta-o moorhaa kaho kahaa karay-i. Then, what could the fool say or do?
RECORD	para 12122	ijsu Twkur isau nwhI cwrw ] (268-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jis thaakur si-o naahee chaaraa. Our Lord and Master cannot be moved by force.
RECORD	para 12123	qw kau kIjY sd nmskwrw ] (268-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) taa ka-o keejai sad namaskaaraa. Unto Him, bow forever in adoration.
RECORD	para 12124	jw kY min lwgw pRBu mITw ] (268-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jaa kai man laagaa parabh meethaa. That one, unto whose mind God seems sweet
RECORD	para 12125	srb sUK qwhU min vUTw ] (268-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sarab sookh taahoo man voothaa. - all pleasures come to abide in his mind.
RECORD	para 12126	ijsu jn Apnw hukmu mnwieAw ] (268-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jis jan apnaa hukam manaa-i-aa. One who abides by the Lord's Will,
