RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v3	O Nanak, the Lord, in His Mercy, unites us with Himself. ||3||
DEFINE	para 12147	imiQAw qnu Dnu kutMbu sbwieAw ] (268-15, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa tan Dhan kutamb sabaa-i-aa. False are body, wealth, and all relations.
DEFINE	para 12148	imiQAw haumY mmqw mwieAw ] (268-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa ha-umai mamtaa maa-i-aa. False are ego, possessiveness and Maya.
DEFINE	para 12149	imiQAw rwj jobn Dn mwl ] (268-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa raaj joban Dhan maal. False are power, youth, wealth and property.
DEFINE	para 12150	imiQAw kwm k®oD ibkrwl ] (268-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa kaam kroDh bikraal. False are sexual desire and wild anger.
DEFINE	para 12151	imiQAw rQ hsqI AsÍ bsqRw ] (268-17, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa rath hastee asav bastaraa. False are chariots, elephants, horses and expensive clothes.
DEFINE	para 12152	imiQAw rMg sMig mwieAw pyiK hsqw ] (268-17, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa rang sang maa-i-aa paykh hastaa. False is the love of gathering wealth, and reveling in the sight of it.
DEFINE	para 12153	imiQAw DRoh moh AiBmwnu ] (268-17, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa Dharoh moh abhimaan. False are deception, emotional attachment and egotistical pride.
DEFINE	para 12154	imiQAw Awps aUpir krq gumwnu ] (268-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa aapas oopar karat gumaan. False are pride and self-conceit.
DEFINE	para 12155	AsiQru Bgiq swD kI srn ] (268-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) asthir bhagat saaDh kee saran. Only devotional worship is permanent, and the Sanctuary of the Holy.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v4	nwnk jip jip jIvY hir ky crn ]4] (268-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak jap jap jeevai har kay charan. ||4||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v4	Nanak lives by meditating, meditating on the Lotus Feet of the Lord. ||4||
DEFINE	para 12157	imiQAw sRvn pr inMdw sunih ] (268-19, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa sarvan par nindaa suneh. False are the ears which listen to the slander of others.
DEFINE	para 12158	imiQAw hsq pr drb kau ihrih ] (268-19, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa hasat par darab ka-o hireh. False are the hands which steal the wealth of others.
DEFINE	para 12160	imiQAw nyqR pyKq pr iqRA rUpwd ] (269-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa naytar paykhat par tari-a roopaad. False are the eyes which gaze upon the beauty of another's wife.
DEFINE	para 12161	imiQAw rsnw Bojn An sÍwd ] (269-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa rasnaa bhojan an savaad. False is the tongue which enjoys delicacies and external tastes.
DEFINE	para 12162	imiQAw crn pr ibkwr kau Dwvih ] (269-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa charan par bikaar ka-o Dhaaveh. False are the feet which run to do evil to others.
DEFINE	para 12163	imiQAw mn pr loB luBwvih ] (269-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa man par lobh lubhaaveh. False is the mind which covets the wealth of others.
DEFINE	para 12164	imiQAw qn nhI praupkwrw ] (269-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa tan nahee par-upkaaraa. False is the body which does not do good to others.
DEFINE	para 12165	imiQAw bwsu lyq ibkwrw ] (269-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mithi-aa baas layt bikaaraa. False is the nose which inhales corruption.
DEFINE	para 12166	ibnu bUJy imiQAw sB Bey ] (269-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) bin boojhay mithi-aa sabh bha-ay. Without understanding, everything is false.
