DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v5	Fruitful is the body, O Nanak, which takes to the Lord's Name. ||5||
DEFINE	para 12168	ibrQI swkq kI Awrjw ] (269-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) birthee saakat kee aarjaa. The life of the faithless cynic is totally useless.
RECORD	para 12169	swc ibnw kh hovq sUcw ] (269-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) saach binaa kah hovat soochaa. Without the Truth, how can anyone be pure?
DEFINE	para 12170	ibrQw nwm ibnw qnu AMD ] (269-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) birthaa naam binaa tan anDh. Useless is the body of the spiritually blind, without the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	para 12171	muiK Awvq qw kY durgMD ] (269-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) mukh aavat taa kai durganDh. From his mouth, a foul smell issues forth.
