RECORD	para 12173	myG ibnw ijau KyqI jwie ] (269-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) maygh binaa ji-o khaytee jaa-ay. like the crop which withers without rain.
DEFINE	para 12174	goibd Bjn ibnu ibRQy sB kwm ] (269-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gobid bhajan bin barithay sabh kaam. Without meditation on the Lord of the Universe, all works are in vain,
RECORD	para 12175	ijau ikrpn ky inrwrQ dwm ] (269-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ji-o kirpan kay niraarath daam. like the wealth of a miser, which lies useless.
DEFINE	para 12176	DMin DMin qy jn ijh Git bisE hir nwau ] (269-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) Dhan Dhan tay jan jih ghat basi-o har naa-o. Blessed, blessed are those, whose hearts are filled with the Name of the Lord.
