DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v6	Nanak is a sacrifice, a sacrifice to them. ||6||
RECORD	para 12178	rhq Avr kCu Avr kmwvq ] (269-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) rahat avar kachh avar kamaavat. He says one thing, and does something else.
DEFINE	para 12179	min nhI pRIiq muKhu gMF lwvq ] (269-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) man nahee pareet mukhahu gandh laavat. There is no love in his heart, and yet with his mouth he talks tall.
