DEFINE	para 12181	bwhir ByK n kwhU BIn ] (269-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) baahar bhaykh na kaahoo bheen. He is not impressed by outward display.
RECORD	para 12182	Avr aupdysY Awip n krY ] (269-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) avar updaysai aap na karai. One who does not practice what he preaches to others,
