DEFINE	para 12184	ijs kY AMqir bsY inrMkwru ] (269-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jis kai antar basai nirankaar. One whose inner being is filled with the Formless Lord
DEFINE	para 12185	iqs kI sIK qrY sMswru ] (269-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tis kee seekh tarai sansaar. - by his teachings, the world is saved.
DEFINE	para 12186	jo qum Bwny iqn pRBu jwqw ] (269-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jo tum bhaanay tin parabh jaataa. Those who are pleasing to You, God, know You.
