RECORD	para 12188	krau bynqI pwrbRhmu sBu jwnY ] (269-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kara-o bayntee paarbarahm sabh jaanai. Offer your prayers to the Supreme Lord God, who knows everything.
RECORD	para 12189	Apnw kIAw Awpih mwnY ] (269-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) apnaa kee-aa aapeh maanai. He Himself values His own creatures.
