DEFINE	para 12430	bRhm igAwnI ijsu krY pRBu Awip ] (273-11, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) barahm gi-aanee jis karai parabh aap. The God-conscious being is made so by God Himself.
DEFINE	para 12431	bRhm igAwnI kw bf prqwp ] (273-11, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) barahm gi-aanee kaa bad partaap. The God-conscious being is gloriously great.
