RECORD	para 12433	bRhm igAwnI kau bil bil jweIAY ] (273-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) barahm gi-aanee ka-o bal bal jaa-ee-ai. To the God-conscious being, I make my life a sacrifice.
