DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v6	O Nanak, the God-conscious being is Himself the Supreme Lord God. ||6||
RECORD	para 12436	bRhm igAwnI kI kImiq nwih ] (273-13, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) barahm gi-aanee kee keemat naahi. The God-conscious being cannot be appraised.
RECORD	para 12437	bRhm igAwnI kY sgl mn mwih ] (273-13, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) barahm gi-aanee kai sagal man maahi. The God-conscious being has all within his mind.
