DEFINE	para 12473	bYsno so ijsu aUpir supRsMn ] (274-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) baisno so jis oopar suparsan. The true Vaishnaav, the devotee of Vishnu, is the one with whom God is thoroughly pleased.
