DEFINE	para 12763	nh iqRpqwvY Kip Kip mrY ] (279-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) nah tariptaavai khap khap marai. but he is still not satisfied; he indulges again and again, wearing himself out, until he dies.
DEFINE	para 12764	ibnw sMqoK nhI koaU rwjY ] (279-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) binaa santokh nahee ko-oo raajai. Without contentment, no one is satisfied.
DEFINE	para 12765	supn mnorQ ibRQy sB kwjY ] (279-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) supan manorath barithay sabh kaajai. Like the objects in a dream, all his efforts are in vain.
DEFINE	para 12766	nwm rMig srb suKu hoie ] (279-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naam rang sarab sukh ho-ay. Through the love of the Naam, all peace is obtained.
RECORD	para 12767	bfBwgI iksY prwpiq hoie ] (279-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) badbhaagee kisai paraapat ho-ay. Only a few obtain this, by great good fortune.
DEFINE	para 12768	krn krwvn Awpy Awip ] (279-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) karan karaavan aapay aap. He Himself is Himself the Cause of causes.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v5	sdw sdw nwnk hir jwip ]5] (279-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sadaa sadaa naanak har jaap. ||5||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v5	Forever and ever, O Nanak, chant the Lord's Name. ||5||
DEFINE	para 12770	krn krwvn krnYhwru ] (279-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) karan karaavan karnaihaar. The Doer, the Cause of causes, is the Creator Lord.
DEFINE	para 12771	ies kY hwiQ khw bIcwru ] (279-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) is kai haath kahaa beechaar. What deliberations are in the hands of mortal beings?
RECORD	para 12772	jYsI idRsit kry qYsw hoie ] (279-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jaisee darisat karay taisaa ho-ay. As God casts His Glance of Grace, they come to be.
DEFINE	para 12773	Awpy Awip Awip pRBu soie ] (279-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aapay aap aap parabh so-ay. God Himself, of Himself, is unto Himself.
RECORD	para 12774	jo ikCu kIno su ApnY rMig ] (279-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jo kichh keeno so apnai rang. Whatever He created, was by His Own Pleasure.
DEFINE	para 12775	sB qy dUir sBhU kY sMig ] (279-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sabh tay door sabhhoo kai sang. He is far from all, and yet with all.
RECORD	para 12776	bUJY dyKY krY ibbyk ] (279-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) boojhai daykhai karai bibayk. He understands, He sees, and He passes judgment.
DEFINE	para 12777	Awpih eyk Awpih Anyk ] (279-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aapeh ayk aapeh anayk. He Himself is the One, and He Himself is the many.
RECORD	para 12778	mrY n ibnsY AwvY n jwie ] (279-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) marai na binsai aavai na jaa-ay. He does not die or perish; He does not come or go.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v6	nwnk sd hI rihAw smwie ]6] (279-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak sad hee rahi-aa samaa-ay. ||6||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v6	O Nanak, He remains forever All-pervading. ||6||
RECORD	para 12780	Awip aupdysY smJY Awip ] (279-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aap updaysai samjhai aap. He Himself instructs, and He Himself learns.
RECORD	para 12781	Awpy ricAw sB kY swiQ ] (279-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aapay rachi-aa sabh kai saath. He Himself mingles with all.
RECORD	para 12782	Awip kIno Awpn ibsQwru ] (279-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aap keeno aapan bisthaar. He Himself created His own expanse.
DEFINE	para 12783	sBu kCu aus kw Ehu krnYhwru ] (279-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sabh kachh us kaa oh karnaihaar. All things are His; He is the Creator.
RECORD	para 12784	aus qy iBMn khhu ikCu hoie ] (279-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) us tay bhinn kahhu kichh ho-ay. Without Him, what could be done?
DEFINE	para 12785	Qwn Qnµqir eykY soie ] (279-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) thaan thanantar aykai so-ay. In the spaces and interspaces, He is the One.
DEFINE	para 12786	Apuny cilq Awip krxYhwr ] (279-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) apunay chalit aap karnaihaar. In His own play, He Himself is the Actor.
RECORD	para 12787	kauqk krY rMg Awpwr ] (279-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ka-utak karai rang aapaar. He produces His plays with infinite variety.
DEFINE	para 12788	mn mih Awip mn Apuny mwih ] (279-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) man meh aap man apunay maahi. He Himself is in the mind, and the mind is in Him.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v7	nwnk kImiq khnu n jwie ]7] (279-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak keemat kahan na jaa-ay. ||7||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v7	O Nanak, His worth cannot be estimated. ||7||
DEFINE	para 12790	siq siq siq pRBu suAwmI ] (279-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sat sat sat parabh su-aamee. True, True, True is God, our Lord and Master.
RECORD	para 12791	gur prswid iknY viKAwnI ] (279-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gur parsaad kinai vakhi-aanee. By Guru's Grace, some speak of Him.
DEFINE	para 12792	scu scu scu sBu kInw ] (279-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sach sach sach sabh keenaa. True, True, True is the Creator of all.
RECORD	para 12793	koit mDy iknY ibrlY cInw ] (279-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kot maDhay kinai birlai cheenaa. Out of millions, scarcely anyone knows Him.
DEFINE	para 12794	Blw Blw Blw qyrw rUp ] (279-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) bhalaa bhalaa bhalaa tayraa roop. Beautiful, Beautiful, Beautiful is Your Sublime Form.
DEFINE	para 12795	Aiq suMdr Apwr AnUp ] (279-11, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) at sundar apaar anoop. You are Exquisitely Beautiful, Infinite and Incomparable.
DEFINE	para 12796	inrml inrml inrml qyrI bwxI ] (279-11, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) nirmal nirmal nirmal tayree banee. Pure, Pure, Pure is the Word of Your Bani,
RECORD	para 12797	Git Git sunI sRvn bK´wxI ] (279-11, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ghat ghat sunee sarvan bakh-yaanee. heard in each and every heart, spoken to the ears.
RECORD	para 12798	pivqR pivqR pivqR punIq ] (279-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) pavitar pavitar pavitar puneet. Holy, Holy, Holy and Sublimely Pure
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v8	nwmu jpY nwnk min pRIiq ]8]12] (279-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naam japai naanak man pareet. ||8||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v8	12|| - chant the Naam, O Nanak, with heart-felt love. ||8||12||
RECORD	para 12800	sloku ] (279-12) salok. Shalok:
