RECORD	para 12803	AstpdI ] (279-14) asatpadee. Ashtapadee:
DEFINE	para 12804	sMq kY dUKin Awrjw GtY ] (279-14, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sant kai dookhan aarjaa ghatai. Slandering the Saints, one's life is cut short.
