DEFINE	para 12808	sMq kY dUKin miq hoie mlIn ] (279-15, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sant kai dookhan mat ho-ay maleen. Slandering the Saints, the intellect is polluted.
DEFINE	para 12809	sMq kY dUKin soBw qy hIn ] (279-15, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sant kai dookhan sobhaa tay heen. Slandering the Saints, one's reputation is lost.
DEFINE	para 12810	sMq ky hqy kau rKY n koie ] (279-15, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sant kay hatay ka-o rakhai na ko-ay. One who is cursed by a Saint cannot be saved.
DEFINE	para 12811	sMq kY dUKin Qwn BRstu hoie ] (279-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sant kai dookhan thaan bharsat ho-ay. Slandering the Saints, one's place is defiled.
WHEN	para 12812	sMq ik®pwl ik®pw jy krY ] (279-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sant kirpaal kirpaa jay karai. But if the Compassionate Saint shows His Kindness,
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	nwnk sMqsMig inMdku BI qrY ]1] (279-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak satsang nindak bhee tarai. ||1||
