DEFINE	para 12817	sMq kY dUKin iqRgd join ikrmwie ] (279-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sant kai dookhan tarigad jon kirmaa-ay. Slandering the Saints, one is reincarnated as a wiggling worm.
RECORD	para 12818	sMqn kY dUKin iqRsnw mih jlY ] (279-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) santan kai dookhan tarisnaa meh jalai. Slandering the Saints, one burns in the fire of desire.
