DEFINE	para 12863	ikrqu inMdk kw Duir hI pieAw ] (280-13, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kirat nindak kaa Dhur hee pa-i-aa. The fate of the slanderer is pre-ordained from the very beginning of time.
