RECORD	para 12889	AstpdI ] (281-3) asatpadee. Ashtapadee:
DEFINE	para 12890	mwnuK kI tyk ibRQI sB jwnu ] (281-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) maanukh kee tayk barithee sabh jaan. Reliance on mortals is in vain - know this well.
DEFINE	para 12891	dyvn kau eykY Bgvwnu ] (281-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) dayvan ka-o aykai bhagvaan. The Great Giver is the One Lord God.
DEFINE	para 12892	ijs kY dIAY rhY AGwie ] (281-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jis kai dee-ai rahai aghaa-ay. By His gifts, we are satisfied,
RECORD	para 12893	bhuir n iqRsnw lwgY Awie ] (281-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) bahur na tarisnaa laagai aa-ay. and we suffer from thirst no longer.
RECORD	para 12894	mwrY rwKY eyko Awip ] (281-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) maarai raakhai ayko aap. The One Lord Himself destroys and also preserves.
DEFINE	para 12895	mwnuK kY ikCu nwhI hwiQ ] (281-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) maanukh kai kichh naahee haath. Nothing at all is in the hands of mortal beings.
DEFINE	para 12896	iqs kw hukmu bUiJ suKu hoie ] (281-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tis kaa hukam boojh sukh ho-ay. Understanding His Order, there is peace.
RECORD	para 12897	iqs kw nwmu rKu kMiT proie ] (281-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tis kaa naam rakh kanth paro-ay. So take His Name, and wear it as your necklace.
RECORD	para 12898	ismir ismir ismir pRBu soie ] (281-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) simar simar simar parabh so-ay. Remember, remember, remember God in meditation.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	nwnk ibGnu n lwgY koie ]1] (281-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak bighan na laagai ko-ay. ||1||
REQUIRE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, no obstacle shall stand in your way. ||1||
RECORD	para 12900	ausqiq mn mih kir inrMkwr ] (281-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ustat man meh kar nirankaar. Praise the Formless Lord in your mind.
RECORD	para 12901	kir mn myry siq ibauhwr ] (281-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kar man mayray sat bi-uhaar. O my mind, make this your true occupation.
RECORD	para 12902	inrml rsnw AMimRqu pIau ] (281-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) nirmal rasnaa amrit pee-o. Let your tongue become pure, drinking in the Ambrosial Nectar.
