RECORD	para 12908	kr hir krm sRvin hir kQw ] (281-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kar har karam sarvan har kathaa. So do the Lord's Work, and listen to the Lord's Sermon.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v2	hir drgh nwnk aUjl mQw ]2] (281-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) har dargeh naanak oojal mathaa. ||2||
REQUIRE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v2	In the Lord's Court, O Nanak, your face shall be radiant. ||2||
DEFINE	para 12910	bfBwgI qy jn jg mwih ] (281-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) badbhaagee tay jan jag maahi. Very fortunate are those humble beings in this world,
RECORD	para 12911	sdw sdw hir ky gun gwih ] (281-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sadaa sadaa har kay gun gaahi. who sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord, forever and ever.
RECORD	para 12912	rwm nwm jo krih bIcwr ] (281-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) raam naam jo karahi beechaar. Those who dwell upon the Lord's Name,
