RECORD	para 12914	min qin muiK bolih hir muKI ] (281-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) man tan mukh boleh har mukhee. Those who speak of the Supreme Lord in thought, word and deed
DEFINE	para 12915	sdw sdw jwnhu qy suKI ] (281-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sadaa sadaa jaanhu tay sukhee. - know that they are peaceful and happy, forever and ever.
RECORD	para 12916	eyko eyku eyku pCwnY ] (281-11, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ayko ayk ayk pachhaanai. One who recognizes the One and only Lord as One,
