RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v3	the Name of the Lord, O Nanak, knows the Immaculate Lord. ||3||
RECORD	para 12920	gur pRswid Awpn Awpu suJY ] (281-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gur parsaad aapan aap sujhai. By Guru's Grace, one understands himself;
DEFINE	para 12921	iqs kI jwnhu iqRsnw buJY ] (281-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tis kee jaanhu tarisnaa bujhai. know that then, his thirst is quenched.
