DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	Meditating in remembrance on Him, we are saved; Nanak is a sacrifice to Him. ||1||
RECORD	para 12974	AstpdI ] (282-10) asatpadee. Ashtapadee:
