RECORD	para 12976	srb jIAw Awpy pRiqpwl ] (282-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sarab jee-aa aapay partipaal. He Himself cherishes all beings.
DEFINE	para 12977	sgl kI icMqw ijsu mn mwih ] (282-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sagal kee chintaa jis man maahi. The cares of all are on His Mind;
