DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	In His Company, the Sikh is saved, O Nanak, singing the Glorious Praises of the Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 13227	AstpdI ] (286-13) asatpadee. Ashtapadee:
RECORD	para 13228	siqguru isK kI krY pRiqpwl ] (286-14, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) satgur sikh kee karai partipaal. The True Guru cherishes His Sikh.
DEFINE	para 13229	syvk kau guru sdw dieAwl ] (286-14, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sayvak ka-o gur sadaa da-i-aal. The Guru is always merciful to His servant.
RECORD	para 13230	isK kI guru durmiq mlu ihrY ] (286-14, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sikh kee gur durmat mal hirai. The Guru washes away the filth of the evil intellect of His Sikh.
RECORD	para 13231	gur bcnI hir nwmu aucrY ] (286-15, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gur bachnee har naam uchrai. Through the Guru's Teachings, he chants the Lord's Name.
