RECORD	para 13233	gur kw isKu ibkwr qy hwtY ] (286-15, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gur kaa sikh bikaar tay haatai. The Sikh of the Guru abstains from evil deeds.
RECORD	para 13234	siqguru isK kau nwm Dnu dyie ] (286-15, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) satgur sikh ka-o naam Dhan day-ay. The True Guru gives His Sikh the wealth of the Naam.
DEFINE	para 13235	gur kw isKu vfBwgI hy ] (286-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gur kaa sikh vadbhaagee hay. The Sikh of the Guru is very fortunate.
RECORD	para 13236	siqguru isK kw hlqu plqu svwrY ] (286-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) satgur sikh kaa halat palat savaarai. The True Guru arranges this world and the next for His Sikh.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	nwnk siqguru isK kau jIA nwil smwrY ]1] (286-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak satgur sikh ka-o jee-a naal samaarai. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, with the fullness of His heart, the True Guru mends His Sikh. ||1||
RECORD	para 13238	gur kY igRih syvku jo rhY ] (286-17, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gur kai garihi sayvak jo rahai. That selfless servant, who lives in the Guru's household,
RECORD	para 13239	gur kI AwigAw mn mih shY ] (286-17, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gur kee aagi-aa man meh sahai. is to obey the Guru's Commands with all his mind.
DEFINE	para 13240	Awps kau kir kCu n jnwvY ] (286-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aapas ka-o kar kachh na janaavai. He is not to call attention to himself in any way.
