RECORD	para 13242	mnu bycY siqgur kY pwis ] (286-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) man baychai satgur kai paas. One who sells his mind to the True Guru
DEFINE	para 13243	iqsu syvk ky kwrj rwis ] (286-19, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tis sayvak kay kaaraj raas. - that humble servant's affairs are resolved.
RECORD	para 13244	syvw krq hoie inhkwmI ] (286-19, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sayvaa karat ho-ay nihkaamee. One who performs selfless service, without thought of reward,
REQUIRE	para 13245	iqs kau hoq prwpiq suAwmI ] (286-19, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) tis ka-o hot paraapat su-aamee. shall attain his Lord and Master.
RECORD	para 13247	ApnI ik®pw ijsu Awip kryie ] (287-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) apnee kirpaa jis aap karay-i. He Himself grants His Grace;
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v2	nwnk so syvku gur kI miq lyie ]2] (287-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak so sayvak gur kee mat lay-ay. ||2||
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v2	O Nanak, that selfless servant lives the Guru's Teachings. ||2||
RECORD	para 13249	bIs ibsvy gur kw mnu mwnY ] (287-1, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) bees bisvay gur kaa man maanai. One who obeys the Guru's Teachings one hundred per cent
RECORD	para 13250	so syvku prmysur kI giq jwnY ] (287-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) so sayvak parmaysur kee gat jaanai. - that selfless servant comes to know the state of the Transcendent Lord.
DEFINE	para 13251	so siqguru ijsu irdY hir nwau ] (287-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) so satgur jis ridai har naa-o. The True Guru's Heart is filled with the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	para 13252	Aink bwr gur kau bil jwau ] (287-2, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) anik baar gur ka-o bal jaa-o. So many times, I am a sacrifice to the Guru.
DEFINE	para 13253	srb inDwn jIA kw dwqw ] (287-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sarab niDhaan jee-a kaa daataa. He is the treasure of everything, the Giver of life.
DEFINE	para 13254	AwT phr pwrbRhm rMig rwqw ] (287-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aath pahar paarbarahm rang raataa. Twenty-four hours a day, He is imbued with the Love of the Supreme Lord God.
DEFINE	para 13255	bRhm mih jnu jn mih pwrbRhmu ] (287-3, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) barahm meh jan jan meh paarbarahm. The servant is in God, and God is in the servant.
DEFINE	para 13256	eykih Awip nhI kCu Brmu ] (287-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aykeh aap nahee kachh bharam. He Himself is One - there is no doubt about this.
DEFINE	para 13257	shs isAwnp lieAw n jweIAY ] (287-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sahas si-aanap la-i-aa na jaa-ee-ai. By thousands of clever tricks, He is not found.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v3	nwnk AYsw guru bfBwgI pweIAY ]3] (287-4, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak aisaa gur badbhaagee paa-ee-ai. ||3||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v3	O Nanak, such a Guru is obtained by the greatest good fortune. ||3||
DEFINE	para 13259	sPl drsnu pyKq punIq ] (287-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) safal darsan paykhat puneet. Blessed is His Darshan; receiving it, one is purified.
RECORD	para 13260	prsq crn giq inrml rIiq ] (287-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) parsat charan gat nirmal reet. Touching His Feet, one's conduct and lifestyle become pure.
RECORD	para 13261	Bytq sMig rwm gun rvy ] (287-5, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) bhaytat sang raam gun ravay. Abiding in His Company, one chants the Lord's Praise,
RECORD	para 13262	pwrbRhm kI drgh gvy ] (287-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) paarbarahm kee dargeh gavay. and reaches the Court of the Supreme Lord God.
DEFINE	para 13263	suin kir bcn krn AwGwny ] (287-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sun kar bachan karan aaghaanay. Listening to His Teachings, one's ears are satisfied.
DEFINE	para 13264	min sMqoKu Awqm pqIAwny ] (287-6, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) man santokh aatam patee-aanay. The mind is contented, and the soul is fulfilled.
DEFINE	para 13265	pUrw guru AK´E jw kw mMqR ] (287-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) pooraa gur akh-ya-o jaa kaa mantar. The Guru is perfect; His Teachings are everlasting.
RECORD	para 13266	AMimRq idRsit pyKY hoie sMq ] (287-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) amrit darisat paykhai ho-ay sant. Beholding His Ambrosial Glance, one becomes saintly.
DEFINE	para 13267	gux ibAMq kImiq nhI pwie ] (287-7, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) gun bi-ant keemat nahee paa-ay. Endless are His virtuous qualities; His worth cannot be appraised.
RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v4	nwnk ijsu BwvY iqsu ley imlwie ]4] (287-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) naanak jis bhaavai tis la-ay milaa-ay. ||4||
DEFINE	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v4	O Nanak, one who pleases Him is united with Him. ||4||
DEFINE	para 13269	ijhbw eyk ausqiq Anyk ] (287-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jihbaa ayk ustat anayk. The tongue is one, but His Praises are many.
RECORD	para 13270	siq purK pUrn ibbyk ] kwhU bol n phucq pRwnI ] (287-8, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sat purakh pooran bibayk. kaahoo bol na pahuchat paraanee. The True Lord, of perfect perfection - no speech can take the mortal to Him.
DEFINE	para 13271	Agm Agocr pRB inrbwnI ] (287-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) agam agochar parabh nirbaanee. God is Inaccessible, Incomprehensible, balanced in the state of Nirvaanaa.
DEFINE	para 13272	inrwhwr inrvYr suKdweI ] (287-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) niraahaar nirvair sukh-daa-ee. He is not sustained by food; He has no hatred or vengeance; He is the Giver of peace.
RECORD	para 13273	qw kI kImiq iknY n pweI ] (287-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) taa kee keemat kinai na paa-ee. No one can estimate His worth.
RECORD	para 13274	Aink Bgq bMdn inq krih ] (287-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) anik bhagat bandan nit karahi. Countless devotees continually bow in reverence to Him.
RECORD	para 13275	crn kml ihrdY ismrih ] (287-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) charan kamal hirdai simrahi. In their hearts, they meditate on His Lotus Feet.
DEFINE	para 13276	sd bilhwrI siqgur Apny ] (287-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sad balihaaree satgur apnay. Nanak is forever a sacrifice to the True Guru;
