RECORD	gauVI bwvn AKrI mhlw 5 v5	by His Grace, he meditates on God. ||5||
RECORD	para 13278	iehu hir rsu pwvY jnu koie ] (287-11, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) ih har ras paavai jan ko-ay. Only a few obtain this ambrosial essence of the Lord's Name.
RECORD	para 13279	AMimRqu pIvY Amru so hoie ] (287-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) amrit peevai amar so ho-ay. Drinking in this Nectar, one becomes immortal.
RECORD	para 13280	ausu purK kw nwhI kdy ibnws ] jw kY min pRgty gunqws ] (287-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) us purakh kaa naahee kaday binaas. jaa kai man pargatay guntaas. That person whose mind is illuminated by the treasure of excellence, never dies.
RECORD	para 13281	AwT phr hir kw nwmu lyie ] (287-12, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) aath pahar har kaa naam lay-ay. Twenty-four hours a day, he takes the Name of the Lord.
