DEFINE	para 13292	sgl ibAwiD mn qy KY nsy ] (287-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) sagal bi-aaDh man tay khai nasay. All evils are dispelled from the mind.
RECORD	para 13293	ijs kw sw iqin ikrpw DwrI ] (287-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) jis kaa saa tin kirpaa Dhaaree. He takes us into His favor as His own.
RECORD	para 13294	swDsMig jip nwmu murwrI ] (287-16, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) saaDhsang jap naam muraaree. In the Company of the Holy, chant the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
