DEFINE	para 13297	inrgunu Awip srgunu BI EhI ] (287-17, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) nirgun aap sargun bhee ohee. He Himself is absolute and unrelated; He Himself is also involved and related.
RECORD	para 13298	klw Dwir ijin sglI mohI ] (287-18, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kalaa Dhaar jin saglee mohee. Manifesting His power, He fascinates the entire world.
