RECORD	para 13333	dh idis Dwvq AwvY Twie ] (288-9, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) dah dis Dhaavat aavai thaa-ay. Having wandered around in the ten directions, it comes to its place of rest.
RECORD	para 13334	qw kau ibGnu n lwgY koie ] (288-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) taa ka-o bighan na laagai ko-ay. No obstacle stands in the way of one
