DEFINE	para 13336	kil qwqI TWFw hir nwau ] (288-10, gauVI suKmnI, mÚ 5) kal taatee thaaNdhaa har naa-o. The Dark Age of Kali Yuga is so hot; the Lord's Name is soothing and cool.
