DEFINE	para 13905	AwT phr min hir jpY sPlu jnmu prvwxu ] (298-7, iQqI gauVI, mÚ 5) aath pahar man har japai safal janam parvaan. One who meditates on the Lord twenty-four hours a day - fruitful and blessed is his coming into the world.
DEFINE	para 13906	AMqir bwhir sdw sMig krnYhwru pCwxu ] (298-8, iQqI gauVI, mÚ 5) antar baahar sadaa sang karnaihaar pachhaan. Inwardly and outwardly, realize that the Creator Lord is always with you.
