RECORD	iQqI gauVI mhlw 5 v7	nwnk iqsu bilhwrxY hir hir nwmu jpyie ]7] (298-8, iQqI gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak tis balihaarnai har har naam japay-ay. ||7||
DEFINE	iQqI gauVI mhlw 5 v7	Nanak is a sacrifice to one who chants the Name of the Lord, Har, Har. ||7||
RECORD	para 13909	sloku ] (298-9) salok. Shalok:
