DEFINE	para 14014	gux inDwn goibMd gur kIAw jw kw hoie ] (300-6, iQqI gauVI, mÚ 5) gun niDhaan gobind gur kee-aa jaa kaa ho-ay. He is the Treasure of Excellence, the Lord of the Universe; through the Guru, He acts.
