RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	nwnk nwmu pivqu hir muiK bolI siB duK prhrI ]2] (301-7, gauVI, mÚ 4) naanak naam pavit har mukh bolee sabh dukh parharee. ||2||
DEFINE	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	O Nanak, the Lord's Name is sacred and pure; chanting it, all my pain has been taken away. ||2||
RECORD	para 14060	pauVI ] (301-8) pa-orhee. Pauree:
