RECORD	para 14062	ijnI qU iek min scu iDAwieAw iqn kw sBu duKu gvwieAw ] (301-8, gauVI, mÚ 4) jinee too ik man sach Dhi-aa-i-aa tin kaa sabh dukh gavaa-i-aa. Those who meditate on You, O True Lord with one-pointed mind, are rid of all their pain.
RECORD	para 14063	qyrw srIku ko nwhI ijs no lvY lwie suxwieAw ] (301-9, gauVI, mÚ 4) tayraa sareek ko naahee jis no lavai laa-ay sunaa-i-aa. You have no equal, next to whom I might sit and speak of You.
