RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	scy myry swihbw scy scu nwieAw ]2] (301-10, gauVI, mÚ 4) sachay mayray saahibaa sachay sach naa-i-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	O my True Lord and Master, Your Name is the Truest of the True. ||2||
RECORD	para 14066	slok mÚ 4 ] (301-11) salok mehlaa 4. Shalok, Fourth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14067	mn AMqir haumY rogu hY BRim BUly mnmuK durjnw ] (301-11, gauVI, mÚ 4) man antar ha-umai rog hai bharam bhoolay manmukh durjanaa. Deep within the mind is the disease of ego; the self-willed manmukhs, the evil beings, are deluded by doubt.
