RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	Servant Nanak has taken to the Sanctuary of the Lord. Hail to the Guru, who has united me with the Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 14072	pauVI ] (301-13) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 14073	qU krqw purKu AgMmu hY iksu nwil qU vVIAY ] (301-13, gauVI, mÚ 4) too kartaa purakh agamm hai kis naal too varhee-ai. You are the Personification of Creativity, the Inaccessible Lord. With whom should I compare You?
