DEFINE	para 14075	qU Git Git ieku vrqdw gurmuiK prgVIAY ] (301-14, gauVI, mÚ 4) too ghat ghat ik varatdaa gurmukh pargarhee-ai. You are the One, permeating each and every heart; You are revealed to the Gurmukh.
DEFINE	para 14076	qU scw sBs dw Ksmu hY sB dU qU cVIAY ] (301-15, gauVI, mÚ 4) too sachaa sabhas daa khasam hai sabh doo too charhee-ai. You are the True Lord and Master of all; You are the Highest of all.
RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v3	qU krih su scy hoiesI qw kwiequ kVIAY ]3] (301-15, gauVI, mÚ 4) too karahi so sachay ho-isee taa kaa-it karhee-ai. ||3||
DEFINE	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v3	Whatever You do, O True Lord - that is what happens, so why should we grieve? ||3||
RECORD	para 14078	slok mÚ 4 ] (301-15) salok mehlaa 4. Shalok, Fourth Mehl:
