ALLOW	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	Shower Your Mercy upon servant Nanak, O God, that he may dwell in peace with the True Guru. ||1||
RECORD	para 14081	mÚ 4 ] (301-17) mehlaa 4. Fourth Mehl:
