RECORD	para 14086	qU krih su scy Blw hY gur sbid buJwhI ] (301-18, gauVI, mÚ 4) too karahi so sachay bhalaa hai gur sabad bujhaahee. Whatever You do is good, O True Lord; this understanding is obtained through the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
DEFINE	para 14087	qU krx kwrx smrQu hY dUjw ko nwhI ] (301-19, gauVI, mÚ 4) too karan kaaran samrath hai doojaa ko naahee. You are the Cause of causes, the All-powerful Lord; there is no other at all.
