RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	siB jIA qyry qU sBs dw qU sB CfwhI ]4] (302-1, gauVI, mÚ 4) sabh jee-a tayray too sabhas daa too sabh chhadaahee. ||4||
DEFINE	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	All beings are Yours; You belong to all. You deliver all. ||4||
RECORD	para 14091	slok mÚ 4 ] (302-1) salok mehlaa 4. Shalok, Fourth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 14092	suix swjn pRym sMdysrw AKI qwr lgMin ] (302-1, gauVI, mÚ 4) sun saajan paraym sandaysraa akhee taar lagann. Listen, O my Friend, to my message of love; my eyes are fixed upon You.
RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	guir quTY sjxu myilAw jn nwnk suiK svMin ]1] (302-2, gauVI, mÚ 4) gur tuthai sajan mayli-aa jan naanak sukh savann. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	The Guru was pleased - He united servant Nanak with his friend, and now he sleeps in peace. ||1||
RECORD	para 14094	mÚ 4 ] (302-2) mehlaa 4. Fourth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 14095	siqguru dwqw dieAwlu hY ijs no dieAw sdw hoie ] (302-3, gauVI, mÚ 4) satgur daataa da-i-aal hai jis no da-i-aa sadaa ho-ay. The True Guru is the Merciful Giver; He is always compassionate.
RECORD	para 14096	siqguru AMdrhu inrvYru hY sBu dyKY bRhmu ieku soie ] (302-3, gauVI, mÚ 4) satgur andrahu nirvair hai sabh daykhai barahm ik so-ay. The True Guru has no hatred within Him; He beholds the One God everywhere.
REQUIRE	para 14097	inrvYrw nwil ij vYru clwiedy iqn ivchu iqsitAw n koie ] (302-4, gauVI, mÚ 4) nirvairaa naal je vair chalaa-iday tin vichahu tisti-aa na ko-ay. Anyone who directs hate against the One who has no hate, shall never be satisfied within.
RECORD	para 14098	siqguru sBnw dw Blw mnwiedw iqs dw burw ikau hoie ] (302-4, gauVI, mÚ 4) satgur sabhnaa daa bhalaa manaa-idaa tis daa buraa ki-o ho-ay. The True Guru wishes everyone well; how can anything bad happen to Him?
DEFINE	para 14099	siqgur no jyhw ko ieCdw qyhw Plu pwey koie ] (302-5, gauVI, mÚ 4) satgur no jayhaa ko ichh-daa tayhaa fal paa-ay ko-ay. As one feels towards the True Guru, so are the rewards he receives.
RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	nwnk krqw sBu ikCu jwxdw ijdU ikCu guJw n hoie ]2] (302-5, gauVI, mÚ 4) naanak kartaa sabh kichh jaandaa jidoo kichh gujhaa na ho-ay. ||2||
RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	O Nanak, the Creator knows everything; nothing can be hidden from Him. ||2||
RECORD	para 14101	pauVI ] (302-6) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 14102	ijs no swihbu vfw kry soeI vf jwxI ] (302-6, gauVI, mÚ 4) jis no saahib vadaa karay so-ee vad jaanee. One who has been made great by his Lord and Master - know him to be great!
DEFINE	para 14103	ijsu swihb BwvY iqsu bKis ley so swihb min BwxI ] (302-7, gauVI, mÚ 4) jis saahib bhaavai tis bakhas la-ay so saahib man bhaanee. By His Pleasure, the Lord and Master forgives those who are pleasing to His Mind.
DEFINE	para 14104	jy ko Es dI rIs kry so mUV AjwxI ] (302-7, gauVI, mÚ 4) jay ko os dee rees karay so moorh ajaanee. One who tries to compete with Him is a senseless fool.
DEFINE	para 14105	ijs no siqguru myly su gux rvY gux AwiK vKwxI ] (302-8, gauVI, mÚ 4) jis no satgur maylay so gun ravai gun aakh vakhaanee. One who is united with the Lord by the True Guru, sings His Praises and speaks His Glories.
RECORD	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v5	nwnk scw scu hY buiJ sic smwxI ]5] (302-8, gauVI, mÚ 4) naanak sachaa sach hai bujh sach samaanee. ||5||
DEFINE	gauVI kI vwr mhlw 4 v5	O Nanak, the True Lord is True; one who understands Him is absorbed in Truth. ||5||
RECORD	para 14107	slok mÚ 4 ] (302-9) salok mehlaa 4. Shalok, Fourth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 14108	hir siq inrMjn Amru hY inrBau inrvYru inrMkwru ] (302-9, gauVI, mÚ 4) har sat niranjan amar hai nirbha-o nirvair nirankaar. The Lord is true, immaculate and eternal; He has no fear, hatred or form.
RECORD	para 14109	ijn jipAw iek min iek iciq iqn lQw haumY Bwru ] (302-9, gauVI, mÚ 4) jin japi-aa ik man ik chit tin lathaa ha-umai bhaar. Those who chant and meditate on Him, who single-mindedly focus their consciousness on Him, are rid of the burden of their ego.
RECORD	para 14110	ijn gurmuiK hir AwrwiDAw iqn sMq jnw jYkwru ] (302-10, gauVI, mÚ 4) jin gurmukh har aaraaDhi-aa tin sant janaa jaikaar. Those Gurmukhs who worship and adore the Lord - hail to those Saintly beings!
