RECORD	para 14373	gur siqgur ipCY qir gieAw ijau lohw kwT sMgoieAw ] (309-15, gauVI, mÚ 4) gur satgur pichhai tar ga-i-aa ji-o lohaa kaath sango-i-aa. He is carried across by the Guru, the True Guru, like iron which is carried across by wood.
