RECORD	para 14423	scu scw rsu ijnI ciKAw sy iqRpiq rhy AwGweI ] (311-1, gauVI, mÚ 4) sach sachaa ras jinee chakhi-aa say taripat rahay aaghaa-ee. Those who have tasted the true essence of the True Lord, remain satisfied and fulfilled.
RECORD	para 14424	iehu hir rsu syeI jwxdy ijau gUMgY imiTAweI KweI ] (311-1, gauVI, mÚ 4) ih har ras say-ee jaanday ji-o goo Ngai mithi-aa-ee khaa-ee. They know this essence of the Lord, but they say nothing, like the mute who tastes the sweet candy, and says nothing.
