REQUIRE	slok mhlw 3 v1	O servant Nanak, praise the Naam; the pains of birth and death shall come to an end. ||1||
RECORD	para 14523	mÚ 4 ] (313-11) mehlaa 4. Fourth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14524	guru swlwhI Awpxw bhu ibiD rMig suBwie ] (313-11, gauVI, mÚ 4) gur saalaahee aapnaa baho biDh rang subhaa-ay. I praise my Guru in so many ways, with joyful love and affection.
