DEFINE	para 14526	ijhvw swlwih n rjeI hir pRIqm icqu lwie ] (313-12, gauVI, mÚ 4) jihvaa saalaahi na raj-ee har pareetam chit laa-ay. My tongue is not satisfied by praising Him; He has linked my consciousness with the Lord, my Beloved.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk nwvY kI min BuK hY mnu iqRpqY hir rsu Kwie ]2] (313-13, gauVI, mÚ 4) naanak naavai kee man bhukh hai man tariptai har ras khaa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, my mind hungers for the Name of the Lord; my mind is satisfied, tasting the sublime essence of the Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 14528	pauVI ] (313-13) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 14529	scu scw kudriq jwxIAY idnu rwqI ijin bxweIAw ] (313-13, gauVI, mÚ 4) sach sachaa kudrat jaanee-ai din raatee jin banaa-ee-aa. The True Lord is truly known for His all-powerful creative nature; He fashioned the days and the nights.
RECORD	para 14530	so scu slwhI sdw sdw scu scy kIAw vifAweIAw ] (313-14, gauVI, mÚ 4) so sach salaahee sadaa sadaa sach sachay kee-aa vadi-aa-ee-aa. I praise that True Lord, forever and ever; True is the glorious greatness of the True Lord.
RECORD	para 14531	swlwhI scu slwh scu scu kImiq iknY n pweIAw ] (313-14, gauVI, mÚ 4) saalaahee sach salaah sach sach keemat kinai na paa-ee-aa. True are the Praises of the Praiseworthy True Lord; the value of the True Lord cannot be appraised.
WHEN	para 14532	jw imilAw pUrw siqgurU qw hwjru ndrI AweIAw ] (313-15, gauVI, mÚ 4) jaa mili-aa pooraa satguroo taa haajar nadree aa-ee-aa. When someone meets the Perfect True Guru, then His Sublime Presence comes to be seen.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v23	scu gurmuiK ijnI slwihAw iqnw BuKw siB gvweIAw ]23] (313-15, gauVI, mÚ 4) sach gurmukh jinee sahaali-aa tinaa bhukhaa sabh gavaa-ee-aa. ||23||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v23	Those Gurmukhs who praise the True Lord - all their hunger is gone. ||23||
RECORD	para 14534	slok mÚ 4 ] (313-16) salok mehlaa 4. Shalok, Fourth Mehl:
