RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	I have found the Guru, the Divine Intermediary, who has united me with the Lord God. ||1||
RECORD	para 14537	mÚ 3 ] (313-17) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 14538	mwieAwDwrI Aiq AMnw bolw ] (313-17, gauVI, mÚ 3) maa-i-aaDhaaree at annaa bolaa. One who is attached to Maya is totally blind and deaf.
RECORD	para 14539	sbdu n suxeI bhu rol Gcolw ] (313-18, gauVI, mÚ 3) sabad na sun-ee baho rol ghacholaa. He does not listen to the Word of the Shabad; he makes a great uproar and tumult.
RECORD	para 14540	gurmuiK jwpY sbid ilv lwie ] (313-18, gauVI, mÚ 3) gurmukh jaapai sabad liv laa-ay. The Gurmukhs chant and meditate on the Shabad, and lovingly center their consciousness on it.
DEFINE	para 14541	hir nwmu suix mMny hir nwim smwie ] (313-18, gauVI, mÚ 3) har naam sun mannay har naam samaa-ay. They hear and believe in the Name of the Lord; they are absorbed in the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	para 14542	jo iqsu BwvY su kry krwieAw ] (313-19, gauVI, mÚ 3) jo tis bhaavai so karay karaa-i-aa. Whatever pleases God, He causes that to be done.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk vjdw jMqu vjwieAw ]2] (313-19, gauVI, mÚ 3) naanak vajdaa jant vajaa-i-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, human beings are the instruments which vibrate as God plays them. ||2||
RECORD	para 14545	pauVI ] (314-1) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 14546	qU krqw sBu ikCu jwxdw jo jIAw AMdir vrqY ] (314-1, gauVI, mÚ 3) too kartaa sabh kichh jaandaa jo jee-aa andar vartai. You, O Creator, know everything which occurs within our beings.
DEFINE	para 14547	qU krqw Awip Agxqu hY sBu jgu ivic gxqY ] (314-1, gauVI, mÚ 3) too kartaa aap agnat hai sabh jag vich gantai. You Yourself, O Creator, are incalculable, while the entire world is within the realm of calculation.
RECORD	para 14548	sBu kIqw qyrw vrqdw sB qyrI bxqY ] (314-2, gauVI, mÚ 3) sabh keetaa tayraa varatdaa sabh tayree bantai. Everything happens according to Your Will; You created all.
DEFINE	para 14549	qU Git Git ieku vrqdw scu swihb clqY ] (314-2, gauVI, mÚ 3) too ghat ghat ik varatdaa sach saahib chaltai. You are the One, pervading in each and every heart; O True Lord and Master, this is Your play.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v24	siqgur no imly su hir imly nwhI iksY prqY ]24] (314-3, gauVI, mÚ 3) satgur no milay so har milay naahee kisai partai. ||24||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v24	One who meets the True Guru meets the Lord; no one can turn him away. ||24||
RECORD	para 14551	sloku mÚ 4 ] (314-3) salok mehlaa 4. Shalok, Fourth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14552	iehu mnUAw idRVu kir rKIAY gurmuiK lweIAY icqu ] (314-3, gauVI, mÚ 4) ih manoo-aa darirh kar rakhee-ai gurmukh laa-ee-ai chit. Hold this mind steady and stable; become Gurmukh and focus your consciousness.
RECORD	para 14553	ikau swis igrwis ivswrIAY bhidAw auTidAw inq ] (314-4, gauVI, mÚ 4) ki-o saas giraas visaaree-ai bahdi-aa uth-di-aa nit. How could you ever forget Him, with each breath and morsel of food, sitting down or standing up?
RECORD	para 14554	mrx jIvx kI icMqw geI iehu jIAVw hir pRB vis ] (314-4, gauVI, mÚ 4) maran jeevan kee chintaa ga-ee ih jee-arhaa har parabh vas. My anxiety about birth and death has ended; this soul is under the control of the Lord God.
