WHEN	slok mhlw 3 v1	If it pleases You, then save servant Nanak, and bless him with Your Name. ||1||
RECORD	para 14556	mÚ 3 ] (314-5) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 14557	mnmuKu AhMkwrI mhlu n jwxY iKnu AwgY iKnu pICY ] (314-6, gauVI, mÚ 3) manmukh aha Nkaaree mahal na jaanai khin aagai khin peechhai. The egotistical, self-willed manmukh does not know the Mansion of the Lord's Presence; one moment he is here, and the next moment he is there.
