RECORD	para 14559	siqgur kw mhlu ivrlw jwxY sdw rhY kr joiV ] (314-7, gauVI, mÚ 3) satgur kaa mahal virlaa jaanai sadaa rahai kar jorh. How rare are those who know the Mansion of the True Guru; they stand with their palms pressed together.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	AwpxI ik®pw kry hir myrw nwnk ley bhoiV ]2] (314-7, gauVI, mÚ 3) aapnee kirpaa karay har mayraa naanak la-ay bahorh. ||2||
WHEN	slok mhlw 3 v2	If my Lord grants His Grace, O Nanak, He restores them to Himself. ||2||
RECORD	para 14561	pauVI ] (314-8) pa-orhee. Pauree:
