RECORD	para 14564	aupdysu ij idqw siqgurU so suixAw isKI kMny ] (314-9, gauVI, mÚ 3) updays je ditaa satguroo so suni-aa sikhee kannay. The Sikhs listen to the Teachings imparted by the True Guru.
RECORD	para 14565	ijn siqgur kw Bwxw mMinAw iqn cVI cvgix vMny ] (314-9, gauVI, mÚ 3) jin satgur kaa bhaanaa mani-aa tin charhee chavgan vannay. Those who surrender to the True Guru's Will are imbued with the four-fold Love of the Lord.
