RECORD	para 14578	ikAw Ehu suxY ikAw AwiK suxwvY ] (314-15, gauVI, mÚ 3) ki-aa oh sunai ki-aa aakh sunaavai. What can he hear, and what can he tell others?
DEFINE	para 14579	AMnw bolw Kuie auJiV pwie ] (314-15, gauVI, mÚ 3) annaa bolaa khu-ay ujharh paa-ay. He is blind and deaf; he loses his way, and wanders lost in the wilderness.
RECORD	para 14580	mnmuKu AMDw AwvY jwie ] (314-16, gauVI, mÚ 3) manmukh anDhaa aavai jaa-ay. The blind, self-willed manmukh comes and goes in reincarnation;
RECORD	para 14581	ibnu siqgur Byty Qwie n pwie ] (314-16, gauVI, mÚ 3) bin satgur bhaytay thaa-ay na paa-ay. without meeting the True Guru, he finds no place of rest.
