DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v1	The Support of the Saints, O Nanak, is manifest, pervading everywhere. ||1||
RECORD	para 14593	mÚ 5 ] (315-2) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14594	muMFhu Buly muMF qy ikQY pwiein hQu ] (315-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) mundhhu bhulay mundh tay kithai paa-in hath. Those who went astray from the Primal Being in the very beginning - where can they find refuge?
