DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, they are struck down by the All-powerful, the Cause of causes. ||2||
RECORD	para 14596	pauVI 5 ] (315-3) pa-orhee 5. Pauree, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14597	lY Pwhy rwqI qurih pRBu jwxY pRwxI ] (315-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) lai faahay raatee tureh parabh jaanai paraanee. They take the noose in their hands, and go out at night to strangle others, but God knows everything, O mortal.
RECORD	para 14598	qkih nwir prweIAw luik AMdir TwxI ] (315-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) takeh naar paraa-ee-aa luk andar thaanee. They spy on other men's women, concealed in their hiding places.
RECORD	para 14599	sMn@I dyin@ ivKMm Qwie imTw mdu mwxI ] (315-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) san Hee dayniH vikhamm thaa-ay mithaa mad maanee. They break into well-protected places, and revel in sweet wine.
REQUIRE	para 14600	krmI Awpo AwpxI Awpy pCuqwxI ] (315-4, gauVI, mÚ 5) karmee aapo aapnee aapay pachhutaanee. But they shall come to regret their actions - they create their own karma.
