RECORD	para 14602	slok mÚ 5 ] (315-5) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 14603	syvk scy swh ky syeI prvwxu ] (315-5, gauVI, mÚ 5) sayvak sachay saah kay say-ee parvaan. The servants of the True King are acceptable and approved.
