RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	Those ignorant ones who serve duality, O Nanak, rot, waste away and die. ||1||
RECORD	para 14605	mÚ 5 ] (315-6) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14606	jo Duir iliKAw lyKu pRB mytxw n jwie ] (315-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) jo Dhur likhi-aa laykh parabh maytnaa na jaa-ay. That destiny which was pre-ordained by God from the very beginning cannot be erased.
