DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	The wealth of the Lord's Name is Nanak's capital; he meditates on it forever. ||2||
RECORD	para 14608	pauVI 5 ] (315-7) pa-orhee 5. Pauree, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14609	nwrwieix lieAw nwTUMgVw pYr ikQY rKY ] (315-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) naaraa-in la-i-aa naathooNgarhaa pair kithai rakhai. One who has received a kick from the Lord God - where can he place his foot?
