RECORD	para 14611	inMdw krdw pic muAw ivic dyhI BKY ] (315-8, gauVI, mÚ 5) nindaa kardaa pach mu-aa vich dayhee bhakhai. Slandering others, he wastes away and dies; within his body, he burns.
