RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v28	Nanak has entered the Sanctuary of the Unseen Lord, the Primal Being. ||28||
RECORD	para 14614	slok mÚ 5 ] (315-9) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 14615	nrk Gor bhu duK Gxy AikrqGxw kw Qwnu ] (315-9, gauVI, mÚ 5) narak ghor baho dukh ghanay akirat-ghanaa kaa thaan. In the most horrible hell, there is terrible pain and suffering. It is the place of the ungrateful.
