RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	Those whom the Lord Himself misleads, O Nanak, putrefy and rot in reincarnation. ||2||
RECORD	para 14620	pauVI 5 ] (315-11) pa-orhee 5. Pauree, Fifth Mehl:
UPHOLD	para 14621	quis idqw pUrY siqgurU hir Dnu scu AKutu ] (315-11, gauVI, mÚ 5) tus ditaa poorai satguroo har Dhan sach akhut. By His Pleasure, the True Guru has blessed me with the inexhaustible wealth of the Name of the True Lord.
DEFINE	para 14622	siB AMdysy imit gey jm kw Bau Cutu ] (315-12, gauVI, mÚ 5) sabh andaysay mit ga-ay jam kaa bha-o chhut. All my anxiety is ended; I am rid of the fear of death.
