RECORD	para 14624	ivxu scy dUjw syvdy huie mrsin butu ] (315-13, gauVI, mÚ 5) vin sachay doojaa sayvday hu-ay marsan but. Those who serve another, instead of the True Lord, die unfulfilled in the end.
