DEFINE	para 14668	mwieAw mohu sBu duKu hY duiK ibnsY duKu roie ] (316-16, gauVI, mÚ 4) maa-i-aa moh sabh dukh hai dukh binsai dukh ro-ay. The love of Maya is total pain; in pain they perish, and in pain they cry out.
ALLOW	para 14669	nwnk Dwqu ilvY joVu n AwveI jy locY sBu koie ] (316-16, gauVI, mÚ 4) naanak Dhaat livai jorh na aavee jay lochai sabh ko-ay. O Nanak, there can be no union between the love of worldliness and the love of the Lord, no matter how much everyone may desire it.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	ijn kau poqY puMnu pieAw iqnw gur sbdI suKu hoie ]2] (316-17, gauVI, mÚ 4) jin ka-o potai punn pa-i-aa tinaa gur sabdee sukh ho-ay. ||2||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	Those who have the treasure of virtuous deeds find peace through the Word of the Guru's Shabad. ||2||
RECORD	para 14671	pauVI mÚ 5 ] (316-17) pa-orhee mehlaa 5. Pauree, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14672	nwnk vIcwrih sMq muin jnW cwir vyd khMdy ] (316-17, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak vichaareh sant mun janaa N chaar vayd kahanday. O Nanak, the Saints and the silent sages think, and the four Vedas proclaim,
RECORD	para 14673	Bgq muKY qy boldy sy vcn hovMdy ] (316-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) bhagat mukhai tay bolday say vachan hovanday. that whatever the Lord's devotees speak comes to pass.
DEFINE	para 14674	prgt pwhwrY jwpdy siB lok suxMdy ] (316-18, gauVI, mÚ 5) pargat pahaarai jaapday sabh lok sunanday. He is revealed in His cosmic workshop; all people hear of it.
RECORD	para 14675	suKu n pwiein mugD nr sMq nwil KhMdy ] (316-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) sukh na paa-in mugaDh nar sant naal khahanday. The foolish people, who fight with the Saints, find no peace.
DEFINE	para 14676	Eie locin Enw guxw no Eie AhMkwir sVMdy ] (316-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) o-ay lochan onaa gunaa no o-ay aha Nkaar sarhanday. The Saints seek to bless them with virtue, but they are burning with egotism.
RECORD	para 14677	Eie vycwry ikAw krih jW Bwg Duir mMdy ] (316-19, gauVI, mÚ 5) o-ay vaychaaray ki-aa karahi jaa N bhaag Dhur manday. What can those wretched ones do? Their evil destiny was pre-ordained.
DEFINE	para 14679	jo mwry iqin pwrbRhim sy iksY n sMdy ] (317-1, gauVI, mÚ 5) jo maaray tin paarbarahm say kisai na sanday. Those who are struck down by the Supreme Lord God do not belong to anyone.
DEFINE	para 14680	vYru krin inrvYr nwil Drim inAwie pcMdy ] (317-1, gauVI, mÚ 5) vair karan nirvair naal Dharam ni-aa-ay pachanday. Those who hate the One who has no hatred, are destroyed by righteous justice.
DEFINE	para 14681	jo jo sMiq srwipAw sy iPrih BvMdy ] (317-2, gauVI, mÚ 5) jo jo sant saraapi-aa say fireh bhavanday. Those who are cursed by the Saints wander around lost.
