DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v31	When the tree is cut off at its roots, the branches wither and die. ||31||
RECORD	para 14683	slok mÚ 5 ] (317-3) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14684	gur nwnk hir nwmu idRVwieAw BMnx GVx smrQu ] (317-3, gauVI, mÚ 5) gur naanak har naam drirh-aa-i-aa bhannan gharhan samrath. Guru Nanak implanted the Naam, the Name of the Lord, within me; He is All-powerful, to create and destroy.
