DEFINE	para 14693	kweI Aws n puMnIAw inq pr mlu ihrqy ] (317-6, gauVI, mÚ 5) kaa-ee aas na punnee-aa nit par mal hirtay. None of his desires are fulfilled; he continually steals the filth of others.
RECORD	para 14694	kIAw n jwxY AikrqGx ivic jonI iPrqy ] (317-7, gauVI, mÚ 5) kee-aa na jaanai aakirat-ghan vich jonee firtay. The ungrateful wretch does not appreciate what he has been given; he wanders lost in reincarnation.
