RECORD	para 14698	slok mÚ 3 ] (317-8) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 14699	gurmuiK igAwnu ibbyk buiD hoie ] (317-9, gauVI, mÚ 3) gurmukh gi-aan bibayk buDh ho-ay. The Gurmukh is blessed with spiritual wisdom and a discerning intellect.
