RECORD	para 14707	mÚ 4 ] (317-12) mehlaa 4. Fourth Mehl:
RECORD	para 14708	siqgur ky jIA kI swr n jwpY ik pUrY siqgur BwvY ] (317-12, gauVI, mÚ 4) satgur kay jee-a kee saar na jaapai ke poorai satgur bhaavai. The sublime state of the True Guru is not known; no one knows what pleases the Perfect True Guru.
