UPHOLD	para 14714	bRhmu bIcwru nwnku AwiK suxwvY ] (317-16, gauVI, mÚ 4) barahm beechaar naanak aakh sunaavai. Nanak proclaims and announces this wisdom of God.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	ij ivxu siqgur ky mnu mMny kMmu krwey so jMqu mhw duKu pwvY ]2] (317-16, gauVI, mÚ 4) je vin satgur kay man mannay kamm karaa-ay so jant mahaa dukh paavai. ||2||
