DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, His play is not known; no one can understand it. ||2||
RECORD	para 14754	slok mÚ 5 ] (318-14) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 14755	nwnk soeI idnsu suhwvVw ijqu pRBu AwvY iciq ] (318-14, gauVI, mÚ 5) naanak so-ee dinas suhaavrhaa jit parabh aavai chit. O Nanak, that day is beautiful, when God comes to mind.
