RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v1	ieVw ipMgulw suKmn bMdy ey Avgn kq jwhI ]1] (334-11, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) irhaa pingulaa sukhman banday ay avgan kat jaahee. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v1	The Ida, the Pingala and the Sushmanaa - O human being, how can the breaths through these be counted now? ||1||
RECORD	para 15561	qwgw qUtw ggnu ibnis gieAw qyrw bolqu khw smweI ] (334-12, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) taagaa tootaa gagan binas ga-i-aa tayraa bolat kahaa samaa-ee. The string has been broken, and the Sky of the Tenth Gate has been destroyed. Where has your speech gone?
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v1	eyh sMsw mo kau Anidnu ibAwpY mo kau ko n khY smJweI ]1] rhwau ] (334-12, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) ayh sansaa mo ka-o an-din bi-aapai mo ka-o ko na kahai samjhaa-ee. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. This cynicism afflicts me, night and day; who can explain this to me and help me understand? ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 15563	jh brBMfu ipMfu qh nwhI rcnhwru qh nwhI ] (334-13, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) jah barbhand pind tah naahee rachanhaar tah naahee. Where the world is - the body is not there; the mind is not there either.
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v2	joVnhwro sdw AqIqw ieh khIAY iksu mwhI ]2] (334-13, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) jorhanhaaro sadaa ateetaa ih kahee-ai kis maahee. ||2||
DEFINE	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v2	The Joiner is forever unattached; now, within whom is the soul said to be contained? ||2||
RECORD	para 15565	joVI juVY n qoVI qUtY jb lgu hoie ibnwsI ] (334-14, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) jorhee jurhai na torhee tootai jab lag ho-ay binaasee. By joining the elements, people cannot join them, and by breaking, they cannot be broken, until the body perishes.
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v3	kw ko Twkuru kw ko syvku ko kwhU kY jwsI ]3] (334-14, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) kaa ko thaakur kaa ko sayvak ko kaahoo kai jaasee. ||3||
DEFINE	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v3	Of whom is the soul the master, and of whom is it the servant? Where, and to whom does it go? ||3||
RECORD	para 15567	khu kbIr ilv lwig rhI hY jhw bsy idn rwqI ] (334-15, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) kaho kabeer liv laag rahee hai jahaa basay din raatee. Says Kabeer, I have lovingly focused my attention on that place where the Lord dwells, day and night.
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v4	auAw kw mrmu EhI pru jwnY Ehu qau sdw AibnwsI ]4]1]52] (334-15, gauVI pUrbI, Bgq kbIr jI) u-aa kaa maram ohee par jaanai oh ta-o sadaa abhinaasee. ||4||
DEFINE	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v4	Only He Himself truly knows the secrets of His mystery; He is eternal and indestructible. ||4||
RECORD	para 15569	gauVI ] (334-16) ga-orhee. Gauree:
