RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v1	suMn guPw mih Awsxu bYsxu klp ibbrijq pMQw ]1] (334-17, gauVI, Bgq kbIr jI) sunn gufaa meh aasan baisan kalap bibarjit panthaa. ||1||
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v1	In the cave of silence, dwell in your Yogic posture; let the subjugation of desire be your spiritual path. ||1||
RECORD	para 15572	myry rwjn mY bYrwgI jogI ] (334-17, gauVI, Bgq kbIr jI) mayray raajan mai bairaagee jogee. O my King, I am a Yogi, a hermit, a renunciate.
