RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. I do not die or suffer pain or separation. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 15574	KMf bRhmMf mih isM|I myrw btUAw sBu jgu BsmwDwrI ] (334-18, gauVI, Bgq kbIr jI) khand barahmand meh sinyee mayraa batoo-aa sabh jag bhasmaaDhaaree. The solar systems and galaxies are my horn; the whole world is the bag to carry my ashes.
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v2	qwVI lwgI iqRplu pltIAY CUtY hoie pswrI ]2] (334-19, gauVI, Bgq kbIr jI) taarhee laagee taripal paltee-ai chhootai ho-ay pasaaree. ||2||
DEFINE	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v2	Eliminating the three qualities and finding release from this world is my deep meditation. ||2||
