RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v3	iQru BeI qMqI qUtis nwhI Anhd ikMgurI bwjI ]3] (335-1, gauVI, Bgq kbIr jI) thir bha-ee tantee tootas naahee anhad kinguree baajee. ||3||
RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v3	The string has become steady, and it does not break; this guitar vibrates with the unstruck melody. ||3||
