RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v4	khu kbIr qw kau punrip jnmu nhI Kyil gieE bYrwgI ]4]2]53] (335-2, gauVI, Bgq kbIr jI) kaho kabeer taa ka-o punrap janam nahee khayl ga-i-o bairaagee. ||4||
DEFINE	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v4	Says Kabeer, the bairaagee, the renunciate, who has played such a game, is not reincarnated again into the world of form and substance. ||4||
