RECORD	gauVI kbIr jI kI nwil rlwie iliKAw mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. Leaving her home, the soul goes to the world of the weaver. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 15586	gjI n imnIAY qoil n qulIAY pwcnu syr AFweI ] (335-4, gauVI, Bgq kbIr jI) gajee na mini-ai tol na tulee-ai paachan sayr adhaa-ee. This cloth cannot be measured in yards or weighed with weights; its food is two and a half measures.
