DEFINE	para 20232	rwrY riv rihAw sB AMqir jyqy kIey jMqw ] (434-5, Awsw, mÚ 1) raarai rav rahi-aa sabh antar jaytay kee-ay jantaa. Rarra: The Lord is contained among all; He created all beings.
RECORD	rwgu Awsw mhlw 1 ptI ilKI v30	jMq aupwie DMDY sB lwey krmu hoAw iqn nwmu lieAw ]30] (434-5, Awsw, mÚ 1) jant upaa-ay DhanDhai sabh laa-ay karam ho-aa tin naam la-i-aa. ||30||
