RECORD	para 20236	vvY vwsudyau prmysru vyKx kau ijin vysu kIAw ] (434-7, Awsw, mÚ 1) vavai vaasuday-o parmaysar vaykhan ka-o jin vays kee-aa. Wawa: The all-pervading Transcendent Lord beholds the world; He created the form it wears.
RECORD	rwgu Awsw mhlw 1 ptI ilKI v32	vyKY cwKY sBu ikCu jwxY AMqir bwhir riv rihAw ]32] (434-7, Awsw, mÚ 1) vaykhai chaakhai sabh kichh jaanai antar baahar rav rahi-aa. ||32||
DEFINE	rwgu Awsw mhlw 1 ptI ilKI v32	He beholds, tastes, and knows everything; He is pervading and permeating inwardly and outwardly. ||32||
RECORD	rwgu Awsw mhlw 1 ptI ilKI v33	VwVY rwiV krih ikAw pRwxI iqsih iDAwvhu ij Amru hoAw ] iqsih iDAwvhu sic smwvhu Esu ivthu kurbwxu kIAw ]33] (434-8, Awsw, mÚ 1) rhaarhai raarh karahi ki-aa paraanee tiseh Dhi-aavahu je amar ho-aa. tiseh Dhi- aavahu sach samaavahu os vitahu kurbaan kee-aa. ||33||
RECORD	rwgu Awsw mhlw 1 ptI ilKI v33	Rarra: Why do you quarrel, O mortal? Meditate on the Imperishable Lord, and be absorbed into the True One. Become a sacrifice to Him. ||33||
RECORD	para 20239	hwhY horu n koeI dwqw jIA aupwie ijin irjku dIAw ] (434-9, Awsw, mÚ 1) haahai hor na ko-ee daataa jee-a upaa-ay jin rijak dee-aa. Haha: There is no other Giver than Him; having created the creatures, He gives them nourishment.
RECORD	rwgu Awsw mhlw 1 ptI ilKI v34	hir nwmu iDAwvhu hir nwim smwvhu Anidnu lwhw hir nwmu lIAw ]34] (434-10, Awsw, mÚ 1) har naam Dhi-aavahu har naam samaavahu an-din laahaa har naam lee-aa. ||34||
RECORD	rwgu Awsw mhlw 1 ptI ilKI v34	Meditate on the Lord's Name, be absorbed into the Lord's Name, and night and day, reap the Profit of the Lord's Name. ||34||
