DEFINE	para 21254	scy qyry loA scy Awkwr ] (463-6, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachay tayray lo-a sachay aakaar. True are Your realms, True is Your creation.
DEFINE	para 21255	scy qyry krxy srb bIcwr ] (463-6, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachay tayray karnay sarab beechaar. True are Your actions, and all Your deliberations.
DEFINE	para 21256	scw qyrw Amru scw dIbwxu ] (463-7, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachaa tayraa amar sachaa deebaan. True is Your Command, and True is Your Court.
DEFINE	para 21257	scw qyrw hukmu scw Purmwxu ] (463-7, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachaa tayraa hukam sachaa furmaan. True is the Command of Your Will, True is Your Order.
DEFINE	para 21258	scw qyrw krmu scw nIswxu ] (463-7, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachaa tayraa karam sachaa neesaan. True is Your Mercy, True is Your Insignia.
RECORD	para 21259	scy quDu AwKih lK kroiV ] (463-8, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachay tuDh aakhahi lakh karorh. Hundreds of thousands and millions call You True.
DEFINE	para 21260	scY siB qwix scY siB joir ] (463-8, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachai sabh taan sachai sabh jor. In the True Lord is all power, in the True Lord is all might.
DEFINE	para 21261	scI qyrI isPiq scI swlwh ] (463-8, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachee tayree sifat sachee saalaah. True is Your Praise, True is Your Adoration.
DEFINE	para 21262	scI qyrI kudriq scy pwiqswh ] (463-9, Awsw, mÚ 1) sachee tayree kudrat sachay paatisaah. True is Your almighty creative power, True King.
DEFINE	para 21263	nwnk scu iDAwiein scu ] (463-9, Awsw, mÚ 1) naanak sach Dhi-aa-in sach. O Nanak, true are those who meditate on the True One.
