DEFINE	Awsw mhlw 1 v1	Those who are subject to birth and death are totally false. ||1||
RECORD	para 21265	mÚ 1 ] (463-10) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
DEFINE	para 21266	vfI vifAweI jw vfw nwau ] (463-10, Awsw, mÚ 1) vadee vadi-aa-ee jaa vadaa naa-o. Great is His greatness, as great as His Name.
DEFINE	para 21267	vfI vifAweI jw scu inAwau ] (463-10, Awsw, mÚ 1) vadee vadi-aa-ee jaa sach ni-aa-o. Great is His greatness, as True is His justice.
DEFINE	para 21268	vfI vifAweI jw inhcl Qwau ] (463-10, Awsw, mÚ 1) vadee vadi-aa-ee jaa nihchal thaa-o. Great is His greatness, as permanent as His Throne.
DEFINE	para 21269	vfI vifAweI jwxY Awlwau ] (463-11, Awsw, mÚ 1) vadee vadi-aa-ee jaanai aalaa-o. Great is His greatness, as He knows our utterances.
DEFINE	para 21270	vfI vifAweI buJY siB Bwau ] (463-11, Awsw, mÚ 1) vadee vadi-aa-ee bujhai sabh bhaa-o. Great is His greatness, as He understands all our affections.
DEFINE	para 21271	vfI vifAweI jw puiC n dwiq ] (463-11, Awsw, mÚ 1) vadee vadi-aa-ee jaa puchh na daat. Great is His greatness, as He gives without being asked.
DEFINE	para 21272	vfI vifAweI jw Awpy Awip ] (463-12, Awsw, mÚ 1) vadee vadi-aa-ee jaa aapay aap. Great is His greatness, as He Himself is all-in-all.
RECORD	para 21273	nwnk kwr n kQnI jwie ] (463-12, Awsw, mÚ 1) naanak kaar na kathnee jaa-ay. O Nanak, His actions cannot be described.
RECORD	Awsw mhlw 1 v2	kIqw krxw srb rjwie ]2] (463-12, Awsw, mÚ 1) keetaa karnaa sarab rajaa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	Awsw mhlw 1 v2	Whatever He has done, or will do, is all by His Own Will. ||2||
RECORD	para 21275	mhlw 2 ] (463-13) mehlaa 2. Second Mehl:
DEFINE	para 21276	iehu jgu scY kI hY koTVI scy kw ivic vwsu ] (463-13, Awsw, mÚ 2) ih jag sachai kee hai koth-rhee sachay kaa vich vaas. This world is the room of the True Lord; within it is the dwelling of the True Lord.
ALLOW	para 21277	iekn@w hukim smwie ley iekn@w hukmy kry ivxwsu ] (463-13, Awsw, mÚ 2) ikn Haa hukam samaa-ay la-ay ikn Haa hukmay karay vinaas. By His Command, some are merged into Him, and some, by His Command, are destroyed.
WHEN	para 21278	iekn@w BwxY kiF ley iekn@w mwieAw ivic invwsu ] (463-14, Awsw, mÚ 2) ikn Haa bhaanai kadh la-ay ikn Haa maa-i-aa vich nivaas. Some, by the Pleasure of His Will, are lifted up out of Maya, while others are made to dwell within it.
RECORD	para 21279	eyv iB AwiK n jwpeI ij iksY Awxy rwis ] (463-14, Awsw, mÚ 2) ayv bhe aakh na jaap-ee je kisai aanay raas. No one can say who will be rescued.
RECORD	Awsw mhlw 1 v3	nwnk gurmuiK jwxIAY jw kau Awip kry prgwsu ]3] (463-15, Awsw, mÚ 2) naanak gurmukh jaanee-ai jaa ka-o aap karay pargaas. ||3||
DEFINE	Awsw mhlw 1 v3	O Nanak, he alone is known as Gurmukh, unto whom the Lord reveals Himself. ||3||
RECORD	para 21281	pauVI ] (463-16) pa-orhee. Pauree:
