DEFINE	para 21283	EQY scy hI sic inbVY cuix viK kFy jjmwilAw ] (463-16, Awsw, mÚ 2) othai sachay hee sach nibrhai chun vakh kadhay jajmaali-aa. There, only the Truth is judged true; the sinners are picked out and separated.
RECORD	para 21284	Qwau n pwiein kUiVAwr muh kwl@Y dojik cwilAw ] (463-17, Awsw, mÚ 2) thaa-o na paa-in koorhi-aar muh kaal Hai dojak chaali-aa. The false find no place there, and they go to hell with their faces blackened.
DEFINE	para 21285	qyrY nwie rqy sy ijix gey hwir gey is Tgx vwilAw ] (463-17, Awsw, mÚ 2) tayrai naa-ay ratay say jin ga-ay haar ga-ay se thagan vaali-aa. Those who are imbued with Your Name win, while the cheaters lose.
RECORD	Awsw mhlw 1 v2	iliK nwvY Drmu bhwilAw ]2] (463-18, Awsw, mÚ 2) likh naavai Dharam bahaali-aa. ||2||
UPHOLD	Awsw mhlw 1 v2	The Lord installed the Righteous Judge of Dharma to read and record the accounts. ||2||
RECORD	para 21287	slok mÚ 1 ] (463-18) salok mehlaa 1. Shalok, First Mehl:
DEFINE	para 21288	ivsmwdu nwd ivsmwdu vyd ] (463-18, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad naad vismaad vayd. Wonderful is the sound current of the Naad, wonderful is the knowledge of the Vedas.
DEFINE	para 21289	ivsmwdu jIA ivsmwdu Byd ] (463-19, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad jee-a vismaad bhayd. Wonderful are the beings, wonderful are the species.
DEFINE	para 21290	ivsmwdu rUp ivsmwdu rMg ] (463-19, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad roop vismaad rang. Wonderful are the forms, wonderful are the colors.
DEFINE	para 21291	ivsmwdu nwgy iPrih jMq ] (463-19, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad naagay fireh jant. Wonderful are the beings who wander around naked.
DEFINE	para 21293	ivsmwdu pauxu ivsmwdu pwxI ] (464-1, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad pa-un vismaad paanee. Wonderful is the wind, wonderful is the water.
DEFINE	para 21294	ivsmwdu AgnI Kyfih ivfwxI ] (464-1, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad agnee khaydeh vidaanee. Wonderful is fire, which works wonders.
DEFINE	para 21295	ivsmwdu DrqI ivsmwdu KwxI ] (464-1, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad Dhartee vismaad khaanee. Wonderful is the earth, wonderful the sources of creation.
DEFINE	para 21296	ivsmwdu swid lgih prwxI ] (464-2, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad saad lageh paraanee. Wonderful are the tastes to which mortals are attached.
DEFINE	para 21297	ivsmwdu sMjogu ivsmwdu ivjogu ] (464-2, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad sanjog vismaad vijog. Wonderful is union, and wonderful is separation.
DEFINE	para 21298	ivsmwdu BuK ivsmwdu Bogu ] (464-2, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad bhukh vismaad bhog. Wonderful is hunger, wonderful is satisfaction.
DEFINE	para 21299	ivsmwdu isPiq ivsmwdu swlwh ] (464-3, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad sifat vismaad saalaah. Wonderful is His Praise, wonderful is His adoration.
DEFINE	para 21300	ivsmwdu auJV ivsmwdu rwh ] (464-3, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad ujharh vismaad raah. Wonderful is the wilderness, wonderful is the path.
DEFINE	para 21301	ivsmwdu nyVY ivsmwdu dUir ] (464-3, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad nayrhai vismaad door. Wonderful is closeness, wonderful is distance.
RECORD	para 21302	ivsmwdu dyKY hwjrw hjUir ] (464-4, Awsw, mÚ 1) vismaad daykhai haajraa hajoor. How wonderful to behold the Lord, ever-present here.
RECORD	para 21303	vyiK ivfwxu rihAw ivsmwdu ] (464-4, Awsw, mÚ 1) vaykh vidaan rahi-aa vismaad. Beholding His wonders, I am wonder-struck.
