DEFINE	Awsw mhlw 1 v1	O Nanak, those who understand this are blessed with perfect destiny. ||1||
RECORD	para 21305	mÚ 1 ] (464-5) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
RECORD	para 21306	kudriq idsY kudriq suxIAY kudriq Bau suK swru ] (464-5, Awsw, mÚ 1) kudrat disai kudrat sunee-ai kudrat bha-o sukh saar. By His Power we see, by His Power we hear; by His Power we have fear, and the essence of happiness.
RECORD	para 21307	kudriq pwqwlI AwkwsI kudriq srb Awkwru ] (464-5, Awsw, mÚ 1) kudrat paataalee aakaasee kudrat sarab aakaar. By His Power the nether worlds exist, and the Akaashic ethers; by His Power the entire creation exists.
RECORD	para 21308	kudriq vyd purwx kqybw kudriq srb vIcwru ] (464-6, Awsw, mÚ 1) kudrat vayd puraan kataybaa kudrat sarab veechaar. By His Power the Vedas and the Puraanas exist, and the Holy Scriptures of the Jewish, Christian and Islamic religions. By His Power all deliberations exist.
RECORD	para 21309	kudriq Kwxw pIxw pYn@xu kudriq srb ipAwru ] (464-6, Awsw, mÚ 1) kudrat khaanaa peenaa pain Han kudrat sarab pi-aar. By His Power we eat, drink and dress; by His Power all love exists.
RECORD	para 21310	kudriq jwqI ijnsI rMgI kudriq jIA jhwn ] (464-7, Awsw, mÚ 1) kudrat jaatee jinsee rangee kudrat jee-a jahaan. - By His Power come the species of all kinds and colors; by His Power the living beings of the world exist.
RECORD	para 21311	kudriq nykIAw kudriq bdIAw kudriq mwnu AiBmwnu ] (464-7, Awsw, mÚ 1) kudrat naykee-aa kudrat badee-aa kudrat maan abhimaan. By His Power virtues exist, and by His Power vices exist. By His Power come honor and dishonor.
RECORD	para 21312	kudriq pauxu pwxI bYsMqru kudriq DrqI Kwku ] (464-8, Awsw, mÚ 1) kudrat pa-un paanee baisantar kudrat Dhartee khaak. By His Power wind, water and fire exist; by His Power earth and dust exist.
RECORD	para 21313	sB qyrI kudriq qUM kwidru krqw pwkI nweI pwku ] (464-8, Awsw, mÚ 1) sabh tayree kudrat tooN kaadir kartaa paakee naa-ee paak. Everything is in Your Power, Lord; You are the all-powerful Creator. Your Name is the Holiest of the Holy.
RECORD	Awsw mhlw 1 v2	nwnk hukmY AMdir vyKY vrqY qwko qwku ]2] (464-9, Awsw, mÚ 1) naanak hukmai andar vaykhai vartai taako taak. ||2||
DEFINE	Awsw mhlw 1 v2	O Nanak, through the Command of His Will, He beholds and pervades the creation; He is absolutely unrivalled. ||2||
RECORD	para 21315	pauVI ] (464-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 21316	AwpIn@Y Bog Boig kY hoie BsmiV Bauru isDwieAw ] (464-9, Awsw, mÚ 1) aapeenHai bhog bhog kai ho-ay bhasmarh bha-ur siDhaa-i-aa. Enjoying his pleasures, one is reduced to a pile of ashes, and the soul passes away.
