RECORD	para 21321	slok mÚ 1 ] (464-12) salok mehlaa 1. Shalok, First Mehl:
RECORD	para 21322	BY ivic pvxu vhY sdvwau ] (464-12, Awsw, mÚ 1) bhai vich pavan vahai sadvaa-o. In the Fear of God, the wind and breezes ever blow.
RECORD	para 21323	BY ivic clih lK drIAwau ] (464-12, Awsw, mÚ 1) bhai vich chaleh lakh daree-aa-o. In the Fear of God, thousands of rivers flow.
