DEFINE	para 21325	BY ivic DrqI dbI Bwir ] (464-13, Awsw, mÚ 1) bhai vich Dhartee dabee bhaar. In the Fear of God, the earth is crushed under its burden.
RECORD	para 21326	BY ivic ieMdu iPrY isr Bwir ] (464-13, Awsw, mÚ 1) bhai vich ind firai sir bhaar. In the Fear of God, the clouds move across the sky.
