RECORD	Awsw mhlw 1 v4	ijin sco scu buJwieAw ]4] (465-4, Awsw, mÚ 1) jin sacho sach bujhaa-i-aa. ||4||
RECORD	Awsw mhlw 1 v4	and instructs us in the Truth of Truths. ||4||
RECORD	para 21353	slok mÚ 1 ] (465-5) salok mehlaa 1. Shalok, First Mehl:
DEFINE	para 21354	GVIAw sBy gopIAw phr kMn@ gopwl ] (465-5, Awsw, mÚ 1) gharhee-aa sabhay gopee-aa pahar kan H gopaal. All the hours are the milk-maids, and the quarters of the day are the Krishnas.
