RECORD	para 21600	qRyqY rQu jqY kw joru AgY rQvwhu ] (470-2, Awsw, mÚ 1) taraytai rath jatai kaa jor agai rathvaahu. In the Silver Age of Traytaa Yuga, celibacy was the chariot and power the charioteer.
