RECORD	para 21603	mÚ 1 ] (470-4) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
RECORD	para 21604	swm khY syqMbru suAwmI sc mih AwCY swic rhy ] sBu ko sic smwvY ] (470-4, Awsw, mÚ 1) saam kahai saytambar su-aamee sach meh aachhai saach rahay. sabh ko sach samaavai. The Sama Veda says that the Lord Master is robed in white; in the Age of Truth, everyone desired Truth, abided in Truth, and was merged in the Truth.
