DEFINE	para 21614	pVih guxih iqn@ cwr vIcwr ] (470-8, Awsw, mÚ 1) parheh guneh tin H chaar veechaar. Reading and studying them, four doctrines are found.
RECORD	Awsw mhlw 1 v2	Bwau Bgiq kir nIcu sdwey ] qau nwnk moKMqru pwey ]2] (470-8, Awsw, mÚ 1) bhaa-o bhagat kar neech sadaa-ay. ta-o naanak mokhantar paa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	Awsw mhlw 1 v2	With loving devotional worship, abiding in humility, O Nanak, salvation is attained. ||2||
RECORD	para 21616	pauVI ] (470-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
