DEFINE	para 21651	eyhu jnyaU jIA kw heI q pwfy Gqu ] (471-2, Awsw, mÚ 1) ayhu janay-oo jee-a kaa ha-ee ta paaday ghat. This is the sacred thread of the soul; if you have it, then go ahead and put it on me.
