DEFINE	para 21653	DMnu su mwxs nwnkw jo gil cly pwie ] (471-3, Awsw, mÚ 1) Dhan so maanas naankaa jo gal chalay paa-ay. Blessed are those mortal beings, O Nanak, who wear such a thread around their necks.
