RECORD	para 21657	mÚ 1 ] (471-5) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
RECORD	para 21658	lK corIAw lK jwrIAw lK kUVIAw lK gwil ] (471-5, Awsw, mÚ 1) lakh choree-aa lakh jaaree-aa lakh koorhee-aa lakh gaal. He commits thousands of robberies, thousands of acts of adultery, thousands of falsehoods and thousands of abuses.
