RECORD	para 21682	KsmY BwvY so kry mnhu icMidAw so Plu pwiesI ] (471-14, Awsw, mÚ 1) khasmai bhaavai so karay manhu chindi-aa so fal paa-isee. One who acts to please His Lord and Master, obtains the fruits of his mind's desires.
