DEFINE	para 23089	AlK inrMjnu eyko vrqY eykw joiq murwrI ] (507-2, gUjrI, mÚ 4) alakh niranjan ayko vartai aykaa jot muraaree. The One unseen immaculate Lord is pervading everywhere, as is the Light of the Lord.
