RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 4 Gru 2 v6	sMq jnw kI inMdw ivAwpy nw aurvwir n pwrI ]6] (507-6, gUjrI, mÚ 4) sant janaa kee nindaa vi-aapay naa urvaar na paaree. ||6||
DEFINE	gUjrI mhlw 4 Gru 2 v6	He indulges in the slander of the humble Saints; he is neither on this shore, nor the shore beyond. ||6||
RECORD	para 23097	eyhu prpMcu Kylu kIAw sBu krqY hir krqY sB kl DwrI ] (507-7, gUjrI, mÚ 4) ayhu parpanch khayl kee-aa sabh kartai har kartai sabh kal Dhaaree. All this worldly drama is set in motion by the Creator Lord; He has infused His almighty strength into all.
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 4 Gru 2 v7	hir eyko sUqu vrqY jug AMqir sUqu iKMcY eykMkwrI ]7] (507-7, gUjrI, mÚ 4) har ayko soot vartai jug antar soot khinchai aykankaaree. ||7||
