RECORD	para 23099	rsin rsin ris gwvih hir gux rsnw hir rsu DwrI ] (507-8, gUjrI, mÚ 4) rasan rasan ras gaavahi har gun rasnaa har ras Dhaaree. With their tongues, they sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord, and savor Them. They place the sublime essence of the Lord upon their tongues, and savor it.
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 4 Gru 2 v8	nwnk hir ibnu Avru n mwgau hir rs pRIiq ipAwrI ]8]1]7] (507-8, gUjrI, mÚ 4) naanak har bin avar na maaga-o har ras pareet pi-aaree. ||8||
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 4 Gru 2 v8	O Nanak, other than the Lord, I ask for nothing else; I am in love with the Love of the Lord's sublime essence. ||8||
