RECORD	para 23107	suKIAn mih suKIAw qUM khIAih dwqn isir dwqw ] (507-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sukhee-an meh sukhee-aa tooN kahee-ahi daatan sir daataa. Among the peaceful, You are called the Peaceful One. Among givers, You are the Greatest Giver.
