DEFINE	para 23109	sUrn mih sUrw qUM khIAih Bogn mih BogI ] (507-14, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sooran meh sooraa too N kahee-ahi bhogan meh bhogee. Among warriors, You are called the Warrior. Among indulgers, You are the Indulger.
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 2 v3	gRsqn mih qUM bfo igRhsqI jogn mih jogI ]3] (507-14, gUjrI, mÚ 5) garastan meh tooN bado garihsatee jogan meh jogee. ||3||
DEFINE	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 2 v3	Among householders, You are the Great Householder. Among yogis, You are the Yogi. ||3||
DEFINE	para 23111	krqn mih qUM krqw khIAih Awcwrn mih AwcwrI ] (507-15, gUjrI, mÚ 5) kartan meh tooN kartaa kahee-ahi aachaaran meh aachaaree. Among creators, You are called the Creator. Among the cultured, You are the Cultured One.
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 2 v4	swhn mih qUM swcw swhw vwpwrn mih vwpwrI ]4] (507-15, gUjrI, mÚ 5) saahan meh too N saachaa saahaa vaapaaran meh vaapaaree. ||4||
DEFINE	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 2 v4	Among bankers, You are the True Banker. Among merchants, You are the Merchant. ||4||
DEFINE	para 23113	drbwrn mih qyro drbwrw srn pwln tIkw ] (507-16, gUjrI, mÚ 5) darbaaran meh tayro darbaaraa saran paalan teekaa. Among courts, Yours is the Court. Yours is the Most Sublime of Sanctuaries.
