RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 2 v5	The extent of Your wealth cannot be determined. Your Coins cannot be counted. ||5||
DEFINE	para 23115	nwmn mih qyro pRB nwmw igAwnn mih igAwnI ] (507-17, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naaman meh tayro parabh naamaa gi-aanan meh gi-aanee. Among names, Your Name, God, is the most respected. Among the wise, You are the Wisest.
