RECORD	para 23149	mÚ 3 ] (508-17) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 23150	AMdir shsw duKu hY AwpY isir DMDY mwr ] (508-17, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) andar sahsaa dukh hai aapai sir DhanDhai maar. Within the self is the pain of doubt; engrossed in worldly affairs, they are killing themselves.
RECORD	para 23151	dUjY Bwie suqy kbih n jwgih mwieAw moh ipAwr ] (508-18, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) doojai bhaa-ay sutay kabeh na jaageh maa-i-aa moh pi-aar. Asleep in the love of duality, they never wake up; they are in love with, and attached to Maya.
