RECORD	para 23159	qdhu Awpy Awip inrMkwru hY nw Epiq hoeI ] (509-3, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) tadahu aapay aap nirankaar hai naa opat ho-ee. At that time, only the Formless Lord Himself existed - there was no creation.
