RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v1	As it pleased Him, so did He act; without Him, there was no other. ||1||
RECORD	para 23161	sloku mÚ 3 ] (509-4) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 23162	swihbu myrw sdw hY idsY sbdu kmwie ] (509-4, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) saahib mayraa sadaa hai disai sabad kamaa-ay. My Master is eternal. He is seen by practicing the Word of the Shabad.
