RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v12	ijs no ik®pw kry iqsu guru imlY gurmuiK insqwrw ]12] (513-15, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) jis no kirpaa karay tis gur milai gurmukh nistaaraa. ||12||
