RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v1	nwnk mwieAw kw mwrxu hir nwmu hY gurmuiK pwieAw jwie ]1] (513-17, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) naanak maa-i-aa kaa maaran har naam hai gurmukh paa-i-aa jaa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v1	O Nanak, the Lord's Name is the antidote to Maya; the Gurmukh obtains it. ||1||
RECORD	para 23361	mÚ 3 ] (513-18) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
