RECORD	para 23485	ijau rwjy rwju kmwvdy duK suK iBVIAw ] (516-15, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) ji-o raajay raaj kamaavday dukh sukh bhirhee-aa. They ruled like kings, and fought for pleasure and pain.
RECORD	para 23486	eIsru bRhmw syvdy AMqu iqn@I n lhIAw ] (516-15, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) eesar barahmaa sayvday ant tin Hee na lahee-aa. Those who serve Shiva and Brahma do not find the limits of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 23487	inrBau inrMkwru AlKu hY gurmuiK pRgtIAw ] (516-16, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) nirbha-o nirankaar alakh hai gurmukh pargatee-aa. The Fearless, Formless Lord is unseen and invisible; He is revealed only to the Gurmukh.
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v19	iqQY sogu ivjogu n ivAwpeI AsiQru jig QIAw ]19] (516-16, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) tithai sog vijog na vi-aapa-ee asthir jag thee-aa. ||19||
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v19	There, one does not suffer sorrow or separation; he becomes stable and immortal in the world. ||19||
RECORD	para 23489	sloku mÚ 3 ] (516-17) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 23490	eyhu sBu ikCu Awvx jwxu hY jyqw hY Awkwru ] (516-17, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) ayhu sabh kichh aavan jaan hai jaytaa hai aakaar. All these things come and go, all these things of the world.
DEFINE	para 23491	ijin eyhu lyKw iliKAw so hoAw prvwxu ] (516-17, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) jin ayhu laykhaa likhi-aa so ho-aa parvaan. One who knows this written account is acceptable and approved.
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v1	nwnk jy ko Awpu gxwiedw so mUrKu gwvwru ]1] (516-18, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) naanak jay ko aap ganaa-idaa so moorakh gaavaar. ||1||
DEFINE	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v1	O Nanak, anyone who takes pride in himself is foolish and unwise. ||1||
RECORD	para 23493	mÚ 3 ] (516-18) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 23494	mnu kuMcru pIlku gurU igAwnu kuMfw jh iKMcy qh jwie ] (516-18, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) man kunchar peelak guroo gi-aan kundaa jah khinchay tah jaa-ay. The mind is the elephant, the Guru is the elephant-driver, and knowledge is the whip. Wherever the Guru drives the mind, it goes.
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v2	nwnk hsqI kuMfy bwhrw iPir iPir auJiV pwie ]2] (516-19, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) naanak hastee kunday baahraa fir fir ujharh paa-ay. ||2||
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v2	O Nanak, without the whip, the elephant wanders into the wilderness, again and again. ||2||
RECORD	para 23496	pauVI ] (516-19) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 23497	iqsu AwgY Ardwis ijin aupwieAw ] (516-19, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) tis aagai ardaas jin upaa-i-aa. I offer my prayer to the One, from whom I was created.
RECORD	para 23499	siqguru Apxw syiv sB Pl pwieAw ] (517-1, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) satgur apnaa sayv sabh fal paa-i-aa. Serving my True Guru, I have obtained all the fruits.
RECORD	para 23500	AMimRq hir kw nwau sdw iDAwieAw ] (517-1, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) amrit har kaa naa-o sadaa Dhi-aa-i-aa. I meditate continually on the Ambrosial Name of the Lord.
RECORD	para 23501	sMq jnw kY sMig duKu imtwieAw ] (517-2, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) sant janaa kai sang dukh mitaa-i-aa. In the Society of the Saints, I am rid of my pain and suffering.
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v20	nwnk Bey AicMqu hir Dnu inhclwieAw ]20] (517-2, gUjrI kI vwr, mÚ 3) naanak bha-ay achint har Dhan nihchalaa-i-aa. ||20||
RECORD	gUjrI mhlw 5 Gru 4 v20	O Nanak, I have become care-free; I have obtained the imperishable wealth of the Lord. ||20||
RECORD	para 23503	slok mÚ 3 ] (517-3) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
