RECORD	para 23530	<> siqgur pRswid ] (517-14) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
RECORD	para 23531	sloku mÚ 5 ] (517-15) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 23532	AMqir guru AwrwDxw ijhvw jip gur nwau ] (517-15, gUjrI, mÚ 5) antar gur aaraaDh-naa jihvaa jap gur naa-o. Deep within yourself, worship the Guru in adoration, and with your tongue, chant the Guru's Name.
RECORD	para 23533	nyqRI siqguru pyKxw sRvxI sunxw gur nwau ] (517-15, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naytree satgur paykh-naa sarvanee sunnaa gur naa-o. Let your eyes behold the True Guru, and let your ears hear the Guru's Name.
REQUIRE	para 23534	siqgur syqI riqAw drgh pweIAY Twau ] (517-16, gUjrI, mÚ 5) satgur saytee rati-aa dargeh paa-ee-ai thaa-o. Attuned to the True Guru, you shall receive a place of honor in the Court of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 23535	khu nwnk ikrpw kry ijs no eyh vQu dyie ] (517-16, gUjrI, mÚ 5) kaho naanak kirpaa karay jis no ayh vath day-ay. Says Nanak, this treasure is bestowed on those who are blessed with His Mercy.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	jg mih auqm kwFIAih ivrly kyeI kyie ]1] (517-17, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jag meh utam kaadhee-ah virlay kay-ee kay-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	In the midst of the world, they are known as the most pious - they are rare indeed. ||1||
RECORD	para 23537	mÚ 5 ] (517-17) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 23538	rKy rKxhwir Awip aubwirAnu ] (517-17, gUjrI, mÚ 5) rakhay rakhanhaar aap ubaari-an. O Savior Lord, save us and take us across.
DEFINE	para 23539	gur kI pYrI pwie kwj svwirAnu ] (517-17, gUjrI, mÚ 5) gur kee pairee paa-ay kaaj savaari-an. Falling at the feet of the Guru, our works are embellished with perfection.
RECORD	para 23540	hoAw Awip dieAwlu mnhu n ivswirAnu ] (517-18, gUjrI, mÚ 5) ho-aa aap da-i-aal manhu na visaari-an. You have become kind, merciful and compassionate; we do not forget You from our minds.
DEFINE	para 23541	swD jnw kY sMig Bvjlu qwirAnu ] (517-18, gUjrI, mÚ 5) saaDh janaa kai sang bhavjal taari-an. In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, we are carried across the terrifying world-ocean.
RECORD	para 23542	swkq inMdk dust iKn mwih ibdwirAnu ] (517-19, gUjrI, mÚ 5) saakat nindak dusat khin maahi bidaari-an. In an instant, You have destroyed the faithless cynics and slanderous enemies.
DEFINE	para 23543	iqsu swihb kI tyk nwnk mnY mwih ] (517-19, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tis saahib kee tayk naanak manai maahi. That Lord and Master is my Anchor and Support; O Nanak, hold firm in your mind.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	ijsu ismrq suKu hoie sgly dUK jwih ]2] (518-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jis simrat sukh ho-ay saglay dookh jaahi. ||2||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	Remembering Him in meditation, happiness comes, and all sorrows and pains simply vanish. ||2||
RECORD	para 23546	pauVI ] (518-1) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 23547	Akul inrMjn purKu Agmu ApwrIAY ] (518-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) akul niranjan purakh agam apaaree-ai. He is without relatives, immaculate, all-powerful, unapproachable and infinite.
DEFINE	para 23548	sco scw scu scu inhwrIAY ] (518-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sacho sachaa sach sach nihaaree-ai. Truly, the True Lord is seen to be the Truest of the True.
RECORD	para 23549	kUVu n jwpY ikCu qyrI DwrIAY ] (518-2, gUjrI, mÚ 5) koorh na jaapai kichh tayree Dhaaree-ai. Nothing established by You appears to be false.
RECORD	para 23550	sBsY dy dwqwru jyq aupwrIAY ] (518-2, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sabhsai day daataar jayt upaaree-ai. The Great Giver gives sustenance to all those He has created.
RECORD	para 23551	iekqu sUiq proie joiq sMjwrIAY ] (518-2, gUjrI, mÚ 5) ikat soot paro-ay jot sanjaaree-ai. He has strung all on only one thread; He has infused His Light in them.
ALLOW	para 23552	hukmy Bvjl mMiJ hukmy qwrIAY ] (518-3, gUjrI, mÚ 5) hukmay bhavjal manjh hukmay taaree-ai. By His Will, some drown in the terrifying world-ocean, and by His Will, some are carried across.
UPHOLD	para 23553	pRB jIau quDu iDAwey soie ijsu Bwgu mQwrIAY ] (518-3, gUjrI, mÚ 5) parabh jee-o tuDh Dhi-aa-ay so-ay jis bhaag mathaaree-ai. O Dear Lord, he alone meditates on You, upon whose forehead such blessed destiny is inscribed.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	qyrI giq imiq lKI n jwie hau quDu bilhwrIAY ]1] (518-4, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tayree gat mit lakhee na jaa-ay ha-o tuDh balihaaree-ai. ||1||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	Your condition and state cannot be known; I am a sacrifice to You. ||1||
RECORD	para 23555	sloku mÚ 5 ] (518-4) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 23556	jw qUM qusih imhrvwn AicMqu vsih mn mwih ] (518-4, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jaa tooN tuseh miharvaan achint vaseh man maahi. When You are pleased, O Merciful Lord, you automatically come to dwell within my mind.
DEFINE	para 23557	jw qUM qusih imhrvwn nau iniD Gr mih pwih ] (518-5, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jaa tooN tuseh miharvaan na-o niDh ghar meh paahi. When You are pleased, O Merciful Lord, I find the nine treasures within the home of my own self.
DEFINE	para 23558	jw qUM qusih imhrvwn qw gur kw mMqRü kmwih ] (518-5, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jaa tooN tuseh miharvaan taa gur kaa mantar kamaahi. When You are pleased, O Merciful Lord, I act according to the Guru's Instructions.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	jw qUM qusih imhrvwn qw nwnk sic smwih ]1] (518-6, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jaa tooN tuseh miharvaan taa naanak sach samaahi. ||1||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	When You are pleased, O Merciful Lord, then Nanak is absorbed in the True One. ||1||
RECORD	para 23560	mÚ 5 ] (518-6) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 23561	ikqI bYhin@ bYhxy mucu vjwiein vj ] (518-7, gUjrI, mÚ 5) kitee baihniH baihnay much vajaa-in vaj. Many sit on thrones, to the sounds of musical instruments.
