RECORD	para 23564	quDu iDAwiein@ byd kqybw sxu KVy ] (518-7, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tuDh Dhi-aa-eeniH bayd kataybaa san kharhay. The followers of the Vedas, the Bible and the Koran, standing at Your Door, meditate on You.
DEFINE	para 23565	gxqI gxI n jwie qyrY dir pVy ] (518-8, gUjrI, mÚ 5) gantee ganee na jaa-ay tayrai dar parhay. Uncounted are those who fall at Your Door.
ALLOW	para 23566	bRhmy quDu iDAwiein@ ieMdR ieMdRwsxw ] (518-8, gUjrI, mÚ 5) barahmay tuDh Dhi-aa-eeniH indar indraasanaa. Brahma meditates on You, as does Indra on his throne.
RECORD	para 23567	sMkr ibsn Avqwr hir jsu muiK Bxw ] (518-9, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sankar bisan avtaar har jas mukh bhanaa. Shiva and Vishnu, and their incarnations, chant the Lord's Praise with their mouths,
RECORD	para 23568	pIr ipkwbr syK mswiek AaulIey ] (518-9, gUjrI, mÚ 5) peer pikaabar saykh masaa-ik a-ulee-ay. as do the Pirs, the spiritual teachers, the prophets and the Shaykhs, the silent sages and the seers.
