DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	Nanak: You, O Lord, conceal my short-comings and dwell within my mind; You are my true friend. ||2||
RECORD	para 23578	pauVI ] (518-13) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 23579	hau mwgau quJY dieAwl kir dwsw goilAw ] (518-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) ha-o maaga-o tujhai da-i-aal kar daasaa goli-aa. I beg of You, O Merciful Lord: please, make me the slave of Your slaves.
RECORD	para 23580	nau iniD pweI rwju jIvw boilAw ] (518-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) na-o niDh paa-ee raaj jeevaa boli-aa. I obtain the nine treasures and royalty; chanting Your Name, I live.
DEFINE	para 23581	AMimRq nwmu inDwnu dwsw Gir Gxw ] (518-14, gUjrI, mÚ 5) amrit naam niDhaan daasaa ghar ghanaa. The great ambrosial treasure, the Nectar of the Naam, is in the home of the Lord's slaves.
