RECORD	para 23598	sBu ikCu jwxY jwxu buiJ vIcwrdw ] (519-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sabh kichh jaanai jaan bujh veechaardaa. The Knower knows everything; He understands and contemplates.
RECORD	para 23599	Aink rUp iKn mwih kudriq Dwrdw ] (519-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) anik roop khin maahi kudrat Dhaardaa. By His creative power, He assumes numerous forms in an instant.
DEFINE	para 23600	ijs no lwie sic iqsih auDwrdw ] (519-2, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jis no laa-ay sach tiseh uDhaardaa. One whom the Lord attaches to the Truth is redeemed.
