DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v4	His Court is eternal and imperishable; I humbly bow to Him. ||4||
RECORD	para 23603	slok mÚ 5 ] (519-3) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
