RECORD	para 23662	iqin pwey sBy Qok ijsu Awip idvwieAY ] (520-6, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tin paa-ay sabhay thok jis aap divaa-i-ai. He receives everything, unto whom the Lord Himself gives.
