DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	There is One Creator; O Nanak, I do not see any other. ||1||
RECORD	para 23728	mÚ 5 ] (521-11) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 23729	pwpiVAw pCwiV bwxu scwvw sMin@ kY ] (521-12, gUjrI, mÚ 5) paaprhi-aa pachhaarh baan sachaavaa sa NniH kai. Take aim with the arrow of Truth, and shoot down sin.
