FORBID	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	Cherish the Words of the Guru's Mantra, O Nanak, and you shall not suffer in pain. ||2||
RECORD	para 23731	pauVI ] (521-12) pa-orhee. Pauree:
WHEN	para 23732	vwhu vwhu isrjxhwr pweIAnu TwiF Awip ] (521-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) vaahu vaahu sirjanhaar paa-ee-an thaadh aap. Waaho! Waaho! The Creator Lord Himself has brought about peace and tranquility.
DEFINE	para 23733	jIA jMq imhrvwnu iqs no sdw jwip ] (521-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jee-a jant miharvaan tis no sadaa jaap. He is Kind to all beings and creatures; meditate forever on Him.
DEFINE	para 23734	dieAw DwrI smriQ cuky ibl iblwp ] (521-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) da-i-aa Dhaaree samrath chukay bil bilaap. The all-powerful Lord has shown Mercy, and my cries of suffering are ended.
DEFINE	para 23735	nTy qwp duK rog pUry gur pRqwip ] (521-14, gUjrI, mÚ 5) nathay taap dukh rog pooray gur partaap. My fevers, pains and diseases are gone, by the Grace of the Perfect Guru.
DEFINE	para 23736	kIqIAnu AwpxI rK grIb invwij Qwip ] (521-14, gUjrI, mÚ 5) keetee-an aapnee rakh gareeb nivaaj thaap. The Lord has established me, and protected me; He is the Cherisher of the poor.
RECORD	para 23737	Awpy lieAnu Cfwie bMDn sgl kwip ] (521-15, gUjrI, mÚ 5) aapay la-i-an chhadaa-ay banDhan sagal kaap. He Himself has delivered me, breaking all my bonds.
DEFINE	para 23738	iqsn buJI Aws puMnI mn sMqoiK DRwip ] (521-15, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tisan bujhee aas punnee man santokh Dharaap. My thirst is quenched, my hopes are fulfilled, and my mind is contented and satisfied.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v13	vfI hUM vfw Apwr Ksmu ijsu lypu n puMin pwip ]13] (521-16, gUjrI, mÚ 5) vadee hooN vadaa apaar khasam jis layp na punn paap. ||13||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v13	The greatest of the great, the Infinite Lord and Master - He is not affected by virtue and vice. ||13||
RECORD	para 23740	slok mÚ 5 ] (521-16) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 23741	jw kau Bey ik®pwl pRB hir hir syeI jpwq ] (521-16, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jaa ka-o bha-ay kirpaal parabh har har say-ee japaat. They alone meditate on the Lord God, Har, Har, unto whom the Lord is Merciful.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	nwnk pRIiq lgI iqn rwm isau Bytq swD sMgwq ]1] (521-17, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naanak pareet lagee tin raam si-o bhaytat saaDh sangaat. ||1||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, they enshrine love for the Lord, meeting the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy. ||1||
RECORD	para 23743	mÚ 5 ] (521-17) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 23744	rwmu rmhu bfBwgIho jil Qil mhIAil soie ] (521-17, gUjrI, mÚ 5) raam ramhu badbhaageeho jal thal mahee-al so-ay. Contemplate the Lord, O very fortunate ones; He is pervading in the water, the land and the sky.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	nwnk nwim ArwiDAY ibGnu n lwgY koie ]2] (521-18, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naanak naam araaDhi-ai bighan na laagai ko-ay. ||2||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	O Nanak, worshipping the Naam, the Name of the Lord, the mortal encounters no misfortune. ||2||
RECORD	para 23746	pauVI ] (521-19) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 23747	Bgqw kw boilAw prvwxu hY drgh pvY Qwie ] (521-19, gUjrI, mÚ 5) bhagtaa kaa boli-aa parvaan hai dargeh pavai thaa-ay. The speech of the devotees is approved; it is accepted in the Court of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 23748	Bgqw qyrI tyk rqy sic nwie ] (521-19, gUjrI, mÚ 5) bhagtaa tayree tayk ratay sach naa-ay. Your devotees take to Your Support; they are imbued with the True Name.
DEFINE	para 23749	ijs no hoie ik®pwlu iqs kw dUKu jwie ] (521-19, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jis no ho-ay kirpaal tis kaa dookh jaa-ay. One unto whom You are Merciful, has his sufferings depart.
RECORD	para 23751	Bgq qyry dieAwl En@w imhr pwie ] (522-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) bhagat tayray da-i-aal on Haa mihar paa-ay. O Merciful Lord, You bless Your devotees with Your Grace.
RECORD	para 23752	dUKu drdu vf rogu n pohy iqsu mwie ] (522-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) dookh darad vad rog na pohay tis maa-ay. Suffering, pain, terrible disease and Maya do not afflict them.
DEFINE	para 23753	Bgqw eyhu ADwru gux goivMd gwie ] (522-2, gUjrI, mÚ 5) bhagtaa ayhu aDhaar gun govind gaa-ay. This is the Support of the devotees, that they sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord of the Universe.
RECORD	para 23754	sdw sdw idnu rYix ieko ieku iDAwie ] (522-2, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sadaa sadaa din rain iko ik Dhi-aa-ay. Forever and ever, day and night, they meditate on the One and Only Lord.
ALLOW	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v14	pIviq AMimRq nwmu jn nwmy rhy AGwie ]14] (522-2, gUjrI, mÚ 5) peevat amrit naam jan naamay rahay aghaa-ay. ||14||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v14	Drinking in the Ambrosial Amrit of the Naam, the Name of the Lord, His humble servants remain satisfied with the Naam. ||14||
RECORD	para 23756	slok mÚ 5 ] (522-3) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 23757	koit ibGn iqsu lwgqy ijs no ivsrY nwau ] (522-3, gUjrI, mÚ 5) kot bighan tis laagtay jis no visrai naa-o. Millions of obstacles stand in the way of one who forgets the Name.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	nwnk Anidnu iblpqy ijau suM\Y Gir kwau ]1] (522-4, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naanak an-din bilpatay ji-o sunjai ghar kaa-o. ||1||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, night and day, he croaks like a raven in a deserted house. ||1||
RECORD	para 23759	mÚ 5 ] (522-4) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 23760	iprI imlwvw jw QIAY sweI suhwvI ruiq ] (522-4, gUjrI, mÚ 5) piree milaavaa jaa thee-ai saa-ee suhaavee rut. Beauteous is that season, when I am united with my Beloved.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	GVI muhqu nh vIsrY nwnk rvIAY inq ]2] (522-5, gUjrI, mÚ 5) gharhee muhat nah veesrai naanak ravee-ai nit. ||2||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	I do not forget Him for a moment or an instant; O Nanak, I contemplate Him constantly. ||2||
RECORD	para 23762	pauVI ] (522-5) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 23763	sUrbIr vrIAwm iknY n hoVIAY ] Pauj sqwxI hwT pMcw joVIAY ] (522-5, gUjrI, mÚ 5) soorbeer varee-aam kinai na horhee-ai. fa-uj sataanee haath panchaa jorhee-ai. Even brave and mighty men cannot withstand the powerful and overwhelming army which the five passions have gathered.
RECORD	para 23764	ds nwrI AauDUq dyin cmoVIAY ] (522-6, gUjrI, mÚ 5) das naaree a-uDhoot dayn chamorhee-ai. The ten organs of sensation attach even detached renunciates to sensory pleasures.
RECORD	para 23765	ijix ijix lYin@ rlwie eyho eynw loVIAY ] (522-6, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jin jin laini H ralaa-ay ayho aynaa lorhee-ai. They seek to conquer and overpower them, and so increase their following.
DEFINE	para 23766	qRY gux ien kY vis iknY n moVIAY ] (522-7, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tarai gun in kai vas kinai na morhee-ai. The world of the three dispositions is under their influence; no one can stand against them.
RECORD	para 23767	Brmu kotu mwieAw KweI khu ikqu ibiD qoVIAY ] (522-7, gUjrI, mÚ 5) bharam kot maa-i-aa khaa-ee kaho kit biDh torhee-ai. So tell me - how can the fort of doubt and the moat of Maya be overcome?
DEFINE	para 23768	guru pUrw AwrwiD ibKm dlu PoVIAY ] (522-8, gUjrI, mÚ 5) gur pooraa aaraaDh bikham dal forhee-ai. Worshipping the Perfect Guru, this awesome force is subdued.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v15	hau iqsu AgY idnu rwiq rhw kr joVIAY ]15] (522-8, gUjrI, mÚ 5) ha-o tis agai din raat rahaa kar jorhee-ai. ||15||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v15	I stand before Him, day and night, with my palms pressed together. ||15||
RECORD	para 23770	slok mÚ 5 ] (522-9) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 23771	iklivK sBy auqrin nIq nIq gux gwau ] (522-9, gUjrI, mÚ 5) kilvikh sabhay utran neet neet gun gaa-o. All sins are washed away, by continually singing the Lord's Glories.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	koit klysw aUpjih nwnk ibsrY nwau ]1] (522-9, gUjrI, mÚ 5) kot kalaysaa oopjahi naanak bisrai naa-o. ||1||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	Millions of afflictions are produced, O Nanak, when the Name is forgotten. ||1||
RECORD	para 23773	mÚ 5 ] (522-10) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 23774	nwnk siqguir ByitAY pUrI hovY jugiq ] (522-10, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naanak satgur bhayti-ai pooree hovai jugat. O Nanak, meeting the True Guru, one comes to know the Perfect Way.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	hsMidAw KylµidAw pYnµidAw KwvMidAw ivcy hovY mukiq ]2] (522-10, gUjrI, mÚ 5) hasandi-aa khaylandi-aa painandi-aa khaavandi-aa vichay hovai mukat. ||2||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	While laughing, playing, dressing and eating, he is liberated. ||2||
RECORD	para 23776	pauVI ] (522-11) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 23777	so siqguru Dnu DMnu ijin Brm gVu qoiVAw ] (522-11, gUjrI, mÚ 5) so satgur Dhan Dhan jin bharam garh torhi-aa. Blessed, blessed is the True Guru, who has demolished the fortress of doubt.
RECORD	para 23778	so siqguru vwhu vwhu ijin hir isau joiVAw ] (522-11, gUjrI, mÚ 5) so satgur vaahu vaahu jin har si-o jorhi-aa. Waaho! Waaho! - Hail! Hail! to the True Guru, who has united me with the Lord.
RECORD	para 23779	nwmu inDwnu AKutu guru dyie dwrUE ] (522-12, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naam niDhaan akhut gur day-ay daroo-o. The Guru has given me the medicine of the inexhaustible treasure of the Naam.
RECORD	para 23780	mhw rogu ibkrwl iqnY ibdwrUE ] (522-12, gUjrI, mÚ 5) mahaa rog bikraal tinai bidaroo-o. He has banished the great and terrible disease.
RECORD	para 23781	pwieAw nwmu inDwnu bhuqu KjwinAw ] (522-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) paa-i-aa naam niDhaan bahut khajaani-aa. I have obtained the great treasure of the wealth of the Naam.
RECORD	para 23782	ijqw jnmu Apwru Awpu pCwinAw ] (522-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jitaa janam apaar aap pachhaani-aa. I have obtained eternal life, recognizing my own self.
RECORD	para 23783	mihmw khI n jwie gur smrQ dyv ] (522-13, gUjrI, mÚ 5) mahimaa kahee na jaa-ay gur samrath dayv. The Glory of the all-powerful Divine Guru cannot be described.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v16	gur pwrbRhm prmysur AprMpr AlK AByv ]16] (522-14, gUjrI, mÚ 5) gur paarbarahm parmaysur aprampar alakh abhayv. ||16||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v16	The Guru is the Supreme Lord God, the Transcendent Lord, infinite, unseen and unknowable. ||16||
RECORD	para 23785	sloku mÚ 5 ] (522-14) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
REQUIRE	para 23786	audmu kryidAw jIau qUM kmwvidAw suK BuMcu ] (522-15, gUjrI, mÚ 5) udam karaydi-aa jee-o tooN kamaavdi-aa sukh bhunch. Make the effort, and you shall live; practicing it, you shall enjoy peace.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	iDAwieidAw qUM pRBU imlu nwnk auqrI icMq ]1] (522-15, gUjrI, mÚ 5) Dhi-aa-idi-aa tooN parabhoo mil naanak utree chint. ||1||
REQUIRE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	Meditating, you shall meet God, O Nanak, and your anxiety shall vanish. ||1||
RECORD	para 23788	mÚ 5 ] (522-16) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
