RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	nwnk nwmu n ivsrau iek GVI kir ikrpw BgvMq ]2] (522-16, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naanak naam na visra-o ik gharhee kar kirpaa bhagvant. ||2||
ALLOW	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	O Nanak, may I never forget the Naam, the Name of the Lord, for even an instant; be merciful to me, Lord God. ||2||
RECORD	para 23791	pauVI ] (522-17) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 23792	qyrw kIqw hoie q kwhy frpIAY ] (522-17, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tayraa keetaa ho-ay ta kaahay darpee-ai. Whatever happens is according to Your Will, so why should I be afraid?
RECORD	para 23793	ijsu imil jpIAY nwau iqsu jIau ArpIAY ] (522-17, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jis mil japee-ai naa-o tis jee-o arpee-ai. Meeting Him, I meditate on the Name - I offer my soul to Him.
DEFINE	para 23794	AwieAY iciq inhwlu swihb bysumwr ] (522-18, gUjrI, mÚ 5) aa-i-ai chit nihaal saahib baysumaar. When the Infinite Lord comes to mind, one is enraptured.
RECORD	para 23795	iqs no pohy kvxu ijsu vil inrMkwr ] (522-18, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tis no pohay kavan jis val nirankaar. Who can touch one who has the Formless Lord on his side?
DEFINE	para 23796	sBu ikCu iqs kY vis n koeI bwhrw ] (522-19, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sabh kichh tis kai vas na ko-ee baahraa. Everything is under His control; no one is beyond Him.
RECORD	para 23797	so Bgqw min vuTw sic smwhrw ] (522-19, gUjrI, mÚ 5) so bhagtaa man vuthaa sach samaaharaa. He, the True Lord, dwells in the minds of His devotees.
DEFINE	para 23798	qyry dws iDAwiein quDu qUM rKx vwilAw ] (522-19, gUjrI, mÚ 5) tayray daas Dhi-aa-in tuDh tooN rakhan vaali-aa. Your slaves meditate on You; You are the Savior, the Protector Lord.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v17	isir sBnw smrQu ndir inhwilAw ]17] (523-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sir sabhnaa samrath nadar nihaali-aa. ||17||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v17	You are the Almighty Overlord of all; You bless us with Your Glance of Grace. ||17||
RECORD	para 23801	slok mÚ 5 ] (523-1) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 23802	kwm k®oD md loB moh dust bwsnw invwir ] (523-1, gUjrI, mÚ 5) kaam kroDh mad lobh moh dusat baasnaa nivaar. Take away my sexual desire, anger, pride, greed, emotional attachment and evil desires.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	rwiK lyhu pRB Awpxy nwnk sd bilhwir ]1] (523-2, gUjrI, mÚ 5) raakh layho parabh aapnay naanak sad balihaar. ||1||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	Protect me, O my God; Nanak is forever a sacrifice to You. ||1||
RECORD	para 23804	mÚ 5 ] (523-2) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 23805	KWidAw KWidAw muhu GTw pYnµidAw sBu AMgu ] (523-3, gUjrI, mÚ 5) khaa Ndi-aa khaaNdi-aa muhu ghathaa painandi-aa sabh ang. By eating and eating, the mouth is worn out; by wearing clothes, the limbs grow weary.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	nwnk iDRgu iqnw dw jIivAw ijn sic n lgo rMgu ]2] (523-3, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naanak Dharig tinaa daa jeevi-aa jin sach na lago rang. ||2||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	O Nanak, cursed are the lives of those who are not attuned to the Love of the True Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 23807	pauVI ] (523-4) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 23808	ijau ijau qyrw hukmu iqvY iqau hovxw ] (523-4, gUjrI, mÚ 5) ji-o ji-o tayraa hukam tivai ti-o hovnaa. As is the Hukam of Your Command, so do things happen.
RECORD	para 23809	jh jh rKih Awip qh jwie KVovxw ] (523-4, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jah jah rakheh aap tah jaa-ay kharhovanaa. Wherever You keep me, there I go and stand.
RECORD	para 23810	nwm qyrY kY rMig durmiq Dovxw ] (523-5, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naam tayrai kai rang durmat Dhovnaa. With the Love of Your Name, I wash away my evil-mindedness.
DEFINE	para 23811	jip jip quDu inrMkwr Brmu Bau Kovxw ] (523-5, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jap jap tuDh nirankaar bharam bha-o khovnaa. By continually meditating on You, O Formless Lord, my doubts and fears are dispelled.
FORBID	para 23812	jo qyrY rMig rqy sy join n jovxw ] (523-5, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jo tayrai rang ratay say jon na jovnaa. Those who are attuned to Your Love, shall not be trapped in reincarnation.
RECORD	para 23813	AMqir bwhir ieku nYx Alovxw ] (523-6, gUjrI, mÚ 5) antar baahar ik nain alovanaa. Inwardly and outwardly, they behold the One Lord with their eyes.
RECORD	para 23814	ijn@I pCwqw hukmu iqn@ kdy n rovxw ] (523-6, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jin Hee pachhaataa hukam tin H kaday na rovnaa. Those who recognize the Lord's Command never weep.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v18	nwau nwnk bKsIs mn mwih provxw ]18] (523-6, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naa-o naanak bakhsees man maahi parovanaa. ||18||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v18	O Nanak, they are blessed with the gift of the Name, woven into the fabric of their minds. ||18||
RECORD	para 23816	slok mÚ 5 ] (523-7) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
REQUIRE	para 23817	jIvidAw n cyiqE muAw rlµdVo Kwk ] (523-7, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jeevdi-aa na chayti-o mu-aa raland-rho khaak. Those who do not remember the Lord while they are alive, shall mix with the dust when they die.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	nwnk dunIAw sMig gudwirAw swkq mUV npwk ]1] (523-8, gUjrI, mÚ 5) naanak dunee-aa sang gudaari-aa saakat moorh napaak. ||1||
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, the foolish and filthy faithless cynic passes his life engrossed in the world. ||1||
RECORD	para 23819	mÚ 5 ] (523-8) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
REQUIRE	para 23820	jIvMidAw hir cyiqAw mrMidAw hir rMig ] (523-8, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jeevandi-aa har chayti-aa marandi-aa har rang. One who remembers the Lord while he is alive, shall be imbued with the Lord's Love when he dies.
RECORD	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	jnmu pdwrQu qwirAw nwnk swDU sMig ]2] (523-9, gUjrI, mÚ 5) janam padaarath taari-aa naanak saaDhoo sang. ||2||
DEFINE	rwgu gUjrI vwr mhlw 5 v2	The precious gift of his life is redeemed, O Nanak, in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy. ||2||
RECORD	para 23822	pauVI ] (523-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 23823	Awid jugwdI Awip rKx vwilAw ] (523-9, gUjrI, mÚ 5) aad jugaadee aap rakhan vaali-aa. From the beginning, and through the ages, You have been our Protector and Preserver.
DEFINE	para 23824	scu nwmu krqwru scu pswirAw ] (523-10, gUjrI, mÚ 5) sach naam kartaar sach pasaari-aa. True is Your Name, O Creator Lord, and True is Your Creation.
DEFINE	para 23825	aUxw khI n hoie Gty Git swirAw ] (523-10, gUjrI, mÚ 5) oonaa kahee na ho-ay ghatay ghat saari-aa. You do not lack anything; You are filling each and every heart.
DEFINE	para 23826	imhrvwn smrQ Awpy hI GwilAw ] (523-10, gUjrI, mÚ 5) miharvaan samrath aapay hee ghaali-aa. You are merciful and all-powerful; You Yourself cause us to serve You.
DEFINE	para 23827	ijn@ min vuTw Awip sy sdw suKwilAw ] (523-11, gUjrI, mÚ 5) jin H man vuthaa aap say sadaa sukhaali-aa. Those whose minds in which You dwell are forever at peace.
