RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	haumY ivic syvw n hoveI qw mnu ibrQw jwie ]1] (560-12, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) ha-umai vich sayvaa na hova-ee taa man birthaa jaa-ay. ||1||
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	In egotism, selfless service cannot be performed, and so the soul goes unfulfilled. ||1||
RECORD	para 25194	hir cyiq mn myry qU gur kw sbdu kmwie ] (560-13, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) har chayt man mayray too gur kaa sabad kamaa-ay. O my mind, think of the Lord, and practice the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
REQUIRE	para 25195	hukmu mMnih qw hir imlY qw ivchu haumY jwie ] rhwau ] (560-13, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) hukam maneh taa har milai taa vichahu ha-umai jaa-ay. rahaa-o. If you submit to the Hukam of the Lord's Command, then you shall meet with the Lord; only then will your ego depart from within. ||Pause||
DEFINE	para 25196	haumY sBu srIru hY haumY Epiq hoie ] (560-14, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) ha-umai sabh sareer hai ha-umai opat ho-ay. Egotism is within all bodies; through egotism, we come to be born.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	haumY vfw gubwru hY haumY ivic buiJ n skY koie ]2] (560-14, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) ha-umai vadaa gubaar hai ha-umai vich bujh na sakai ko-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	Egotism is total darkness; in egotism, no one can understand anything. ||2||
RECORD	para 25198	haumY ivic Bgiq n hoveI hukmu n buiJAw jwie ] (560-15, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) ha-umai vich bhagat na hova-ee hukam na bujhi-aa jaa-ay. In egotism, devotional worship cannot be performed, and the Hukam of the Lord's Command cannot be understood.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v3	haumY ivic jIau bMDu hY nwmu n vsY min Awie ]3] (560-15, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) ha-umai vich jee-o banDh hai naam na vasai man aa-ay. ||3||
DEFINE	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v3	In egotism, the soul is in bondage, and the Naam, the Name of the Lord, does not come to abide in the mind. ||3||
RECORD	para 25200	nwnk sqguir imilAY haumY geI qw scu visAw min Awie ] (560-16, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak satgur mili-ai ha-umai ga-ee taa sach vasi-aa man aa-ay. O Nanak, meeting with the True Guru, egotism is eliminated, and then, the True Lord comes to dwell in the mind||
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v4	scu kmwvY sic rhY scy syiv smwie ]4]9]12] (560-17, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sach kamaavai sach rahai sachay sayv samaa-ay. ||4||
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v4	One starts practicing truth, abides in truth and by serving the True One gets absorbed in Him. ||4||
