RECORD	para 25495	scY sbid imil rhI mueIey ipru rwvy Bwie ipAwry ] (567-16, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sachai sabad mil rahee mu-ee-ay pir raavay bhaa-ay pi-aaray. Let yourself remain merged in the True Word of the Shabad, O mortal bride; savor and enjoy the Love of your Beloved Husband Lord.
