DEFINE	para 26143	sbid rqy vf hMs hY scu nwmu auir Dwir ] (585-12, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sabad ratay vad hans hai sach naam ur Dhaar. The great swans are imbued with the Word of the Shabad; they enshrine the True Name within their hearts.
RECORD	para 26144	scu sMgRhih sd sic rhih scY nwim ipAwir ] (585-12, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sach sangr-hahi sad sach raheh sachai naam pi-aar. They gather Truth, remain always in Truth, and love the True Name.
