RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	nwnk hau iqn kY bilhwrxY jo Anidnu jpih murwir ]1] (585-13, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak ha-o tin kai balihaarnai jo an-din jaapeh muraar. ||1||
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, I am a sacrifice to those who, night and day, meditate on the Lord. ||1||
