DEFINE	para 26156	qU krx kwrx smrQu hY qU krih su QIAw ] (585-17, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) too karan kaaran samrath hai too karahi so thee-aa. You are the all-powerful Cause of causes; what You do, comes to be.
RECORD	para 26157	qU AxmMigAw dwnu dyvxw sBnwhw jIAw ] (585-17, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) too anmangi-aa daan dayvnaa sabhnaahaa jee-aa. You give gifts to all beings, without their asking.
