DEFINE	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	Everyone proclaims, "Waaho! Waaho! Blessed, blessed is the True Guru, who has given the supreme gift of the Name of the Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 26160	sloku mÚ 3 ] (586-1) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 26161	BY ivic sBu Awkwru hY inrBau hir jIau soie ] (586-1, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) bhai vich sabh aakaar hai nirbha-o har jee-o so-ay. The entire universe is in fear; only the Dear Lord is fearless.
RECORD	para 26162	siqguir syivAY hir min vsY iqQY Bau kdy n hoie ] (586-1, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) satgur sayvi-ai har man vasai tithai bha-o kaday na ho-ay. Serving the True Guru, the Lord comes to dwell in the mind, and then, fear cannot stay there.
RECORD	para 26163	dusmnu duKu iqs no nyiV n AwvY poih n skY koie ] (586-2, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) dusman dukh tis no nayrh na aavai pohi na sakai ko-ay. Enemies and pain cannot come close, and no one can touch him.
