RECORD	para 26172	iqsu imlIAY siqgur pRIqmY ijin hMaumY ivchu mwrI ] (586-6, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis milee-ai satgur pareetamai jin ha N-umai vichahu maaree. Meet with that Beloved True Guru, who has subdued ego from within himself.
