RECORD	para 26178	AYQY imlin vifAweIAw drgh moK duAwru ] (586-9, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) aithai milan vadi-aa-ee-aa dargeh mokh du-aar. Doing so, one obtains honor here, and the door of salvation in the Court of the Lord.
