RECORD	para 26180	scI sMgiq sic imlY scY nwie ipAwru ] (586-10, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sachee sangat sach milai sachai naa-ay pi-aar. Associating with Truth, obtain Truth, and love the True Name.
