RECORD	para 26194	so siqguru pUjhu idnsu rwiq ijin jgMnwQu jgdIsu jpwieAw ] (586-16, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) so satgur poojahu dinas raat jin jagannaath jagdees japaa-i-aa. Worship the True Guru day and night; He leads us the meditate on the Lord of the Universe, the Master of the Universe.
