RECORD	para 26196	iqsu siqgur kI sB pgI pvhu ijin moh AMDyru cukwieAw ] (586-18, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis satgur kee sabh pagee pavahu jin moh anDhayr chukaa-i-aa. Let everyone fall at the feet of the True Guru; He has dispelled the darkness of emotional attachment.
