RECORD	para 26201	duiK lgY Gir Gir iPrY AgY dUxI imlY sjwie ] (587-1, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) dukh lagai ghar ghar firai agai doonee milai sajaa-ay. Afflicted with pain, he wanders from house to house, and in the world hereafter, he receives double punishment.
DEFINE	para 26202	AMdir shju n AwieE shjy hI lY Kwie ] (587-1, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) andar sahj na aa-i-o sehjay hee lai khaa-ay. Peace does not come to his heart - he is not content to eat what comes his way.
