RECORD	para 26205	sbid rqy iqnw soJI peI dUjY Brim Bulwie ] (587-3, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sabad ratay tinaa sojhee pa-ee doojai bharam bhulaa-ay. Those who are attuned to the Word of the Shabad, acquire understanding; the others wander, deluded by doubt.
