DEFINE	para 26210	icMqw mUil n hoveI AicMqu vsY min Awie ] (587-5, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) chintaa mool na hova-ee achint vasai man aa-ay. He is not troubled by anxiety, and the carefree Lord comes to dwell in the mind.
