RECORD	para 26214	Gr hI prcw pwieAw joqI joiq imlwie ] (587-7, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) ghar hee parchaa paa-i-aa jotee jot milaa-ay. Within the home of his own being, he finds the Divine Self, and his light blends with the Light.
