RECORD	para 26219	shjy hI hir nwmu lyhu hir qqu n KoeIAY ] (587-9, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sehjay hee har naam layho har tat na kho-ee-ai. In peace and poise, contemplate the Lord's Name - don't lose the essence of the Lord.
