RECORD	para 26221	so pwey pUrw sqgurU ijsu Duir msqik illwit ilKoeIAY ] (587-10, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) so paa-ay pooraa satguroo jis Dhur mastak lilaat likho-ee-ai. He alone finds the Perfect True Guru, on whose forehead such a pre-ordained destiny is written.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v4	iqsu gur kMau siB nmskwru krhu ijin hir kI hir gwl gloeIAY ]4] (587-10, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis gur kaN-u sabh namaskaar karahu jin har kee har gaal galo-ee-ai. ||4||
