RECORD	para 26223	slok mÚ 3 ] (587-11) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 26224	sjx imly sjxw ijn sqgur nwil ipAwru ] (587-11, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sajan milay sajnaa jin satgur naal pi-aar. The friends who love the True Guru, meet with the Lord, the True Friend.
RECORD	para 26225	imil pRIqm iqnI iDAwieAw scY pRyim ipAwru ] (587-12, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) mil pareetam tinee Dhi-aa-i-aa sachai paraym pi-aar. Meeting their Beloved, they meditate on the True Lord with love and affection.
DEFINE	para 26226	mn hI qy mnu mwinAw gur kY sbid Apwir ] (587-12, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) man hee tay man maani-aa gur kai sabad apaar. Their minds are appeased by their own minds, through the incomparable Word of the Guru's Shabad.
RECORD	para 26227	eyih sjx imly n ivCuVih ij Awip myly krqwir ] (587-13, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) ayhi sajan milay na vichhurheh je aap maylay kartaar. These friends are united, and will not be separated again; they have been united by the Creator Lord Himself.
