DEFINE	para 26229	ivCuiVAw kw ikAw ivCuVY ijnw dUjY Bwie ipAwru ] (587-14, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) vichhurhi-aa kaa ki-aa vichhurhai jinaa doojai bhaa-ay pi-aar. The separated ones are in love with duality - what more separation can they suffer?
RECORD	para 26230	mnmuK syqI dosqI QoViVAw idn cwir ] (587-15, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) manmukh saytee dostee thorh-rhi-aa din chaar. Friendship with the self-willed manmukhs lasts for only a few short days.
DEFINE	para 26231	iesu prIqI qutdI ivlmu n hoveI iequ dosqI clin ivkwr ] (587-15, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) is pareetee tutdee vilam na hova-ee it dostee chalan vikaar. This friendship is broken in an instant; this friendship leads to corruption.
RECORD	para 26232	ijnw AMdir scy kw Bau nwhI nwim n krih ipAwru ] (587-16, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) jinaa andar sachay kaa bha-o naahee naam na karahi pi-aar. They do not fear the True Lord within their hearts, and they do not love the Naam.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	nwnk iqn isau ikAw kIcY dosqI ij Awip Bulwey krqwir ]1] (587-16, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak tin si-o ki-aa keechai dostee je aap bhulaa-ay kartaar. ||1||
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, why become friends with those whom the Creator Lord Himself has misled? ||1||
RECORD	para 26234	mÚ 3 ] (587-17) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 26235	ieik sdw iekqY rMig rhih iqn kY hau sd bilhwrY jwau ] (587-17, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) ik sadaa iktai rang raheh tin kai ha-o sad balihaarai jaa-o. Some remain constantly imbued with the Lord's Love; I am forever a sacrifice to them.
RECORD	para 26236	qnu mnu Dnu ArpI iqn kau iniv iniv lwgau pwie ] (587-18, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tan man Dhan arpee tin ka-o niv niv laaga-o paa-ay. I dedicate my mind, soul and wealth to them; bowing low, I fall at their feet.
DEFINE	para 26237	iqn imilAw mnu sMqoKIAY iqRsnw BuK sB jwie ] (587-18, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tin mili-aa man santokhee-ai tarisnaa bhukh sabh jaa-ay. Meeting them, the soul is satisfied, and one's hunger and thirst all depart.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	nwnk nwim rqy suKIey sdw scy isau ilv lwie ]2] (587-19, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak naam ratay sukhee-ay sadaa sachay si-o liv laa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, those who are attuned to the Naam are happy forever; they lovingly focus their minds on the True Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 26239	pauVI ] (587-19) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 26240	iqsu gur kau hau vwirAw ijin hir kI hir kQw suxweI ] (587-19, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis gur ka-o ha-o vaari-aa jin har kee har kathaa sunaa-ee. I am a sacrifice to the Guru, who recites the sermon of the Lord's Teachings.
RECORD	para 26242	iqsu gur kau sd bilhwrxY ijin hir syvw bxq bxweI ] (588-1, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis gur ka-o sad balihaarnai jin har sayvaa banat banaa-ee. I am forever a sacrifice to that Guru, who has led me to serve the Lord.
ALLOW	para 26243	so siqguru ipAwrw myrY nwil hY ijQY ikQY mYno ley CfweI ] (588-2, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) so satgur pi-aaraa mayrai naal hai jithai kithai maino la-ay chhadaa-ee. That Beloved True Guru is always with me; wherever I may be, He will save me.
DEFINE	para 26244	iqsu gur kau swbwis hY ijin hir soJI pweI ] (588-2, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis gur ka-o saabaas hai jin har sojhee paa-ee. Most blessed is that Guru, who imparts understanding of the Lord.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v5	nwnku gur ivthu vwirAw ijin hir nwmu dIAw myry mn kI Aws purweI ]5] (588-3, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak gur vitahu vaari-aa jin har naam dee-aa mayray man kee aas puraa-ee. ||5||
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v5	O Nanak, I am a sacrifice to the Guru, who has given me the Lord's Name, and fulfilled the desires of my mind. ||5||
RECORD	para 26246	slok mÚ 3 ] (588-4) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 26247	iqRsnw dwDI jil mueI jil jil kry pukwr ] (588-4, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tarisnaa daaDhee jal mu-ee jal jal karay pukaar. Consumed by desires, the world is burning and dying; burning and burning, it cries out.
WHEN	para 26248	siqgur sIql jy imlY iPir jlY n dUjI vwr ] (588-4, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) satgur seetal jay milai fir jalai na doojee vaar. But if it meets with the cooling and soothing True Guru, it does not burn any longer.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	nwnk ivxu nwvY inrBau ko nhI ijcru sbid n kry vIcwru ]1] (588-5, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak vin naavai nirbha-o ko nahee jichar sabad na karay veechaar. ||1||
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, without the Name, and without contemplating the Word of the Shabad, no one becomes fearless. ||1||
RECORD	para 26250	mÚ 3 ] (588-5) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 26251	ByKI Agin n buJeI icMqw hY mn mwih ] (588-5, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) bhaykhee agan na bujh-ee chintaa hai man maahi. Wearing ceremonial robes, the fire is not quenched, and the mind is filled with anxiety.
RECORD	para 26252	vrmI mwrI swpu n mrY iqau ingury krm kmwih ] (588-6, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) varmee maaree saap na marai ti-o niguray karam kamaahi. Destroying the snake's hole, the snake is not killed; it is just like doing deeds without a Guru.
RECORD	para 26253	siqguru dwqw syvIAY sbdu vsY min Awie ] (588-6, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) satgur daataa sayvee-ai sabad vasai man aa-ay. Serving the Giver, the True Guru, the Shabad comes to abide in the mind.
DEFINE	para 26254	mnu qnu sIqlu sWiq hoie iqRsnw Agin buJwie ] (588-7, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) man tan seetal saa Nt ho-ay tarisnaa agan bujhaa-ay. The mind and body are cooled and soothed; peace ensues, and the fire of desire is quenched.
DEFINE	para 26255	suKw isir sdw suKu hoie jw ivchu Awpu gvwie ] (588-7, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sukhaa sir sadaa sukh ho-ay jaa vichahu aap gavaa-ay. The supreme comforts and lasting peace are obtained, when one eradicates ego from within.
RECORD	para 26256	gurmuiK audwsI so kry ij sic rhY ilv lwie ] (588-8, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) gurmukh udaasee so karay je sach rahai liv laa-ay. He alone becomes a detached Gurmukh, who lovingly focuses his consciousness on the True Lord.
DEFINE	para 26257	icMqw mUil n hoveI hir nwim rjw AwGwie ] (588-8, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) chintaa mool na hova-ee har naam rajaa aaghaa-ay. Anxiety does not affect him at all; he is satisfied and satiated with the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	nwnk nwm ibnw nh CUtIAY haumY pcih pcwie ]2] (588-9, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak naam binaa nah chhootee-ai ha-umai pacheh pachaa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, without the Naam, no one is saved; they are utterly ruined by egotism. ||2||
RECORD	para 26259	pauVI ] (588-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 26260	ijnI hir hir nwmu iDAwieAw iqnI pwieAVy srb suKw ] (588-10, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) jinee har har naam Dhi-aa-i-aa tinee paa-i-arhay sarab sukhaa. Those who meditate on the Lord, Har, Har, obtain all peace and comforts.
RECORD	para 26261	sBu jnmu iqnw kw sPlu hY ijn hir ky nwm kI min lwgI BuKw ] (588-10, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) sabh janam tinaa kaa safal hai jin har kay naam kee man laagee bhukhaa. Fruitful is the entire life of those, who hunger for the Name of the Lord in their minds.
RECORD	para 26262	ijnI gur kY bcin AwrwiDAw iqn ivsir gey siB duKw ] (588-11, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) jinee gur kai bachan aaraaDhi-aa tin visar ga-ay sabh dukhaa. Those who worship the Lord in adoration, through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, forget all their pains and suffering.
DEFINE	para 26263	qy sMq Bly gurisK hY ijn nwhI icMq prweI cuKw ] (588-11, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tay sant bhalay gursikh hai jin naahee chint paraa-ee chukhaa. Those Gursikhs are good Saints, who care for nothing other than the Lord.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v6	Dnu DMnu iqnw kw gurU hY ijsu AMimRq Pl hir lwgy muKw ]6] (588-12, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) Dhan Dhan tinaa kaa guroo hai jis amrit fal har laagay mukhaa. ||6||
DEFINE	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v6	Blessed, blessed is their Guru, whose mouth tastes the Ambrosial Fruit of the Lord's Name. ||6||
RECORD	para 26265	slok mÚ 3 ] (588-13) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
