RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	nwnk nwmu iDAwieAw suKdwqw duKu ivsirAw shij suBwie ]2] (588-17, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak naam Dhi-aa-i-aa sukh-daata dukh visri-aa sahj subhaa-ay. ||2||
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, meditating on the Naam, the Name of the Peace-Giving Lord, his pains are automatically forgotten. ||2||
RECORD	para 26275	pauVI ] (588-17) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 26276	ijin jgjIvnu aupdyisAw iqsu gur kau hau sdw GumwieAw ] (588-17, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) jin jagjeevan updaysi-aa tis gur ka-o ha-o sadaa ghumaa-i-aa. I am forever a sacrifice to the Guru, who has taught me about the Lord, the Life of the World.
RECORD	para 26277	iqsu gur kau hau KMnIAY ijin mDusUdnu hir nwmu suxwieAw ] (588-18, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis gur ka-o ha-o khannee-ai jin maDhusoodan har naam sunaa-i-aa. I am every bit a sacrifice to the Guru, the Lover of Nectar, who has revealed the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	para 26278	iqsu gur kau hau vwrxY ijin haumY ibKu sBu rogu gvwieAw ] (588-19, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis gur ka-o ha-o vaarnai jin ha-umai bikh sabh rog gavaa-i-aa. I am a sacrifice to the Guru, who has totally cured me of the fatal disease of egotism.
RECORD	para 26279	iqsu siqgur kau vf puMnu hY ijin Avgx kit guxI smJwieAw ] (588-19, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) tis satgur ka-o vad punn hai jin avgan kat gunee samjhaa-i-aa. Glorious and great are the virtues of the Guru, who has eradicated evil, and instructed me in virtue.
RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v7	so siqguru iqn kau ByitAw ijn kY muiK msqik Bwgu iliK pwieAw ]7] (589-1, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) so satgur tin ka-o bhayti-aa jin kai mukh mastak bhaag likh paa-i-aa. ||7||
UPHOLD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v7	The True Guru meets with those upon whose foreheads such blessed destiny is recorded. ||7||
RECORD	para 26282	sloku mÚ 3 ] (589-2) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 26283	Bgiq krih mrjIvVy gurmuiK Bgiq sdw hoie ] (589-2, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) bhagat karahi marjeevrhay gurmukh bhagat sadaa ho-ay. They alone worship the Lord, who remain dead while yet alive; the Gurmukhs worship the Lord continually.
