RECORD	para 26413	hir nwmu hmwrI sMgiq Aiq ipAwrI hir nwmu kulu hir nwmu prvwrw ] (592-6, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) har naam hamaaree sangat at pi-aaree har naam kul har naam parvaaraa. The Lord's Name is my most beloved society, the Lord's Name is my ancestry, and the Lord's Name is my family.
