RECORD	vfhMsu mhlw 3 v2	nwnk gurmuiK iqnI nwmu iDAwieAw ijn kMau Duir pUrib iliKAwis ]2] (593-1, vfhMsu, mÚ 3) naanak gurmukh tinee naam Dhi-aa-i-aa jin ka N-u Dhur poorab likhi-aas. ||2||
