REQUIRE	para 26519	puChu jwie isAwixAw AwgY imlxu iknwh ] (595-4, soriT, mÚ 1) puchhahu jaa-ay si-aani-aa aagai milan kinaah. Go and ask the clever people, whether they shall meet in the world hereafter.
