RECORD	para 26521	BI swlwihhu swcw soie ] (595-5, soriT, mÚ 1) bhee saalaahihu saachaa so-ay. So praise the True Lord,
RECORD	para 26522	jw kI ndir sdw suKu hoie ] rhwau ] (595-5, soriT, mÚ 1) jaa kee nadar sadaa sukh ho-ay. rahaa-o. by whose Grace peace ever prevails. ||Pause||
