DEFINE	para 26524	sBnw dwqw eyku qU mwxs dwiq n hoie ] (595-6, soriT, mÚ 1) sabhnaa daataa ayk too maanas daat na ho-ay. You alone are the Great Giver; mankind cannot give anything.
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 caupdy v2	jo iqsu BwvY so QIAY rMn ik ruMnY hoie ]2] (595-6, soriT, mÚ 1) jo tis bhaavai so thee-ai rann ke runnai ho-ay. ||2||
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 caupdy v2	Whatever pleases Him, comes to pass; what good does it do to cry out in protest? ||2||
RECORD	para 26526	DrqI aupir kot gV kyqI geI vjwie ] (595-7, soriT, mÚ 1) Dhartee upar kot garh kaytee ga-ee vajaa-ay. Many have proclaimed their sovereignty over millions of fortresses on the earth, but they have now departed.
