WHEN	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 caupdy v3	O mind, if you only knew the torment in your future, you would not relish the sweet pleasures of the present. ||3||
DEFINE	para 26529	nwnk Aaugux jyqVy qyqy glI jMjIr ] (595-8, soriT, mÚ 1) naanak a-ogun jayt-rhay taytay galee janjeer. O Nanak, as many as are the sins one commits, so many are the chains around his neck.
