DEFINE	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 caupdy v4	1|| Going to the world hereafter, those who have no Guru are not accepted; they are beaten, and expelled. ||4||1||
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 ] (595-10)
RECORD	para 26532	sorath mehlaa 1 ghar 1. Sorat'h, First Mehl, First House:
