RECORD	para 26534	nwmu bIju sMqoKu suhwgw rKu grIbI vysu ] (595-10, soriT, mÚ 1) naam beej santokh suhaagaa rakh gareebee vays. Let the Lord's Name be the seed, contentment the plow, and your humble dress the fence.
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 v1	Bwau krm kir jMmsI sy Gr BwgT dyKu ]1] (595-11, soriT, mÚ 1) bhaa-o karam kar jammsee say ghar bhaagath daykh. ||1||
REQUIRE	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 v1	Doing deeds of love, the seed shall sprout, and you shall see your home flourish. ||1||
RECORD	para 26536	bwbw mwieAw swiQ n hoie ] (595-11, soriT, mÚ 1) baabaa maa-i-aa saath na ho-ay. O Baba, the wealth of Maya does not go with anyone.
RECORD	para 26537	iein mwieAw jgu moihAw ivrlw bUJY koie ] rhwau ] (595-12, soriT, mÚ 1) in maa-i-aa jag mohi-aa virlaa boojhai ko-ay. rahaa-o. This Maya has bewitched the world, but only a rare few understand this. ||Pause||
RECORD	para 26538	hwxu htu kir Awrjw scu nwmu kir vQu ] (595-12, soriT, mÚ 1) haan hat kar aarjaa sach naam kar vath. Make your ever-decreasing life your shop, and make the Lord's Name your merchandise.
RECORD	para 26539	suriq soc kir BWfswl iqsu ivic iqs no rKu ] (595-13, soriT, mÚ 1) surat soch kar bhaaNdsaal tis vich tis no rakh. Make understanding and contemplation your warehouse, and in that warehouse, store the Lord's Name.
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 v2	vxjwirAw isau vxju kir lY lwhw mn hsu ]2] (595-13, soriT, mÚ 1) vanjaari-aa si-o vanaj kar lai laahaa man has. ||2||
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 v2	Deal with the Lord's dealers, earn your profits, and rejoice in your mind. ||2||
RECORD	para 26541	suix swsq saudwgrI squ GoVy lY clu ] (595-14, soriT, mÚ 1) sun saasat sa-udaagree sat ghorhay lai chal. Let your trade be listening to scripture, and let Truth be the horses you take to sell.
RECORD	para 26542	Krcu bMnu cMigAweIAw mqu mn jwxih klu ] (595-14, soriT, mÚ 1) kharach bann chang-aa-ee-aa mat man jaaneh kal. Gather up merits for your travelling expenses, and do not think of tomorrow in your mind.
