REQUIRE	soriT mhlw 1 Gru 1 v3	When you arrive in the land of the Formless Lord, you shall find peace in the Mansion of His Presence. ||3||
RECORD	para 26544	lwie icqu kir cwkrI mMin nwmu kir kMmu ] (595-15, soriT, mÚ 1) laa-ay chit kar chaakree man naam kar kamm. Let your service be the focusing of your consciousness, and let your occupation be the placing of faith in the Naam.
UPHOLD	para 26546	bMnu bdIAw kir DwvxI qw ko AwKY DMnu ] (596-1, soriT, mÚ 1) bann badee-aa kar Dhaavnee taa ko aakhai Dhan. Let your work be restraint from sin; only then will people call you blessed.
