RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 duquky v1	sgl Bvx kI mUriq eykw muiK qyrY tkswlw ]1] (596-13, soriT, mÚ 1) sagal bhavan kee moorat aykaa mukh tayrai taksaalaa. ||1||
DEFINE	soriT mhlw 1 duquky v1	Yours is the one and only form of the entire universe; Your mouth is the mint to fashion all. ||1||
DEFINE	para 26570	myry swihbw qyry coj ivfwxw ] (596-13, soriT, mÚ 1) mayray saahibaa tayray choj vidaanaa. O my Lord Master, Your play is so wonderful!
RECORD	para 26571	jil Qil mhIAil Birpuir lIxw Awpy srb smwxw ] rhwau ] (596-13, soriT, mÚ 1) jal thal mahee-al bharipur leenaa aapay sarab samaanaa. rahaa-o. You are pervading and permeating the water, the land and the sky; You Yourself are contained in all. ||Pause||
DEFINE	para 26572	jh jh dyKw qh joiq qumwrI qyrw rUpu iknyhw ] (596-14, soriT, mÚ 1) jah jah daykhaa tah jot tumaaree tayraa roop kinayhaa. Wherever I look, there I see Your Light, but what is Your form?
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 duquky v2	iekqu rUip iPrih prCMnw koie n iks hI jyhw ]2] (596-15, soriT, mÚ 1) ikat roop fireh parchhannaa ko-ay na kis hee jayhaa. ||2||
DEFINE	soriT mhlw 1 duquky v2	You have one form, but it is unseen; there is none like any other. ||2||
RECORD	para 26574	AMfj jyrj auqBuj syqj qyry kIqy jMqw ] (596-15, soriT, mÚ 1) andaj jayraj ut-bhuj saytaj tayray keetay jantaa. The beings born of eggs, born of the womb, born of the earth and born of sweat, all are created by You.
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 duquky v3	eyku purbu mY qyrw dyiKAw qU sBnw mwih rvMqw ]3] (596-16, soriT, mÚ 1) ayk purab mai tayraa daykhi-aa too sabhnaa maahi ravantaa. ||3||
DEFINE	soriT mhlw 1 duquky v3	I have seen one glory of Yours, that You are pervading and permeating in all. ||3||
RECORD	para 26576	qyry gux bhuqy mY eyku n jwixAw mY mUrK ikCu dIjY ] (596-16, soriT, mÚ 1) tayray gun bahutay mai ayk na jaani-aa mai moorakh kichh deejai. Your Glories are so numerous, and I do not know even one of them; I am such a fool - please, give me some of them!
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 duquky v4	pRxviq nwnk suix myry swihbw fubdw pQru lIjY ]4]4] (596-17, soriT, mÚ 1) paranvat naanak sun mayray saahibaa dubdaa pathar leejai. ||4||
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 duquky v4	4|| Prays Nanak, listen, O my Lord Master: I am sinking like a stone - please, save me! ||4||4||
RECORD	para 26578	sorath mehlaa 1. Sorat'h, First Mehl:
DEFINE	para 26579	hau pwpI piqqu prm pwKMfI qU inrmlu inrMkwrI ] (596-17, soriT, mÚ 1) ha-o paapee patit param paakhandee too nirmal nirankaaree. I am a wicked sinner and a great hypocrite; You are the Immaculate and Formless Lord.
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 v1	AMimRqu cwiK prm ris rwqy Twkur srix qumwrI ]1] (596-18, soriT, mÚ 1) amrit chaakh param ras raatay thaakur saran tumaaree. ||1||
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 v1	Tasting the Ambrosial Nectar, I am imbued with supreme bliss; O Lord and Master, I seek Your Sanctuary. ||1||
DEFINE	para 26581	krqw qU mY mwxu inmwxy ] (596-19, soriT, mÚ 1) kartaa too mai maan nimaanay. O Creator Lord, You are the honor of the dishonored.
RECORD	para 26582	mwxu mhqu nwmu Dnu plY swcY sbid smwxy ] rhwau ] (596-19, soriT, mÚ 1) maan mahat naam Dhan palai saachai sabad samaanay. rahaa-o. In my lap is the honor and glory of the wealth of the Name; I merge into the True Word of the Shabad. ||Pause||
DEFINE	para 26583	qU pUrw hm aUry hoCy qU gaurw hm haury ] (596-19, soriT, mÚ 1) too pooraa ham ooray hochhay too ga-uraa ham ha-uray. You are perfect, while I am worthless and imperfect. You are profound, while I am trivial.
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 v2	quJ hI mn rwqy Aihinis prBwqy hir rsnw jip mn ry ]2] (597-1, soriT, mÚ 1) tujh hee man raatay ahinis parbhaatay har rasnaa jap man ray. ||2||
DEFINE	soriT mhlw 1 v2	My mind is imbued with You, day and night and morning, O Lord; my tongue chants Your Name, and my mind meditates on You. ||2||
