DEFINE	para 26591	AlK Apwr AgMm Agocr nw iqsu kwlu n krmw ] (597-4, soriT, mÚ 1) alakh apaar agamm agochar naa tis kaal na karmaa. He is unknowable, infinite, unapproachable and imperceptible. He is not subject to death or karma.
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 v1	jwiq Ajwiq AjonI sMBau nw iqsu Bwau n Brmw ]1] (597-5, soriT, mÚ 1) jaat ajaat ajonee sambha-o naa tis bhaa-o na bharmaa. ||1||
DEFINE	soriT mhlw 1 v1	His caste is casteless; He is unborn, self-illumined, and free of doubt and desire. ||1||
RECORD	para 26593	swcy sicAwr ivthu kurbwxu ] (597-5, soriT, mÚ 1) saachay sachiaar vitahu kurbaan. I am a sacrifice to the Truest of the True.
