DEFINE	para 26604	ijau mInw ibnu pwxIAY iqau swkqu mrY ipAws ] (597-11, soriT, mÚ 1) ji-o meenaa bin paanee-ai ti-o saakat marai pi-aas. Like a fish without water is the faithless cynic, who dies of thirst.
