DEFINE	para 26608	sMq jnw imlu sMgqI gurmuiK qIrQu hoie ] (597-13, soriT, mÚ 1) sant janaa mil sangtee gurmukh tirath ho-ay. For the Gurmukh, meeting with the Society of the Saints is like making a pilgrimage to a sacred shrine.
