RECORD	para 26610	ijau jogI jq bwhrw qpu nwhI squ sMqoKu ] (597-14, soriT, mÚ 1) ji-o jogee jat baahraa tap naahee sat santokh. Like the Yogi without abstinence, and like penance without truth and contentment,
RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 v3	iqau nwmY ibnu dyhurI jmu mwrY AMqir doKu ]3] (597-14, soriT, mÚ 1) ti-o naamai bin dayhuree jam maarai antar dokh. ||3||
DEFINE	soriT mhlw 1 v3	so is the body without the Lord's Name; death will slay it, because of the sin within. ||3||
