RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 v1	Cofhu vysu ByK cqurweI duibDw iehu Plu nwhI jIau ]1] (598-4, soriT, mÚ 1) chhodahu vays bhaykh chaturaa-ee dubiDhaa ih fal naahee jee-o. ||1||
DEFINE	soriT mhlw 1 v1	Renounce costumes, disguises and clever tricks; this fruit is not obtained by duplicity. ||1||
