RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 pMcpdy v1	That Gurmukh who joins himself to the Guru's service, saves his own home, and tastes the Lord's Nectar. ||1||
REQUIRE	para 26640	mn ry smJu kvn miq lwgw ] (598-12, soriT, mÚ 1) man ray samajh kavan mat laagaa. O mind, you must realize what your intellect is focused on.
