RECORD	soriT mhlw 1 pMcpdy v3	mwieAw moihq ijin iehu rsu KoieAw jw swkq durmiq lwgw ]3] (598-14, soriT, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa mohit jin ih ras kho-i-aa jaa saakat durmat laagaa. ||3||
