RECORD	soriT mhlw 3 v3	ibstw ky kIVy ibstw mwih smwxy mnmuK mugD gubwrw ]3] (601-7, soriT, mÚ 3) bistaa kay keerhay bistaa maahi samaanay manmukh mugaDh gubaaraa. ||3||
DEFINE	soriT mhlw 3 v3	The blind, idiotic, self-willed manmukhs are like maggots in manure, and in manure they rot away. ||3||
