DEFINE	soriT mhlw 3 v1	You are the Giver of virtue, realized through the Word of Your Shabad. Uttering Your Glories, we merge with You, O Glorious Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 26750	mn myry hir jIau sdw smwil ] (601-11, soriT, mÚ 3) man mayray har jee-o sadaa samaal. O my mind, remember always the Dear Lord.
