ALLOW	soriT mhlw 5 Gru 2 AstpdIAw v3	but this will not cause the filth of his mind to depart, even though he may make thousands of efforts. ||3||
ALLOW	para 28416	kink kwimnI hYvr gYvr bhu ibiD dwnu dwqwrw ] (642-2, soriT, mÚ 5) kanik kaaminee haivar gaivar baho biDh daan daataaraa. He may give gifts of all sorts - gold, women, horses and elephants.
RECORD	soriT mhlw 5 Gru 2 AstpdIAw v4	AMn bsqR BUim bhu Arpy nh imlIAY hir duAwrw ]4] (642-3, soriT, mÚ 5) ann bastar bhoom baho arpay nah milee-ai har du-aaraa. ||4||
