RECORD	soriT mhlw 5 Gru 2 AstpdIAw v5	hau hau krq bMDn mih pirAw nh imlIAY ieh jugqw ]5] (642-4, soriT, mÚ 5) ha-o ha-o karat banDhan meh pari-aa nah milee-ai ih jugtaa. ||5||
RECORD	soriT mhlw 5 Gru 2 AstpdIAw v5	He indulges in egotism and pride, and falls into entanglements, but he does not meet the Lord by these devices. ||5||
