RECORD	para 28894	Esu Arlu brlu muhhu inklY inq JgU sutdw muAw ] (653-5, soriT, mÚ 4) os aral baral muhhu niklai nit jhagoo sutdaa mu-aa. He babbles incoherently, and foaming at the mouth, he dies.
