DEFINE	para 28896	ijQY Ehu jwie iqQY Ehu JUTw kUVu boly iksY n BwvY ] (653-6, soriT, mÚ 4) jithai oh jaa-ay tithai oh jhoothaa koorh bolay kisai na bhaavai. Wherever he goes, he is a liar, and by telling lies, he not liked by anyone.
RECORD	para 28897	vyKhu BweI vifAweI hir sMqhu suAwmI Apuny kI jYsw koeI krY qYsw koeI pwvY ] (653-7, soriT, mÚ 4) vaykhhu bhaa-ee vadi-aa-ee har santahu su-aamee apunay kee jaisaa ko-ee karai taisaa ko-ee paavai. O Siblings of Destiny, behold this, the glorious greatness of our Lord and Master, O Saints; as one behaves, so does he receive.
RECORD	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v2	eyhu bRhm bIcwru hovY dir swcY Ago dy jnu nwnku AwiK suxwvY ]2] (653-7, soriT, mÚ 4) ayhu barahm beechaar hovai dar saachai ago day jan naanak aakh sunaavai. ||2||
REQUIRE	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v2	This shall be God's determination in His True Court; servant Nanak predicts and proclaims this. ||2||
RECORD	para 28899	pauVI ] (653-8) pa-orhee. Pauree:
