DEFINE	para 28901	pUrn hoeI Aws gur crxI mn rqy ] (653-9, soriT, mÚ 4) pooran ho-ee aas gur charnee man ratay. My hopes are fulfilled, and my mind is imbued with the love of the Guru's Feet.
DEFINE	para 28902	guir ik®pwil byAMiq Avgux siB hqy ] (653-9, soriT, mÚ 4) gur kirpaal bay-ant avgun sabh hatay. The Guru is infinitely merciful; He has erased all my sins.
