DEFINE	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v27	Nanak is forever a sacrifice to the Guru, who has countless virtues. ||27||
RECORD	para 28905	slok mÚ 1 ] (653-11) salok mehlaa 1. Shalok, First Mehl:
RECORD	para 28906	qw kI rjwie lyiKAw pwie Ab ikAw kIjY pWfy ] (653-11, soriT, mÚ 1) taa kee rajaa-ay laykhi-aa paa-ay ab ki-aa keejai paa Nday. By His Command, we receive our pre-ordained rewards; so what can we do now, O Pandit?
