DEFINE	para 28909	nik nQ Ksm hQ ikrqu Dky dy ] (653-12, soriT, mÚ 2) nak nath khasam hath kirat Dhakay day. The string through the nose is in the hands of the Lord Master; one's own actions drive him on.
