RECORD	para 28913	Awpy rcnu rcwie Awpy hI GwilEnu ] (653-13, soriT, mÚ 2) aapay rachan rachaa-ay aapay hee ghaali-on. He Himself created the creation, and He Himself destroys it.
RECORD	para 28914	Awpy jMq aupwie Awip pRiqpwilEnu ] (653-14, soriT, mÚ 2) aapay jant upaa-ay aap partipaali-on. He Himself fashions His creatures, and He Himself nourishes them.
RECORD	para 28915	dws rKy kMiT lwie ndir inhwilEnu ] (653-14, soriT, mÚ 2) daas rakhay kanth laa-ay nadar nihaali-on. He hugs His slaves close in His embrace, and blesses them with His Glance of Grace.
RECORD	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v28	nwnk Bgqw sdw Anµdu Bwau dUjw jwilEnu ]28] (653-15, soriT, mÚ 2) naanak bhagtaa sadaa anand bhaa-o doojaa jaali-on. ||28||
DEFINE	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v28	O Nanak, His devotees are forever in bliss; they have burnt away the love of duality. ||28||
RECORD	para 28917	sloku mÚ 3 ] (653-15) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 28918	ey mn hir jI iDAwie qU iek min iek iciq Bwie ] (653-15, soriT, mÚ 3) ay man har jee Dhi-aa-ay too ik man ik chit bhaa-ay. O mind, meditate on the Dear Lord, with single-minded conscious concentration.
REQUIRE	para 28919	hir kIAw sdw sdw vifAweIAw dyie n pCoqwie ] (653-16, soriT, mÚ 3) har kee-aa sadaa sadaa vadi-aa-ee-aa day-ay na pachhotaa-ay. The glorious greatness of the Lord shall last forever and ever; He never regrets what He gives.
DEFINE	para 28920	hau hir kY sd bilhwrxY ijqu syivAY suKu pwie ] (653-16, soriT, mÚ 3) ha-o har kai sad balihaarnai jit sayvi-ai sukh paa-ay. I am forever a sacrifice to the Lord; serving Him, peace is obtained.
RECORD	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v1	nwnk gurmuiK imil rhY haumY sbid jlwie ]1] (653-17, soriT, mÚ 3) naanak gurmukh mil rahai ha-umai sabad jalaa-ay. ||1||
RECORD	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v1	O Nanak, the Gurmukh remains merged with the Lord; he burns away his ego through the Word of the Shabad. ||1||
RECORD	para 28922	mÚ 3 ] (653-17) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 28923	Awpy syvw lwieAnu Awpy bKs kryie ] (653-18, soriT, mÚ 3) aapay sayvaa laa-i-an aapay bakhas karay-i. He Himself enjoins us to serve Him, and He Himself blesses us with forgiveness.
DEFINE	para 28924	sBnw kw mw ipau Awip hY Awpy swr kryie ] (653-18, soriT, mÚ 3) sabhnaa kaa maa pi-o aap hai aapay saar karay-i. He Himself is the father and mother of all; He Himself cares for us.
RECORD	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v2	nwnk nwmu iDAwiein iqn inj Gir vwsu hY jugu jugu soBw hoie ]2] (653-18, soriT, mÚ 3) naanak naam Dhi-aa-in tin nij ghar vaas hai jug jug sobhaa ho-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v2	O Nanak, those who meditate on the Naam, the Name of the Lord, abide in the home of their inner being; they are honored throughout the ages. ||2||
RECORD	para 28926	pauVI ] (653-19) pa-orhee. Pauree:
