RECORD	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v3	byd pVy piV pMifq mUey rUpu dyiK dyiK nwrI ]3] (654-8, soriT, Bgq kbIr jI) bayd parhay parh pandit moo-ay roop daykh daykh naaree. ||3||
RECORD	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v3	The Pandits die, reading and reciting the Vedas; women die, gazing at their own beauty. ||3||
