RECORD	rwgu soriT vwr mhly 4 kI v3	rwg rwgnI ifMB hoie bYTw auin hir pih ikAw lInw ]3] (654-19, soriT, Bgq kbIr jI) raag raagnee dinbh ho-ay baithaa un har peh ki-aa leenaa. ||3||
