RECORD	para 31024	pauVI ] (706-2) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 31025	hir eyku inrMjnu gweIAY sB AMqir soeI ] (706-2, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) har ayk niranjan gaa-ee-ai sabh antar so-ee. Sing the Praise of the One, the Immaculate Lord; He is contained within all.
RECORD	para 31026	krx kwrx smrQ pRBu jo kry su hoeI ] (706-2, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) karan kaaran samrath parabh jo karay so ho-ee. The Cause of causes, the Almighty Lord God; whatever He wills, comes to pass.
DEFINE	para 31027	iKn mih Qwip auQwpdw iqsu ibnu nhI koeI ] (706-3, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) khin meh thaap uthaapadaa tis bin nahee ko-ee. In an instant, He establishes and disestablishes; without Him, there is no other.
RECORD	para 31028	KMf bRhmMf pwqwl dIp rivAw sB loeI ] (706-3, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) khand barahmand paataal deep ravi-aa sabh lo-ee. He pervades the continents, solar systems, nether worlds, islands and all worlds.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	ijsu Awip buJwey so buJsI inrml jnu soeI ]1] (706-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jis aap bujhaa-ay so bujhsee nirmal jan so-ee. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	He alone understands, whom the Lord Himself instructs; he alone is a pure and unstained being. ||1||
RECORD	para 31030	slok ] (706-4) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31031	rcMiq jIA rcnw mwq grB AsQwpnµ ] (706-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) rachant jee-a rachnaa maat garabh asthaapna N. Creating the soul, the Lord places this creation in the womb of the mother.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	swis swis ismrMiq nwnk mhw Agin n ibnwsnµ ]1] (706-5, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) saas saas simrant naanak mahaa agan na binaasna N. ||1||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	With each and every breath, it meditates in remembrance on the Lord, O Nanak; it is not consumed by the great fire. ||1||
RECORD	para 31033	muKu qlY pYr aupry vsMdo kuhQVY Qwie ] (706-5, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) mukh talai pair upray vasando kuhtharhai thaa-ay. With its head down, and feet up, it dwells in that slimy place.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nwnk so DxI ikau ivswirE auDrih ijs dY nwie ]2] (706-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak so Dhanee ki-o visaar-i-o uDhrahi jis dai naa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, how could we forget the Master? Through His Name, we are saved. ||2||
RECORD	para 31035	pauVI ] (706-6) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31036	rkqu ibMdu kir inMimAw Agin audr mJwir ] (706-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) rakat bind kar nimmi-aa agan udar majhaar. From egg and sperm, you were conceived, and placed in the fire of the womb.
RECORD	para 31037	aurD muKu kucIl ibklu nrik Goir gubwir ] (706-7, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) uraDh mukh kucheel bikal narak ghor gubaar. Head downwards, you abided restlessly in that dark, dismal, terrible hell.
RECORD	para 31038	hir ismrq qU nw jlih min qin aur Dwir ] (706-7, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) har simrat too naa jaleh man tan ur Dhaar. Remembering the Lord in meditation, you were not burnt; enshrine Him in your heart, mind and body.
RECORD	para 31039	ibKm Qwnhu ijin riKAw iqsu iqlu n ivswir ] (706-8, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bikham thaanahu jin rakhi-aa tis til na visaar. In that treacherous place, He protected and preserved you; do not forget Him, even for an instant.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	pRB ibsrq suKu kdy nwih jwsih jnmu hwir ]2] (706-8, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) parabh bisrat sukh kaday naahi jaaseh janam haar. ||2||
REQUIRE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	Forgetting God, you shall never find peace; you shall forfeit your life, and depart. ||2||
RECORD	para 31041	slok ] (706-9) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31042	mn ieCw dwn krxM srbqR Awsw pUrnh ] (706-9, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) man ichhaa daan karnaN sarbatar aasaa poornah. He grants our hearts' desires, and fulfills all our hopes.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	KMfxM kil klysh pRB ismir nwnk nh dUrxh ]1] (706-9, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) khaNdnaN kal kalayseh parabh simar naanak nah poornah. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	He destroys pain and suffering; remember God in meditation, O Nanak - He is not far away. ||1||
RECORD	para 31044	hiB rMg mwxih ijsu sMig qY isau lweIAY nyhu ] (706-10, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) habh rang maaneh jis sang tai si-o laa-ee-ai nayhu. Love Him, with whom you enjoy all pleasures.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	so shu ibMd n ivsrau nwnk ijin suMdru ricAw dyhu ]2] (706-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) so saho bind na visra-o naanak jin sundar rachi-aa dayh. ||2||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	Do not forget that Lord, even for an instant; O Nanak, He fashioned this beautiful body. ||2||
RECORD	para 31046	pauVI ] (706-11) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31047	jIau pRwn qnu Dnu dIAw dIny rs Bog ] (706-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jee-o paraan tan Dhan dee-aa deenay ras bhog. He gave you your soul, breath of life, body and wealth; He gave you pleasures to enjoy.
RECORD	para 31048	igRh mMdr rQ Asu dIey ric Bly sMjog ] (706-12, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) garih mandar rath as dee-ay rach bhalay sanjog. He gave you households, mansions, chariots and horses; He ordained your good destiny.
DEFINE	para 31049	suq binqw swjn syvk dIey pRB dyvn jog ] (706-12, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) sut banitaa saajan sayvak dee-ay parabh dayvan jog. He gave you your children, spouse, friends and servants; God is the all-powerful Great Giver.
DEFINE	para 31050	hir ismrq qnu mnu hirAw lih jwih ivjog ] (706-13, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) har simrat tan man hari-aa leh jaahi vijog. Meditating in remembrance on the Lord, the body and mind are rejuvenated, and sorrow departs.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v3	swDsMig hir gux rmhu ibnsy siB rog ]3] (706-13, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) saaDhsang har gun ramhu binsay sabh rog. ||3||
REQUIRE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v3	In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, chant the Praises of the Lord, and all your sickness shall vanish. ||3||
RECORD	para 31052	slok ] (706-14) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31053	kutMb jqn krxM mwieAw Anyk audmh ] (706-14, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) kutamb jatan karnaN maa-i-aa anayk udmah. For his family, he works very hard; for the sake of Maya, he makes countless efforts.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	hir Bgiq Bwv hIxM nwnk pRB ibsrq qy pRyqqh ]1] (706-14, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) har bhagat bhaav heenaN naanak parabh bisrat tay paraytah. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	But without loving devotional worship of the Lord, O Nanak, he forgets God, and then, he is a mere ghost. ||1||
REQUIRE	para 31055	qutVIAw sw pRIiq jo lweI ibAMn isau ] (706-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) tutrhee-aa saa pareet jo laa-ee bi-ann si-o. That love shall break, which is established with any other than the Lord.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nwnk scI rIiq sWeI syqI riqAw ]2] (706-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak sachee reet saaN-ee saytee rati-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, that way of life is true, which inspires love of the Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 31057	pauVI ] (706-16) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31058	ijsu ibsrq qnu Bsm hoie khqy siB pRyqu ] (706-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jis bisrat tan bhasam ho-ay kahtay sabh parayt. Forgetting Him, one's body turns to dust, and everyone calls him a ghost.
RECORD	para 31059	iKnu igRh mih bsn n dyvhI ijn isau soeI hyqu ] (706-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) khin garih meh basan na dayvhee jin si-o so-ee hayt. And those, with whom he was so much in love - they do not let him stay in their home, even for an instant.
RECORD	para 31060	kir AnrQ drbu sMicAw so kwrij kyqu ] (706-17, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) kar anrath darab sanchi-aa so kaaraj kayt. Practicing exploitation, he gathers wealth, but what use will it be in the end?
DEFINE	para 31061	jYsw bIjY so luxY krm iehu Kyqu ] (706-17, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jaisaa beejai so lunai karam ih khayt. As one plants, so does he harvest; the body is the field of actions.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v4	AikrqGxw hir ivsirAw jonI Brmyqu ]4] (706-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) akirat-ghanaa har visri-aa jonee bharmayt. ||4||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v4	The ungrateful wretches forget the Lord, and wander in reincarnation. ||4||
RECORD	para 31063	slok ] (706-18) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31064	koit dwn iesnwnµ Aink soDn pivqRqh ] (706-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) kot daan isnaana N anik soDhan pavitartah. The benefits of millions of charitable donations and cleansing baths, and countless ceremonies of purification and piety,
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	aucrMiq nwnk hir hir rsnw srb pwp ibmucqy ]1] (706-19, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) uchrant naanak har har rasnaa sarab paap bimuchtay. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	O Nanak, are obtained by chanting the Name of the Lord, Har, Har with one's tongue; all sins are washed away. ||1||
RECORD	para 31066	eIDxu kIqomU Gxw BorI idqImu Bwih ] (706-19, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) eeDhan keetomoo ghanaa bhoree diteem bhaahi. I gathered together a great stack of firewood, and applied a tiny flame to light it.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	min vsMdVo scu shu nwnk hBy fuKVy aulwih ]2] (707-1, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) man vasand-rho sach saho naanak habhay dukh-rhay ulaahi. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	When the True Lord and Master abides in one's mind, O Nanak, all sins are dispelled. ||2||
RECORD	para 31069	pauVI ] (707-1) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 31070	koit AGw siB nws hoih ismrq hir nwau ] (707-1, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) kot aghaa sabh naas hohi simrat har naa-o. Millions of sins are totally erased, by meditating on the Lord's Name.
DEFINE	para 31071	mn icMdy Pl pweIAih hir ky gux gwau ] (707-2, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) man chinday fal paa-ee-ah har kay gun gaa-o. The fruits of one's heart's desires are obtained, by singing the Glorious Praises of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 31072	jnm mrx BY ktIAih inhcl scu Qwau ] (707-2, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) janam maran bhai katee-ah nihchal sach thaa-o. The fear of birth and death is eradicated, and one's eternal, unchanging true home is obtained.
DEFINE	para 31073	pUrib hovY iliKAw hir crx smwau ] (707-3, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) poorab hovai likhi-aa har charan samaa-o. If it is so pre-ordained, one is absorbed in the Lord's lotus feet.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v5	kir ikrpw pRB rwiK lyhu nwnk bil jwau ]5] (707-3, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) kar kirpaa parabh raakh layho naanak bal jaa-o. ||5||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v5	Bless me with Your mercy, God - please preserve and save me! Nanak is a sacrifice to You. ||5||
RECORD	para 31075	slok ] (707-4) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 31076	igRh rcnw ApwrM min iblws suAwdM rsh ] (707-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) garih rachnaa apaara N man bilaas su-aada N rasah. They are involved in their beautiful houses, and the pleasures of the mind's desires.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	kdWc nh ismrMiq nwnk qy jMq ibstw ik®mh ]1] (707-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) kadaa Nch nah simrant naanak tay jant bistaa kirmeh. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	They never remember the Lord in meditation; O Nanak, they are like maggots in manure. ||1||
DEFINE	para 31078	mucu AfMbru hBu ikhu mMiJ muhbiq nyh ] (707-5, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) much adambar habh kihu manjh muhabat nayh. They are engrossed in ostentatious displays, lovingly attached to all their possessions.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	so sWeI jYN ivsrY nwnk so qnu Kyh ]2] (707-5, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) so saaN-ee jaiN visrai naanak so tan khayh. ||2||
REQUIRE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	That body which forgets the Lord, O Nanak, shall be reduced to ashes. ||2||
RECORD	para 31080	pauVI ] (707-6) pa-orhee. Pauree:
ALLOW	para 31081	suMdr syj Anyk suK rs Bogx pUry ] (707-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) sundar sayj anayk sukh ras bhogan pooray. He may enjoy a beautiful bed, countless pleasures and all sorts of enjoyments.
ALLOW	para 31082	igRh soien cMdn sugMD lwie moqI hIry ] (707-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) garih so-in chandan suganDh laa-ay motee heeray. He may possess mansions of gold, studded with pearls and rubies, plastered with fragrant sandalwood oil.
ALLOW	para 31083	mn ieCy suK mwxdw ikCu nwih ivsUry ] (707-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) man ichhay sukh maandaa kichh naahi visooray. He may relish in the pleasures of his mind's desires, and have no anxiety at all.
DEFINE	para 31084	so pRBu iciq n AwveI ivstw ky kIry ] (707-7, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) so parabh chit na aavee vistaa kay keeray. But if he does not remember God, he is like a maggot in manure.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v6	ibnu hir nwm n sWiq hoie ikqu ibiD mnu DIry ]6] (707-7, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bin har naam na saa Nt ho-ay kit biDh man Dheeray. ||6||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v6	Without the Lord's Name, there is no peace at all. How can the mind be comforted? ||6||
RECORD	para 31086	slok ] (707-8) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31087	crn kml ibrhM KojMq bYrwgI dh idsh ] (707-8, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) charan kamal biraha N khojant bairaagee dah disah. One who loves the Lord's lotus feet searches for Him in the ten directions.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	iqAwgMq kpt rUp mwieAw nwnk Awnµd rUp swD sMgmh ]1] (707-8, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) ti-aagant kapat roop maa-i-aa naanak aanand roop saaDh sangmah. ||1||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	He renounces the deceptive illusion of Maya, and joins the blissful form of the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy. ||1||
DEFINE	para 31089	min sWeI muiK aucrw vqw hBy loA ] (707-9, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) man saa N-ee mukh uchraa vataa habhay lo-a. The Lord is in my mind, and with my mouth I chant His Name; I seek Him in all the lands of the world.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nwnk hiB AfMbr kUiVAw suix jIvw scI soie ]2] (707-10, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak habh adambar koorhi-aa sun jeevaa sachee so-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, all ostentatious displays are false; hearing the Praises of the True Lord, I live. ||2||
RECORD	para 31091	pauVI ] (707-10) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31092	bsqw qUtI JuMpVI cIr siB iCMnw ] (707-10, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bastaa tootee jhumprhee cheer sabh chhinnaa. He dwells in a broken-down shack, in tattered clothes,
RECORD	para 31093	jwiq n piq n Awdro auidAwn BRimMnw ] (707-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jaat na pat na aadro udi-aan bharminnaa. with no social status, no honor and no respect; he wanders in the wilderness,
RECORD	para 31094	imqR n ieT Dn rUphIx ikCu swku n isMnw ] (707-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) mitar na ith Dhan roopheen kichh saak na sinnaa. with no friend or lover, without wealth, beauty, relatives or relations.
DEFINE	para 31095	rwjw sglI isRsit kw hir nwim mnu iBMnw ] (707-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) raajaa saglee sarisat kaa har naam man bhinnaa. Even so, he is the king of the whole world, if his mind is imbued with the Lord's Name.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v7	iqs kI DUiV mnu auDrY pRBu hoie supRsMnw ]7] (707-12, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) tis kee Dhoorh man uDhrai parabh ho-ay suparsannaa. ||7||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v7	With the dust of his feet, men are redeemed, because God is very pleased with him. ||7||
RECORD	para 31097	slok ] (707-12) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31098	Aink lIlw rwj rs rUpM CqR cmr qKq Awsnµ ] (707-13, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) anik leelaa raaj ras roopa N chhatar chamar takhat aasna N. The various sorts of pleasures, powers, joys, beauty, canopies, cooling fans and thrones to sit on
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	rcMiq mUV AigAwn AMDh nwnk supn mnorQ mwieAw ]1] (707-13, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) rachant moorh agi-aan anDhah naanak supan manorath maa-i-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	- the foolish, ignorant and blind are engrossed in these things. O Nanak, desire for Maya is just a dream. ||1||
RECORD	para 31100	supnY hiB rMg mwixAw imTw lgVw mohu ] (707-14, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) supnai habh rang maani-aa mithaa lagrhaa moh. In a dream, he enjoys all sorts of pleasures, and emotional attachment seems so sweet.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nwnk nwm ivhUxIAw suMdir mwieAw DRohu ]2] (707-14, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak naam vihoonee-aa sundar maa-i-aa Dharoh. ||2||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, without the Naam, the Name of the Lord, the beauty of Maya's illusion is fake. ||2||
RECORD	para 31102	pauVI ] (707-15) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31103	supny syqI icqu mUriK lwieAw ] (707-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) supnay saytee chit moorakh laa-i-aa. The fool attaches his consciousness to the dream.
DEFINE	para 31104	ibsry rwj rs Bog jwgq BKlwieAw ] (707-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bisray raaj ras bhog jaagat bhakhlaa-i-aa. When he awakes, he forgets the power, pleasures and enjoyments, and he is sad.
RECORD	para 31105	Awrjw geI ivhwie DMDY DwieAw ] (707-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) aarjaa ga-ee vihaa-ay DhanDhai Dhaa-i-aa. He passes his life chasing after worldly affairs.
DEFINE	para 31106	pUrn Bey n kwm moihAw mwieAw ] (707-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) pooran bha-ay na kaam mohi-aa maa-i-aa. His works are not completed, because he is enticed by Maya.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v8	ikAw vycwrw jMqu jw Awip BulwieAw ]8] (707-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) ki-aa vaychaaraa jant jaa aap bhulaa-i-aa. ||8||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v8	What can the poor helpless creature do? The Lord Himself has deluded him. ||8||
RECORD	para 31108	slok ] (707-17) salok. Shalok:
ALLOW	para 31109	bsMiq sÍrg lokh ijqqy ipRQvI nv KMfxh ] (707-17, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) basant savarag lokah jittay parithvee nav khandnah. They may live in heavenly realms, and conquer the nine regions of the world,
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	ibsrMq hir gopwlh nwnk qy pRwxI auidAwn Brmxh ]1] (707-17, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bisrant har gopaalah naanak tay paraanee udi-aan bharamneh. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	but if they forget the Lord of the world, O Nanak, they are just wanderers in the wilderness. ||1||
RECORD	para 31111	kauqk kof qmwisAw iciq n Awvsu nwau ] (707-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) ka-utak kod tamaasi-aa chit na aavas naa-o. In the midst of millions of games and entertainments, the Lord's Name does not come to their minds.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nwnk koVI nrk brwbry aujVu soeI Qwau ]2] (707-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak korhee narak baraabaray ujarh so-ee thaa-o. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, their home is like a wilderness, in the depths of hell. ||2||
RECORD	para 31113	pauVI ] (707-19) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31114	mhw BieAwn auidAwn ngr kir mwinAw ] (707-19, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) mahaa bha-i-aan udi-aan nagar kar maani-aa. He sees the terrible, awful wilderness as a city.
RECORD	para 31115	JUT smgRI pyiK scu kir jwinAw ] (707-19, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jhooth samagree paykh sach kar jaani-aa. Gazing upon the false objects, he believes them to be real.
RECORD	para 31117	kwm k®oiD AhMkwir iPrih dyvwinAw ] (708-1, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) kaam kroDh aha Nkaar fireh dayvaani-aa. Engrossed in sexual desire, anger and egotism, he wanders around insane.
WHEN	para 31118	isir lgw jm fMfu qw pCuqwinAw ] (708-1, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) sir lagaa jam dand taa pachhutaani-aa. When the Messenger of Death hits him on the head with his club, then he regrets and repents.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v9	ibnu pUry gurdyv iPrY sYqwinAw ]9] (708-2, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bin pooray gurdayv firai saitaani-aa. ||9||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v9	Without the Perfect, Divine Guru, he roams around like Satan. ||9||
RECORD	para 31120	slok ] (708-2) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 31121	rwj kptM rUp kptM Dn kptM kul grbqh ] (708-2, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) raaj kapta N roop kapta N Dhan kapta N kul garabteh. Power is fraudulent, beauty is fraudulent, and wealth is fraudulent, as is pride of ancestry.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	sMcMiq ibiKAw ClM iCdRM nwnk ibnu hir sMig n cwlqy ]1] (708-3, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) saNchant bikhi-aa chhala N chhidaraN naanak bin har sang na chaaltay. ||1||
REQUIRE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	One may gather poison through deception and fraud, O Nanak, but without the Lord, nothing shall go along with him in the end. ||1||
DEFINE	para 31123	pyKMdVo kI Bulu quMmw idsmu sohxw ] (708-3, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) paykhand-rho kee bhul tummaa disam sohnaa. Beholding the bitter melon, he is deceived, since it appears so pretty
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	AFu n lhMdVo mulu nwnk swiQ n juleI mwieAw ]2] (708-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) adh na lahand-rho mul naanak saath na jul-ee maa-i-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	But it is not worth even a shell, O Nanak; the riches of Maya will not go along with anyone. ||2||
RECORD	para 31125	pauVI ] (708-4) pa-orhee. Pauree:
FORBID	para 31126	clidAw nwil n clY so ikau sMjIAY ] (708-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) chaldi-aa naal na chalai so ki-o sanjee-ai. It shall not go along with you when you depart - why do you bother to collect it?
REQUIRE	para 31127	iqs kw khu ikAw jqnu ijs qy vMjIAY ] (708-5, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) tis kaa kaho ki-aa jatan jis tay vanjee-ai. Tell me, why do you try so hard to acquire that which you must leave behind in the end?
RECORD	para 31128	hir ibsirAY ikau iqRpqwvY nw mnu rMjIAY ] (708-5, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) har bisri-ai ki-o tariptaavai naa man ranjee-ai. Forgetting the Lord, how can you be satisfied? Your mind cannot be pleased.
REQUIRE	para 31129	pRBU Coif An lwgY nrik smMjIAY ] (708-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) parabhoo chhod an laagai narak samanjee-ai. One who forsakes God, and attaches himself to another, shall be immersed in hell.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v10	hohu ik®pwl dieAwl nwnk Bau BMjIAY ]10] (708-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) hohu kirpaal da-i-aal naanak bha-o bhanjee-ai. ||10||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v10	Be kind and compassionate to Nanak, O Lord, and dispel his fear. ||10||
RECORD	para 31131	slok ] (708-7) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31132	nc rwj suK imstM nc Bog rs imstM nc imstM suK mwieAw ] (708-7, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) nach raaj sukh mista N nach bhog ras mista N nach mista N sukh maa-i-aa. Princely pleasures are not sweet; sensual enjoyments are not sweet; the pleasures of Maya are not sweet.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	imstM swDsMig hir nwnk dws imstM pRB drsnµ ]1] (708-7, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) mistaN saaDhsang har naanak daas mistaN parabh darsanaN. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	The Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, is sweet, O slave Nanak; the Blessed Vision of God's Darshan is sweet. ||1||
RECORD	para 31134	lgVw so nyhu mMn mJwhU riqAw ] (708-8, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) lagrhaa so nayhu man majhaahoo rati-aa. I have enshrined that love which drenches my soul.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	ivDVo sc Qoik nwnk imTVw so DxI ]2] (708-8, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) viDh-rho sach thok naanak mith-rhaa so Dhanee. ||2||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	I have been pierced by the Truth, O Nanak; the Master seems so sweet to me. ||2||
RECORD	para 31136	pauVI ] (708-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31137	hir ibnu kCU n lwgeI Bgqn kau mITw ] (708-9, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) har bin kachhoo na laag-ee bhagtan ka-o meethaa. Nothing seems sweet to His devotees, except the Lord.
DEFINE	para 31138	Awn suAwd siB PIikAw kir inrnau fITw ] (708-9, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) aan su-aad sabh feeki-aa kar nirna-o deethaa. All other tastes are bland and insipid; I have tested them and seen them.
DEFINE	para 31139	AigAwnu Brmu duKu kitAw gur Bey bsITw ] (708-10, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) agi-aan bharam dukh kati-aa gur bha-ay baseethaa. Ignorance, doubt and suffering are dispelled, when the Guru becomes one's advocate.
RECORD	para 31140	crn kml mnu byiDAw ijau rMgu mjITw ] (708-10, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) charan kamal man bayDhi-aa ji-o rang majeethaa. The Lord's lotus feet have pierced my mind, and I am dyed in the deep crimson color of His Love.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v11	jIau pRwx qnu mnu pRBU ibnsy siB JUTw ]11] (708-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jee-o paraan tan man parabhoo binsay sabh jhoothaa. ||11||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v11	My soul, breath of life, body and mind belong to God; all falsehood has left me. ||11||
RECORD	para 31142	slok ] (708-11) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31143	iqAkq jlµ nh jIv mInµ nh iqAwig cwiqRk myG mMflh ] (708-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) ti-akat jala N nah jeev meena N nah ti-aag chaatrik maygh mandlah. Leaving the water, the fish cannot live; the rainbird cannot live without the raindrops from the clouds.
RECORD	para 31144	bwx byDMc kurMk nwdM Ail bMDn kusm bwsnh ] (708-12, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) baan bayDhanch kurank naadaN al banDhan kusam baasnah. The deer is enticed by the sound of the hunter's bell, and shot through with the arrow; the bumble bee is entangled in the fragrance of the flowers.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	crn kml rcMiq sMqh nwnk Awn n rucqy ]1] (708-12, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) charan kamal rachant santeh naanak aan na ruchtay. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	The Saints are entranced by the Lord's lotus feet; O Nanak, they desire nothing else. ||1||
WHEN	para 31146	muKu fyKwaU plk Cif Awn n fyaU icqu ] (708-13, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) mukh daykhaa-oo palak chhad aan na day-oo chit. Show me Your face, for even an instant, Lord, and I will not give my consciousness to any other.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	jIvx sMgmu iqsu DxI hir nwnk sMqW imqu ]2] (708-13, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jeevan sangam tis Dhanee har naanak jantaaN mit. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	My life is with the Lord Master, O Nanak, the Friend of the Saints. ||2||
RECORD	para 31148	pauVI ] (708-14) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31149	ijau mCulI ibnu pwxIAY ikau jIvxu pwvY ] (708-14, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) ji-o machhulee bin paanee-ai ki-o jeevan paavai. How can the fish live without water?
RECORD	para 31150	bUMd ivhUxw cwiqRko ikau kir iqRpqwvY ] (708-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) boond vihoonaa chaatriko ki-o kar tariptaavai. Without the raindrops, how can the rainbird be satisfied?
RECORD	para 31151	nwd kurMkih byiDAw snmuK auiT DwvY ] (708-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naad kura Nkeh bayDhi-aa sanmukh uth Dhaavai. The deer, entranced by the sound of the hunter's bell, runs straight to him;
DEFINE	para 31152	Bvru loBI kusm bwsu kw imil Awpu bMDwvY ] (708-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bhavar lobhee kusam baas kaa mil aap banDhaavai. the bumble bee is greedy for the flower's fragrance; finding it, he traps himself in it.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v12	iqau sMq jnw hir pRIiq hY dyiK drsu AGwvY ]12] (708-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) ti-o sant janaa har pareet hai daykh daras aghaavai. ||12||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v12	Just so, the humble Saints love the Lord; beholding the Blessed Vision of His Darshan, they are satisfied and satiated. ||12||
RECORD	para 31154	slok ] (708-16) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31155	icqvMiq crn kmlµ swis swis ArwDnh ] (708-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) chitvant charan kamla N saas saas araaDhneh. They contemplate the Lord's lotus feet; they worship and adore Him with each and every breath.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	nh ibsrMiq nwm Acuq nwnk Aws pUrn prmysurh ]1] (708-17, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) nah bisrant naam achut naanak aas pooran parmaysureh. ||1||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	They do not forget the Name of the imperishable Lord; O Nanak, the Transcendent Lord fulfills their hopes. ||1||
DEFINE	para 31157	sIqVw mMn mMJwih plk n QIvY bwhrw ] (708-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) seet-rhaa man manjhaahi palak na theevai baahraa. He is woven into the fabric of my mind; He is not outside of it, even for an instant.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nwnk AwsVI inbwih sdw pyKMdo scu DxI ]2] (708-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak aasrhee nibaahi sadaa paykhando sach Dhanee. ||2||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, the True Lord and Master fulfills my hopes, and always watches over me. ||2||
RECORD	para 31159	pauVI ] (708-18) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31160	AwswvMqI Aws gusweI pUrIAY ] (708-19, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) aasaavantee aas gusaa-ee pooree-ai. My hopes rest in You, O Lord of the universe; please, fulfill them.
REQUIRE	para 31161	imil gopwl goibMd n kbhU JUrIAY ] (708-19, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) mil gopaal gobind na kabhoo jhooree-ai. Meeting with the Lord of the world, the Lord of the universe, I shall never grieve.
REQUIRE	para 31162	dyhu drsu min cwau lih jwih ivsUrIAY ] (708-19, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) dayh daras man chaa-o leh jaahi visooree-ai. Grant me the Blessed Vision of Your Darshan, the desire of my mind, and my worries shall be over.
DEFINE	para 31164	hoie pivqR srIru crnw DUrIAY ] (709-1, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) ho-ay pavitar sareer charnaa Dhooree-ai. By body is sanctified, by the dust of Your feet.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v13	pwrbRhm gurdyv sdw hjUrIAY ]13] (709-1, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) paarbarahm gurdayv sadaa hajooree-ai. ||13||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v13	O Supreme Lord God, Divine Guru, You are always with me, ever-present. ||13||
RECORD	para 31166	slok ] (709-1) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31167	rsnw aucrMiq nwmM sRvxM sunµiq sbd AMimRqh ] (709-2, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) rasnaa uchrant naama N sarvanaN sunant sabad amritah. With my tongue, I chant the Lord's Name; with my ears, I listen to the Ambrosial Word of His Shabad.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	nwnk iqn sd bilhwrM ijnw iDAwnu pwrbRhmxh ]1] (709-2, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak tin sad balihaara N jinaa Dhi-aan paarbrahmaneh. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	Nanak is forever a sacrifice to those who meditate on the Supreme Lord God. ||1||
DEFINE	para 31169	hiB kUVwvy kMm ieksu sweI bwhry ] (709-3, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) habh koorhaavay kamm ikas saa-ee baahray. All concerns are false, except those of the One Lord.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nwnk syeI DMnu ijnw iprhVI sc isau ]2] (709-3, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak say-ee Dhan jinaa pirharhee sach si-o. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, blessed are those, who are in love with their True Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 31171	pauVI ] (709-4) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31172	sd bilhwrI iqnw ij sunqy hir kQw ] (709-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) sad balihaaree tinaa je suntay har kathaa. I am forever a sacrifice to those who listen to the sermon of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 31173	pUry qy prDwn invwvih pRB mQw ] (709-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) pooray tay parDhaan nivaaveh parabh mathaa. Those who bow their heads before God are perfect and distinguished.
DEFINE	para 31174	hir jsu ilKih byAMq sohih sy hQw ] (709-4, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) har jas likheh bay-ant soheh say hathaa. Those hands, which write the Praises of the infinite Lord are beautiful.
DEFINE	para 31175	crn punIq pivqR cwlih pRB pQw ] (709-5, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) charan puneet pavitar chaaleh parabh pathaa. Those feet which walk on God's Path are pure and holy.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v14	sMqW sMig auDwru sglw duKu lQw ]14] (709-5, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) jantaaN sang uDhaar saglaa dukh lathaa. ||14||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v14	In the Society of the Saints, they are emancipated; all their sorrows depart. ||14||
RECORD	para 31177	sloku ] (709-6) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 31178	BwvI audoq krxM hir rmxM sMjog pUrnh ] (709-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bhaavee udot karnaN har ramnaN sanjog poornah. One's destiny is activated, when one chants the Lord's Name, through perfect good fortune.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	gopwl drs BytM sPl nwnk so mhUrqh ]1] (709-6, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) gopaal daras bhayta N safal naanak so mahoorteh. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	Fruitful is that moment, O Nanak, when one obtains the Blessed Vision of the Darshan of the Lord of the Universe. ||1||
RECORD	para 31180	kIm n skw pwie suK imqI hU bwhry ] (709-7, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) keem na sakaa paa-ay sukh mitee hoo baahray. Its value cannot be estimated; it brings peace beyond measure.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nwnk sw vylVI prvwxu ijqu imlµdVo mw iprI ]2] (709-7, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) naanak saa vaylrhee parvaan jit miland-rho maa piree. ||2||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	O Nanak, that time alone is approved, when my Beloved meets with me. ||2||
RECORD	para 31182	pauVI ] (709-8) pa-orhee. Pauree:
REQUIRE	para 31183	sw vylw khu kauxu hY ijqu pRB kau pweI ] (709-8, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) saa vaylaa kaho ka-un hai jit parabh ka-o paa-ee. Tell me, what is that time, when I shall find God?
REQUIRE	para 31184	so mUrqu Blw sMjogu hY ijqu imlY gusweI ] (709-8, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) so moorat bhalaa sanjog hai jit milai gusaa-ee. Blessed and auspicious is that moment, and that destiny, when I shall find the Lord of the Universe.
DEFINE	para 31185	AwT phr hir iDAwie kY mn ieC pujweI ] (709-9, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) aath pahar har Dhi-aa-ay kai man ichh pujaa-ee. Meditating on the Lord, twenty-four hours a day, my mind's desires are fulfilled.
RECORD	para 31186	vfY Bwig sqsMgu hoie iniv lwgw pweI ] (709-9, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) vadai bhaag satsang ho-ay niv laagaa paa-ee. By great good fortune, I have found the Society of the Saints; I bow and touch their feet.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v15	min drsn kI ipAws hY nwnk bil jweI ]15] (709-10, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) man darsan kee pi-aas hai naanak bal jaa-ee. ||15||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v15	My mind thirsts for the Blessed Vision of the Lord's Darshan; Nanak is a sacrifice to Him. ||15||
RECORD	para 31188	slok ] (709-10) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 31189	piqq punIq goibMdh srb doK invwrxh ] (709-10, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) patit puneet gobindah sarab dokh nivaarneh. The Lord of the Universe is the Purifier of sinners; He is the Dispeller of all distress.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	srix sUr Bgvwnh jpMiq nwnk hir hir hry ]1] (709-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) saran soor bhagvaaneh japant naanak har har haray. ||1||
DEFINE	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	The Lord God is Mighty, giving His Protective Sanctuary; Nanak chants the Name of the Lord, Har, Har. ||1||
RECORD	para 31191	CifE hBu Awpu lgVo crxw pwis ] (709-11, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) chhadi-o habh aap lagrho charnaa paas. Renouncing all self-conceit, I hold tight to the Lord's Feet.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	nTVo duK qwpu nwnk pRBu pyKMidAw ]2] (709-12, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) nath-rho dukh taap naanak parabh paykhandi-aa. ||2||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	My sorrows and troubles have departed, O Nanak, beholding God. ||2||
RECORD	para 31193	pauVI ] (709-12) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 31194	myil lYhu dieAwl Fih pey duAwirAw ] (709-12, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) mayl laihu da-i-aal dheh pa-ay du-aari-aa. Unite with me, O Merciful Lord; I have fallen at Your Door.
RECORD	para 31195	riK lyvhu dIn dieAwl BRmq bhu hwirAw ] (709-13, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) rakh layvhu deen da-i-aal bharmat baho haari-aa. O Merciful to the meek, save me. I have wandered enough; now I am tired.
DEFINE	para 31196	Bgiq vClu qyrw ibrdu hir piqq auDwirAw ] (709-13, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) bhagat vachhal tayraa birad har patit uDhaari-aa. It is Your very nature to love Your devotees, and save sinners.
DEFINE	para 31197	quJ ibnu nwhI koie ibnau moih swirAw ] (709-14, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) tujh bin naahee ko-ay bin-o mohi saari-aa. Without You, there is no other at all; I offer this prayer to You.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v16	kru gih lyhu dieAwl swgr sMswirAw ]16] (709-14, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) kar geh layho da-i-aal saagar sansaari-aa. ||16||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v16	Take me by the hand, O Merciful Lord, and carry me across the world-ocean. ||16||
RECORD	para 31199	slok ] (709-15) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31200	sMq auDrx dieAwlµ AwsrM gopwl kIrqnh ] (709-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) sant uDhran da-i-aalaN aasraN gopaal keeratneh. The Merciful Lord is the Savior of the Saints; their only support is to sing the Kirtan of the Lord's Praises.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	inrmlµ sMq sMgyx Et nwnk prmysurh ]1] (709-15, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) nirmala N sant sangayn ot naanak parmaysureh. ||1||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v1	One becomes immaculate and pure, by associating with the Saints, O Nanak, and taking the Protection of the Transcendent Lord. ||1||
DEFINE	para 31202	cMdn cMdu n srd ruiq mUil n imteI GWm ] (709-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) chandan chand na sarad rut mool na mit-ee ghaaNm. The burning of the heart is not dispelled at all, by sandalwood paste, the moon, or the cold season.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	sIqlu QIvY nwnkw jpMdVo hir nwmu ]2] (709-16, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) seetal theevai naankaa japand-rho har naam. ||2||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v2	It only becomes cool, O Nanak, by chanting the Name of the Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 31204	pauVI ] (709-17) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 31205	crn kml kI Et auDry sgl jn ] (709-17, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) charan kamal kee ot uDhray sagal jan. Through the Protection and Support of the Lord's lotus feet, all beings are saved.
RECORD	para 31206	suix prqwpu goivMd inrBau Bey mn ] (709-17, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) sun partaap govind nirbha-o bha-ay man. Hearing of the Glory of the Lord of the Universe, the mind becomes fearless.
DEFINE	para 31207	qoit n AwvY mUil sMicAw nwmu Dn ] (709-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) tot na aavai mool sanchi-aa naam Dhan. Nothing at all is lacking, when one gathers the wealth of the Naam.
DEFINE	para 31208	sMq jnw isau sMgu pweIAY vfY pun ] (709-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) sant janaa si-o sang paa-ee-ai vadai pun. The Society of the Saints is obtained, by very good deeds.
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v17	AwT phr hir iDAwie hir jsu inq sun ]17] (709-18, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) aath pahar har Dhi-aa-ay har jas nit sun. ||17||
RECORD	jYqsrI mhlw 5 vwr slokw nwil v17	Twenty-four hours a day, meditate on the Lord, and listen continually to the Lord's Praises. ||17||
RECORD	para 31210	slok ] (709-19) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 31211	dieAw krxM duK hrxM aucrxM nwm kIrqnh ] (709-19, jYqsrI, mÚ 5) da-i-aa karnaN dukh harnaN ucharnaN naam keeratneh. The Lord grants His Grace, and dispels the pains of those who sing the Kirtan of the Praises of His Name.
