DEFINE	para 32896	krqw iciq n AwveI iPir iPir lgih duK jIau ] (751-8, sUhI, mÚ 1) kartaa chit na aavee fir fir lageh dukh jee-o. But he does not think of the Creator Lord, and so he is overtaken by pain, again and again.
