RECORD	sUhI mhlw 1 Gru 9 v4	But one, within whose mind the Giver of pleasure and pain dwells - how can his body feel any need? ||4||
DEFINE	para 32898	bwkI vwlw qlbIAY isir mwry jMdwru jIau ] (751-9, sUhI, mÚ 1) baakee vaalaa talbee-ai sir maaray jandaar jee-o. One who has a karmic debt to pay off is summoned, and the Messenger of Death smashes his head.
