RECORD	sUhI mhlw 1 Gru 9 v5	scy kI ilv aubrY bKsy bKsxhwru jIau ]5] (751-10, sUhI, mÚ 1) sachay kee liv ubrai bakhsay bakhsanhaar jee-o. ||5||
