DEFINE	para 32964	dyhI Bsm rulwie n jwpI kh gieAw ] (753-1, sUhI, mÚ 1) dayhee bhasam rulaa-ay na jaapee kah ga-i-aa. When the body rolls in the dust, it is not known where the soul has gone.
