RECORD	para 32974	kaufI bdlY jnmu gvwieAw cInis nwhI AwpY ] (753-7, sUhI, mÚ 3) ka-udee badlai janam gavaa-i-aa cheenas naahee aapai. He wastes this human life in exchange for a mere shell; he does not understand his own self.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v1	gurmuiK hovY qw eyko jwxY haumY duKu n sMqwpY ]1] (753-7, sUhI, mÚ 3) gurmukh hovai taa ayko jaanai ha-umai dukh na santaapai. ||1||
