RECORD	para 32996	gur kI swKI shjy cwKI iqRsnw Agin buJwey ] (753-18, sUhI, mÚ 3) gur kee saakhee sehjay chaakhee tarisnaa agan bujhaa-ay. I have intuitively tasted the Guru's Teachings, and the fire of my desire has been quenched.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v6	gur kY sbid rwqw shjy mwqw shjy rihAw smwey ]6] (753-19, sUhI, mÚ 3) gur kai sabad raataa sehjay maataa sehjay rahi-aa samaa-ay. ||6||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v6	Attuned to the Word of the Guru's Shabad, one is naturally intoxicated, merging imperceptibly into the Lord. ||6||
DEFINE	para 32999	hir kw nwmu siq kir jwxY gur kY Bwie ipAwry ] (754-1, sUhI, mÚ 3) har kaa naam sat kar jaanai gur kai bhaa-ay pi-aaray. The Name of the Lord is known as True, through the Love of the Beloved Guru.
