DEFINE	para 33001	eyko scw sB mih vrqY ivrlw ko vIcwry ] (754-2, sUhI, mÚ 3) ayko sachaa sabh meh vartai virlaa ko veechaaray. The One True Lord is permeating and pervading among all; how rare is the one who contemplates this.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v7	Awpy myil ley qw bKsy scI Bgiq svwry ]7] (754-2, sUhI, mÚ 3) aapay mayl la-ay taa bakhsay sachee bhagat savaaray. ||7||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 1 AstpdIAw v7	The Lord Himself unites us in Union, and forgives us; He embellishes us with true devotional worship. ||7||
DEFINE	para 33003	sBo scu scu scu vrqY gurmuiK koeI jwxY ] (754-3, sUhI, mÚ 3) sabho sach sach sach vartai gurmukh ko-ee jaanai. All is Truth; Truth, and Truth alone is pervading; how rare is the Gurmukh who knows this.
RECORD	para 33004	jMmx mrxw hukmo vrqY gurmuiK Awpu pCwxY ] (754-3, sUhI, mÚ 3) jaman marnaa hukmo vartai gurmukh aap pachhaanai. Birth and death occur by the Hukam of His Command; the Gurmukh understands his own self.
