DEFINE	sUhI mhlw 3 v2	The body-bride is eternally beautiful; the Gurmukh contemplates the Naam. ||2||
DEFINE	para 33016	kwieAw AMdir Awpy vsY AlKu n liKAw jweI ] (754-9, sUhI, mÚ 3) kaa-i-aa andar aapay vasai alakh na lakhi-aa jaa-ee. The Lord Himself dwells within the body; He is invisible and cannot be seen.
RECORD	para 33017	mnmuKu mugDu bUJY nwhI bwhir Bwlix jweI ] (754-10, sUhI, mÚ 3) manmukh mugaDh boojhai naahee baahar bhaalan jaa-ee. The foolish self-willed manmukh does not understand; he goes out searching for the Lord externally.
