DEFINE	para 33043	gurmuiK jnmu skwrQw scY sbid lgMin ] (755-4, sUhI, mÚ 3) gurmukh janam sakaarthaa sachai sabad lagann. The lives of the Gurmukhs are fruitful and blessed; they are committed to the True Word of the Shabad.
