DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v3	Their souls are illuminated by the Lord, and they dwell in peace and pleasure. ||3||
DEFINE	para 33045	gur kw sbdu ivswirAw dUjY Bwie rcMin ] (755-5, sUhI, mÚ 3) gur kaa sabad visaari-aa doojai bhaa-ay rachann. Those who forget the Word of the Guru's Shabad are engrossed in the love of duality.
