RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v4	Their hunger and thirst never leave them, and night and day, they wander around burning. ||4||
RECORD	para 33047	dustw nwil dosqI nwil sMqw vYru krMin ] (755-6, sUhI, mÚ 3) dustaa naal dostee naal santaa vair karann. Those who make friendships with the wicked, and harbor animosity to the Saints,
