REQUIRE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v5	shall drown with their families, and their entire lineage shall be obliterated. ||5||
DEFINE	para 33049	inMdw BlI iksY kI nwhI mnmuK mugD krMin ] (755-7, sUhI, mÚ 3) nindaa bhalee kisai kee naahee manmukh mugaDh karann. It is not good to slander anyone, but the foolish, self-willed manmukhs still do it.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v6	muh kwly iqn inMdkw nrky Goir pvMin ]6] (755-7, sUhI, mÚ 3) muh kaalay tin nindkaa narkay ghor pavann. ||6||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v6	The faces of the slanderers turn black, and they fall into the most horrible hell. ||6||
DEFINE	para 33051	ey mn jYsw syvih qYsw hovih qyhy krm kmwie ] (755-8, sUhI, mÚ 3) ay man jaisaa sayveh taisaa hoveh tayhay karam kamaa-ay. O mind, as you serve, so do you become, and so are the deeds that you do.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v7	Awip bIij Awpy hI Kwvxw khxw ikCU n jwie ]7] (755-8, sUhI, mÚ 3) aap beej aapay hee khaavnaa kahnaa kichhoo na jaa-ay. ||7||
REQUIRE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v7	Whatever you yourself plant, that is what you shall have to eat; nothing else can be said about this. ||7||
RECORD	para 33053	mhw purKw kw bolxw hovY ikqY prQwie ] (755-9, sUhI, mÚ 3) mahaa purkhaa kaa bolnaa hovai kitai parthaa-ay. The speech of the great spiritual beings has a higher purpose.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v8	Eie AMimRq Bry BrpUr hih Enw iqlu n qmwie ]8] (755-9, sUhI, mÚ 3) o-ay amrit bharay bharpoor heh onaa til na tamaa-ay. ||8||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v8	They are filled to over-flowing with Ambrosial Nectar, and they have absolutely no greed at all. ||8||
RECORD	para 33055	guxkwrI gux sMGrY Avrw aupdysyin ] (755-10, sUhI, mÚ 3) gunkaaree gun sanghrai avraa updaysayn. The virtuous accumulate virtue, and teach others.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v9	sy vfBwgI ij Enw imil rhy Anidnu nwmu leyin ]9] (755-10, sUhI, mÚ 3) say vadbhaagee je onaa mil rahay an-din naam la-ayn. ||9||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v9	Those who meet with them are so very fortunate; night and day, they chant the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||9||
RECORD	para 33057	dysI irjku sMbwih ijin aupweI mydnI ] (755-11, sUhI, mÚ 3) daysee rijak sambaahi jin upaa-ee maydnee. He who created the Universe, gives sustenance to it.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v10	eyko hY dwqwru scw Awip DxI ]10] (755-11, sUhI, mÚ 3) ayko hai daataar sachaa aap Dhanee. ||10||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v10	The One Lord alone is the Great Giver. He Himself is the True Master. ||10||
DEFINE	para 33059	so scu qyrY nwil hY gurmuiK ndir inhwil ] (755-12, sUhI, mÚ 3) so sach tayrai naal hai gurmukh nadar nihaal. That True Lord is always with you; the Gurmukh is blessed with His Glance of Grace.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v11	Awpy bKsy myil ley so pRBu sdw smwil ]11] (755-12, sUhI, mÚ 3) aapay bakhsay mayl la-ay so parabh sadaa samaal. ||11||
REQUIRE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v11	He Himself shall forgive you, and merge you into Himself; forever cherish and contemplate God. ||11||
DEFINE	para 33061	mnu mYlw scu inrmlw ikau kir imilAw jwie ] (755-13, sUhI, mÚ 3) man mailaa sach nirmalaa ki-o kar mili-aa jaa-ay. The mind is impure; only the True Lord is pure. So how can it merge into Him?
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v12	pRBu myly qw imil rhY haumY sbid jlwie ]12] (755-13, sUhI, mÚ 3) parabh maylay taa mil rahai ha-umai sabad jalaa-ay. ||12||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v12	God merges it into Himself, and then it remains merged; through the Word of His Shabad, the ego is burnt away. ||12||
DEFINE	para 33063	so shu scw vIsrY iDRgu jIvxu sMswir ] (755-14, sUhI, mÚ 3) so saho sachaa veesrai Dharig jeevan sansaar. Cursed is the life in this world, of one who forgets her True Husband Lord.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v13	ndir kry nw vIsrY gurmqI vIcwir ]13] (755-14, sUhI, mÚ 3) nadar karay naa veesrai gurmatee veechaar. ||13||
WHEN	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v13	The Lord grants His Mercy, and she does not forget Him, if she contemplates the Guru's Teachings. ||13||
RECORD	para 33065	siqguru myly qw imil rhw swcu rKw aur Dwir ] (755-15, sUhI, mÚ 3) satgur maylay taa mil rahaa saach rakhaa ur Dhaar. The True Guru unites her, and so she remains united with Him, with the True Lord enshrined within her heart.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v14	imilAw hoie n vICuVY gur kY hyiq ipAwir ]14] (755-15, sUhI, mÚ 3) mili-aa ho-ay na veechhurhai gur kai hayt pi-aar. ||14||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v14	And so united, she will not be separated again; she remains in the love and affection of the Guru. ||14||
RECORD	para 33067	ipru swlwhI Awpxw gur kY sbid vIcwir ] (755-16, sUhI, mÚ 3) pir saalaahee aapnaa gur kai sabad veechaar. I praise my Husband Lord, contemplating the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v15	imil pRIqm suKu pwieAw soBwvMqI nwir ]15] (755-16, sUhI, mÚ 3) mil pareetam sukh paa-i-aa sobhaavantee naar. ||15||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v15	Meeting with my Beloved, I have found peace; I am His most beautiful and happy soul-bride. ||15||
DEFINE	para 33069	mnmuK mnu n iBjeI Aiq mYly iciq kTor ] (755-17, sUhI, mÚ 3) manmukh man na bhij-ee at mailay chit kathor. The mind of the self-willed manmukh is not softened; his consciousness is totally polluted and stone-hearted.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v16	spY duDu pIAweIAY AMdir ivsu inkor ]16] (755-17, sUhI, mÚ 3) sapai duDh pee-aa-ee-ai andar vis nikor. ||16||
REQUIRE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v16	Even if the venomous snake is fed on milk, it shall still be filled with poison. ||16||
DEFINE	para 33071	Awip kry iksu AwKIAY Awpy bKsxhwru ] (755-18, sUhI, mÚ 3) aap karay kis aakhee-ai aapay bakhsanhaar. He Himself does - who else should I ask? He Himself is the Forgiving Lord.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v17	gur sbdI mYlu auqrY qw scu bixAw sIgwru ]17] (755-18, sUhI, mÚ 3) gur sabdee mail utrai taa sach bani-aa seegaar. ||17||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v17	Through the Guru's Teachings, filth is washed away, and then, one is embellished with the ornament of Truth. ||17||
DEFINE	para 33074	scw swhu scy vxjwry EQY kUVy n itkMin ] (756-1, sUhI, mÚ 3) sachaa saahu sachay vanjaaray othai koorhay na tikann. True is the Banker, and True are His traders. The false ones cannot remain there.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v18	Enw scu n BwveI duK hI mwih pcMin ]18] (756-1, sUhI, mÚ 3) onaa sach na bhaav-ee dukh hee maahi pachann. ||18||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v18	They do not love the Truth - they are consumed by their pain. ||18||
DEFINE	para 33076	haumY mYlw jgu iPrY mir jMmY vwro vwr ] (756-2, sUhI, mÚ 3) ha-umai mailaa jag firai mar jammai vaaro vaar. The world wanders around in the filth of egotism; it dies, and is re-born, over and again.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v19	pieAY ikriq kmwvxw koie n mytxhwr ]19] (756-2, sUhI, mÚ 3) pa-i-ai kirat kamaavanaa ko-ay na maytanhaar. ||19||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v19	He acts in accordance with the karma of his past actions, which no one can erase. ||19||
WHEN	para 33078	sMqw sMgiq imil rhY qw sic lgY ipAwru ] (756-2, sUhI, mÚ 3) santaa sangat mil rahai taa sach lagai pi-aar. But if he joins the Society of the Saints, then he comes to embrace love for the Truth.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v20	scu slwhI scu min dir scY sicAwru ]20] (756-3, sUhI, mÚ 3) sach salaahee sach man dar sachai sachiaar. ||20||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v20	Praising the True Lord with a truthful mind, he becomes true in the Court of the True Lord. ||20||
DEFINE	para 33080	gur pUry pUrI miq hY Aihinis nwmu iDAwie ] (756-3, sUhI, mÚ 3) gur pooray pooree mat hai ahinis naam Dhi-aa-ay. The Teachings of the Perfect Guru are perfect; meditate on the Naam, the Name of the Lord, day and night.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v21	haumY myrw vf rogu hY ivchu Twik rhwie ]21] (756-4, sUhI, mÚ 3) ha-umai mayraa vad rog hai vichahu thaak rahaa-ay. ||21||
