RECORD	para 33082	guru swlwhI Awpxw iniv iniv lwgw pwie ] (756-4, sUhI, mÚ 3) gur saalaahee aapnaa niv niv laagaa paa-ay. I praise my Guru; bowing down to Him again and again, I fall at His Feet.
