RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v22	I place my body and mind in offering unto Him, eradicating self-conceit from within. ||22||
RECORD	para 33084	iKMcoqwix ivgucIAY eyksu isau ilv lwie ] (756-6, sUhI, mÚ 3) khinchotaan viguchee-ai aykas si-o liv laa-ay. Indecision leads to ruin; focus your attention on the One Lord.
