DEFINE	para 33088	sy BweI sy sjxw jo scw syvMin ] (756-7, sUhI, mÚ 3) say bhaa-ee say sajnaa jo sachaa sayvann. They are my Siblings of Destiny, and they are my friends, who serve the True Lord.
