RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v26	scu vxMjih gur sbd isau lwhw nwmu leyin ]26] (756-9, sUhI, mÚ 3) sach vana Njahi gur sabad si-o laahaa naam la-ayn. ||26||
