DEFINE	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v27	Nothing will go with you in the end, except the Name; all are plundered by the Messenger of Death. ||27||
RECORD	para 33094	mn kw qosw hir nwmu hY ihrdY rKhu sm@wil ] (756-11, sUhI, mÚ 3) man kaa tosaa har naam hai hirdai rakhahu sam Haal. The Lord's Name is the nourishment of the mind; cherish it, and preserve it carefully within your heart.
RECORD	rwgu sUhI mhlw 3 Gru 10 v28	eyhu Krcu AKutu hY gurmuiK inbhY nwil ]28] (756-11, sUhI, mÚ 3) ayhu kharach akhut hai gurmukh nibhai naal. ||28||
