RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v2	jy suKu dyih q quJih ArwDI duiK BI quJY iDAweI ]2] (757-11, sUhI, mÚ 4) jay sukh deh ta tujheh araaDhee dukh bhee tujhai Dhi-aa-ee. ||2||
WHEN	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v2	If You will bless me with happiness, then I will worship and adore You. Even in pain, I will meditate on You. ||2||
