RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v6	Poor Nanak has fallen at the Lord's Door; please, O Lord, unite me with Yourself, by Your Glorious Greatness. ||6||
WHEN	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v7	AKI kwiF DrI crxw qil sB DrqI iPir mq pweI ]7] (757-14, sUhI, mÚ 4) akhee kaadh Dharee charnaa tal sabh Dhartee fir mat paa-ee. ||7||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v7	Taking out my eyes, I place them at Your Feet; after travelling over the entire earth, I have come to understand this. ||7||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v8	jy pwis bhwlih qw quJih ArwDI jy mwir kFih BI iDAweI ]8] (757-15, sUhI, mÚ 4) jay paas bahaaleh taa tujheh araaDhee jay maar kadheh bhee Dhi-aa-ee. ||8||
WHEN	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v8	If You seat me near You, then I worship and adore You. Even if You beat me and drive me out, I will still meditate on You. ||8||
WHEN	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v9	jy loku slwhy qw qyrI aupmw jy inMdY q Coif n jweI ]9] (757-16, sUhI, mÚ 4) jay lok salaahay taa tayree upmaa jay nindai ta chhod na jaa-ee. ||9||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v9	If people praise me, the praise is Yours. Even if they slander me, I will not leave You. ||9||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v10	jy quDu vil rhY qw koeI ikhu AwKau quDu ivsirAY mir jweI ]10] (757-16, sUhI, mÚ 4) jay tuDh val rahai taa ko-ee kihu aakha-o tuDh visri-ai mar jaa-ee. ||10||
