RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v11	vwir vwir jweI gur aUpir pY pYrI sMq mnweI ]11] (757-17, sUhI, mÚ 4) vaar vaar jaa-ee gur oopar pai pairee sant manaa-ee. ||11||
