RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v12	nwnku ivcwrw BieAw idvwnw hir qau drsn kY qweI ]12] (757-18, sUhI, mÚ 4) naanak vichaaraa bha-i-aa divaanaa har ta-o darsan kai taa-ee. ||12||
