RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v13	Even in violent storms and torrential rain, I go out to catch a glimpse of my Guru. ||13||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v14	smuMdu swgru hovY bhu Kwrw gurisKu lµiG gur pih jweI ]14] (757-19, sUhI, mÚ 4) samund saagar hovai baho khaaraa gursikh langh gur peh jaa-ee. ||14||
DEFINE	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v14	Even though the oceans and the salty seas are very vast, the GurSikh will cross over it to get to his Guru. ||14||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v15	ijau pRwxI jl ibnu hY mrqw iqau isKu gur ibnu mir jweI ]15] (757-19, sUhI, mÚ 4) ji-o paraanee jal bin hai martaa ti-o sikh gur bin mar jaa-ee. ||15||
