RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v16	ijau DrqI soB kry jlu brsY iqau isKu gur imil ibgsweI ]16] (758-1, sUhI, mÚ 4) ji-o Dhartee sobh karay jal barsai ti-o sikh gur mil bigsaa-ee. ||16||
