RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v17	syvk kw hoie syvku vrqw kir kir ibnau bulweI ]17] (758-2, sUhI, mÚ 4) sayvak kaa ho-ay sayvak vartaa kar kar bin-o bulaa-ee. ||17||
