RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v18	nwnk kI bynµqI hir pih gur imil gur suKu pweI ]18] (758-2, sUhI, mÚ 4) naanak kee baynantee har peh gur mil gur sukh paa-ee. ||18||
