DEFINE	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v21	O Lord, Your devotional worship is a treasure over-flowing. One who loves You, is blessed with it. ||21||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v22	ijsu qUM dyih soeI jnu pwey hor inhPl sB cqurweI ]22] (758-5, sUhI, mÚ 4) jis tooN deh so-ee jan paa-ay hor nihfal sabh chaturaa-ee. ||22||
RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v22	That humble being alone receives it, unto whom You bestow it. All other clever tricks are fruitless. ||22||
