RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v25	jy guru iJVky q mITw lwgY jy bKsy q gur vifAweI ]25] (758-7, sUhI, mÚ 4) jay gur jhirhkay ta meethaa laagai jay bakhsay ta gur vadi-aa-ee. ||25||
