RECORD	rwgu sUhI AstpdIAw mhlw 4 Gru 2 v27	pwlw kkru vrP vrsY gurisKu gur dyKx jweI ]27] (758-8, sUhI, mÚ 4) paalaa kakar varaf varsai gursikh gur daykhan jaa-ee. ||27||
