RECORD	para 35277	eyq CfweI moih qy ieqnI idRVqwrI ] (810-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) ayt chhadaa-ee mohi tay itnee darirh-taaree. They have helped me renounce this ego, and implant this humility within myself.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	sgl ryn iehu mnu BieAw ibnsI ApDwrI ]2] (810-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) sagal rayn ih man bha-i-aa binsee apDhaaree. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	This mind has become the dust of all men's feet, and my self-conceit has been dispelled. ||2||
RECORD	para 35279	inMd icMd pr dUKnw ey iKn mih jwrI ] (810-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) nind chind par dookhnaa ay khin meh jaaree. In an instant, I burnt away the ideas of slander and ill-will towards others.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	dieAw mieAw Aru inkit pyKu nwhI dUrwrI ]3] (810-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) da-i-aa ma-i-aa ar nikat paykh naahee dooraaree. ||3||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	I see close at hand, the Lord of mercy and compassion; He is not far away at all. ||3||
DEFINE	para 35281	qn mn sIql Bey Ab mukqy sMswrI ] (810-17, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) tan man seetal bha-ay ab muktay sansaaree. My body and mind are cooled and soothed, and now, I am liberated from the world.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	hIq cIq sB pRwn Dn nwnk drswrI ]4]10]40] (810-17, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) heet cheet sabh paraan Dhan naanak darsaaree. ||4||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	Love, consciousness, the breath of life, wealth and everything, O Nanak, are in the Blessed Vision of the Lord's Darshan. ||4||
RECORD	para 35284	thl krau qyry dws kI pg Jwrau bwl ] (810-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) tahal kara-o tayray daas kee pag jhaara-o baal. I perform service for Your slave, O Lord, and wipe his feet with my hair.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	msqku Apnw Byt dyau gun sunau rswl ]1] (810-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) mastak apnaa bhayt day-o gun sun-o rasaal. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	I offer my head to him, and listen to the Glorious Praises of the Lord, the source of bliss. ||1||
DEFINE	para 35286	qum@ imlqy myrw mnu jIE qum@ imlhu dieAwl ] (810-19, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) tum H miltay mayraa man jee-o tum H milhu da-i-aal. Meeting You, my mind is rejuvenated, so please meet me, O Merciful Lord.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	inis bwsur min Andu hoq icqvq ikrpwl ]1] rhwau ] (810-19, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) nis baasur man anad hot chitvat kirpaal. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. Night and day, my mind enjoys bliss, contemplating the Lord of Compassion. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 35289	jgq auDwrn swD pRB iqn@ lwghu pwl ] (811-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) jagat uDhaaran saaDh parabh tin H laagahu paal. God's Holy people are the saviors of the world; I grab hold of the hem of their robes.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	mo kau dIjY dwnu pRB sMqn pg rwl ]2] (811-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) mo ka-o deejai daan parabh santan pag raal. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	Bless me, O God, with the gift of the dust of the feet of the Saints. ||2||
UPHOLD	para 35291	aukiq isAwnp kCu nhI nwhI kCu Gwl ] (811-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) ukat si-aanap kachh nahee naahee kachh ghaal. I have no skill or wisdom at all, nor any work to my credit.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	BRm BY rwKhu moh qy kwthu jm jwl ]3] (811-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) bharam bhai raakho moh tay kaatahu jam jaal. ||3||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	Please, protect me from doubt, fear and emotional attachment, and cut away the noose of Death from my neck. ||3||
RECORD	para 35293	ibnau krau kruxwpqy ipqw pRiqpwl ] (811-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) bin-o kara-o karunaapatay pitaa partipaal. I beg of You, O Lord of Mercy, O my Father, please cherish me!
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	gux gwvau qyry swDsMig nwnk suK swl ]4]11]41] (811-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) gun gaava-o tayray saaDhsang naanak sukh saal. ||4||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	I sing Your Glorious Praises, in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, O Lord, Home of peace. ||4||
DEFINE	para 35296	kIqw loVih so krih quJ ibnu kCu nwih ] (811-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) keetaa lorheh so karahi tujh bin kachh naahi. Whatever You wish, You do. Without You, there is nothing.
WHEN	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	prqwpu qum@wrw dyiK kY jmdUq Cif jwih ]1] (811-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) partaap tum Haaraa daykh kai jamdoot chhad jaahi. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	Gazing upon Your Glory, the Messenger of Death leaves and goes away. ||1||
DEFINE	para 35298	qum@rI ik®pw qy CUtIAY ibnsY AhMmyv ] (811-5, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) tum Hree kirpaa tay chhootee-ai binsai aha Nmayv. By Your Grace, one is emancipated, and egotism is dispelled.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	srb klw smrQ pRB pUry gurdyv ]1] rhwau ] (811-5, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) sarab kalaa samrath parabh pooray gurdayv. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. God is omnipotent, possessing all powers; He is obtained through the Perfect, Divine Guru. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 35300	Kojq Kojq KoijAw nwmY ibnu kUru ] (811-6, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) khojat khojat khoji-aa naamai bin koor. Searching, searching, searching - without the Naam, everything is false.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	jIvn suKu sBu swDsMig pRB mnsw pUru ]2] (811-6, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) jeevan sukh sabh saaDhsang parabh mansaa poor. ||2||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	All the comforts of life are found in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy; God is the Fulfiller of desires. ||2||
RECORD	para 35302	ijqu ijqu lwvhu iqqu iqqu lgih isAwnp sB jwlI ] (811-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) jit jit laavhu tit tit lageh si-aanap sabh jaalee. Whatever You attach me to, to that I am attached; I have burnt away all my cleverness.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	jq kq qum@ BrpUr hhu myry dIn dieAwlI ]3] (811-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) jat kat tum H bharpoor hahu mayray deen da-i-aalee. ||3||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	You are permeating and pervading everywhere, O my Lord, Merciful to the meek. ||3||
RECORD	para 35304	sBu ikCu qum qy mwgnw vfBwgI pwey ] (811-8, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) sabh kichh tum tay maagnaa vadbhaagee paa-ay. I ask for everything from You, but only the very fortunate ones obtain it.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	nwnk kI Ardwis pRB jIvw gun gwey ]4]12]42] (811-8, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) naanak kee ardaas parabh jeevaa gun gaa-ay. ||4||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	This is Nanak's prayer, O God, I live by singing Your Glorious Praises. ||4||
DEFINE	para 35307	swDsMgiq kY bwsbY klml siB nsnw ] (811-9, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) saaDhsangat kai baasbai kalmal sabh nasnaa. Dwelling in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, all sins are erased.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	pRB syqI rMig rwiqAw qw qy griB n gRsnw ]1] (811-9, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) parabh saytee rang raati-aa taa tay garabh na garsanaa. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	One who is attuned to the Love of God, is not cast into the womb of reincarnation. ||1||
RECORD	para 35309	nwmu khq goivMd kw sUcI BeI rsnw ] (811-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) naam kahat govind kaa soochee bha-ee rasnaa. Chanting the Name of the Lord of the Universe, the tongue becomes holy.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	mn qn inrml hoeI hY gur kw jpu jpnw ]1] rhwau ] (811-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) man tan nirmal ho-ee hai gur kaa jap japnaa. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. The mind and body become immaculate and pure, chanting the Chant of the Guru. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 35311	hir rsu cwKq DRwipAw min rsu lY hsnw ] (811-11, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) har ras chaakhat Dharaapi-aa man ras lai hasnaa. Tasting the subtle essence of the Lord, one is satisfied; receiving this essence, the mind becomes happy.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	buiD pRgws pRgt BeI aulit kmlu ibgsnw ]2] (811-11, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) buDh pargaas pargat bha-ee ulat kamal bigsanaa. ||2||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	The intellect is brightened and illuminated; turning away from the world, the heart- lotus blossoms forth. ||2||
DEFINE	para 35313	sIql sWiq sMqoKu hoie sB bUJI iqRsnw ] (811-12, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) seetal saaNt santokh ho-ay sabh boojhee tarisnaa. He is cooled and soothed, peaceful and content; all his thirst is quenched.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	dh ids Dwvq imit gey inrml Qwin bsnw ]3] (811-12, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) dah dis Dhaavat mit ga-ay nirmal thaan basnaa. ||3||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	The mind's wandering in the ten directions is stopped, and one dwells in the immaculate place. ||3||
DEFINE	para 35315	rwKnhwrY rwiKAw Bey BRm Bsnw ] (811-13, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) raakhanhaarai raakhi-aa bha-ay bharam bhasnaa. The Savior Lord saves him, and his doubts are burnt to ashes.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	nwmu inDwn nwnk suKI pyiK swD drsnw ]4]13]43] (811-13, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) naam niDhaan naanak sukhee paykh saaDh darsanaa. ||4||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	Nanak is blessed with the treasure of the Naam, the Name of the Lord. He finds peace, gazing upon the Blessed Vision of the Saints' Darshan. ||4||
REQUIRE	para 35318	pwxI pKw pIsu dws kY qb hoih inhwlu ] (811-14, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) paanee pakhaa pees daas kai tab hohi nihaal. Carry water for the Lord's slave, wave the fan over him, and grind his corn; then, you shall be happy.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	rwj imlK iskdwrIAw AgnI mih jwlu ]1] (811-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) raaj milakh sikdaaree-aa agnee meh jaal. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	Burn in the fire your power, property and authority. ||1||
RECORD	para 35320	sMq jnw kw Cohrw iqsu crxI lwig ] (811-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) sant janaa kaa chhohraa tis charnee laag. Grasp hold of the feet of the servant of the humble Saints.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	mwieAwDwrI CqRpiq iqn@ Cofau iqAwig ]1] rhwau ] (811-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) maa-i-aaDhaaree chhatarpat tin H chhoda-o ti-aag. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. Renounce and abandon the wealthy, the regal overlords and kings. ||1||Pause||
