RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	sMq crx kr sIsu Dir hir nwmu iDAwvau ]1] (812-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) sant charan kar sees Dhar har naam Dhi-aava-o. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	I place my hands and my head upon the feet of the Saints, and meditate on the Lord's Name. ||1||
RECORD	para 35334	kir ikrpw dieAwl pRB ieh iniD isiD pwvau ] (812-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) kar kirpaa da-i-aal parabh ih niDh siDh paava-o. Be kind to me, O Merciful God, and bless me with this wealth and success.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	sMq jnw kI ryxukw lY mwQY lwvau ]1] rhwau ] (812-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) sant janaa kee raynukaa lai maathai laava-o. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. Obtaining the dust of the feet of the Saints, I apply it to my forehead. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 35336	nIc qy nIcu Aiq nIcu hoie kir ibnau bulwvau ] (812-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) neech tay neech at neech ho-ay kar bin-o bulaava-o. I am the lowest of the low, absolutely the lowest; I offer my humble prayer.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	pwv mlovw Awpu iqAwig sMqsMig smwvau ]2] (812-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) paav malovaa aap ti-aag satsang samaava-o. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	I wash their feet, and renounce my self-conceit; I merge in the Saints' Congregation. ||2||
RECORD	para 35338	swis swis nh vIsrY An kqih n Dwvau ] (812-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) saas saas nah veesrai an kateh na Dhaava-o. With each and every breath, I never forget the Lord; I never go to another.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	sPl drsn guru BytIAY mwnu mohu imtwvau ]3] (812-5, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) safal darsan gur bhaytee-ai maan moh mitaava-o. ||3||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	Obtaining the Fruitful Vision of the Guru's Darshan, I discard my pride and attachment. ||3||
RECORD	para 35340	squ sMqoKu dieAw Drmu sIgwru bnwvau ] (812-5, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) sat santokh da-i-aa Dharam seegaar banaava-o. I am embellished with truth, contentment, compassion and Dharmic faith.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	sPl suhwgix nwnkw Apuny pRB Bwvau ]4]15]45] (812-6, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) safal suhaagan naankaa apunay parabh bhaava-o. ||4||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	My spiritual marriage is fruitful, O Nanak; I am pleasing to my God. ||4||
DEFINE	para 35343	Atl bcn swDU jnw sB mih pRgtwieAw ] (812-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) atal bachan saaDhoo janaa sabh meh paragtaa-i-aa. The words of the Holy are eternal and unchanging; this is apparent to everyone.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	ijsu jn hoAw swDsMgu iqsu BytY hir rwieAw ]1] (812-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) jis jan ho-aa saaDhsang tis bhaytai har raa-i-aa. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	That humble being, who joins the Saadh Sangat, meets the Sovereign Lord. ||1||
DEFINE	para 35345	ieh prqIiq goivMd kI jip hir suKu pwieAw ] (812-8, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) ih parteet govind kee jap har sukh paa-i-aa. This faith in the Lord of the Universe, and peace, are found by meditating on the Lord.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	Aink bwqw siB kir rhy guru Gir lY AwieAw ]1] rhwau ] (812-8, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) anik baataa sabh kar rahay gur ghar lai aa-i-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. Everyone is speaking in various ways, but the Guru has brought the Lord into the home of my self. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 35347	srix pry kI rwKqw nwhI shswieAw ] (812-9, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) saran paray kee raakh-taa naahee sehsaa-i-aa. He preserves the honor of those who seek His Sanctuary; there is no doubt about this at all.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	krm BUim hir nwmu boie Aausru dulBwieAw ]2] (812-9, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) karam bhoom har naam bo-ay a-osar dulbhaa-i-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	In the field of actions and karma, plant the Lord's Name; this opportunity is so difficult to obtain! ||2||
DEFINE	para 35349	AMqrjwmI Awip pRBu sB kry krwieAw ] (812-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) antarjaamee aap parabh sabh karay karaa-i-aa. God Himself is the Inner-knower, the Searcher of hearts; He does, and causes everything to be done.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	piqq punIq Gxy kry Twkur ibrdwieAw ]3] (812-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) patit puneet ghanay karay thaakur birdaa-i-aa. ||3||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	He purifies so many sinners; this is the natural way of our Lord and Master. ||3||
RECORD	para 35351	mq BUlhu mwnuK jn mwieAw BrmwieAw ] (812-11, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) mat bhoolahu maanukh jan maa-i-aa bharmaa-i-aa. Don't be fooled, O mortal being, by the illusion of Maya.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	nwnk iqsu piq rwKsI jo pRiB pihrwieAw ]4]16]46] (812-11, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) naanak tis pat raakhsee jo parabh pehraa-i-aa. ||4||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	O Nanak, God saves the honor of those of whom He approves. ||4||
RECORD	para 35354	mwtI qy ijin swijAw kir durlB dyh ] (812-12, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) maatee tay jin saaji-aa kar durlabh dayh. He fashioned you from clay, and made your priceless body.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	Aink iCdR mn mih Fky inrml idRstyh ]1] (812-13, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) anik chhidar man meh dhakay nirmal daristayh. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	He covers the many faults in your mind, and makes you look immaculate and pure. ||1||
RECORD	para 35356	ikau ibsrY pRBu mnY qy ijs ky gux eyh ] (812-13, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) ki-o bisrai parabh manai tay jis kay gun ayh. So why do you forget God from your mind? He has done so many good things for you.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	pRB qij rcy ij Awn isau so rlIAY Kyh ]1] rhwau ] (812-14, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) parabh taj rachay je aan si-o so ralee-ai khayh. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. One who forsakes God, and blends himself with another, in the end is blended with dust. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 35358	ismrhu ismrhu swis swis mq iblm kryh ] (812-14, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) simrahu simrahu saas saas mat bilam karayh. Meditate, meditate in remembrance with each and every breath - do not delay!
WHEN	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	Coif pRpMcu pRB isau rchu qij kUVy nyh ]2] (812-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) chhod parpanch parabh si-o rachahu taj koorhay nayh. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	Renounce worldly affairs, and merge yourself into God; forsake false loves. ||2||
DEFINE	para 35360	ijin Aink eyk bhu rMg kIey hY hosI eyh ] (812-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) jin anik ayk baho rang kee-ay hai hosee ayh. He is many, and He is One; He takes part in the many plays. This is as He is, and shall be.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	kir syvw iqsu pwrbRhm gur qy miq lyh ]3] (812-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) kar sayvaa tis paarbarahm gur tay mat layh. ||3||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v3	So serve that Supreme Lord God, and accept the Guru's Teachings. ||3||
DEFINE	para 35362	aUcy qy aUcw vfw sB sMig brnyh ] (812-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) oochay tay oochaa vadaa sabh sang barnayh. God is said to be the highest of the high, the greatest of all, our companion.
