RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v1	No other actions will bring release; save me, O my Lord and Master. ||1||
RECORD	para 35469	qau srxwgiq mwDvy pUrn dieAwl ] (815-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) ta-o sarnaagat maaDhvay pooran da-i-aal. I have entered Your Sanctuary, O Perfect Lord of Mercy.
