DEFINE	para 35471	Awsw Brm ibkwr moh ien mih loBwnw ] (815-8, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) aasaa bharam bikaar moh in meh lobhaanaa. Hope, doubt, corruption and emotional attachment - in these, he is engrossed.
