RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v4	nwnk qrIAY swDsMig hir hir gux gwau ]4]27]57] (815-11, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) naanak taree-ai saaDhsang har har gun gaa-o. ||4||
