RECORD	para 35482	jp qp sMjm qum@ KMfy jm ky duK fWf ] (815-13, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) jap tap sanjam tum H khanday jam kay dukh daa Nd. You destroy the value of chanting, intensive meditation and self-discipline; you shall suffer in pain, beaten by the Messenger of Death.
