DEFINE	para 35496	DMnu su Qwnu bsMq DMnu jh jpIAY nwmu ] (816-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) Dhan so thaan basant Dhan jah japee-ai naam. Blessed is that place, and blessed are those who dwell there, where they chant the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
