DEFINE	para 35525	Kwq Krcq inbhq rhY gur sbdu AKUt ] (816-14, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) khaat kharchat nibhat rahai gur sabad akhoot. Eating and expending it, it is always available; the Word of the Guru's Shabad is inexhaustible.
