RECORD	para 35531	srin pry pRB qyrIAw pRB kI vifAweI ] (816-17, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) saran paray parabh tayree-aa parabh kee vadi-aa-ee. O God, I seek Your Sanctuary, the glorious greatness of God. Nanak:
