DEFINE	para 35539	qoit n AwvY kdy mUil pUrn BMfwr ] (817-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) tot na aavai kaday mool pooran bhandaar. There is never any deficiency at all; the Lord's treasures are over-flowing.
