DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 5 v2	His Lotus Feet are enshrined within my mind and body; God is inaccessible and infinite. ||2||
RECORD	para 35541	bsq kmwvq siB suKI ikCu aUn n dIsY ] (817-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 5) basat kamaavat sabh sukhee kichh oon na deesai. All those who work for Him dwell in peace; you can see that they lack nothing.
