RECORD	para 36061	bilaaval mehlaa 9. Bilaaval, Ninth Mehl:
REQUIRE	para 36062	hir ky nwm ibnw duKu pwvY ] (830-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 9) har kay naam binaa dukh paavai. Without the Name of the Lord, you shall only find pain.
