RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 9 v1	jog jg inhPl iqh mwnau jo pRB jsu ibsrwvY ]1] (831-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 9) jog jag nihfal tih maan-o jo parabh jas bisraavai. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 9 v1	Know that Yoga and sacrificial feasts are fruitless, if one forgets the Praises of God. ||1||
