DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 9 v1	Know that such religion is useless to him. I speak the Truth for his sake. ||1||
RECORD	para 36074	jYsy pwhnu jl mih rwiKE BydY nwih iqh pwnI ] (831-5, iblwvlu, mÚ 9) jaisay paahan jal meh raakhi-o bhaydai naahi tih paanee. It's like a stone, kept immersed in water; still, the water does not penetrate it.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 9 v2	qYsy hI qum qwih pCwnhu Bgiq hIn jo pRwnI ]2] (831-5, iblwvlu, mÚ 9) taisay hee tum taahi pachhaanahu bhagat heen jo paraanee. ||2||
