RECORD	para 36163	hir jIau syvIAY AMqrjwmI ] (832-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) har jee-o sayvee-ai antarjaamee. Serve the Dear Lord, the Inner-knower, the Searcher of hearts;
DEFINE	para 36164	Gt Gt AMqir ijs kI joiq smwnI ] (832-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) ghat ghat antar jis kee jot samaanee. deep within each and every heart, His Light is shining forth.
