RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 3 AstpdI Gru 10 v4	How can anyone hide anything from Him? ||4||
DEFINE	para 36167	swcw nwmu swcY sbid jwnY ] (833-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) saachaa naam saachai sabad jaanai. The True Name is known through the True Word of the Shabad.
