RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 3 AstpdI Gru 10 v5	The Gurmukh chants the Naam, forever and ever. ||5||
DEFINE	para 36170	siqguir syivAY dUjI durmiq jweI ] (833-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) satgur sayvi-ai doojee durmat jaa-ee. Serving the True Guru, duality and evil-mindedness are taken away.
DEFINE	para 36171	Aaugx kwit pwpw miq KweI ] (833-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) a-ugan kaat paapaa mat khaa-ee. Guilty mistakes are erased, and the sinful intellect is cleansed.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 3 AstpdI Gru 10 v6	kMcn kwieAw joqI joiq smweI ]6] (833-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) kanchan kaa-i-aa jotee jot samaa-ee. ||6||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 3 AstpdI Gru 10 v6	One's body sparkles like gold, and one's light merges into the Light. ||6||
DEFINE	para 36173	siqguir imilAY vfI vifAweI ] (833-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) satgur mili-ai vadee vadi-aa-ee. Meeting with the True Guru, one is blessed with glorious greatness.
DEFINE	para 36174	duKu kwtY ihrdY nwmu vsweI ] (833-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) dukh kaatai hirdai naam vasaa-ee. Pain is taken away, and the Naam comes to dwell within the heart.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 3 AstpdI Gru 10 v7	nwim rqy sdw suKu pweI ]7] (833-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) naam ratay sadaa sukh paa-ee. ||7||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 3 AstpdI Gru 10 v7	Imbued with the Naam, one finds eternal peace. ||7||
DEFINE	para 36176	gurmiq mwinAw krxI swru ] (833-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) gurmat maani-aa karnee saar. Obeying the Gur's instructions, one's actions are purified.
RECORD	para 36177	gurmiq mwinAw moK duAwru ] (833-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) gurmat maani-aa mokh du-aar. Obeying the Guru's Instructions, one finds the state of salvation.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 3 AstpdI Gru 10 v8	nwnk gurmiq mwinAw prvwrY swDwru ]8]1]3] (833-5, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) naanak gurmat maani-aa parvaarai saaDhaar. ||8||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 3 AstpdI Gru 10 v8	O Nanak, those who follow the Guru's Teachings are saved, along with their families. ||8||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 (833-6)
RECORD	para 36179	bilaaval mehlaa 4 asatpadee-aa ghar 11 Bilaaval, Fourth Mehl, Ashtapadees, Eleventh House:
RECORD	para 36180	<> siqgur pRswid ] (833-6) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
RECORD	para 36181	AwpY Awpu Kwie hau mytY Anidnu hir rs gIq gveIAw ] (833-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) aapai aap khaa-ay ha-o maytai an-din har ras geet gava-ee-aa. One who eliminates his self-centeredness, and eradicates his ego, night and day sings the songs of the Lord's Love.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v1	gurmuiK prcY kMcn kwieAw inrBau joqI joiq imleIAw ]1] (833-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) gurmukh parchai kanchan kaa-i-aa nirbha-o jotee jot mila-ee-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v1	The Gurmukh is inspired, his body is golden, and his light merges into the Light of the Fearless Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 36183	mY hir hir nwmu ADwru rmeIAw ] (833-8, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) mai har har naam aDhaar rama-ee-aa. I take the Support of the Name of the Lord, Har, Har.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v1	iKnu plu rih n skau ibnu nwvY gurmuiK hir hir pwT pVeIAw ]1] rhwau ] (833-8, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) khin pal reh na saka-o bin naavai gurmukh har har paath parha-ee-aa. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v1	rahaa-o. I cannot live, for a moment, even for an instant, without the Name of the Lord; the Gurmukh reads the Sermon of the Lord, Har, Har. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 36185	eyku igrhu ds duAwr hY jw ky Aihinis qskr pMc cor lgeIAw ] (833-9, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) ayk girahu das du-aar hai jaa kay ahinis taskar panch chor laga-ee-aa. In the one house of the body, there are ten gates; night and day, the five thieves break in.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v2	Drmu ArQu sBu ihir ly jwvih mnmuK AMDuly Kbir n peIAw ]2] (833-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) Dharam arath sabh hir lay jaaveh manmukh anDhulay khabar na pa-ee-aa. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v2	They steal the entire wealth of one's Dharmic faith, but the blind, self-willed manmukh does not know it. ||2||
WHEN	para 36187	kMcn kotu bhu mwxik BirAw jwgy igAwn qiq ilv leIAw ] (833-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) kanchan kot baho maanak bhari-aa jaagay gi-aan tat liv la-ee-aa. The fortress of the body is overflowing with gold and jewels; when it is awakened by spiritual wisdom, one enshrines love for the essence of reality.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v3	qskr hyrU Awie lukwny gur kY sbid pkiV bMiD peIAw ]3] (833-11, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) taskar hayroo aa-ay lukaanay gur kai sabad pakarh banDh pa-ee-aa. ||3||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v3	The thieves and robbers hide out in the body; through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, they are arrested and locked up. ||3||
RECORD	para 36189	hir hir nwmu poqu boihQw Kyvtu sbdu guru pwir lµGeIAw ] (833-12, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) har har naam pot bohithaa khayvat sabad gur paar langh-ee-aa. The Name of the Lord, Har, Har, is the boat, and the Word of the Guru's Shabad is the boatman, to carry us across.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v4	jmu jwgwqI nyiV n AwvY nw ko qskru coru lgeIAw ]4] (833-12, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) jam jaagaatee nayrh na aavai naa ko taskar chor laga-ee-aa. ||4||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v4	The Messenger of Death, the tax collector, does not even come close, and no thieves or robbers can plunder you. ||4||
RECORD	para 36191	hir gux gwvY sdw idnu rwqI mY hir jsu khqy AMqu n lhIAw ] (833-13, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) har gun gaavai sadaa din raatee mai har jas kahtay ant na lahee-aa. I continuously sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord, day and night; singing the Lord's Praises, I cannot find His limits.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v5	gurmuiK mnUAw iekqu Gir AwvY imlau guopwl nIswnu bjeIAw ]5] (833-14, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) gurmukh manoo-aa ikat ghar aavai mila-o gopaal neesaan baja-ee-aa. ||5||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v5	The mind of the Gurmukh returns to its own home; it meets the Lord of the Universe, to the beat of the celestial drum. ||5||
UPHOLD	para 36193	nYnI dyiK drsu mnu iqRpqY sRvn bwxI gur sbdu suxeIAw ] (833-14, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) nainee daykh daras man tariptai sarvan banee gur sabad suna-ee-aa. Gazing upon the Blessed Vision of His Darshan with my eyes, my mind is satisfied; with my ears, I listen to the Guru's Bani, and the Word of His Shabad.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v6	suin suin Awqm dyv hY BIny ris ris rwm gopwl rveIAw ]6] (833-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) sun sun aatam dayv hai bheenay ras ras raam gopaal rava-ee-aa. ||6||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v6	Listening, listening, my soul is softened, delighted by His subtle essence, chanting the Name of the Lord of the Universe. ||6||
RECORD	para 36195	qRY gux mwieAw moih ivAwpy qurIAw guxu hY gurmuiK lhIAw ] (833-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) tarai gun maa-i-aa mohi vi-aapay turee-aa gun hai gurmukh lahee-aa. In the grip of the three qualities, they are engrossed in love and attachment to Maya; only as Gurmukh do they find the absolute quality, absorption in bliss.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v7	eyk idRsit sB sm kir jwxY ndrI AwvY sBu bRhmu psreIAw ]7] (833-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) ayk darisat sabh sam kar jaanai nadree aavai sabh barahm pasra-ee-aa. ||7||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v7	With a single, impartial eye, look upon all alike, and see God pervading all. ||7||
RECORD	para 36197	rwm nwmu hY joiq sbweI gurmuiK Awpy AlKu lKeIAw ] (833-17, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) raam naam hai jot sabaa-ee gurmukh aapay alakh lakha-ee-aa. The Light of the Lord's Name permeates all; the Gurmukh knows the unknowable.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v8	nwnk dIn dieAwl Bey hY Bgiq Bwie hir nwim smeIAw ]8]1]4] (833-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) naanak deen da-i-aal bha-ay hai bhagat bhaa-ay har naam sama-ee-aa. ||8||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 AstpdIAw Gru 11 v8	O Nanak, the Lord has become merciful to the meek; through loving adoration, he merges in the Lord's Name. ||8||
