RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v1	imil sqsMgiq prm pdu pwieAw mY ihrf plws sMig hir buhIAw ]1] (834-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) mil satsangat param pad paa-i-aa mai hirad palaas sang har buhee-aa. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v1	Joining the Society of the Saints, I have obtained the supreme status. I am just a castor-oil tree, made fragrant by their association. ||1||
RECORD	para 36203	jip jgMnwQ jgdIs guseIAw ] (834-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) jap jagannaath jagdees gus-ee-aa. Meditate on the Lord of the Universe, the Master of the world, the Lord of creation.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v1	srix pry syeI jn aubry ijau pRihlwd auDwir smeIAw ]1] rhwau ] (834-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) saran paray say-ee jan ubray ji-o par-hilaad uDhaar sama-ee-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. Those humble beings who seek the Lord's Sanctuary are saved, like Prahlaad; they are emancipated and merge with the Lord. ||1||Pause||
