RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v2	swkq kUVy aUB suk hUey min AiBmwnu ivCuiV dUir geIAw ]2] (834-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) saakat koorhay oobh suk hoo-ay man abhimaan vichhurh door ga-ee-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v2	The stubborn, false faithless cynics are dried up; their egotistical pride separates them far from the Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 36207	hir giq imiq krqw Awpy jwxY sB ibiD hir hir Awip bneIAw ] (834-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) har gat mit kartaa aapay jaanai sabh biDh har har aap bana-ee-aa. Only the Creator Lord Himself knows the state and condition of everyone; the Lord Himself makes all the arrangements.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v3	ijsu siqguru Byty su kMcnu hovY jo Duir iliKAw su imtY n imteIAw ]3] (834-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) jis satgur bhaytay so kanchan hovai jo Dhur likhi-aa so mitai na mita-ee-aa. ||3||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v3	One who meets the True Guru is transformed into gold. Whatever is pre-ordained, is not erased by erasing. ||3||
RECORD	para 36209	rqn pdwrQ gurmiq pwvY swgr Bgiq BMfwr Kul@eIAw ] (834-5, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) ratan padaarath gurmat paavai saagar bhagat bhandaar khulH-ee-aa. The treasure of jewels is found in the ocean of the Guru's Teachings. The treasure of devotional worship is opened to me.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v4	gur crxI iek srDw aupjI mY hir gux khqy iqRpiq n BeIAw ]4] (834-6, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) gur charnee ik sarDhaa upjee mai har gun kahtay taripat na bha-ee-aa. ||4||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v4	Focused on the Guru's Feet, faith wells up within me; chanting the Glorious Praises of the Lord, I hunger for more. ||4||
RECORD	para 36211	prm bYrwgu inq inq hir iDAwey mY hir gux khqy BwvnI khIAw ] (834-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) param bairaag nit nit har Dhi-aa-ay mai har gun kahtay bhaavnee kahee-aa. I am totally detached, continually, continuously meditating on the Lord; chanting the Glorious Praises of the Lord, I express my love for Him.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v5	bwr bwr iKnu iKnu plu khIAY hir pwru n pwvY prY preIAw ]5] (834-7, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) baar baar khin khin pal kahee-ai har paar na paavai parai para-ee-aa. ||5||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v5	Time and time again, each and every moment and instant, I express it. I cannot find the Lord's limits; He is the farthest of the far. ||5||
UPHOLD	para 36213	swsq byd purwx pukwrih Drmu krhu Ktu krm idRVeIAw ] (834-8, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) saasat bayd puraan pukaareh Dharam karahu khat karam darirha-ee-aa. The Shaastras, the Vedas and the Puraanas advise righteous actions, and the performance of the six religious rituals.
WHEN	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v6	mnmuK pwKMif Brim ivgUqy loB lhir nwv Bwir bufeIAw ]6] (834-9, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) manmukh pakhand bharam vigootay lobh lahar naav bhaar buda-ee-aa. ||6||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v6	The hypocritical, self-willed manmukhs are ruined by doubt; in the waves of greed, their boat is heavily loaded, and it sinks. ||6||
ALLOW	para 36215	nwmu jphu nwmy giq pwvhu isimRiq swsqR nwmu idRVeIAw ] (834-9, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) naam japahu naamay gat paavhu simrit saastar naam darirh-ee-aa. So chant the Naam, the Name of the Lord, and through the Naam, find emancipation. The Simritees and Shaastras recommend the Naam.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v7	haumY jwie q inrmlu hovY gurmuiK prcY prm pdu peIAw ]7] (834-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) ha-umai jaa-ay ta nirmal hovai gurmukh parchai param pad pa-ee-aa. ||7||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v7	Eradicating egotism, one becomes pure. The Gurmukh is inspired, and obtains the supreme status. ||7||
RECORD	para 36217	iehu jgu vrnu rUpu sBu qyrw ijqu lwvih sy krm kmeIAw ] (834-11, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) ih jag varan roop sabh tayraa jit laaveh say karam kama-ee-aa. This world, with its colors and forms, is all Yours, O Lord; as You attach us, so do we do our deeds.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v8	nwnk jMq vjwey vwjih ijqu BwvY iqqu rwih cleIAw ]8]2]5] (834-11, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) naanak jant vajaa-ay vaajeh jit bhaavai tit raahi chala-ee-aa. ||8||
DEFINE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v8	O Nanak, we are the instruments upon which He plays; as He wills, so is the path we take. ||8||
RECORD	para 36220	gurmuiK Agm Agocru iDAwieAw hau bil bil siqgur siq purKeIAw ] (834-12, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) gurmukh agam agochar Dhi-aa-i-aa ha-o bal bal satgur sat purkha-ee-aa. The Gurmukh meditates on the Inaccessible, Unfathomable Lord. I am a sacrifice, a sacrifice to the True Guru, the True Primal Being.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v1	rwm nwmu myrY pRwix vswey siqgur pris hir nwim smeIAw ]1] (834-13, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) raam naam mayrai paraan vasaa-ay satgur paras har naam sama-ee-aa. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v1	He has brought the Lord's Name to dwell upon my breath of life; meeting with the True Guru, I am absorbed into the Lord's Name. ||1||
DEFINE	para 36222	jn kI tyk hir nwmu itkeIAw ] (834-14, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) jan kee tayk har naam tika-ee-aa. The Name of the Lord is the only Support of His humble servants.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v1	siqgur kI Dr lwgw jwvw gur ikrpw qy hir dru lhIAw ]1] rhwau ] (834-14, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) satgur kee Dhar laagaa jaavaa gur kirpaa tay har dar lahee-aa. ||1||
REQUIRE	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. I shall live under the protection of the True Guru. By Guru's Grace, I shall attain the Court of the Lord. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 36224	iehu srIru krm kI DrqI gurmuiK miQ miQ qqu kFeIAw ] (834-15, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) ih sareer karam kee Dhartee gurmukh math math tat kadha-ee-aa. This body is the field of karma; the Gurmukhs plow and work it, and harvest the essence.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v2	lwlu jvyhr nwmu pRgwisAw BWfY Bwau pvY iqqu AeIAw ]2] (834-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) laal javayhar naam pargaasi-aa bhaa Ndai bhaa-o pavai tit a-ee-aa. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v2	The priceless jewel of the Naam becomes manifest, and it pours into their vessels of love. ||2||
RECORD	para 36226	dwsin dws dws hoie rhIAY jo jn rwm Bgq inj BeIAw ] (834-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) daasan daas daas ho-ay rahee-ai jo jan raam bhagat nij bha-ee-aa. Become the slave of the slave of the slave, of that humble being who has become the devotee of the Lord.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v3	mnu buiD Arip Drau gur AwgY gur prswdI mY AkQu kQeIAw ]3] (834-17, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) man buDh arap Dhara-o gur aagai gur parsaadee mai akath katha-ee-aa. ||3||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v3	I dedicate my mind and intellect, and place them in offering before my Guru; by Guru's Grace, I speak the Unspoken. ||3||
RECORD	para 36228	mnmuK mwieAw moih ivAwpy iehu mnu iqRsnw jlq iqKeIAw ] (834-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) manmukh maa-i-aa mohi vi-aapay ih man tarisnaa jalat tikha-ee-aa. The self-willed manmukhs are engrossed in attachment to Maya; their minds are thirsty, burning with desire.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v4	gurmiq nwmu AMimRq jlu pwieAw Agin buJI gur sbid buJeIAw ]4] (834-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) gurmat naam amrit jal paa-i-aa agan bujhee gur sabad bujha-ee-aa. ||4||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v4	Following the Guru's Teachings, I have obtained the Ambrosial Water of the Naam, and the fire has been put out. The Word of the Guru's Shabad has put it out. ||4||
RECORD	para 36230	iehu mnu nwcY siqgur AwgY Anhd sbd Duin qUr vjeIAw ] (834-19, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) ih man naachai satgur aagai anhad sabad Dhun toor vaja-ee-aa. This mind dances before the True Guru. The unstruck sound current of the Shabad resounds, vibrating the celestial melody.
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v5	hir hir ausqiq krY idnu rwqI riK riK crx hir qwl pUreIAw ]5] (835-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) har har ustat karai din raatee rakh rakh charan har taal poora-ee-aa. ||5||
RECORD	iblwvlu mhlw 4 v5	I praise the Lord, day and night, moving my feet to the beat of the drum. ||5||
RECORD	para 36233	hir kY rMig rqw mnu gwvY ris rswl ris sbdu rveIAw ] (835-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 4) har kai rang rataa man gaavai ras rasaal ras sabad rava-ee-aa. Imbued with the Lord's Love, my mind sings His Praise, joyfully chanting the Shabad, the source of nectar and bliss.
