RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	quDu ApiV koie n skY sB JiK JiK pvY JiV ]2] (849-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) tuDh aparh ko-ay na sakai sabh jhakh jhakh pavai jharh. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	No one can equal You, Lord. Those who try, struggle and die in frustration. ||2||
RECORD	para 36908	slok mÚ 3 ] (850-1) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 36909	bRhmu ibMdih qy bRwhmxw jy clih siqgur Bwie ] (850-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) barahm bindeh tay barahmanaa jay chaleh satgur bhaa-ay. He alone knows God, and he alone is a Brahmin, who walks in harmony with the Will of the True Guru.
DEFINE	para 36910	ijn kY ihrdY hir vsY haumY rogu gvwie ] (850-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) jin kai hirdai har vasai ha-umai rog gavaa-ay. One whose heart is filled with the Lord, is freed of egotism and disease.
RECORD	para 36911	gux rvih gux sMgRhih joqI joiq imlwie ] (850-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) gun raveh gun sangar-hahi jotee jot milaa-ay. He chants the Lord's Praises, gathers virtue, and his light merges into the Light.
RECORD	para 36912	iesu jug mih ivrly bRwhmx bRhmu ibMdih icqu lwie ] (850-2, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) is jug meh virlay baraahman barahm bindeh chit laa-ay. How rare are those Brahmins who, in this age, come to know God, by lovingly focusing their consciousness on Him.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	nwnk ijn@ kau ndir kry hir scw sy nwim rhy ilv lwie ]1] (850-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) naanak jin H ka-o nadar karay har sachaa say naam rahay liv laa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	O Nanak, those who are blessed by the Lord's Glance of Grace, remain lovingly attuned to the Name of the True Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 36914	mÚ 3 ] (850-4) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 36915	siqgur kI syv n kIqIAw sbid n lgo Bwau ] (850-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) satgur kee sayv na keetee-aa sabad na lago bhaa-o. One who does not serve the True Guru, and who does not love the Word of the Shabad,
DEFINE	para 36916	haumY rogu kmwvxw Aiq dIrGu bhu suAwau ] (850-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) ha-umai rog kamaavanaa at deeragh baho su-aa-o. earns the very painful disease of egotism; he is so very selfish.
