RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	nwim rqy jn sdw suKu pwiein@ jn nwnk iqn bil jwey ]1] (851-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) naam ratay jan sadaa sukh paa-ini H jan naanak tin bal jaa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	Imbued with the Naam, the humble servants of the Lord find a lasting peace; servant Nanak is a sacrifice to them. ||1||
RECORD	para 36953	mÚ 3 ] (851-3) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 36954	Awsw mnsw jig mohxI ijin moihAw sMswru ] (851-3, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) aasaa mansaa jag mohnee jin mohi-aa sansaar. Hope and desire entice the world; they entice the whole universe.
