RECORD	para 36956	hukmI hI jmu lgdw so aubrY ijsu bKsY krqwru ] (851-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) hukmee hee jam lagdaa so ubrai jis bakhsai kartaar. By the Hukam of the Lord's Command, Death seizes the mortal; he alone is saved, whom the Creator Lord forgives.
