RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v5	Servant Nanak worships the True Lord in adoration; as Gurmukh, he finds peace. ||5||
RECORD	para 36965	slok mÚ 3 ] (851-9) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
