DEFINE	para 36967	Epwvw isir Epwau hY nwau prwpiq hoie ] (851-9, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) opaavaa sir opaa-o hai naa-o paraapat ho-ay. Of all efforts, the best effort is to attain the Lord's Name.
RECORD	para 36968	AMdru sIqlu sWiq hY ihrdY sdw suKu hoie ] (851-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) andar seetal saa Nt hai hirdai sadaa sukh ho-ay. It brings a cooling, soothing tranquility deep within the heart, and eternal peace.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	AMimRqu Kwxw pYn@xw nwnk nwie vifAweI hoie ]1] (851-10, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) amrit khaanaa pain Hnaa naanak naa-ay vadi-aa-ee ho-ay. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	Then, one eats and wears the Ambrosial Nectar; O Nanak, through the Name, comes glorious greatness. ||1||
RECORD	para 36970	mÚ 3 ] (851-11) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
