RECORD	para 37095	Apxw Awpu n pCwxeI hir pRBu jwqw dUir ] (854-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) apnaa aap na pachhaan-ee har parabh jaataa door. He does not understand himself; he believes the Lord God to be far away.
RECORD	para 37096	gur kI syvw ivsrI ikau mnu rhY hjUir ] (854-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) gur kee sayvaa visree ki-o man rahai hajoor. He forgets to serve the Guru; how can his mind remain in the Lord's Presence?
RECORD	para 37097	mnmuiK jnmu gvwieAw JUTY lwlic kUir ] (854-16, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) manmukh janam gavaa-i-aa jhoothai laalach koor. The self-willed manmukh wastes away his life in worthless greed and falsehood.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	nwnk bKis imlwieAnu scY sbid hdUir ]1] (854-17, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) naanak bakhas milaa-i-an sachai sabad hadoor. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	O Nanak, the Lord forgives, and blends them with Himself; through the True Word of the Shabad, He is ever-present. ||1||
RECORD	para 37099	mÚ 3 ] (854-17) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 37100	hir pRBu scw soihlw gurmuiK nwmu goivMdu ] (854-17, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) har parabh sachaa sohilaa gurmukh naam govind. True is the Praise of the Lord God; the Gurmukh chants the Name of the Lord of the Universe.
RECORD	para 37101	Anidnu nwmu slwhxw hir jipAw min Awnµdu ] (854-18, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) an-din naam salaahnaa har japi-aa man aanand. Praising the Naam night and day, and meditating on the Lord, the mind becomes blissful.
RECORD	para 37102	vfBwgI hir pwieAw pUrnu prmwnµdu ] (854-19, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) vadbhaagee har paa-i-aa pooran parmaanand. By great good fortune, I have found the Lord, the perfect embodiment of supreme bliss.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	jn nwnk nwmu slwihAw bhuiV n min qin BMgu ]2] (854-19, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) jan naanak naam sahaali-aa bahurh na man tan bhang. ||2||
REQUIRE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	Servant Nanak praises the Naam; his mind and body shall never again be shattered. ||2||
RECORD	para 37105	pauVI ] (855-1) pa-orhee. Pauree:
WHEN	para 37106	koeI inMdku hovY siqgurU kw iPir srix gur AwvY ] (855-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) ko-ee nindak hovai satguroo kaa fir saran gur aavai. If someone slanders the True Guru, and then comes seeking the Guru's Protection,
RECORD	para 37107	ipCly gunh siqguru bKis ley sqsMgiq nwil rlwvY ] (855-1, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) pichhlay gunah satgur bakhas la-ay satsangat naal ralaavai. the True Guru forgives him for his past sins, and unites him with the Saints' Congregation.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v13	nwnk iehu Acrju dyKhu myry hir scy swh kw ij siqgurU no mMnY su sBnW BwvY ]13]1] suDu ] (855-4, iblwvlu, mÚ 3) naanak ih achraj daykhhu mayray har sachay saah kaa je satguroo no mannai so sabhnaa N bhaavai. ||13||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v13	1|| suDh. O Nanak, behold this wonder of the Lord, my True King! Everyone is pleased with one who obeys and believes in the True Guru. ||13||1|| Sudh||
RECORD	para 37111	iblwvlu bwxI Bgqw kI ] (855-6) bilaaval banee bhagtaa kee. Bilaaval, The Word Of The Devotees.
RECORD	para 37112	kbIr jIau kI (855-6) kabeer jee-o kee Of Kabeer Jee:
DEFINE	para 37113	<> siq nwmu krqw purKu gur pRswid ] (855-6, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) ik-oNkaar sat naam kartaa purakh gur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. Truth Is The Name. Creative Being Personified By Guru's Grace:
DEFINE	para 37114	AYso iehu sMswru pyKnw rhnu n koaU peIhY ry ] (855-7, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) aiso ih sansaar paykhnaa rahan na ko-oo pa-eehai ray. This world is a drama; no one can remain here.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	sUDy sUDy ryig clhu qum nqr kuDkw idveIhY ry ]1] rhwau ] (855-7, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) sooDhay sooDhay rayg chalhu tum natar kuDhkaa diva-eehai ray. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. Walk the straight path; otherwise, you will be pushed around. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 37116	bwry bUFy qruny BeIAw sBhU jmu lY jeIhY ry ] (855-8, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) baaray boodhay tarunay bha-ee-aa sabhhoo jam lai ja-eehai ray. The children, the young and the old, O Siblings of Destiny, will be taken away by the Messenger of Death.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	mwnsu bpurw mUsw kIno mIcu ibleIAw KeIhY ry ]1] (855-8, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) maanas bapuraa moosaa keeno meech bila-ee-aa kha-eehai ray. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	The Lord has made the poor man a mouse, and the cat of Death is eating him up. ||1||
RECORD	para 37118	DnvMqw Aru inrDn mneI qw kI kCU n kwnI ry ] (855-9, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) Dhanvantaa ar nirDhan man-ee taa kee kachhoo na kaanee ray. It gives no special consideration to either the rich or the poor.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	rwjw prjw sm kir mwrY AYso kwlu bfwnI ry ]2] (855-9, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) raajaa parjaa sam kar maarai aiso kaal badaanee ray. ||2||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	The king and his subjects are equally killed; such is the power of Death. ||2||
RECORD	para 37120	hir ky syvk jo hir Bwey iqn@ kI kQw inrwrI ry ] (855-10, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) har kay sayvak jo har bhaa-ay tin H kee kathaa niraaree ray. Those who are pleasing to the Lord are the servants of the Lord; their story is unique and singular.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v3	Awvih n jwih n kbhU mrqy pwrbRhm sMgwrI ry ]3] (855-10, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) aavahi na jaahi na kabhoo martay paarbarahm sangaaree ray. ||3||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v3	They do not come and go, and they never die; they remain with the Supreme Lord God. ||3||
RECORD	para 37122	puqR klqR liCmI mwieAw iehY qjhu jIA jwnI ry ] (855-11, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) putar kaltar lachhimee maa-i-aa ihai tajahu jee-a jaanee ray. Know this in your soul, that by renouncing your children, spouse, wealth and property
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	khq kbIru sunhu ry sMqhu imilhY swirgpwnI ry ]4]1] (855-12, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) kahat kabeer sunhu ray santahu milihai saarigpaanee ray. ||4||
REQUIRE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	1|| - says Kabeer, listen, O Saints - you shall be united with the Lord of the Universe. ||4||1||
RECORD	para 37124	iblwvlu ] (855-12) bilaaval. Bilaaval:
RECORD	para 37125	ibidAw n prau bwdu nhI jwnau ] (855-12, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) bidi-aa na para-o baad nahee jaan-o. I do not read books of knowledge, and I do not understand the debates.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	hir gun kQq sunq baurwno ]1] (855-13, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) har gun kathat sunat ba-uraano. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	I have gone insane, chanting and hearing the Glorious Praises of the Lord. ||1||
DEFINE	para 37127	myry bwbw mY baurw sB Klk sYAwnI mY baurw ] (855-13, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) mayray baabaa mai ba-uraa sabh khalak sai-aanee mai ba-uraa. O my father, I have gone insane; the whole world is sane, and I am insane.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	mY ibgirE ibgrY miq Aaurw ]1] rhwau ] (855-14, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) mai bigri-o bigrai mat a-uraa. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. I am spoiled; let no one else be spoiled like me. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 37129	Awip n baurw rwm kIE baurw ] (855-14, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) aap na ba-uraa raam kee-o ba-uraa. I have not made myself go insane - the Lord made me go insane.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	siqguru jwir gieE BRmu morw ]2] (855-14, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) satgur jaar ga-i-o bharam moraa. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	The True Guru has burnt away my doubt. ||2||
RECORD	para 37131	mY ibgry ApnI miq KoeI ] (855-15, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) mai bigray apnee mat kho-ee. I am spoiled; I have lost my intellect.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v3	myry Brim BUlau miq koeI ]3] (855-15, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) mayray bharam bhoola-o mat ko-ee. ||3||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v3	Let no one go astray in doubt like me. ||3||
DEFINE	para 37133	so baurw jo Awpu n pCwnY ] (855-15, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) so ba-uraa jo aap na pachhaanai. He alone is insane, who does not understand himself.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	Awpu pCwnY q eykY jwnY ]4] (855-16, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) aap pachhaanai ta aykai jaanai. ||4||
WHEN	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	When he understands himself, then he knows the One Lord. ||4||
REQUIRE	para 37135	Abih n mwqw su kbhu n mwqw ] (855-16, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) abeh na maataa so kabahu na maataa. One who is not intoxicated with the Lord now, shall never be intoxicated.
