DEFINE	para 37147	khu kbIr myry mwDvw qU srb ibAwpI ] (856-2, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) kaho kabeer mayray maaDhvaa too sarab bi-aapee. Says Kabeer, O my Lord, You are contained in all.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	qum smsir nwhI dieAwlu moih smsir pwpI ]4]3] (856-2, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) tum samsar naahee da-i-aal mohi samsar paapee. ||4||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	3|| There is none as merciful as You are, and none as sinful as I am. ||4||3||
RECORD	para 37149	iblwvlu ] (856-3) bilaaval. Bilaaval:
RECORD	para 37150	inq auiT korI gwgir AwnY lIpq jIau gieE ] (856-3, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) nit uth koree gaagar aanai leepat jee-o ga-i-o. Every day, he rises early, and brings a fresh clay pot; he passes his life embellishing and glazing it.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	qwnw bwnw kCU n sUJY hir hir ris lpitE ]1] (856-4, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) taanaa baanaa kachhoo na soojhai har har ras lapti-o. ||1||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	He does not think at all of worldly weaving; he is absorbed in the subtle essence of the Lord, Har, Har. ||1||
RECORD	para 37152	hmwry kul kauny rwmu kihE ] (856-4, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) hamaaray kul ka-unay raam kahi-o. Who in our family has ever chanted the Name of the Lord?
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	jb kI mwlw leI inpUqy qb qy suKu n BieE ]1] rhwau ] (856-5, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) jab kee maalaa la-ee nipootay tab tay sukh na bha-i-o. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. Ever since this worthless son of mine began chanting with his mala, we have had no peace at all! ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 37154	sunhu ijTwnI sunhu idrwnI Acrju eyku BieE ] (856-5, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) sunhu jithaanee sunhu diraanee achraj ayk bha-i-o. Listen, O my sisters-in-law, a wondrous thing has happened!
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	swq sUq iein mufINey Koey iehu mufIAw ikau n muieE ]2] (856-6, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) saat soot in mudee Nay kho-ay ih mudee-aa ki-o na mu-i-o. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	This boy has ruined our weaving business. Why didn't he simply die? ||2||
UPHOLD	para 37156	srb suKw kw eyku hir suAwmI so guir nwmu dieE ] (856-6, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) sarab sukhaa kaa ayk har su-aamee so gur naam da-i-o. O mother, the One Lord, the Lord and Master, is the source of all peace. The Guru has blessed me with His Name.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v3	sMq pRhlwd kI pYj ijin rwKI hrnwKsu nK ibdirE ]3] (856-7, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) sant parahlaad kee paij jin raakhee harnaakhas nakh bidri-o. ||3||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v3	He preserved the honor of Prahlaad, and destroyed Harnaakhash with his nails. ||3||
RECORD	para 37158	Gr ky dyv ipqr kI CofI gur ko sbdu lieE ] (856-7, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) ghar kay dayv pitar kee chhodee gur ko sabad la-i-o. I have renounced the gods and ancestors of my house, for the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	khq kbIru sgl pwp KMfnu sMqh lY auDirE ]4]4] (856-8, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) kahat kabeer sagal paap khandan santeh lai uDhaari-o. ||4||
DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v4	4|| Says Kabeer, God is the Destroyer of all sins; He is the Saving Grace of His Saints. ||4||4||
RECORD	para 37160	iblwvlu ] (856-9) bilaaval. Bilaaval:
DEFINE	para 37161	koaU hir smwin nhI rwjw ] (856-9, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) ko-oo har samaan nahee raajaa. There is no king equal to the Lord.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	ey BUpiq sB idvs cwir ky JUTy krq idvwjw ]1] rhwau ] (856-9, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) ay bhoopat sabh divas chaar kay jhoothay karat divaajaa. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. All these lords of the world last for only a few days, putting on their false displays. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 37163	qyro jnu hoie soie kq folY qIin Bvn pr Cwjw ] (856-10, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) tayro jan ho-ay so-ay kat dolai teen bhavan par chhaajaa. How can Your humble servant waver? You spread Your shadow over the three worlds.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	hwQu pswir skY ko jn kau boil skY n AMdwjw ]1] (856-10, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) haath pasaar sakai ko jan ka-o bol sakai na andaajaa. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	Who can raise his hand against Your humble servant? No one can describe the Lord's expanse. ||1||
RECORD	para 37165	cyiq Acyq mUV mn myry bwjy Anhd bwjw ] (856-11, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) chayt achayt moorh man mayray baajay anhad baajaa. Remember Him, O my thoughtless and foolish mind, and the unstruck melody of the sound current will resonate and resound.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	kih kbIr sMsw BRmu cUko DR¨ pRihlwd invwjw ]2]5] (856-11, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) kahi kabeer sansaa bharam chooko Dharoo par-hilaad nivaajaa. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	5|| Says Kabeer, my skepticism and doubt have been dispelled; the Lord has exalted me, as He did Dhroo and Prahlaad. ||2||5||
RECORD	para 37167	iblwvlu ] (856-12) bilaaval. Bilaaval:
RECORD	para 37168	rwiK lyhu hm qy ibgrI ] (856-12, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) raakh layho ham tay bigree. Save me! I have disobeyed You.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	sIlu Drmu jpu Bgiq n kInI hau AiBmwn tyF pgrI ]1] rhwau ] (856-12, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) seel Dharam jap bhagat na keenee ha-o abhimaan taydh pagree. ||1||
UPHOLD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. I have not practiced humility, righteousness or devotional worship; I am proud and egotistical, and I have taken a crooked path. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 37170	Amr jwin sMcI ieh kwieAw ieh imiQAw kwcI ggrI ] (856-13, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) amar jaan sanchee ih kaa-i-aa ih mithi-aa kaachee gagree. Believing this body to be immortal, I pampered it, but it is a fragile and perishable vessel.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	ijnih invwij swij hm kIey iqsih ibswir Avr lgrI ]1] (856-14, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) jineh nivaaj saaj ham kee-ay tiseh bisaar avar lagree. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	Forgetting the Lord who formed, fashioned and embellished me, I have become attached to another. ||1||
RECORD	para 37172	sMiDk qoih swD nhI khIAau srin pry qumrI pgrI ] (856-14, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) sanDhik tohi saaDh nahee kahee-a-o saran paray tumree pagree. I am Your thief; I cannot be called holy. I have fallen at Your feet, seeking Your Sanctuary.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	kih kbIr ieh ibnqI sunIAhu mq Gwlhu jm kI KbrI ]2]6] (856-15, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) kahi kabeer ih bintee sunee-ahu mat ghaalhu jam kee khabree. ||2||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v2	6|| Says Kabeer, please listen to this prayer of mine, O Lord; please do not send me sommons of the Messenger of Death. ||2||6||
RECORD	para 37174	iblwvlu ] (856-16) bilaaval. Bilaaval:
