RECORD	para 37189	iblwvlu ] (857-2) bilaaval. Bilaaval:
RECORD	para 37190	iein@ mwieAw jgdIs gusweI qum@ry crn ibswry ] (857-3, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) ayniH maa-i-aa jagdees gusaa-ee tum Hray charan bisaaray. This Maya has made me forget Your feet, O Lord of the World, Master of the Universe.
