RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. Not even a bit of love wells up in Your humble servant; what can Your poor servant do? ||1||Pause||
UPHOLD	para 37192	iDRgu qnu iDRgu Dnu iDRgu ieh mwieAw iDRgu iDRgu miq buiD PMnI ] (857-4, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) Dharig tan Dharig Dhan Dharig ih maa-i-aa Dharig Dharig mat buDh fannee. Cursed is the body, cursed is the wealth, and cursed is this Maya; cursed, cursed is the clever intellect and understanding.
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	ies mwieAw kau idRVu kir rwKhu bWDy Awp bcMnI ]1] (857-5, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) is maa-i-aa ka-o darirh kar raakho baa NDhay aap bachannee. ||1||
RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	Restrain and hold back this Maya; overcome it, through the Word of the Guru's Teachings. ||1||
