DEFINE	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. O my mind, vibrate, meditate on the Lord, and forsake your doubt. The Lord is the Life of the World. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 37200	Awvq kCU n dIseI nh dIsY jwq ] (857-8, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) aavat kachhoo na dees-ee nah deesai jaat. Nothing is seen coming into the world, and nothing is seen leaving it.
