RECORD	para 37204	iblwvlu ] (857-10) bilaaval. Bilaaval:
DEFINE	para 37205	jnm mrn kw BRmu gieAw goibd ilv lwgI ] (857-10, iblwvlu, Bgq kbIr jI) janam maran kaa bharam ga-i-aa gobid liv laagee. The illusion of birth and death is gone; I lovingly focus on the Lord of the Universe.
