RECORD	iblwvlu kI vwr mhlw 4 v1	hoie punIq BgvMq Bjn qy Awpu qwir qwry kul doie ]1] (858-9, iblwvlu, Bgq rivdws jI) ho-ay puneet bhagvant bhajan tay aap taar taaray kul do-ay. ||1||
