DEFINE	para 38684	ibrly pwvih Ehu ibsRwmu ] (888-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) birlay paavahi oh bisraam. How rare are those who find this place of rest.
DEFINE	para 38685	Bojnu Bwau kIrqn AwDwru ] (888-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bhojan bhaa-o keertan aaDhaar. The love of God is their food, and the Kirtan of the Lord's Praise is their support.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	inhcl Awsnu bysumwru ]2] (889-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) nihchal aasan baysumaar. ||2||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	They obtain a permanent seat in the infinite. ||2||
RECORD	para 38688	ifig n folY kqhU n DwvY ] (889-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) dig na dolai kathoo na Dhaavai. No one falls there, or wavers, or goes anywhere.
RECORD	para 38689	gur pRswid ko iehu mhlu pwvY ] (889-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) gur parsaad ko ih mahal paavai. By Guru's Grace, some find this mansion.
DEFINE	para 38690	BRm BY moh n mwieAw jwl ] (889-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bharam bhai moh na maa-i-aa jaal. They are not touched by doubt, fear, attachment or the traps of Maya.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	suMn smwiD pRBU ikrpwl ]3] (889-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sunn samaaDh parabhoo kirpaal. ||3||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	They enter the deepest state of Samaadhi, through the kind mercy of God. ||3||
RECORD	para 38692	qw kw AMqu n pwrwvwru ] (889-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) taa kaa ant na paaraavaar. He has no end or limitation.
DEFINE	para 38693	Awpy gupqu Awpy pwswru ] (889-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay gupat aapay paasaar. He Himself is unmanifest, and He Himself is manifest.
RECORD	para 38694	jw kY AMqir hir hir suAwdu ] (889-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jaa kai antar har har su-aad. One who enjoys the taste of the Lord, Har, Har, deep within himself,
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	khnu n jweI nwnk ibsmwdu ]4]9]20] (889-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kahan na jaa-ee naanak bismaad. ||4||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	O Nanak, his wondrous state cannot be described. ||4||
RECORD	para 38697	Bytq sMig pwrbRhmu iciq AwieAw ] (889-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bhaytat sang paarbarahm chit aa-i-aa. Meeting with the Sangat, the Congregation, the Supreme Lord God has come into my consciousness.
RECORD	para 38698	sMgiq krq sMqoKu min pwieAw ] (889-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sangat karat santokh man paa-i-aa. In the Sangat, my mind has found contentment.
RECORD	para 38699	sMqh crn mwQw myro pauq ] (889-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) santeh charan maathaa mayro pa-ut. I touch my forehead to the feet of the Saints.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	Aink bwr sMqh fMfauq ]1] (889-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) anik baar santeh dand-ut. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	Countless times, I humbly bow to the Saints. ||1||
DEFINE	para 38701	iehu mnu sMqn kY bilhwrI ] (889-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ih man santan kai balihaaree. This mind is a sacrifice to the Saints;
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	jw kI Et ghI suKu pwieAw rwKy ikrpw DwrI ]1] rhwau ] (889-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jaa kee ot gahee sukh paa-i-aa raakhay kirpaa Dhaaree. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. holding tight to their support, I have found peace, and in their mercy, they have protected me. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 38703	sMqh crx Doie Doie pIvw ] (889-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) santeh charan Dho-ay Dho-ay peevaa. I wash the feet of the Saints, and drink in that water.
UPHOLD	para 38704	sMqh drsu pyiK pyiK jIvw ] (889-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) santeh daras paykh paykh jeevaa. Gazing upon the Blessed Vision of the Saints' Darshan, I live.
RECORD	para 38705	sMqh kI myrY min Aws ] (889-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) santeh kee mayrai man aas. My mind rests its hopes in the Saints.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	sMq hmwrI inrml rwis ]2] (889-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sant hamaaree nirmal raas. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	The Saints are my immaculate wealth. ||2||
RECORD	para 38707	sMq hmwrw rwiKAw pVdw ] (889-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sant hamaaraa raakhi-aa parh-daa. The Saints have covered my faults.
RECORD	para 38708	sMq pRswid moih kbhU n kVdw ] (889-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sant parsaad mohi kabhoo na karh-daa. By the Grace of the Saints, I am no longer tormented.
UPHOLD	para 38709	sMqh sMgu dIAw ikrpwl ] (889-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) santeh sang dee-aa kirpaal. The Merciful Lord has blessed me with the Saints' Congregation.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	sMq shweI Bey dieAwl ]3] (889-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sant sahaa-ee bha-ay da-i-aal. ||3||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	The Compassionate Saints have become my help and support. ||3||
UPHOLD	para 38711	suriq miq buiD prgwsu ] (889-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) surat mat buDh pargaas. My consciousness, intellect and wisdom have been enlightened.
DEFINE	para 38712	gihr gMBIr Apwr guxqwsu ] (889-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) gahir gambheer apaar guntaas. The Lord is profound, unfathomable, infinite, the treasure of virtue.
RECORD	para 38713	jIA jMq sgly pRiqpwl ] (889-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jee-a jant saglay partipaal. He cherishes all beings and creatures.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	nwnk sMqh dyiK inhwl ]4]10]21] (889-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak santeh daykh nihaal. ||4||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	Nanak is enraptured, seeing the Saints. ||4||
RECORD	para 38716	qyrY kwij n igRhu rwju mwlu ] (889-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tayrai kaaj na garihu raaj maal. Your home, power and wealth will be of no use to you.
RECORD	para 38717	qyrY kwij n ibKY jMjwlu ] (889-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tayrai kaaj na bikhai janjaal. Your corrupt worldly entanglements will be of no use to you.
DEFINE	para 38718	iest mIq jwxu sB ClY ] (889-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) isat meet jaan sabh chhalai. Know that all your dear friends are fake.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	hir hir nwmu sMig qyrY clY ]1] (889-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) har har naam sang tayrai chalai. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	Only the Name of the Lord, Har, Har, will go along with you. ||1||
REQUIRE	para 38720	rwm nwm gux gwie ly mIqw hir ismrq qyrI lwj rhY ] (889-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) raam naam gun gaa-ay lay meetaa har simrat tayree laaj rahai. Sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord's Name, O friend; remembering the Lord in meditation, your honor shall be saved.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	hir ismrq jmu kCu n khY ]1] rhwau ] (889-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) har simrat jam kachh na kahai. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. Remembering the Lord in meditation, the Messenger of Death will not touch you. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 38722	ibnu hir sgl inrwrQ kwm ] (889-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bin har sagal niraarath kaam. Without the Lord, all pursuits are useless.
DEFINE	para 38723	suienw rupw mwtI dwm ] (889-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) su-inaa rupaa maatee daam. Gold, silver and wealth are just dust.
REQUIRE	para 38724	gur kw sbdu jwip mn suKw ] (889-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) gur kaa sabad jaap man sukhaa. Chanting the Word of the Guru's Shabad, your mind shall be at peace.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	eIhw aUhw qyro aUjl muKw ]2] (889-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) eehaa oohaa tayro oojal mukhaa. ||2||
REQUIRE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	Here and hereafter, your face shall be radiant and bright. ||2||
RECORD	para 38726	kir kir Qwky vfy vfyry ] (889-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kar kar thaakay vaday vadayray. Even the greatest of the great worked and worked until they were exhausted.
RECORD	para 38727	ikn hI n kIey kwj mwieAw pUry ] (889-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kin hee na kee-ay kaaj maa-i-aa pooray. None of them ever accomplished the tasks of Maya.
RECORD	para 38728	hir hir nwmu jpY jnu koie ] (889-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) har har naam japai jan ko-ay. Any humble being who chants the Name of the Lord, Har, Har,
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	qw kI Awsw pUrn hoie ]3] (889-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) taa kee aasaa pooran ho-ay. ||3||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	will have all his hopes fulfilled. ||3||
DEFINE	para 38730	hir Bgqn ko nwmu ADwru ] (889-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) har bhagtan ko naam aDhaar. The Naam, the Name of the Lord, is the anchor and support of the Lord's devotees.
DEFINE	para 38731	sMqI jIqw jnmu Apwru ] (889-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) santee jeetaa janam apaar. The Saints are victorious in this priceless human life.
DEFINE	para 38732	hir sMqu kry soeI prvwxu ] (889-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) har sant karay so-ee parvaan. Whatever the Lord's Saint does, is approved and accepted.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	nwnk dwsu qw kY kurbwxu ]4]11]22] (889-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak daas taa kai kurbaan. ||4||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	Slave Nanak is a sacrifice to him. ||4||
RECORD	para 38735	isMcih drbu dyih duKu log ] (889-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sincheh darab deh dukh log. You gather wealth by exploiting people.
DEFINE	para 38736	qyrY kwij n Avrw jog ] (889-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tayrai kaaj na avraa jog. It is of no use to you; it was meant for others.
RECORD	para 38737	kir AhMkwru hoie vrqih AMD ] (889-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kar ahaNkaar ho-ay varteh anDh. You practice egotism, and act like a blind man.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	jm kI jyvVI qU AwgY bMD ]1] (889-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jam kee jayvrhee too aagai banDh. ||1||
REQUIRE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	In the world hereafter, you shall be tied to the leash of the Messenger of Death. ||1||
WHEN	para 38739	Cwif ivfwxI qwiq mUVy ] (889-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) chhaad vidaanee taat moorhay. Give up your envy of others, you fool!
RECORD	para 38740	eIhw bsnw rwiq mUVy ] (889-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) eehaa basnaa raat moorhay. You only live here for a night, you fool!
REQUIRE	para 38741	mwieAw ky mwqy qY auiT clnw ] (889-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) maa-i-aa kay maatay tai uth chalnaa. You are intoxicated with Maya, but you must soon arise and depart.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	rwic rihE qU sMig supnw ]1] rhwau ] (889-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) raach rahi-o too sang supnaa. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. You are totally involved in the dream. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 38743	bwl ibvsQw bwirku AMD ] (889-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) baal bivasthaa baarik anDh. In his childhood, the child is blind.
DEFINE	para 38744	Bir jobin lwgw durgMD ] (889-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bhar joban laagaa durganDh. In the fullness of youth, he is involved in foul-smelling sins.
RECORD	para 38746	iqRqIA ibvsQw isMcy mwie ] (890-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) taritee-a bivasthaa sinchay maa-ay. In the third stage of life, he gathers the wealth of Maya.
WHEN	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	ibriD BieAw Coif cilE pCuqwie ]2] (890-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) biraDh bha-i-aa chhod chali-o pachhutaa-ay. ||2||
REQUIRE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	And when he grows old, he must leave all this; he departs regretting and repenting. ||2||
RECORD	para 38748	icrMkwl pweI dRülB dyh ] (890-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) chirankaal paa-ee darulabh dayh. After a very long time, one obtains this precious human body, so difficult to obtain.
DEFINE	para 38749	nwm ibhUxI hoeI Kyh ] (890-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naam bihoonee ho-ee khayh. Without the Naam, the Name of the Lord, it is reduced to dust.
RECORD	para 38750	psU pryq mugD qy burI ] (890-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) pasoo parayt mugaDh tay buree. Worse than a beast, a demon or an idiot,
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	iqsih n bUJY ijin eyh isrI ]3] (890-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tiseh na boojhai jin ayh siree. ||3||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	is that one who does not understand who created him. ||3||
RECORD	para 38752	suix krqwr goivMd gopwl ] (890-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sun kartaar govind gopaal. Listen, O Creator Lord, Lord of the Universe, Lord of the World,
RECORD	para 38753	dIn dieAwl sdw ikrpwl ] (890-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) deen da-i-aal sadaa kirpaal. Merciful to the meek, forever compassionate
DEFINE	para 38754	qumih Cfwvhu Cutkih bMD ] (890-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tumeh chhadaavahu chhutkahi banDh. - If You emancipate the human, then his bonds are broken.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	bKis imlwvhu nwnk jg AMD ]4]12]23] (890-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bakhas milaavhu naanak jag anDh. ||4||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	O Nanak, the people of world are blind; please, Lord, forgive them, and unite them with Yourself. ||4||
DEFINE	para 38757	kir sMjogu bnweI kwiC ] (890-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kar sanjog banaa-ee kaachh. Joining the elements together, the robe of the body is fashioned.
DEFINE	para 38758	iqsu sMig rihE ieAwnw rwic ] (890-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tis sang rahi-o i-aanaa raach. The ignorant fool is engrossed in it.
RECORD	para 38759	pRiqpwrY inq swir smwrY ] (890-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) partipaarai nit saar samaarai. He cherishes it, and constantly takes care of it.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	AMq kI bwr aUiT isDwrY ]1] (890-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ant kee baar ooth siDhaarai. ||1||
REQUIRE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	But at the very last moment, he must arise and depart. ||1||
DEFINE	para 38761	nwm ibnw sBu JUTu prwnI ] (890-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naam binaa sabh jhooth paraanee. Without the Naam, the Name of the Lord, everything is false, O mortal.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	goivd Bjn ibnu Avr sMig rwqy qy siB mwieAw mUTu prwnI ]1] rhwau ] (890-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) govid bhajan bin avar sang raatay tay sabh maa-i-aa mooth paraanee. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. Those who do not vibrate and meditate on the Lord of the Universe, but instead are imbued with other things, - all those mortals are plundered by Maya. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 38763	qIrQ nwie n auqris mYlu ] (890-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tirath naa-ay na utras mail. Bathing at sacred shrines of pilgrimage, filth is not washed off.
DEFINE	para 38764	krm Drm siB haumY PYlu ] (890-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) karam Dharam sabh ha-umai fail. Religious rituals are all just egotistical displays.
DEFINE	para 38765	lok pcwrY giq nhI hoie ] (890-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) lok pachaarai gat nahee ho-ay. By pleasing and appeasing people, no one is saved.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	nwm ibhUxy clsih roie ]2] (890-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naam bihoonay chalsahi ro-ay. ||2||
REQUIRE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	Without the Naam, they shall depart weeping. ||2||
DEFINE	para 38767	ibnu hir nwm n tUtis ptl ] (890-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bin har naam na tootas patal. Without the Lord's Name, the screen is not torn away.
RECORD	para 38768	soDy swsqR isimRiq sgl ] (890-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) soDhay saastar simrit sagal. I have studied all the Shaastras and Simritees.
RECORD	para 38769	so nwmu jpY ijsu Awip jpwey ] (890-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) so naam japai jis aap japaa-ay. He alone chants the Naam, whom the Lord Himself inspires to chant.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	sgl Plw sy sUiK smwey ]3] (890-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sagal falaa say sookh samaa-ay. ||3||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	He obtains all fruits and rewards, and merges in peace. ||3||
RECORD	para 38771	rwKnhwry rwKhu Awip ] (890-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) raakhanhaaray raakho aap. O Savior Lord, please save me!
DEFINE	para 38772	sgl suKw pRB qumrY hwiQ ] (890-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sagal sukhaa parabh tumrai haath. All peace and comforts are in Your Hand, God.
RECORD	para 38773	ijqu lwvih iqqu lwgh suAwmI ] (890-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jit laaveh tit laagah su-aamee. Whatever you attach me to, to that I am attached, O my Lord and Master.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	nwnk swihbu AMqrjwmI ]4]13]24] (890-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak saahib antarjaamee. ||4||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	O Nanak, the Lord is the Inner-knower, the Searcher of hearts. ||4||
RECORD	para 38776	jo ikCu krY soeI suKu jwnw ] (890-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jo kichh karai so-ee sukh jaanaa. Whatever He does makes me happy.
DEFINE	para 38777	mnu AsmJu swDsMig pqIAwnw ] (890-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) man asmajh saaDhsang patee-aanaa. The ignorant mind is encouraged, in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy.
RECORD	para 38778	foln qy cUkw ThrwieAw ] (890-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) dolan tay chookaa thehraa-i-aa. Now, it does not waver at all; it has become stable and steady.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	siq mwih ly siq smwieAw ]1] (890-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sat maahi lay sat samaa-i-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	Receiving Truth, it is merged in the True Lord. ||1||
DEFINE	para 38780	dUKu gieAw sBu rogu gieAw ] (890-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) dookh ga-i-aa sabh rog ga-i-aa. Pain is gone, and all illness is gone.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	pRB kI AwigAw mn mih mwnI mhw purK kw sMgu BieAw ]1] rhwau ] (890-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) parabh kee aagi-aa man meh maanee mahaa purakh kaa sang bha-i-aa. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. I have accepted the Will of God in my mind, associating with the Great Person, the Guru. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 38782	sgl pivqR srb inrmlw ] (890-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sagal pavitar sarab nirmalaa. All is pure; all is immaculate.
DEFINE	para 38783	jo vrqwey soeI Blw ] (890-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jo vartaa-ay so-ee bhalaa. Whatever exists is good.
DEFINE	para 38784	jh rwKY soeI mukiq Qwnu ] (890-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jah raakhai so-ee mukat thaan. Wherever He keeps me, that is the place of liberation for me.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	jo jpwey soeI nwmu ]2] (890-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jo japaa-ay so-ee naam. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 v2	Whatever He makes me chant, is His Name. ||2||
DEFINE	para 38786	ATsiT qIrQ jh swD pg Drih ] (890-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) athsath tirath jah saaDh pag Dhareh. That is the sixty-eight sacred shrines of pilgrimage, where the Holy place their feet,
DEFINE	para 38787	qh bYkuMTu jh nwmu aucrih ] (890-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tah baikunth jah naam uchrahi. and that is heaven, where the Naam is chanted.
WHEN	para 38788	srb Anµd jb drsnu pweIAY ] (890-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sarab anand jab darsan paa-ee-ai. All bliss comes, when one obtains the Blessed Vision of the Lord's Darshan.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	rwm guxw inq inq hir gweIAY ]3] (890-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) raam gunaa nit nit har gaa-ee-ai. ||3||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v3	I sing continuously, continually, the Glorious Praises of the Lord. ||3||
DEFINE	para 38790	Awpy Git Git rihAw ibAwip ] (890-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay ghat ghat rahi-aa bi-aap. The Lord Himself is pervading in each and every heart.
DEFINE	para 38791	dieAwl purK prgt prqwp ] (890-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) da-i-aal purakh pargat partaap. The glory of the Merciful Lord is radiant and manifest.
DEFINE	para 38792	kpt Kulwny BRm nwTy dUry ] (890-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kapat khulaanay bharam naathay dooray. The shutters are opened, and doubts have run away.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	nwnk kau gur Byty pUry ]4]14]25] (890-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak ka-o gur bhaytay pooray. ||4||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v4	Nanak has met with the Perfect Guru. ||4||
RECORD	para 38795	koit jwp qwp ibsRwm ] (890-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kot jaap taap bisraam. Millions of meditations and austerities rest in him,
UPHOLD	para 38796	iriD buiD isiD sur igAwn ] (890-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) riDh buDh siDh sur gi-aan. along with wealth, wisdom, miraculous spiritual powers and angelic spiritual insight.
RECORD	para 38797	Aink rUp rMg Bog rsY ] (890-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) anik roop rang bhog rasai. He enjoys the various shows and forms, pleasures and delicacies;
