DEFINE	para 39865	koeI khqau Anµin BgauqI ] (912-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ko-ee kahta-o annan bhag-utee. Some claim that they are devotees of the One Lord alone.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v2	moih dIn hir hir Et lIqI ]2] (912-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) mohi deen har har ot leetee. ||2||
