RECORD	para 39867	iknhI kihAw hau qIrQ vwsI ] (912-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kinhee kahi-aa ha-o tirath vaasee. Some say that they live at sacred shrines of pilgrimage.
RECORD	para 39868	koeI AMnu qij BieAw audwsI ] (912-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ko-ee ann taj bha-i-aa udaasee. Some refuse food and become Udaasis, shaven-headed renunciates.
