RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v4	I am meek; I have the support of the Lord, Har, Har. ||4||
RECORD	para 39876	iknhI GUGr inriq krweI ] (913-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kinhee ghooghar nirat karaa-ee. Some dance, wearing ankle bells.
RECORD	para 39877	iknhU vrq nym mwlw pweI ] (913-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kinhoo varat naym maalaa paa-ee. Some fast and take vows, and wear malas.
RECORD	para 39878	iknhI iqlku gopI cMdn lwieAw ] (913-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kinhee tilak gopee chandan laa-i-aa. Some apply ceremonial tilak marks to their foreheads.
