RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v5	I am meek; I meditate on the Lord, Har, Har, Har. ||5||
RECORD	para 39880	iknhI isD bhu cytk lwey ] (913-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kinhee siDh baho chaytak laa-ay. Some work spells using the miraculous spiritual powers of the Siddhas.
RECORD	para 39881	iknhI ByK bhu Qwt bnwey ] (913-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kinhee bhaykh baho thaat banaa-ay. Some wear various religious robes and establish their authority.
RECORD	para 39882	iknhI qMq mMq bhu Kyvw ] (913-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kinhee tant mant baho khayvaa. Some perform Tantric spells, and chant various mantras.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v6	moih dIn hir hir hir syvw ]6] (913-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) mohi deen har har har sayvaa. ||6||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v6	I am meek; I serve the Lord, Har, Har, Har. ||6||
RECORD	para 39884	koeI cquru khwvY pMifq ] (913-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ko-ee chatur kahaavai pandit. One calls himself a wise Pandit, a religious scholar.
RECORD	para 39885	ko Ktu krm sihq isau mMifq ] (913-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ko khat karam sahit si-o mandit. One performs the six rituals to appease Shiva.
RECORD	para 39886	koeI krY Awcwr sukrxI ] (913-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ko-ee karai aachaar sukarnee. One maintains the rituals of pure lifestyle, and does good deeds.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v7	moih dIn hir hir hir srxI ]7] (913-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) mohi deen har har har sarnee. ||7||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 AstpdIAw v7	I am meek; I seek the Sanctuary of the Lord, Har, Har, Har. ||7||
RECORD	para 39888	sgly krm Drm jug soDy ] (913-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) saglay karam Dharam jug soDhay. I have studied the religions and rituals of all the ages.
DEFINE	para 39889	ibnu nwvY iehu mnu n pRboDy ] (913-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bin naavai ih man na parboDhay. Without the Name, this mind is not awakened.
WHEN	para 39890	khu nwnk jau swDsMgu pwieAw ] (913-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kaho naanak ja-o saaDhsang paa-i-aa. Says Nanak, when I found the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy,
