RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 v1	In your mother's womb, He preserved you. ||1||
RECORD	para 39897	rwKnhwru smHwir jnw ] (913-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) raakhanhaar sam Haar janaa. Contemplate your Savior Lord.
