RECORD	para 40085	pMc dUq quDu vis kIqy kwlu kMtku mwirAw ] (917-12, rwmklI, mÚ 3) panch doot tuDh vas keetay kaal kantak maari-aa. Through You, we subdue the five demons of desire, and slay Death, the torturer.
