UPHOLD	para 40095	kir ikrpw iklivK kty igAwn AMjnu swirAw ] (917-17, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kar kirpaa kilvikh katay gi-aan anjan saari-aa. Granting His Grace, He cuts away our sins; He blesses us with the healing ointment of spiritual wisdom.
RECORD	para 40096	AMdrhu ijn kw mohu qutw iqn kw sbdu scY svwirAw ] (917-18, rwmklI, mÚ 3) andrahu jin kaa moh tutaa tin kaa sabad sachai savaari-aa. Those who eradicate attachment from within themselves, are adorned with the Shabad, the Word of the True Lord.
