DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v7	Says Nanak, this alone is bliss - bliss which is known through the Guru. ||7||
RECORD	para 40099	bwbw ijsu qU dyih soeI jnu pwvY ] (918-1, rwmklI, mÚ 3) baabaa jis too deh so-ee jan paavai. O Baba, he alone receives it, unto whom You give it.
RECORD	para 40100	pwvY q so jnu dyih ijs no hoir ikAw krih vycwirAw ] (918-1, rwmklI, mÚ 3) paavai ta so jan deh jis no hor ki-aa karahi vaychaari-aa. He alone receives it, unto whom You give it; what can the other poor wretched beings do?
RECORD	para 40101	ieik Brim BUly iPrih dh idis ieik nwim lwig svwirAw ] (918-2, rwmklI, mÚ 3) ik bharam bhoolay fireh dah dis ik naam laag savaari-aa. Some are deluded by doubt, wandering in the ten directions; some are adorned with attachment to the Naam.
RECORD	para 40102	gur prswdI mnu BieAw inrmlu ijnw Bwxw Bwvey ] (918-3, rwmklI, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee man bha-i-aa nirmal jinaa bhaanaa bhaav-ay. By Guru's Grace, the mind becomes immaculate and pure, for those who follow God's Will.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v8	khY nwnku ijsu dyih ipAwry soeI jnu pwvey ]8] (918-3, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kahai naanak jis deh pi-aaray so-ee jan paav-ay. ||8||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v8	Says Nanak, he alone receives it, unto whom You give it, O Beloved Lord. ||8||
RECORD	para 40104	Awvhu sMq ipAwirho AkQ kI krh khwxI ] (918-4, rwmklI, mÚ 3) aavhu sant pi-aariho akath kee karah kahaanee. Come, Beloved Saints, let us speak the Unspoken Speech of the Lord.
RECORD	para 40105	krh khwxI AkQ kyrI ikqu duAwrY pweIAY ] (918-4, rwmklI, mÚ 3) karah kahaanee akath kayree kit du-aarai paa-ee-ai. How can we speak the Unspoken Speech of the Lord? Through which door will we find Him?
RECORD	para 40106	qnu mnu Dnu sBu sauip gur kau hukim mMinAY pweIAY ] (918-5, rwmklI, mÚ 3) tan man Dhan sabh sa-up gur ka-o hukam mani-ai paa-ee-ai. Surrender body, mind, wealth, and everything to the Guru; obey the Order of His Will, and you will find Him.
RECORD	para 40107	hukmu mMinhu gurU kyrw gwvhu scI bwxI ] (918-5, rwmklI, mÚ 3) hukam mannihu guroo kayraa gaavhu sachee banee. Obey the Hukam of the Guru's Command, and sing the True Word of His Bani.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v9	khY nwnku suxhu sMqhu kiQhu AkQ khwxI ]9] (918-6, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kahai naanak sunhu santahu kathihu akath kahaanee. ||9||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v9	Says Nanak, listen, O Saints, and speak the Unspoken Speech of the Lord. ||9||
RECORD	para 40109	ey mn cMclw cqurweI iknY n pwieAw ] (918-6, rwmklI, mÚ 3) ay man chanchlaa chaturaa-ee kinai na paa-i-aa. O fickle mind, through cleverness, no one has found the Lord.
RECORD	para 40110	cqurweI n pwieAw iknY qU suix mMn myirAw ] (918-7, rwmklI, mÚ 3) chaturaa-ee na paa-i-aa kinai too sun man mayri-aa. Through cleverness, no one has found Him; listen, O my mind.
DEFINE	para 40111	eyh mwieAw mohxI ijin eyqu Brim BulwieAw ] (918-7, rwmklI, mÚ 3) ayh maa-i-aa mohnee jin ayt bharam bhulaa-i-aa. This Maya is so fascinating; because of it, people wander in doubt.
RECORD	para 40112	mwieAw q mohxI iqnY kIqI ijin TgaulI pweIAw ] (918-8, rwmklI, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa ta mohnee tinai keetee jin thag-ulee paa-ee-aa. This fascinating Maya was created by the One who has administered this potion.
RECORD	para 40113	kurbwxu kIqw iqsY ivthu ijin mohu mITw lwieAw ] (918-8, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kurbaan keetaa tisai vitahu jin moh meethaa laa-i-aa. I am a sacrifice to the One who has made emotional attachment sweet.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v10	khY nwnku mn cMcl cqurweI iknY n pwieAw ]10] (918-9, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kahai naanak man chanchal chaturaa-ee kinai na paa-i-aa. ||10||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v10	Says Nanak, O fickle mind, no one has found Him through cleverness. ||10||
RECORD	para 40115	ey mn ipAwirAw qU sdw scu smwly ] (918-9, rwmklI, mÚ 3) ay man pi-aari-aa too sadaa sach samaalay. O beloved mind, contemplate the True Lord forever.
FORBID	para 40116	eyhu kutMbu qU ij dyKdw clY nwhI qyrY nwly ] (918-10, rwmklI, mÚ 3) ayhu kutamb too je daykh-daa chalai naahee tayrai naalay. This family which you see shall not go along with you.
