RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v11	khY nwnku mn ipAwry qU sdw scu smwly ]11] (918-12, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kahai naanak man pi-aaray too sadaa sach samaalay. ||11||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v11	Says Nanak, O beloved mind, contemplate the True Lord forever. ||11||
RECORD	para 40121	Agm Agocrw qyrw AMqu n pwieAw ] (918-12, rwmklI, mÚ 3) agam agocharaa tayraa ant na paa-i-aa. O inaccessible and unfathomable Lord, Your limits cannot be found.
