RECORD	para 40128	jIA jMq siB quDu aupwey ieik vyiK prsix AwieAw ] (918-16, rwmklI, mÚ 3) jee-a jant sabh tuDh upaa-ay ik vaykh parsan aa-i-aa. All living beings and creatures were created by You; only some come to see the Guru, and seek His blessing.
