RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v13	khY nwnku ijs no Awip quTw iqin AMimRqu gur qy pwieAw ]13] (918-17, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kahai naanak jis no aap tuthaa tin amrit gur tay paa-i-aa. ||13||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v13	Says Nanak, those with whom the Lord is pleased, obtain the Amrit, through the Guru. ||13||
DEFINE	para 40131	Bgqw kI cwl inrwlI ] (918-18, rwmklI, mÚ 3) bhagtaa kee chaal niraalee. The lifestyle of the devotees is unique and distinct.
DEFINE	para 40132	cwlw inrwlI Bgqwh kyrI ibKm mwrig clxw ] (918-18, rwmklI, mÚ 3) chaalaa niraalee bhagtaah kayree bikham maarag chalnaa. The devotees' lifestyle is unique and distinct; they follow the most difficult path.
RECORD	para 40133	lbu loBu AhMkwru qij iqRsnw bhuqu nwhI bolxw ] (918-18, rwmklI, mÚ 3) lab lobh aha Nkaar taj tarisnaa bahut naahee bolnaa. They renounce greed, avarice, egotism and desire; they do not talk too much.
DEFINE	para 40134	KMinAhu iqKI vwlhu inkI eyqu mwrig jwxw ] (918-19, rwmklI, mÚ 3) khanni-ahu tikhee vaalahu nikee ayt maarag jaanaa. The path they take is sharper than a two-edged sword, and finer than a hair.
