RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v14	khY nwnku cwl Bgqw jughu jugu inrwlI ]14] (919-1, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kahai naanak chaal bhagtaa jugahu jug niraalee. ||14||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v14	Says Nanak, the lifestyle of the devotees, in each and every age, is unique and distinct. ||14||
