RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v35	khY nwnku eyhu srIru prvwxu hoAw ijin siqgur isau icqu lwieAw ]35] (922-4, rwmklI, mÚ 3) kahai naanak ayhu sareer parvaan ho-aa jin satgur si-o chit laa-i-aa. ||35||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 3 Anµdu v35	Says Nanak, this body is adorned and honored, when one's consciousness is focused on the True Guru. ||35||
