DEFINE	para 40418	so suAwmI pRBu rKko AMcil qw kY lwgu jIau ] (926-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) so su-aamee parabh rakhko anchal taa kai laag jee-o. He is God, our Lord and Master, our Saving Grace. Grab hold of the hem of His robe.
RECORD	para 40419	Bju swDU sMig dieAwl dyv mn kI miq iqAwgu jIau ] (926-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bhaj saaDhoo sang da-i-aal dayv man kee mat ti-aag jee-o. Vibrate, and meditate on the Merciful Divine Lord in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy; renounce your intellectual mind.
RECORD	para 40421	iek Et kIjY jIau dIjY Aws iek DrxIDrY ] (927-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ik ot keejai jee-o deejai aas ik DharneeDharai. Seek the Support of the One Lord, and surrender your soul to Him; place your hopes only in the Sustainer of the World.
RECORD	para 40422	swDsMgy hir nwm rMgy sMswru swgru sBu qrY ] (927-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) saaDhsangay har naam rangay sansaar saagar sabh tarai. Those who are imbued with the Lord's Name, in the Saadh Sangat, cross over the terrifying world-ocean.
DEFINE	para 40423	jnm mrx ibkwr CUty iPir n lwgY dwgu jIau ] (927-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) janam maran bikaar chhootay fir na laagai daag jee-o. The corrupting sins of birth and death are eradicated, and no stain ever sticks to them again.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 CMq v3	bil jwie nwnku purK pUrn iQru jw kw sohwgu jIau ]3] (927-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bal jaa-ay naanak purakh pooran thir jaa kaa sohaag jee-o. ||3||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 CMq v3	Nanak is a sacrifice to the Perfect Primal Lord; His marriage is eternal. ||3||
RECORD	para 40425	sloku ] (927-3) salok. Shalok:
UPHOLD	para 40426	Drm ArQ Aru kwm moK mukiq pdwrQ nwQ ] (927-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) Dharam arath ar kaam mokh mukat padaarath naath. Righteous faith, wealth, sexual success and salvation; the Lord bestows these four blessings.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 CMq v1	sgl mnorQ pUirAw nwnk iliKAw mwQ ]1] (927-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sagal manorath poori-aa naanak likhi-aa maath. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 CMq v1	One who has such pre-ordained destiny upon his forehead, O Nanak, has all his desires fulfilled. ||1||
RECORD	para 40428	CMqu ] (927-4) chhant. Chhant:
DEFINE	para 40429	sgl ieC myrI puMnIAw imilAw inrMjn rwie jIau ] (927-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sagal ichh mayree punnee-aa mili-aa niranjan raa-ay jee-o. All my desires are fulfilled, meeting with my Immaculate, Sovereign Lord.
RECORD	para 40430	Andu BieAw vfBwgIho igRih pRgty pRB Awie jIau ] (927-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) anad bha-i-aa vadbhaageeho garihi pargatay parabh aa-ay jee-o. I am in ecstasy, O very fortunate ones; the Dear Lord has become manifest in my own home.
RECORD	para 40431	igRih lwl Awey purib kmwey qw kI aupmw ikAw gxw ] (927-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) garihi laal aa-ay purab kamaa-ay taa kee upmaa ki-aa ganaa. My Beloved has come to my home, because of my past actions; how can I count His Glories?
RECORD	para 40432	byAMq pUrn suK shj dwqw kvn rsnw gux Bxw ] (927-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bay-ant pooran sukh sahj daataa kavan rasnaa gun bhanaa. The Lord, the Giver of peace and intuition, is infinite and perfect; with what tongue can I describe His Glorious Virtues?
RECORD	para 40433	Awpy imlwey gih kMiT lwey iqsu ibnw nhI jwie jIau ] (927-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay milaa-ay geh kanth laa-ay tis binaa nahee jaa-ay jee-o. He hugs me close in His embrace, and merges me into Himself; there is no place of rest other than Him.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 CMq v4	bil jwie nwnku sdw krqy sB mih rihAw smwie jIau ]4]4] (927-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bal jaa-ay naanak sadaa kartay sabh meh rahi-aa samaa-ay jee-o. ||4||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 CMq v4	4|| Nanak is forever a sacrifice to the Creator, who is contained in, and permeating all. ||4||4||
RECORD	rwgu rwmklI mhlw 5	rwgu rwmklI mhlw 5 ] (927-8)
RECORD	para 40435	raag raamkalee mehlaa 5. Raag Raamkalee, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 40436	rx JuMJnVw gwau sKI hir eyku iDAwvhu ] (927-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ran jhunjhnarhaa gaa-o sakhee har ayk Dhi-aavahu. Sing the melodious harmonies, O my companions, and meditate on the One Lord.
REQUIRE	para 40437	siqguru qum syiv sKI min icMidAVw Plu pwvhu ] (927-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) satgur tum sayv sakhee man chindi-arhaa fal paavhu. Serve your True Guru, O my companions, and you shall obtain the fruits of your mind's desires.
