RECORD	para 40438	raamkalee mehlaa 5 rutee salok Raamkalee, Fifth Mehl, Ruti ~ The Seasons. Shalok:
RECORD	para 40439	<> siqgur pRswid ] (927-10) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
RECORD	para 40440	kir bMdn pRB pwrbRhm bwCau swDh DUir ] (927-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kar bandan parabh paarbarahm baachha-o saaDhah Dhoor. Bow to the Supreme Lord God, and seek the dust of the feet of the Holy.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	Awpu invwir hir hir Bjau nwnk pRB BrpUir ]1] (927-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aap nivaar har har bhaja-o naanak parabh bharpoor. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	Cast out your self-conceit, and vibrate, meditate, on the Lord, Har, Har. O Nanak, God is all-pervading. ||1||
DEFINE	para 40442	iklivK kwtx BY hrx suK swgr hir rwie ] (927-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kilvikh kaatan bhai haran sukh saagar har raa-ay. He is the Eradicator of sins, the Destroyer of fear, the Ocean of peace, the Sovereign Lord King.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	dIn dieAwl duK BMjno nwnk nIq iDAwie ]2] (927-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) deen da-i-aal dukh bhanjno naanak neet Dhi-aa-ay. ||2||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	Merciful to the meek, the Destroyer of pain: O Nanak, always meditate on Him. ||2||
RECORD	para 40444	CMqu ] (927-13) chhant. Chhant:
REQUIRE	para 40445	jsu gwvhu vfBwgIho kir ikrpw BgvMq jIau ] (927-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jas gaavhu vadbhaageeho kar kirpaa bhagvant jee-o. Sing His Praises, O very fortunate ones, and the Dear Lord God shall bless you with His Mercy.
WHEN	para 40446	ruqI mwh mUrq GVI gux aucrq soBwvMq jIau ] (927-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) rutee maah moorat gharhee gun uchrat sobhaavant jee-o. Blessed and auspicious is that season, that month, that moment, that hour, when you chant the Lord's Glorious Praises.
UPHOLD	para 40447	gux rMig rwqy DMin qy jn ijnI iek min iDAwieAw ] (927-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) gun rang raatay Dhan tay jan jinee ik man Dhi-aa-i-aa. Blessed are those humble beings, who are imbued with love for His Praises, and who meditate single-mindedly on Him.
RECORD	para 40448	sPl jnmu BieAw iqn kw ijnI so pRBu pwieAw ] (927-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) safal janam bha-i-aa tin kaa jinee so parabh paa-i-aa. Their lives become fruitful, and they find that Lord God.
RECORD	para 40449	puMn dwn n quil ikirAw hir srb pwpw hMq jIau ] (927-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) punn daan na tul kiri-aa har sarab paapaa hant jee-o. Donations to charities and religious rituals are not equal to meditation on the Lord, who destroys all sins.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	ibnvMiq nwnk ismir jIvw jnm mrx rhMq jIau ]1] (927-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binvant naanak simar jeevaa janam maran rahant jee-o. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	Prays Nanak, meditating in remembrance on Him, I live; birth and death are finished for me. ||1||
RECORD	para 40451	slok ] (927-16) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 40452	audmu Agmu Agocro crn kml nmskwr ] (927-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) udam agam agocharo charan kamal namaskaar. Strive for the inaccessible and unfathomable Lord, and bow in humility to His lotus feet.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	kQnI sw quDu BwvsI nwnk nwm ADwr ]1] (927-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kathnee saa tuDh bhaavsee naanak naam aDhaar. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	O Nanak, that sermon alone is pleasing to You, Lord, which inspires us to take the Support of the Name. ||1||
RECORD	para 40454	sMq srix swjn prhu suAwmI ismir Anµq ] (927-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sant saran saajan parahu su-aamee simar anant. Seek the Sanctuary of the Saints, O friends; meditate in remembrance on your infinite Lord and Master.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	sUky qy hirAw QIAw nwnk jip BgvMq ]2] (927-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sookay tay hari-aa thee-aa naanak jap bhagvant. ||2||
REQUIRE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	The dried branch shall blossom forth in its greenery again, O Nanak, meditating on the Lord God. ||2||
RECORD	para 40456	CMqu ] (927-18) chhant. Chhant:
RECORD	para 40457	ruiq srs bsMq mwh cyqu vYswK suK mwsu jIau ] (927-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) rut saras basant maah chayt vaisaakh sukh maas jee-o. The season of spring is delightful; the months of Chayt and Baisaakhi are the most pleasant months.
RECORD	para 40458	hir jIau nwhu imilAw mauilAw mnu qnu swsu jIau ] (927-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) har jee-o naahu mili-aa ma-oli-aa man tan saas jee-o. I have obtained the Dear Lord as my Husband, and my mind, body and breath have blossomed forth.
RECORD	para 40459	Gir nwhu inhclu Andu sKIey crn kml pRPuilAw ] (927-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ghar naahu nihchal anad sakhee-ay charan kamal parfuli-aa. The eternal, unchanging Lord has come into my home as my Husband, O my companions; dwelling upon His lotus feet, I blossom forth in bliss.
DEFINE	para 40461	suMdru suGVu sujwxu byqw gux goivMd AmuilAw ] (928-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sundar sugharh sujaan baytaa gun govind amuli-aa. The Lord of the Universe is beautiful, proficient, wise and all-knowing;
RECORD	para 40462	vfBwig pwieAw duKu gvwieAw BeI pUrn Aws jIau ] (928-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) vadbhaag paa-i-aa dukh gavaa-i-aa bha-ee pooran aas jee-o. His Virtues are priceless. By great good fortune, I have found Him; my pain is dispelled, and my hopes are fulfilled.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	ibnvMiq nwnk srix qyrI imtI jm kI qRws jIau ]2] (928-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binvant naanak saran tayree mitee jam kee taraas jee-o. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	Prays Nanak, I have entered Your Sanctuary, Lord, and my fear of death is eradicated. ||2||
RECORD	para 40464	slok ] (928-2) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 40465	swDsMgiq ibnu BRim mueI krqI krm Anyk ] (928-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) saaDhsangat bin bharam mu-ee kartee karam anayk. Without the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, one dies wandering around in confusion, performing all sorts of rituals.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	koml bMDn bwDIAw nwnk krmih lyK ]1] (928-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) komal banDhan baaDhee-aa naanak karmeh laykh. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	O Nanak, all are bound by the attractive bonds of Maya, and the karmic record of past actions. ||1||
DEFINE	para 40467	jo Bwxy sy myilAw ivCoVy BI Awip ] (928-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jo bhaanay say mayli-aa vichhorhay bhee aap. Those who are pleasing to God are united with Him; He separates others from Himself.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	nwnk pRB srxwgqI jw kw vf prqwpu ]2] (928-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak parabh sarnaagatee jaa kaa vad partaap. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	Nanak has entered the Sanctuary of God; His greatness is glorious! ||2||
RECORD	para 40469	CMqu ] (928-4) chhant. Chhant:
RECORD	para 40470	gRIKm ruiq Aiq gwKVI jyT AKwVY Gwm jIau ] (928-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) gareekham rut at gaakh-rhee jayth akhaarhai ghaam jee-o. In the summer season, in the months of Jayt'h and Asaarh, the heat is terrible, intense and severe.
DEFINE	para 40471	pRym ibCohu duhwgxI idRsit n krI rwm jIau ] (928-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) paraym bichhohu duhaaganee darisat na karee raam jee-o. The discarded bride is separated from His Love, and the Lord does not even look at her.
RECORD	para 40472	nh idRsit AwvY mrq hwvY mhw gwrib muTIAw ] (928-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) nah darisat aavai marat haavai mahaa gaarab muthee-aa. She does not see her Lord, and she dies with an aching sigh; she is defrauded and plundered by her great pride.
RECORD	para 40473	jl bwJu mCulI qVPVwvY sMig mwieAw ruTIAw ] (928-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jal baajh machhulee tarhfarhaavai sang maa-i-aa ruthee-aa. She flails around, like a fish out of water; attached to Maya, she is alienated from the Lord.
RECORD	para 40474	kir pwp jonI BY BIq hoeI dyie swsn jwm jIau ] (928-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kar paap jonee bhai bheet ho-ee day-ay saasan jaam jee-o. She sins, and so she is fearful of reincarnation; the Messenger of Death will surely punish her.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v3	ibnvMiq nwnk Et qyrI rwKu pUrn kwm jIau ]3] (928-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binvant naanak ot tayree raakh pooran kaam jee-o. ||3||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v3	Prays Nanak, take me under Your sheltering support, Lord, and protect me; You are the Fulfiller of desire. ||3||
RECORD	para 40476	slok ] (928-8) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 40477	srDw lwgI sMig pRIqmY ieku iqlu rhxu n jwie ] (928-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sarDhaa laagee sang pareetamai ik til rahan na jaa-ay. With loving faith, I am attached to my Beloved; I cannot survive without Him, even for an instant.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	mn qn AMqir riv rhy nwnk shij suBwie ]1] (928-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) man tan antar rav rahay naanak sahj subhaa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	He is permeating and pervading my mind and body, O Nanak, with intuitive ease. ||1||
RECORD	para 40479	kru gih lInI swjnih jnm jnm ky mIq ] (928-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kar geh leenee saajniH janam janam kay meet. My Friend has taken me by the hand; He has been my best friend, lifetime after lifetime.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	crnh dwsI kir leI nwnk pRB ihq cIq ]2] (928-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) charnah daasee kar la-ee naanak parabh hit cheet. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	He has made me the slave of His feet; O Nanak, my consciousness is filled with love for God. ||2||
RECORD	para 40481	CMqu ] (928-10) chhant. Chhant:
DEFINE	para 40482	ruiq brsu suhylIAw swvx Bwdvy Awnµd jIau ] (928-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) rut baras suhaylee-aa saavan bhaadvay aanand jee-o. The rainy season is beautiful; the months of Saawan and Bhaadon bring bliss.
DEFINE	para 40483	Gx auniv vuTy jl Ql pUirAw mkrMd jIau ] (928-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ghan unav vuthay jal thal poori-aa makrand jee-o. The clouds are low, and heavy with rain; the waters and the lands are filled with honey.
RECORD	para 40484	pRBu pUir rihAw srb TweI hir nwm nv iniD igRh Bry ] (928-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) parabh poor rahi-aa sarab thaa-ee har naam nav niDh garih bharay. God is all-pervading everywhere; the nine treasures of the Lord's Name fill the homes of all hearts.
