RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v4	ibnvMiq nwnk hir kMqu pwieAw sdw min BwvMdu jIau ]4] (928-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binvant naanak har kant paa-i-aa sadaa man bhaavand jee-o. ||4||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v4	Prays Nanak, I have found my Husband Lord, who is forever pleasing to my mind. ||4||
RECORD	para 40488	slok ] (928-13) salok. Shalok:
