RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	hY koeI swjnu sMq jnu nwnk pRB mylxhwr ]1] (928-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) hai ko-ee saajan sant jan naanak parabh maylanhaar. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	Is there any humble Saint, any friend, O Nanak, who can lead me to meet with God? ||1||
RECORD	para 40491	ibnu imlby sWiq n aUpjY iqlu plu rhxu n jwie ] (928-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bin milbay saa Nt na oopjai til pal rahan na jaa-ay. Without meeting Him, I have no peace or tranquility; I cannot survive for a moment, even for an instant.
