DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	Entering the Sanctuary of the Lord's Holy Saints, O Nanak, my desires are fulfilled. ||2||
RECORD	para 40493	CMqu ] (928-15) chhant. Chhant:
