UPHOLD	para 40496	ibnu kMq ipAwry nh sUK swry hwr kM|x iDRgu bnw ] (928-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bin kant pi-aaray nah sookh saaray haar kanyan Dharig banaa. Without my Beloved Husband Lord, I find no peace, and all my necklaces and bracelets become cursed.
DEFINE	para 40497	suMdir sujwix cquir byqI sws ibnu jYsy qnw ] (928-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sundar sujaan chatur baytee saas bin jaisay tanaa. So beautiful, so wise, so clever and knowing; still, without the breath, it is just a body.
DEFINE	para 40498	eIq auq dh ids Alokn min imln kI pRB ipAws jIau ] (928-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) eet ut dah dis alokan man milan kee parabh pi-aas jee-o. I look here and there, in the ten directions; my mind is so thirsty to meet God!
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v5	ibnvMiq nwnk Dwir ikrpw mylhu pRB guxqws jIau ]5] (928-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binvant naanak Dhaar kirpaa maylhu parabh guntaas jee-o. ||5||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v5	Prays Nanak, shower Your Mercy upon me; unite me with Yourself, O God, O treasure of virtue. ||5||
RECORD	para 40500	slok ] (928-19) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 40501	jlix buJI sIql Bey min qin aupjI sWiq ] (928-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jalan bujhee seetal bha-ay man tan upjee saa Nt. The fire of desire is cooled and quenched; my mind and body are filled with peace and tranquility.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	nwnk pRB pUrn imly duqIAw ibnsI BRWiq ]1] (928-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak parabh pooran milay dutee-aa binsee bharaaNt. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	O Nanak, I have met my Perfect God; the illusion of duality is dispelled. ||1||
DEFINE	para 40504	swD pTwey Awip hir hm qum qy nwhI dUir ] (929-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) saaDh pathaa-ay aap har ham tum tay naahee door. The Lord Himself sent His Holy Saints, to tell us that He is not far away.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	nwnk BRm BY imit gey rmx rwm BrpUir ]2] (929-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak bharam bhai mit ga-ay raman raam bharpoor. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	O Nanak, doubt and fear are dispelled, chanting the Name of the all-pervading Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 40506	CMqu ] (929-2) chhant. Chhant:
RECORD	para 40507	ruiq issIAr sIql hir pRgty mMGr poih jIau ] (929-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) rut sisee-ar seetal har pargatay manghar pohi jee-o. In the cold season of Maghar and Poh, the Lord reveals Himself.
WHEN	para 40508	jlin buJI drsu pwieAw ibnsy mwieAw DRoh jIau ] (929-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jalan bujhee daras paa-i-aa binsay maa-i-aa Dharoh jee-o. My burning desires were quenched, when I obtained the Blessed Vision of His Darshan; the fraudulent illusion of Maya is gone.
RECORD	para 40509	siB kwm pUry imil hjUry hir crx syvik syivAw ] (929-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sabh kaam pooray mil hajooray har charan sayvak sayvi-aa. All my desires have been fulfilled, meeting the Lord face-to-face; I am His servant, I serve at His feet.
RECORD	para 40510	hwr for sIgwr siB rs gux gwau AlK AByivAw ] (929-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) haar dor seegaar sabh ras gun gaa-o alakh abhayvi-aa. My necklaces, hair-ties, all decorations and adornments, are in singing the Glorious Praises of the unseen, mysterious Lord.
RECORD	para 40511	Bwau Bgiq goivMd bWCq jmu n swkY joih jIau ] (929-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bhaa-o bhagat govind baa Nchhat jam na saakai johi jee-o. I long for loving devotion to the Lord of the Universe, and so the Messenger of Death cannot even see me.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v6	ibnvMiq nwnk pRiB Awip mylI qh n pRym ibCoh jIau ]6] (929-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binvant naanak parabh aap maylee tah na paraym bichhoh jee-o. ||6||
REQUIRE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v6	Prays Nanak, God has united me with Himself; I shall never suffer separation from my Beloved again. ||6||
RECORD	para 40513	slok ] (929-5) salok. Shalok:
RECORD	para 40514	hir Dnu pwieAw sohwgxI folq nwhI cIq ] (929-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) har Dhan paa-i-aa sohaaganee dolat naahee cheet. The happy soul bride has found the wealth of the Lord; her consciousness does not waver.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	sMq sMjogI nwnkw igRih pRgty pRB mIq ]1] (929-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sant sanjogee naankaa garihi pargatay parabh meet. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	Joining together with the Saints, O Nanak, God, my Friend, has revealed Himself in my home. ||1||
RECORD	para 40516	nwd ibnod Anµd kof ipRA pRIqm sMig bny ] (929-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naad binod anand kod pari-a pareetam sang banay. With her Beloved Husband Lord, she enjoys millions of melodies, pleasures and joys.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	mn bWCq Pl pwieAw hir nwnk nwm Bny ]2] (929-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) man baa Nchhat fal paa-i-aa har naanak naam bhanay. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	The fruits of the mind's desires are obtained, O Nanak, chanting the Lord's Name. ||2||
RECORD	para 40518	CMqu ] (929-7) chhant. Chhant:
DEFINE	para 40519	ihmkr ruiq min BwvqI mwGu Pgxu guxvMq jIau ] (929-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) himkar rut man bhaavtee maagh fagan gunvant jee-o. The snowy winter season, the months of Maagh and Phagun, are pleasing and ennobling to the mind.
RECORD	para 40520	sKI shylI gwau mMglo igRih Awey hir kMq jIau ] (929-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sakhee sahaylee gaa-o manglo garihi aa-ay har kant jee-o. O my friends and companions, sing the songs of joy; my Husband Lord has come into my home.
RECORD	para 40521	igRih lwl Awey min iDAwey syj suMdir sohIAw ] (929-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) garihi laal aa-ay man Dhi-aa-ay sayj sundar sohee-aa. My Beloved has come into my home; I meditate on Him in my mind. The bed of my heart is beautifully adorned.
UPHOLD	para 40522	vxu iqRxu iqRBvx Bey hirAw dyiK drsn mohIAw ] (929-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) van tarin taribhavan bha-ay hari-aa daykh darsan mohee-aa. The woods, the meadows and the three worlds have blossomed forth in their greenery; gazing upon the Blessed Vision of His Darshan, I am fascinated.
RECORD	para 40523	imly suAwmI ieC puMnI min jipAw inrml mMq jIau ] (929-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) milay su-aamee ichh punnee man japi-aa nirmal mant jee-o. I have met my Lord and Master, and my desires are fulfilled; my mind chants His Immaculate Mantra.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v7	ibnvMiq nwnk inq krhu rlIAw hir imly sRIDr kMq jIau ]7] (929-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binvant naanak nit karahu ralee-aa har milay sareeDhar kant jee-o. ||7||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v7	Prays Nanak, I celebrate continuously; I have met my Husband Lord, the Lord of excellence. ||7||
RECORD	para 40525	slok ] (929-11) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 40526	sMq shweI jIA ky Bvjl qwrxhwr ] (929-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sant sahaa-ee jee-a kay bhavjal taaranhaar. The Saints are the helpers, the support of the soul; they carry us cross the terrifying world-ocean.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	sB qy aUcy jwxIAih nwnk nwm ipAwr ]1] (929-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sabh tay oochay jaanee-ahi naanak naam pi-aar. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v1	Know that they are the highest of all; O Nanak, they love the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||1||
DEFINE	para 40528	ijn jwinAw syeI qry sy sUry sy bIr ] (929-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jin jaani-aa say-ee taray say sooray say beer. Those who know Him, cross over; they are the brave heroes, the heroic warriors.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	nwnk iqn bilhwrxY hir jip auqry qIr ]2] (929-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak tin balihaarnai har jap utray teer. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v2	Nanak is a sacrifice to those who meditate on the Lord, and cross over to the other shore. ||2||
RECORD	para 40530	CMqu ] (929-13) chhant. Chhant:
DEFINE	para 40531	crx ibrwijq sB aUpry imitAw sgl klysu jIau ] (929-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) charan biraajit sabh oopray miti-aa sagal kalays jee-o. His feet are exalted above all. They eradicate all suffering.
RECORD	para 40532	Awvx jwvx duK hry hir Bgiq kIAw prvysu jIau ] (929-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aavan jaavan dukh haray har bhagat kee-aa parvays jee-o. They destroy the pains of coming and going. They bring loving devotion to the Lord.
RECORD	para 40533	hir rMig rwqy shij mwqy iqlu n mn qy bIsrY ] (929-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) har rang raatay sahj maatay til na man tay beesrai. Imbued with the Lord's Love, one is intoxicated with intuitive peace and poise, and does not forget the Lord from his mind, even for an instant.
RECORD	para 40534	qij Awpu srxI pry crnI srb gux jgdIsrY ] (929-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) taj aap sarnee paray charnee sarab gun jagdeesrai. Shedding my self-conceit, I have entered the Sanctuary of His Feet; all virtues rest in the Lord of the Universe.
RECORD	para 40535	goivMd gux iniD sRIrMg suAwmI Awid kau Awdysu jIau ] (929-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) govind gun niDh sareerang su-aamee aad ka-o aadays jee-o. I bow in humility to the Lord of the Universe, the treasure of virtue, the Lord of excellence, our Primal Lord and Master.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v8	ibnvMiq nwnk mieAw Dwrhu jugu jugo iek vysu jIau ]8]1]6]8] (929-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binvant naanak ma-i-aa Dhaarahu jug jugo ik vays jee-o. ||8||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 5 ruqI sloku v8	8|| Prays Nanak, shower me with Your Mercy, Lord; throughout the ages, You take the same form. ||8||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru (929-17)
RECORD	para 40537	raamkalee mehlaa 1 dakh-nee o-ankaar Raamkalee, First Mehl, Dakhanee, Ongkaar:
RECORD	para 40538	<> siqgur pRswid ] (929-17) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
RECORD	para 40539	EAMkwir bRhmw auqpiq ] (929-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) o-ankaar barahmaa utpat. From Ongkaar, the One Universal Creator God, Brahma was created.
RECORD	para 40540	EAMkwru kIAw ijin iciq ] (929-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) o-ankaar kee-aa jin chit. He kept Ongkaar in his consciousness.
RECORD	para 40541	EAMkwir sYl jug Bey ] (929-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) o-ankaar sail jug bha-ay. From Ongkaar, the mountains and the ages were created.
RECORD	para 40542	EAMkwir byd inrmey ] (929-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) o-ankaar bayd nirma-ay. Ongkaar created the Vedas.
RECORD	para 40544	EAMkwir sbid auDry ] (930-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) o-ankaar sabad uDhray. Ongkaar saves the world through the Shabad.
RECORD	para 40545	EAMkwir gurmuiK qry ] (930-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) o-ankaar gurmukh taray. Ongkaar saves the Gurmukhs.
RECORD	para 40546	Enm AKr suxhu bIcwru ] (930-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) onam akhar sunhu beechaar. Listen to the Message of the Universal, Imperishable Creator Lord.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v1	Enm AKru iqRBvx swru ]1] (930-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) onam akhar taribhavan saar. ||1||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v1	The Universal, Imperishable Creator Lord is the essence of the three worlds. ||1||
DEFINE	para 40548	suix pwfy ikAw ilKhu jMjwlw ] (930-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) sun paaday ki-aa likhahu janjaalaa. Listen, O Pandit, O religious scholar, why are you writing about worldly debates?
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v1	ilKu rwm nwm gurmuiK gopwlw ]1] rhwau ] (930-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) likh raam naam gurmukh gopaalaa. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v1	rahaa-o. As Gurmukh, write only the Name of the Lord, the Lord of the World. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 40550	ssY sBu jgu shij aupwieAw qIin Bvn iek joqI ] (930-3, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) sasai sabh jag sahj upaa-i-aa teen bhavan ik jotee. Sassa: He created the entire universe with ease; His One Light pervades the three worlds.
RECORD	para 40551	gurmuiK vsqu prwpiq hovY cuix lY mwxk moqI ] (930-3, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh vasat paraapat hovai chun lai maanak motee. Become Gurmukh, and obtain the real thing; gather the gems and pearls.
REQUIRE	para 40552	smJY sUJY piV piV bUJY AMiq inrMqir swcw ] (930-4, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) samjhai soojhai parh parh boojhai ant nirantar saachaa. If one understands, realizes and comprehends what he reads and studies, in the end he shall realize that the True Lord dwells deep within his nucleus.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v2	gurmuiK dyKY swcu smwly ibnu swcy jgu kwcw ]2] (930-4, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh daykhai saach samaalay bin saachay jag kaachaa. ||2||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v2	The Gurmukh sees and contemplates the True Lord; without the True Lord, the world is false. ||2||
RECORD	para 40554	DDY Drmu Dry Drmw puir guxkwrI mnu DIrw ] (930-5, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) DhaDhai Dharam Dharay Dharmaa pur gunkaaree man Dheeraa. Dhadha: Those who enshrine Dharmic faith and dwell in the City of Dharma are worthy; their minds are steadfast and stable.
WHEN	para 40555	DDY DUil pVY muiK msqik kMcn Bey mnUrw ] (930-5, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) DhaDhai Dhool parhai mukh mastak kanchan bha-ay manooraa. Dhadha: If the dust of their feet touches one's face and forehead, he is transformed from iron into gold.
UPHOLD	para 40556	Dnu DrxIDru Awip AjonI qoil boil scu pUrw ] (930-6, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) Dhan DharneeDhar aap ajonee tol bol sach pooraa. Blessed is the Support of the Earth; He Himself is not born; His measure and speech are perfect and True.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v3	krqy kI imiq krqw jwxY kY jwxY guru sUrw ]3] (930-6, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kartay kee mit kartaa jaanai kai jaanai gur sooraa. ||3||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v3	Only the Creator Himself knows His own extent; He alone knows the Brave Guru. ||3||
UPHOLD	para 40558	i|Awnu gvwieAw dUjw BwieAw grib gly ibKu KwieAw ] (930-7, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) nyi-aan gavaa-i-aa doojaa bhaa-i-aa garab galay bikh khaa-i-aa. In love with duality, spiritual wisdom is lost; the mortal rots away in pride, and eats poison.
RECORD	para 40559	gur rsu gIq bwd nhI BwvY suxIAY gihr gMBIru gvwieAw ] (930-7, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gur ras geet baad nahee bhaavai sunee-ai gahir gambheer gavaa-i-aa. He thinks that the sublime essence of the Guru's song is useless, and he does not like to hear it. He loses the profound, unfathomable Lord.
RECORD	para 40560	guir scu kihAw AMimRqu lihAw min qin swcu suKwieAw ] (930-8, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gur sach kahi-aa amrit lahi-aa man tan saach sukhaa-i-aa. Through the Guru's Words of Truth, the Ambrosial Nectar is obtained, and the mind and body find joy in the True Lord.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v4	Awpy gurmuiK Awpy dyvY Awpy AMimRqu pIAwieAw ]4] (930-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aapay gurmukh aapay dayvai aapay amrit pee-aa-i-aa. ||4||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v4	He Himself is the Gurmukh, and He Himself bestows the Ambrosial Nectar; He Himself leads us to drink it in. ||4||
DEFINE	para 40562	eyko eyku khY sBu koeI haumY grbu ivAwpY ] (930-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ayko ayk kahai sabh ko-ee ha-umai garab vi-aapai. Everyone says that God is the One and only, but they are engrossed in egotism and pride.
RECORD	para 40563	AMqir bwhir eyku pCwxY ieau Gru mhlu is\wpY ] (930-10, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) antar baahar ayk pachhaanai i-o ghar mahal sinjaapai. Realize that the One God is inside and outside; understand this, that the Mansion of His Presence is within the home of your heart.
RECORD	para 40564	pRBu nyVY hir dUir n jwxhu eyko isRsit sbweI ] (930-10, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) parabh nayrhai har door na jaanhu ayko sarisat sabaa-ee. God is near at hand; do not think that God is far away. The One Lord permeates the entire universe.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v5	eykMkwru Avru nhI dUjw nwnk eyku smweI ]5] (930-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aykankaar avar nahee doojaa naanak ayk samaa-ee. ||5||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v5	There in One Universal Creator Lord; there is no other at all. O Nanak, merge into the One Lord. ||5||
RECORD	para 40566	iesu krqy kau ikau gih rwKau APirE quilE n jweI ] (930-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) is kartay ka-o ki-o geh raakha-o afri-o tuli-o na jaa-ee. How can you keep the Creator under your control? He cannot be seized or measured.
RECORD	para 40567	mwieAw ky dyvwny pRwxI JUiT TgaurI pweI ] (930-12, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa kay dayvaanay paraanee jhooth thag-uree paa-ee. Maya has made the mortal insane; she has administered the poisonous drug of falsehood.
DEFINE	para 40568	lib loiB muhqwij ivgUqy ieb qb iPir pCuqweI ] (930-12, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) lab lobh muhtaaj vigootay ib tab fir pachhutaa-ee. Addicted to greed and avarice, the mortal is ruined, and then later, he regrets and repents.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v6	eyku sryvY qw giq imiq pwvY Awvxu jwxu rhweI ]6] (930-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ayk sarayvai taa gat mit paavai aavan jaan rahaa-ee. ||6||
REQUIRE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v6	So serve the One Lord, and attain the state of Salvation; your comings and goings shall cease. ||6||
DEFINE	para 40570	eyku Acwru rMgu ieku rUpu ] (930-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ayk achaar rang ik roop. The One Lord is in all actions, colors and forms.
RECORD	para 40571	paux pwxI AgnI AsrUpu ] (930-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) pa-un paanee agnee asroop. He manifests in many shapes through wind, water and fire.
RECORD	para 40572	eyko Bvru BvY iqhu loie ] (930-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ayko bhavar bhavai tihu lo-ay. The One Soul wanders through the three worlds.
DEFINE	para 40573	eyko bUJY sUJY piq hoie ] (930-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ayko boojhai soojhai pat ho-ay. One who understands and comprehends the One Lord is honored.
UPHOLD	para 40574	igAwnu iDAwnu ly smsir rhY ] (930-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gi-aan Dhi-aan lay samsar rahai. One who gathers in spiritual wisdom and meditation, dwells in the state of balance.
DEFINE	para 40575	gurmuiK eyku ivrlw ko lhY ] (930-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh ayk virlaa ko lahai. How rare are those who, as Gurmukh, attain the One Lord.
RECORD	para 40576	ijs no dyie ikrpw qy suKu pwey ] (930-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jis no day-ay kirpaa tay sukh paa-ay. They alone find peace, whom the Lord blesses with His Grace.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v7	gurU duAwrY AwiK suxwey ]7] (930-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) guroo du-aarai aakh sunaa-ay. ||7||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v7	In the Gurdwara, the Guru's Door, they speak and hear of the Lord. ||7||
RECORD	para 40578	aUrm DUrm joiq aujwlw ] (930-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ooram Dhooram jot ujaalaa. His Light illuminates the ocean and the earth.
DEFINE	para 40579	qIin Bvx mih gur gopwlw ] (930-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) teen bhavan meh gur gopaalaa. Throughout the three worlds, is the Guru, the Lord of the World.
RECORD	para 40580	aUgivAw AsrUpu idKwvY ] (930-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) oogvi-aa asroop dikhaavai. The Lord reveals His various forms;
RECORD	para 40581	kir ikrpw ApunY Gir AwvY ] (930-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kar kirpaa apunai ghar aavai. granting His Grace, He enters the home of the heart.
DEFINE	para 40582	aUniv brsY nIJr Dwrw ] (930-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) oonav barsai neejhar Dhaaraa. The clouds hang low, and the rain is pouring down.
RECORD	para 40583	aUqm sbid svwrxhwrw ] (930-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ootam sabad savaaranhaaraa. The Lord embellishes and exalts with the Sublime Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	para 40584	iesu eyky kw jwxY Byau ] (930-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) is aykay kaa jaanai bhay-o. One who knows the mystery of the One God,
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v8	Awpy krqw Awpy dyau ]8] (930-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aapay kartaa aapay day-o. ||8||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v8	is Himself the Creator, Himself the Divine Lord. ||8||
DEFINE	para 40586	augvY sUru Asur sMGwrY ] (930-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ugvai soor asur sanghaarai. When the sun rises, the demons are slain;
RECORD	para 40587	aUcau dyiK sbid bIcwrY ] (930-19, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) oocha-o daykh sabad beechaarai. the mortal looks upwards, and contemplates the Shabad.
DEFINE	para 40588	aUpir Awid AMiq iqhu loie ] (930-19, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) oopar aad ant tihu lo-ay. The Lord is beyond the beginning and the end, beyond the three worlds.
RECORD	para 40589	Awpy krY kQY suxY soie ] (930-19, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aapay karai kathai sunai so-ay. He Himself acts, speaks and listens.
DEFINE	para 40591	Ehu ibDwqw mnu qnu dyie ] (931-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) oh biDhaataa man tan day-ay. He is the Architect of Destiny; He blesses us with mind and body.
DEFINE	para 40592	Ehu ibDwqw min muiK soie ] (931-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) oh biDhaataa man mukh so-ay. That Architect of Destiny is in my mind and mouth.
DEFINE	para 40593	pRBu jgjIvnu Avru n koie ] (931-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) parabh jagjeevan avar na ko-ay. God is the Life of the world; there is no other at all.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v9	nwnk nwim rqy piq hoie ]9] (931-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) naanak naam ratay pat ho-ay. ||9||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v9	O Nanak, imbued with the Naam, the Name of the Lord, one is honored. ||9||
RECORD	para 40595	rwjn rwm rvY ihqkwir ] (931-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) raajan raam ravai hitkaar. One who lovingly chants the Name of the Sovereign Lord King,
RECORD	para 40596	rx mih lUJY mnUAw mwir ] (931-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ran meh loojhai manoo-aa maar. fights the battle and conquers his own mind;
RECORD	para 40597	rwiq idnµiq rhY rMig rwqw ] (931-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) raat dinant rahai rang raataa. day and night, he remains imbued with the Lord's Love.
DEFINE	para 40598	qIin Bvn jug cwry jwqw ] (931-3, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) teen bhavan jug chaaray jaataa. He is famous throughout the three worlds and the four ages.
RECORD	para 40599	ijin jwqw so iqs hI jyhw ] (931-3, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jin jaataa so tis hee jayhaa. One who knows the Lord, becomes like Him.
DEFINE	para 40600	Aiq inrmwielu sIJis dyhw ] (931-3, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) at nirmaa-il seejhas dayhaa. He becomes absolutely immaculate, and his body is sanctified.
DEFINE	para 40601	rhsI rwmu irdY iek Bwie ] (931-4, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) rahsee raam ridai ik bhaa-ay. His heart is happy, in love with the One Lord.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v10	AMqir sbdu swic ilv lwie ]10] (931-4, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) antar sabad saach liv laa-ay. ||10||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v10	He lovingly centers his attention deep within upon the True Word of the Shabad. ||10||
FORBID	para 40603	rosu n kIjY AMimRqu pIjY rhxu nhI sMswry ] (931-4, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ros na keejai amrit peejai rahan nahee sansaaray. Don't be angry - drink in the Ambrosial Nectar; you shall not remain in this world forever.
FORBID	para 40604	rwjy rwie rMk nhI rhxw Awie jwie jug cwry ] (931-5, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) raajay raa-ay rank nahee rahnaa aa-ay jaa-ay jug chaaray. The ruling kings and the paupers shall not remain; they come and go, throughout the four ages.
RECORD	para 40605	rhx khx qy rhY n koeI iksu pih krau ibnµqI ] (931-5, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) rahan kahan tay rahai na ko-ee kis peh kara-o binantee. Everyone says that they will remain, but none of them remain; unto whom should I offer my prayer?
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v11	eyku sbdu rwm nwm inroDru guru dyvY piq mqI ]11] (931-6, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ayk sabad raam naam niroDhar gur dayvai pat matee. ||11||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v11	The One Shabad, the Name of the Lord, will never fail you; the Guru grants honor and understanding. ||11||
RECORD	para 40607	lwj mrMqI mir geI GUGtu Koil clI ] (931-6, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) laaj marantee mar ga-ee ghooghat khol chalee. My shyness and hesitation have died and gone, and I walk with my face unveiled.
RECORD	para 40608	swsu idvwnI bwvrI isr qy sMk tlI ] (931-7, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) saas divaanee baavree sir tay sank talee. The confusion and doubt from my crazy, insane mother-in-law has been removed from over my head.
DEFINE	para 40609	pRyim bulweI rlI isau mn mih sbdu Anµdu ] (931-7, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) paraym bulaa-ee ralee si-o man meh sabad anand. My Beloved has summoned me with joyful caresses; my mind is filled with the bliss of the Shabad.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v12	lwil rqI lwlI BeI gurmuiK BeI inicMdu ]12] (931-8, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) laal ratee laalee bha-ee gurmukh bha-ee nichind. ||12||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v12	Imbued with the Love of my Beloved, I have become Gurmukh, and carefree. ||12||
RECORD	para 40611	lwhw nwmu rqnu jip swru ] (931-8, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) laahaa naam ratan jap saar. Chant the jewel of the Naam, and earn the profit of the Lord.
RECORD	para 40612	lbu loBu burw AhMkwru ] (931-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) lab lobh buraa aha Nkaar. Greed, avarice, evil and egotism;
RECORD	para 40613	lwVI cwVI lwieqbwru ] (931-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) laarhee chaarhee laa-itbaar. slander, inuendo and gossip;
DEFINE	para 40614	mnmuKu AMDw mugDu gvwru ] (931-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) manmukh anDhaa mugaDh gavaar. the self-willed manmukh is blind, foolish and ignorant.
RECORD	para 40615	lwhy kwrix AwieAw jig ] (931-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) laahay kaaran aa-i-aa jag. For the sake of earning the profit of the Lord, the mortal comes into the world.
DEFINE	para 40616	hoie mjUru gieAw Tgwie Tig ] (931-10, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ho-ay majoor ga-i-aa thagaa-ay thag. But he becomes a mere slave laborer, and is mugged by the mugger, Maya.
RECORD	para 40617	lwhw nwmu pUMjI vyswhu ] (931-10, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) laahaa naam poonjee vaysaahu. One who earns the profit of the Naam, with the capital of faith,
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v13	nwnk scI piq scw pwiqswhu ]13] (931-10, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) naanak sachee pat sachaa paatisaahu. ||13||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v13	O Nanak, is truly honored by the True Supreme King. ||13||
DEFINE	para 40619	Awie ivgUqw jgu jm pMQu ] (931-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aa-ay vigootaa jag jam panth. The world is ruined on the path of Death.
RECORD	para 40620	AweI n mytx ko smrQu ] (931-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aa-ee na maytan ko samrath. No one has the power to erase Maya's influence.
WHEN	para 40621	AwiQ sYl nIc Gir hoie ] (931-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aath sail neech ghar ho-ay. If wealth visits the home of the lowliest clown,
RECORD	para 40622	AwiQ dyiK invY ijsu doie ] (931-12, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aath daykh nivai jis do-ay. seeing that wealth, all pay their respects to him.
DEFINE	para 40623	AwiQ hoie qw mugDu isAwnw ] (931-12, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aath ho-ay taa mugaDh si-aanaa. Even an idiot is thought of as clever, if he is rich.
DEFINE	para 40624	Bgiq ibhUnw jgu baurwnw ] (931-12, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) bhagat bihoonaa jag ba-uraanaa. Without devotional worship, the world is insane.
DEFINE	para 40625	sB mih vrqY eyko soie ] (931-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) sabh meh vartai ayko so-ay. The One Lord is contained among all.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v14	ijs no ikrpw kry iqsu prgtu hoie ]14] (931-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jis no kirpaa karay tis pargat ho-ay. ||14||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v14	He reveals Himself, unto those whom He blesses with His Grace. ||14||
DEFINE	para 40627	juig juig Qwip sdw inrvYru ] (931-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jug jug thaap sadaa nirvair. Throughout the ages, the Lord is eternally established; He has no vengeance.
DEFINE	para 40628	jnim mrix nhI DMDw DYru ] (931-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) janam maran nahee DhanDhaa Dhair. He is not subject to birth and death; He is not entangled in worldly affairs.
DEFINE	para 40629	jo dIsY so Awpy Awip ] (931-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jo deesai so aapay aap. Whatever is seen, is the Lord Himself.
RECORD	para 40630	Awip aupwie Awpy Gt Qwip ] (931-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aap upaa-ay aapay ghat thaap. Creating Himself, He establishes Himself in the heart.
DEFINE	para 40631	Awip Agocru DMDY loeI ] (931-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) aap agochar DhanDhai lo-ee. He Himself is unfathomable; He links people to their affairs.
DEFINE	para 40632	jog jugiq jgjIvnu soeI ] (931-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jog jugat jagjeevan so-ee. He is the Way of Yoga, the Life of the World.
DEFINE	para 40633	kir Awcwru scu suKu hoeI ] (931-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kar aachaar sach sukh ho-ee. Living a righteous lifestyle, true peace is found.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v15	nwm ivhUxw mukiq ikv hoeI ]15] (931-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) naam vihoonaa mukat kiv ho-ee. ||15||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v15	Without the Naam, the Name of the Lord, how can anyone find liberation? ||15||
DEFINE	para 40635	ivxu nwvY vyroDu srIr ] (931-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) vin naavai vayroDh sareer. Without the Name, even one's own body is an enemy.
RECORD	para 40636	ikau n imlih kwtih mn pIr ] (931-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ki-o na mileh kaateh man peer. Why not meet the Lord, and take away the pain of your mind?
RECORD	para 40637	vwt vtwaU AwvY jwie ] (931-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) vaat vataa-oo aavai jaa-ay. The traveller comes and goes along the highway.
WHEN	para 40638	ikAw ly AwieAw ikAw plY pwie ] (931-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ki-aa lay aa-i-aa ki-aa palai paa-ay. What did he bring when he came, and what will he take away when he goes?
RECORD	para 40639	ivxu nwvY qotw sB Qwie ] (931-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) vin naavai totaa sabh thaa-ay. Without the Name, one loses everywhere.
DEFINE	para 40640	lwhw imlY jw dyie buJwie ] (931-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) laahaa milai jaa day-ay bujhaa-ay. The profit is earned, when the Lord grants understanding.
DEFINE	para 40641	vxju vwpwru vxjY vwpwrI ] (931-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) vanaj vaapaar vanjai vaapaaree. In merchandise and trade, the merchant is trading.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v16	ivxu nwvY kYsI piq swrI ]16] (931-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) vin naavai kaisee pat saaree. ||16||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v16	Without the Name, how can one find honor and nobility? ||16||
DEFINE	para 40643	gux vIcwry igAwnI soie ] (931-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gun veechaaray gi-aanee so-ay. One who contemplates the Lord's Virtues is spiritually wise.
UPHOLD	para 40644	gux mih igAwnu prwpiq hoie ] (931-19, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gun meh gi-aan paraapat ho-ay. Through His Virtues, one receives spiritual wisdom.
DEFINE	para 40645	guxdwqw ivrlw sMswir ] (931-19, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gundaataa virlaa sansaar. How rare in this world, is the Giver of virtue.
RECORD	para 40646	swcI krxI gur vIcwir ] (931-19, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) saachee karnee gur veechaar. The True way of life comes through contemplation of the Guru.
DEFINE	para 40647	Agm Agocru kImiq nhI pwie ] (931-19, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) agam agochar keemat nahee paa-ay. The Lord is inaccessible and unfathomable. His worth cannot be estimated.
RECORD	para 40649	qw imlIAY jw ley imlwie ] (932-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) taa milee-ai jaa la-ay milaa-ay. They alone meet Him, whom the Lord causes to meet.
RECORD	para 40650	guxvMqI gux swry nIq ] (932-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gunvantee gun saaray neet. The virtuous soul bride continually contemplates His Virtues.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v17	nwnk gurmiq imlIAY mIq ]17] (932-1, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) naanak gurmat milee-ai meet. ||17||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v17	O Nanak, following the Guru's Teachings, one meets the Lord, the true friend. ||17||
RECORD	para 40652	kwmu k®oDu kwieAw kau gwlY ] (932-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kaam kroDh kaa-i-aa ka-o gaalai. Unfulfilled sexual desire and unresolved anger waste the body away,
DEFINE	para 40653	ijau kMcn sohwgw FwlY ] (932-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ji-o kanchan sohaagaa dhaalai. as gold is dissolved by borax.
DEFINE	para 40654	kis ksvtI shY su qwau ] (932-2, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kas kasvatee sahai so taa-o. The gold is touched to the touchstone, and tested by fire;
DEFINE	para 40655	ndir srwP vMnI scVwau ] (932-3, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) nadar saraaf vannee sachrhaa-o. when its pure color shows through, it is pleasing to the eye of the assayer.
DEFINE	para 40656	jgqu psU AhM kwlu ksweI ] (932-3, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jagat pasoo aha N kaal kasaa-ee. The world is a beast, and arrogent Death is the butcher.
RECORD	para 40657	kir krqY krxI kir pweI ] (932-3, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kar kartai karnee kar paa-ee. The created beings of the Creator receive the karma of their actions.
RECORD	para 40658	ijin kIqI iqin kImiq pweI ] (932-4, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jin keetee tin keemat paa-ee. He who created the world, knows its worth.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v18	hor ikAw khIAY ikCu khxu n jweI ]18] (932-4, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) hor ki-aa kahee-ai kichh kahan na jaa-ee. ||18||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v18	What else can be said? There is nothing at all to say. ||18||
RECORD	para 40660	Kojq Kojq AMimRqu pIAw ] (932-4, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) khojat khojat amrit pee-aa. Searching, searching, I drink in the Ambrosial Nectar.
RECORD	para 40661	iKmw ghI mnu sqguir dIAw ] (932-5, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) khimaa gahee man satgur dee-aa. I have adopted the way of tolerance, and given my mind to the True Guru.
RECORD	para 40662	Krw Krw AwKY sBu koie ] (932-5, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kharaa kharaa aakhai sabh ko-ay. Everyone calls himself true and genuine.
DEFINE	para 40663	Krw rqnu jug cwry hoie ] (932-5, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kharaa ratan jug chaaray ho-ay. He alone is true, who obtains the jewel throughout the four ages.
RECORD	para 40664	Kwq pIAMq mUey nhI jwinAw ] (932-6, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) khaat pee-ant moo-ay nahee jaani-aa. Eating and drinking, one dies, but still does not know.
WHEN	para 40665	iKn mih mUey jw sbdu pCwinAw ] (932-6, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) khin meh moo-ay jaa sabad pachhaani-aa. He dies in an instant, when he realizes the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	para 40666	AsiQru cIqu mrin mnu mwinAw ] (932-6, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) asthir cheet maran man maani-aa. His consciousness becomes permanently stable, and his mind accepts death.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v19	gur ikrpw qy nwmu pCwinAw ]19] (932-7, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gur kirpaa tay naam pachhaani-aa. ||19||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v19	By Guru's Grace, he realizes the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||19||
RECORD	para 40668	ggn gMBIru ggnµqir vwsu ] (932-7, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gagan gambheer gagnantar vaas. The Profound Lord dwells in the sky of the mind, the Tenth Gate;
RECORD	para 40669	gux gwvY suK shij invwsu ] (932-7, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gun gaavai sukh sahj nivaas. singing His Glorious Praises, one dwells in intuitive poise and peace.
RECORD	para 40670	gieAw n AwvY Awie n jwie ] (932-8, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ga-i-aa na aavai aa-ay na jaa-ay. He does not go to come, or come to go.
RECORD	para 40671	gur prswid rhY ilv lwie ] (932-8, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gur parsaad rahai liv laa-ay. By Guru's Grace, he remains lovingly focused on the Lord.
DEFINE	para 40672	ggnu AgMmu AnwQu AjonI ] (932-8, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gagan agamm anaath ajonee. The Lord of the mind-sky is inaccessible, independent and beyond birth.
DEFINE	para 40673	AsiQru cIqu smwiD sgonI ] (932-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) asthir cheet samaaDh sagonee. The most worthy Samaadhi is to keep the consciousness stable, focused on Him.
DEFINE	para 40674	hir nwmu cyiq iPir pvih n jUnI ] (932-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) har naam chayt fir paveh na joonee. Remembering the Lord's Name, one is not subject to reincarnation.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v20	gurmiq swru hor nwm ibhUnI ]20] (932-9, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmat saar hor naam bihoonee. ||20||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v20	The Guru's Teachings are the most Excellent; all other ways lack the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||20||
RECORD	para 40676	Gr dr iPir QwkI bhuqyry ] (932-10, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) ghar dar fir thaakee bahutayray. Wandering to countless doorsteps and homes, I have grown weary.
DEFINE	para 40677	jwiq AsMK AMq nhI myry ] (932-10, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) jaat asa Nkh ant nahee mayray. My incarnations are countless, without limit.
RECORD	para 40678	kyqy mwq ipqw suq DIAw ] (932-10, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kaytay maat pitaa sut Dhee-aa. I have had so many mothers and fathers, sons and daughters.
RECORD	para 40679	kyqy gur cyly Puin hUAw ] (932-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kaytay gur chaylay fun hoo-aa. I have had so many gurus and disciples.
DEFINE	para 40680	kwcy gur qy mukiq n hUAw ] (932-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kaachay gur tay mukat na hoo-aa. Through a false guru, liberation is not found.
DEFINE	para 40681	kyqI nwir vru eyku smwil ] (932-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) kaytee naar var ayk samaal. There are so many brides of the One Husband Lord - consider this.
RECORD	para 40682	gurmuiK mrxu jIvxu pRB nwil ] (932-11, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh maran jeevan parabh naal. The Gurmukh dies, and lives with God.
WHEN	para 40683	dh ids FUiF GrY mih pwieAw ] (932-12, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) dah dis dhoodh gharai meh paa-i-aa. Searching in the ten directions, I found Him within my own home.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v21	mylu BieAw siqgurU imlwieAw ]21] (932-12, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) mayl bha-i-aa satguroo milaa-i-aa. ||21||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v21	I have met Him; the True Guru has led me to meet Him. ||21||
RECORD	para 40685	gurmuiK gwvY gurmuiK bolY ] (932-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh gaavai gurmukh bolai. The Gurmukh sings, and the Gurmukh speaks.
RECORD	para 40686	gurmuiK qoil quolwvY qolY ] (932-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh tol tolaavai tolai. The Gurmukh evaluates the value of the Lord, and inspires others to evaluate Him as well.
RECORD	para 40687	gurmuiK AwvY jwie insMgu ] (932-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh aavai jaa-ay nisang. The Gurmukh comes and goes without fear.
DEFINE	para 40688	prhir mYlu jlwie klµku ] (932-13, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) parhar mail jalaa-ay kalank. His filth is taken away, and his stains are burnt off.
RECORD	para 40689	gurmuiK nwd byd bIcwru ] (932-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh naad bayd beechaar. The Gurmukh contemplates the sound current of the Naad for his Vedas.
DEFINE	para 40690	gurmuiK mjnu cju Acwru ] (932-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh majan chaj achaar. The Gurmukh's cleansing bath is the performance of good deeds.
DEFINE	para 40691	gurmuiK sbdu AMimRqu hY swru ] (932-14, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) gurmukh sabad amrit hai saar. For the Gurmukh, the Shabad is the most excellent Ambrosial Nectar.
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v22	nwnk gurmuiK pwvY pwru ]22] (932-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) naanak gurmukh paavai paar. ||22||
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v22	O Nanak, the Gurmukh crosses over. ||22||
RECORD	para 40693	cMclu cIqu n rheI Twie ] (932-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) chanchal cheet na rah-ee thaa-ay. The fickle consciousness does not remain stable.
RECORD	para 40694	corI imrgu AMgUrI Kwie ] (932-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) choree mirag angooree khaa-ay. The deer secretly nibbles at the green sprouts.
RECORD	para 40695	crn kml aur Dwry cIq ] (932-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) charan kamal ur Dhaaray cheet. One who enshrines the Lord's lotus feet in his heart and consciousness
RECORD	para 40696	icru jIvnu cyqnu inq nIq ] (932-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) chir jeevan chaytan nit neet. lives long, always remembering the Lord.
RECORD	para 40697	icMqq hI dIsY sBu koie ] (932-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) chintat hee deesai sabh ko-ay. Everyone has worries and cares.
RECORD	para 40698	cyqih eyku qhI suKu hoie ] (932-16, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) cheeteh ayk tahee sukh ho-ay. He alone finds peace, who thinks of the One Lord.
DEFINE	para 40699	iciq vsY rwcY hir nwie ] (932-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) chit vasai raachai har naa-ay. When the Lord dwells in the consciousness, and one is absorbed in the Lord's Name,
RECORD	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v23	mukiq BieAw piq isau Gir jwie ]23] (932-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) mukat bha-i-aa pat si-o ghar jaa-ay. ||23||
DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v23	one is liberated, and returns home with honor. ||23||
DEFINE	para 40701	CIjY dyh KulY iek gMiF ] (932-17, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) chheejai dayh khulai ik gandh. The body falls apart, when one knot is untied.
DEFINE	para 40702	CyAw inq dyKhu jig hMiF ] (932-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) chhay-aa nit daykhhu jag handh. Behold, the world is on the decline; it will be totally destroyed.
RECORD	para 40703	DUp Cwv jy sm kir jwxY ] (932-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) Dhoop chhaav jay sam kar jaanai. Only one who looks alike upon sunshine and shade
DEFINE	para 40704	bMDn kwit mukiq Gir AwxY ] (932-18, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) banDhan kaat mukat ghar aanai. has his bonds shattered; he is liberated and returns home.
DEFINE	para 40705	CwieAw CUCI jgqu Bulwnw ] (932-19, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) chhaa-i-aa chhoochhee jagat bhulaanaa. Maya is empty and petty; she has defrauded the world.
