DEFINE	rwmklI mhlw 1 dKxI EAMkwru v35	He is the Eradicator of poverty, and the Destroyer of pain; the Gurmukh realizes spiritual wisdom and meditation. ||35||
DEFINE	para 40796	Din gieAY bih JUrIAY Dn mih cIqu gvwr ] (934-15, rwmklI dKxI, mÚ 1) Dhan ga-i-ai bahi jhooree-ai Dhan meh cheet gavaar. Losing his wealth, he cries out in anguish; the fool's consciousness is engrossed in wealth.
