DEFINE	para 41398	Awpy vyiK ivgsdw dUjw ko nwhI ] (947-17, rwmklI, mÚ 3) aapay vaykh vigsadaa doojaa ko naahee. You Yourself see, and blossom forth; there is no one else at all.
RECORD	para 41399	ijau BwvY iqau rKu qU gur sbid buJwhI ] (947-17, rwmklI, mÚ 3) ji-o bhaavai ti-o rakh too gur sabad bujhaahee. As it pleases You, You keep me. Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, I understand You.
DEFINE	para 41400	sBnw qyrw joru hY ijau BwvY iqvY clwhI ] (947-17, rwmklI, mÚ 3) sabhnaa tayraa jor hai ji-o bhaavai tivai chalaahee. You are the strength of all. As it pleases You, You lead us on.
RECORD	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v2	quDu jyvf mY nwih ko iksu AwiK suxweI ]2] (947-18, rwmklI, mÚ 3) tuDh jayvad mai naahi ko kis aakh sunaa-ee. ||2||
DEFINE	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v2	There is no other as great as You; unto whom should I speak and talk? ||2||
RECORD	para 41402	sloku mÚ 3 ] (947-18) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
