WHEN	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, seated in his her own home, she finds her Husband Lord, when the Creator Lord grants His Grace. ||1||
RECORD	para 41408	mÚ 3 ] (948-3) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 41409	DMDw Dwvq idnu gieAw rYix gvweI soie ] (948-3, rwmklI, mÚ 3) DhanDhaa Dhaavat din ga-i-aa rain gavaa-ee so-ay. Chasing after worldly affairs, the day is wasted, and the night passes in sleep.
