DEFINE	para 41417	ieknw no nwau bKisEnu AsiQru hir sqI ] (948-6, rwmklI, mÚ 3) iknaa no naa-o bakhsi-on asthir har satee. Some are blessed with the Name of the eternal, unchanging True Lord.
RECORD	para 41418	pauxu pwxI bYsMqro hukim krih BgqI ] (948-7, rwmklI, mÚ 3) pa-un paanee baisantaro hukam karahi bhagtee. Water, air and fire, by His Will, worship Him.
DEFINE	para 41419	eynw no Bau Aglw pUrI bxq bxqI ] (948-7, rwmklI, mÚ 3) aynaa no bha-o aglaa pooree banat bantee. They are held in the Fear of God; He has formed the perfect form.
RECORD	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v3	sBu ieko hukmu vrqdw mMinAY suKu pweI ]3] (948-7, rwmklI, mÚ 3) sabh iko hukam varatdaa mani-ai sukh paa-ee. ||3||
DEFINE	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v3	The Hukam, the Command of the One Lord is all-pervasive; accepting it, peace is found. ||3||
RECORD	para 41421	sloku ] (948-8) salok. Shalok:
DEFINE	para 41422	kbIr ksautI rwm kI JUTw itkY n koie ] (948-8, rwmklI, kbIr) kabeer kasa-utee raam kee jhoothaa tikai na ko-ay. Kabeer, such is the touchstone of the Lord; the false cannot even touch it.
RECORD	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v1	rwm ksautI so shY jo mrjIvw hoie ]1] (948-8, rwmklI, kbIr) raam kasa-utee so sahai jo marjeevaa ho-ay. ||1||
RECORD	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v1	He alone passes this test of the Lord, who remains dead while yet alive. ||1||
RECORD	para 41424	mÚ 3 ] (948-9) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
