RECORD	para 41436	bRhmw ibsnu mhysu aupwieAnu hukim kmwvin kwrw ] (948-14, rwmklI, mÚ 3) barahmaa bisan mahays upaa-i-an hukam kamaavan kaaraa. He created Brahma, Vishnu and Shiva, who act according to His Will.
RECORD	para 41437	pMifq pVdy joqkI nw bUJih bIcwrw ] (948-14, rwmklI, mÚ 3) pandit parh-day jotkee naa boojheh beechaaraa. The Pandits, the religious scholars, and the astrologers study their books, but they do not understand contemplation.
DEFINE	para 41438	sBu ikCu qyrw Kylu hY scu isrjxhwrw ] (948-15, rwmklI, mÚ 3) sabh kichh tayraa khayl hai sach sirjanhaaraa. Everything is Your play, O True Creator Lord.
RECORD	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v4	ijsu BwvY iqsu bKis lYih sic sbid smweI ]4] (948-15, rwmklI, mÚ 3) jis bhaavai tis bakhas laihi sach sabad samaa-ee. ||4||
RECORD	rwmklI kI vwr mhlw 3 v4	As it pleases You, You bless us with forgiveness, and merge us in the True Word of the Shabad. ||4||
RECORD	para 41440	sloku mÚ 3 ] (948-16) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 41441	mn kw JUTw JUTu kmwvY ] (948-16, rwmklI, mÚ 3) man kaa jhoothaa jhooth kamaavai. The man of false mind practices falsehood.
RECORD	para 41442	mwieAw no iPrY qpw sdwvY ] (948-16, rwmklI, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa no firai tapaa sadaavai. He runs after Maya, and yet pretends to be a man of disciplined meditation.
