RECORD	para 41444	Ehu qpw kYsy prm giq lhY ] (948-17, rwmklI, mÚ 3) oh tapaa kaisay param gat lahai. How can such a man of disciplined meditation attain the supreme status?
RECORD	para 41445	gur prswdI ko scu kmwvY ] (948-17, rwmklI, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee ko sach kamaavai. By Guru's Grace, one lives the Truth.
