DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v1	I have seen that all relationships are false, and so I have grasped hold of the hem of Your robe, Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 42182	mÚ 5 ] (963-18) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 42183	iPrdI iPrdI nwnk jIau hau PwvI QIeI bhuqu idswvr pMDw ] (963-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) firdee firdee naanak jee-o ha-o faavee thee-ee bahut disaavar panDhaa. I wandered and wandered and went crazy, O Nanak, in countless foreign lands and pathways.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	qw hau suiK suKwlI suqI jw gur imil sjxu mY lDw ]2] (963-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) taa ha-o sukh sukhaalee sutee jaa gur mil sajan mai laDhaa. ||2||
WHEN	slok mhlw 5 v2	But then, I slept in peace and comfort, when I met the Guru, and found my Friend. ||2||
RECORD	para 42186	pauVI ] (964-1) pa-orhee. Pauree:
WHEN	para 42187	sBy duK sMqwp jW quDhu BulIAY ] (964-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sabhay dukh santaap jaa N tuDhhu bhulee-ai. When I forget You, I endure all pains and afflictions.
DEFINE	para 42188	jy kIcin lK aupwv qW khI n GulIAY ] (964-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jay keechan lakh upaav taaN kahee na ghulee-ai. Making thousands of efforts, they are still not eliminated.
DEFINE	para 42189	ijs no ivsrY nwau su inrDnu kWFIAY ] (964-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis no visrai naa-o so nirDhan kaa Ndhee-ai. One who forgets the Name, is known as a poor person.
RECORD	para 42190	ijs no ivsrY nwau so jonI hWFIAY ] (964-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis no visrai naa-o so jonee haa Ndhee-ai. One who forgets the Name, wanders in reincarnation.
DEFINE	para 42191	ijsu Ksmu n AwvY iciq iqsu jmu fMfu dy ] (964-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis khasam na aavai chit tis jam dand day. One who does not remember his Lord and Master, is punished by the Messenger of Death.
DEFINE	para 42192	ijsu Ksmu n AwvI iciq rogI sy gxy ] (964-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis khasam na aavee chit rogee say ganay. One who does not remember his Lord and Master, is judged to be a sick person.
DEFINE	para 42193	ijsu Ksmu n AwvI iciq su Kro AhMkwrIAw ] (964-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis khasam na aavee chit so kharo aha Nkaaree-aa. One who does not remember his Lord and Master, is egotistical and proud.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v14	soeI duhylw jig ijin nwau ivswrIAw ]14] (964-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) so-ee duhaylaa jag jin naa-o visaaree-aa. ||14||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v14	One who forgets the Name is miserable in this world. ||14||
RECORD	para 42195	slok mÚ 5 ] (964-4) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 42196	qYfI bMdis mY koie n ifTw qU nwnk min Bwxw ] (964-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) taidee bandas mai ko-ay na dithaa too naanak man bhaanaa. I have not seen any other like You. You alone are pleasing to Nanak's mind.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	Goil GumweI iqsu imqR ivcoly jY imil kMqu pCwxw ]1] (964-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ghol ghumaa-ee tis mitar vicholay jai mil kant pachhaanaa. ||1||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	I am a dedicated, devoted sacrifice to that friend, that mediator, who leads me to recognize my Husband Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 42198	mÚ 5 ] (964-6) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 42199	pwv suhwvy jW qau iDir juldy sIsu suhwvw crxI ] (964-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) paav suhaavay jaa N ta-o Dhir julday sees suhaavaa charnee. Beautiful are those feet which walk towards You; beautiful is that head which falls at Your Feet.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	muKu suhwvw jW qau jsu gwvY jIau pieAw qau srxI ]2] (964-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) mukh suhaavaa jaa N ta-o jas gaavai jee-o pa-i-aa ta-o sarnee. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v2	Beautiful is that mouth which sings Your Praises; beautiful is that soul which seeks Your Sanctuary. ||2||
RECORD	para 42201	pauVI ] (964-7) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 42202	imil nwrI sqsMig mMglu gwvIAw ] (964-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) mil naaree satsang mangal gaavee-aa. Meeting the Lord's brides, in the True Congregation, I sing the songs of joy.
FORBID	para 42203	Gr kw hoAw bMDwnu bhuiV n DwvIAw ] (964-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ghar kaa ho-aa banDhaan bahurh na Dhaavee-aa. The home of my heart is now held steady, and I shall not go out wandering again.
RECORD	para 42204	ibnTI durmiq durqu soie kUVwvIAw ] (964-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) binthee durmat durat so-ay koorhaavee-aa. Evil-mindedness has been dispelled, along with sin and my bad reputation.
DEFINE	para 42205	sIlvMiq prDwin irdY scwvIAw ] (964-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) seelvant parDhaan ridai sachaavee-aa. I am well-known as being calm and good-natured; my heart is filled with Truth.
DEFINE	para 42206	AMqir bwhir ieku iek rIqwvIAw ] (964-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) antar baahar ik ik reetaavee-aa. Inwardly and outwardly, the One and only Lord is my way.
DEFINE	para 42207	min drsn kI ipAws crx dwswvIAw ] (964-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) man darsan kee pi-aas charan daasaavee-aa. My mind is thirsty for the Blessed Vision of His Darshan. I am a slave at His feet.
WHEN	para 42208	soBw bxI sIgwru Ksim jW rwvIAw ] (964-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sobhaa banee seegaar khasam jaa N raavee-aa. I am glorified and embellished, when my Lord and Master enjoys me.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v15	imlIAw Awie sMjoig jW iqsu BwvIAw ]15] (964-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) milee-aa aa-ay sanjog jaa N tis bhaavee-aa. ||15||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v15	I meet Him through my blessed destiny, when it is pleasing to His Will. ||15||
RECORD	para 42210	slok mÚ 5 ] (964-10) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 42211	hiB gux qYfy nwnk jIau mY kU QIey mY inrgux qy ikAw hovY ] (964-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) habh gun taiday naanak jee-o mai koo thee-ay mai nirgun tay ki-aa hovai. All virtues are Yours, Dear Lord; You bestow them upon us. I am unworthy - what can I achieve, O Nanak?
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	qau jyvfu dwqwru n koeI jwcku sdw jwcovY ]1] (964-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) ta-o jayvad daataar na ko-ee jaachak sadaa jaachovai. ||1||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v1	There is no other Giver as great as You. I am a beggar; I beg from You forever. ||1||
RECORD	para 42213	mÚ 5 ] (964-11) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 42214	dyh iCjMdVI aUx mJUxw guir sjix jIau DrwieAw ] (964-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) dayh chhijand-rhee oon majhoonaa gur sajan jee-o Dharaa-i-aa. My body was wasting away, and I was depressed. The Guru, my Friend, has encouraged and consoled me.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	hBy suK suhylVw suqw ijqw jgu sbwieAw ]2] (964-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) habhay sukh suhaylrhaa sutaa jitaa jag sabaa-i-aa. ||2||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	I sleep in total peace and comfort; I have conquered the whole world. ||2||
RECORD	para 42216	pauVI ] (964-13) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 42217	vfw qyrw drbwru scw quDu qKqu ] (964-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) vadaa tayraa darbaar sachaa tuDh takhat. The Darbaar of Your Court is glorious and great. Your holy throne is True.
DEFINE	para 42218	isir swhw pwiqswhu inhclu cauru Cqu ] (964-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sir saahaa paatisaahu nihchal cha-ur chhat. You are the Emperor over the heads of kings. Your canopy and chauree (fly-brush) are permanent and unchanging.
DEFINE	para 42219	jo BwvY pwrbRhm soeI scu inAwau ] (964-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jo bhaavai paarbarahm so-ee sach ni-aa-o. That alone is true justice, which is pleasing to the Will of the Supreme Lord God.
DEFINE	para 42220	jy BwvY pwrbRhm inQwvy imlY Qwau ] (964-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jay bhaavai paarbarahm nithaavay milai thaa-o. Even the homeless receive a home, when it is pleasing to the Will of the Supreme Lord God.
DEFINE	para 42221	jo kIn@I krqwir sweI BlI gl ] (964-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jo keen Hee kartaar saa-ee bhalee gal. Whatever the Creator Lord does, is a good thing.
DEFINE	para 42222	ijn@I pCwqw Ksmu sy drgwh ml ] (964-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jin Hee pachhaataa khasam say dargaah mal. Those who recognize their Lord and Master, are seated in the Court of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 42223	shI qyrw Purmwnu iknY n PyrIAY ] (964-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sahee tayraa furmaan kinai na fayree-ai. True is Your Command; no one can challenge it.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v16	kwrx krx krIm kudriq qyrIAY ]16] (964-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kaaran karan kareem kudrat tayree-ai. ||16||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v16	O Merciful Lord, Cause of causes, Your creative power is all-powerful. ||16||
RECORD	para 42225	slok mÚ 5 ] (964-16) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 42226	soie suxMdVI myrw qnu mnu maulw nwmu jpMdVI lwlI ] (964-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) so-ay sunand-rhee mayraa tan man ma-ulaa naam japand-rhee laalee. Hearing of You, my body and mind have blossomed forth; chanting the Naam, the Name of the Lord, I am flushed with life.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	pMiD julµdVI myrw AMdru TMFw gur drsnu dyiK inhwlI ]1] (964-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) panDh juland-rhee mayraa andar thandhaa gur darsan daykh nihaalee. ||1||
UPHOLD	slok mhlw 5 v1	Walking on the Path, I have found cool tranquility deep within; gazing upon the Blessed Vision of the Guru's Darshan, I am enraptured. ||1||
RECORD	para 42228	mÚ 5 ] (964-17) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 42229	hT mMJwhU mY mwxku lDw ] (964-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) hath manjhaahoo mai maanak laDhaa. I have found the jewel within my heart.
RECORD	para 42230	muil n iGDw mY kU siqguir idqw ] (964-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) mul na ghiDhaa mai koo satgur ditaa. I was not charged for it; the True Guru gave it to me.
RECORD	para 42231	FUMF v\weI QIAw iQqw ] (964-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) dhoondh vanjaa-ee thee-aa thitaa. My search has ended, and I have become stable.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	jnmu pdwrQu nwnk ijqw ]2] (964-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) janam padaarath naanak jitaa. ||2||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	O Nanak, I have conquered this priceless human life. ||2||
RECORD	para 42233	pauVI ] (964-18) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 42234	ijs kY msqik krmu hoie so syvw lwgw ] (964-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis kai mastak karam ho-ay so sayvaa laagaa. One who has such good karma inscribed upon his forehead, is committed to the Lord's service.
RECORD	para 42235	ijsu gur imil kmlu pRgwisAw so Anidnu jwgw ] (964-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis gur mil kamal pargaasi-aa so an-din jaagaa. One whose heart lotus blossoms forth upon meeting the Guru, remains awake and aware, night and day.
DEFINE	para 42236	lgw rMgu crxwribMd sBu BRmu Bau Bwgw ] (964-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) lagaa rang charnaarbind sabh bharam bha-o bhaagaa. All doubt and fear run away from one who is in love with the Lord's lotus feet.
RECORD	para 42238	Awqmu ijqw gurmqI AwgMjq pwgw ] (965-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aatam jitaa gurmatee aaganjat paagaa. He conquers his soul, following the Guru's Teachings, and attains the Imperishable Lord.
RECORD	para 42239	ijsih iDAwieAw pwrbRhmu so kil mih qwgw ] (965-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jisahi Dhi-aa-i-aa paarbarahm so kal meh taagaa. He alone keeps up in this Dark Age of Kali Yuga, who meditates on the Supreme Lord God.
WHEN	para 42240	swDU sMgiq inrmlw ATsiT mjnwgw ] (965-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) saaDhoo sangat nirmalaa athsath majnaagaa. In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, he is immaculate, as if he has bathed at the sixty-eight sacred shrines of pilgrimage.
DEFINE	para 42241	ijsu pRBu imilAw Awpxw so purKu sBwgw ] (965-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis parabh mili-aa aapnaa so purakh sabhaagaa. He alone is a man of good fortune, who has met with God.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v17	nwnk iqsu bilhwrxY ijsu eyvf Bwgw ]17] (965-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak tis balihaarnai jis ayvad bhaagaa. ||17||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v17	Nanak is a sacrifice to such a one, whose destiny is so great! ||17||
RECORD	para 42243	slok mÚ 5 ] (965-3) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 42244	jW ipru AMdir qW Dn bwhir ] (965-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jaa N pir andar taaN Dhan baahar. When the Husband Lord is within the heart, then Maya, the bride, goes outside.
DEFINE	para 42245	jW ipru bwhir qW Dn mwhir ] (965-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jaa N pir baahar taa N Dhan maahar. When one's Husband Lord is outside of oneself, then Maya, the bride, is supreme.
RECORD	para 42246	ibnu nwvY bhu Pyru iPrwhir ] (965-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) bin naavai baho fayr firaahar. Without the Name, one wanders all around.
DEFINE	para 42247	siqguir sMig idKwieAw jwhir ] (965-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) satgur sang dikhaa-i-aa jaahar. The True Guru shows us that the Lord is with us.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	jn nwnk scy sic smwhir ]1] (965-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jan naanak sachay sach samaahar. ||1||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	Servant Nanak merges in the Truest of the True. ||1||
RECORD	para 42249	mÚ 5 ] (965-5) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 42250	Awhr siB krdw iPrY Awhru ieku n hoie ] (965-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aahar sabh kardaa firai aahar ik na ho-ay. Making all sorts of efforts, they wander around; but they do not make even one effort.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	nwnk ijqu Awhir jgu auDrY ivrlw bUJY koie ]2] (965-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak jit aahar jag uDhrai virlaa boojhai ko-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v2	O Nanak, how rare are those who understand the effort which saves the world. ||2||
RECORD	para 42252	pauVI ] (965-6) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 42253	vfI hU vfw Apwru qyrw mrqbw ] (965-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) vadee hoo vadaa apaar tayraa martabaa. The greatest of the great, infinite is Your dignity.
DEFINE	para 42254	rMg prMg Anyk n jwpin@ krqbw ] (965-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) rang parang anayk na jaapni H kartabaa. Your colors and hues are so numerous; no one can know Your actions.
DEFINE	para 42255	jIAw AMdir jIau sBu ikCu jwxlw ] (965-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jee-aa andar jee-o sabh kichh jaanlaa. You are the Soul within all souls; You alone know everything.
DEFINE	para 42256	sBu ikCu qyrY vis qyrw Gru Blw ] (965-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sabh kichh tayrai vas tayraa ghar bhalaa. Everything is under Your control; Your home is beautiful.
DEFINE	para 42257	qyrY Gir Awnµdu vDweI quDu Gir ] (965-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) tayrai ghar aanand vaDhaa-ee tuDh ghar. Your home is filled with bliss, which resonates and resounds throughout Your home.
DEFINE	para 42258	mwxu mhqw qyju Awpxw Awip jir ] (965-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) maan mahtaa tayj aapnaa aap jar. Your honor, majesty and glory are Yours alone.
DEFINE	para 42259	srb klw BrpUru idsY jq kqw ] (965-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sarab kalaa bharpoor disai jat kataa. You are overflowing with all powers; wherever we look, there You are.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v18	nwnk dwsin dwsu quDu AwgY ibnvqw ]18] (965-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak daasan daas tuDh aagai binvataa. ||18||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v18	Nanak, the slave of Your slaves, prays to You alone. ||18||
RECORD	para 42261	slok mÚ 5 ] (965-9) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 42262	CqVy bwjwr sohin ivic vpwrIey ] (965-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) chhat-rhay baajaar sohan vich vapaaree-ai. Your streets are covered with canopies; under them, the traders look beautiful.
