DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, he alone is truly a banker, who buys the infinite commodity. ||1||
RECORD	para 42264	mhlw 5 ] (965-10) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 42265	kbIrw hmrw ko nhI hm iks hU ky nwih ] (965-10, rwmklI, kbIr) kabeeraa hamraa ko nahee ham kis hoo kay naahi. Kabeer, no one is mine, and I belong to no one.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	ijin iehu rcnu rcwieAw iqs hI mwih smwih ]2] (965-11, rwmklI, kbIr) jin ih rachan rachaa-i-aa tis hee maahi samaahi. ||2||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	I am absorbed in the One, who created this creation. ||2||
RECORD	para 42267	pauVI ] (965-11) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 42268	sPilau ibrKu suhwvVw hir sPl AMimRqw ] (965-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) safli-o birakh suhaavrhaa har safal amritaa. The Lord is the most beautiful fruit tree, bearing fruits of Ambrosial Nectar.
RECORD	para 42269	mnu locY aun@ imlx kau ikau vM\Y iGqw ] (965-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) man lochai un H milan ka-o ki-o vanjai ghitaa. My mind longs to meet Him; how can I ever find Him?
DEFINE	para 42270	vrnw ichnw bwhrw Ehu Agmu Aijqw ] (965-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) varnaa chihnaa baahraa oh agam ajitaa. He has no color or form; He is inaccessible and unconquerable.
RECORD	para 42271	Ehu ipAwrw jIA kw jo Kol@Y iBqw ] (965-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) oh pi-aaraa jee-a kaa jo khol Hai bhitaa. I love Him with all my soul; He opens the door for me.
