RECORD	para 42273	kurbwxI vM\w vwrxY bly bil ikqw ] (965-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kurbaanee vanjaa vaarnai balay bal kitaa. I am a sacrifice, a dedicated, devoted sacrifice to Him.
RECORD	para 42274	dsin sMq ipAwirAw suxhu lwie icqw ] (965-14, rwmklI, mÚ 5) dasan sant pi-aari-aa sunhu laa-ay chitaa. The Beloved Saints tell us, to listen with our consciousness.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v19	ijsu iliKAw nwnk dws iqsu nwau AMimRqu siqguir idqw ]19] (965-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis likhi-aa naanak daas tis naa-o amrit satgur ditaa. ||19||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v19	One who has such pre-ordained destiny, O slave Nanak, is blessed with the Ambrosial Name by the True Guru. ||19||
RECORD	para 42277	kbIr DrqI swD kI qskr bYsih gwih ] (965-15, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kabeer Dhartee saaDh kee taskar baiseh gaahi. Kabeer, the earth belongs to the Holy, but the thieves have come and now sit among them.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	DrqI Bwir n ibAwpeI aun kau lwhU lwih ]1] (965-16, rwmklI, mÚ 5) Dhartee bhaar na bi-aapa-ee un ka-o laahoo laahi. ||1||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	The earth does not feel their weight; even they profit. ||1||
RECORD	para 42279	mhlw 5 ] (965-16) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 42280	kbIr cwvl kwrxy quK kau muhlI lwie ] (965-17, rwmklI, mÚ 5) kabeer chaaval kaarnay tukh ka-o muhlee laa-ay. Kabeer, for the sake of the rice, the husks are beaten and threshed.
