WHEN	slok mhlw 5 v2	When one sits in the company of evil people, then he will be called to account by the Righteous Judge of Dharma. ||2||
RECORD	para 42282	pauVI ] (965-17) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 42283	Awpy hI vf prvwru Awip iekwqIAw ] (965-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay hee vad parvaar aap ikaatee-aa. He Himself has the greatest family; He Himself is all alone.
RECORD	para 42284	AwpxI kImiq Awip Awpy hI jwqIAw ] (965-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapnee keemat aap aapay hee jaatee-aa. He alone knows His own worth.
RECORD	para 42285	sBu ikCu Awpy Awip Awip aupMinAw ] (965-18, rwmklI, mÚ 5) sabh kichh aapay aap aap upanni-aa. He Himself, by Himself, created everything.
RECORD	para 42286	Awpxw kIqw Awip Awip vrMinAw ] (965-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapnaa keetaa aap aap varanni-aa. Only He Himself can describe His own creation.
DEFINE	para 42287	DMnu su qyrw Qwnu ijQY qU vuTw ] (965-19, rwmklI, mÚ 5) Dhan so tayraa thaan jithai too vuthaa. Blessed is Your place, where You dwell, Lord.
DEFINE	para 42289	DMnu su qyry Bgq ijn@I scu qUM ifTw ] (966-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) Dhan so tayray bhagat jin Hee sach tooN dithaa. Blessed are Your devotees, who see You, O True Lord.
DEFINE	para 42290	ijs no qyrI dieAw slwhy soie quDu ] (966-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis no tayree da-i-aa salaahay so-ay tuDh. He alone praises You, who is blessed by Your Grace.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v20	ijsu gur Byty nwnk inrml soeI suDu ]20] (966-1, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis gur bhaytay naanak nirmal so-ee suDh. ||20||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v20	One who meets the Guru, O Nanak, is immaculate and sanctified. ||20||
RECORD	para 42292	slok mÚ 5 ] (966-2) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 42293	PrIdw BUim rMgwvlI mMiJ ivsUlw bwgu ] (966-2, rwmklI, mÚ 5) fareedaa bhoom rangaavalee manjh visoolaa baag. Fareed, this world is beautiful, but there is a thorny garden within it.
