DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v1	Those who are blessed by their spiritual teacher are not even scratched. ||1||
RECORD	para 42295	mÚ 5 ] (966-3) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 42296	PrIdw aumr suhwvVI sMig suvMnVI dyh ] (966-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) fareedaa umar suhaavarhee sang suvannrhee dayh. Fareed, blessed is the life, with such a beautiful body.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v2	ivrly kyeI pweIAin@ ijn@w ipAwry nyh ]2] (966-3, rwmklI, mÚ 5) virlay kay-ee paa-ee-aniH jin Haa pi-aaray nayh. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v2	How rare are those who are found to love their Beloved Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 42298	pauVI ] (966-4) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 42299	jpu qpu sMjmu dieAw Drmu ijsu dyih su pwey ] (966-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jap tap sanjam da-i-aa Dharam jis deh so paa-ay. He alone obtains meditation, austerities, self-discipline, compassion and Dharmic faith, whom the Lord so blesses.
RECORD	para 42300	ijsu buJwieih Agin Awip so nwmu iDAwey ] (966-4, rwmklI, mÚ 5) jis bujhaa-ihi agan aap so naam Dhi-aa-ay. He alone meditates on the Naam, the Name of the Lord, whose fire the Lord puts out.
RECORD	para 42301	AMqrjwmI Agm purKu iek idRsit idKwey ] (966-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) antarjaamee agam purakh ik darisat dikhaa-ay. The Inner-knower, the Searcher of hearts, the Inaccessible Primal Lord, inspires us to look upon all with an impartial eye.
RECORD	para 42302	swDsMgiq kY AwsrY pRB isau rMgu lwey ] (966-5, rwmklI, mÚ 5) saaDhsangat kai aasrai parabh si-o rang laa-ay. With the support of the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, one falls in love with God.
DEFINE	para 42303	Aaugx kit muKu aujlw hir nwim qrwey ] (966-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) a-ugan kat mukh ujlaa har naam taraa-ay. One's faults are eradicated, and one's face becomes radiant and bright; through the Lord's Name, one crosses over.
DEFINE	para 42304	jnm mrx Bau kitEnu iPir join n pwey ] (966-6, rwmklI, mÚ 5) janam maran bha-o kati-on fir jon na paa-ay. The fear of birth and death is removed, and he is not reincarnated again.
RECORD	para 42305	AMD kUp qy kwiFAnu lVu Awip PVwey ] (966-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) anDh koop tay kaadhi-an larh aap farhaa-ay. God lifts him up and pulls him out of the deep, dark pit, and attaches him to the hem of His robe.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v21	nwnk bKis imlwieAnu rKy gil lwey ]21] (966-7, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak bakhas milaa-i-an rakhay gal laa-ay. ||21||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v21	O Nanak, God forgives him, and holds him close in His embrace. ||21||
RECORD	para 42307	slok mÚ 5 ] (966-8) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 42308	muhbiq ijsu Kudwie dI rqw rMig clUil ] (966-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) muhabat jis khudaa-ay dee rataa rang chalool. One who loves God is imbued with the deep crimson color of His love.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	nwnk ivrly pweIAih iqsu jn kIm n mUil ]1] (966-8, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak virlay paa-ee-ah tis jan keem na mool. ||1||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v1	O Nanak, such a person is rarely found; the value of such a humble person can never be estimated. ||1||
RECORD	para 42310	mÚ 5 ] (966-9) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 42311	AMdru ivDw sic nwie bwhir BI scu ifToim ] (966-9, rwmklI, mÚ 5) andar viDhaa sach naa-ay baahar bhee sach dithom. The True Name has pierced the nucleus of my self deep within. Outside, I see the True Lord as well.
