DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v2	O Nanak, He is pervading and permeating all places, the forests and the meadows, the three worlds, and every hair. ||2||
RECORD	para 42313	pauVI ] (966-10) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 42314	Awpy kIqo rcnu Awpy hI riqAw ] (966-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay keeto rachan aapay hee rati-aa. He Himself created the Universe; He Himself imbues it.
DEFINE	para 42315	Awpy hoieE ieku Awpy bhu BiqAw ] (966-10, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay ho-i-o ik aapay baho bhati-aa. He Himself is One, and He Himself has numerous forms.
DEFINE	para 42316	Awpy sBnw mMiJ Awpy bwhrw ] (966-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay sabhnaa manjh aapay baahraa. He Himself is within all, and He Himself is beyond them.
DEFINE	para 42317	Awpy jwxih dUir Awpy hI jwhrw ] (966-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay jaaneh door aapay hee jaahraa. He Himself is known to be far away, and He Himself is right here.
DEFINE	para 42318	Awpy hovih gupqu Awpy prgtIAY ] (966-11, rwmklI, mÚ 5) aapay hoveh gupat aapay pargatee-ai. He Himself is hidden, and He Himself is revealed.
RECORD	para 42319	kImiq iksY n pwie qyrI QtIAY ] (966-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) keemat kisai na paa-ay tayree thatee-ai. No one can estimate the value of Your Creation, Lord.
DEFINE	para 42320	gihr gMBIru AQwhu Apwru Agxqu qUM ] (966-12, rwmklI, mÚ 5) gahir gambheer athaahu apaar agnat tooN. You are deep and profound, unfathomable, infinite and invaluable.
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v22	nwnk vrqY ieku ieko ieku qUM ]22]1]2] suDu ] (966-13, rwmklI, mÚ 5) naanak vartai ik iko ik tooN. ||22||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 5 v22	suDh. O Nanak, the One Lord is all-pervading. You are the One and only. ||22||
WHEN	para 42322	rwmklI kI vwr rwie blvMif qQw sqY fUim AwKI (966-14) raamkalee kee vaar raa-ay balvand tathaa satai doom aakhee Vaar Of Raamkalee, Uttered By Satta And Balwand The Drummer:
RECORD	para 42323	<> siqgur pRswid ] (966-14) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
