WHEN	para 42325	dy gunw siq BYx Brwv hY pwrMgiq dwnu pVIvdY ] (966-15, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) day gunaa sat bhain bharaav hai paarangat daan parheevadai. His divine virtues are the true sisters and brothers; through them, the gift of supreme status is obtained.
WHEN	para 42326	nwnik rwju clwieAw scu kotu sqwxI nIv dY ] (966-16, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) naanak raaj chalaa-i-aa sach kot sataanee neev dai. Nanak established the kingdom; He built the true fortress on the strongest foundations.
WHEN	para 42327	lhxy DirEnu Cqu isir kir isPqI AMimRqu pIvdY ] (966-16, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) lahnay Dhari-on chhat sir kar siftee amrit peevdai. He installed the royal canopy over Lehna's head; chanting the Lord's Praises, He drank in the Ambrosial Nectar.
WHEN	para 42328	miq gur Awqm dyv dI KVig joir prwkuie jIA dY ] (966-17, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) mat gur aatam dayv dee kharhag jor puraaku-ay jee-a dai. The Guru implanted the almighty sword of the Teachings to illuminate his soul.
WHEN	para 42329	guir cyly rhrwis kIeI nwnik slwmiq QIvdY ] (966-17, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) gur chaylay rahraas kee-ee naanak salaamat theevdai. The Guru bowed down to His disciple, while Nanak was still alive.
WHEN	slok mhlw 5 v1	sih itkw idqosu jIvdY ]1] (966-18, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) seh tikaa ditos jeevdai. ||1||
RECORD	slok mhlw 5 v1	The King, while still alive, applied the ceremonial mark to his forehead. ||1||
WHEN	para 42331	lhxy dI PyrweIAY nwnkw dohI KtIAY ] (966-18, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) lahnay dee fayraa-ee-ai naankaa dohee khatee-ai. Nanak proclaimed Lehna's succession - he earned it.
WHEN	para 42332	joiq Ehw jugiq swie sih kwieAw Pyir pltIAY ] (966-18, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) jot ohaa jugat saa-ay seh kaa-i-aa fayr paltee-ai. They shared the One Light and the same way; the King just changed His body.
WHEN	para 42333	JulY su Cqu inrMjnI mil qKqu bYTw gur htIAY ] (966-19, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) jhulai so chhat niranjanee mal takhat baithaa gur hatee-ai. The immaculate canopy waves over Him, and He sits on the throne in the Guru's shop.
WHEN	para 42334	krih ij gur PurmwieAw isl jogu AlUxI ctIAY ] (966-19, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) karahi je gur furmaa-i-aa sil jog aloonee chatee-ai. He does as the Guru commands; He tasted the tasteless stone of Yoga.
WHEN	para 42336	lµgru clY gur sbid hir qoit n AwvI KtIAY ] (967-1, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) langar chalai gur sabad har tot na aavee khatee-ai. The Langar - the Kitchen of the Guru's Shabad has been opened, and its supplies never run short.
WHEN	para 42337	Krcy idiq KsMm dI Awp KhdI KYir dbtIAY ] (967-2, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) kharchay dit khasamm dee aap khahdee khair dabtee-ai. Whatever His Master gave, He spent; He distributed it all to be eaten.
WHEN	para 42338	hovY isPiq KsMm dI nUru Arshu kurshu JtIAY ] (967-2, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) hovai sifat khasamm dee noor arsahu kursahu jhatee-ai. The Praises of the Master were sung, and the Divine Light descended from the heavens to the earth.
DEFINE	para 42339	quDu ifTy scy pwiqswh mlu jnm jnm dI ktIAY ] (967-3, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) tuDh dithay sachay paatisaah mal janam janam dee katee-ai. Gazing upon You, O True King, the filth of countless past lives is washed away.
WHEN	para 42340	scu ij guir PurmwieAw ikau eydU bolhu htIAY ] (967-3, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) sach je gur furmaa-i-aa ki-o aydoo bolhu hatee-ai. The Guru gave the True Command; why should we hesitate to proclaim this?
WHEN	para 42341	puqRI kaulu n pwilE kir pIrhu kMn@ murtIAY ] (967-4, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) putree ka-ul na paali-o kar peerahu kan H murtee-ai. His sons did not obey His Word; they turned their backs on Him as Guru.
WHEN	para 42342	idil KotY AwkI iPrin@ bMin@ Bwru aucwiein@ CtIAY ] (967-4, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) dil khotai aakee firniH baneh bhaar uchaa-ini H chhatee-ai. These evil-hearted ones became rebellious; they carry loads of sin on their backs.
WHEN	para 42343	ijin AwKI soeI kry ijin kIqI iqnY QtIAY ] (967-5, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) jin aakhee so-ee karay jin keetee tinai thatee-ai. Whatever the Guru said, Lehna did, and so he was installed on the throne.
WHEN	slok mhlw 5 v2	kauxu hwry ikin auvtIAY ]2] (967-5, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) ka-un haaray kin uvtee-ai. ||2||
