WHEN	para 42363	joiq smwxI joiq mwih Awpu AwpY syqI imikEnu ] (967-15, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) jot samaanee jot maahi aap aapai saytee miki-on. His Light merged into the Light, and He blended Him into Himself.
WHEN	para 42364	isKW puqRW GoiK kY sB aumiq vyKhu ij ikEnu ] (967-15, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) sikhaa N putraaN ghokh kai sabh umat vaykhhu je ki-on. Guru Nanak tested His Sikhs and His sons, and everyone saw what happened.
