DEFINE	para 42370	ijqu su hwQ n lBeI qUM Ehu TrUru ] (967-18, rwmklI, blvMif qy sqw) jit so haath na labh-ee tooN oh tharoor. You are the cooling peace, whose depth cannot be found.
