DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v6	By Guru's Grace, one is liberated, absorbed in the primal trance of Truth. ||6||
RECORD	para 44074	Anhiq lwlw byiDAw pRB hyiq ipAwrI ] (1011-6, mwrU, mÚ 1) anhat laalaa bayDhi-aa parabh hayt pi-aaree. His slave remains continually pierced through with love and affection for God.
DEFINE	para 44075	ibnu swcy jIau jil blau JUTy vykwrI ] (1011-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) bin saachay jee-o jal bala-o jhoothay vaykaaree. Without the True Lord, the soul of the false, corrupt person is burnt to ashes.
