RECORD	para 44077	ijnI nwmu ivswirAw iqnw Taur n Twau ] (1011-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) jinee naam visaari-aa tinaa tha-ur na thaa-o. Those who have forgotten the Naam have no home, no place of rest.
