RECORD	para 44081	lwlY gwrbu CoifAw gur kY BY shij suBweI ] (1011-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) laalai gaarab chhodi-aa gur kai bhai sahj subhaa-ee. The Lord's slave renounces his egotistical pride, through the Guru's Fear, intuitively and easily.
DEFINE	para 44082	lwlY Ksmu pCwixAw vfI vifAweI ] (1011-10, mwrU, mÚ 1) laalai khasam pachhaani-aa vadee vadi-aa-ee. The slave realizes his Lord and Master; glorious is his greatness!
