RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v1	Meeting with his Lord and Master, he finds peace; His value cannot be desribed. ||1||
DEFINE	para 44084	lwlw golw Ksm kw KsmY vifAweI ] (1011-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) laalaa golaa khasam kaa khasmai vadi-aa-ee. I am the slave and servant of my Lord and Master; all glory is to my Master.
