DEFINE	para 44110	eyhu mnu Avgix bwiDAw shu dyh srIrY ] (1012-3, mwrU, mÚ 1) ayhu man avgan baaDhi-aa saho dayh sareerai. This mind is tied to its faults; it suffers terrible pain in its body.
