DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v1	rahaa-o. He alone is united, whom You, O Lord, unite. Such is the Primal Command of the Infinite Lord. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 44114	ijau qU rwKih iqau rhw jo dyih su Kwau ] (1012-5, mwrU, mÚ 1) ji-o too raakhahi ti-o rahaa jo deh so khaa-o. As You keep me, I remain; whatever You give me, I eat.
RECORD	para 44115	ijau qU clwvih iqau clw muiK AMimRq nwau ] (1012-6, mwrU, mÚ 1) ji-o too chalaaveh ti-o chalaa mukh amrit naa-o. As You lead me, I follow, with the Ambrosial Name in my mouth.
