DEFINE	para 44129	myry pRB Bwvin sy aUjly sB mYlu BrIjY ] (1012-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) mayray parabh bhaavan say oojlay sabh mail bhareejai. They alone are pure, who are pleasing to my God; all others are soiled with filth.
