RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v7	Who can estimate the value of the color of the true jewel? ||7||
RECORD	para 44132	ByKI hwQ n lBeI qIriQ nhI dwny ] (1012-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) bhaykhee haath na labh-ee tirath nahee daanay. Wearing religious robes, the Lord is not obtained, nor is He obtained by giving donations at sacred shrines of pilgrimage.
DEFINE	para 44133	pUCau byd pVMiqAw mUTI ivxu mwny ] (1012-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) poochha-o bayd parhanti-aa moothee vin maanay. Go and ask the readers of the Vedas; without faith, the world is cheated.
