RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v2	qU dwqw dieAwlu sBY isir Aihinis dwiq smwir kry ]2] (1013-19, mwrU, mÚ 1) too daataa da-i-aal sabhai sir ahinis daat samaar karay. ||2||
