RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v3	lwgI BUK mwieAw mgu johY mukiq pdwrQu moih Kry ]3] (1014-1, mwrU, mÚ 1) laagee bhookh maa-i-aa mag johai mukat padaarath mohi kharay. ||3||
