RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v4	kwim k®oiD AhMkwir ivAwpy kUV kutMb isau pRIiq kry ]4] (1014-2, mwrU, mÚ 1) kaam kroDh aha Nkaar vi-aapay koorh kutamb si-o pareet karay. ||4||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v4	Engrossed in sexual desire, anger and egotism, he falls in love with his false relatives. ||4||
