DEFINE	para 44239	ihknI lidAw ihik lid gey ihik Bwry Br nwil ] (1015-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) hiknee ladi-aa hik lad ga-ay hik bhaaray bhar naal. Some are getting on board, and some have already set out; some are weighed down with their loads.
