RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v7	Those who deal in Truth, remain with their True Lord God. ||7||
DEFINE	para 44241	nw hm cMgy AwKIAh burw n idsY koie ] (1015-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) naa ham changay aakhee-aah buraa na disai ko-ay. I am not called good, and I see none who are bad.
