DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	The all-knowing Lord and Master shows us the true way of life; He is our Savior and Protector forever. ||3||
DEFINE	para 44318	dUK drd klys ibnsih ijsu bsY mn mwih ] (1017-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) dookh darad kalays binsahi jis basai man maahi. Pain, suffering and troubles are eradicated, when the Lord abides in the mind.
