RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	pwvnw qy mhw pwvn koit dwn iesnwn ]7] (1017-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) paavnaa tay mahaa paavan kot daan isnaan. ||7||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	Such a person becomes the purest of the pure, and is blessed with the merits of millions of donations to charity and cleansing baths. ||7||
DEFINE	para 44326	bl buiD suiD prwx srbsu sMqnw kI rwis ] (1017-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) bal buDh suDh paraan sarbas santnaa kee raas. God is power, intellect, understanding, the breath of life, wealth, and everything for the Saints.
