DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. The Lord of the Universe is merciful, divine and compassionate. Listen - this is the way of the Saints. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 44334	crx qlY augwih bYisE sRmu n rihE srIir ] (1018-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) charan talai ugaahi baisi-o saram na rahi-o sareer. He plants his feet in the boat, and then sits down in it; the fatigue of his body is relieved.
