RECORD	para 44338	aUc nIc ibkwr suik®q sMlgn sB suK CqR ] (1018-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) ooch neech bikaar sukarit sa Nlgan sabh sukh chhatar. High and low, bad and good - the comforting canopy of the sky stretches evenly over all.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	imqR sqRü n kCU jwnY srb jIA smq ]4] (1018-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) mitar satar na kachhoo jaanai sarab jee-a samat. ||4||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	It knows nothing of friend and enemy; all beings are alike to it. ||4||
RECORD	para 44340	kir pRgwsu pRcMf pRgitE AMDkwr ibnws ] (1018-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) kar pargaas parchand pargati-o anDhkaar binaas. Blazing with its dazzling light, the sun rises, and dispels the darkness.
