RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	Touching both the pure and the impure, it harbors no hatred to any. ||5||
RECORD	para 44342	sIq mMd sugMD cilE srb Qwn smwn ] (1018-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) seet mand suganDh chali-o sarab thaan samaan. The cool and fragrant wind gently blows upon all places alike.
