RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	Wherever anything is, it touches it there, and does not hesitate a bit. ||6||
DEFINE	para 44344	suBwie ABwie ju inkit AwvY sIqu qw kw jwie ] (1018-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) subhaa-ay abhaa-ay jo nikat aavai seet taa kaa jaa-ay. Good or bad, whoever comes close to the fire - his cold is taken away.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	Awp pr kw kCu n jwxY sdw shij suBwie ]7] (1018-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) aap par kaa kachh na jaanai sadaa sahj subhaa-ay. ||7||
