RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	pIvnw ijqu mnu AwGwvY nwmu AMimRq rsu pIvnw ]1] (1019-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) peevnaa jit man aaghaavai naam amrit ras peevnaa. ||1||
