RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 Gru 8 AMjulIAw v3	swDsMig qutih hau bMDn eyko eyku inhwlIAY ]3] (1019-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) saaDhsang tuteh ha-o banDhan ayko ayk nihaalee-ai. ||3||
