DEFINE	para 44390	krm krY q bMDw nh krY q inMdw ] (1019-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) karam karai ta banDhaa nah karai ta nindaa. Doing deeds, one is placed in bondage; but if he does not act, he is slandered.
DEFINE	para 44391	moh mgn mnu ivAwipAw icMdw ] (1019-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) moh magan man vi-aapi-aa chindaa. Intoxicated with emotional attachment, the mind is afflicted with anxiety.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 Gru 8 AMjulIAw v4	gur pRswid suKu duKu sm jwxY Git Git rwmu ihAwlIAY ]4] (1019-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur parsaad sukh dukh sam jaanai ghat ghat raam hi-aalee-ai. ||4||
