RECORD	para 44507	gMgw jmunw kyl kydwrw ] (1022-1, mwrU, mÚ 1) gangaa jamunaa kayl kaydaaraa. The Ganges, the Jamunaa where Krishna played, Kaydar Naat'h,
RECORD	para 44508	kwsI kWqI purI duAwrw ] (1022-1, mwrU, mÚ 1) kaasee kaaNtee puree du-aaraa. Benares, Kanchivaram, Puri, Dwaarkaa,
