DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v9	Ganga Saagar where the Ganges empties into the ocean, Trivaynee where the three rivers come together, and the sixty-eight sacred shrines of pilgrimage, are all merged in the Lord's Being. ||9||
DEFINE	para 44510	Awpy isD swiDku vIcwrI ] (1022-2, mwrU, mÚ 1) aapay siDh saaDhik veechaaree. He Himself is the Siddha, the seeker, in meditative contemplation.
DEFINE	para 44511	Awpy rwjnu pMcw kwrI ] (1022-2, mwrU, mÚ 1) aapay raajan panchaa kaaree. He Himself is the King and the Council.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v10	qKiq bhY AdlI pRBu Awpy Brmu Bydu Bau jweI hy ]10] (1022-3, mwrU, mÚ 1) takhat bahai adlee parabh aapay bharam bhayd bha-o jaa-ee hay. ||10||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v10	God Himself, the wise Judge, sits on the throne; He takes away doubt, duality and fear. ||10||
DEFINE	para 44513	Awpy kwjI Awpy mulw ] (1022-3, mwrU, mÚ 1) aapay kaajee aapay mulaa. He Himself is the Qazi; He Himself is the Mullah.
DEFINE	para 44514	Awip ABulu n kbhU Bulw ] (1022-3, mwrU, mÚ 1) aap abhul na kabhoo bhulaa. He Himself is infallible; He never makes mistakes.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v11	Awpy imhr dieAwpiq dwqw nw iksY ko bYrweI hy ]11] (1022-4, mwrU, mÚ 1) aapay mihar da-i-aapat daataa naa kisai ko bairaa-ee hay. ||11||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v11	He Himself is the Giver of Grace, compassion and honor; He is no one's enemy. ||11||
RECORD	para 44516	ijsu bKsy iqsu dy vifAweI ] (1022-4, mwrU, mÚ 1) jis bakhsay tis day vadi-aa-ee. Whoever He forgives, He blesses with glorious greatness.
DEFINE	para 44517	sBsY dwqw iqlu n qmweI ] (1022-5, mwrU, mÚ 1) sabhsai daataa til na tamaa-ee. He is the Giver of all; He does not have even an iota of greed.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v12	Brpuir Dwir rihAw inhkyvlu gupqu pRgtu sB TweI hy ]12] (1022-5, mwrU, mÚ 1) bharpur Dhaar rahi-aa nihkayval gupat pargat sabh thaa-ee hay. ||12||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v12	The Immaculate Lord is all pervading, permeating everywhere, both hidden and manifest. ||12||
RECORD	para 44519	ikAw swlwhI Agm ApwrY ] (1022-6, mwrU, mÚ 1) ki-aa saalaahee agam apaarai. How can I praise the inaccessible, infinite Lord?
DEFINE	para 44520	swcy isrjxhwr murwrY ] (1022-6, mwrU, mÚ 1) saachay sirjanhaar muraarai. The True Creator Lord is the Enemy of ego.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v13	ijs no ndir kry iqsu myly myil imlY mylweI hy ]13] (1022-6, mwrU, mÚ 1) jis no nadar karay tis maylay mayl milai maylaa-ee hay. ||13||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v13	He unites those whom He blesses with His Grace; uniting them in His Union, they are united. ||13||
RECORD	para 44522	bRhmw ibsnu mhysu duAwrY ] (1022-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) barahmaa bisan mahays du-aarai. Brahma, Vishnu and Shiva stand at His Door;
RECORD	para 44523	aUBy syvih AlK ApwrY ] (1022-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) oobhay sayveh alakh apaarai. they serve the unseen, infinite Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v14	hor kyqI dir dIsY ibllwdI mY gxq n AwvY kweI hy ]14] (1022-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) hor kaytee dar deesai billaadee mai ganat na aavai kaa-ee hay. ||14||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v14	Millions of others can be seen crying at His door; I cannot even estimate their numbers. ||14||
DEFINE	para 44525	swcI kIriq swcI bwxI ] (1022-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) saachee keerat saachee banee. True is the Kirtan of His Praise, and True is the Word of His Bani.
RECORD	para 44526	hor n dIsY byd purwxI ] (1022-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) hor na deesai bayd puraanee. I can see no other in the Vedas and the Puraanas.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v15	pUMjI swcu scy gux gwvw mY Dr hor n kweI hy ]15] (1022-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) poonjee saach sachay gun gaavaa mai Dhar hor na kaa-ee hay. ||15||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v15	Truth is my capital; I sing the Glorious Praises of the True Lord. I have no other support at all. ||15||
REQUIRE	para 44528	jugu jugu swcw hY BI hosI ] (1022-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) jug jug saachaa hai bhee hosee. In each and every age, the True Lord is, and shall always be.
FORBID	para 44529	kauxu n mUAw kauxu n mrsI ] (1022-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) ka-un na moo-aa ka-un na marsee. Who has not died? Who shall not die?
