RECORD	para 44538	kwmu k®oDu AhMkwru invwry ] (1022-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) kaam kroDh aha Nkaar nivaaray. Eradicating sexual desire, anger and egotism,
RECORD	para 44539	qskr pMc sbid sMGwry ] (1022-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) taskar panch sabad sanghaaray. she destroys the five thieves through the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v3	igAwn KVgu lY mn isau lUJY mnsw mnih smweI hy ]3] (1022-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) gi-aan kharhag lai man si-o loojhai mansaa maneh samaa-ee hay. ||3||
