RECORD	para 44547	inj Gir bYis rhy Bau KwieAw ] (1022-17, mwrU, mÚ 1) nij ghar bais rahay bha-o khaa-i-aa. One who sits in the home of his own self, eats his own fears.
RECORD	para 44548	Dwvq rwKy Twik rhwieAw ] (1022-17, mwrU, mÚ 1) Dhaavat raakhay thaak rahaa-i-aa. He quiets and holds his wandering mind still.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v6	kml ibgws hry sr suBr Awqm rwmu sKweI hy ]6] (1022-17, mwrU, mÚ 1) kamal bigaas haray sar subhar aatam raam sakhaa-ee hay. ||6||
