RECORD	para 44550	mrxu ilKwie mMfl mih Awey ] (1022-18, mwrU, mÚ 1) maran likhaa-ay mandal meh aa-ay. With their death already ordained, mortals come into this world.
RECORD	para 44551	ikau rhIAY clxw prQwey ] (1022-18, mwrU, mÚ 1) ki-o rahee-ai chalnaa parthaa-ay. How can they remain here? They have to go to the world beyond.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v7	scw Amru scy Amrw puir so scu imlY vfweI hy ]7] (1022-18, mwrU, mÚ 1) sachaa amar sachay amraa pur so sach milai vadaa-ee hay. ||7||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v7	True is the Lord's Command; the true ones dwell in the eternal city. The True Lord blesses them with glorious greatness. ||7||
RECORD	para 44553	Awip aupwieAw jgqu sbwieAw ] (1022-19, mwrU, mÚ 1) aap upaa-i-aa jagat sabaa-i-aa. He Himself created the whole world.
RECORD	para 44554	ijin isirAw iqin DMDY lwieAw ] (1022-19, mwrU, mÚ 1) jin siri-aa tin DhanDhai laa-i-aa. The One who made it, assigns the tasks to it.
