RECORD	para 44854	sUrju qpY Agin ibKu Jwlw ] (1029-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) sooraj tapai agan bikh jhaalaa. The scorching sun blazes with flames of poison.
DEFINE	para 44855	Apqu psU mnmuKu byqwlw ] (1029-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) apat pasoo manmukh baytaalaa. The self-willed manmukh is dishonored, a beast, a demon.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v7	Awsw mnsw kUVu kmwvih rogu burw buirAwrw hy ]7] (1029-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) aasaa mansaa koorh kamaaveh rog buraa buri-aaraa hay. ||7||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v7	Trapped by hope and desire, he practices falsehood, and is afflicted by the terrible disease of corruption. ||7||
RECORD	para 44857	msqik Bwru klr isir Bwrw ] (1029-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) mastak bhaar kalar sir bhaaraa. He carries the heavy load of sins on his forehead and head.
RECORD	para 44858	ikau kir Bvjlu lµGis pwrw ] (1029-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) ki-o kar bhavjal langhas paaraa. How can he cross the terrifying world-ocean?
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v8	siqguru boihQu Awid jugwdI rwm nwim insqwrw hy ]8] (1029-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) satgur bohith aad jugaadee raam naam nistaaraa hay. ||8||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v8	From the very beginning of time, and throughout the ages, the True Guru has been the boat; through the Lord's Name, He carries us across. ||8||
DEFINE	para 44860	puqR klqR jig hyqu ipAwrw ] (1029-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) putar kaltar jag hayt pi-aaraa. The love of one's children and spouse is so sweet in this world.
DEFINE	para 44861	mwieAw mohu psirAw pwswrw ] (1029-10, mwrU, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa moh pasri-aa paasaaraa. The expansive expanse of the Universe is attachment to Maya.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v9	jm ky Pwhy siqguir qoVy gurmuiK qqu bIcwrw hy ]9] (1029-10, mwrU, mÚ 1) jam kay faahay satgur torhay gurmukh tat beechaaraa hay. ||9||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v9	The True Guru snaps the noose of Death, for that Gurmukh who contemplates the essence of reality. ||9||
RECORD	para 44863	kUiV muTI cwlY bhu rwhI ] (1029-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) koorh muthee chaalai baho raahee. Cheated by falsehood, the self-willed manmukh walks along many paths;
ALLOW	para 44864	mnmuKu dwJY piV piV BwhI ] (1029-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) manmukh daajhai parh parh bhaahee. he may be highly educated, but he burns in the fire.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v10	AMimRq nwmu gurU vf dwxw nwmu jphu suK swrw hy ]10] (1029-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) amrit naam guroo vad daanaa naam japahu sukh saaraa hay. ||10||
