RECORD	para 44866	siqguru quTw scu idRVwey ] (1029-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) satgur tuthaa sach drirh-aa-ay. The True Guru, in His Mercy, implants Truth within.
DEFINE	para 44867	siB duK myty mwrig pwey ] (1029-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) sabh dukh maytay maarag paa-ay. All suffering is eradicated, and one is placed on the Path.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v11	kMfw pwie n gfeI mUly ijsu siqguru rwKxhwrw hy ]11] (1029-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) kandaa paa-ay na gad-ee moolay jis satgur raakhanhaaraa hay. ||11||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v11	Not even a thorn ever pierces the foot of one who has the True Guru as his Protector. ||11||
WHEN	para 44869	KyhU Kyh rlY qnu CIjY ] (1029-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) khayhoo khayh ralai tan chheejai. Dust mixes with dust, when the body wastes away.
DEFINE	para 44870	mnmuKu pwQru sYlu n BIjY ] (1029-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) manmukh paathar sail na bheejai. The self-willed manmukh is like a stone slab, which is impervious to water.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v12	krx plwv kry bhuqyry nrik surig Avqwrw hy ]12] (1029-14, mwrU, mÚ 1) karan palaav karay bahutayray narak surag avtaaraa hay. ||12||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v12	He cries out and weeps and wails; he is reincarnated into heaven and then hell. ||12||
RECORD	para 44872	mwieAw ibKu BuieAMgm nwly ] (1029-14, mwrU, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa bikh bhu-i-angam naalay. They live with the poisonous snake of Maya.
RECORD	para 44873	iein duibDw Gr bhuqy gwly ] (1029-14, mwrU, mÚ 1) in dubiDhaa ghar bahutay gaalay. This duality has ruined so many homes.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v13	siqgur bwJhu pRIiq n aupjY Bgiq rqy pqIAwrw hy ]13] (1029-15, mwrU, mÚ 1) satgur baajhahu pareet na upjai bhagat ratay patee-aaraa hay. ||13||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v13	Without the True Guru, love does not well up. Imbued with devotional worship, the soul is satisfied. ||13||
RECORD	para 44875	swkq mwieAw kau bhu Dwvih ] (1029-15, mwrU, mÚ 1) saakat maa-i-aa ka-o baho Dhaaveh. The faithless cynics chase after Maya.
RECORD	para 44876	nwmu ivswir khw suKu pwvih ] (1029-16, mwrU, mÚ 1) naam visaar kahaa sukh paavahi. Forgetting the Naam, how can they find peace?
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v14	iqRhu gux AMqir Kpih Kpwvih nwhI pwir auqwrw hy ]14] (1029-16, mwrU, mÚ 1) tarihu gun antar khapeh khapaaveh naahee paar utaaraa hay. ||14||
