DEFINE	para 45046	swcw vwsw puir ggnµdir ] (1033-9, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) saachaa vaasaa pur gagnandar. The dwelling of the True Lord is within the city of the Tenth Gate.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 dKxI v1	AsiQru Qwnu sdw inrmwielu Awpy Awpu aupwiedw ]1] (1033-9, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) asthir thaan sadaa nirmaa-il aapay aap upaa-idaa. ||1||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 dKxI v1	This place is permanent and forever immaculate. He Himself created it. ||1||
DEFINE	para 45048	AMdir kot Cjy htnwly ] (1033-10, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) andar kot chhajay hatnaalay. Within the fortress are balconies and bazaars.
RECORD	para 45049	Awpy lyvY vsqu smwly ] (1033-10, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) aapay layvai vasat samaalay. He Himself takes care of His merchandise.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 dKxI v2	bjr kpwt jVy jiV jwxY gur sbdI Kolwiedw ]2] (1033-10, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) bajar kapaat jarhay jarh jaanai gur sabdee kholaa-idaa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 dKxI v2	The hard and heavy doors of the Tenth Gate are closed and locked. Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, they are thrown open. ||2||
DEFINE	para 45051	BIqir kot guPw Gr jweI ] (1033-11, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) bheetar kot gufaa ghar jaa-ee. Within the fortress is the cave, the home of the self.
RECORD	para 45052	nau Gr Qwpy hukim rjweI ] (1033-11, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) na-o ghar thaapay hukam rajaa-ee. He established the nine gates of this house, by His Command and His Will.
