RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 dKxI v3	In the Tenth Gate, the Primal Lord, the unknowable and infinite dwells; the unseen Lord reveals Himself. ||3||
RECORD	para 45054	paux pwxI AgnI iek vwsw ] (1033-12, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) pa-un paanee agnee ik vaasaa. Within the body of air, water and fire, the One Lord dwells.
RECORD	para 45055	Awpy kIqo Kylu qmwsw ] (1033-12, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) aapay keeto khayl tamaasaa. He Himself stages His wondrous dramas and plays.
