RECORD	para 45057	Driq aupwie DrI Drm swlw ] (1033-13, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) Dharat upaa-ay Dharee Dharam saalaa. Creating the earth, He established it as the home of Dharma.
RECORD	para 45058	auqpiq prlau Awip inrwlw ] (1033-14, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) utpat parla-o aap niraalaa. Creating and destroying, He remains unattached.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 dKxI v5	pvxY Kylu kIAw sB QweI klw iKMic Fwhwiedw ]5] (1033-14, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) pavnai khayl kee-aa sabh thaa-ee kalaa khinch dhaahaa-idaa. ||5||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 dKxI v5	He stages the play of the breath everywhere. Withdrawing His power, He lets the beings crumble. ||5||
DEFINE	para 45060	Bwr ATwrh mwlix qyrI ] (1033-14, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) bhaar athaarah maalan tayree. Your gardener is the vast vegetation of nature.
DEFINE	para 45061	cauru FulY pvxY lY PyrI ] (1033-15, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) cha-ur dhulai pavnai lai fayree. The wind blowing around is the chauree, the fly-brush, waving over You.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 dKxI v6	cMdu sUrju duie dIpk rwKy sis Gir sUru smwiedw ]6] (1033-15, mwrU dKxI, mÚ 1) chand sooraj du-ay deepak raakhay sas ghar soor samaa-idaa. ||6||
