RECORD	para 45198	nau Gr Qwpy QwpxhwrY ] (1036-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) na-o ghar thaapay thaapanhaarai. The Creator established the nine gates.
DEFINE	para 45199	dsvY vwsw AlK ApwrY ] (1036-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) dasvai vaasaa alakh apaarai. In the Tenth Gate, is the dwelling of the infinite, unseen Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v2	swier spq Bry jil inrmil gurmuiK mYlu n lwiedw ]2] (1036-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) saa-ir sapat bharay jal nirmal gurmukh mail na laa-idaa. ||2||
