RECORD	para 45213	Awpy vrKY AMimRq Dwrw ] rqn jvyhr lwl Apwrw ] (1036-17, mwrU, mÚ 1) aapay varkhai amrit Dhaaraa. ratan javayhar laal apaaraa. He Himself rains down the Ambrosial Stream of jewels, diamonds, and rubies of priceless value.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v7	siqguru imlY q pUrw pweIAY pRym pdwrQu pwiedw ]7] (1036-17, mwrU, mÚ 1) satgur milai ta pooraa paa-ee-ai paraym padaarath paa-idaa. ||7||
