RECORD	para 45215	pRym pdwrQu lhY Amolo ] (1036-18, mwrU, mÚ 1) paraym padaarath lahai amolo. Whoever receives the priceless treasure of Love
RECORD	para 45216	kb hI n Gwtis pUrw qolo ] (1036-18, mwrU, mÚ 1) kab hee na ghaatas pooraa tolo. - his weight never decreases; he has perfect weight.
