RECORD	para 45231	hukim aupwey ds Aauqwrw ] (1037-5, mwrU, mÚ 1) hukam upaa-ay das a-utaaraa. By His Hukam, He created His ten incarnations,
RECORD	para 45232	dyv dwnv Agxq Apwrw ] (1037-5, mwrU, mÚ 1) dayv daanav agnat apaaraa. and the uncounted and infinite gods and devils.
