RECORD	para 45237	kwieAw kotu gVY mih rwjw ] nyb Kvws Blw drvwjw ] (1037-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) kaa-i-aa kot garhai meh raajaa. nayb khavaas bhalaa darvaajaa. In the strong fortress of the body with its beautiful doors, is the king, with his special assistants and ministers.
