ALLOW	para 45269	bRhmy muiK mwieAw hY qRY gux ] (1038-1, mwrU, mÚ 1) barahmay mukh maa-i-aa hai tarai gun. form the mouth of Brahma; they speak of the three gunas, the three qualities of Maya.
