RECORD	para 45418	gurmiq ik®sin govrDn Dwry ] (1041-6, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmat krisan govarDhan Dhaaray. Through the Guru's Teachings, Krishna lifted up the mountain of Govardhan.
RECORD	para 45419	gurmiq swieir pwhx qwry ] (1041-6, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmat saa-ir paahan taaray. Through the Guru's Teachings, Rama floated stones across the ocean.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v10	gurmiq lyhu prm pdu pweIAY nwnk guir Brmu cukwieAw ]10] (1041-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmat layho param pad paa-ee-ai naanak gur bharam chukaa-i-aa. ||10||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v10	Accepting the Guru's Teachings, the supreme status is obtained; O Nanak, the Guru eradicates doubt. ||10||
RECORD	para 45421	gurmiq lyhu qrhu scu qwrI ] (1041-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmat layho tarahu sach taaree. Accepting the Guru's Teachings, cross over to the other side through Truth.
RECORD	para 45422	Awqm cInhu irdY murwrI ] (1041-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) aatam cheenahu ridai muraaree. O soul, remember the Lord within your heart.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v11	jm ky Pwhy kwtih hir jip Akul inrMjnu pwieAw ]11] (1041-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) jam kay faahay kaateh har jap akul niranjan paa-i-aa. ||11||
REQUIRE	mwrU mhlw 1 v11	The noose of death is cut away, meditating on the Lord; you shall obtain the Immaculate Lord, who has no ancestry. ||11||
RECORD	para 45424	gurmiq pMc sKy gur BweI ] (1041-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmat panch sakhay gur bhaa-ee. Through the Guru's Teachings, the Holy become one's friends and Siblings of Destiny.
DEFINE	para 45425	gurmiq Agin invwir smweI ] (1041-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmat agan nivaar samaa-ee. Through the Guru's Teachings, the inner fire is subdued and extinguished.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v12	min muiK nwmu jphu jgjIvn ird AMqir AlKu lKwieAw ]12] (1041-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) man mukh naam japahu jagjeevan rid antar alakh lakhaa-i-aa. ||12||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v12	Chant the Naam with your mind and mouth; know the unknowable Lord, the Life of the World, deep within the nucleus of your heart. ||12||
DEFINE	para 45427	gurmuiK bUJY sbid pqIjY ] (1041-10, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmukh boojhai sabad pateejai. The Gurmukh understands, and is pleased with the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	para 45428	ausqiq inMdw iks kI kIjY ] (1041-10, mwrU, mÚ 1) ustat nindaa kis kee keejai. Who does he praise or slander?
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v13	cInhu Awpu jphu jgdIsru hir jgMnwQu min BwieAw ]13] (1041-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) cheenahu aap japahu jagdeesar har jagannaath man bhaa-i-aa. ||13||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v13	Know yourself, and meditate on the Lord of the Universe; let your mind be pleased with the Lord, the Master of the Universe. ||13||
WHEN	para 45430	jo bRhmMif KMif so jwxhu ] (1041-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) jo barahmand khand so jaanhu. Know the One who pervades all the realms of the universe.
RECORD	para 45431	gurmuiK bUJhu sbid pCwxhu ] (1041-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmukh boojhhu sabad pachhaanhu. As Gurmukh, understand and realize the Shabad.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v14	Git Git Bogy Bogxhwrw rhY AqIqu sbwieAw ]14] (1041-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) ghat ghat bhogay bhoganhaaraa rahai ateet sabaa-i-aa. ||14||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v14	The Enjoyer enjoys each and every heart, and yet He remains detached from all. ||14||
RECORD	para 45433	gurmiq bolhu hir jsu sUcw ] (1041-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmat bolhu har jas soochaa. Through the Guru's Teachings, chant the Pure Praises of the Lord.
RECORD	para 45434	gurmiq AwKI dyKhu aUcw ] (1041-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) gurmat aakhee daykhhu oochaa. Through the Guru's Teachings, behold the lofty Lord with your eyes.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v15	sRvxI nwmu suxY hir bwxI nwnk hir rMig rMgwieAw ]15]3]20] (1041-13, mwrU, mÚ 1) sarvanee naam sunai har banee naanak har rang rangaa-i-aa. ||15||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v15	Whoever listens to the Lord's Name, and the Word of His Bani, O Nanak, is imbued with the color of the Lord's Love. ||15||
RECORD	para 45437	kwmu k®oDu prhru pr inMdw ] (1041-14, mwrU, mÚ 1) kaam kroDh parhar par nindaa. Leave behind sexual desire, anger and the slander of others.
RECORD	para 45438	lbu loBu qij hohu inicMdw ] (1041-14, mwrU, mÚ 1) lab lobh taj hohu nichindaa. Renounce greed and possessiveness, and become carefree.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v1	BRm kw sMglu qoiV inrwlw hir AMqir hir rsu pwieAw ]1] (1041-15, mwrU, mÚ 1) bharam kaa sangal torh niraalaa har antar har ras paa-i-aa. ||1|| Renounce greed and possessiveness, and become carefree.
RECORD	para 45440	inis dwmin ijau cmik cMdwiexu dyKY ] (1041-15, mwrU, mÚ 1) nis daaman ji-o chamak chandaa-in daykhai. As one sees the flash of lightning in the night,
RECORD	para 45441	Aihinis joiq inrMqir pyKY ] (1041-16, mwrU, mÚ 1) ahinis jot nirantar paykhai. see the Divine Light deep within your nucleus, day and night.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v2	Awnµd rUpu AnUpu srUpw guir pUrY dyKwieAw ]2] (1041-16, mwrU, mÚ 1) aanand roop anoop saroopaa gur poorai daykhaa-i-aa. ||2||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 1 v2	The Lord, the embodiment of bliss, incomparably beautiful, reveals the Perfect Guru. ||2||
RECORD	para 45443	siqgur imlhu Awpy pRBu qwry ] (1041-17, mwrU, mÚ 1) satgur milhu aapay parabh taaray. So meet with the True Guru, and God Himself will save you.
RECORD	para 45444	sis Gir sUru dIpku gYxwry ] (1041-17, mwrU, mÚ 1) sas ghar soor deepak gainaaray. He placed the lamps of the sun and the moon in the home of the sky.
