DEFINE	para 45446	AMimRq rsu pwey iqRsnw Bau jwey ] (1041-18, mwrU, mÚ 1) amrit ras paa-ay tarisnaa bha-o jaa-ay. Obtaining the sublime ambrosial essence, desire and fear are dispelled.
DEFINE	para 45447	AnBau pdu pwvY Awpu gvwey ] (1041-18, mwrU, mÚ 1) anbha-o pad paavai aap gavaa-ay. Obtaining the sublime ambrosial essence, desire and fear are dispelled.
