DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v4	The lofty and exalted state, the highest of the high is obtained, practicing the immaculate Word of the Shabad. ||4||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v4	AidRst Agocru nwmu Apwrw ] (1041-19, mwrU, mÚ 1) adrist agochar naam apaaraa. The lofty and exalted state, the highest of the high is obtained, practicing the immaculate Word of the Shabad. ||4||
DEFINE	para 45451	Aiq rsu mITw nwmu ipAwrw ] (1042-1, mwrU, mÚ 1) at ras meethaa naam pi-aaraa. The sublime essence of the Beloved Naam is utterly sweet.
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 1 v5	nwnk kau juig juig hir jsu dIjY hir jpIAY AMqu n pwieAw ]5] (1042-1, mwrU, mÚ 1) naanak ka-o jug jug har jas deejai har japee-ai ant na paa-i-aa. ||5|| The sublime essence of the Beloved Naam is utterly sweet.
DEFINE	para 45453	AMqir nwmu prwpiq hIrw ] (1042-2, mwrU, mÚ 1) antar naam paraapat heeraa. With the Naam deep within the nucleus of the self, the jewel is obtained.
