DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v2	They serve the True Lord and practice Truth; through the Name, they are absorbed in the True Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 45987	Duir Bgqw myly Awip imlwey ] (1053-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) Dhur bhagtaa maylay aap milaa-ay. The Primal Lord unites His devotees in His Union.
RECORD	para 45988	scI BgqI Awpy lwey ] (1053-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) sachee bhagtee aapay laa-ay. He attaches them to true devotional worship.
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v3	swcI bwxI sdw gux gwvY iesu jnmY kw lwhw hy ]3] (1053-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) saachee banee sadaa gun gaavai is janmai kaa laahaa hay. ||3||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v3	One who sings forever the Glorious Praises of the Lord, through the True Word of His Bani, earns the profit of this life. ||3||
RECORD	para 45990	gurmuiK vxju krih pru Awpu pCwxih ] (1053-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh vanaj karahi par aap pachhaaneh. The Gurmukh trades, and understands his own self.
RECORD	para 45991	eyks ibnu ko Avru n jwxih ] (1053-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) aykas bin ko avar na jaaneh. He knows no other than the One Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v4	scw swhu scy vxjwry pUMjI nwmu ivswhw hy ]4] (1053-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) sachaa saahu sachay vanjaaray poonjee naam visaahaa hay. ||4||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v4	True is the banker, and True are His traders, who buy the merchandise of the Naam. ||4||
RECORD	para 45993	Awpy swjy isRsit aupwey ] (1053-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay saajay sarisat upaa-ay. He Himself fashions and creates the Universe.
RECORD	para 45994	ivrly kau gur sbdu buJwey ] (1053-13, mwrU, mÚ 3) virlay ka-o gur sabad bujhaa-ay. He inspires a few to realize the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v5	siqguru syvih sy jn swcy kwty jm kw Pwhw hy ]5] (1053-13, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur sayveh say jan saachay kaatay jam kaa faahaa hay. ||5||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v5	Those humble beings who serve the True Guru are true. He snaps the noose of death from around their necks. ||5||
RECORD	para 45996	BMnY GVy svwry swjy ] (1053-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) bhannai gharhay savaaray saajay. He destroys, creates, embellishes and fashions all beings,
RECORD	para 45997	mwieAw moih dUjY jMq pwjy ] (1053-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) maa-i-aa mohi doojai jant paajay. and attaches them to duality, attachment and Maya.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v6	mnmuK iPrih sdw AMDu kmwvih jm kw jyvVw gil Pwhw hy ]6] (1053-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) manmukh fireh sadaa anDh kamaaveh jam kaa jayvrhaa gal faahaa hay. ||6||
