RECORD	para 45999	Awpy bKsy gur syvw lwey ] (1053-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay bakhsay gur sayvaa laa-ay. He Himself forgives, and enjoins us to serve the Guru.
RECORD	para 46000	gurmqI nwmu mMin vswey ] (1053-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmatee naam man vasaa-ay. Through the Guru's Teachings, the Naam comes to dwell within the mind.
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v7	Anidnu nwmu iDAwey swcw iesu jg mih nwmo lwhw hy ]7] (1053-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) an-din naam Dhi-aa-ay saachaa is jag meh naamo laahaa hay. ||7||
