DEFINE	para 46002	Awpy scw scI nweI ] (1053-16, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay sachaa sachee naa-ee. He Himself is True, and True is His Name.
RECORD	para 46003	gurmuiK dyvY mMin vsweI ] (1053-16, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh dayvai man vasaa-ee. The Gurmukh bestows it, and enshrines it within the mind.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v8	ijn min visAw sy jn sohih iqn isir cUkw kwhw hy ]8] (1053-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) jin man vasi-aa say jan soheh tin sir chookaa kaahaa hay. ||8||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v8	Noble and exalted are those, within whose mind the Lord abides. Their heads are free of strife. ||8||
DEFINE	para 46005	Agm Agocru kImiq nhI pweI ] (1053-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) agam agochar keemat nahee paa-ee. He is inaccessible and unfathomable; His value cannot be appraised.
RECORD	para 46006	gur prswdI mMin vsweI ] (1053-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee man vasaa-ee. By Guru's Grace, He dwells within the mind.
