RECORD	para 46008	bRhmw ibsnu rudRü iqs kI syvw ] (1053-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) barahmaa bisan rudar tis kee sayvaa. Brahma, Vishnu and Shiva serve Him.
RECORD	para 46009	AMqu n pwvih AlK AByvw ] (1053-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) ant na paavahi alakh abhayvaa. Even they cannot find the limits of the unseen, unknowable Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	ijn kau ndir krih qU ApxI gurmuiK AlKu lKwhw hy ]10] (1053-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) jin ka-o nadar karahi too apnee gurmukh alakh lakhaahaa hay. ||10||
