RECORD	para 46012	pUrY siqguir soJI pweI ] (1054-1, mwrU, mÚ 3) poorai satgur sojhee paa-ee. The Perfect True Guru has imparted this understanding.
RECORD	para 46013	eyko nwmu mMin vsweI ] (1054-1, mwrU, mÚ 3) ayko naam man vasaa-ee. I have enshrined the Naam, the One Name, within my mind.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v11	nwmu jpI qY nwmu iDAweI mhlu pwie gux gwhw hy ]11] (1054-1, mwrU, mÚ 3) naam japee tai naam Dhi-aa-ee mahal paa-ay gun gaahaa hay. ||11||
