RECORD	para 46015	syvk syvih mMin hukmu Apwrw ] (1054-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) sayvak sayveh man hukam apaaraa. The servant serves, and obeys the Command of the Infinite Lord.
RECORD	para 46016	mnmuK hukmu n jwxih swrw ] (1054-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) manmukh hukam na jaaneh saaraa. The self-willed manmukhs do not know the value of the Lord's Command.
