RECORD	para 46018	gur prswdI hukmu pCwxY ] (1054-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee hukam pachhaanai. By Guru's Grace, one recognizes the Lord's Hukam.
DEFINE	para 46019	Dwvqu rwKY iekqu Gir AwxY ] (1054-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) Dhaavat raakhai ikat ghar aanai. The wandering mind is restrained, and brought back to the home of the One Lord.
ALLOW	mwrU mhlw 3 v13	nwmy rwqw sdw bYrwgI nwmu rqnu min qwhw hy ]13] (1054-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) naamay raataa sadaa bairaagee naam ratan man taahaa hay. ||13||
