DEFINE	para 46021	sB jg mih vrqY eyko soeI ] (1054-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) sabh jag meh vartai ayko so-ee. The One Lord is pervasive throughout all the world.
DEFINE	para 46022	gur prswdI prgtu hoeI ] (1054-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee pargat ho-ee. By Guru's Grace, He is revealed.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v14	sbdu slwhih sy jn inrml inj Gir vwsw qwhw hy ]14] (1054-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) sabad salaaheh say jan nirmal nij ghar vaasaa taahaa hay. ||14||
