RECORD	para 46024	sdw Bgq qyrI srxweI ] (1054-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) sadaa bhagat tayree sarnaa-ee. The devotees abide forever in Your Sanctuary, Lord.
DEFINE	para 46025	Agm Agocr kImiq nhI pweI ] (1054-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) agam agochar keemat nahee paa-ee. You are inaccessible and unfathomable; Your value cannot be estimated.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v15	ijau quDu Bwvih iqau qU rwKih gurmuiK nwmu iDAwhw hy ]15] (1054-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) ji-o tuDh bhaaveh ti-o too raakhahi gurmukh naam Dhi-aahaa hay. ||15||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v15	As it pleases Your Will, You keep us; the Gurmukh meditates on the Naam. ||15||
RECORD	para 46027	sdw sdw qyry gux gwvw ] (1054-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) sadaa sadaa tayray gun gaavaa. Forever and ever, I sing Your Glorious Praises.
