RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v16	nwnku swcu khY bynµqI scu dyvhu sic smwhw hy ]16]1]10] (1054-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) naanak saach kahai baynantee sach dayvhu sach samaahaa hay. ||16||
ALLOW	mwrU mhlw 3 v16	Nanak offers this true prayer: O Lord, please bless me with Truth, that I may merge in the Truth. ||16||
DEFINE	para 46031	siqguru syvin sy vfBwgI ] (1054-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur sayvan say vadbhaagee. Those who serve the True Guru are very fortunate.
RECORD	para 46032	Anidnu swic nwim ilv lwgI ] (1054-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) an-din saach naam liv laagee. Night and day, they remain lovingly attuned to the True Name.
