RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v1	The Lord, the Giver of peace, abides forever deep within their hearts; they delight in the True Word of the Shabad. ||1||
WHEN	para 46034	ndir kry qw gurU imlwey ] (1054-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) nadar karay taa guroo milaa-ay. When the Lord grants His Grace, one meets with the Guru.
DEFINE	para 46035	hir kw nwmu mMin vswey ] (1054-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) har kaa naam man vasaa-ay. The Name of the Lord is enshrined within the mind.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v2	hir min visAw sdw suKdwqw sbdy min Emwhw hy ]2] (1054-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) har man vasi-aa sadaa sukh-daata sabday man omaahaa hay. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v2	The Lord, the Giver of peace, abides forever within the mind; the mind is delighted with the Word of the Shabad. ||2||
WHEN	para 46037	ik®pw kry qw myil imlwey ] (1054-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) kirpaa karay taa mayl milaa-ay. When the Lord bestows His Mercy, He unites in His Union.
DEFINE	para 46038	haumY mmqw sbid jlwey ] (1054-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) ha-umai mamtaa sabad jalaa-ay. Egotism and attachment are burned away by the Shabad.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v3	sdw mukqu rhY iek rMgI nwhI iksY nwil kwhw hy ]3] (1054-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) sadaa mukat rahai ik rangee naahee kisai naal kaahaa hay. ||3||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v3	In the Love of the One Lord, one remains liberated forever; he is not in conflict with anyone. ||3||
DEFINE	para 46040	ibnu siqgur syvy Gor AMDwrw ] (1054-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) bin satgur sayvay ghor anDhaaraa. Without serving the True Guru, there is only pitch-black darkness.
RECORD	para 46041	ibnu sbdY koie n pwvY pwrw ] (1054-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) bin sabdai ko-ay na paavai paaraa. Without the Shabad, no one crosses over to the other side.
