RECORD	para 46146	siB rs dyhI AMdir pwey ] (1056-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) sabh ras dayhee andar paa-ay. He placed all the flavors within the body.
DEFINE	para 46147	ivrly kau guru sbdu buJwey ] (1056-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) virlay ka-o gur sabad bujhaa-ay. How rare are those who understand, through the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
