RECORD	para 46150	gur kY sbid AMimRqu pIAwieAw ] (1056-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur kai sabad amrit pee-aa-i-aa. Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, one drinks in the Ambrosial Nectar.
