DEFINE	para 46156	gur syvw qy sBu ikCu pwey ] (1057-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur sayvaa tay sabh kichh paa-ay. Serving the Guru, all things are obtained;
DEFINE	para 46157	haumY myrw Awpu gvwey ] (1057-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) ha-umai mayraa aap gavaa-ay. egotism, possessiveness and self-conceit are taken away.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v9	Awpy ik®pw kry suKdwqw gur kY sbdy sohw hy ]9] (1057-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay kirpaa karay sukh-daata gur kai sabday sohaa hay. ||9||
