DEFINE	para 46159	gur kw sbdu AMimRq hY bwxI ] (1057-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur kaa sabad amrit hai banee. The Guru's Shabad is the Ambrosial Bani.
RECORD	para 46160	Anidnu hir kw nwmu vKwxI ] (1057-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) an-din har kaa naam vakhaanee. Night and day, chant the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	hir hir scw vsY Gt AMqir so Gtu inrmlu qwhw hy ]10] (1057-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) har har sachaa vasai ghat antar so ghat nirmal taahaa hay. ||10||
