RECORD	para 46165	sbdy AkQu kQy swlwhy ] (1057-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) sabday akath kathay saalaahay. Through the Shabad, they speak the Unspoken, and praise the Lord.
DEFINE	para 46166	myry pRB swcy vyprvwhy ] (1057-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) mayray parabh saachay vayparvaahay. My True Lord God is self-sufficient.
