RECORD	para 46168	mnmuKu BUlw Taur n pwey ] (1057-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) manmukh bhoolaa tha-ur na paa-ay. The confused, self-willed manmukhs find no place of rest.
DEFINE	para 46169	jo Duir iliKAw su krm kmwey ] (1057-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) jo Dhur likhi-aa so karam kamaa-ay. They do those deeds which they are pre-destined to do.
