RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v13	Imbued with poison, they search out poison, and suffer the pains of death and rebirth. ||13||
RECORD	para 46171	Awpy Awip Awip swlwhy ] (1057-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay aap aap saalaahay. He Himself praises Himself.
DEFINE	para 46172	qyry gux pRB quJ hI mwhy ] (1057-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) tayray gun parabh tujh hee maahay. Your Glorious Virtues are within You alone, God.
