RECORD	para 46174	ibnu gur dwqy koie n pwey ] (1057-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) bin gur daatay ko-ay na paa-ay. Without the Guru, the Giver, no one finds the Lord,
ALLOW	para 46175	lK kotI jy krm kmwey ] (1057-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) lakh kotee jay karam kamaa-ay. though one may make hundreds of thousands and millions of attempts.
