RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v6	ibnu siqgur syvy nwmu n pweIAY nwmu scw jig lwhw hy ]6] (1057-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) bin satgur sayvay naam na paa-ee-ai naam sachaa jag laahaa hay. ||6||
