DEFINE	para 46199	scw Amru sbid suhwieAw ] (1057-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) sachaa amar sabad suhaa-i-aa. True is His Will, beauteous and pleasing through the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	para 46200	pMc sbd imil vwjw vwieAw ] (1057-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) panch sabad mil vaajaa vaa-i-aa. The Panch Shabad, the five primal sounds, vibrate and resonate.
