RECORD	para 46209	rs ks Kwey ipMfu vDwey ] (1058-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) ras kas khaa-ay pind vaDhaa-ay. Eating tasty delicacies, he fattens up his body
RECORD	para 46210	ByK krY gur sbdu n kmwey ] (1058-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) bhaykh karai gur sabad na kamaa-ay. and wears religious robes, but he does not live to the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	AMqir rogu mhw duKu BwrI ibstw mwih smwhw hy ]10] (1058-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) antar rog mahaa dukh bhaaree bistaa maahi samaahaa hay. ||10||
