RECORD	para 46212	byd pVih piV bwdu vKwxih ] (1058-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) bayd parheh parh baad vakaaneh. He reads and studies the Vedas, and argues about them;
DEFINE	para 46213	Gt mih bRhmu iqsu sbid n pCwxih ] (1058-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) ghat meh barahm tis sabad na pachhaaneh. God is within his own heart, but he does not recognize the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v11	gurmuiK hovY su qqu iblovY rsnw hir rsu qwhw hy ]11] (1058-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh hovai so tat bilovai rasnaa har ras taahaa hay. ||11||
