RECORD	para 46218	mnmuK dyhI Brmu Bqwro ] (1058-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) manmukh dayhee bharam bhataaro. The self-willed manmukh has doubt as his spouse.
RECORD	para 46219	durmiq mrY inq hoie KuAwro ] (1058-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) durmat marai nit ho-ay khu-aaro. He dies of evil-mindedness, and suffers forever.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v13	kwim k®oiD mnu dUjY lwieAw supnY suKu n qwhw hy ]13] (1058-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) kaam kroDh man doojai laa-i-aa supnai sukh na taahaa hay. ||13||
