RECORD	para 46224	Awpy dyvY dyvxhwrw ] (1058-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay dayvai dayvanhaaraa. The Great Giver Himself gives.
RECORD	para 46225	iqsu AwgY nhI iksY kw cwrw ] (1058-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) tis aagai nahee kisai kaa chaaraa. No one has any power to stand against Him.
