RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v16	nwnk gurbwxI hir pwieAw hir jpu jwip smwhw hy ]16]5]14] (1058-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) naanak gurbaanee har paa-i-aa har jap jaap samaahaa hay. ||16||
