RECORD	para 46234	gurmuiK mnUAw aulit prwvY ] (1058-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh manoo-aa ulat paraavai. The mind of the Gurmukh turns away from the world.
RECORD	para 46235	gurmuiK bwxI nwdu vjwvY ] (1058-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh banee naad vajaavai. The Gurmukh vibrates the Naad, the sound current of the Guru's Bani.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v2	gurmuiK sic rqy bYrwgI inj Gir vwsw pwiedw ]2] (1058-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh sach ratay bairaagee nij ghar vaasaa paa-idaa. ||2||
