RECORD	para 46386	bwjIgir iek bwjI pweI ] (1061-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) baajeegar ik baajee paa-ee. The Juggler has staged His juggling show.
RECORD	para 46387	pUry gur qy ndrI AweI ] (1061-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) pooray gur tay nadree aa-ee. Through the Perfect Guru, one comes to behold it.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v3	sdw Ailpqu rhY gur sbdI swcy isau icqu lwiedw ]3] (1061-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) sadaa alipat rahai gur sabdee saachay si-o chit laa-idaa. ||3||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v3	One who remains forever detached in the Word of the Guru's Shabad - his consciousness is attuned to the True Lord. ||3||
RECORD	para 46389	bwjih bwjy Duin Awkwrw ] (1061-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) baajeh baajay Dhun aakaaraa. The musical instruments of the body vibrate and resound.
RECORD	para 46390	Awip vjwey vjwvxhwrw ] (1061-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) aap vajaa-ay vajaavanhaaraa. The Player Himself plays them.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v4	Git Git pauxu vhY iek rMgI imil pvxY sB vjwiedw ]4] (1061-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) ghat ghat pa-un vahai ik rangee mil pavnai sabh vajaa-idaa. ||4||
