RECORD	para 46393	krqw kry su inhcau hovY ] (1062-1, mwrU, mÚ 3) kartaa karay so nihcha-o hovai. Whatever the Creator does, surely comes to pass.
DEFINE	para 46394	gur kY sbdy haumY KovY ] (1062-1, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur kai sabday ha-umai khovai. Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, egotism is consumed.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v5	gur prswdI iksY dy vifAweI nwmo nwmu iDAwiedw ]5] (1062-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee kisai day vadi-aa-ee naamo naam Dhi-aa-idaa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v5	By Guru's Grace, some are blessed with glorious greatness; they meditate on the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||5||
DEFINE	para 46396	gur syvy jyvfu horu lwhw nwhI ] (1062-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur sayvay jayvad hor laahaa naahee. There is no other profit as great as service to the Guru.
RECORD	para 46397	nwmu mMin vsY nwmo swlwhI ] (1062-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) naam man vasai naamo saalaahee. The Naam abides within my mind, and I praise the Naam.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v6	nwmo nwmu sdw suKdwqw nwmo lwhw pwiedw ]6] (1062-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) naamo naam sadaa sukh-daata naamo laahaa paa-idaa. ||6||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v6	The Naam is forever the Giver of peace. Through the Naam, we earn the profit. ||6||
RECORD	para 46399	ibnu nwvY sB duKu sMswrw ] (1062-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) bin naavai sabh dukh sansaaraa. Without the Name, all the world suffers in misery.
RECORD	para 46400	bhu krm kmwvih vDih ivkwrw ] (1062-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) baho karam kamaaveh vaDheh vikaaraa. The more actions one does, the more the corruption increases.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v7	nwmu n syvih ikau suKu pweIAY ibnu nwvY duKu pwiedw ]7] (1062-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) naam na sayveh ki-o sukh paa-ee-ai bin naavai dukh paa-idaa. ||7||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v7	Without serving the Naam, how can anyone find peace? Without the Naam, one suffers in pain. ||7||
RECORD	para 46402	Awip kry qY Awip krwey ] (1062-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) aap karay tai aap karaa-ay. He Himself acts, and inspires all to act.
RECORD	para 46403	gur prswdI iksY buJwey ] (1062-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee kisai bujhaa-ay. By Guru's Grace, He reveals Himself to a few.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v8	gurmuiK hovih sy bMDn qoVih mukqI kY Gir pwiedw ]8] (1062-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh hoveh say banDhan torheh muktee kai ghar paa-idaa. ||8||
