RECORD	para 46405	gxq gxY so jlY sMswrw ] (1062-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) ganat ganai so jalai sansaaraa. One who calculates his accounts, burns in the world.
DEFINE	para 46406	shsw mUil n cukY ivkwrw ] (1062-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) sahsaa mool na chukai vikaaraa. His skepticism and corruption are never dispelled.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v9	gurmuiK hovY su gxq cukwey scy sic smwiedw ]9] (1062-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh hovai so ganat chukaa-ay sachay sach samaa-idaa. ||9||
