ALLOW	para 46408	jy scu dyie q pwey koeI ] (1062-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) jay sach day-ay ta paa-ay ko-ee. If God grants Truth, then we may attain it.
DEFINE	para 46409	gur prswdI prgtu hoeI ] (1062-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee pargat ho-ee. By Guru's Grace, it is revealed.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	scu nwmu swlwhy rMig rwqw gur ikrpw qy suKu pwiedw ]10] (1062-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) sach naam saalaahay rang raataa gur kirpaa tay sukh paa-idaa. ||10||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	One who praises the True Name, and remains imbued with the Lord's Love, by Guru's Grace, finds peace. ||10||
DEFINE	para 46411	jpu qpu sMjmu nwmu ipAwrw ] (1062-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) jap tap sanjam naam pi-aaraa. The Beloved Naam, the Name of the Lord, is chanting, meditation, penance and self- control.
RECORD	para 46412	iklivK kwty kwtxhwrw ] (1062-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) kilvikh kaatay kaatanhaaraa. God, the Destroyer, destroys sins.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v11	hir kY nwim qnu mnu sIqlu hoAw shjy shij smwiedw ]11] (1062-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) har kai naam tan man seetal ho-aa sehjay sahj samaa-idaa. ||11||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v11	Through the Name of the Lord, the body and mind are cooled and soothed, and one is intuitively, easily absorbed into the Celestial Lord. ||11||
DEFINE	para 46414	AMqir loBu min mYlY mlu lwey ] (1062-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) antar lobh man mailai mal laa-ay. With greed within them, their minds are filthy, and they spread filth around.
RECORD	para 46415	mYly krm kry duKu pwey ] (1062-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) mailay karam karay dukh paa-ay. They do filthy deeds, and suffer in pain.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v12	kUVo kUVu kry vwpwrw kUVu boil duKu pwiedw ]12] (1062-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) koorho koorh karay vaapaaraa koorh bol dukh paa-idaa. ||12||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v12	They deal in falsehood, and nothing but falsehood; telling lies, they suffer in pain. ||12||
DEFINE	para 46417	inrml bwxI ko mMin vswey ] (1062-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) nirmal banee ko man vasaa-ay. Rare is that person who enshrines the Immaculate Bani of the Guru's Word within his mind.
DEFINE	para 46418	gur prswdI shsw jwey ] (1062-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee sahsaa jaa-ay. By Guru's Grace, his skepticism is removed.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v13	gur kY BwxY clY idnu rwqI nwmu cyiq suKu pwiedw ]13] (1062-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur kai bhaanai chalai din raatee naam chayt sukh paa-idaa. ||13||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v13	He walks in harmony with the Guru's Will, day and night; remembering the Naam, the Name of the Lord, he finds peace. ||13||
DEFINE	para 46420	Awip isrMdw scw soeI ] (1062-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) aap sirandaa sachaa so-ee. The True Lord Himself is the Creator.
RECORD	para 46421	Awip aupwie Kpwey soeI ] (1062-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) aap upaa-ay khapaa-ay so-ee. He Himself creates and destroys.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v14	gurmuiK hovY su sdw slwhy imil swcy suKu pwiedw ]14] (1062-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh hovai so sadaa salaahay mil saachay sukh paa-idaa. ||14||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v14	One who becomes Gurmukh, praises the Lord forever. Meeting the True Lord, he finds peace. ||14||
DEFINE	para 46423	Anyk jqn kry ieMdRI vis n hoeI ] (1062-13, mwrU, mÚ 3) anayk jatan karay indree vas na ho-ee. Making countless efforts, sexual desire is not overcome.
DEFINE	para 46424	kwim kroiD jlY sBu koeI ] (1062-13, mwrU, mÚ 3) kaam karoDh jalai sabh ko-ee. Everyone is burning in the fires of sexuality and anger.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v15	siqgur syvy mnu vis AwvY mn mwry mnih smwiedw ]15] (1062-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur sayvay man vas aavai man maaray maneh samaa-idaa. ||15||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v15	Serving the True Guru, one brings his mind under control; conquering his mind, he merges in the Mind of God. ||15||
RECORD	para 46426	myrw qyrw quDu Awpy kIAw ] (1062-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) mayraa tayraa tuDh aapay kee-aa. You Yourself created the sense of 'mine' and 'yours.'
DEFINE	para 46427	siB qyry jMq qyry siB jIAw ] (1062-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) sabh tayray jant tayray sabh jee-aa. All creatures are Yours; You created all beings.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v16	nwnk nwmu smwil sdw qU gurmqI mMin vswiedw ]16]4]18] (1062-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) naanak naam samaal sadaa too gurmatee man vasaa-idaa. ||16||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v16	O Nanak, contemplate the Naam forever; through the Guru's Teachings, the Lord abides in the mind. ||16||
DEFINE	para 46430	hir jIau dwqw Agm AQwhw ] (1062-16, mwrU, mÚ 3) har jee-o daataa agam athaahaa. The Dear Lord is the Giver, inaccessible and unfathomable.
DEFINE	para 46431	Esu iqlu n qmwie vyprvwhw ] (1062-16, mwrU, mÚ 3) os til na tamaa-ay vayparvaahaa. He does not have even an iota of greed; He is self-sufficient.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v1	iqs no ApiV n skY koeI Awpy myil imlwiedw ]1] (1062-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) tis no aparh na sakai ko-ee aapay mayl milaa-idaa. ||1||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v1	No one can reach up to Him; He Himself unites in His Union. ||1||
RECORD	para 46433	jo ikCu krY su inhcau hoeI ] (1062-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) jo kichh karai so nihcha-o ho-ee. Whatever He does, surely comes to pass.
DEFINE	para 46434	iqsu ibnu dwqw Avru n koeI ] (1062-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) tis bin daataa avar na ko-ee. There is no other Giver, except for Him.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v2	ijs no nwm dwnu kry so pwey gur sbdI mylwiedw ]2] (1062-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) jis no naam daan karay so paa-ay gur sabdee maylaa-idaa. ||2||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v2	Whoever the Lord blesses with His gift, obtains it. Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, He unites him with Himself. ||2||
DEFINE	para 46436	caudh Bvx qyry htnwly ] (1062-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) cha-odah bhavan tayray hatnaalay. The fourteen worlds are Your markets.
RECORD	para 46437	siqguir idKwey AMqir nwly ] (1062-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur dikhaa-ay antar naalay. The True Guru reveals them, along with one's inner being.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v3	nwvY kw vwpwrI hovY gur sbdI ko pwiedw ]3] (1062-19, mwrU, mÚ 3) naavai kaa vaapaaree hovai gur sabdee ko paa-idaa. ||3||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v3	One who deals in the Name, through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, obtains it. ||3||
RECORD	para 46440	siqguir syivAY shj Anµdw ] (1063-1, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur sayvi-ai sahj anandaa. Serving the True Guru, one obtains intuitive bliss.
RECORD	para 46441	ihrdY Awie vuTw goivMdw ] (1063-1, mwrU, mÚ 3) hirdai aa-ay vuthaa govindaa. The Lord of the Universe comes to dwell within the heart.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v4	shjy Bgiq kry idnu rwqI Awpy Bgiq krwiedw ]4] (1063-1, mwrU, mÚ 3) sehjay bhagat karay din raatee aapay bhagat karaa-idaa. ||4||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v4	He intuitively practices devotional worship day and night; God Himself practices devotional worship. ||4||
DEFINE	para 46443	siqgur qy ivCuVy iqnI duKu pwieAw ] (1063-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur tay vichhurhay tinee dukh paa-i-aa. Those who are separated from the True Guru, suffer in misery.
DEFINE	para 46444	Anidnu mwrIAih duKu sbwieAw ] (1063-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) an-din maaree-ah dukh sabaa-i-aa. Night and day, they are punished, and they suffer in total agony.
