DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v5	Their faces are blackened, and they do not obtain the Mansion of the Lord's Presence. They suffer in sorrow and agony. ||5||
DEFINE	para 46446	siqguru syvih sy vfBwgI ] (1063-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur sayveh say vadbhaagee. Those who serve the True Guru are very fortunate.
RECORD	para 46447	shj Bwie scI ilv lwgI ] (1063-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) sahj bhaa-ay sachee liv laagee. They intuitively enshrine love for the True Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v6	sco scu kmwvih sd hI scY myil imlwiedw ]6] (1063-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) sacho sach kamaaveh sad hee sachai mayl milaa-idaa. ||6||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v6	They practice Truth, forever Truth; they are united in Union with the True Lord. ||6||
RECORD	para 46449	ijs no scw dyie su pwey ] (1063-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) jis no sachaa day-ay so paa-ay. He alone obtains the Truth, unto whom the True Lord gives it.
DEFINE	para 46450	AMqir swcu Brmu cukwey ] (1063-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) antar saach bharam chukaa-ay. His inner being is filled with Truth, and his doubt is dispelled.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v7	scu scY kw Awpy dwqw ijsu dyvY so scu pwiedw ]7] (1063-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) sach sachai kaa aapay daataa jis dayvai so sach paa-idaa. ||7||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v7	The True Lord Himself is the Giver of Truth; he alone obtains the Truth, unto whom He gives it. ||7||
DEFINE	para 46452	Awpy krqw sBnw kw soeI ] (1063-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay kartaa sabhnaa kaa so-ee. He Himself is the Creator of all.
RECORD	para 46453	ijs no Awip buJwey bUJY koeI ] (1063-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) jis no aap bujhaa-ay boojhai ko-ee. Only one whom He instructs, understands Him.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v8	Awpy bKsy dy vifAweI Awpy myil imlwiedw ]8] (1063-6, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay bakhsay day vadi-aa-ee aapay mayl milaa-idaa. ||8||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v8	He Himself forgives, and grants glorious greatness. He himself unites in His Union. ||8||
RECORD	para 46455	haumY kridAw jnmu gvwieAw ] (1063-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) ha-umai kardi-aa janam gavaa-i-aa. Acting egotistically, one loses his life.
RECORD	para 46456	AwgY mohu n cUkY mwieAw ] (1063-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) aagai moh na chookai maa-i-aa. Even in the world hereafter, emotioal attachment to Maya does not leave him.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v9	AgY jmkwlu lyKw lyvY ijau iql GwxI pIVwiedw ]9] (1063-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) agai jamkaal laykhaa layvai ji-o til ghaanee peerhaa-idaa. ||9||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v9	In the world hereafter, the Messenger of Death calls him to account, and crushes him like sesame seeds in the oil-press. ||9||
RECORD	para 46458	pUrY Bwig gur syvw hoeI ] (1063-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) poorai bhaag gur sayvaa ho-ee. By perfect destiny, one serves the Guru.
WHEN	para 46459	ndir kry qw syvy koeI ] (1063-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) nadar karay taa sayvay ko-ee. If God grants His Grace, then one serves.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	jmkwlu iqsu nyiV n AwvY mhil scY suKu pwiedw ]10] (1063-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) jamkaal tis nayrh na aavai mahal sachai sukh paa-idaa. ||10||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	The Messenger of Death cannot even approach him, and in the Mansion of the True Lord's Presence, he finds peace. ||10||
DEFINE	para 46461	iqn suKu pwieAw jo quDu Bwey ] (1063-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) tin sukh paa-i-aa jo tuDh bhaa-ay. They alone find peace, who are pleasing to Your Will.
DEFINE	para 46462	pUrY Bwig gur syvw lwey ] (1063-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) poorai bhaag gur sayvaa laa-ay. By perfect destiny, they are attached to the Guru's service.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v11	qyrY hiQ hY sB vifAweI ijsu dyvih so pwiedw ]11] (1063-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) tayrai hath hai sabh vadi-aa-ee jis dayveh so paa-idaa. ||11||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v11	All glorious greatness rests in Your Hands; he alone obtains it, unto whom You give it. ||11||
DEFINE	para 46464	AMdir prgwsu gurU qy pwey ] (1063-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) andar pargaas guroo tay paa-ay. Through the Guru, one's inner being is enlightened and illumined.
RECORD	para 46465	nwmu pdwrQu mMin vswey ] (1063-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) naam padaarath man vasaa-ay. The wealth of the Naam, the Name of the Lord, comes to dwell in the mind.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v12	igAwn rqnu sdw Git cwnxu AigAwn AMDyru gvwiedw ]12] (1063-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) gi-aan ratan sadaa ghat chaanan agi-aan anDhayr gavaa-idaa. ||12||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v12	The jewel of spiritual wisdom ever illumines the heart, and the darkness of spiritual ignorance is dispelled. ||12||
DEFINE	para 46467	AigAwnI AMDy dUjY lwgy ] (1063-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) agi-aanee anDhay doojai laagay. The blind and ignorant are attached to duality.
DEFINE	para 46468	ibnu pwxI fuib mUey ABwgy ] (1063-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) bin paanee dub moo-ay abhaagay. The unfortunates are drowned without water, and die.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v13	clidAw Gru dru ndir n AwvY jm dir bwDw duKu pwiedw ]13] (1063-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) chaldi-aa ghar dar nadar na aavai jam dar baaDhaa dukh paa-idaa. ||13||
