RECORD	para 46470	ibnu siqgur syvy mukiq n hoeI ] (1063-13, mwrU, mÚ 3) bin satgur sayvay mukat na ho-ee. Without serving the True Guru, no one finds liberation.
RECORD	para 46471	igAwnI iDAwnI pUChu koeI ] (1063-13, mwrU, mÚ 3) gi-aanee Dhi-aanee poochhahu ko-ee. Go ask any spiritual teacher or meditator.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v14	siqguru syvy iqsu imlY vifAweI dir scY soBw pwiedw ]14] (1063-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur sayvay tis milai vadi-aa-ee dar sachai sobhaa paa-idaa. ||14||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 3 v14	Whoever serves the True Guru is blessed with glorious greatness, and honored in the Court of the True Lord. ||14||
RECORD	para 46473	siqgur no syvy iqsu Awip imlwey ] (1063-14, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur no sayvay tis aap milaa-ay. One who serves the True Guru, the Lord merges into Himself.
RECORD	para 46474	mmqw kwit sic ilv lwey ] (1063-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) mamtaa kaat sach liv laa-ay. Cutting away attachment, one lovingly focuses on the True Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v15	sdw scu vxjih vwpwrI nwmo lwhw pwiedw ]15] (1063-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) sadaa sach vanjahi vaapaaree naamo laahaa paa-idaa. ||15||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v15	The merchants deal forever in Truth; they earn the profit of the Naam. ||15||
RECORD	para 46476	Awpy kry krwey krqw ] (1063-15, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay karay karaa-ay kartaa. The Creator Himself acts, and inspires all to act.
DEFINE	para 46477	sbid mrY soeI jnu mukqw ] (1063-16, mwrU, mÚ 3) sabad marai so-ee jan muktaa. He alone is liberated, who dies in the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v16	nwnk nwmu vsY mn AMqir nwmo nwmu iDAwiedw ]16]5]19] (1063-16, mwrU, mÚ 3) naanak naam vasai man antar naamo naam Dhi-aa-idaa. ||16||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v16	O Nanak, the Naam dwells deep within the mind; meditate on the Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||16||
DEFINE	para 46480	jo quDu krxw so kir pwieAw ] (1063-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) jo tuDh karnaa so kar paa-i-aa. Whatever You do, is done.
DEFINE	para 46481	Bwxy ivic ko ivrlw AwieAw ] (1063-17, mwrU, mÚ 3) bhaanay vich ko virlaa aa-i-aa. How rare are those who walk in harmony with the Lord's Will.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v1	Bwxw mMny so suKu pwey Bwxy ivic suKu pwiedw ]1] (1063-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) bhaanaa mannay so sukh paa-ay bhaanay vich sukh paa-idaa. ||1||
