DEFINE	para 46483	gurmuiK qyrw Bwxw BwvY ] (1063-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh tayraa bhaanaa bhaavai. Your Will is pleasing to the Gurmukh.
RECORD	para 46484	shjy hI suKu scu kmwvY ] (1063-18, mwrU, mÚ 3) sehjay hee sukh sach kamaavai. Practicing Truth, he intuitively finds peace.
