RECORD	para 46491	gurmuiK nwmu pdwrQu pwey ] (1064-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh naam padaarath paa-ay. The Gurmukh finds the treasure of the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v4	quDu AwpxY BwxY sB isRsit aupweI ijs no Bwxw dyih iqsu Bwiedw ]4] (1064-2, mwrU, mÚ 3) tuDh aapnai bhaanai sabh sarisat upaa-ee jis no bhaanaa deh tis bhaa-idaa. ||4||
