RECORD	para 46493	mnmuKu AMDu kry cqurweI ] (1064-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) manmukh anDh karay chaturaa-ee. The blind, self-willed manmukhs practice cleverness.
RECORD	para 46494	Bwxw n mMny bhuqu duKu pweI ] (1064-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) bhaanaa na mannay bahut dukh paa-ee. They do not surrender to the Lord's Will, and suffer terrible pain.
