RECORD	para 46496	siqguru myly dy vifAweI ] (1064-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur maylay day vadi-aa-ee. The True Guru brings Union, and grants glorious greatness.
RECORD	para 46497	siqgur kI syvw Duir PurmweI ] (1064-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) satgur kee sayvaa Dhur furmaa-ee. The Primal Lord ordained service to the True Guru.
