DEFINE	para 46508	nwim rqy iqn inrml dyhw ] (1064-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) naam ratay tin nirmal dayhaa. Those who are imbued with the Naam - their bodies are immaculate and pure.
DEFINE	para 46509	inrml hMsw sdw suKu nyhw ] (1064-9, mwrU, mÚ 3) nirmal hansaa sadaa sukh nayhaa. Their soul-swan is immaculate, and in the Lord's Love, they find eternal peace.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	nwmu slwih sdw suKu pwieAw inj Gir vwsw pwiedw ]10] (1064-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) naam salaahi sadaa sukh paa-i-aa nij ghar vaasaa paa-idaa. ||10||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v10	Praising the Naam, they find eternal peace, and dwell in the home of their own inner being. ||10||
RECORD	para 46511	sBu ko vxju kry vwpwrw ] (1064-10, mwrU, mÚ 3) sabh ko vanaj karay vaapaaraa. Everyone deals and trades.
RECORD	para 46512	ivxu nwvY sBu qotw sMswrw ] (1064-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) vin naavai sabh totaa sansaaraa. Without the Name, all the world loses.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v11	nwgo AwieAw nwgo jwsI ivxu nwvY duKu pwiedw ]11] (1064-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) naago aa-i-aa naago jaasee vin naavai dukh paa-idaa. ||11||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 3 v11	Naked they come, and naked they go; without the Name, they suffer in pain. ||11||
RECORD	para 46514	ijs no nwmu dyie so pwey ] (1064-11, mwrU, mÚ 3) jis no naam day-ay so paa-ay. He alone obtains the Naam, unto whom the Lord gives it.
RECORD	para 46515	gur kY sbid hir mMin vswey ] (1064-12, mwrU, mÚ 3) gur kai sabad har man vasaa-ay. Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, the Lord comes to dwell in the mind.
