RECORD	para 46730	<> siqgur pRswid ] (1069-4) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
DEFINE	para 46731	scw Awip svwrxhwrw ] (1069-5, mwrU, mÚ 4) sachaa aap savaaranhaaraa. The Lord Lord Himself is the One who exalts and embellishes.
RECORD	para 46732	Avr n sUJis bIjI kwrw ] (1069-5, mwrU, mÚ 4) avar na soojhas beejee kaaraa. Do not consider any other work.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v1	gurmuiK scu vsY Gt AMqir shjy sic smweI hy ]1] (1069-5, mwrU, mÚ 4) gurmukh sach vasai ghat antar sehjay sach samaa-ee hay. ||1||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v1	The True Lord abides deep within the heart of the Gurmukh, who intuitively merges in the True Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 46734	sBnw scu vsY mn mwhI ] (1069-6, mwrU, mÚ 4) sabhnaa sach vasai man maahee. The True Lord dwells within the minds of all.
