DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v2	Calling out, "Guru, Guru", I have found eternal peace; my consciousness is focused on the Guru's feet. ||2||
DEFINE	para 46737	siqguru hY igAwnu siqguru hY pUjw ] (1069-7, mwrU, mÚ 4) satgur hai gi-aan satgur hai poojaa. The True Guru is spiritual wisdom; the True Guru is worship and adoration.
RECORD	para 46738	siqguru syvI Avru n dUjw ] (1069-7, mwrU, mÚ 4) satgur sayvee avar na doojaa. I serve the True Guru, and no other.
