DEFINE	para 46743	gurmuiK pRIiq sdw hY swcI ] (1069-10, mwrU, mÚ 4) gurmukh pareet sadaa hai saachee. The love of the Gurmukh is forever true.
RECORD	para 46744	siqgur qy mwgau nwmu AjwcI ] (1069-10, mwrU, mÚ 4) satgur tay maaga-o naam ajaachee. I beg for the invaluable Naam, the Name of the Lord, from the Guru.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v5	hohu dieAwlu ik®pw kir hir jIau riK lyvhu gur srxweI hy ]5] (1069-10, mwrU, mÚ 4) hohu da-i-aal kirpaa kar har jee-o rakh layvhu gur sarnaa-ee hay. ||5||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v5	O Dear Lord, please be kind, and grant Your Grace; please keep me in the Guru's Sanctuary. ||5||
RECORD	para 46746	AMimRq rsu siqgurU cuAwieAw ] (1069-11, mwrU, mÚ 4) amrit ras satguroo chu-aa-i-aa. The True Guru trickles the Ambrosial Nectar into my mouth.
RECORD	para 46747	dsvY duAwir pRgtu hoie AwieAw ] (1069-11, mwrU, mÚ 4) dasvai du-aar pargat ho-ay aa-i-aa. My Tenth Gate has been opened and revealed.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v6	qh Anhd sbd vjih Duin bwxI shjy shij smweI hy ]6] (1069-12, mwrU, mÚ 4) tah anhad sabad vajeh Dhun banee sehjay sahj samaa-ee hay. ||6||
