DEFINE	para 46749	ijn kau krqY Duir iliK pweI ] (1069-12, mwrU, mÚ 4) jin ka-o kartai Dhur likh paa-ee. Those who are so pre-ordained by the Creator,
RECORD	para 46750	Anidnu guru guru krq ivhweI ] (1069-13, mwrU, mÚ 4) an-din gur gur karat vihaa-ee. pass their nights and days calling on the Guru.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v7	ibnu siqgur ko sIJY nwhI gur crxI icqu lweI hy ]7] (1069-13, mwrU, mÚ 4) bin satgur ko seejhai naahee gur charnee chit laa-ee hay. ||7||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v7	Without the True Guru, no one understands; focus your consciousness on the Guru's Feet. ||7||
DEFINE	para 46752	ijsu BwvY iqsu Awpy dyie ] (1069-14, mwrU, mÚ 4) jis bhaavai tis aapay day-ay. The Lord Himself blesses those with whom He is pleased.
RECORD	para 46753	gurmuiK nwmu pdwrQu lyie ] (1069-14, mwrU, mÚ 4) gurmukh naam padaarath lay-ay. The Gurmukh receives the wealth of the Naam.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v8	Awpy ik®pw kry nwmu dyvY nwnk nwim smweI hy ]8] (1069-14, mwrU, mÚ 4) aapay kirpaa karay naam dayvai naanak naam samaa-ee hay. ||8||
