DEFINE	para 46755	igAwn rqnu min prgtu BieAw ] (1069-15, mwrU, mÚ 4) gi-aan ratan man pargat bha-i-aa. The jewel of spiritual wisdom is revealed within the mind.
DEFINE	para 46756	nwmu pdwrQu shjy lieAw ] (1069-15, mwrU, mÚ 4) naam padaarath sehjay la-i-aa. The wealth of the Naam is easily, intuitively received.
