DEFINE	para 46758	pRgitAw sUru inis imitAw AMiDAwrw ] (1069-16, mwrU, mÚ 4) pargati-aa soor nis miti-aa anDhi-aaraa. With the rising of the sun, the darkness of the night is dispelled.
DEFINE	para 46759	AigAwnu imitAw gur rqin Apwrw ] (1069-17, mwrU, mÚ 4) agi-aan miti-aa gur ratan apaaraa. Spiritual ignorance is eradicated, by the priceless jewel of the Guru.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v10	siqgur igAwnu rqnu Aiq BwrI krim imlY suKu pweI hy ]10] (1069-17, mwrU, mÚ 4) satgur gi-aan ratan at bhaaree karam milai sukh paa-ee hay. ||10||
