RECORD	para 46765	shjy jwgY shjy sovY ] (1069-19, mwrU, mÚ 4) sehjay jaagai sehjay sovai. In intuitive peace he wakes, and in intuitive peace he sleeps.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v12	gurmuiK nwim smwie smwvY nwnk nwmu iDAweI hy ]12] (1070-1, mwrU, mÚ 4) gurmukh naam samaa-ay samaavai naanak naam Dhi-aa-ee hay. ||12||
