RECORD	para 46772	siqgur qy smJ pVI mn mwhI ] (1070-3, mwrU, mÚ 4) satgur tay samajh parhee man maahee. From the True Guru, I have obtained understanding in my mind.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 4 v14	hohu dieAwlu ik®pw kir hir jIau siqgur kI syvw lweI hy ]14] (1070-3, mwrU, mÚ 4) hohu da-i-aal kirpaa kar har jee-o satgur kee sayvaa laa-ee hay. ||14||
