DEFINE	para 46777	ijn kau Awid imlI vifAweI ] (1070-5, mwrU, mÚ 4) jin ka-o aad milee vadi-aa-ee. Those who are blessed with glorious greatness by the Primal Lord God
RECORD	para 46778	siqguru min visAw ilv lweI ] (1070-6, mwrU, mÚ 4) satgur man vasi-aa liv laa-ee. are lovingly focused on the True Guru, who dwells within their minds.
