DEFINE	para 46939	swcw qKqu scI pwiqswhI ] (1073-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) saachaa takhat sachee paatisaahee. True is His throne, and True is His kingdom.
DEFINE	para 46940	scu KjInw swcw swhI ] (1073-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) sach khajeenaa saachaa saahee. True is the treasure of the True Banker.
