RECORD	para 47021	gurmuiK nwmu pdwrQu lhIAY ] (1075-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) gurmukh naam padaarath lahee-ai. The Gurmukh receives the treasure of the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v3	ijsu Awip Bulwey soeI BUlY so bUJY ijsih buJwiedw ]3] (1075-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) jis aap bhulaa-ay so-ee bhoolai so boojhai jisahi bujhaa-idaa. ||3||
