DEFINE	para 47059	qU Awpy krqw kwrx krxw ] (1076-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) too aapay kartaa kaaran karnaa. You Yourself are the Creator Lord, the Cause of causes.
RECORD	para 47060	isRsit aupwie DrI sB Drxw ] (1076-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) sarisat upaa-ay Dharee sabh Dharnaa. You created the Universe, and You support the whole earth.
