DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v16	Servant Nanak seeks the Sanctuary of Your Door, O Lord; if it is Your Will, please preserve his honor. ||16||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 (1076-16)
RECORD	para 47063	<> siqgur pRswid ] (1076-16) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
DEFINE	para 47064	jo dIsY so eyko qUhY ] (1076-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) jo deesai so ayko toohai. Whatever is seen is You, O One Lord.
DEFINE	para 47065	bwxI qyrI sRvix suxIAY ] (1076-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) banee tayree sarvan sunee-ai. What the ears hear is the Word of Your Bani.
