DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v1	There is nothing else to be seen at all. You give support to all. ||1||
DEFINE	para 47067	Awip icqwry Apxw kIAw ] (1076-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) aap chitaaray apnaa kee-aa. You Yourself are conscious of Your Creation.
RECORD	para 47068	Awpy Awip Awip pRBu QIAw ] (1076-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) aapay aap aap parabh thee-aa. You Yourself established Yourself, O God.
