RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v2	Creating Yourself, You formed the expanse of the Universe; You Yourself cherish and sustain each and every heart. ||2||
RECORD	para 47070	ieik aupwey vf drvwrI ] (1076-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) ik upaa-ay vad darvaaree. You created some to hold great and royal courts.
RECORD	para 47071	ieik audwsI ieik Gr bwrI ] (1076-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) ik udaasee ik ghar baaree. Some turn away from the world in renunciation, and some maintain their households.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v3	ieik BUKy ieik iqRpiq AGwey sBsY qyrw pwrxw ]3] (1077-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) ik bhookhay ik taripat aghaa-ay sabhsai tayraa paarnaa. ||3||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v3	Some are hungry and some are satisfied and satiated, but all lean on Your Support. ||3||
DEFINE	para 47074	Awpy siq siq siq swcw ] (1077-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) aapay sat sat sat saachaa. The True Lord Himself is True, True, True.
DEFINE	para 47075	Eiq poiq Bgqn sMig rwcw ] (1077-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) ot pot bhagtan sang raachaa. He is woven into the essence of His devotees, through and through.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v4	Awpy gupqu Awpy hY prgtu Apxw Awpu pswrxw ]4] (1077-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) aapay gupat aapay hai pargat apnaa aap pasaarnaa. ||4||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v4	He Himself is hidden, and He Himself is revealed. He Himself spreads Himself out. ||4||
REQUIRE	para 47077	sdw sdw sd hovxhwrw ] (1077-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) sadaa sadaa sad hovanhaaraa. Forever, forever and ever, He shall always exist.
DEFINE	para 47078	aUcw Agmu AQwhu Apwrw ] (1077-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) oochaa agam athaahu apaaraa. He is lofty, inaccessible, unfathomable and infinite.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v5	aUxy Bry Bry Bir aUxy eyih clq suAwmI ky kwrxw ]5] (1077-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) oonay bharay bharay bhar oonay ayhi chalat su-aamee kay kaarnaa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v5	He fills the empty, and empties out the filled; such are the plays and dramas of my Lord and Master. ||5||
RECORD	para 47080	muiK swlwhI scy swhw ] (1077-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) mukh saalaahee sachay saahaa. With my mouth, I praise my True Lord King.
RECORD	para 47081	nYxI pyKw Agm AQwhw ] (1077-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) nainee paykhaa agam athaahaa. With my eyes, I behold the inaccessible and unfathomable Lord.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v6	krnI suix suix mnu qnu hirAw myry swihb sgl auDwrxw ]6] (1077-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) karnee sun sun man tan hari-aa mayray saahib sagal uDhaaranaa. ||6||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v6	Listening, listening with my ears, my mind and body are rejuvenated; my Lord and Master saves all. ||6||
RECORD	para 47083	kir kir vyKih kIqw Apxw ] (1077-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) kar kar vaykheh keetaa apnaa. He created the creation, and gazes upon what He has created.
RECORD	para 47084	jIA jMq soeI hY jpxw ] (1077-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) jee-a jant so-ee hai japnaa. All beings and creatures meditate on Him.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v7	ApxI kudriq Awpy jwxY ndrI ndir inhwlxw ]7] (1077-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) apnee kudrat aapay jaanai nadree nadar nihaalanaa. ||7||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v7	He Himself knows His creative power; He blesses with His Glance of Grace. ||7||
RECORD	para 47086	sMq sBw jh bYsih pRB pwsy ] (1077-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) sant sabhaa jah baiseh parabh paasay. Where the Saints gather together and sit, God dwells close at hand.
RECORD	para 47087	Anµd mMgl hir clq qmwsy ] (1077-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) anand mangal har chalat tamaasay. They abide in bliss and joy, beholding the Lord's wondrous play.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v8	gux gwvih Anhd Duin bwxI qh nwnk dwsu icqwrxw ]8] (1077-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) gun gaavahi anhad Dhun banee tah naanak daas chitaaranaa. ||8||
