DEFINE	para 47089	Awvxu jwxw sBu clqu qumwrw ] (1077-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) aavan jaanaa sabh chalat tumaaraa. Coming and going is all Your wondrous play.
RECORD	para 47090	kir kir dyKY Kylu Apwrw ] (1077-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) kar kar daykhai khayl apaaraa. Creating the Creation, You gaze upon Your infinite play.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v9	Awip aupwey aupwvxhwrw Apxw kIAw pwlxw ]9] (1077-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) aap upaa-ay upaavanhaaraa apnaa kee-aa paalnaa. ||9||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v9	Creating the Creation, You Yourself cherish and nurture it. ||9||
RECORD	para 47092	suix suix jIvw soie qumwrI ] (1077-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) sun sun jeevaa so-ay tumaaree. Listening, listening to Your Glory, I live.
RECORD	para 47093	sdw sdw jweI bilhwrI ] (1077-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) sadaa sadaa jaa-ee balihaaree. Forever and ever, I am a sacrifice to You.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v10	duie kr joiV ismrau idnu rwqI myry suAwmI Agm Apwrxw ]10] (1077-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) du-ay kar jorh simra-o din raatee mayray su-aamee agam apaaranaa. ||10||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v10	With my palms pressed together, I meditate in remembrance on You, day and night, O my inaccessible, infinite Lord and Master. ||10||
RECORD	para 47095	quDu ibnu dUjy iksu swlwhI ] (1077-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) tuDh bin doojay kis saalaahee. Other than You, who else should I praise?
RECORD	para 47096	eyko eyku jpI mn mwhI ] (1077-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) ayko ayk japee man maahee. I meditate on the One and Only Lord within my mind.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v11	hukmu bUiJ jn Bey inhwlw ieh Bgqw kI Gwlxw ]11] (1077-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) hukam boojh jan bha-ay nihaalaa ih bhagtaa kee ghaalnaa. ||11||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v11	Realizing the Hukam of Your Will, Your humble servants are enraptured; this is the achievement of Your devotees. ||11||
RECORD	para 47098	gur aupdyis jpIAY min swcw ] (1077-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur updays japee-ai man saachaa. Following the Guru's Teachings, I meditate on the True Lord within my mind.
RECORD	para 47099	gur aupdyis rwm rMig rwcw ] (1077-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur updays raam rang raachaa. Following the Guru's Teachings, I am immersed in the Lord's Love.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v12	gur aupdyis qutih siB bMDn iehu Brmu mohu prjwlxw ]12] (1077-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur updays tuteh sabh banDhan ih bharam moh parjaalanaa. ||12||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v12	Following the Guru's Teachings, all bonds are broken, and this doubt and emotional attachment are burnt away. ||12||
DEFINE	para 47101	jh rwKY soeI suK Qwnw ] (1077-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) jah raakhai so-ee sukh thaanaa. Wherever He keeps me, is my place of rest.
RECORD	para 47102	shjy hoie soeI Bl mwnw ] (1077-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) sehjay ho-ay so-ee bhal maanaa. Whatever naturally happens, I accept that as good.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v13	ibnsy bYr nwhI ko bYrI sBu eyko hY Bwlxw ]13] (1077-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) binsay bair naahee ko bairee sabh ayko hai bhaalnaa. ||13||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v13	Hatred is gone - I have no hatred at all; I see the One Lord in all. ||13||
RECORD	para 47104	fr cUky ibnsy AMiDAwry ] (1077-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) dar chookay binsay anDhi-aaray. Fear has been removed, and darkness has been dispelled.
RECORD	para 47105	pRgt Bey pRB purK inrwry ] (1077-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) pargat bha-ay parabh purakh niraaray. The all-powerful, primal, detached Lord God has been revealed.
WHEN	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v14	Awpu Coif pey srxweI ijs kw sw iqsu Gwlxw ]14] (1077-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) aap chhod pa-ay sarnaa-ee jis kaa saa tis ghaalnaa. ||14||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v14	Forsaking self-conceit, I have entered His Sanctuary, and I work for Him. ||14||
DEFINE	para 47107	AYsw ko vfBwgI AwieAw ] (1077-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) aisaa ko vadbhaagee aa-i-aa. Rare are those few, very blessed people, who come into the world,
RECORD	para 47108	AwT phr ijin Ksmu iDAwieAw ] (1077-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) aath pahar jin khasam Dhi-aa-i-aa. and meditate on their Lord and Master, twenty-four hours a day.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v15	iqsu jn kY sMig qrY sBu koeI so prvwr sDwrxw ]15] (1077-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) tis jan kai sang tarai sabh ko-ee so parvaar saDhaaranaa. ||15||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v15	Associating with such humble people, all are saved, and their families are saved as well. ||15||
DEFINE	para 47110	ieh bKsIs Ksm qy pwvw ] (1077-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) ih bakhsees khasam tay paavaa. This is the blessing which I have received from my Lord and Master.
RECORD	para 47111	AwT phr kr joiV iDAwvw ] (1077-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) aath pahar kar jorh Dhi-aavaa. Twenty-four hours a day, with my palms pressed together, I meditate on Him.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v16	nwmu jpI nwim shij smwvw nwmu nwnk imlY aucwrxw ]16]1]6] (1077-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) naam japee naam sahj samaavaa naam naanak milai uchaaranaa. ||16||
