RECORD	para 47117	gur pUry kI pau srxweI ] (1077-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur pooray kee pa-o sarnaa-ee. Seek the Sanctuary of the Perfect Guru.
REQUIRE	para 47118	mohu sogu sBu Brmu imtweI ] (1077-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) moh sog sabh bharam mitaa-ee. He shall eradicate all emotional attachment, sorrow and doubt.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	eyko mMqRü idRVwey AauKDu scu nwmu ird gwiexw ]2] (1077-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) ayko mantar drirh-aa-ay a-ukhaDh sach naam rid gaa-inaa. ||2||
