RECORD	para 47121	ijsu nwmY kau qrsih bhu dyvw ] (1078-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) jis naamai ka-o tarseh baho dayvaa. So many gods yearn for the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	para 47122	sgl Bgq jw kI krdy syvw ] (1078-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) sagal bhagat jaa kee karday sayvaa. All the devotees serve Him.
