RECORD	para 47125	iqRBvx DwvY qw ikCU n bUJY ] (1078-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) taribhavan Dhaavai taa kichhoo na boojhai. One who wanders through the three worlds, understands nothing.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	siqguru swhu BMfwru nwmu ijsu iehu rqnu iqsY qy pwiexw ]4] (1078-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) satgur saahu bhandaar naam jis ih ratan tisai tay paa-inaa. ||4||
