RECORD	para 47127	jw kI DUir kry punIqw ] (1078-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) jaa kee Dhoor karay puneetaa. The dust of His feet purifies.
RECORD	para 47128	suir nr dyv n pwvih mIqw ] (1078-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) sur nar dayv na paavahi meetaa. Even the angelic beings and gods cannot obtain it, O friend.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	siq purKu siqguru prmysru ijsu Bytq pwir prwiexw ]5] (1078-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) sat purakh satgur parmaysar jis bhaytat paar paraa-inaa. ||5||
