WHEN	para 47130	pwrjwqu loVih mn ipAwry ] (1078-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) paarjaat lorheh man pi-aaray. O my beloved mind, if you wish for the 'tree of life';
WHEN	para 47131	kwmDynu sohI drbwry ] (1078-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaamDhayn sohee darbaaray. if you wish for Kaamadhayna, the wish-fulfilling cow to adorn your court;
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	iqRpiq sMqoKu syvw gur pUry nwmu kmwie rswiexw ]6] (1078-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) taripat santokh sayvaa gur pooray naam kamaa-ay rasaa-inaa. ||6||
