REQUIRE	para 47134	BY pwrbRhm hovih inrmlw qU ] (1078-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) bhai paarbarahm hoveh nirmalaa too. In the Fear of the Supreme Lord God, you shall become immaculate and pure.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	pwrsu jb BytY guru pUrw qw pwrsu pris idKwiexw ]7] (1078-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) paaras jab bhaytai gur pooraa taa paaras paras dikhaa-inaa. ||7||
WHEN	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	When one meets the Perfect Guru, the Philosopher's Stone, His touch reveals the Lord, the Philosopher's Stone. ||7||
RECORD	para 47136	keI bYkuMT nwhI lvY lwgy ] (1078-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) ka-ee baikunth naahee lavai laagay. Myriads of heavens do not equal the Lord's Name.
RECORD	para 47137	mukiq bpuVI BI igAwnI iqAwgy ] (1078-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) mukat bapurhee bhee gi-aanee ti-aagay. The spiritually wise forsake mere liberation.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	eykMkwru siqgur qy pweIAY hau bil bil gur drswiexw ]8] (1078-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) aykankaar satgur tay paa-ee-ai ha-o bal bal gur darsaa-inaa. ||8||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	The One Universal Creator Lord is found through the True Guru. I am a sacrifice, a sacrifice to the Blessed Vision of the Guru's Darshan. ||8||
RECORD	para 47139	gur kI syv n jwxY koeI ] (1078-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur kee sayv na jaanai ko-ee. No one knows how to serve the Guru.
DEFINE	para 47140	guru pwrbRhmu Agocru soeI ] (1078-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur paarbarahm agochar so-ee. The Guru is the unfathomable, Supreme Lord God.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	ijs no lwie ley so syvku ijsu vfBwg mQwiexw ]9] (1078-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) jis no laa-ay la-ay so sayvak jis vadbhaag mathaa-inaa. ||9||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	He alone is the Guru's servant, whom the Guru Himself links to His service, and upon whose forehead such blessed destiny is inscribed. ||9||
RECORD	para 47142	gur kI mihmw byd n jwxih ] (1078-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur kee mahimaa bayd na jaaneh. Even the Vedas do not know the Guru's Glory.
DEFINE	para 47143	quC mwq suix suix vKwxih ] (1078-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) tuchh maat sun sun vakaaneh. They narrate only a tiny bit of what is heard.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	pwrbRhm AprMpr siqgur ijsu ismrq mnu sIqlwiexw ]10] (1078-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) paarbarahm aprampar satgur jis simrat man seetlaa-inaa. ||10||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	The True Guru is the Supreme Lord God, the Incomparable One; meditating in remembrance on Him, the mind is cooled and soothed. ||10||
RECORD	para 47145	jw kI soie suxI mnu jIvY ] (1078-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) jaa kee so-ay sunee man jeevai. Hearing of Him, the mind comes to life.
