RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	guru muKhu Alwey qw soBw pwey iqsu jm kY pMiQ n pwiexw ]11] (1078-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur mukhahu alaa-ay taa sobhaa paa-ay tis jam kai panth na paa-inaa. ||11||
