RECORD	para 47178	ismrih nr nwrI Awsrmw ] (1079-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) simrahi nar naaree aasramaa. Men and women, throughout the four stages of life, meditate in remembrance on You.
RECORD	para 47179	ismrih jwiq joiq siB vrnw ] (1079-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) simrahi jaat jot sabh varnaa. All social classes and souls of all races meditate in remembrance on You.
