RECORD	para 47181	ismrih GVI mUrq pl inmKw ] (1079-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) simrahi gharhee moorat pal nimkhaa. Hours, minutes and seconds meditate in remembrance.
RECORD	para 47182	ismrY kwlu Akwlu suic socw ] (1079-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) simrai kaal akaal such sochaa. Death and life, and thoughts of purification, meditate in remembrance.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v7	ismrih saux swsqR sMjogw AlKu n lKIAY ieku iKnw ]7] (1079-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) simrahi sa-un saastar sanjogaa alakh na lakhee-ai ik khinaa. ||7||
