DEFINE	para 47184	krn krwvnhwr suAwmI ] (1079-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) karan karaavanhaar su-aamee. The Lord and Master is the Doer, the Cause of causes.
DEFINE	para 47185	sgl Gtw ky AMqrjwmI ] (1079-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) sagal ghataa kay antarjaamee. He is the Inner-knower, the Searcher of all hearts.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v8	kir ikrpw ijsu BgqI lwvhu jnmu pdwrQu so ijnw ]8] (1079-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) kar kirpaa jis bhagtee laavhu janam padaarath so jinaa. ||8||
