RECORD	para 47187	jw kY min vUTw pRBu Apnw ] (1079-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) jaa kai man voothaa parabh apnaa. He, within whose mind God dwells,
RECORD	para 47188	pUrY krim gur kw jpu jpnw ] (1079-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) poorai karam gur kaa jap japnaa. has perfect karma, and chants the Chant of the Guru.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v9	srb inrMqir so pRBu jwqw bhuiV n jonI Brim runw ]9] (1079-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) sarab nirantar so parabh jaataa bahurh na jonee bharam runaa. ||9||
