RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v10	sUK shj Awnµd nwm rsu Anhd bwxI shj Dunw ]10] (1079-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) sookh sahj aanand naam ras anhad banee sahj Dhunaa. ||10||
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v10	Intuitive peace, poise and bliss come from the sublime essence of the Naam; the unstruck sound current of the Guru's Bani intuitively vibrates and resounds. ||10||
DEFINE	para 47192	so DnvMqw ijin pRBu iDAwieAw ] (1079-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) so Dhanvantaa jin parabh Dhi-aa-i-aa. He alone is wealthy, who meditates on God.
DEFINE	para 47193	so piqvMqw ijin swDsMgu pwieAw ] (1079-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) so pativantaa jin saaDhsang paa-i-aa. He alone is honorable, who joins the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v11	pwrbRhmu jw kY min vUTw so pUr krMmw nw iCnw ]11] (1079-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) paarbarahm jaa kai man voothaa so poor karammaa naa chhinaa. ||11||
