DEFINE	para 47195	jil Qil mhIAil suAwmI soeI ] (1079-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) jal thal mahee-al su-aamee so-ee. The Lord and Master is pervading the water, land and sky.
DEFINE	para 47196	Avru n khIAY dUjw koeI ] (1079-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) avar na kahee-ai doojaa ko-ee. There is no other said to be so.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v12	gur igAwn AMjin kwitE BRmu sglw Avru n dIsY eyk ibnw ]12] (1079-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur gi-aan anjan kaati-o bharam saglaa avar na deesai ayk binaa. ||12||
