DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v16	Says Nanak, those humble beings are exalted, who are pleasing to Your Mind, O my Lord and Master. ||16||
DEFINE	para 47211	pRB smrQ srb suK dwnw ] (1080-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) parabh samrath sarab sukh daanaa. God is the almighty Giver of all peace and joy.
