DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	The chronic diseases are cured by the medicine of the Lord's Name; I beg to be imbued with the Immaculate Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 47217	sRvxI suxau ibml jsu suAwmI ] (1080-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) sarvanee suna-o bimal jas su-aamee. With my ears, I listen to the Pure Praises of my Lord and Master.
RECORD	para 47218	eykw Et qjau ibKu kwmI ] (1080-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) aykaa ot taja-o bikh kaamee. With the Support of the One Lord, I have abandoned corruption, sexuality and desire.
