RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	I humbly bow and fall at the feet of Your slaves; I do not hesitate to do good deeds. ||3||
RECORD	para 47220	rsnw gux gwvY hir qyry ] (1080-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) rasnaa gun gaavai har tayray. O Lord, with my tongue I sing Your Glorious Praises.
DEFINE	para 47221	imtih kmwqy Avgux myry ] (1080-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) miteh kamaatay avgun mayray. The sins which I have committed are erased.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	ismir ismir suAwmI mnu jIvY pMc dUq qij qMgnw ]4] (1080-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) simar simar su-aamee man jeevai panch doot taj tangnaa. ||4||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	Meditating, meditating in remembrance on my Lord and Master, my mind lives; I am rid of the five oppressive demons. ||4||
RECORD	para 47223	crn kml jip boihiQ crIAY ] (1080-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) charan kamal jap bohith charee-ai. Meditating on Your lotus feet, I have come aboard Your boat.
RECORD	para 47224	sMqsMig imil swgru qrIAY ] (1080-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) satsang mil saagar taree-ai. Joining the Society of the Saints, I cross over the world-ocean.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	Arcw bMdn hir smq invwsI bwhuiV join n nµgnw ]5] (1080-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) archaa bandan har samat nivaasee baahurh jon na nangnaa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	My flower-offering and worship is to realize that the Lord is dwelling alike in all; I shall not be reincarnated naked again. ||5||
RECORD	para 47226	dws dwsn ko kir lyhu guopwlw ] (1080-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) daas daasan ko kar layho gopaalaa. Please make me the slave of Your slaves, O Lord of the world.
DEFINE	para 47227	ik®pw inDwn dIn dieAwlw ] (1080-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) kirpaa niDhaan deen da-i-aalaa. You are the treasure of Grace, merciful to the meek.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	sKw shweI pUrn prmysur imlu kdy n hovI BMgnw ]6] (1080-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) sakhaa sahaa-ee pooran parmaysur mil kaday na hovee bhangnaa. ||6||
