RECORD	para 47235	jq kq pyKau pRB suK swgr ] (1080-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) jat kat paykha-o parabh sukh saagar. Wherever I look, there I see God, the ocean of peace.
DEFINE	para 47236	hir qoit BMfwr nwhI rqnwgr ] (1080-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) har tot bhandaar naahee ratnaagar. The Lord's treasure is never exhausted; He is the storehouse of jewels.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	Agh Agwh ikCu imiq nhI pweIAY so bUJY ijsu ikrpMgnw ]9] (1080-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) agah agaah kichh mit nahee paa-ee-ai so boojhai jis kirpangnaa. ||9||
