DEFINE	para 47238	CwqI sIql mnu qnu TMFw ] (1080-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) chhaatee seetal man tan thandhaa. My heart is cooled, and my mind and body are calmed and soothed.
DEFINE	para 47239	jnm mrx kI imtvI fMJw ] (1080-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) janam maran kee mitvee danjhaa. The craving for birth and death is quenched.
