UPHOLD	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	Grasping hold of my hand, He has lifted me up and out; He has blessed me with His Ambrosial Glance of Grace. ||10||
DEFINE	para 47241	eyko eyku rivAw sB TweI ] (1080-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) ayko ayk ravi-aa sabh thaa-ee. The One and Only Lord is permeating and pervading everywhere.
DEFINE	para 47242	iqsu ibnu dUjw koeI nwhI ] (1080-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) tis bin doojaa ko-ee naahee. There is none other than Him at all.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	Awid miD AMiq pRBu rivAw iqRsn buJI BrmMgnw ]11] (1080-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) aad maDh ant parabh ravi-aa tarisan bujhee bharmangnaa. ||11||
