DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v7	By His Hukam, one is shallow, and by His Hukam, one is wise. There is no other side except His. ||7||
RECORD	para 47283	swgru kInw Aiq qum Bwrw ] (1081-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) saagar keenaa at tum bhaaraa. You made the ocean vast and huge.
RECORD	para 47284	ieik KVy rswqil kir mnmuK gwvwrw ] (1081-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) ik kharhay rasaatal kar manmukh gaavaaraa. You made some into foolish self-willed manmukhs, and dragged them into hell.
