DEFINE	para 47289	vfw swihbu vfI nweI ] (1081-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) vadaa saahib vadee naa-ee. Great is the Lord and Master, and Great is His Name.
DEFINE	para 47290	vf dwqwru vfI ijsu jweI ] (1081-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) vad daataar vadee jis jaa-ee. He is the Great Giver; Great is His place.
