DEFINE	para 47306	khu nwnk byAMq gusweI ] (1082-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaho naanak bay-ant gusaa-ee. Says Nanak, the Lord of the world is infinite.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v15	Awid miD AMiq pRBu soeI hwiQ iqsY kY nybyVw ]15] (1082-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) aad maDh ant parabh so-ee haath tisai kai naybayrhaa. ||15||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v15	In the beginning, in the middle and in the end, God exists. Judgement is in His Hands alone. ||15||
DEFINE	para 47308	iqsih srIku nwhI ry koeI ] (1082-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) tiseh sareek naahee ray ko-ee. No one is equal to Him.
RECORD	para 47309	iks hI buqY jbwbu n hoeI ] (1082-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) kis hee butai jabaab na ho-ee. No one can stand up against Him by any means.
RECORD	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v16	nwnk kw pRBu Awpy Awpy kir kir vyKY coj KVw ]16]1]10] (1082-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak kaa parabh aapay aapay kar kar vaykhai choj kharhaa. ||16||
DEFINE	mwrU solhy mhlw 5 v16	Nanak's God is Himself all-in-all. He creates and stages and watches His wondrous plays. ||16||
DEFINE	para 47312	Acuq pwrbRhm prmysur AMqrjwmI ] (1082-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) achut paarbarahm parmaysur antarjaamee. The Supreme Lord God is imperishable, the Transcendent Lord, the Inner-knower, the Searcher of hearts.
DEFINE	para 47313	mDusUdn dwmodr suAwmI ] (1082-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) maDhusoodan daamodar su-aamee. He is the Slayer of demons, our Supreme Lord and Master.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	irKIkys govrDn DwrI murlI mnohr hir rMgw ]1] (1082-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) rikheekays govarDhan Dhaaree murlee manohar har rangaa. ||1||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	The Supreme Rishi, the Master of the sensory organs, the uplifter of mountains, the joyful Lord playing His enticing flute. ||1||
RECORD	para 47315	mohn mwDv ik®s˜ murwry ] (1082-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) mohan maaDhav krisan muraaray. The Enticer of Hearts, the Lord of wealth, Krishna, the Enemy of ego.
RECORD	para 47316	jgdIsur hir jIau Asur sMGwry ] (1082-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) jagdeesur har jee-o asur sanghaaray. The Lord of the Universe, the Dear Lord, the Destroyer of demons.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	jgjIvn AibnwsI Twkur Gt Gt vwsI hY sMgw ]2] (1082-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) jagjeevan abhinaasee thaakur ghat ghat vaasee hai sangaa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	The Life of the World, our eternal and ever-stable Lord and Master dwells within each and every heart, and is always with us. ||2||
RECORD	para 47318	DrxIDr eIs nrisMG nwrwiex ] (1082-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) DharneeDhar ees narsingh naaraa-in. The Support of the Earth, the man-lion, the Supreme Lord God.
RECORD	para 47319	dwVw AgRy ipRQim Drwiex ] (1082-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) daarhaa agray paritham Dharaa-in. The Protector who tears apart demons with His teeth, the Upholder of the earth.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	bwvn rUpu kIAw quDu krqy sB hI syqI hY cMgw ]3] (1082-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) baavan roop kee-aa tuDh kartay sabh hee saytee hai changa. ||3||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	O Creator, You assumed the form of the pygmy to humble the demons; You are the Lord God of all. ||3||
DEFINE	para 47321	sRI rwmcMd ijsu rUpu n ryiKAw ] (1082-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) saree raamchand jis roop na raykh-i-aa. You are the Great Raam Chand, who has no form or feature.
DEFINE	para 47322	bnvwlI ck®pwix dris AnUipAw ] (1082-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) banvaalee chakarpaan daras anoopi-aa. Adorned with flowers, holding the chakra in Your hand, Your form is incomparably beautiful.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	shs nyqR mUriq hY shsw ieku dwqw sB hY mMgw ]4] (1082-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) sahas naytar moorat hai sahsaa ik daataa sabh hai mangaa. ||4||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	You have thousands of eyes, and thousands of forms. You alone are the Giver, and all are beggars of You. ||4||
DEFINE	para 47324	Bgiq vClu AnwQh nwQy ] (1082-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) bhagat vachhal anaathah naathay. You are the Lover of Your devotees, the Master of the masterless.
DEFINE	para 47325	gopI nwQu sgl hY swQy ] (1082-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) gopee naath sagal hai saathay. The Lord and Master of the milk-maids, You are the companion of all.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	bwsudyv inrMjn dwqy brin n swkau gux AMgw ]5] (1082-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) baasudayv niranjan daatay baran na saaka-o gun angaa. ||5||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	O Lord, Immacuate Great Giver, I cannot describe even an iota of Your Glorious Virtues. ||5||
RECORD	para 47327	mukMd mnohr lKmI nwrwiex ] (1082-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) mukand manohar lakhmee naaraa-in. Liberator, Enticing Lord, Lord of Lakshmi, Supreme Lord God.
RECORD	para 47328	dRopqI ljw invwir auDwrx ] (1082-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) daropatee lajaa nivaar uDhaaran. Savior of Dropadi's honor.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	kmlwkMq krih kMqUhl And ibnodI inhsMgw ]6] (1082-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) kamlaakant karahi kantoohal anad binodee nihsangaa. ||6||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	Lord of Maya, miracle-worker, absorbed in delightful play, unattached. ||6||
DEFINE	para 47330	AmoG drsn AwjUnI sMBau ] (1082-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) amogh darsan aajoonee sambha-o. The Blessed Vision of His Darshan is fruitful and rewarding; He is not born, He is self- existent.
DEFINE	para 47331	Akwl mUriq ijsu kdy nwhI Kau ] (1082-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) akaal moorat jis kaday naahee kha-o. His form is undying; it is never destroyed.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	AibnwsI Aibgq Agocr sBu ikCu quJ hI hY lgw ]7] (1082-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) abhinaasee abigat agochar sabh kichh tujh hee hai lagaa. ||7||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	O imperishable, eternal, unfathomable Lord, everything is attached to You. ||7||
RECORD	para 47333	sRIrMg bYkuMT ky vwsI ] (1082-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) sareerang baikunth kay vaasee. The Lover of greatness, who dwells in heaven.
RECORD	para 47334	mCu kCu kUrmu AwigAw AauqrwsI ] (1082-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) machh kachh kooram aagi-aa a-utraasee. By the Pleasure of His Will, He took incarnation as the great fish and the tortoise.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	kysv clq krih inrwly kIqw loVih so hoiegw ]8] (1082-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaysav chalat karahi niraalay keetaa lorheh so ho-igaa. ||8||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	The Lord of beauteous hair, the Worker of miraculous deeds, whatever He wishes, comes to pass. ||8||
DEFINE	para 47336	inrwhwrI inrvYru smwieAw ] (1082-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) niraahaaree nirvair samaa-i-aa. He is beyond need of any sustenance, free of hate and all-pervading.
DEFINE	para 47337	Dwir Kylu cqurBuju khwieAw ] (1082-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) Dhaar khayl chaturbhuj kahaa-i-aa. He has staged His play; He is called the four-armed Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	swvl suMdr rUp bxwvih byxu sunq sB mohYgw ]9] (1082-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) saaval sundar roop banaaveh bayn sunat sabh mohaigaa. ||9||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	He assumed the beautiful form of the blue-skinned Krishna; hearing His flute, all are fascinated and enticed. ||9||
DEFINE	para 47339	bnmwlw ibBUKn kml nYn ] (1082-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) banmaalaa bibhookhan kamal nain. He is adorned with garlands of flowers, with lotus eyes.
DEFINE	para 47340	suMdr kuMfl mukt bYn ] (1082-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) sundar kundal mukat bain. His ear-rings, crown and flute are so beautiful.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	sMK ck® gdw hY DwrI mhw swrQI sqsMgw ]10] (1082-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) sankh chakar gadaa hai Dhaaree mahaa saarthee satsangaa. ||10||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	He carries the conch, the chakra and the war club; He is the Great Charioteer, who stays with His Saints. ||10||
RECORD	para 47342	pIq pIqMbr iqRBvx DxI ] (1082-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) peet peetambar taribhavan Dhanee. The Lord of yellow robes, the Master of the three worlds.
RECORD	para 47343	jgMnwQu gopwlu muiK BxI ] (1082-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) jagannaath gopaal mukh bhanee. The Lord of the Universe, the Lord of the world; with my mouth, I chant His Name.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	swirMgDr Bgvwn bITulw mY gxq n AwvY srbMgw ]11] (1082-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) saaringDhar bhagvaan beethulaa mai ganat na aavai sarbangaa. ||11||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	The Archer who draws the bow, the Beloved Lord God; I cannot count all His limbs. ||11||
DEFINE	para 47345	inhkMtku inhkyvlu khIAY ] (1082-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) nihkantak nihkayval kahee-ai. He is said to be free of anguish, and absolutely immaculate.
RECORD	para 47346	DnµjY jil Qil hY mhIAY ] (1082-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) Dhananjai jal thal hai mahee-ai. The Lord of prosperity, pervading the water, the land and the sky.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v12	imrq lok pieAwl smIpq AsiQr Qwnu ijsu hY ABgw ]12] (1083-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) mirat lok pa-i-aal sameepat asthir thaan jis hai abhgaa. ||12||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v12	He is near this world and the nether regions of the underworld; His Place is permanent, ever-stable and imperishable. ||12||
RECORD	para 47349	piqq pwvn duK BY BMjnu ] (1083-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) patit paavan dukh bhai bhanjan. The Purifier of sinners, the Destroyer of pain and fear.
RECORD	para 47350	AhMkwr invwrxu hY Bv KMfnu ] (1083-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) aha Nkaar nivaaran hai bhav khandan. The Eliminator of egotism, the Eradicator of coming and going.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v13	BgqI qoiKq dIn ik®pwlw guxy n ikq hI hY iBgw ]13] (1083-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) bhagtee tokhit deen kirpaalaa gunay na kit hee hai bhigaa. ||13||
