DEFINE	para 47352	inrMkwru ACl Afolo ] (1083-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) nirankaar achhal adolo. The Formless Lord is undeceivable and unchanging.
DEFINE	para 47353	joiq srUpI sBu jgu maulo ] (1083-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) jot saroopee sabh jag ma-ulo. He is the Embodiment of Light; through Him, the whole world blossoms forth.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v14	so imlY ijsu Awip imlwey Awphu koie n pwvYgw ]14] (1083-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) so milai jis aap milaa-ay aaphu ko-ay na paavaigaa. ||14||
