RECORD	para 47356	Awpy gaU crwvY bwnw ] (1083-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) aapay ga-oo charaavai baanaa. He Himself grazes the cows in the forest.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v15	Awip aupwvih Awip Kpwvih quDu lypu nhI ieku iqlu rMgw ]15] (1083-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) aap upaaveh aap khapaaveh tuDh layp nahee ik til rangaa. ||15||
