RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v16	nvqn nwm jpY idnu rwqI ieku guxu nwhI pRB kih sMgw ]16] (1083-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) navtan naam japai din raatee ik gun naahee parabh kahi sangaa. ||16||
