DEFINE	para 47364	idRsitmwn hY sgl imQynw ] (1083-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) daristimaan hai sagal mithaynaa. All that is seen is an illusion.
RECORD	para 47365	ieku mwgau dwnu goibd sMq rynw ] (1083-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) ik maaga-o daan gobid sant raynaa. I beg for this one gift, for the dust of the feet of the Saints, O Lord of the Universe.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v18	msqik lwie prm pdu pwvau ijsu pRwpiq so pwvYgw ]18] (1083-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) mastak laa-ay param pad paava-o jis paraapat so paavaigaa. ||18||
