RECORD	para 47367	ijn kau ik®pw krI suKdwqy ] (1083-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) jin ka-o kirpaa karee sukh-daatay. Those, unto whom the Lord, the Giver of peace, grants His Mercy,
RECORD	para 47368	iqn swDU crx lY irdY prwqy ] (1083-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) tin saaDhoo charan lai ridai paraatay. grasp the feet of the Holy, and weave them into their hearts.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v19	sgl nwm inDwnu iqn pwieAw Anhd sbd min vwjMgw ]19] (1083-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) sagal naam niDhaan tin paa-i-aa anhad sabad man vaajangaa. ||19||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v19	They obtain all the wealth of the Naam, the Name of the Lord; the unstruck sound current of the Shabad vibrates and resounds within their minds. ||19||
RECORD	para 47370	ikrqm nwm kQy qyry ijhbw ] (1083-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) kirtam naam kathay tayray jihbaa. With my tongue I chant the Names given to You.
DEFINE	para 47371	siq nwmu qyrw prw pUrblw ] (1083-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) sat naam tayraa paraa poorbalaa. 'Sat Naam' is Your perfect, primal Name.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v20	khu nwnk Bgq pey srxweI dyhu drsu min rMgu lgw ]20] (1083-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaho naanak bhagat pa-ay sarnaa-ee dayh daras man rang lagaa. ||20||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v20	Says Nanak, Your devotees have entered Your Sanctuary. Please bestow the Blessed Vision of Your Darshan; their minds are filled with love for You. ||20||
RECORD	para 47373	qyrI giq imiq qUhY jwxih ] (1083-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) tayree gat mit toohai jaaneh. You alone know Your state and extent.
RECORD	para 47374	qU Awpy kQih qY Awip vKwxih ] (1083-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) too aapay katheh tai aap vakaaneh. You Yourself speak, and You Yourself describe it.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v21	nwnk dwsu dwsn ko krIAhu hir BwvY dwsw rwKu sMgw ]21]2]11] (1083-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak daas daasan ko karee-ahu har bhaavai daasaa raakh sangaa. ||21||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v21	Please make Nanak the slave of Your slaves, O Lord; as it pleases Your Will, please keep him with Your slaves. ||21||
RECORD	para 47377	Alh Agm KudweI bMdy ] (1083-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) alah agam khudaa-ee banday. O slave of the inaccessible Lord God Allah,
WHEN	para 47378	Coif iKAwl dunIAw ky DMDy ] (1083-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) chhod khi-aal dunee-aa kay DhanDhay. forsake thoughts of worldly entanglements.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	hoie pY Kwk PkIr muswPru iehu drvysu kbUlu drw ]1] (1083-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) ho-ay pai khaak fakeer musaafar ih darvays kabool daraa. ||1||
REQUIRE	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	Become the dust of the feet of the humble fakeers, and consider yourself a traveller on this journey. O saintly dervish, you shall be approved in the Court of the Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 47380	scu invwj XkIn muslw ] (1083-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) sach nivaaj yakeen muslaa. Let Truth be your prayer, and faith your prayer-mat.
RECORD	para 47381	mnsw mwir invwirhu Awsw ] (1083-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) mansaa maar nivaarihu aasaa. Subdue your desires, and overcome your hopes.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	dyh msIiq mnu maulwxw klm KudweI pwku Krw ]2] (1083-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) dayh maseet man ma-ulaanaa kalam khudaa-ee paak kharaa. ||2||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	Let your body be the mosque, and your mind the priest. Let true purity be God's Word for you. ||2||
RECORD	para 47383	srw srIAiq ly kMmwvhu ] (1083-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) saraa saree-at lay kammaavahu. Let your practice be to live the spiritual life.
RECORD	para 47384	qrIkiq qrk Koij tolwvhu ] (1083-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) tareekat tarak khoj tolaavahu. Let your spiritual cleansing be to renounce the world and seek God.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	mwrPiq mnu mwrhu Abdwlw imlhu hkIkiq ijqu iPir n mrw ]3] (1083-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) maarfat man maarahu abdaalaa milhu hakeekat jit fir na maraa. ||3||
REQUIRE	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	Let control of the mind be your spiritual wisdom, O holy man; meeting with God, you shall never die again. ||3||
RECORD	para 47386	kurwxu kqyb idl mwih kmwhI ] (1083-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) kuraan katayb dil maahi kamaahee. Practice within your heart the teachings of the Koran and the Bible;
RECORD	para 47387	ds Aaurwq rKhu bd rwhI ] (1083-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) das a-uraat rakhahu bad raahee. restrain the ten sensory organs from straying into evil.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	pMc mrd isdik ly bwDhu KYir sbUrI kbUl prw ]4] (1083-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) panch marad sidak lay baaDhhu khair sabooree kabool paraa. ||4||
REQUIRE	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	Tie up the five demons of desire with faith, charity and contentment, and you shall be acceptable. ||4||
RECORD	para 47389	mkw imhr rojw pY Kwkw ] (1083-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) makaa mihar rojaa pai khaakaa. Let compassion be your Mecca, and the dust of the feet of the holy your fast.
RECORD	para 47390	iBsqu pIr lPj kmwie AMdwjw ] (1083-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) bhisat peer lafaj kamaa-ay andaajaa. Let Paradise be your practice of the Prophet's Word.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	hUr nUr musku KudwieAw bMdgI Alh Awlw hujrw ]5] (1083-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) hoor noor musak khudaa-i-aa bandagee alah aalaa hujraa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	God is the beauty, the light and the fragrance. Meditation on Allah is the secluded meditation chamber. ||5||
DEFINE	para 47393	scu kmwvY soeI kwjI ] (1084-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) sach kamaavai so-ee kaajee. He alone is a Qazi, who practices the Truth.
DEFINE	para 47394	jo idlu soDY soeI hwjI ] (1084-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) jo dil soDhai so-ee haajee. He alone is a Haji, a pilgrim to Mecca, who purifies his heart.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	so mulw mlaUn invwrY so drvysu ijsu isPiq Drw ]6] (1084-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) so mulaa mala-oon nivaarai so darvays jis sifat Dharaa. ||6||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	He alone is a Mullah, who banishes evil; he alone is a saintly dervish, who takes the Support of the Lord's Praise. ||6||
RECORD	para 47396	sBy vKq sBy kir vylw ] Kwlku Xwid idlY mih maulw ] (1084-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) sabhay vakhat sabhay kar vaylaa. khaalak yaad dilai meh ma-ulaa. Always, at every moment, remember God, the Creator within your heart.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	qsbI Xwid krhu ds mrdnu suMniq sIlu bMDwin brw ]7] (1084-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) tasbee yaad karahu das mardan sunat seel banDhaan baraa. ||7||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	Let your meditation beads be the subjugation of the ten senses. Let good conduct and self-restraint be your circumcision. ||7||
REQUIRE	para 47398	idl mih jwnhu sB iPlhwlw ] (1084-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) dil meh jaanhu sabh filhaalaa. You must know in your heart that everything is temporary.
DEFINE	para 47399	iKlKwnw ibrwdr hmU jMjwlw ] (1084-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) khilkhaanaa biraadar hamoo janjaalaa. Family, household and siblings are all entanglements.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	mIr mlk aumry PwnwieAw eyk mukwm Kudwie drw ]8] (1084-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) meer malak umray faanaa-i-aa ayk mukaam khudaa-ay daraa. ||8||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	Kings, rulers and nobles are mortal and transitory; only God's Gate is the permanent place. ||8||
DEFINE	para 47401	Avil isPiq dUjI swbUrI ] (1084-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) aval sifat doojee saabooree. First, is the Lord's Praise; second, contentment;
RECORD	para 47402	qIjY hlymI cauQY KYrI ] (1084-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) teejai halaymee cha-uthai khairee. third, humility, and fourth, giving to charities.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	pMjvY pMjy iekqu mukwmY eyih pMij vKq qyry Aprprw ]9] (1084-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) punjvai panjay ikat mukaamai ayhi panj vakhat tayray aparparaa. ||9||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	Fifth is to hold one's desires in restraint. These are the five most sublime daily prayers. ||9||
DEFINE	para 47404	sglI jwin krhu maudIPw ] (1084-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) saglee jaan karahu ma-udeefaa. Let your daily worship be the knowledge that God is everywhere.
WHEN	para 47405	bd Aml Coif krhu hiQ kUjw ] (1084-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) bad amal chhod karahu hath koojaa. Let renunciation of evil actions be the water-jug you carry.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	Kudwie eyku buiJ dyvhu bWgW burgU brKurdwr Krw ]10] (1084-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) khudaa-ay ayk bujh dayvhu baa Ngaa N burgoo barkhurdaar kharaa. ||10||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	Let realization of the One Lord God be your call to prayer; be a good child of God - let this be your trumpet. ||10||
DEFINE	para 47407	hku hlwlu bKorhu Kwxw ] (1084-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) hak halaal bakhorahu khaanaa. Let what is earned righteously be your blessed food.
RECORD	para 47408	idl drIAwau Dovhu mYlwxw ] (1084-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) dil daree-aa-o Dhovahu mailaanaa. Wash away pollution with the river of your heart.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	pIru pCwxY iBsqI soeI AjrweIlu n doj Trw ]11] (1084-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) peer pachhaanai bhistee so-ee ajraa-eel na doj tharaa. ||11||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	One who realizes the Prophet attains heaven. Azraa-eel, the Messenger of Death, does not cast him into hell. ||11||
RECORD	para 47410	kwieAw ikrdwr Aaurq XkInw ] (1084-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaa-i-aa kirdaar a-urat yakeenaa. Let good deeds be your body, and faith your bride.
RECORD	para 47411	rMg qmwsy mwix hkInw ] (1084-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) rang tamaasay maan hakeenaa. Play and enjoy the Lord's love and delight.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v12	nwpwk pwku kir hdUir hdIsw swbq sUriq dsqwr isrw ]12] (1084-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) naapaak paak kar hadoor hadeesaa saabat soorat dastaar siraa. ||12||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v12	Purify what is impure, and let the Lord's Presence be your religious tradition. Let your total awareness be the turban on your head. ||12||
DEFINE	para 47413	muslmwxu mom idil hovY ] (1084-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) musalmaan mom dil hovai. To be Muslim is to be kind-hearted,
RECORD	para 47414	AMqr kI mlu idl qy DovY ] (1084-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) antar kee mal dil tay Dhovai. and wash away pollution from within the heart.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v13	dunIAw rMg n AwvY nyVY ijau kusm pwtu iGau pwku hrw ]13] (1084-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) dunee-aa rang na aavai nayrhai ji-o kusam paat ghi-o paak haraa. ||13||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v13	He does not even approach worldly pleasures; he is pure, like flowers, silk, ghee and the deer-skin. ||13||
DEFINE	para 47416	jw kau imhr imhr imhrvwnw ] (1084-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) jaa ka-o mihar mihar miharvaanaa. One who is blessed with the mercy and compassion of the Merciful Lord,
RECORD	para 47417	soeI mrdu mrdu mrdwnw ] (1084-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) so-ee marad marad mardaanaa. is the manliest man among men.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v14	soeI syKu mswieku hwjI so bMdw ijsu njir nrw ]14] (1084-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) so-ee saykh masaa-ik haajee so bandaa jis najar naraa. ||14||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v14	He alone is a Shaykh, a preacher, a Haji, and he alone is God's slave, who is blessed with God's Grace. ||14||
RECORD	para 47419	kudriq kwdr krx krImw ] (1084-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) kudrat kaadar karan kareemaa. The Creator Lord has Creative Power; the Merciful Lord has Mercy.
DEFINE	para 47420	isPiq muhbiq AQwh rhImw ] (1084-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) sifat muhabat athaah raheemaa. The Praises and the Love of the Merciful Lord are unfathomable.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v15	hku hukmu scu KudwieAw buiJ nwnk bMid Klws qrw ]15]3]12] (1084-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) hak hukam sach khudaa-i-aa bujh naanak band khalaas taraa. ||15||
REQUIRE	mwrU mhlw 5 v15	Realize the True Hukam, the Command of the Lord, O Nanak; you shall be released from bondage, and carried across. ||15||
DEFINE	para 47423	pwrbRhm sB aUc ibrwjy ] (1084-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) paarbarahm sabh ooch biraajay. The Abode of the Supreme Lord God is above all.
RECORD	para 47424	Awpy Qwip auQwpy swjy ] (1084-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) aapay thaap uthaapay saajay. He Himself establishes, establishes and creates.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	pRB kI srix ghq suKu pweIAY ikCu Bau n ivAwpY bwl kw ]1] (1084-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) parabh kee saran gahat sukh paa-ee-ai kichh bha-o na vi-aapai baal kaa. ||1||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	Holding tight to the Sanctuary of God, peace is found, and one is not afflicted by the fear of Maya. ||1||
RECORD	para 47426	grB Agin mih ijnih aubwirAw ] (1084-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) garabh agan meh jineh ubaari-aa. He saved you from the fire of the womb,
WHEN	para 47427	rkq ikrm mih nhI sMGwirAw ] (1084-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) rakat kiram meh nahee sanghaari-aa. and did not destroy you, when you were an egg in your mother's ovary.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	Apnw ismrnu dy pRiqpwilAw Ehu sgl Gtw kw mwlkw ]2] (1084-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) apnaa simran day partipaali-aa oh sagal ghataa kaa maalkaa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	Blessing you with meditative remembrance upon Himself, He nurtured you and cherished you; He is the Master of all hearts. ||2||
RECORD	para 47429	crx kml srxweI AwieAw ] (1084-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) charan kamal sarnaa-ee aa-i-aa. I have come to the Sanctuary of His lotus feet.
RECORD	para 47430	swDsMig hY hir jsu gwieAw ] (1084-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) saaDhsang hai har jas gaa-i-aa. In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, I sing the Praises of the Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	jnm mrx siB dUK invwry jip hir hir Bau nhI kwl kw ]3] (1084-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) janam maran sabh dookh nivaaray jap har har bha-o nahee kaal kaa. ||3||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	I have erased all the pains of birth and death; meditating on the Lord, Har, Har, I have no fear of death. ||3||
DEFINE	para 47432	smrQ AkQ Agocr dyvw ] (1084-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) samrath akath agochar dayvaa. God is all-powerful, indescribable, unfathomable and divine.
RECORD	para 47433	jIA jMq siB qw kI syvw ] (1084-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) jee-a jant sabh taa kee sayvaa. All beings and creatures serve Him.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	AMfj jyrj syqj auqBuj bhu prkwrI pwlkw ]4] (1084-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) andaj jayraj saytaj ut-bhuj baho parkaaree paalkaa. ||4||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	In so many ways, He cherishes those born from eggs, from the womb, from sweat and from the earth. ||4||
RECORD	para 47435	iqsih prwpiq hoie inDwnw ] (1084-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) tiseh paraapat ho-ay niDhaanaa. He alone obtains this wealth,
RECORD	para 47436	rwm nwm rsu AMqir mwnw ] (1084-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) raam naam ras antar maanaa. who savors and enjoys, deep within his mind, the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	kru gih lIny AMD kUp qy ivrly kyeI swlkw ]5] (1084-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) kar geh leenay anDh koop tay virlay kay-ee saalkaa. ||5||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	Grasping hold of his arm, God lifts him up and pulls him out of the deep, dark pit. Such a devotee of the Lord is very rare. ||5||
RECORD	para 47439	Awid AMiq miD pRBu soeI ] (1085-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) aad ant maDh parabh so-ee. God exists in the beginning, in the middle and in the end.
RECORD	para 47440	Awpy krqw kry su hoeI ] (1085-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) aapay kartaa karay so ho-ee. Whatever the Creator Lord Himself does, comes to pass.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	BRmu Bau imitAw swDsMg qy dwild n koeI Gwlkw ]6] (1085-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) bharam bha-o miti-aa saaDhsang tay daalid na ko-ee ghaalkaa. ||6||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	Doubt and fear are erased, in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, and then one is not afflicted by deadly pain. ||6||
RECORD	para 47442	aUqm bwxI gwau guopwlw ] (1085-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) ootam banee gaa-o gopaalaa. I sing the most Sublime Bani, the Word of the Lord of the Universe.
RECORD	para 47443	swDsMgiq kI mMghu rvwlw ] (1085-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) saaDhsangat kee mangahu ravaalaa. I beg for the dust of the feet of the Saadh Sangat.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	bwsn myit inbwsn hoeIAY klml sgly jwlkw ]7] (1085-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) baasan mayt nibaasan ho-ee-ai kalmal saglay jaalkaa. ||7||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	Eradicating desire, I have become free of desire; I have burnt away all my sins. ||7||
DEFINE	para 47445	sMqw kI ieh rIiq inrwlI ] (1085-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) santaa kee ih reet niraalee. This is the unique way of the Saints;
RECORD	para 47446	pwrbRhmu kir dyKih nwlI ] (1085-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) paarbarahm kar daykheh naalee. they behold the Supreme Lord God with them.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	swis swis AwrwDin hir hir ikau ismrq kIjY Awlkw ]8] (1085-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) saas saas aaraaDhan har har ki-o simrat keejai aalkaa. ||8||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	With each and every breath, they worship and adore the Lord, Har, Har. How could anyone be too lazy to meditate on Him? ||8||
RECORD	para 47448	jh dyKw qh AMqrjwmI ] (1085-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) jah daykhaa tah antarjaamee. Wherever I look, there I see the Inner-knower, the Searcher of hearts.
RECORD	para 47449	inmK n ivsrhu pRB myry suAwmI ] (1085-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) nimakh na visrahu parabh mayray su-aamee. I never forget God, my Lord and Master, even for an instant.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	ismir ismir jIvih qyry dwsw bin jil pUrn Qwlkw ]9] (1085-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) simar simar jeeveh tayray daasaa ban jal pooran thaalkaa. ||9||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v9	Your slaves live by meditating, meditating in remembrance on the Lord; You are permeating the woods, the water and the land. ||9||
RECORD	para 47451	qqI vwau n qw kau lwgY ] (1085-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) tatee vaa-o na taa ka-o laagai. Even the hot wind does not touch one
RECORD	para 47452	ismrq nwmu Anidnu jwgY ] (1085-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) simrat naam an-din jaagai. who remains awake in meditative remembrance, night and day.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	And ibnod kry hir ismrnu iqsu mwieAw sMig n qwlkw ]10] (1085-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) anad binod karay har simran tis maa-i-aa sang na taalkaa. ||10||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	He delights and enjoys meditative remembrance on the Lord; he has no attachment to Maya. ||10||
RECORD	para 47454	rog sog dUK iqsu nwhI ] (1085-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) rog sog dookh tis naahee. Disease, sorrow and pain do not affect him;
RECORD	para 47455	swDsMig hir kIrqnu gwhI ] (1085-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) saaDhsang har keertan gaahee. he sings the Kirtan of the Lord's Praises in the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	Awpxw nwmu dyih pRB pRIqm suix bynµqI Kwlkw ]11] (1085-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) aapnaa naam deh parabh pareetam sun baynantee khaalkaa. ||11||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	Please bless me with Your Name, O my Beloved Lord God; please listen to my prayer, O Creator. ||11||
DEFINE	para 47457	nwm rqnu qyrw hY ipAwry ] (1085-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) naam ratan tayraa hai pi-aaray. Your Name is a jewel, O my Beloved Lord.
DEFINE	para 47458	rMig rqy qyrY dws Apwry ] (1085-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) rang ratay tayrai daas apaaray. Your slaves are imbued with Your Infinite Love.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v12	qyrY rMig rqy quDu jyhy ivrly kyeI Bwlkw ]12] (1085-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) tayrai rang ratay tuDh jayhay virlay kay-ee bhaalkaa. ||12||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v12	Those who are imbued with Your Love, become like You; it is so rare that they are found. ||12||
RECORD	para 47460	iqn kI DUiV mWgY mnu myrw ] (1085-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) tin kee Dhoorh maa Ngai man mayraa. My mind longs for the dust of the feet of those
RECORD	para 47461	ijn ivsrih nwhI kwhU byrw ] (1085-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) jin visrahi naahee kaahoo bayraa. who never forget the Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v13	iqn kY sMig prm pdu pweI sdw sMgI hir nwlkw ]13] (1085-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) tin kai sang param pad paa-ee sadaa sangee har naalkaa. ||13||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v13	Associating with them, I obtain the supreme status; the Lord, my Companion, is always with me. ||13||
DEFINE	para 47463	swjnu mIqu ipAwrw soeI ] (1085-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) saajan meet pi-aaraa so-ee. He alone is my beloved friend and companion,
RECORD	para 47464	eyku idRVwey durmiq KoeI ] (1085-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) ayk drirh-aa-ay durmat kho-ee. who implants the Name of the One Lord within, and eradicates evil-mindedness.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v14	kwmu k®oDu AhMkwru qjwey iqsu jn kau aupdysu inrmwlkw ]14] (1085-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaam kroDh aha Nkaar tajaa-ay tis jan ka-o updays nirmaalkaa. ||14||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v14	Immaculate are the teachings of that humble servant of the Lord, who casts out sexual desire, anger and egotism. ||14||
DEFINE	para 47466	quDu ivxu nwhI koeI myrw ] (1085-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) tuDh vin naahee ko-ee mayraa. Other than You, O Lord, no one is mine.
RECORD	para 47467	guir pkVwey pRB ky pYrw ] (1085-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur pakrhaa-ay parabh kay pairaa. The Guru has led me to grasp the feet of God.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v15	hau bilhwrI siqgur pUry ijin KMifAw Brmu Anwlkw ]15] (1085-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) ha-o balihaaree satgur pooray jin khandi-aa bharam anaalkaa. ||15||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v15	I am a sacrifice to the Perfect True Guru, who has destroyed the illusion of duality. ||15||
RECORD	para 47469	swis swis pRBu ibsrY nwhI ] (1085-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) saas saas parabh bisrai naahee. With each and every breath, I never forget God.
RECORD	para 47470	AwT phr hir hir kau iDAweI ] (1085-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) aath pahar har har ka-o Dhi-aa-ee. Twenty-four hours a day, I meditate on the Lord, Har, Har.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v16	nwnk sMq qyrY rMig rwqy qU smrQu vfwlkw ]16]4]13] (1085-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak sant tayrai rang raatay too samrath vadaalkaa. ||16||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v16	O Nanak, the Saints are imbued with Your Love; You are the great and all-powerful Lord. ||16||
RECORD	para 47472	maaroo mehlaa 5 Maaroo, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 47473	<> siqgur pRswid ] (1085-16) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
RECORD	para 47474	crn kml ihrdY inq DwrI ] (1085-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) charan kamal hirdai nit Dhaaree. I enshrine the Lord's lotus feet continually within my heart.
RECORD	para 47475	guru pUrw iKnu iKnu nmskwrI ] (1085-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur pooraa khin khin namaskaaree. Each and every moment, I humbly bow to the Perfect Guru.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	qnu mnu Arip DrI sBu AwgY jg mih nwmu suhwvxw ]1] (1085-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) tan man arap Dharee sabh aagai jag meh naam suhaavanaa. ||1||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v1	I dedicate my body, mind and everything, and place it in offering before the Lord. His Name is the most beautiful in this world. ||1||
RECORD	para 47477	so Twkuru ikau mnhu ivswry ] (1085-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) so thaakur ki-o manhu visaaray. Why forget the Lord and Master from your mind?
UPHOLD	para 47478	jIau ipMfu dy swij svwry ] (1085-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) jee-o pind day saaj savaaray. He blessed you with body and soul, creating and embellishing you.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	swis grwis smwly krqw kIqw Apxw pwvxw ]2] (1085-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) saas garaas samaalay kartaa keetaa apnaa paavnaa. ||2||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v2	With every breath and morsel of food, the Creator takes care of His beings, who receive according to what they have done. ||2||
RECORD	para 47480	jw qy ibrQw koaU nwhI ] (1085-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) jaa tay birthaa ko-oo naahee. No one returns empty-handed from Him;
RECORD	para 47481	AwT phr hir rKu mn mwhI ] (1085-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) aath pahar har rakh man maahee. twenty-four hours a day, keep the Lord in your mind.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	swDsMig Bju Acuq suAwmI drgh soBw pwvxw ]3] (1086-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) saaDhsang bhaj achut su-aamee dargeh sobhaa paavnaa. ||3||
REQUIRE	mwrU mhlw 5 v3	In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, meditate and vibrate upon your imperishable Lord and Master, and you shall be honored in the Court of the Lord. ||3||
RECORD	para 47484	cwir pdwrQ Ast dsw isiD ] (1086-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) chaar padaarath asat dasaa siDh. The four great blessings, and the eighteen miraculous spiritual powers,
RECORD	para 47485	nwmu inDwnu shj suK nau iniD ] (1086-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) naam niDhaan sahj sukh na-o niDh. are found in the treasure of the Naam, which brings celestial peace and poise, and the nine treasures.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	srb kilAwx jy mn mih cwhih imil swDU suAwmI rwvxw ]4] (1086-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) sarab kali-aan jay man meh chaaheh mil saaDhoo su-aamee raavnaa. ||4||
WHEN	mwrU mhlw 5 v4	If you yearn in your mind for all joys, then join the Saadh Sangat, and dwell upon your Lord and Master. ||4||
RECORD	para 47487	swsq isMimRiq byd vKwxI ] (1086-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) saasat simrit bayd vakhaanee. The Shaastras, the Simritees and the Vedas proclaim
REQUIRE	para 47488	jnmu pdwrQu jIqu prwxI ] (1086-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) janam padaarath jeet paraanee. that the mortal must be victorious in this priceless human life.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	kwmu k®oDu inMdw prhrIAY hir rsnw nwnk gwvxw ]5] (1086-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaam kroDh nindaa parharee-ai har rasnaa naanak gaavnaa. ||5||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v5	Forsaking sexual desire, anger and slander, sing of the Lord with your tongue, O Nanak. ||5||
RECORD	para 47490	ijsu rUpu n ryiKAw kulu nhI jwqI ] (1086-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) jis roop na raykh-i-aa kul nahee jaatee. He has no form or shape, no ancestry or social class.
DEFINE	para 47491	pUrn pUir rihAw idnu rwqI ] (1086-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) pooran poor rahi-aa din raatee. The Perfect Lord is perfectly pervading day and night.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	jo jo jpY soeI vfBwgI bhuiV n jonI pwvxw ]6] (1086-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) jo jo japai so-ee vadbhaagee bahurh na jonee paavnaa. ||6||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v6	Whoever meditates on Him is very fortunate; he is not consigned to reincarnation again. ||6||
RECORD	para 47493	ijs no ibsrY purKu ibDwqw ] (1086-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) jis no bisrai purakh biDhaataa. One who forgets the Primal Lord, the Architect of karma,
RECORD	para 47494	jlqw iPrY rhY inq qwqw ] (1086-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) jaltaa firai rahai nit taataa. wanders around burning, and remains tormented.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	AikrqGxY kau rKY n koeI nrk Gor mih pwvxw ]7] (1086-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) akirat-ghanai ka-o rakhai na ko-ee narak ghor meh paavnaa. ||7||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v7	No one can save such an ungrateful person; he is thrown into the most horrible hell. ||7||
UPHOLD	para 47496	jIau pRwx qnu Dnu ijin swijAw ] (1086-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) jee-o paraan tan Dhan jin saaji-aa. He blessed you with your soul, the breath of life, your body and wealth;
RECORD	para 47497	mwq grB mih rwiK invwijAw ] (1086-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) maat garabh meh raakh nivaaji-aa. He preserved and nurtured you in your mother's womb.
WHEN	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	iqs isau pRIiq Cwif An rwqw kwhU isrY n lwvxw ]8] (1086-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) tis si-o pareet chhaad an raataa kaahoo sirai na laavnaa. ||8||
REQUIRE	mwrU mhlw 5 v8	Forsaking His Love, you are imbued with another; you shall never achieve your goals like this. ||8||
RECORD	para 47499	Dwir AnugRhu suAwmI myry ] (1086-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) Dhaar anoograhu su-aamee mayray. Please shower me with Your Merciful Grace, O my Lord and Master.
DEFINE	para 47500	Git Git vsih sBn kY nyry ] (1086-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) ghat ghat vaseh sabhan kai nayray. You dwell in each and every heart, and are near everyone.
