RECORD	para 47502	jw kY msqik Duir iliK pwieAw ] (1086-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) jaa kai mastak Dhur likh paa-i-aa. One who has such pre-ordained destiny inscribed upon his forehead,
DEFINE	para 47503	iqs hI purK n ivAwpY mwieAw ] (1086-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) tis hee purakh na vi-aapai maa-i-aa. that person is not afflicted by Maya.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	nwnk dws sdw srxweI dUsr lvY n lwvxw ]10] (1086-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak daas sadaa sarnaa-ee doosar lavai na laavnaa. ||10||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v10	Slave Nanak seeks Your Sanctuary forever; there is no other equal to You. ||10||
