DEFINE	para 47506	AMimRq nwmu ibrlY hI cIny ] (1086-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) amrit naam birlai hee cheenay. How rare are those who remember the Ambrosial Naam, the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	qw kI kImiq khxu n jweI jq kq EhI smwvxw ]11] (1086-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) taa kee keemat kahan na jaa-ee jat kat ohee samaavnaa. ||11||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v11	His value cannot be described. He is prevailing everywhere. ||11||
DEFINE	para 47508	soeI Bgqu soeI vf dwqw ] (1086-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) so-ee bhagat so-ee vad daataa. He is the devotee; He is the Great Giver.
DEFINE	para 47509	soeI pUrn purKu ibDwqw ] (1086-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) so-ee pooran purakh biDhaataa. He is the Perfect Primal Lord, the Architect of karma.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v12	bwl shweI soeI qyrw jo qyrY min Bwvxw ]12] (1086-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) baal sahaa-ee so-ee tayraa jo tayrai man bhaavnaa. ||12||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v12	He is your help and support, since infancy; He fulfills your mind's desires. ||12||
DEFINE	para 47511	imrqu dUK sUK iliK pwey ] (1086-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) mirat dookh sookh likh paa-ay. Death, pain and pleasure are ordained by the Lord.
RECORD	para 47512	iqlu nhI bDih Gtih n Gtwey ] (1086-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) til nahee baDheh ghateh na ghataa-ay. They do not increase or decrease by anyone's efforts.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v13	soeI hoie ij krqy BwvY kih kY Awpu v\wvxw ]13] (1086-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) so-ee ho-ay je kartay bhaavai kahi kai aap vanjaavanaa. ||13||
DEFINE	mwrU mhlw 5 v13	That alone happens, which is pleasing to the Creator; speaking of himself, the mortal ruins himself. ||13||
RECORD	para 47514	AMD kUp qy syeI kwFy ] (1086-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) anDh koop tay say-ee kaadhay. He lifts us up and pulls us out of the deep dark pit;
RECORD	para 47515	jnm jnm ky tUty gWFy ] (1086-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) janam janam kay tootay gaa Ndhay. He unites with Himself, those who were separated for so many incarnations.
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v14	ikrpw Dwir rKy kir Apuny imil swDU goibMdu iDAwvxw ]14] (1086-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) kirpaa Dhaar rakhay kar apunay mil saaDhoo gobind Dhi-aavanaa. ||14||
RECORD	mwrU mhlw 5 v14	Showering them with His Mercy, He protects them with His own hands. Meeting with the Holy Saints, they meditate on the Lord of the Universe. ||14||
RECORD	para 47517	qyrI kImiq khxu n jweI ] (1086-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) tayree keemat kahan na jaa-ee. Your worth cannot be described.
DEFINE	para 47518	Acrj rUpu vfI vifAweI ] (1086-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) achraj roop vadee vadi-aa-ee. Wondrous is Your form, and Your glorious greatness.
