DEFINE	para 47523	ivxu gwhk guxu vycIAY qau guxu shGo jwie ] (1086-19, mwrU, mÚ 1) vin gaahak gun vaychee-ai ta-o gun sahgho jaa-ay. If virtue is sold when there is no buyer, then it is sold very cheap.
