DEFINE	para 47526	gux qy gux imil pweIAY jy siqgur mwih smwie ] (1087-1, mwrU, mÚ 1) gun tay gun mil paa-ee-ai jay satgur maahi samaa-ay. Meeting with a virtuous person, virtue is obtained, and one is immersed in the True Guru.
DEFINE	para 47527	muoil Amuolu n pweIAY vxij n lIjY hwit ] (1087-1, mwrU, mÚ 1) mol amol na paa-ee-ai vanaj na leejai haat. Priceless virtues are not obtained for any price; they cannot be purchased in a store.
