DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, their weight is full and perfect; it never decreases at all. ||1||
RECORD	para 47529	mÚ 4 ] (1087-2) mehlaa 4. Fourth Mehl:
RECORD	para 47530	nwm ivhUxy Brmsih Awvih jwvih nIq ] (1087-2, mwrU, mÚ 4) naam vihoonay bharmaseh aavahi jaaveh neet. Without the Naam, the Name of the Lord, they wander around, continually coming and going in reincarnation.
DEFINE	para 47531	ieik bWDy ieik FIilAw ieik suKIey hir pRIiq ] (1087-3, mwrU, mÚ 4) ik baa NDhay ik dheeli-aa ik sukhee-ay har pareet. Some are in bondage, and some are set free; some are happy in the Love of the Lord.
