RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, believe in the True Lord, and practice Truth, through the lifestyle of Truth. ||2||
RECORD	para 47533	pauVI ] (1087-4) pa-orhee. Pauree:
UPHOLD	para 47534	gur qy igAwnu pwieAw Aiq KVgu krwrw ] (1087-4, mwrU, mÚ 4) gur tay gi-aan paa-i-aa at kharhag karaaraa. From the Guru, I have obtained the supremely powerful sword of spiritual wisdom.
RECORD	para 47535	dUjw BRmu gVu kitAw mohu loBu AhMkwrw ] (1087-4, mwrU, mÚ 4) doojaa bharam garh kati-aa moh lobh aha Nkaaraa. I have cut down the fortress of duality and doubt, attachment, greed and egotism.
RECORD	para 47536	hir kw nwmu min visAw gur sbid vIcwrw ] (1087-5, mwrU, mÚ 4) har kaa naam man vasi-aa gur sabad veechaaraa. The Name of the Lord abides within my mind; I contemplate the Word of the Guru's Shabad.
