WHEN	para 47541	sqsMgiq isau imldo rhY scy Dry ipAwru ] (1087-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) satsangat si-o mildo rahai sachay Dharay pi-aar. and if one remains in the Soceity of the Saints, and enshrines love for the True Lord.
RECORD	para 47542	ivchu mlu kty AwpxI kulw kw kry auDwru ] (1087-7, mwrU, mÚ 3) vichahu mal katay aapnee kulaa kaa karay uDhaar. Such a person washes away the pollution from within, and saves his generations as well.
RECORD	para 47543	guxw kI rwis sMgRhY Avgx kFY ivfwir ] (1087-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) gunaa kee raas sangrahai avgan kadhai vidaar. He gathes in the capital of virtue, and destroys and drives out unvirtuous sins.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v1	nwnk imilAw so jwxIAY gurU n CofY Awpxw dUjY n Dry ipAwru ]1] (1087-8, mwrU, mÚ 3) naanak mili-aa so jaanee-ai guroo na chhodai aapnaa doojai na Dharay pi-aar. ||1||
