DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, without the True Name, these entanglements are not removed from hanging over one's head. ||1||
RECORD	para 47580	mÚ 3 ] (1088-3) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 47581	iqRBvx FUFI sjxw haumY burI jgiq ] (1088-3, mwrU, mÚ 3) taribhavan dhoodhee sajnaa ha-umai buree jagat. I have searched throughout the three worlds, O my friend; egotism is bad for the world.
