RECORD	para 47583	pauVI ] (1088-4) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 47584	gurmuiK Awpy bKisEnu hir nwim smwxy ] (1088-4, mwrU, mÚ 3) gurmukh aapay bakhsi-on har naam samaanay. The Lord Himself forgives the Gurmukhs; they are absorbed and immersed in the Lord's Name.
RECORD	para 47585	Awpy BgqI lwieEnu gur sbid nIswxy ] (1088-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) aapay bhagtee laa-i-on gur sabad neesaanay. He Himself links them to devotional worship; they bear the Insignia of the Guru's Shabad.
DEFINE	para 47586	snmuK sdw sohxy scY dir jwxy ] (1088-5, mwrU, mÚ 3) sanmukh sadaa sohnay sachai dar jaanay. Those who turn towards the Guru, as sunmukh, are beautiful. They are famous in the Court of the True Lord.
