DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v4	Blessed, blessed are those humble beings who serve the Lord. I am a sacrifice to them. ||4||
RECORD	para 47589	sloku mÚ 1 ] (1088-7) salok mehlaa 1. Shalok, First Mehl:
DEFINE	para 47590	mhl kucjI mVvVI kwlI mnhu ksuD ] (1088-7, mwrU, mÚ 1) mahal kuchjee marvarhee kaalee manhu kasuDh. The rude, ill-mannered bride is encased in the body-tomb; she is blackened, and her mind is impure.
