DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v1	She can enjoy her Husband Lord, only if she is virtuous. O Nanak, the soul-bride is unworthy, and without virtue. ||1||
RECORD	para 47592	mÚ 1 ] (1088-8) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
RECORD	para 47593	swcu sIl scu sMjmI sw pUrI prvwir ] (1088-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) saach seel sach sanjmee saa pooree parvaar. She has good conduct, true self-discipline, and a perfect family.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v2	nwnk Aihinis sdw BlI ipr kY hyiq ipAwir ]2] (1088-8, mwrU, mÚ 1) naanak ahinis sadaa bhalee pir kai hayt pi-aar. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, day and night, she is always good; she loves her Beloved Husband Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 47595	pauVI ] (1088-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 47596	Awpxw Awpu pCwixAw nwmu inDwnu pwieAw ] (1088-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) aapnaa aap pachhaani-aa naam niDhaan paa-i-aa. One who realizes his own self, is blessed with the treasure of the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
