RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v1	So stand before Him, O Nanak, and offer your prayers. ||1||
RECORD	para 47833	mÚ 1 ] (1093-9) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
RECORD	para 47834	ijin kIAw iqin dyiKAw Awpy jwxY soie ] (1093-9, mwrU, mÚ 1) jin kee-aa tin daykhi-aa aapay jaanai so-ay. He who created the creation, watches over it; He Himself knows.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v2	iks no khIAY nwnkw jw Gir vrqY sBu koie ]2] (1093-10, mwrU, mÚ 1) kis no kahee-ai naankaa jaa ghar vartai sabh ko-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v2	Unto whom should I speak, O Nanak, when everything is contained within the home of the heart? ||2||
RECORD	para 47836	pauVI ] (1093-10) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 47837	sBy Qok ivswir ieko imqu kir ] (1093-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) sabhay thok visaar iko mit kar. Forget everything, and be friends with the One Lord alone.
REQUIRE	para 47838	mnu qnu hoie inhwlu pwpw dhY hir ] (1093-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) man tan ho-ay nihaal paapaa dahai har. Your mind and body shall be enraptured, and the Lord shall burn away your sins.
FORBID	para 47839	Awvx jwxw cukY jnim n jwih mir ] (1093-11, mwrU, mÚ 1) aavan jaanaa chukai janam na jaahi mar. Your comings and goings in reincarnation shall cease; you shall not be reborn and die again.
FORBID	para 47840	scu nwmu AwDwru soig n moih jir ] (1093-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) sach naam aaDhaar sog na mohi jar. The True Name shall be your Support, and you shall not burn in sorrow and attachment.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v20	nwnk nwmu inDwnu mn mih sMij Dir ]20] (1093-12, mwrU, mÚ 1) naanak naam niDhaan man meh sanj Dhar. ||20||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 3 v20	O Nanak, gather in the treasure of the Naam, the Name of the Lord, within your mind. ||20||
RECORD	para 47842	slok mÚ 5 ] (1093-13) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 47843	mwieAw mnhu n vIsrY mWgY dMmw dMm ] (1093-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) maa-i-aa manhu na veesrai maa Ngai dammaa damm. You do not forget Maya from your mind; you beg for it with each and every breath.
