RECORD	para 47884	pauVI ] (1094-10) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 47885	qU scw swihbu scu scu sBu DwirAw ] (1094-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) too sachaa saahib sach sach sabh Dhaari-aa. You are True, O my True Lord and Master; You uphold all that is true.
RECORD	para 47886	gurmuiK kIqo Qwtu isrij sMswirAw ] (1094-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) gurmukh keeto thaat siraj sansaari-aa. You created the world, making a place for the Gurmukhs.
