RECORD	para 47889	nv KMf ipRQmI swij hir rMg svwirAw ] (1094-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) nav khand parithmee saaj har rang savaari-aa. Creating the world of the nine regions, O Lord, You have embellished it with beauty.
