RECORD	para 47891	qyrw AMqu n jwxY koie scu isrjxhwirAw ] (1094-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) tayraa ant na jaanai ko-ay sach sirjanhaari-aa. No one knows Your limit, O True Creator Lord.
