RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	You Yourself know all ways and means; You Yourself save the Gurmukhs. ||1||
RECORD	para 47893	fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1094-14) dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
