RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	jIau mihMjw qau moihAw kid psI jwnI qoih ]1] (1094-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) jee-o mahinjaa ta-o mohi-aa kad pasee jaanee tohi. ||1||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	My soul is fascinated and enticed by You; when will I see You, O my Love? ||1||
RECORD	para 47896	mÚ 5 ] (1094-15) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
