DEFINE	para 47904	quDu isrijAw sBu sMswru qU nwieku sgl Baux ] (1094-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) tuDh sirji-aa sabh sansaar too naa-ik sagal bha-un. You created the entire universe; You are the Master of all the worlds.
RECORD	para 47905	qyrI kudriq koie n jwxY myry Twkur sgl raux ] (1094-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) tayree kudrat ko-ay na jaanai mayray thaakur sagal ra-un. No one knows Your creative power, O my all-pervading Lord and Master.
DEFINE	para 47906	quDu ApiV koie n skY qU AibnwsI jg auDrx ] (1094-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) tuDh aparh ko-ay na sakai too abhinaasee jag uDhran. No one can equal You; You are imperishable and eternal, the Savior of the world.
DEFINE	para 47908	quDu Qwpy cwry jug qU krqw sgl Drx ] (1095-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) tuDh thaapay chaaray jug too kartaa sagal Dharan. You established the four ages; You are the Creator of all worlds.
RECORD	para 47909	quDu Awvx jwxw kIAw quDu lypu n lgY iqRx ] (1095-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) tuDh aavan jaanaa kee-aa tuDh layp na lagai tarin. You created the comings and goings of reincarnation; not even a particle of filth sticks to You.
DEFINE	para 47910	ijsu hovih Awip dieAwlu iqsu lwvih siqgur crx ] (1095-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) jis hoveh aap da-i-aal tis laaveh satgur charan. As you are merciful, You attach us to the Feet of the True Guru.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	qU horqu aupwie n lBhI AibnwsI isRsit krx ]2] (1095-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) too horat upaa-ay na labhhee abhinaasee sarisat karan. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	You cannot be found by any other efforts; You are the eternal, imperishable Creator of the Universe. ||2||
RECORD	para 47912	fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1095-3) dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
