RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	ihksu kMqY bwhrI mYfI vwq n puCY koie ]1] (1095-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) hikas kantai baahree maidee vaat na puchhai ko-ay. ||1||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	Other than the One Lord, my Husband, no one else cares for me. ||1||
