RECORD	para 47921	pauVI ] (1095-6) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 47922	qU pwrbRhmu prmysru join n AwvhI ] (1095-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) too paarbarahm parmaysar jon na aavhee. O Supreme Lord God, O Transcendent Lord, You do not take birth.
RECORD	para 47923	qU hukmI swjih isRsit swij smwvhI ] (1095-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) too hukmee saajeh sarisat saaj samaavahee. By the Hukam of Your Command, You formed the Universe; forming it, You merge into it.
RECORD	para 47924	qyrw rUpu n jweI liKAw ikau quJih iDAwvhI ] (1095-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) tayraa roop na jaa-ee lakhi-aa ki-o tujheh Dhi-aavahee. Your Form cannot be known; how can one meditate on You?
DEFINE	para 47925	qU sB mih vrqih Awip kudriq dyKwvhI ] (1095-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) too sabh meh varteh aap kudrat daykhaavahee. You are pervading and permeating all; You Yourself reveal Your creative potency.
DEFINE	para 47926	qyrI Bgiq Bry BMfwr qoit n AwvhI ] (1095-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) tayree bhagat bharay bhandaar tot na aavhee. Your treasures of devotional worship are overflowing; they never decrease.
RECORD	para 47927	eyih rqn jvyhr lwl kIm n pwvhI ] (1095-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) ayhi ratan javayhar laal keem na paavhee. These gems, jewels and diamonds - their value cannot be estimated.
RECORD	para 47928	ijsu hovih Awip dieAwlu iqsu siqgur syvw lwvhI ] (1095-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) jis hoveh aap da-i-aal tis satgur sayvaa laavhee. As You Yourself become merciful, Lord, You link us to the service of the True Guru.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	iqsu kdy n AwvY qoit jo hir gux gwvhI ]3] (1095-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) tis kaday na aavai tot jo har gun gaavhee. ||3||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	One who sings the Glorious Praises of the Lord, never suffers any deficiency. ||3||
