DEFINE	para 47941	qU Awpy Twkuru syvko Awpy pUjMqw ] (1095-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) too aapay thaakur sayvko aapay poojantaa. You Yourself are the Lord and Master, and the servant; You worship and adore Yourself.
DEFINE	para 47942	dwnw bInw Awip qU Awpy sqvMqw ] (1095-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) daanaa beenaa aap too aapay satvantaa. You are all-wise and all-seeing; You Yourself are true and pure.
