RECORD	para 47944	sBu bRhm pswru pswirE Awpy Kylµqw ] (1095-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) sabh barahm pasaar pasaari-o aapay khaylantaa. God spreads out the expanse of the entire universe, and He Himself plays in it.
