DEFINE	para 47960	ey mwxs jwxih dUir qU vrqih jwhrw ] (1096-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) ay maanas jaaneh door too varteh jaahraa. These humans believe that You are far away; but You are quite obviously apparent.
