DEFINE	para 47962	qU purKu AnµdI Anµq sB joiq smwhrw ] (1096-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) too purakh anandee anant sabh jot samaaharaa. You are the blissful and infinite Primal Lord God; Your Light is all-pervading.
