DEFINE	para 47964	ikAw AwrwDy ijhvw iek qU AibnwsI Aprprw ] (1096-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) ki-aa aaraaDhay jihvaa ik too abhinaasee aparparaa. How can my single tongue worship and adore You? You are the eternal, imperishable, infinite Lord God.
