RECORD	para 48095	fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1098-16) dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 48096	mU QIAwaU qKqu iprI mihMjy pwiqswh ] (1098-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) moo thee-aa-oo takhat piree mahinjay paatisaah. I have become the throne for my Beloved Lord King.
