DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	The filth of birth and death is erased, singing the Glorious Praises of the True Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 48153	mÚ 5 ] (1099-18) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48154	dyh AMDwrI AMDu suM\I nwm ivhUxIAw ] (1099-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) dayh anDhaaree anDh sunjee naam vihoonee-aa. The body is dark, blind and empty, without the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	nwnk sPl jnµmu jY Git vuTw scu DxI ]2] (1099-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak safal jannam jai ghat vuthaa sach Dhanee. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	O Nanak, fruitful is the birth of one, within whose heart the True Master dwells. ||2||
RECORD	para 48156	mÚ 5 ] (1099-19) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48157	loiex loeI ifT ipAws n buJY mU GxI ] (1099-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) lo-in lo-ee dith pi-aas na bujhai moo ghanee. With my eyes, I have seen the Light; my great thirst for Him is not quenched.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	nwnk sy AKVIAw ibAMin ijnI ifsMdo mw iprI ]3] (1100-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak say akh-rhee-aa bi-ann jinee disando maa piree. ||3||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	O Nanak, these are not the eyes which can see my Beloved Husband Lord. ||3||
RECORD	para 48160	pauVI ] (1100-1) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 48161	ijin jin gurmuiK syivAw iqin siB suK pweI ] (1100-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) jin jan gurmukh sayvi-aa tin sabh sukh paa-ee. That humble being, who, as Gurmukh, serves the Lord, obtains all peace and pleasure.
DEFINE	para 48162	Ehu Awip qirAw kutMb isau sBu jgqu qrweI ] (1100-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) oh aap tari-aa kutamb si-o sabh jagat taraa-ee. He Himself is saved, along with his family, and all the world is saved as well.
DEFINE	para 48163	Ein hir nwmw Dnu sMicAw sB iqKw buJweI ] (1100-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) on har naamaa Dhan sanchi-aa sabh tikhaa bujhaa-ee. He collects the wealth of the Lord's Name, and all his thirst is quenched.
DEFINE	para 48164	Ein Cfy lwlc dunI ky AMqir ilv lweI ] (1100-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) on chhaday laalach dunee kay antar liv laa-ee. He renounces worldly greed, and his inner being is lovingly attuned to the Lord.
RECORD	para 48165	Esu sdw sdw Gir Anµdu hY hir sKw shweI ] (1100-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) os sadaa sadaa ghar anand hai har sakhaa sahaa-ee. Forever and ever, the home of his heart is filled with bliss; the Lord is his companion, help and support.
RECORD	para 48166	Ein vYrI imqR sm kIiqAw sB nwil suBweI ] (1100-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) on vairee mitar sam keeti-aa sabh naal subhaa-ee. He looks alike upon enemy and friend, and wishes well to all.
DEFINE	para 48167	hoAw EhI Alu jg mih gur igAwnu jpweI ] (1100-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) ho-aa ohee al jag meh gur gi-aan japaa-ee. He alone is fulfilled in this world, who meditates on the spiritual wisdom of the Guru.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v16	pUrib iliKAw pwieAw hir isau bix AweI ]16] (1100-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) poorab likhi-aa paa-i-aa har si-o ban aa-ee. ||16||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v16	He obtains what is pre-ordained for him, according to the Lord. ||16||
RECORD	para 48169	fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1100-5) dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48170	scu suhwvw kwFIAY kUVY kUVI soie ] (1100-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) sach suhaavaa kaadhee-ai koorhai koorhee so-ay. The true person is said to be beautiful; false is the reputation of the false.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	nwnk ivrly jwxIAih ijn scu plY hoie ]1] (1100-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak virlay jaanee-ahi jin sach palai ho-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	O Nanak, rare are those who have Truth in their laps. ||1||
RECORD	para 48172	mÚ 5 ] (1100-6) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48173	sjx muKu AnUpu ATy phr inhwlsw ] (1100-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) sajan mukh anoop athay pahar nihaalsaa. The face of my friend, the Lord, is incomparably beautiful; I would watch Him, twenty-four hours a day.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	suqVI so shu ifTu qY supny hau KMnIAY ]2] (1100-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) sut-rhee so saho dith tai supnay ha-o khannee-ai. ||2||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	In sleep, I saw my Husband Lord; I am a sacrifice to that dream. ||2||
RECORD	para 48175	mÚ 5 ] (1100-7) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48176	sjx scu priK muiK Alwvxu QoQrw ] (1100-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) sajan sach parakh mukh alaavan thothraa. O my friend, realize the True Lord. Just to talk about Him is useless.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	mMn mJwhU liK quDhu dUir n su iprI ]3] (1100-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) man majhaahoo lakh tuDhhu door na so piree. ||3||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	See Him within your mind; your Beloved is not far away. ||3||
RECORD	para 48178	pauVI ] (1100-8) pa-orhee. Pauree:
REQUIRE	para 48179	Driq Awkwsu pwqwlu hY cMdu sUru ibnwsI ] (1100-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) Dharat aakaas paataal hai chand soor binaasee. The earth, the Akaashic ethers of the sky, the nether regions of the underworld, the moon and the sun shall pass away.
REQUIRE	para 48180	bwidswh swh aumrwv Kwn Fwih fyry jwsI ] (1100-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) baadisaah saah umraav khaan dhaahi dayray jaasee. Emperors, bankers, rulers and leaders shall depart, and their homes shall be demolished.
REQUIRE	para 48181	rMg quMg grIb msq sBu loku isDwsI ] (1100-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) rang tung gareeb masat sabh lok siDhaasee. The poor and the rich, the humble and the intoxicated, all these people shall pass away.
REQUIRE	para 48182	kwjI syK mswiekw sBy auiT jwsI ] (1100-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaajee saykh masaa-ikaa sabhay uth jaasee. The Qazis, Shaykhs and preachers shall all arise and depart.
REQUIRE	para 48183	pIr pYkwbr AaulIey ko iQru n rhwsI ] (1100-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) peer paikaabar a-ulee-ay ko thir na rahaasee. The spiritual teachers, prophets and disciples - none of these shall remain permanently.
RECORD	para 48184	rojw bwg invwj kqyb ivxu buJy sB jwsI ] (1100-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) rojaa baag nivaaj katayb vin bujhay sabh jaasee. Fasts, calls to prayer and sacred scriptures - without understanding, all these shall vanish.
REQUIRE	para 48185	lK caurwsIh mydnI sB AwvY jwsI ] (1100-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) lakh cha-oraaseeh maydnee sabh aavai jaasee. The 8.4 million species of beings of the earth shall all continue coming and going in reincarnation.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v17	inhclu scu Kudwie eyku Kudwie bMdw AibnwsI ]17] (1100-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) nihchal sach khudaa-ay ayk khudaa-ay bandaa abhinaasee. ||17||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v17	The One True Lord God is eternal and unchanging. The Lord's slave is also eternal. ||17||
RECORD	para 48187	fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1100-12) dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48188	ifTI hB FMFoil ihksu bwJu n koie ] (1100-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) dithee habh dhandhol hikas baajh na ko-ay. I have seen and examined all; without the One Lord, there is none at all.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	Awau sjx qU muiK lgu myrw qnu mnu TMFw hoie ]1] (1100-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) aa-o sajan too mukh lag mayraa tan man thandhaa ho-ay. ||1||
ALLOW	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	Come, and show me Your face, O my friend, so that my body and mind may be cooled and soothed. ||1||
RECORD	para 48190	mÚ 5 ] (1100-13) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48191	Awsku Awsw bwhrw mU min vfI Aws ] (1100-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) aasak aasaa baahraa moo man vadee aas. The lover is without hope, but within my mind, there is great hope.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	Aws inrwsw ihku qU hau bil bil bil geIAws ]2] (1100-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) aas niraasaa hik too ha-o bal bal bal ga-ee-aas. ||2||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	In the midst of hope, only You, O Lord, remain free of hope; I am a sacrifice, a sacrifice, a sacrifice to You. ||2||
RECORD	para 48193	mÚ 5 ] (1100-14) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
WHEN	para 48194	ivCoVw suxy fuKu ivxu ifTy mirEid ] (1100-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) vichhorhaa sunay dukh vin dithay mari-od. Even if I just hear of separation from You, I am in pain; without seeing You, O Lord, I die.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	bwJu ipAwry Awpxy ibrhI nw DIroid ]3] (1100-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) baajh pi-aaray aapnay birhee naa Dheerod. ||3||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	Without her Beloved, the separated lover takes no comfort. ||3||
RECORD	para 48196	pauVI ] (1100-15) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 48197	qt qIrQ dyv dyvwilAw kydwru mQurw kwsI ] (1100-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) tat tirath dayv dayvaali-aa kaydaar mathuraa kaasee. River-banks, sacred shrines, idols, temples, and places of pilgrimage like Kaydarnaat'h, Mat'huraa and Benares,
REQUIRE	para 48198	koit qyqIsw dyvqy sxu ieMdRY jwsI ] (1100-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) kot tayteesaa dayvtay san indrai jaasee. the three hundred thirty million gods, along with Indra, shall all pass away.
RECORD	para 48199	isimRiq swsqR byd cwir Ktu drs smwsI ] (1100-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) simrit saastar bayd chaar khat daras samaasee. The Simritees, Shaastras, the four Vedas and the six systems of philosophy shall vanish.
REQUIRE	para 48200	poQI pMifq gIq kivq kvqy BI jwsI ] (1100-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) pothee pandit geet kavit kavtay bhee jaasee. Prayer books, Pandits, religious scholars, songs, poems and poets shall also depart.
DEFINE	para 48201	jqI sqI sMinAwsIAw siB kwlY vwsI ] (1100-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) jatee satee sanni-aasee-aa sabh kaalai vaasee. Those who are celibate, truthful and charitiable, and the Sannyaasee hermits are all subject to death.
RECORD	para 48202	muin jogI idgMbrw jmY sxu jwsI ] (1100-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) mun jogee digambraa jamai san jaasee. The silent sages, the Yogis and the nudists, along with the Messengers of Death, shall pass away.
REQUIRE	para 48203	jo dIsY so ivxsxw sB ibnis ibnwsI ] (1100-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) jo deesai so vinsanaa sabh binas binaasee. Whatever is seen shall perish; all will dissolve and disappear.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v18	iQru pwrbRhmu prmysro syvku iQru hosI ]18] (1100-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) thir paarbarahm parmaysaro sayvak thir hosee. ||18||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v18	Only the Supreme Lord God, the Transcendent Lord, is permanent. His servant becomes permanent as well. ||18||
RECORD	para 48205	slok fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1100-18) salok dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Shalok Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 48206	sY nµgy nh nµg BuKy lK n BuiKAw ] (1100-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) sai nangay nah nang bhukhay lakh na bhukhi-aa. Hundreds of times naked does not make the person naked; tens of thousands of hungers do not make him hungry;
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	fuKy koiV n fuK nwnk iprI ipKMdo suB idsit ]1] (1100-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) dukhay korh na dukh naanak piree pikhando subh disat. ||1||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	millions of pains do not cause him pain. O Nanak, the Husband Lord blesses him with his Glance of Grace. ||1||
RECORD	para 48209	mÚ 5 ] (1101-1) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
WHEN	para 48210	suK smUhw Bog BUim sbweI ko DxI ] (1101-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) sukh samoohaa bhog bhoom sabaa-ee ko Dhanee. Even if one were to enjoy all pleasures, and be master of the entire earth,
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	nwnk hBo rogu imrqk nwm ivhUixAw ]2] (1101-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak habho rog mirtak naam vihooni-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	O Nanak, all of that is just a disease. Without the Naam, he is dead. ||2||
RECORD	para 48212	mÚ 5 ] (1101-2) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 48213	ihks kUM qU Awih pCwxU BI ihku kir ] (1101-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) hikas koo N too aahi pachhaanoo bhee hik kar. Yearn for the One Lord, and make Him your friend.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	nwnk AwsVI inbwih mwnuK prQweI ljIvdo ]3] (1101-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak aasrhee nibaahi maanukh parthaa-ee lajeevdo. ||3||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	O Nanak, He alone fulfills your hopes; you should feel embarrassed, visiting other places. ||3||
RECORD	para 48215	pauVI ] (1101-3) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 48216	inhclu eyku nrwiexo hir Agm AgwDw ] (1101-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) nihchal ayk naaraa-ino har agam agaaDhaa. The One and only Lord is eternal, imperishable, inaccessible and incomprehensible.
RECORD	para 48217	inhclu nwmu inDwnu hY ijsu ismrq hir lwDw ] (1101-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) nihchal naam niDhaan hai jis simrat har laaDhaa. The treasure of the Naam is eternal and imperishable. Meditating in remembrance on Him, the Lord is attained.
RECORD	para 48218	inhclu kIrqnu gux goibMd gurmuiK gwvwDw ] (1101-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) nihchal keertan gun gobind gurmukh gaavaaDhaa. The Kirtan of His Praises is eternal and imperishable; the Gurmukh sings the Glorious Praises of the Lord of the Universe.
UPHOLD	para 48219	scu Drmu qpu inhclo idnu rYin ArwDw ] (1101-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) sach Dharam tap nihchalo din rain araaDhaa. Truth, righteousness, Dharma and intense meditation are eternal and imperishable. Day and night, worship the Lord in adoration.
UPHOLD	para 48220	dieAw Drmu qpu inhclo ijsu krim ilKwDw ] (1101-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) da-i-aa Dharam tap nihchalo jis karam likhaaDhaa. Compassion, righteousness, Dharma and intense meditation are eternal and imperishable; they alone obtain these, who have such pre-ordained destiny.
RECORD	para 48221	inhclu msqik lyKu iliKAw so tlY n tlwDw ] (1101-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) nihchal mastak laykh likhi-aa so talai na talaaDhaa. The inscription inscribed upon one's forehead is eternal and imperishable; it cannot be avoided by avoidance.
RECORD	para 48222	inhcl sMgiq swD jn bcn inhclu gur swDw ] (1101-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) nihchal sangat saaDh jan bachan nihchal gur saaDhaa. The Congregation, the Company of the Holy, and the word of the humble, are eternal and imperishable. The Holy Guru is eternal and imperishable.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v19	ijn kau pUrib iliKAw iqn sdw sdw AwrwDw ]19] (1101-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) jin ka-o poorab likhi-aa tin sadaa sadaa aaraaDhaa. ||19||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v19	Those who have such pre-ordained destiny worship and adore the Lord, forever and ever. ||19||
RECORD	para 48224	slok fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1101-7) salok dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Shalok, Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 48225	jo fubMdo Awip so qrwey ikn@ Ky ] (1101-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) jo dubando aap so taraa-ay kin H khay. One who himself has drowned - how can he carry anyone else across?
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	qwrydVo BI qwir nwnk ipr isau riqAw ]1] (1101-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) taaraydarho bhee taar naanak pir si-o rati-aa. ||1||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	One who is imbued with the Love of the Husband Lord - O Nanak, he himself is saved, and he saves others as well. ||1||
RECORD	para 48227	mÚ 5 ] (1101-8) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 48228	ijQY koie kQMin nwau suxMdo mw iprI ] (1101-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) jithai ko-ay kathann naa-o sunando maa piree. Wherever someone speaks and hears the Name of my Beloved Lord,
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	mUM julwaUN qiQ nwnk iprI psMdo hirE QIEis ]2] (1101-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) mooN julaa-oo N tath naanak piree pasando hari-o thee-os. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	that is where I go, O Nanak, to see Him, and blossom forth in bliss. ||2||
RECORD	para 48230	mÚ 5 ] (1101-9) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48231	myrI myrI ikAw krih puqR klqR snyh ] (1101-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) mayree mayree ki-aa karahi putar kaltar sanayh. You are in love with your children and your wife; why do you keep calling them your own?
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	nwnk nwm ivhUxIAw inmuxIAwdI dyh ]3] (1101-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak naam vihoonee-aa nimunee-aadee dayh. ||3||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	O Nanak, without the Naam, the Name of the Lord, the human body has no foundation. ||3||
RECORD	para 48233	pauVI ] (1101-10) pa-orhee. Pauree:
UPHOLD	para 48234	nYnI dyKau gur drsno gur crxI mQw ] (1101-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) nainee daykh-a-u gur darsano gur charnee mathaa. With my eyes, I gaze upon the Blessed Vision of the Guru's Darshan; I touch my forehead to the Guru's feet.
RECORD	para 48235	pYrI mwrig gur cldw pKw PyrI hQw ] (1101-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) pairee maarag gur chaldaa pakhaa fayree hathaa. With my feet I walk on the Guru's Path; with my hands, I wave the fan over Him.
RECORD	para 48236	Akwl mUriq irdY iDAwiedw idnu rYin jpMQw ] (1101-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) akaal moorat ridai Dhi-aa-idaa din rain japanthaa. I meditate on Akaal Moorat, the undying form, within my heart; day and night, I meditate on Him.
RECORD	para 48237	mY CifAw sgl Apwiexo BrvwsY gur smrQw ] (1101-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) mai chhadi-aa sagal apaa-ino bharvaasai gur samrathaa. I have renounced all possessiveness, and have placed my faith in the all-powerful Guru.
UPHOLD	para 48238	guir bKisAw nwmu inDwnu sBo duKu lQw ] (1101-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur bakhsi-aa naam niDhaan sabho dukh lathaa. The Guru has blessed me with the treasure of the Naam; I am rid of all sufferings.
RECORD	para 48239	Boghu BuMchu BweIho plY nwmu AgQw ] (1101-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) bhogahu bhunchahu bhaa-eeho palai naam agthaa. Eat and enjoy the Naam, the Name of the indescribable Lord, O Siblings of Destiny.
RECORD	para 48240	nwmu dwnu iesnwnu idVu sdw krhu gur kQw ] (1101-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) naam daan isnaan dirh sadaa karahu gur kathaa. Confirm your faith in the Naam, charity and self-purification; chant the Guru's sermon forever.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v20	shju BieAw pRBu pwieAw jm kw Bau lQw ]20] (1101-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) sahj bha-i-aa parabh paa-i-aa jam kaa bha-o lathaa. ||20||
UPHOLD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v20	Blessed with intuitive poise, I have found God; I am rid of the fear of the Messenger of Death. ||20||
RECORD	para 48242	slok fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1101-14) salok dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Shalok, Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 48243	lgVIAw iprIAMin pyKMdIAw nw iqpIAw ] (1101-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) lagrhee-aa piree-ann paykhandee-aa naa tipee-aa. I am centered and focused on my Beloved, but I am not satisfied, even by seeing Him.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	hB mJwhU so DxI ibAw n ifTo koie ]1] (1101-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) habh majhaahoo so Dhanee bi-aa na ditho ko-ay. ||1||
