RECORD	para 48245	mÚ 5 ] (1101-15) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48246	kQVIAw sMqwh qy suKwaU pMDIAw ] (1101-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) kathrhee-aa santaah tay sukhaa-oo panDhee-aa. The sayings of the Saints are the paths of peace.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	nwnk lDVIAw iqMnwh ijnw Bwgu mQwhVY ]2] (1101-15, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak laDh-rhee-aa tinnaah jinaa bhaag mathaaharhai. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	O Nanak, they alone obtain them, upon whose foreheads such destiny is written. ||2||
RECORD	para 48248	mÚ 5 ] (1101-16) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48249	fUMgir jlw Qlw BUim bnw Pl kMdrw ] (1101-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) doongar jalaa thalaa bhoom banaa fal kandraa. He is totally permeating the mountains, oceans, deserts, lands, forests, orchards, caves,
RECORD	para 48250	pwqwlw Awkws pUrnu hB Gtw ] (1101-16, mwrU, mÚ 5) paataalaa aakaas pooran habh ghataa. the nether regions of the underworld, the Akaashic ethers of the skies, and all hearts.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	nwnk pyiK jIE iekqu sUiq proqIAw ]3] (1101-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak paykh jee-o ikat soot parotee-aa. ||3||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	Nanak sees that they are all strung on the same thread. ||3||
RECORD	para 48252	pauVI ] (1101-17) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 48253	hir jI mwqw hir jI ipqw hir jIau pRiqpwlk ] (1101-17, mwrU, mÚ 5) har jee maataa har jee pitaa har jee-o partipaalak. The Dear Lord is my mother, the Dear Lord is my father; the Dear Lord cherishes and nurtures me.
RECORD	para 48254	hir jI myrI swr kry hm hir ky bwlk ] (1101-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) har jee mayree saar karay ham har kay baalak. The Dear Lord takes care of me; I am the child of the Lord.
RECORD	para 48255	shjy shij iKlwiedw nhI krdw Awlk ] (1101-18, mwrU, mÚ 5) sehjay sahj khilaa-idaa nahee kardaa aalak. Slowly and steadily, He feeds me; He never fails.
RECORD	para 48256	Aaugxu ko n icqwrdw gl syqI lwiek ] (1101-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) a-ugan ko na chitaardaa gal saytee laa-ik. He does not remind me of my faults; He hugs me close in His embrace.
DEFINE	para 48257	muih mMgW soeI dyvdw hir ipqw suKdwiek ] (1101-19, mwrU, mÚ 5) muhi mangaa N so-ee dayvdaa har pitaa sukh-daa-ik. Whatever I ask for, He give me; the Lord is my peace-giving father.
UPHOLD	para 48259	igAwnu rwis nwmu Dnu sauipEnu iesu saudy lwiek ] (1102-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) gi-aan raas naam Dhan sa-opi-on is sa-uday laa-ik. He has blessed me with the capital, the wealth of spiritual wisdom; He has made me worthy of this merchandise.
RECORD	para 48260	swJI gur nwil bhwilAw srb suK pwiek ] (1102-1, mwrU, mÚ 5) saajhee gur naal bahaali-aa sarab sukh paa-ik. He has made me a partner with the Guru; I have obtained all peace and comforts.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v21	mY nwlhu kdy n ivCuVY hir ipqw sBnw glw lwiek ]21] (1102-2, mwrU, mÚ 5) mai naalahu kaday na vichhurhai har pitaa sabhnaa galaa laa-ik. ||21||
REQUIRE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v21	He is with me, and shall never separate from me; the Lord, my father, is potent to do everything. ||21||
RECORD	para 48262	slok fKxy mÚ 5 ] (1102-2) salok dakh-nay mehlaa 5. Shalok, Dakhanay, Fifth Mehl:
WHEN	para 48263	nwnk kciVAw isau qoiV FUiF sjx sMq pikAw ] (1102-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak kachrhi-aa si-o torh dhoodh sajan sant paki-aa. O Nanak, break away from the false, and seek out the Saints, your true friends.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	Eie jIvMdy ivCuVih Eie muieAw n jwhI CoiV ]1] (1102-3, mwrU, mÚ 5) o-ay jeevanday vichhurheh o-ay mu-i-aa na jaahee chhorh. ||1||
FORBID	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	The false shall leave you, even while you are still alive; but the Saints shall not forsake you, even when you are dead. ||1||
RECORD	para 48265	mÚ 5 ] (1102-4) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 48266	nwnk ibjulIAw cmkMin Gurin@ Gtw Aiq kwlIAw ] (1102-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) naanak bijulee-aa chamkann ghurni H ghataa at kaalee-aa. O Nanak, the lightning flashes, and thunder echoes in the dark black clouds.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	brsin myG Apwr nwnk sMgim iprI suhMdIAw ]2] (1102-4, mwrU, mÚ 5) barsan maygh apaar naanak sangam piree suhandee-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	The downpour from the clouds is heavy; O Nanak, the soul-brides are exalted and embellished with their Beloved. ||2||
