DEFINE	para 48270	syjVIAw soieMn hIry lwl jVMdIAw ] (1102-5, mwrU, mÚ 5) sayjrhee-aa so-inn heeray laal jarhandee-aa. Her bed is adorned with gold, diamonds and rubies;
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	suBr kpV Bog nwnk iprI ivhUxI qqIAw ]3] (1102-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) subhar kaparh bhog naanak piree vihoonee tatee-aa. ||3||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	she is blessed with beautiful gowns and delicacies, O Nanak, but without her Beloved, she burns in agony. ||3||
RECORD	para 48272	pauVI ] (1102-6) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 48273	kwrxu krqY jo kIAw soeI hY krxw ] (1102-6, mwrU, mÚ 5) kaaran kartai jo kee-aa so-ee hai karnaa. He does the dees which the Creator causes him to do.
REQUIRE	para 48274	jy sau Dwvih pRwxIAw pwvih Duir lhxw ] (1102-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) jay sa-o Dhaaveh paraanee-aa paavahi Dhur lahnaa. Even if you run in hundreds of directions, O mortal, you shall still receive what you are pre-destined to receive.
REQUIRE	para 48275	ibnu krmw ikCU n lBeI jy iPrih sB Drxw ] (1102-7, mwrU, mÚ 5) bin karmaa kichhoo na labh-ee jay fireh sabh Dharnaa. Without good karma, you shall obtain nothing, even if you wander across the whole world.
REQUIRE	para 48276	gur imil Bau goivMd kw BY fru dUir krxw ] (1102-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) gur mil bha-o govind kaa bhai dar door karnaa. Meeting with the Guru, you shall know the Fear of God, and other fears shall be taken away.
RECORD	para 48277	BY qy bYrwgu aUpjY hir Kojq iPrxw ] (1102-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) bhai tay bairaag oopjai har khojat firnaa. Through the Fear of God, the attitude of detachment wells up, and one sets out in search of the Lord.
DEFINE	para 48278	Kojq Kojq shju aupijAw iPir jnim n mrxw ] (1102-8, mwrU, mÚ 5) khojat khojat sahj upji-aa fir janam na marnaa. Searching and searching, intuitive wisdom wells up, and then, one is not born to die again.
RECORD	para 48279	ihAwie kmwie iDAwieAw pwieAw swD srxw ] (1102-9, mwrU, mÚ 5) hi-aa-ay kamaa-ay Dhi-aa-i-aa paa-i-aa saaDh sarnaa. Practicing meditation within my heart, I have found the Sanctuary of the Holy.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v22	boihQu nwnk dyau guru ijsu hir cVwey iqsu Baujlu qrxw ]22] (1102-10, mwrU, mÚ 5) bohith naanak day-o gur jis har charhaa-ay tis bha-ojal tarnaa. ||22||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v22	Whoever the Lord places on the boat of Guru Nanak, is carried across the terrifying world-ocean. ||22||
RECORD	para 48281	slok mÚ 5 ] (1102-10) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Dakhanay Fifth Mehl:
