ALLOW	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v1	Become the dust of the feet of all, and then, you may come to me. ||1||
RECORD	para 48284	mÚ 5 ] (1102-11) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 48285	muAw jIvMdw pyKu jIvMdy mir jwin ] (1102-11, mwrU, mÚ 5) mu-aa jeevandaa paykh jeevanday mar jaan. See, that only one who has died, truly lives; one who is alive, consider him dead.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	ijn@w muhbiq iek isau qy mwxs prDwn ]2] (1102-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) jin Haa muhabat ik si-o tay maanas parDhaan. ||2||
DEFINE	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v2	Those who are in love with the One Lord, are the supreme people. ||2||
RECORD	para 48287	mÚ 5 ] (1102-12) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 48288	ijsu min vsY pwrbRhmu inkit n AwvY pIr ] (1102-12, mwrU, mÚ 5) jis man vasai paarbarahm nikat na aavai peer. Pain does not even approach that person, within whose mind God abides.
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	BuK iqK iqsu n ivAwpeI jmu nhI AwvY nIr ]3] (1102-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) bhukh tikh tis na vi-aapa-ee jam nahee aavai neer. ||3||
RECORD	mwrU vwr mhlw 5 fKxy mÚ 5 v3	Hunger and thirst do not affect him, and the Messenger of Death does not approach him. ||3||
RECORD	para 48290	pauVI ] (1102-13) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 48291	kImiq khxu n jweIAY scu swh AfolY ] (1102-13, mwrU, mÚ 5) keemat kahan na jaa-ee-ai sach saah adolai. Your worth cannot be estimated, O True, Unmoving Lord God.
RECORD	para 48292	isD swiDk igAwnI iDAwnIAw kauxu quDuno qolY ] (1102-14, mwrU, mÚ 5) siDh saaDhik gi-aanee Dhi-aanee-aa ka-un tuDhuno tolai. The Siddhas, seekers, spiritual teachers and meditators - who among them can measure You?
