RECORD	para 48452	<> siqgur pRswid ] (1107-2) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
RECORD	para 48453	qU suix ikrq krMmw purib kmwieAw ] isir isir suK shMmw dyih su qU Blw ] (1107-3, quKwrI, mÚ 1) too sun kirat karammaa purab kamaa-i-aa. sir sir sukh sahammaa deh so too bhalaa. Listen: according to the karma of their past actions, each and every person experiences happiness or sorrow; whatever You give, Lord, is good.
RECORD	para 48454	hir rcnw qyrI ikAw giq myrI hir ibnu GVI n jIvw ] (1107-3, quKwrI, mÚ 1) har rachnaa tayree ki-aa gat mayree har bin gharhee na jeevaa. O Lord, the Created Universe is Yours; what is my condition? Without the Lord, I cannot survive, even for an instant.
RECORD	para 48455	ipRA bwJu duhylI koie n bylI gurmuiK AMimRqu pIvW ] (1107-4, quKwrI, mÚ 1) pari-a baajh duhaylee ko-ay na baylee gurmukh amrit peevaa N. Without my Beloved, I am miserable; I have no friend at all. As Gurmukh, I drink in the Ambrosial Nectar.
DEFINE	para 48456	rcnw rwic rhy inrMkwrI pRB min krm sukrmw ] (1107-5, quKwrI, mÚ 1) rachnaa raach rahay nirankaaree parabh man karam sukarmaa. The Formless Lord is contained in His Creation. To obey God is the best course of action.
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v1	nwnk pMQu inhwly sw Dn qU suix Awqm rwmw ]1] (1107-5, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak panth nihaalay saa Dhan too sun aatam raamaa. ||1||
DEFINE	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v1	O Nanak, the soul-bride is gazing upon Your Path; please listen, O Supreme Soul. ||1||
RECORD	para 48458	bwbIhw ipRau boly koikl bwxIAw ] (1107-6, quKwrI, mÚ 1) baabeehaa pari-o bolay kokil baanee-aa. The rainbird cries out, "Pri-o! Beloved!", and the song-bird sings the Lord's Bani.
RECORD	para 48459	sw Dn siB rs colY AMik smwxIAw ] (1107-6, quKwrI, mÚ 1) saa Dhan sabh ras cholai ank samaanee-aa. The soul-bride enjoys all the pleasures, and merges in the Being of her Beloved.
WHEN	para 48460	hir AMik smwxI jw pRB BwxI sw sohwgix nwry ] (1107-7, quKwrI, mÚ 1) har ank samaanee jaa parabh bhaanee saa sohagan naaray. She merges into the Being of her Beloved, when she becomes pleasing to God; she is the happy, blessed soul-bride.
RECORD	para 48461	nv Gr Qwip mhl Gru aUcau inj Gir vwsu murwry ] (1107-7, quKwrI, mÚ 1) nav ghar thaap mahal ghar oocha-o nij ghar vaas muraaray. Establishing the nine houses, and the Royal Mansion of the Tenth Gate above them, the Lord dwells in that home deep within the self.
DEFINE	para 48462	sB qyrI qU myrw pRIqmu inis bwsur rMig rwvY ] (1107-8, quKwrI, mÚ 1) sabh tayree too mayraa pareetam nis baasur rang raavai. All are Yours, You are my Beloved; night and day, I celebrate Your Love.
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v2	nwnk ipRau ipRau cvY bbIhw koikl sbid suhwvY ]2] (1107-8, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak pari-o pari-o chavai babeehaa kokil sabad suhaavai. ||2||
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v2	O Nanak, the rainbird cries out, "Pri-o! Pri-o! Beloved! Beloved!" The song-bird is embellished with the Word of the Shabad. ||2||
RECORD	para 48464	qU suix hir rs iBMny pRIqm Awpxy ] (1107-9, quKwrI, mÚ 1) too sun har ras bhinnay pareetam aapnay. Please listen, O my Beloved Lord - I am drenched with Your Love.
DEFINE	para 48465	min qin rvq rvMny GVI n bIsrY ] (1107-9, quKwrI, mÚ 1) man tan ravat ravannay gharhee na beesrai. My mind and body are absorbed in dwelling on You; I cannot forget You, even for an instant.
RECORD	para 48466	ikau GVI ibswrI hau bilhwrI hau jIvw gux gwey ] (1107-10, quKwrI, mÚ 1) ki-o gharhee bisaaree ha-o balihaaree ha-o jeevaa gun gaa-ay. How could I forget You, even for an instant? I am a sacrifice to You; singing Your Glorious Praises, I live.
DEFINE	para 48467	nw koeI myrw hau iksu kyrw hir ibnu rhxu n jwey ] (1107-10, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naa ko-ee mayraa ha-o kis kayraa har bin rahan na jaa-ay. No one is mine; unto whom do I belong? Without the Lord, I cannot survive.
RECORD	para 48468	Et ghI hir crx invwsy Bey pivqR srIrw ] (1107-11, quKwrI, mÚ 1) ot gahee har charan nivaasay bha-ay pavitar sareeraa. I have grasped the Support of the Lord's Feet; dwelling there, my body has become immaculate.
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v3	nwnk idRsit dIrG suKu pwvY gur sbdI mnu DIrw ]3] (1107-11, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak darisat deeragh sukh paavai gur sabdee man Dheeraa. ||3||
DEFINE	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v3	O Nanak, I have obtained profound insight, and found peace; my mind is comforted by the Word of the Guru's Shabad. ||3||
DEFINE	para 48470	brsY AMimRq Dwr bUMd suhwvxI ] (1107-12, quKwrI, mÚ 1) barsai amrit Dhaar boond suhaavanee. The Ambrosial Nectar rains down on us! Its drops are so delightful!
RECORD	para 48471	swjn imly shij suBwie hir isau pRIiq bxI ] (1107-12, quKwrI, mÚ 1) saajan milay sahj subhaa-ay har si-o pareet banee. Meeting the Guru, the Best Friend, with intuitive ease, the mortal falls in love with the Lord.
WHEN	para 48472	hir mMdir AwvY jw pRB BwvY Dn aUBI gux swrI ] (1107-13, quKwrI, mÚ 1) har mandar aavai jaa parabh bhaavai Dhan oobhee gun saaree. The Lord comes into the temple of the body, when it pleases God's Will; the soul-bride rises up, and sings His Glorious Praises.
RECORD	para 48473	Gir Gir kMqu rvY sohwgix hau ikau kMiq ivswrI ] (1107-13, quKwrI, mÚ 1) ghar ghar kant ravai sohagan ha-o ki-o kant visaaree. In each and every home, the Husband Lord ravishes and enjoys the happy soul- brides; so why has He forgotten me?
RECORD	para 48474	auniv Gn Cwey brsu suBwey min qin pRymu suKwvY ] (1107-14, quKwrI, mÚ 1) unav ghan chhaa-ay baras subhaa-ay man tan paraym sukhaavai. The sky is overcast with heavy, low-hanging clouds; the rain is delightful, and my Beloved's Love is pleasing to my mind and body.
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v4	nwnk vrsY AMimRq bwxI kir ikrpw Gir AwvY ]4] (1107-15, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak varsai amrit banee kar kirpaa ghar aavai. ||4||
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v4	O Nanak, the Ambrosial Nectar of Gurbani rains down; the Lord, in His Grace, has come into the home of my heart. ||4||
RECORD	para 48476	cyqu bsMqu Blw Bvr suhwvVy ] (1107-15, quKwrI, mÚ 1) chayt basant bhalaa bhavar suhaavrhay. In the month of Chayt, the lovely spring has come, and the bumble bees hum with joy.
DEFINE	para 48478	bn PUly mMJ bwir mY ipru Gir bwhuVY ] (1108-1, quKwrI, mÚ 1) ban foolay manjh baar mai pir ghar baahurhai. The forest is blossoming in front of my door; if only my Beloved would return to my home!
WHEN	para 48479	ipru Gir nhI AwvY Dn ikau suKu pwvY ibrih ibroD qnu CIjY ] (1108-1, quKwrI, mÚ 1) pir ghar nahee aavai Dhan ki-o sukh paavai bireh biroDh tan chheejai. If her Husband Lord does not return home, how can the soul-bride find peace? Her body is wasting away with the sorrow of separation.
RECORD	para 48480	koikl AMib suhwvI bolY ikau duKu AMik shIjY ] (1108-2, quKwrI, mÚ 1) kokil amb suhaavee bolai ki-o dukh ank saheejai. The beautiful song-bird sings, perched on the mango tree; but how can I endure the pain in the depths of my being?
RECORD	para 48481	Bvru BvMqw PUlI fwlI ikau jIvw mru mwey ] (1108-2, quKwrI, mÚ 1) bhavar bhavantaa foolee daalee ki-o jeevaa mar maa-ay. The bumble bee is buzzing around the flowering branches; but how can I survive? I am dying, O my mother!
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v5	nwnk cyiq shij suKu pwvY jy hir vru Gir Dn pwey ]5] (1108-3, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak chayt sahj sukh paavai jay har var ghar Dhan paa-ay. ||5||
DEFINE	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v5	O Nanak, in Chayt, peace is easily obtained, if the soul-bride obtains the Lord as her Husband, within the home of her own heart. ||5||
DEFINE	para 48483	vYswKu Blw swKw vys kry ] (1108-3, quKwrI, mÚ 1) vaisaakh bhalaa saakhaa vays karay. Baisakhi is so pleasant; the branches blossom with new leaves.
RECORD	para 48484	Dn dyKY hir duAwir Awvhu dieAw kry ] (1108-4, quKwrI, mÚ 1) Dhan daykhai har du-aar aavhu da-i-aa karay. The soul-bride yearns to see the Lord at her door. Come, O Lord, and take pity on me!
RECORD	para 48485	Gir Awau ipAwry duqr qwry quDu ibnu AFu n molo ] (1108-4, quKwrI, mÚ 1) ghar aa-o pi-aaray dutar taaray tuDh bin adh na molo. Please come home, O my Beloved; carry me across the treacherous world-ocean. Without You, I am not worth even a shell.
WHEN	para 48486	kImiq kaux kry quDu BwvW dyiK idKwvY Folo ] (1108-5, quKwrI, mÚ 1) keemat ka-un karay tuDh bhaavaaN daykh dikhaavai dholo. Who can estimate my worth, if I am pleasing to You? I see You, and inspire others to see You, O my Love.
RECORD	para 48487	dUir n jwnw AMqir mwnw hir kw mhlu pCwnw ] (1108-5, quKwrI, mÚ 1) door na jaanaa antar maanaa har kaa mahal pachhaanaa. I know that You are not far away; I believe that You are deep within me, and I realize Your Presence.
