RECORD	para 48498	rQu iPrY CwieAw Dn qwkY tIfu lvY mMiJ bwry ] (1108-10, quKwrI, mÚ 1) rath firai chhaa-i-aa Dhan taakai teed lavai manjh baaray. His chariot moves on, and the soul-bride seeks shade; the crickets are chirping in the forest.
