RECORD	para 48511	mCr fMg swier Br suBr ibnu hir ikau suKu pweIAY ] (1108-17, quKwrI, mÚ 1) machhar dang saa-ir bhar subhar bin har ki-o sukh paa-ee-ai. The mosquitoes bite and sting, and the ponds are filled to overflowing; without the Lord, how can she find peace?
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v10	nwnk pUiC clau gur Apuny jh pRBu qh hI jweIAY ]10] (1108-18, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak poochh chala-o gur apunay jah parabh tah hee jaa-ee-ai. ||10||
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v10	O Nanak, I will go and ask my Guru; wherever God is, there I will go. ||10||
DEFINE	para 48513	Asuin Awau iprw sw Dn JUir mueI ] (1108-19, quKwrI, mÚ 1) asun aa-o piraa saa Dhan jhoor mu-ee. In Assu, come, my Beloved; the soul-bride is grieving to death.
DEFINE	para 48514	qw imlIAY pRB myly dUjY Bwie KueI ] (1108-19, quKwrI, mÚ 1) taa milee-ai parabh maylay doojai bhaa-ay khu-ee. She can only meet Him, when God leads her to meet Him; she is ruined by the love of duality.
WHEN	para 48515	JUiT ivguqI qw ipr muqI kukh kwh is Puly ] (1108-19, quKwrI, mÚ 1) jhooth vigutee taa pir mutee kukah kaah se fulay. If she is plundered by falsehood, then her Beloved forsakes her. Then, the white flowers of old age blossom in my hair.
RECORD	para 48517	AwgY Gwm ipCY ruiq jwfw dyiK clq mnu foly ] (1109-1, quKwrI, mÚ 1) aagai ghaam pichhai rut jaadaa daykh chalat man dolay. Summer is now behind us, and the winter season is ahead. Gazing upon this play, my shaky mind wavers.
DEFINE	para 48518	dh idis swK hrI hrIAwvl shij pkY so mITw ] (1109-1, quKwrI, mÚ 1) dah dis saakh haree haree-aaval sahj pakai so meethaa. In all ten directions, the branches are green and alive. That which ripens slowly, is sweet.
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v11	nwnk Asuin imlhu ipAwry siqgur Bey bsITw ]11] (1109-2, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak asun milhu pi-aaray satgur bha-ay baseethaa. ||11||
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v11	O Nanak, in Assu, please meet me, my Beloved. The True Guru has become my Advocate and Friend. ||11||
DEFINE	para 48520	kqik ikrqu pieAw jo pRB BwieAw ] (1109-2, quKwrI, mÚ 1) katak kirat pa-i-aa jo parabh bhaa-i-aa. In Katak, that alone comes to pass, which is pleasing to the Will of God.
RECORD	para 48521	dIpku shij blY qiq jlwieAw ] (1109-3, quKwrI, mÚ 1) deepak sahj balai tat jalaa-i-aa. The lamp of intuition burns, lit by the essence of reality.
RECORD	para 48522	dIpk rs qylo Dn ipr mylo Dn EmwhY srsI ] (1109-3, quKwrI, mÚ 1) deepak ras taylo Dhan pir maylo Dhan omaahai sarsee. Love is the oil in the lamp, which unites the soul-bride with her Lord. The bride is delighted, in ecstasy.
RECORD	para 48523	Avgx mwrI mrY n sIJY guix mwrI qw mrsI ] (1109-4, quKwrI, mÚ 1) avgan maaree marai na seejhai gun maaree taa marsee. One who dies in faults and demerits - her death is not successful. But one who dies in glorious virtue, really truly dies.
