RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v12	nwnk imlhu kpt dr Kolhu eyk GVI Ktu mwsw ]12] (1109-5, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak milhu kapat dar kholahu ayk gharhee khat maasaa. ||12||
DEFINE	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v12	Nanak: please open the shutters of Your Door, O Lord, and meet me. A single moment is like six months to me. ||12||
DEFINE	para 48526	mMGr mwhu Blw hir gux AMik smwvey ] (1109-5, quKwrI, mÚ 1) manghar maahu bhalaa har gun ank samaav-ay. The month of Maghar is good, for those who sing the Glorious Praises of the Lord, and merge in His Being.
