DEFINE	para 48528	inhclu cquru sujwxu ibDwqw cMclu jgqu sbwieAw ] (1109-6, quKwrI, mÚ 1) nihchal chatur sujaan biDhaataa chanchal jagat sabaa-i-aa. The Primal Lord is Unmoving and Unchanging, Clever and Wise; all the world is fickle.
