RECORD	para 48530	gIq nwd kivq kvy suix rwm nwim duKu BwgY ] (1109-7, quKwrI, mÚ 1) geet naad kavit kavay sun raam naam dukh bhaagai. I have heard the songs and the music, and the poems of the poets; but only the Name of the Lord takes away my pain.
