DEFINE	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v13	O Nanak, that soul-bride is pleasing to her Husband Lord, who performs loving devotional worship before her Beloved. ||13||
RECORD	para 48532	poiK quKwru pVY vxu iqRxu rsu soKY ] (1109-8, quKwrI, mÚ 1) pokh tukhaar parhai van tarin ras sokhai. In Poh, the snow falls, and the sap of the trees and the fields dries up.
RECORD	para 48533	Awvq kI nwhI min qin vsih muKy ] (1109-9, quKwrI, mÚ 1) aavat kee naahee man tan vaseh mukhay. Why have You not come? I keep You in my mind, body and mouth.
