FORBID	para 48546	bhuqy vys krI ipr bwJhu mhlI lhw n QwE ] (1109-16, quKwrI, mÚ 1) bahutay vays karee pir baajhahu mahlee lahaa na thaa-o. I dress in various clothes, but without my Beloved, I shall not find a place in the Mansion of His Presence.
RECORD	para 48547	hwr for rs pwt ptMbr ipir loVI sIgwrI ] (1109-16, quKwrI, mÚ 1) haar dor ras paat patambar pir lorhee seegaaree. I have adorned myself with garlands of flowers, pearl necklaces, scented oils and silk robes.
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v16	nwnk myil leI guir ApxY Gir vru pwieAw nwrI ]16] (1109-17, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak mayl la-ee gur apnai ghar var paa-i-aa naaree. ||16||
RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v16	O Nanak, the Guru has united me with Him. The soul-bride has found her Husband Lord, within the home of her own heart. ||16||
RECORD	para 48550	pRB imly ipAwry kwrj swry krqw sB ibiD jwxY ] (1109-18, quKwrI, mÚ 1) parabh milay pi-aaray kaaraj saaray kartaa sabh biDh jaanai. God, my Beloved, has met me, and my affairs are all resolved. The Creator Lord knows all ways and means.
