RECORD	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v17	nwnk Aihinis rwvY pRIqmu hir vru iQru sohwgo ]17]1] (1110-1, quKwrI, mÚ 1) naanak ahinis raavai pareetam har var thir sohaago. ||17||
DEFINE	quKwrI CMq mhlw 1 bwrh mwhw v17	1|| O Nanak, day and night, my Beloved enjoys me; with the Lord as my Husband, my Marriage is Eternal. ||17||1||
RECORD	para 48555	tukhaaree mehlaa 1. Tukhaari, First Mehl:
