RECORD	para 48598	pRgtI joiq joiq mih jwqw mnmuiK Brim BulwxI ] (1111-3, quKwrI, mÚ 1) pargatee jot jot meh jaataa manmukh bharam bhulaanee. The Divine Light is revealed, and in that Light, they achieve realization; the self-willed manmukhs wander in doubt and confusion.
