RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 4 Gru 1 v2	jn nwnk kau hir dieAwl hohu suAwmI hir sMqn kI DUir kir hry ]2]1]2] (1119-1, kydwrw, mÚ 4) jan naanak ka-o har da-i-aal hohu su-aamee har santan kee Dhoor kar haray. ||2||
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 4 Gru 1 v2	Please be kind to servant Nanak, O Lord, my Lord and Master; please make him the dust of the Feet of the Saints. ||2||
