RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 Gru 2 v1	I have forgotten other thirsts. ||1||
RECORD	para 48866	Ab guru pwieE hY shj suKdwiek drsnu pyKq mnu lptwnI ] (1119-5, kydwrw, mÚ 5) ab gur paa-i-o hai sahj sukh-daa-ik darsan paykhat man laptaanee. Now, I have found my Peace-giving Guru with ease; seeing His Darshan, my mind clings to Him.
