RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 Gru 4 v1	dyhu pRIiq swDU sMig suAwmI hir gun rsn bKwn ]1] (1119-15, kydwrw, mÚ 5) dayh pareet saaDhoo sang su-aamee har gun rasan bakhaan. ||1||
