UPHOLD	para 48888	gopwl dieAwl goibd dmodr inrml kQw igAwn ] (1119-16, kydwrw, mÚ 5) gopaal da-i-aal gobid damodar nirmal kathaa gi-aan. O Lord of the World, Merciful Lord of the Universe, Your sermon and spiritual wisdom are immaculate and pure.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 Gru 4 v2	nwnk kau hir kY rMig rwghu crn kml sMig iDAwn ]2]1]3] (1119-16, kydwrw, mÚ 5) naanak ka-o har kai rang raagahu charan kamal sang Dhi-aan. ||2||
