RECORD	para 48890	kaydaaraa mehlaa 5. Kaydaaraa, Fifth Mehl:
UPHOLD	para 48891	hir ky drsn ko min cwau ] (1119-17, kydwrw, mÚ 5) har kay darsan ko man chaa-o. My mind yearns for the Blessed Vision of the Lord's Darshan.
RECORD	para 48892	kir ikrpw sqsMig imlwvhu qum dyvhu Apno nwau ] rhwau ] (1119-18, kydwrw, mÚ 5) kar kirpaa satsang milaavhu tum dayvhu apno naa-o. rahaa-o. Please grant Your Grace, and unite me with the Society of the Saints; please bless me with Your Name. ||Pause||
RECORD	para 48893	krau syvw sq purK ipAwry jq sunIAY qq min rhswau ] (1119-18, kydwrw, mÚ 5) kara-o sayvaa sat purakh pi-aaray jat sunee-ai tat man rahsaa-o. I serve my True Beloved Lord. Wherever I hear His Praise, there my mind is in ecstasy.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	vwrI PyrI sdw GumweI kvnu AnUpu qyro Twau ]1] (1120-1, kydwrw, mÚ 5) vaaree fayree sadaa ghumaa-ee kavan anoop tayro thaa-o. ||1||
DEFINE	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	I am a sacrifice, a sacrifice, forever devoted to You. Your place is incomparably beautiful! ||1||
RECORD	para 48896	srb pRiqpwlih sgl smwlih sgilAw qyrI Cwau ] (1120-1, kydwrw, mÚ 5) sarab paratpaalahi sagal samaaleh sagli-aa tayree chhaa-o. You cherish and nurture all; You take care of all, and Your shade covers all.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	nwnk ky pRB purK ibDwqy Git Git quJih idKwau ]2]2]4] (1120-2, kydwrw, mÚ 5) naanak kay parabh purakh biDhaatay ghat ghat tujheh dikhaa-o. ||2||
DEFINE	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	You are the Primal Creator, the God of Nanak; I behold You in each and every heart. ||2||
RECORD	para 48899	ipRA kI pRIiq ipAwrI ] (1120-3, kydwrw, mÚ 5) pari-a kee pareet pi-aaree. I love the Love of my Beloved.
RECORD	para 48900	mgn mnY mih icqvau Awsw nYnhu qwr quhwrI ] rhwau ] (1120-3, kydwrw, mÚ 5) magan manai meh chitva-o aasaa nainhu taar tuhaaree. rahaa-o. My mind is intoxicated with delight, and my consciousness is filled with hope; my eyes are drenched with Your Love. ||Pause||
WHEN	para 48901	Eie idn phr mUrq pl kYsy Eie pl GrI ikhwrI ] (1120-4, kydwrw, mÚ 5) o-ay din pahar moorat pal kaisay o-ay pal gharee kihaaree. Blessed is that day, that hour, minute and second when the heavy, rigid shutters are opened, and desire is quenched.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	KUly kpt Dpt buiJ iqRsnw jIvau pyiK drswrI ]1] (1120-4, kydwrw, mÚ 5) khoolay kapat Dhapat bujh tarisnaa jeeva-o paykh darsaaree. ||1||
UPHOLD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	Seeing the Blessed Vision of Your Darshan, I live. ||1||
RECORD	para 48903	kaunu su jqnu aupwau iknyhw syvw kaun bIcwrI ] (1120-5, kydwrw, mÚ 5) ka-un so jatan upaa-o kinayhaa sayvaa ka-un beechaaree. What is the method, what is the effort, and what is the service, which inspires me to contemplate You?
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	mwnu AiBmwnu mohu qij nwnk sMqh sMig auDwrI ]2]3]5] (1120-6, kydwrw, mÚ 5) maan abhimaan moh taj naanak santeh sang uDhaaree. ||2||
