WHEN	para 48908	kwiF lIey pRB Awn ibKY qy swDsMig mnu lwvhu ] (1120-7, kydwrw, mÚ 5) kaadh lee-ay parabh aan bikhai tay saaDhsang man laavhu. Please lift me up, God, out of vice and corruption, and attach my mind to the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	BRmu Bau mohu kitE gur bcnI Apnw drsu idKwvhu ]1] (1120-8, kydwrw, mÚ 5) bharam bha-o moh kati-o gur bachnee apnaa daras dikhaavhu. ||1||
DEFINE	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	Doubt, fear and attachment are eradicated from that person who follows the Guru's Teachings, and gazes on the Blessed Vision of His Darshan. ||1||
ALLOW	para 48910	sB kI ryn hoie mnu myrw AhMbuiD qjwvhu ] (1120-8, kydwrw, mÚ 5) sabh kee rayn ho-ay man mayraa aha N-buDh tajaavahu. Let my mind become the dust of all; may I abandon my egotistical intellect.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	ApnI Bgiq dyih dieAwlw vfBwgI nwnk hir pwvhu ]2]4]6] (1120-9, kydwrw, mÚ 5) apnee bhagat deh da-i-aalaa vadbhaagee naanak har paavhu. ||2||
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	Please bless me with Your devotional worship, O Merciful Lord; by great good fortune, O Nanak, I have found the Lord. ||2||
DEFINE	para 48913	hir ibnu jnmu AkwrQ jwq ] (1120-10, kydwrw, mÚ 5) har bin janam akaarath jaat. Without the Lord, life is useless.
RECORD	para 48914	qij gopwl Awn rMig rwcq imiQAw pihrq Kwq ] rhwau ] (1120-10, kydwrw, mÚ 5) taj gopaal aan rang raachat mithi-aa pahirat khaat. rahaa-o. Those who forsake the Lord, and become engrossed in other pleasures - false and useless are the clothes they wear, and the food they eat. ||Pause||
RECORD	para 48915	Dnu jobnu sMpY suK BuogvY sMig n inbhq mwq ] (1120-11, kydwrw, mÚ 5) Dhan joban sampai sukh bhogvai sang na nibhat maat. The pleasures of wealth, youth, property and comforts will not stay with you, O mother.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	imRg iqRsnw dyiK ricE bwvr dRüm CwieAw rMig rwq ]1] (1120-11, kydwrw, mÚ 5) marig tarisnaa daykh rachi-o baavar darum chhaa-i-aa rang raat. ||1||
DEFINE	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	Seeing the mirage, the madman is entangled in it; he is imbued with pleasures that pass away, like the shade of a tree. ||1||
RECORD	para 48917	mwn moh mhw md mohq kwm k®oD kY Kwq ] (1120-12, kydwrw, mÚ 5) maan moh mahaa mad mohat kaam kroDh kai khaat. Totally intoxicated with the wine of pride and attachment, he has fallen into the pit of sexual desire and anger.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	kru gih lyhu dws nwnk kau pRB jIau hoie shwq ]2]5]7] (1120-12, kydwrw, mÚ 5) kar geh layho daas naanak ka-o parabh jee-o ho-ay sahaat. ||2||
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	O Dear God, please be the Help and Support of servant Nanak; please take me by the hand, and uplift me. ||2||
RECORD	para 48920	hir ibnu koie n cwlis swQ ] (1120-13, kydwrw, mÚ 5) har bin ko-ay na chaalas saath. Nothing goes along with the mortal, except for the Lord.
RECORD	para 48921	dInw nwQ kruxwpiq suAwmI AnwQw ky nwQ ] rhwau ] (1120-14, kydwrw, mÚ 5) deenaa naath karunaapat su-aamee anaathaa kay naath. rahaa-o. He is the Master of the meek, the Lord of Mercy, my Lord and Master, the Master of the masterless. ||Pause||
RECORD	para 48922	suq sMpiq ibiKAw rs Buogvq nh inbhq jm kY pwQ ] (1120-14, kydwrw, mÚ 5) sut sampat bikhi-aa ras bhogvat nah nibhat jam kai paath. Children, possessions and the enjoyment of corrupt pleasures do not go along with the mortal on the path of Death.
