RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	nwnk dIn DUir jn bWCq imlY ilKq Duir mwQ ]2]6]8] (1120-16, kydwrw, mÚ 5) naanak deen Dhoor jan baa Nchhat milai likhat Dhur maath. ||2||
REQUIRE	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	Nanak longs for the dust of the feet of the Lord's humble servant; he shall obtain it only if such pre-ordained destiny is written on his forehead. ||2||
