RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 Gru 5 v2	pRB crn kml rswl nwnk gwiT bwiD DrI ]2]1]9] (1121-2, kydwrw, mÚ 5) parabh charan kamal rasaal naanak gaath baaDh Dharee. ||2||
