REQUIRE	para 48945	iqAwig clnw sgl sMpq kwlu isr pir jwnu ] (1121-7, kydwrw, mÚ 5) ti-aag chalnaa sagal sampat kaal sir par jaan. You shall have to leave behind all your riches when you depart. Death is hanging over your head - know this well!
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	imQn moh durMq Awsw JUTu srpr mwnu ]1] (1121-7, kydwrw, mÚ 5) mithan moh durant aasaa jhooth sarpar maan. ||1||
REQUIRE	kydwrw mhlw 5 v1	Transitory attachments and evil hopes are false. Surely you must believe this! ||1||
RECORD	para 48947	siq purK Akwl mUriq irdY Dwrhu iDAwnu ] (1121-8, kydwrw, mÚ 5) sat purakh akaal moorat ridai Dhaarahu Dhi-aan. Within your heart, focus your meditation on the True Primal Being, Akaal Moorat, the Undying Form.
RECORD	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	nwmu inDwnu lwBu nwnk bsqu ieh prvwnu ]2]3]11] (1121-8, kydwrw, mÚ 5) naam niDhaan laabh naanak basat ih parvaan. ||2||
REQUIRE	kydwrw mhlw 5 v2	Only this profitable merchandise, the treasure of the Naam, O Nanak, shall be accepted. ||2||
RECORD	para 48950	hir ky nwm ko AwDwru ] (1121-9, kydwrw, mÚ 5) har kay naam ko aaDhaar. I take only the Support of the Name of the Lord.
