DEFINE	rwgu BYrau mhlw 1 Gru 2 v4	O Nanak, our Lord and Master is All-pervading; through the True Word of the Shabad, we are emancipated. ||4||
RECORD	para 49097	bhairo mehlaa 1. Bhairao, First Mehl:
