RECORD	para 49676	jog ByK sMinAwsY pyiKE jiq jMgm kwpVwey ] (1139-5, BYrau, mÚ 5) jog bhaykh sanni-aasai paykhi-o jat jangam kaaprhaa-ay. I have seen Him among the Yogis, the Sannyaasees, the celibates, the wandering hermits and the wearers of patched coats.
