DEFINE	BYrau AstpdIAw mhlw 1 Gru 2 v3	Mother, father, Maya and the body are diseased; those united with their relatives are diseased. ||3||
DEFINE	para 50484	rogI bRhmw ibsnu srudRw rogI sgl sMswrw ] (1153-12, BYrau, mÚ 1) rogee barahmaa bisan sarudraa rogee sagal sansaaraa. Brahma, Vishnu and Shiva are diseased; the whole world is diseased.
