RECORD	BYrau AstpdIAw mhlw 1 Gru 2 v4	Those who remember the Lord's Feet and contemplate the Word of the Guru's Shabad are liberated. ||4||
RECORD	para 50486	rogI swq smuMd sndIAw KMf pqwl is roig Bry ] (1153-13, BYrau, mÚ 1) rogee saat samund sandee-aa khand pataal se rog bharay. The seven seas are diseased, along with the rivers; the continents and the nether regions of the underworlds are full of disease.
