DEFINE	para 50488	rogI Kt drsn ByKDwrI nwnw hTI Anykw ] (1153-14, BYrau, mÚ 1) rogee khat darsan bhaykh-Dhaaree naanaa hathee anaykaa. The six Shaastras are diseased, as are the many who follow the different religious orders.
