RECORD	para 50567	mnmuiK mrih iqn ikCU n sUJY durmiq AigAwn AMDwrw ] (1155-11, BYrau, mÚ 3) manmukh mareh tin kichhoo na soojhai durmat agi-aan anDhaaraa. The self-willed manmukhs die, understanding nothing; they are enveloped by the darkness of evil-mindedness and ignorance.
