RECORD	para 50569	swcY sbid rqy jn swcy hir pRiB Awip imlwey ] (1155-12, BYrau, mÚ 3) saachai sabad ratay jan saachay har parabh aap milaa-ay. True are those humble beings who are imbued with the True Shabad; the Lord God unites them with Himself.
