DEFINE	para 54057	mn ky qrMg sbid invwry rsnw shij suBweI ] (1233-13, swrMg, mÚ 3) man kay tarang sabad nivaaray rasnaa sahj subhaa-ee. The Shabad calms the turbulent waves of the mind; the tongue is intuively imbued with peace.
RECORD	swrg mhlw 3 AstpdIAw Gru 1 v4	siqgur imil rhIAY sd Apuny ijin hir syqI ilv lweI ]4] (1233-14, swrMg, mÚ 3) satgur mil rahee-ai sad apunay jin har saytee liv laa-ee. ||4||
