RECORD	swrg mhlw 3 AstpdIAw Gru 1 v6	AMqir inhkyvlu hir rivAw sBu Awqm rwmu murwrI ]6] (1233-16, swrMg, mÚ 3) antar nihkayval har ravi-aa sabh aatam raam muraaree. ||6||
