DEFINE	para 55161	haumY vfw rogu hY isir mwry jmkwil ] (1258-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) ha-umai vadaa rog hai sir maaray jamkaal. They are stricken with the great disease of egotism; they are hit on the head by the Messenger of Death.
