RECORD	para 55357	qIriQ ATsiT mjnu nweI ] (1263-7, mlwr, mÚ 4) tirath athsath majan naa-ee. Instead of bathing at the sixty-eight sacred shrines of pilgrimage, take your cleansing bath in the Name.
