RECORD	mlwr mhlw 4 v1	gur ky bcn krn suin iDAwvY Bv swgru pwir prY ]1] rhwau ] (1263-13, mlwr, mÚ 4) gur kay bachan karan sun Dhi-aavai bhav saagar paar parai. ||1||
DEFINE	mlwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. One who listens to the Guru's Teachings and meditates on them, is carried across the terrifying world-ocean. ||1||Pause||
