RECORD	mlwr mhlw 4 v1	hir jn kau hir dIn@ vfweI hir jnu hir kwrY lwvY ]1] (1263-19, mlwr, mÚ 4) har jan ka-o har deen H vadaa-ee har jan har kaarai laavai. ||1||
RECORD	mlwr mhlw 4 v1	The Lord blesses His humble servant with glorious greatness. The Lord enjoins him to his tasks. ||1||
RECORD	para 55379	siqguru hir hir nwmu idRVwvY ] (1263-19, mlwr, mÚ 4) satgur har har naam darirh-aavai. The True Guru implants the Naam, the Name of the Lord, Har, Har, within.
RECORD	mlwr mhlw 4 v1	hir bolhu gur ky isK myry BweI hir Baujlu jgqu qrwvY ]1] rhwau ] (1264-1, mlwr, mÚ 4) har bolhu gur kay sikh mayray bhaa-ee har bha-ojal jagat taraavai. ||1||
RECORD	mlwr mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. Chant the Name of the Lord, O Sikhs of the Guru, O my Siblings of Destiny. Only the Lord will carry you across the terrifying world-ocean. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 55382	jo gur kau jnu pUjy syvy so jnu myry hir pRB BwvY ] (1264-1, mlwr, mÚ 4) jo gur ka-o jan poojay sayvay so jan mayray har parabh bhaavai. That humble being who worships, adores and serves the Guru is pleasing to my Lord God.
