RECORD	para 56047	mnmuK kcy kUiVAwr iqn@I inhcau drgh hwirAw ] (1280-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) manmukh kachay koorhi-aar tin Hee nihcha-o dargeh haari-aa. The self-willed manmukhs are worthless and false. Without a doubt, they lose in the Court of the Lord.
RECORD	para 56048	gurmqI sbid sUr hY kwmu k®oDu ijn@I mwirAw ] (1280-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) gurmatee sabad soor hai kaam kroDh jin Hee maari-aa. Those who follow the Guru's Teachings are the true spiritual warriors; they have conquered sexual desire and anger.
RECORD	para 56049	scY AMdir mhil sbid svwirAw ] (1280-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) sachai andar mahal sabad savaari-aa. They enter into the True Mansion of the Lord's Presence, embellished and exalted by the Word of the Shabad.
DEFINE	para 56050	sy Bgq quDu Bwvdy scY nwie ipAwirAw ] (1280-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) say bhagat tuDh bhaavday sachai naa-ay pi-aari-aa. Those devotees are pleasing to Your Will, O Lord; they dearly love the True Name.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v5	siqguru syvin Awpxw iqn@w ivthu hau vwirAw ]5] (1280-14, mlwr, mÚ 3) satgur sayvan aapnaa tin Haa vitahu ha-o vaari-aa. ||5||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v5	I am a sacrifice to those who serve their True Guru. ||5||
RECORD	para 56052	slok mÚ 3 ] (1280-14) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56053	aUNniv aUNniv AwieAw vrsY lwie JVI ] (1280-14, mlwr, mÚ 3) ooNnav oo Nnav aa-i-aa varsai laa-ay jharhee. Hanging low, low and thick in the sky, the clouds come, and water rains down in torrents.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	nwnk BwxY clY kMq kY su mwxy sdw rlI ]1] (1280-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak bhaanai chalai kant kai so maanay sadaa ralee. ||1||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, she walks in harmony with the Will of her Husband Lord; she enjoys peace and pleasure forever. ||1||
RECORD	para 56055	mÚ 3 ] (1280-15) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56056	ikAw auiT auiT dyKhu bpuVyN iesu myGY hiQ ikCu nwih ] (1280-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) ki-aa uth uth daykhhu bapurhay N is mayghai hath kichh naahi. Why are you standing up, standing up to look? You poor wretch, this cloud has nothing in its hands.
RECORD	para 56057	ijin eyhu myGu pTwieAw iqsu rwKhu mn mWih ] (1280-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) jin ayhu maygh pathaa-i-aa tis raakho man maa Nhi. The One who sent this cloud - cherish Him in your mind.
RECORD	para 56058	iqs no mMin vswiesI jw kau ndir kryie ] (1280-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) tis no man vasaa-isee jaa ka-o nadar karay-i. He alone enshrines the Lord in his mind, upon whom the Lord bestows His Glance of Grace.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk ndrI bwhrI sB krx plwh kryie ]2] (1280-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak nadree baahree sabh karan palaah karay-i. ||2||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, all those who lack this Grace, cry and weep and wail. ||2||
RECORD	para 56060	pauVI ] (1280-18) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 56061	so hir sdw sryvIAY ijsu krq n lwgY vwr ] (1280-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) so har sadaa sarayvee-ai jis karat na laagai vaar. Serve the Lord forever; He acts in no time at all.
RECORD	para 56062	Awfwxy Awkws kir iKn mih Fwih auswrxhwr ] (1280-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) aadaanay aakaas kar khin meh dhaahi usaaranhaar. He stretched the sky across the heavens; in an instant, He creates and destroys.
RECORD	para 56063	Awpy jgqu aupwie kY kudriq kry vIcwr ] (1280-19, mlwr, mÚ 3) aapay jagat upaa-ay kai kudrat karay veechaar. He Himself created the world; He contemplates His Creative Omnipotence.
RECORD	para 56064	mnmuK AgY lyKw mMgIAY bhuqI hovY mwr ] (1280-19, mlwr, mÚ 3) manmukh agai laykhaa mangee-ai bahutee hovai maar. The self-willed manmukh will be called to account hereafter; he will be severely punished.
RECORD	para 56066	gurmuiK piq isau lyKw inbVY bKsy isPiq BMfwr ] (1281-1, mlwr, mÚ 3) gurmukh pat si-o laykhaa nibrhai bakhsay sifat bhandaar. The Gurmukh's account is settled with honor; the Lord blesses him with the treasure of His Praise.
RECORD	para 56067	EQY hQu n ApVY kUk n suxIAY pukwr ] (1281-1, mlwr, mÚ 3) othai hath na aprhai kook na sunee-ai pukaar. No one's hands can reach there; no one will hear anyone's cries.
WHEN	para 56068	EQY siqguru bylI hovY kiF ley AMqI vwr ] (1281-2, mlwr, mÚ 3) othai satgur baylee hovai kadh la-ay antee vaar. The True Guru will be your best friend there; at the very last instant, He will save you.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v6	eynw jMqw no hor syvw nhI siqguru isir krqwr ]6] (1281-2, mlwr, mÚ 3) aynaa jantaa no hor sayvaa nahee satgur sir kartaar. ||6||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v6	These beings should serve no other than the True Guru or the Creator Lord above the heads of all. ||6||
RECORD	para 56070	slok mÚ 3 ] (1281-3) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56071	bwbIhw ijs no qU pUkwrdw iqs no locY sBu koie ] (1281-3, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa jis no too pookaardaa tis no lochai sabh ko-ay. O rainbird, the One unto whom you call - everyone longs for that Lord.
WHEN	para 56072	ApxI ikrpw kir kY vssI vxu iqRxu hirAw hoie ] (1281-3, mlwr, mÚ 3) apnee kirpaa kar kai vassee van tarin hari-aa ho-ay. When He grants His Grace, it rains, and the forests and fields blossom forth in their greenery.
DEFINE	para 56073	gur prswdI pweIAY ivrlw bUJY koie ] (1281-4, mlwr, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee paa-ee-ai virlaa boojhai ko-ay. By Guru's Grace, He is found; only a rare few understand this.
RECORD	para 56074	bhidAw auTidAw inq iDAweIAY sdw sdw suKu hoie ] (1281-4, mlwr, mÚ 3) bahdi-aa uth-di-aa nit Dhi-aa-ee-ai sadaa sadaa sukh ho-ay. Sitting down and standing up, meditate continually on Him, and be at peace forever and ever.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	nwnk AMimRqu sd hI vrsdw gurmuiK dyvY hir soie ]1] (1281-5, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak amrit sad hee varasdaa gurmukh dayvai har so-ay. ||1||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, the Ambrosial Nectar rains down forever; the Lord gives it to the Gurmukh. ||1||
RECORD	para 56076	mÚ 3 ] (1281-5) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56077	klmil hoeI mydnI Ardwis kry ilv lwie ] (1281-6, mlwr, mÚ 3) kalmal ho-ee maydnee ardaas karay liv laa-ay. When the people of the world are suffering in pain, they call upon the Lord in loving prayer.
RECORD	para 56078	scY suixAw kMnu dy DIrk dyvY shij suBwie ] (1281-6, mlwr, mÚ 3) sachai suni-aa kann day Dheerak dayvai sahj subhaa-ay. The True Lord naturally listens and hears and gives comfort.
RECORD	para 56079	ieMdRY no PurmwieAw vuTw Chbr lwie ] (1281-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) indrai no furmaa-i-aa vuthaa chhahbar laa-ay. He commands the god of rain, and the rain pours down in torrents.
DEFINE	para 56080	Anu Dnu aupjY bhu Gxw kImiq khxu n jwie ] (1281-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) an Dhan upjai baho ghanaa keemat kahan na jaa-ay. Corn and wealth are produced in great abundance and prosperity; their value cannot be estimated.
RECORD	para 56081	nwnk nwmu slwih qU sBnw jIAw dydw irjku sMbwih ] (1281-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak naam salaahi too sabhnaa jee-aa daydaa rijak sambaahi. O Nanak, praise the Naam, the Name of the Lord; He reaches out and gives sustenance to all beings.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	ijqu KwDY suKu aUpjY iPir dUKu n lwgY Awie ]2] (1281-8, mlwr, mÚ 3) jit khaaDhai sukh oopjai fir dookh na laagai aa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	Eating this, peace is produced, and the mortal never again suffers in pain. ||2||
RECORD	para 56083	pauVI ] (1281-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 56084	hir jIau scw scu qU scy lYih imlwie ] (1281-9, mlwr, mÚ 3) har jee-o sachaa sach too sachay laihi milaa-ay. O Dear Lord, You are the Truest of the True. You blend those who are truthful into Your Own Being.
RECORD	para 56085	dUjY dUjI qrP hY kUiV imlY n imilAw jwie ] (1281-9, mlwr, mÚ 3) doojai doojee taraf hai koorh milai na mili-aa jaa-ay. Those caught in duality are on the side of duality; entrenched in falsehood, they cannot merge into the Lord.
RECORD	para 56086	Awpy joiV ivCoiVAY Awpy kudriq dyie idKwie ] (1281-10, mlwr, mÚ 3) aapay jorh vichhorhi-ai aapay kudrat day-ay dikhaa-ay. You Yourself unite, and You Yourself separate; You display Your Creative Omnipotence.
RECORD	para 56087	mohu sogu ivjogu hY pUrib iliKAw kmwie ] (1281-10, mlwr, mÚ 3) moh sog vijog hai poorab likhi-aa kamaa-ay. Attachment brings the sorrow of separation; the mortal acts in accordance with pre- ordained destiny.
RECORD	para 56088	hau bilhwrI iqn kau jo hir crxI rhY ilv lwie ] (1281-11, mlwr, mÚ 3) ha-o balihaaree tin ka-o jo har charnee rahai liv laa-ay. I am a sacrifice to those who remain lovingly attached to the Lord's Feet.
DEFINE	para 56089	ijau jl mih kmlu Ailpqu hY AYsI bxq bxwie ] (1281-11, mlwr, mÚ 3) ji-o jal meh kamal alipat hai aisee banat banaa-ay. They are like the lotus which remains detached, floating upon the water.
DEFINE	para 56090	sy suKIey sdw sohxy ijn@ ivchu Awpu gvwie ] (1281-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) say sukhee-ay sadaa sohnay jin H vichahu aap gavaa-ay. They are peaceful and beautiful forever; they eradicate self-conceit from within.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v7	iqn@ sogu ivjogu kdy nhI jo hir kY AMik smwie ]7] (1281-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) tin H sog vijog kaday nahee jo har kai ank samaa-ay. ||7||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v7	They never suffer sorrow or separation; they are merged in the Being of the Lord. ||7||
RECORD	para 56092	slok mÚ 3 ] (1281-13) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56093	nwnk so swlwhIAY ijsu vis sBu ikCu hoie ] (1281-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak so salaahee-ai jis vas sabh kichh ho-ay. O Nanak, praise the Lord; everything is in His power.
DEFINE	para 56094	iqsY sryivhu pRwxIho iqsu ibnu Avru n koie ] (1281-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) tisai sarayvihu paraaneeho tis bin avar na ko-ay. Serve Him, O mortal beings; there is none other than Him.
RECORD	para 56095	gurmuiK hir pRBu min vsY qW sdw sdw suKu hoie ] (1281-14, mlwr, mÚ 3) gurmukh har parabh man vasai taaN sadaa sadaa sukh ho-ay. The Lord God abides within the mind of the Gurmukh, and then he is at peace, forever and ever.
DEFINE	para 56096	shsw mUil n hoveI sB icMqw ivchu jwie ] (1281-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) sahsaa mool na hova-ee sabh chintaa vichahu jaa-ay. He is never cynical; all anxiety has been taken out from within him.
RECORD	para 56097	jo ikCu hoie su shjy hoie khxw ikCU n jwie ] (1281-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) jo kichh ho-ay so sehjay ho-ay kahnaa kichhoo na jaa-ay. Whatever happens, happens naturally; no one has any say about it.
DEFINE	para 56098	scw swihbu min vsY qW min icMidAw Plu pwie ] (1281-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) sachaa saahib man vasai taa N man chindi-aa fal paa-ay. When the True Lord abides in the mind, then the mind's desires are fulfilled.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	nwnk iqn kw AwiKAw Awip suxy ij lieAnu pMnY pwie ]1] (1281-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak tin kaa aakhi-aa aap sunay je la-i-an pannai paa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, He Himself hears the words of those, whose accounts are in His Hands. ||1||
RECORD	para 56100	mÚ 3 ] (1281-17) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56101	AMimRqu sdw vrsdw bUJin bUJxhwr ] (1281-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) amrit sadaa varasdaa boojhan boojhanhaar. The Ambrosial Nectar rains down continually; realize this through realization.
RECORD	para 56102	gurmuiK ijn@I buiJAw hir AMimRqu riKAw auir Dwir ] (1281-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) gurmukh jin Hee bujhi-aa har amrit rakhi-aa ur Dhaar. Those who, as Gurmukh, realize this, keep the Lord's Ambrosial Nectar enshrined within their hearts.
RECORD	para 56103	hir AMimRqu pIvih sdw rMig rwqy haumY iqRsnw mwir ] (1281-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) har amrit peeveh sadaa rang raatay ha-umai tarisnaa maar. They drink in the Lord's Ambrosial Nectar, and remain forever imbued with the Lord; they conquer egotism and thirsty desires.
DEFINE	para 56104	AMimRqu hir kw nwmu hY vrsY ikrpw Dwir ] (1281-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) amrit har kaa naam hai varsai kirpaa Dhaar. The Name of the Lord is Ambrosial Nectar; the Lord showers His Grace, and it rains down.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk gurmuiK ndrI AwieAw hir Awqm rwmu murwir ]2] (1281-19, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak gurmukh nadree aa-i-aa har aatam raam muraar. ||2||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, the Gurmukh comes to behold the Lord, the Supreme Soul. ||2||
RECORD	para 56107	pauVI ] (1282-1) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 56108	Aqulu ikau qolIAY ivxu qoly pwieAw n jwie ] (1282-1, mlwr, mÚ 3) atul ki-o tolee-ai vin tolay paa-i-aa na jaa-ay. How can the unweighable be weighed? Without weighing Him, He cannot be obtained.
RECORD	para 56109	gur kY sbid vIcwrIAY gux mih rhY smwie ] (1282-1, mlwr, mÚ 3) gur kai sabad veechaaree-ai gun meh rahai samaa-ay. Reflect on the Word of the Guru's Shabad, and immerse yourself in His Glorious Virtues.
RECORD	para 56110	Apxw Awpu Awip qolsI Awpy imlY imlwie ] (1282-2, mlwr, mÚ 3) apnaa aap aap tolsee aapay milai milaa-ay. He Himself weighs Himself; He unites in Union with Himself.
RECORD	para 56111	iqs kI kImiq nw pvY khxw ikCU n jwie ] (1282-2, mlwr, mÚ 3) tis kee keemat naa pavai kahnaa kichhoo na jaa-ay. His value cannot be estimated; nothing can be said about this.
RECORD	para 56112	hau bilhwrI gur Awpxy ijin scI bUJ idqI buJwie ] (1282-3, mlwr, mÚ 3) ha-o balihaaree gur aapnay jin sachee boojh ditee bujhaa-ay. I am a sacrifice to my Guru; He has made me realize this true realization.
RECORD	para 56113	jgqu musY AMimRqu lutIAY mnmuK bUJ n pwie ] (1282-3, mlwr, mÚ 3) jagat musai amrit lootee-ai manmukh boojh na paa-ay. The world has been deceived, and the Ambrosial Nectar is being plundered. The self- willed manmukh does not realize this.
RECORD	para 56114	ivxu nwvY nwil n clsI jwsI jnmu gvwie ] (1282-4, mlwr, mÚ 3) vin naavai naal na chalsee jaasee janam gavaa-ay. Without the Name, nothing will go along with him; he wastes his life, and departs.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v8	gurmqI jwgy iqn@I Gru riKAw dUqw kw ikCu n vswie ]8] (1282-4, mlwr, mÚ 3) gurmatee jaagay tin Hee ghar rakhi-aa dootaa kaa kichh na vasaa-ay. ||8||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v8	Those who follow the Guru's Teachings and remain awake and aware, preserve and protect the home of their heart; demons have no power against them. ||8||
RECORD	para 56116	slok mÚ 3 ] (1282-5) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56117	bwbIhw nw ibllwie nw qrswie eyhu mnu Ksm kw hukmu mMin ] (1282-5, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa naa billaa-ay naa tarsaa-ay ayhu man khasam kaa hukam man. O rainbird, do not cry out. Do not let this mind of yours be so thirsty for a drop of water. Obey the Hukam, the Command of your Lord and Master,
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	nwnk hukim mMinAY iqK auqrY cVY cvgil vMnu ]1] (1282-6, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak hukam mani-ai tikh utrai charhai chavgal vann. ||1||
REQUIRE	slok mhlw 3 v1	and your thirst shall be quenched. Your love for Him shall increase four-fold. ||1||
RECORD	para 56119	mÚ 3 ] (1282-6) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56120	bwbIhw jl mih qyrw vwsu hY jl hI mwih iPrwih ] (1282-6, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa jal meh tayraa vaas hai jal hee maahi firaahi. O rainbird, your place is in the water; you move around in the water.
RECORD	para 56121	jl kI swr n jwxhI qW qUM kUkx pwih ] (1282-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) jal kee saar na jaanhee taaN tooN kookan paahi. But you do not appreciate the water, and so you cry out.
DEFINE	para 56122	jl Ql chu idis vrsdw KwlI ko Qwau nwih ] (1282-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) jal thal chahu dis varasdaa khaalee ko thaa-o naahi. In the water and on the land, it rains down in the ten directions. No place is left dry.
DEFINE	para 56123	eyqY jil vrsdY iqK mrih Bwg iqnw ky nwih ] (1282-8, mlwr, mÚ 3) aytai jal varsadai tikh mareh bhaag tinaa kay naahi. With so much rain, those who are die of thirst are very unfortunate.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk gurmuiK iqn soJI peI ijn visAw mn mwih ]2] (1282-8, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak gurmukh tin sojhee pa-ee jin vasi-aa man maahi. ||2||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, the Gurmukhs understand; the Lord abides within their minds. ||2||
RECORD	para 56125	pauVI ] (1282-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 56126	nwQ jqI isD pIr iknY AMqu n pwieAw ] (1282-9, mlwr, mÚ 3) naath jatee siDh peer kinai ant na paa-i-aa. The Yogic Masters, celibates, Siddhas and spiritual teachers - none of them has found the limits of the Lord.
RECORD	para 56127	gurmuiK nwmu iDAwie quJY smwieAw ] (1282-10, mlwr, mÚ 3) gurmukh naam Dhi-aa-ay tujhai samaa-i-aa. The Gurmukhs meditate on the Naam, and merge in You, O Lord.
RECORD	para 56128	jug CqIh gubwru iqs hI BwieAw ] (1282-10, mlwr, mÚ 3) jug chhateeh gubaar tis hee bhaa-i-aa. For thirty-six ages, God remained in utter darkness, as He pleased.
RECORD	para 56129	jlw ibMbu Asrwlu iqnY vrqwieAw ] (1282-10, mlwr, mÚ 3) jalaa bimb asraal tinai vartaa-i-aa. The vast expanse of water swirled around.
DEFINE	para 56130	nIlu AnIlu AgMmu srjIqu sbwieAw ] (1282-11, mlwr, mÚ 3) neel aneel agamm sarjeet sabaa-i-aa. The Creator of all is Infinite, Endless and Inaccessible.
RECORD	para 56131	Agin aupweI vwdu BuK iqhwieAw ] (1282-11, mlwr, mÚ 3) agan upaa-ee vaad bhukh tihaa-i-aa. He formed fire and conflict, hunger and thirst.
RECORD	para 56132	dunIAw kY isir kwlu dUjw BwieAw ] (1282-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) dunee-aa kai sir kaal doojaa bhaa-i-aa. Death hangs over the heads of the people of the world, in the love of duality.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v9	rKY rKxhwru ijin sbdu buJwieAw ]9] (1282-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) rakhai rakhanhaar jin sabad bujhaa-i-aa. ||9||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v9	The Savior Lord saves those who realize the Word of the Shabad. ||9||
RECORD	para 56134	slok mÚ 3 ] (1282-12) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56135	iehu jlu sB qY vrsdw vrsY Bwie suBwie ] (1282-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) ih jal sabh tai varasdaa varsai bhaa-ay subhaa-ay. This rain pours down on all; it rains down in accordance with God's Loving Will.
RECORD	para 56136	sy ibrKw hrIAwvly jo gurmuiK rhy smwie ] (1282-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) say birkhaa haree-aavlay jo gurmukh rahay samaa-ay. Those trees become green and lush, which remain immersed in the Guru's Word.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	nwnk ndrI suKu hoie eynw jMqw kw duKu jwie ]1] (1282-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak nadree sukh ho-ay aynaa jantaa kaa dukh jaa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, by His Grace, there is peace; the pain of these creatures is gone. ||1||
RECORD	para 56138	mÚ 3 ] (1282-14) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56139	iBMnI rYix cmikAw vuTw Chbr lwie ] (1282-14, mlwr, mÚ 3) bhinnee rain chamki-aa vuthaa chhahbar laa-ay. The night is wet with dew; lightning flashes, and the rain pours down in torrents.
DEFINE	para 56140	ijqu vuTY Anu Dnu bhuqu aUpjY jW shu kry rjwie ] (1282-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) jit vuthai an Dhan bahut oopjai jaa N saho karay rajaa-ay. Food and wealth are produced in abundance when it rains, if it is the Will of God.
DEFINE	para 56141	ijqu KwDY mnu iqRpqIAY jIAW jugiq smwie ] (1282-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) jit khaaDhai man taripat-ee-ai jee-aaN jugat samaa-ay. Consuming it, the minds of His creatures are satisfied, and they adopt the lifestyle of the way.
DEFINE	para 56142	iehu Dnu krqy kw Kylu hY kdy AwvY kdy jwie ] (1282-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) ih Dhan kartay kaa khayl hai kaday aavai kaday jaa-ay. This wealth is the play of the Creator Lord. Sometimes it comes, and sometimes it goes.
DEFINE	para 56143	igAwnIAw kw Dnu nwmu hY sd hI rhY smwie ] (1282-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) gi-aanee-aa kaa Dhan naam hai sad hee rahai samaa-ay. The Naam is the wealth of the spiritually wise. It is permeating and pervading forever.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk ijn kau ndir kry qW iehu Dnu plY pwie ]2] (1282-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak jin ka-o nadar karay taaN ih Dhan palai paa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, those who are blessed with His Glance of Grace receive this wealth. ||2||
RECORD	para 56145	pauVI ] (1282-17) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 56146	Awip krwey kry Awip hau kY isau krI pukwr ] (1282-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) aap karaa-ay karay aap ha-o kai si-o karee pukaar. He Himself does, and causes all to be done. Unto whom can I complain?
RECORD	para 56147	Awpy lyKw mMgsI Awip krwey kwr ] (1282-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) aapay laykhaa mangsee aap karaa-ay kaar. He Himself calls the mortal beings to account; He Himself causes them to act.
RECORD	para 56148	jo iqsu BwvY so QIAY hukmu kry gwvwru ] (1282-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) jo tis bhaavai so thee-ai hukam karay gaavaar. Whatever pleases Him happens. Only a fool issues commands.
DEFINE	para 56149	Awip Cfwey CutIAY Awpy bKsxhwru ] (1282-19, mlwr, mÚ 3) aap chhadaa-ay chhutee-ai aapay bakhsanhaar. He Himself saves and redeems; He Himself is the Forgiver.
RECORD	para 56150	Awpy vyKY suxy Awip sBsY dy AwDwru ] (1282-19, mlwr, mÚ 3) aapay vaykhai sunay aap sabhsai day aaDhaar. He Himself sees, and He Himself hears; He gives His Support to all.
DEFINE	para 56151	sB mih eyku vrqdw isir isir kry bIcwru ] (1282-19, mlwr, mÚ 3) sabh meh ayk varatdaa sir sir karay beechaar. He alone is pervading and permeating all; He considers each and every one.
RECORD	para 56153	gurmuiK Awpu vIcwrIAY lgY sic ipAwru ] (1283-1, mlwr, mÚ 3) gurmukh aap veechaaree-ai lagai sach pi-aar. The Gurmukh reflects on the self, lovingly attached to the True Lord.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v10	nwnk iks no AwKIAY Awpy dyvxhwru ]10] (1283-1, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak kis no aakhee-ai aapay dayvanhaar. ||10||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v10	O Nanak, whom can we ask? He Himself is the Great Giver. ||10||
RECORD	para 56155	slok mÚ 3 ] (1283-2) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56156	bwbIhw eyhu jgqu hY mq ko Brim Bulwie ] (1283-2, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa ayhu jagat hai mat ko bharam bhulaa-ay. This world is a rainbird; let no one be deluded by doubt.
DEFINE	para 56157	iehu bwbINhw psU hY ies no bUJxu nwih ] (1283-2, mlwr, mÚ 3) ih baabee Nhaa pasoo hai is no boojhan naahi. This rainbird is an animal; it has no understanding at all.
DEFINE	para 56158	AMimRqu hir kw nwmu hY ijqu pIqY iqK jwie ] (1283-3, mlwr, mÚ 3) amrit har kaa naam hai jit peetai tikh jaa-ay. The Name of the Lord is Ambrosial Nectar; drinking it in, thirst is quenched.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	nwnk gurmuiK ijn@ pIAw iqn@ bhuiV n lwgI Awie ]1] (1283-3, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak gurmukh jin H pee-aa tin H bahurh na laagee aa-ay. ||1||
REQUIRE	slok mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, those Gurmukhs who drink it in shall never again be afflicted by thirst. ||1||
RECORD	para 56160	mÚ 3 ] (1283-4) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56161	mlwru sIql rwgu hY hir iDAwieAY sWiq hoie ] (1283-4, mlwr, mÚ 3) malaar seetal raag hai har Dhi-aa-i-ai saa Nt ho-ay. Malaar is a calming and soothing raga; meditating on the Lord brings peace and tranquility.
WHEN	para 56162	hir jIau ApxI ik®pw kry qW vrqY sB loie ] (1283-4, mlwr, mÚ 3) har jee-o apnee kirpaa karay taaN vartai sabh lo-ay. When the Dear Lord grants His Grace, then the rain falls on all the people of the world.
RECORD	para 56163	vuTY jIAw jugiq hoie DrxI no sIgwru hoie ] (1283-5, mlwr, mÚ 3) vuthai jee-aa jugat ho-ay Dharnee no seegaar ho-ay. From this rain, all creatures find the ways and means to live, and the earth is embellished.
DEFINE	para 56164	nwnk iehu jgqu sBu jlu hY jl hI qy sB koie ] (1283-5, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak ih jagat sabh jal hai jal hee tay sabh ko-ay. O Nanak, this world is all water; everything came from water.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	gur prswdI ko ivrlw bUJY so jnu mukqu sdw hoie ]2] (1283-6, mlwr, mÚ 3) gur parsaadee ko virlaa boojhai so jan mukat sadaa ho-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	By Guru's Grace, a rare few realize the Lord; such humble beings are liberated forever. ||2||
RECORD	para 56166	pauVI ] (1283-7) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 56167	scw vyprvwhu ieko qU DxI ] (1283-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) sachaa vayparvaahu iko too Dhanee. O True and Independent Lord God, You alone are my Lord and Master.
DEFINE	para 56168	qU sBu ikCu Awpy Awip dUjy iksu gxI ] (1283-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) too sabh kichh aapay aap doojay kis ganee. You Yourself are everything; who else is of any account?
DEFINE	para 56169	mwxs kUVw grbu scI quDu mxI ] (1283-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) maanas koorhaa garab sachee tuDh manee. False is the pride of man. True is Your glorious greatness.
RECORD	para 56170	Awvw gauxu rcwie aupweI mydnI ] (1283-8, mlwr, mÚ 3) aavaa ga-on rachaa-ay upaa-ee maydnee. Coming and going in reincarnation, the beings and species of the world came into being.
DEFINE	para 56171	siqguru syvy Awpxw AwieAw iqsu gxI ] (1283-8, mlwr, mÚ 3) satgur sayvay aapnaa aa-i-aa tis ganee. But if the mortal serves his True Guru, his coming into the world is judged to be worthwhile.
WHEN	para 56172	jy haumY ivchu jwie q kyhI gxq gxI ] (1283-9, mlwr, mÚ 3) jay ha-umai vichahu jaa-ay ta kayhee ganat ganee. And if he eradicates eogtism from within himself, then how can he be judged?
DEFINE	para 56173	mnmuK moih gubwir ijau Bulw mMiJ vxI ] (1283-9, mlwr, mÚ 3) manmukh mohi gubaar ji-o bhulaa manjh vanee. The self-willed manmukh is lost in the darkness of emotional attachment, like the man lost in the wilderness.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v11	kty pwp AsMK nwvY iek kxI ]11] (1283-9, mlwr, mÚ 3) katay paap asa Nkh naavai ik kanee. ||11||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v11	Countless sins are erased, by even a tiny particle of the Lord's Name. ||11||
RECORD	para 56175	slok mÚ 3 ] (1283-10) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56176	bwbIhw KsmY kw mhlu n jwxhI mhlu dyiK Ardwis pwie ] (1283-10, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa khasmai kaa mahal na jaanhee mahal daykh ardaas paa-ay. O rainbird, you do not know the Mansion of your Lord and Master's Presence. Offer your prayers to see this Mansion.
DEFINE	para 56177	AwpxY BwxY bhuqw bolih boilAw Qwie n pwie ] (1283-11, mlwr, mÚ 3) aapnai bhaanai bahutaa boleh boli-aa thaa-ay na paa-ay. You speak as you please, but your speech is not accepted.
REQUIRE	para 56178	Ksmu vfw dwqwru hY jo ieCy so Pl pwie ] (1283-11, mlwr, mÚ 3) khasam vadaa daataar hai jo ichhay so fal paa-ay. Your Lord and Master is the Great Giver; whatever you desire, you shall receive from Him.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	bwbIhw ikAw bpuVw jgqY kI iqK jwie ]1] (1283-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa ki-aa bapurhaa jagtai kee tikh jaa-ay. ||1||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v1	Not only the thirst of the poor rainbird, but the thirst of the whole world is quenched. ||1||
RECORD	para 56180	mÚ 3 ] (1283-12) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56181	bwbIhw iBMnI rYix boilAw shjy sic suBwie ] (1283-12, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa bhinnee rain boli-aa sehjay sach subhaa-ay. The night is wet with dew; the rainbird sings the True Name with intuitive ease.
DEFINE	para 56182	iehu jlu myrw jIau hY jl ibnu rhxu n jwie ] (1283-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) ih jal mayraa jee-o hai jal bin rahan na jaa-ay. This water is my very soul; without water, I cannot survive.
DEFINE	para 56183	gur sbdI jlu pweIAY ivchu Awpu gvwie ] (1283-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) gur sabdee jal paa-ee-ai vichahu aap gavaa-ay. Through the Word of the Guru's Shabad, this water is obtained, and egotism is eradicated from within.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk ijsu ibnu csw n jIvdI so siqguir dIAw imlwie ]2] (1283-14, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak jis bin chasaa na jeevdee so satgur dee-aa milaa-ay. ||2||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, I cannot live without Him, even for a moment; the True Guru has led me to meet Him. ||2||
RECORD	para 56185	pauVI ] (1283-14) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 56186	KMf pqwl AsMK mY gxq n hoeI ] (1283-14, mlwr, mÚ 3) khand pataal asa Nkh mai ganat na ho-ee. There are countless worlds and nether regions; I cannot calculate their number.
DEFINE	para 56187	qU krqw goivMdu quDu isrjI quDY goeI ] (1283-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) too kartaa govind tuDh sirjee tuDhai go-ee. You are the Creator, the Lord of the Universe; You create it, and You destroy it.
RECORD	para 56188	lK caurwsIh mydnI quJ hI qy hoeI ] (1283-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) lakh cha-oraaseeh maydnee tujh hee tay ho-ee. The 8.4 million species of beings issued forth from You.
DEFINE	para 56189	ieik rwjy Kwn mlUk khih khwvih koeI ] (1283-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) ik raajay khaan malook kaheh kahaaveh ko-ee. Some are called kings, emperors and nobles.
RECORD	para 56190	ieik swh sdwvih sMic Dnu dUjY piq KoeI ] (1283-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) ik saah sadaaveh sanch Dhan doojai pat kho-ee. Some claim to be bankers and accumulate wealth, but in duality they lose their honor.
DEFINE	para 56191	ieik dwqy iek mMgqy sBnw isir soeI ] (1283-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) ik daatay ik mangtay sabhnaa sir so-ee. Some are givers, and some are beggars; God is above the heads of all.
DEFINE	para 56192	ivxu nwvY bwjwrIAw BIhwvil hoeI ] (1283-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) vin naavai baajaaree-aa bheehaaval ho-ee. Without the Name, they are vulgar, dreadful and wretched.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v12	kUV inKuty nwnkw scu kry su hoeI ]12] (1283-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) koorh nikhutay naankaa sach karay so ho-ee. ||12||
FORBID	slok mhlw 3 v12	Falsehood shall not last, O Nanak; whatever the True Lord does, comes to pass. ||12||
RECORD	para 56194	slok mÚ 3 ] (1283-18) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56195	bwbIhw guxvMqI mhlu pwieAw AaugxvMqI dUir ] (1283-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa gunvantee mahal paa-i-aa a-uganvantee door. O rainbird, the virtuous soul-bride attains the Mansion of her Lord's Presence; the unworthy, unvirtuous one is far away.
RECORD	para 56196	AMqir qyrY hir vsY gurmuiK sdw hjUir ] (1283-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) antar tayrai har vasai gurmukh sadaa hajoor. Deep within your inner being, the Lord abides. The Gurmukh beholds Him ever- present.
WHEN	para 56197	kUk pukwr n hoveI ndrI ndir inhwl ] (1283-19, mlwr, mÚ 3) kook pukaar na hova-ee nadree nadar nihaal. When the Lord bestows His Glance of Grace, the mortal no longer weeps and wails.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	nwnk nwim rqy shjy imly sbid gurU kY Gwl ]1] (1283-19, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak naam ratay sehjay milay sabad guroo kai ghaal. ||1||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, those who are imbued with the Naam intuitively merge with the Lord; they practice the Word of the Guru's Shabad. ||1||
RECORD	para 56200	mÚ 3 ] (1284-1) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56201	bwbIhw bynqI kry kir ikrpw dyhu jIA dwn ] (1284-1, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehaa bayntee karay kar kirpaa dayh jee-a daan. The rainbird prays: O Lord, grant Your Grace, and bless me with the gift of the life of the soul.
DEFINE	para 56202	jl ibnu ipAws n aUqrY Cutik jWih myry pRwn ] (1284-1, mlwr, mÚ 3) jal bin pi-aas na ootrai chhutak jaa Nhi mayray paraan. Without the water, my thirst is not quenched, and my breath of life is ended and gone.
DEFINE	para 56203	qU suKdwqw byAMqu hY guxdwqw nyDwnu ] (1284-2, mlwr, mÚ 3) too sukh-daata bay-ant hai gundaataa nayDhaan. You are the Giver of peace, O Infinite Lord God; You are the Giver of the treasure of virtue.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk gurmuiK bKis ley AMiq bylI hoie Bgvwnu ]2] (1284-2, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak gurmukh bakhas la-ay ant baylee ho-ay bhagvaan. ||2||
REQUIRE	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, the Gurmukh is forgiven; in the end, the Lord God shall be your only friend. ||2||
RECORD	para 56205	pauVI ] (1284-3) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 56206	Awpy jgqu aupwie kY gux Aaugx kry bIcwru ] (1284-3, mlwr, mÚ 3) aapay jagat upaa-ay kai gun a-ugan karay beechaar. He created the world; He considers the merits and demerits of the mortals.
RECORD	para 56207	qRY gux srb jMjwlu hY nwim n Dry ipAwru ] (1284-4, mlwr, mÚ 3) tarai gun sarab janjaal hai naam na Dharay pi-aar. Those who are entangled in the three gunas - the three dispositions - do not love the Naam, the Name of the Lord.
REQUIRE	para 56208	gux Coif Aaugx kmwvdy drgh hoih KuAwru ] (1284-4, mlwr, mÚ 3) gun chhod a-ugan kamaavday dargeh hohi khu-aar. Forsaking virtue, they practice evil; they shall be miserable in the Court of the Lord.
RECORD	para 56209	jUAY jnmu iqnI hwirAw ikqu Awey sMswir ] (1284-5, mlwr, mÚ 3) joo-ai janam tinee haari-aa kit aa-ay sansaar. They lose their life in the gamble; why did they even come into the world?
RECORD	para 56210	scY sbid mnu mwirAw Aihinis nwim ipAwir ] (1284-5, mlwr, mÚ 3) sachai sabad man maari-aa ahinis naam pi-aar. But those who conquer and subdue their minds, through the True Word of the Shabad - night and day, they love the Naam.
RECORD	para 56211	ijnI purKI auir DwirAw scw AlK Apwru ] (1284-6, mlwr, mÚ 3) jinee purkhee ur Dhaari-aa sachaa alakh apaar. Those people enshrine the True, Invisible and Infinite Lord in their hearts.
DEFINE	para 56212	qU guxdwqw inDwnu hih AsI AvgixAwr ] (1284-6, mlwr, mÚ 3) too gundaataa niDhaan heh asee avgani-aar. You, O Lord, are the Giver, the Treasure of virtue; I am unvirtuous and unworthy.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v13	ijsu bKsy so pwiesI gur sbdI vIcwru ]13] (1284-7, mlwr, mÚ 3) jis bakhsay so paa-isee gur sabdee veechaar. ||13||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v13	He alone finds You, whom You bless and forgive, and inspire to contemplate the Word of the Guru's Shabad. ||13||
RECORD	para 56214	slok mÚ 5 ] (1284-7) salok mehlaa 5. Shalok, Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 56215	rwiq n ivhwvI swkqW ijn@w ivsrY nwau ] (1284-7, mlwr, mÚ 5) raat na vihaavee saaktaaN jin Haa visrai naa-o. The faithless cynics forget the Name of the Lord; the night of their lives does not pass in peace.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	rwqI idns suhylIAw nwnk hir gux gWau ]1] (1284-8, mlwr, mÚ 5) raatee dinas suhaylee-aa naanak har gun gaa N-o. ||1||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	Their days and nights become comfortable, O Nanak, singing the Glorious Praises of the Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 56217	mÚ 5 ] (1284-8) mehlaa 5. Fifth Mehl:
RECORD	para 56218	rqn jvyhr mwxkw hBy mxI mQMin ] (1284-8, mlwr, mÚ 5) ratan javayhar maankaa habhay manee mathann. All sorts of jewels and gems, diamonds and rubies, shine forth from their foreheads.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk jo pRiB BwixAw scY dir sohMin ]2] (1284-9, mlwr, mÚ 5) naanak jo parabh bhaani-aa sachai dar sohann. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, those who are pleasing to God, look beautiful in the Court of the Lord. ||2||
RECORD	para 56220	pauVI ] (1284-9) pa-orhee. Pauree:
RECORD	para 56221	scw siqguru syiv scu sm@wilAw ] (1284-9, mlwr, mÚ 5) sachaa satgur sayv sach sam Haali-aa. Serving the True Guru, I dwell on the True Lord.
REQUIRE	para 56222	AMiq KloAw Awie ij siqgur AgY GwilAw ] (1284-10, mlwr, mÚ 5) ant khalo-aa aa-ay je satgur agai ghaali-aa. The work you have done for the True Guru shall be very useful in the end.
DEFINE	para 56223	poih n skY jmkwlu scw rKvwilAw ] (1284-10, mlwr, mÚ 5) pohi na sakai jamkaal sachaa rakhvaali-aa. The Messenger of Death cannot even touch that person who is protected by the True Lord.
RECORD	para 56224	gur swKI joiq jgwie dIvw bwilAw ] (1284-11, mlwr, mÚ 5) gur saakhee jot jagaa-ay deevaa baali-aa. Lighting the lamp of the Guru's Teachings, my awareness has been awakened.
DEFINE	para 56225	mnmuK ivxu nwvY kUiVAwr iPrih byqwilAw ] (1284-11, mlwr, mÚ 5) manmukh vin naavai koorhi-aar fireh baytaali-aa. The self-willed manmukhs are false; without the Name, they wander around like demons.
DEFINE	para 56226	psU mwxs cMim plyty AMdrhu kwilAw ] (1284-11, mlwr, mÚ 5) pasoo maanas chamm palaytay andrahu kaali-aa. They are nothing more than beasts, wrapped up in human skin; they are black- hearted within.
DEFINE	para 56227	sBo vrqY scu scY sbid inhwilAw ] (1284-12, mlwr, mÚ 5) sabho vartai sach sachai sabad nihaali-aa. The True Lord is pervading all; through the True Word of the Shabad, He is seen.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v14	nwnk nwmu inDwnu hY pUrY guir dyKwilAw ]14] (1284-12, mlwr, mÚ 5) naanak naam niDhaan hai poorai gur daykhaali-aa. ||14||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v14	O Nanak, the Naam is the greatest treasure. The Perfect Guru has revealed it to me. ||14||
RECORD	para 56229	slok mÚ 3 ] (1284-13) salok mehlaa 3. Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56230	bwbIhY hukmu pCwixAw gur kY shij suBwie ] (1284-13, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehai hukam pachhaani-aa gur kai sahj subhaa-ay. The rainbird realizes the Hukam of the Lord's Command with intuitive ease through the Guru.
RECORD	para 56231	myGu vrsY dieAw kir gUVI Chbr lwie ] (1284-14, mlwr, mÚ 3) maygh varsai da-i-aa kar goorhee chhahbar laa-ay. The clouds mercifully burst forth, and the rain pours down in torrents.
RECORD	para 56232	bwbIhy kUk pukwr rih geI suKu visAw min Awie ] (1284-14, mlwr, mÚ 3) baabeehay kook pukaar reh ga-ee sukh vasi-aa man aa-ay. The cries and wailings of the rainbird have ceased, and peace has come to abide in its mind.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	nwnk so swlwhIAY ij dyNdw sBnW jIAw irjku smwie ]1] (1284-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak so salaahee-ai je day Ndaa sabhnaa N jee-aa rijak samaa-ay. ||1||
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	O Nanak, praise that Lord, who reaches out and gives sustenance to all beings and creatures. ||1||
RECORD	para 56234	mÚ 3 ] (1284-15) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 56235	cwiqRk qU n jwxhI ikAw quDu ivic iqKw hY ikqu pIqY iqK jwie ] (1284-15, mlwr, mÚ 3) chaatrik too na jaanhee ki-aa tuDh vich tikhaa hai kit peetai tikh jaa-ay. O rainbird, you do not know what thirst is within you, or what you can drink to quench it.
RECORD	para 56236	dUjY Bwie BrMimAw AMimRq jlu plY n pwie ] (1284-16, mlwr, mÚ 3) doojai bhaa-ay bharammi-aa amrit jal palai na paa-ay. You wander in the love of duality, and you do not obtain the Ambrosial Water.
WHEN	para 56237	ndir kry jy AwpxI qW siqguru imlY suBwie ] (1284-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) nadar karay jay aapnee taaN satgur milai subhaa-ay. When God casts His Glance of Grace, then the mortal automatically meets the True Guru.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v2	nwnk siqgur qy AMimRq jlu pwieAw shjy rihAw smwie ]2] (1284-17, mlwr, mÚ 3) naanak satgur tay amrit jal paa-i-aa sehjay rahi-aa samaa-ay. ||2||
DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	O Nanak, the Ambrosial Water is obtained from the True Guru, and then the mortal remains merged in the Lord with intuitive ease. ||2||
RECORD	para 56239	pauVI ] (1284-18) pa-orhee. Pauree:
WHEN	para 56240	ieik vx KMif bYsih jwie sdu n dyvhI ] (1284-18, mlwr, mÚ 3) ik van khand baiseh jaa-ay sad na dayvhee. Some go and sit in the forest realms, and do not answer any calls.
