RECORD	para 56436	scw vyprvwhu sbid sMqoKIAW ] (1288-17, mlwr, mÚ 1) sachaa vayparvaahu sabad santokhee-aaN. Through the Shabad, the Word of the True and Independent Lord God, one becomes content.
DEFINE	para 56437	gihr gBIr AQwhu hwQ n lBeI ] (1288-18, mlwr, mÚ 1) gahir gabheer athaahu haath na labh-ee. The Lord is deep and profound and unfathomable; His depth cannot be measured.
RECORD	para 56438	muhy muih cotw Kwhu ivxu gur koie n CutsI ] (1288-18, mlwr, mÚ 1) muhay muhi chotaa khaahu vin gur ko-ay na chhutsee. Without the Guru, the mortals are beaten and punched in the face and the mouth, and no one is released.
RECORD	para 56439	piq syqI Gir jwhu nwmu vKwxIAY ] (1288-19, mlwr, mÚ 1) pat saytee ghar jaahu naam vakhaanee-ai. Chanting the Naam, the Name of the Lord, one returns to his true home with honor.
