RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v23	Know that the Lord, by the Hukam of His Command, gives sustenance and the breath of life. ||23||
RECORD	para 56442	slok mÚ 1 ] (1289-1) salok mehlaa 1. Shalok, First Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56443	pauxY pwxI AgnI jIau iqn ikAw KusIAw ikAw pIV ] (1289-1, mlwr, mÚ 1) pa-unai paanee agnee jee-o tin ki-aa khusee-aa ki-aa peerh. Living beings are formed of air, water and fire. They are subject to pleasure and pain.
RECORD	para 56444	DrqI pwqwlI AwkwsI ieik dir rhin vjIr ] (1289-1, mlwr, mÚ 1) Dhartee paataalee aakaasee ik dar rahan vajeer. In this world, in the nether regions of the underworld, and in the Akaashic ethers of the heavens, some remain ministers in the Court of the Lord.
RECORD	para 56445	ieknw vfI Awrjw ieik mir hoih jhIr ] (1289-2, mlwr, mÚ 1) iknaa vadee aarjaa ik mar hohi jaheer. Some live long lives, while others suffer and die.
RECORD	para 56446	ieik dy Kwih inKutY nwhI ieik sdw iPrih PkIr ] (1289-2, mlwr, mÚ 1) ik day khaahi nikhutai naahee ik sadaa fireh fakeer. Some give and consume, and still their wealth is not exhausted, while others remain poor forever.
RECORD	para 56447	hukmI swjy hukmI Fwhy eyk csy mih lK ] (1289-3, mlwr, mÚ 1) hukmee saajay hukmee dhaahay ayk chasay meh lakh. In His Will He creates, and in His Will He destroys thousands in an instant.
WHEN	para 56448	sBu ko nQY niQAw bKsy qoVy nQ ] (1289-3, mlwr, mÚ 1) sabh ko nathai nathi-aa bakhsay torhay nath. He has harnessed everyone with His harness; when He forgives, he breaks the harness.
DEFINE	para 56449	vrnw ichnw bwhrw lyKy bwJu AlKu ] (1289-4, mlwr, mÚ 1) varnaa chihnaa baahraa laykhay baajh alakh. He has no color or features; He is invisible and beyond calculation.
