DEFINE	para 56451	krxw kQnw kwr sB nwnk Awip AkQu ] (1289-4, mlwr, mÚ 1) karnaa kathnaa kaar sabh naanak aap akath. All the actions which are done and described, O Nanak, are done by the Indescribable Lord Himself.
RECORD	para 56452	AkQ kI kQw suxyie ] (1289-5, mlwr, mÚ 1) akath kee kathaa sunay-ay. Whoever hears the description of the indescribable,
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	iriD buiD isiD igAwnu sdw suKu hoie ]1] (1289-5, mlwr, mÚ 1) riDh buDh siDh gi-aan sadaa sukh ho-ay. ||1||
UPHOLD	slok mhlw 3 v1	is blessed with wealth, intelligence, perfection, spiritual wisdom and eternal peace. ||1||
RECORD	para 56454	mÚ 1 ] (1289-6) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
RECORD	para 56455	Ajru jrY q nau kul bMDu ] (1289-6, mlwr, mÚ 1) ajar jarai ta na-o kul banDh. One who bears the unbearable, controls the nine holes of the body.
RECORD	para 56456	pUjY pRwx hovY iQru kMDu ] (1289-6, mlwr, mÚ 1) poojai paraan hovai thir kanDh. One who worships and adores the Lord with his breath of life, gains stability in his body-wall.
RECORD	para 56457	khW qy AwieAw khW eyhu jwxu ] (1289-6, mlwr, mÚ 1) kahaa N tay aa-i-aa kahaa N ayhu jaan. Where has he come from, and where will he go?
DEFINE	para 56458	jIvq mrq rhY prvwxu ] (1289-7, mlwr, mÚ 1) jeevat marat rahai parvaan. Remaining dead while yet alive, he is accepted and approved.
RECORD	para 56459	hukmY bUJY qqu pCwxY ] (1289-7, mlwr, mÚ 1) hukmai boojhai tat pachhaanai. Whoever understands the Hukam of the Lord's Command, realizes the essence of reality.
