DEFINE	slok mhlw 3 v2	Only those who have no ego and no self-conceit, are not consigned to reincarnation. ||2||
RECORD	para 56463	pauVI ] (1289-8) pa-orhee. Pauree:
DEFINE	para 56464	pV@IAY nwmu swlwh hoir buDˆØI imiQAw ] (1289-8, mlwr, mÚ 1) parhHee-ai naam saalaah hor buDhee N mithi-aa. Read the Praise of the Lord's Name; other intellectual pursuits are false.
DEFINE	para 56465	ibnu scy vwpwr jnmu ibriQAw ] (1289-9, mlwr, mÚ 1) bin sachay vaapaar janam birthi-aa. Without dealing in Truth, life is worthless.
RECORD	para 56466	AMqu n pwrwvwru n ikn hI pwieAw ] (1289-9, mlwr, mÚ 1) ant na paaraavaar na kin hee paa-i-aa. No one has ever found the Lord's end or limitation.
DEFINE	para 56467	sBu jgu grib gubwru iqn scu n BwieAw ] (1289-9, mlwr, mÚ 1) sabh jag garab gubaar tin sach na bhaa-i-aa. All the world is enveloped by the darkness of egotistical pride. It does not like the Truth.
