RECORD	para 56469	bldI AMdir qylu duibDw GiqAw ] (1289-10, mlwr, mÚ 1) baldee andar tayl dubiDhaa ghati-aa. They pour the oil of duality within, and burn.
WHEN	para 56470	AwieAw auTI Kylu iPrY auviqAw ] (1289-11, mlwr, mÚ 1) aa-i-aa uthee khayl firai uvti-aa. They come into the world and wander around aimlessly; they depart when the play is finished.
