RECORD	para 56507	qoAw AwKY hau bhu ibiD hCw qoAY bhuqu ibkwrw ] (1290-8, mlwr, mÚ 1) to-aa aakhai ha-o baho biDh hachhaa toai bahut bikaaraa. Water says, "I am good in many ways." But water takes many forms.
