DEFINE	para 56511	scw sbdu vIcwir sy quJ hI mwih smwieAw ] (1290-10, mlwr, mÚ 1) sachaa sabad veechaar say tujh hee maahi samaa-i-aa. Those who contemplate the True Word of the Shabad are absorbed into You, O Lord.
