RECORD	para 56536	pMc sbd Duinkwr Duin qh bwjY sbdu nIswxu ] (1291-1, mlwr, mÚ 1) panch sabad Dhunikaar Dhun tah baajai sabad neesaan. The Panch Shabad, the Five Primal Sounds, resonate and resound within; the insignia of the Shabad is revealed there, vibrating gloriously.
DEFINE	para 56537	dIp loA pwqwl qh KMf mMfl hYrwnu ] (1291-2, mlwr, mÚ 1) deep lo-a paataal tah khand mandal hairaan. Worlds and realms, nether regions, solar systems and galaxies are wondrously revealed.
DEFINE	para 56538	qwr Gor bwijMqR qh swic qKiq sulqwnu ] (1291-2, mlwr, mÚ 1) taar ghor baajintar tah saach takhat sultaan. The strings and the harps vibrate and resound; the true throne of the Lord is there.
RECORD	para 56539	suKmn kY Gir rwgu suin suMin mMfil ilv lwie ] (1291-3, mlwr, mÚ 1) sukhman kai ghar raag sun sunn mandal liv laa-ay. Listen to the music of the home of the heart - Sukhmani, peace of mind. Lovingly tune in to His state of celestial ecstasy.
DEFINE	para 56540	AkQ kQw bIcwrIAY mnsw mnih smwie ] (1291-3, mlwr, mÚ 1) akath kathaa beechaaree-ai mansaa maneh samaa-ay. Contemplate the Unspoken Speech, and the desires of the mind are dissolved.
RECORD	para 56541	aulit kmlu AMimRiq BirAw iehu mnu kqhu n jwie ] (1291-4, mlwr, mÚ 1) ulat kamal amrit bhari-aa ih man katahu na jaa-ay. The heart-lotus is turned upside-down, and is filled with Ambrosial Nectar. This mind does not go out; it does not get distracted.
DEFINE	para 56542	Ajpw jwpu n vIsrY Awid jugwid smwie ] (1291-4, mlwr, mÚ 1) ajpaa jaap na veesrai aad jugaad samaa-ay. It does not forget the Chant which is chanted without chanting; it is immersed in the Primal Lord God of the ages.
UPHOLD	para 56543	siB sKIAw pMcy imly gurmuiK inj Gir vwsu ] (1291-5, mlwr, mÚ 1) sabh sakhee-aa panchay milay gurmukh nij ghar vaas. All the sister-companions are blessed with the five virtues. The Gurmukhs dwell in the home of the self deep within.
RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	sbdu Koij iehu Gru lhY nwnku qw kw dwsu ]1] (1291-5, mlwr, mÚ 1) sabad khoj ih ghar lahai naanak taa kaa daas. ||1||
