RECORD	para 56545	mÚ 1 ] (1291-6) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56546	icilimil ibsIAwr dunIAw PwnI ] (1291-6, mlwr, mÚ 1) chilimil bisee-aar dunee-aa faanee. The extravagant glamor of the world is a passing show.
RECORD	para 56547	kwlUib Akl mn gor n mwnI ] (1291-6, mlwr, mÚ 1) kaaloob akal man gor na maanee. My twisted mind does not believe that it will end up in a grave.
DEFINE	para 56548	mn kmIn kmqrIn qU drIAwau KudwieAw ] (1291-7, mlwr, mÚ 1) man kameen kamatreen too daree-aa-o khudaa-i-aa. I am meek and lowly; You are the great river.
DEFINE	para 56549	eyku cIju muJY dyih Avr jhr cIj n BwieAw ] (1291-7, mlwr, mÚ 1) ayk cheej mujhai deh avar jahar cheej na bhaa-i-aa. Please, bless me with the one thing; everything else is poison, and does not tempt me.
RECORD	para 56550	purwb Kwm kUjY ihkmiq KudwieAw ] (1291-8, mlwr, mÚ 1) puraab khaam koojai hikmat khudaa-i-aa. You filled this fragile body with the water of life, O Lord, by Your Creative Power.
RECORD	para 56551	mn quAwnw qU kudrqI AwieAw ] (1291-8, mlwr, mÚ 1) man tu-aanaa too kudratee aa-i-aa. By Your Omnipotence, I have become powerful.
DEFINE	para 56552	sg nwnk dIbwn msqwnw inq cVY svwieAw ] (1291-8, mlwr, mÚ 1) sag naanak deebaan mastaanaa nit charhai savaa-i-aa. Nanak is a dog in the Court of the Lord, intoxicated more and more, all the time.
