RECORD	para 56554	pauVI nvI mÚ 5 ] (1291-9) pa-orhee navee mehlaa 5. New Pauree, Fifth Mehl:
DEFINE	para 56555	sBo vrqY clqu clqu vKwixAw ] (1291-10, mlwr, mÚ 5) sabho vartai chalat chalat vakhaani-aa. His wonderful play is all-pervading; it is wonderful and amazing!
RECORD	para 56556	pwrbRhmu prmysru gurmuiK jwixAw ] (1291-10, mlwr, mÚ 5) paarbarahm parmaysar gurmukh jaani-aa. As Gurmukh, I know the the Transcendent Lord, the Supreme Lord God.
DEFINE	para 56557	lQy siB ivkwr sbid nIswixAw ] (1291-10, mlwr, mÚ 5) lathay sabh vikaar sabad neesaani-aa. All my sins and corruption are washed away, through the insignia of the Shabad, the Word of God.
DEFINE	para 56558	swDU sMig auDwru Bey inkwixAw ] (1291-11, mlwr, mÚ 5) saaDhoo sang uDhaar bha-ay nikaani-aa. In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, one is saved, and becomes free.
RECORD	para 56559	ismir ismir dwqwru siB rMg mwixAw ] (1291-11, mlwr, mÚ 5) simar simar daataar sabh rang maani-aa. Meditating, meditating in remembrance on the Great Giver, I enjoy all comforts and pleasures.
