RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v2	krux ik®pwl guopwl dIn bMDu nwnk auDru srin prIAw ]2]11]30] (1303-17, kwnVw, mÚ 5) karun kirpaal gopaal deen banDh naanak uDhar saran paree-aa. ||2||
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v2	O Merciful Lord of the World, Embodiment of Compassion, Relative of the meek and the poor, please save Nanak; I seek Your Sanctuary. ||2||
RECORD	para 57007	jIA pRwn mwn dwqw ] (1303-18, kwnVw, mÚ 5) jee-a paraan maan daataa. The Giver of the soul, the breath of life and honor
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v1	hir ibsrqy hI hwin ]1] rhwau ] (1303-18, kwnVw, mÚ 5) har bisratay hee haan. ||1||
DEFINE	kwnVw mhlw 5 v1	rahaa-o. - forgetting the Lord, all is lost. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 57009	goibMd iqAwig Awn lwgih AMimRqo fwir BUim pwgih ] (1303-18, kwnVw, mÚ 5) gobind ti-aag aan laageh amrito daar bhoom paageh. You have forsaken the Lord of the Universe, and become attached to another - you are throwing away the Ambrosial Nectar, to take dust.
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v1	ibKY rs isau Awskq mUVy kwhy suK mwin ]1] (1303-19, kwnVw, mÚ 5) bikhai ras si-o aaskat moorhay kaahay sukh maan. ||1||
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v1	What do you expect from corrupt pleasures? You fool! What makes you think that they will bring peace? ||1||
REQUIRE	para 57012	kwim k®oiD loiB ibAwipE jnm hI kI Kwin ] (1304-1, kwnVw, mÚ 5) kaam kroDh lobh bi-aapi-o janam hee kee khaan. Engrossed in unfulfilled sexual desire, unresolved anger and greed, you shall be consigned to reincarnation.
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v2	piqq pwvn srin AwieE auDru nwnk jwin ]2]12]31] (1304-1, kwnVw, mÚ 5) patit paavan saran aa-i-o uDhar naanak jaan. ||2||
REQUIRE	kwnVw mhlw 5 v2	But I have entered the Sanctuary of the Purifier of sinners. O Nanak, I know that I shall be saved. ||2||
