RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v1	auqirAw duKu mMd ]1] (1304-3, kwnVw, mÚ 5) utri-aa dukh mand. ||1||
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v1	pain and wickedness have been dispelled. ||1||
DEFINE	para 57019	rwj Dnu prvwru myrY srbso goibMd ] (1304-3, kwnVw, mÚ 5) raaj Dhan parvaar mayrai sarbaso gobind. The Lord of all the Universe is my kingdom, wealth and family.
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v2	swDsMgim lwBu pwieE nwnk iPir n mrMd ]2]13]32] (1304-4, kwnVw, mÚ 5) saaDhsangam laabh paa-i-o naanak fir na marand. ||2||
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v2	In the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, Nanak has earned the Profit; he shall never die again. ||2||
