RECORD	para 57069	pUjwcwr krq mylµgw ] (1305-5, kwnVw, mÚ 5) poojaachaar karat maylangaa. They sit cross-legged, perform worship services and do good deeds.
RECORD	para 57070	ck® krm iqlk KwtMgw ] (1305-6, kwnVw, mÚ 5) chakar karam tilak khaatangaa. They apply religious symbols to their bodies, and ceremonial marks to their limbs.
