RECORD	para 57091	ihrdY goibMd gwie crn kml pRIiq lwie dIn dieAwl mohnw ] (1305-17, kwnVw, mÚ 5) hirdai gobind gaa-ay charan kamal pareet laa-ay deen da-i-aal mohnaa. Within your heart, sing the Praises of the Lord of the Universe, and be lovingly attuned to His Lotus Feet. He is the Fascinating Lord, Merciful to the meek and the humble.
RECORD	para 57092	ik®pwl dieAw mieAw Dwir ] (1305-18, kwnVw, mÚ 5) kirpaal da-i-aa ma-i-aa Dhaar. O Merciful Lord, please bless me with Your Kindness and Compassion.
