RECORD	para 57099	jqn BWqn qpn BRmn Aink kQn kQqy nhI Qwh pweI Twau ] (1306-1, kwnVw, mÚ 5) jatan bhaaNtan tapan bharman anik kathan kathtay nahee thaah paa-ee thaa-o. All sorts of efforts, austerities, wanderings and various speeches - none of these will lead you to find the Lord's Place.
RECORD	kwnVw mhlw 5 v2	soiD sgr soDnw suKu nwnkw Bju nwau ]2]2]39] (1306-2, kwnVw, mÚ 5) soDh sagar soDhnaa sukh naankaa bhaj naa-o. ||2||
