DEFINE	para 57773	gurmuiK joiq BlI isv nIkI Awin pwnI skiq BrIjY ] (1324-16, kilAwn, mÚ 4) gurmukh jot bhalee siv neekee aan paanee sakat bhareejai. The Gurmukhs are blessed with the Divine Light of the Lord; Maya comes to serve them.
RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v3	mYndMq inksy gur bcnI swru cib cib hir rsu pIjY ]3] (1324-17, kilAwn, mÚ 4) maindant niksay gur bachnee saar chab chab har ras peejai. ||3||
RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v3	Through the Word of the Guru's Teachings, they bite with teeth of wax and chew iron, drinking in the Sublime Essence of the Lord. ||3||
RECORD	para 57775	rwm nwm AnugRhu bhu kIAw gur swDU purK imlIjY ] (1324-17, kilAwn, mÚ 4) raam naam anoograhu baho kee-aa gur saaDhoo purakh mileejai. The Lord has shown great mercy, and bestowed His Name; I have met with the Holy Guru, the Primal Being.
RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v4	gun rwm nwm ibsQIrn kIey hir sgl Bvn jsu dIjY ]4] (1324-18, kilAwn, mÚ 4) gun raam naam bistheeran kee-ay har sagal bhavan jas deejai. ||4||
RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v4	The Glorious Praises of the Lord's Name have spread out everywhere; the Lord bestows fame all over the world. ||4||
RECORD	para 57777	swDU swD swD min pRIqm ibnu dyKy rih n skIjY ] (1324-18, kilAwn, mÚ 4) saaDhoo saaDh saaDh man pareetam bin daykhay reh na sakeejai. The Beloved Lord is within the minds of the Holy, the Holy Saadhus; without seeing Him, they cannot survive.
RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v5	ijau jl mIn jlµ jl pRIiq hY iKnu jl ibnu PUit mrIjY ]5] (1324-19, kilAwn, mÚ 4) ji-o jal meen jala N jal pareet hai khin jal bin foot mareejai. ||5||
RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v5	The fish in the water loves only the water. Without water, it bursts and dies in an instant. ||5||
RECORD	para 57780	mhw ABwg ABwg hY ijn ky iqn swDU DUir n pIjY ] (1325-1, kilAwn, mÚ 4) mahaa abhaag abhaag hai jin kay tin saaDhoo Dhoor na peejai. Those who have terrible luck and bad fortune do not drink in the water which washes the dust of the feet of the Holy.
RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v6	iqnw iqsnw jlq jlq nhI bUJih fMfu Drm rwie kw dIjY ]6] (1325-1, kilAwn, mÚ 4) tinaa tisnaa jalat jalat nahee boojheh dand Dharam raa-ay kaa deejai. ||6||
