DEFINE	kilAwn mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. I surrender my mind and body, and place everything before Him; following the Guru's Teachings, spiritual wisdom is implanted within me. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 57789	bRhm nwm gux swK qrovr inq cuin cuin pUj krIjY ] (1325-6, kilAwn, mÚ 4) barahm naam gun saakh tarovar nit chun chun pooj kareejai. God's Name is the tree, and His Glorious Virtues are the branches. Picking and gathering up the fruit, I worship Him.
