DEFINE	kilAwn mhlw 4 v2	By Guru's Grace, the treasure is found; dedicate this mind to the True Guru. ||2||
DEFINE	para 57793	inrmolku Aiq hIro nIko hIrY hIru ibDIjY ] (1325-8, kilAwn, mÚ 4) nirmolak at heero neeko heerai heer biDheejai. Priceless and utterly sublime is the Diamond of the Lord. This Diamond pierces the diamond of the mind.
