RECORD	para 57810	kwm kroDu ngr mih sblw inq auiT auiT jUJu krIjY ] (1325-18, kilAwn, mÚ 4) kaam karoDh nagar meh sablaa nit uth uth joojh kareejai. Sexual desire and anger are very powerful in the body-village; I rise up to fight the battle against them.
