DEFINE	kilAwn mhlw 4 v3	My mind and body are calm and tranquil; the disease has been cured, and now I sleep in peace. ||3||
RECORD	para 57815	ijau sUrju ikrix rivAw srb TweI sB Git Git rwmu rvIjY ] (1326-2, kilAwn, mÚ 4) ji-o sooraj kiran ravi-aa sarab thaa-ee sabh ghat ghat raam raveejai. As the rays of the sun spread out everywhere, the Lord pervades each and every heart.
