RECORD	kilAwn mhlw 4 v6	Awpn suAwie krih bhu bwqw iqnw kw ivswhu ikAw kIjY ]6] (1326-5, kilAwn, mÚ 4) aapan su-aa-ay karahi baho baataa tinaa kaa visaahu ki-aa keejai. ||6||
RECORD	kilAwn mhlw 4 v6	He talks excessively about his own interests. How can he be trusted? ||6||
WHEN	para 57821	swDU swD srin imil sMgiq ijqu hir rsu kwiF kFIjY ] (1326-6, kilAwn, mÚ 4) saaDhoo saaDh saran mil sangat jit har ras kaadh kadheejai. I have sought the Sanctuary of the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy; I have found the Sublime Essence of the Lord.
RECORD	kilAwn mhlw 4 v7	praupkwr bolih bhu guxIAw muiK sMq Bgq hir dIjY ]7] (1326-6, kilAwn, mÚ 4) par-upkaar boleh baho gunee-aa mukh sant bhagat har deejai. ||7||
RECORD	kilAwn mhlw 4 v7	They do good deeds for others, and speak of the Lord's many Glorious Virtues; please bless me to meet these Saints, these devotees of the Lord. ||7||
