RECORD	kilAwn mhlw 4 v8	srb jIA jgjIvnu eyko nwnk pRiqpwl krIjY ]8]5] (1326-8, kilAwn, mÚ 4) sarab jee-a jagjeevan ayko naanak partipaal kareejai. ||8||
DEFINE	kilAwn mhlw 4 v8	5|| You are the Life of all the beings of the world; please cherish and sustain Nanak. ||8||5||
RECORD	para 57826	rwmw hm dwsn dws krIjY ] (1326-8, kilAwn, mÚ 4) raamaa ham daasan daas kareejai. O Lord, please make me the slave of Your slaves.
