DEFINE	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v1	rahaa-o. As long as there is breath deep within my mind, let me drink in the dust of the Holy. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 57828	sMkru nwrdu syKnwg muin DUir swDU kI locIjY ] (1326-9, kilAwn, mÚ 4) sankar naarad saykhnaag mun Dhoor saaDhoo kee locheejai. Shiva, Naarad, the thousand-headed cobra king and the silent sages long for the dust of the Holy.
RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v1	Bvn Bvn pivqu hoih siB jh swDU crn DrIjY ]1] (1326-10, kilAwn, mÚ 4) bhavan bhavan pavit hohi sabh jah saaDhoo charan Dhareejai. ||1||
DEFINE	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v1	All the worlds and realms where the Holy place their feet are sanctified. ||1||
RECORD	para 57830	qij lwj AhMkwru sBu qjIAY imil swDU sMig rhIjY ] (1326-11, kilAwn, mÚ 4) taj laaj aha Nkaar sabh tajee-ai mil saaDhoo sang raheejai. So let go of your shame and renounce all your egotism; join with the Saadh Sangat, the Company of the Holy, and remain there.
