REQUIRE	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v2	Give up your fear of the Righteous Judge of Dharma, and you shall be lifted up and saved from drowning in the sea of poison. ||2||
RECORD	para 57832	Brim sUky bhu auiB suk khIAih imil swDU sMig hrIjY ] (1326-12, kilAwn, mÚ 4) bharam sookay baho ubh suk kahee-ahi mil saaDhoo sang hareejai. Some are standing, parched and shrivelled up by their doubts; joining the Saadh Sangat, they are rejuvenated.
