RECORD	kilAwnu mhlw 4 v3	So do not delay, even for an instant - go and fall at the feet of the Holy. ||3||
RECORD	para 57834	rwm nwm kIrqn rqn vQu hir swDU pwis rKIjY ] (1326-13, kilAwn, mÚ 4) raam naam keertan ratan vath har saaDhoo paas rakheejai. The Kirtan of the Praise of the Lord's Name is a priceless jewel. The Lord has given it for the Holy to keep.
