DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	Within the self, the self is revealed, when one is blessed with the Ambrosial Naam, the Name of the Lord. ||1||
DEFINE	para 57926	krqw qU myrw jjmwnu ] (1329-6, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) kartaa too mayraa jajmaan. O Creator Lord, You alone are my Benefactor.
