DEFINE	para 57928	pMc qskr Dwvq rwKy cUkw min AiBmwnu ] (1329-7, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) panch taskar Dhaavat raakhay chookaa man abhimaan. The five wandering thieves are captured and held, and the egotistical pride of the mind is subdued.
