DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v3	Bless me with the milk of good karma, and the clarified butter, the ghee, of compassion. Such are the gifts I beg of You, Lord. ||3||
RECORD	para 57932	iKmw DIrju kir gaU lvyrI shjy bCrw KIru pIAY ] (1329-9, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) khimaa Dheeraj kar ga-oo lavayree sehjay bachhraa kheer pee-ai. Let forgiveness and patience be my milk-cows, and let the calf of my mind intuitively drink in this milk.
