DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	He alone thoroughly understands this, from whom all beings come; all are merged and immersed in Him. ||1||
DEFINE	para 57937	qUhY hY vwhu qyrI rjwie ] (1329-11, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) toohai hai vaahu tayree rajaa-ay. Waaho! - You are Great, and Wondrous is Your Will.
