RECORD	para 57943	ijs kI Awsw iqs hI sauip kY eyhu rihAw inrbwxu ] (1329-15, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) jis kee aasaa tis hee sa-up kai ayhu rahi-aa nirbaan. Hope comes from the Lord; surrendering to Him, we remain in the state of nirvaanaa.
