RECORD	para 58465	nmskwr rKnhwr min ArwiD pRBU myk ] (1341-17, pRBwqI, mÚ 5) namaskaar rakhanhaar man araaDh parabhoo mayk. So bow down in respect to the Savior Lord; worship and adore the One God.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 5 v2	sMq rynu krau mjnu nwnk pwvY suK Anyk ]2]2]15] (1341-17, pRBwqI, mÚ 5) sant rayn kara-o majan naanak paavai sukh anayk. ||2||
DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 5 v2	Bathing in the dust of the feet of the Saints, Nanak is blessed with countless comforts. ||2||
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws (1342-1)
RECORD	para 58468	parbhaatee asatpadee-aa mehlaa 1 bibhaas Prabhaatee, Ashtapadees, First Mehl, Bibhaas:
RECORD	para 58469	<> siqgur pRswid ] (1342-1) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
RECORD	para 58470	duibDw baurI mnu baurwieAw ] (1342-2, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) dubiDhaa ba-uree man ba-uraa-i-aa. The insanity of duality has driven the mind insane.
DEFINE	para 58471	JUTY lwlic jnmu gvwieAw ] (1342-2, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) jhoothai laalach janam gavaa-i-aa. In false greed, life is wasting away.
RECORD	para 58472	lpit rhI Puin bMDu n pwieAw ] (1342-2, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) lapat rahee fun banDh na paa-i-aa. Duality clings to the mind; it cannot be restrained.
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v1	siqguir rwKy nwmu idRVwieAw ]1] (1342-3, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) satgur raakhay naam drirh-aa-i-aa. ||1||
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v1	The True Guru saves us, implanting the Naam, the Name of the Lord within. ||1||
RECORD	para 58474	nw mnu mrY n mwieAw mrY ] (1342-3, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) naa man marai na maa-i-aa marai. Without subduing the mind, Maya cannot be subdued.
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v1	ijin ikCu kIAw soeI jwxY sbdu vIcwir Bau swgru qrY ]1] rhwau ] (1342-3, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) jin kichh kee-aa so-ee jaanai sabad veechaar bha-o saagar tarai. ||1||
DEFINE	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v1	rahaa-o. The One who created this, He alone understands. Contemplating the Word of the Shabad, one is carried across the terrifying world-ocean. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 58476	mwieAw sMic rwjy AhMkwrI ] (1342-4, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa sanch raajay aha Nkaaree. Gathering the wealth of Maya, kings become proud and arrogant.
FORBID	para 58477	mwieAw swiQ n clY ipAwrI ] (1342-4, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa saath na chalai pi-aaree. But this Maya that they love so much shall not go along with them in the end.
DEFINE	para 58478	mwieAw mmqw hY bhu rMgI ] (1342-5, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa mamtaa hai baho rangee. There are so many colors and flavors of attachment to Maya.
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v2	ibnu nwvY ko swiQ n sMgI ]2] (1342-5, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) bin naavai ko saath na sangee. ||2||
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v2	Except for the Name, no one has any friend or companion. ||2||
RECORD	para 58480	ijau mnu dyKih pr mnu qYsw ] (1342-5, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) ji-o man daykheh par man taisaa. According to one's own mind, one sees the minds of others.
DEFINE	para 58481	jYsI mnsw qYsI dsw ] (1342-6, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) jaisee mansaa taisee dasaa. According to one's desires, one's condition is determined.
DEFINE	para 58482	jYsw krmu qYsI ilv lwvY ] (1342-6, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) jaisaa karam taisee liv laavai. According to one's actions, one is focused and tuned in.
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v3	siqguru pUiC shj Gru pwvY ]3] (1342-6, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) satgur poochh sahj ghar paavai. ||3||
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v3	Seeking the advice of the True Guru, one finds the home of peace and poise. ||3||
DEFINE	para 58484	rwig nwid mnu dUjY Bwie ] (1342-7, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) raag naad man doojai bhaa-ay. In music and song, the mind is caught by the love of duality.
RECORD	para 58485	AMqir kptu mhw duKu pwie ] (1342-7, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) antar kapat mahaa dukh paa-ay. Filled with deception deep within, one suffers in terrible pain.
DEFINE	para 58486	siqguru BytY soJI pwie ] (1342-7, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) satgur bhaytai sojhee paa-ay. Meeting with the True Guru, one is blessed with clear understanding,
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v4	scY nwim rhY ilv lwie ]4] (1342-7, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) sachai naam rahai liv laa-ay. ||4||
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v4	and remains lovingly attuned to the True Name. ||4||
RECORD	para 58488	scY sbid scu kmwvY ] (1342-8, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) sachai sabad sach kamaavai. Through the True Word of the Shabad, one practices Truth.
RECORD	para 58489	scI bwxI hir gux gwvY ] (1342-8, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) sachee banee har gun gaavai. He sings the Glorious Praises of the Lord, through the True Word of His Bani.
RECORD	para 58490	inj Gir vwsu Amr pdu pwvY ] (1342-8, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) nij ghar vaas amar pad paavai. He dwells in the home of his own heart deep within, and obtains the immortal status.
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v5	qw dir swcY soBw pwvY ]5] (1342-9, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) taa dar saachai sobhaa paavai. ||5||
DEFINE	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v5	Then, he is blessed with honor in the Court of the True Lord. ||5||
DEFINE	para 58492	gur syvw ibnu Bgiq n hoeI ] (1342-9, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) gur sayvaa bin bhagat na ho-ee. Without serving the Guru, there is no devotional worship,
ALLOW	para 58493	Anyk jqn krY jy koeI ] (1342-9, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) anayk jatan karai jay ko-ee. even though one may make all sorts of efforts.
WHEN	para 58494	haumY myrw sbdy KoeI ] (1342-9, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) ha-umai mayraa sabday kho-ee. If one eradicates egotism and selfishness through the Shabad,
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v6	inrml nwmu vsY min soeI ]6] (1342-10, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) nirmal naam vasai man so-ee. ||6||
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v6	the Immaculate Naam comes to abide in the mind. ||6||
DEFINE	para 58496	iesu jg mih sbdu krxI hY swru ] (1342-10, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) is jag meh sabad karnee hai saar. In this world, the practice of the Shabad is the most excellent occupation.
DEFINE	para 58497	ibnu sbdY horu mohu gubwru ] (1342-10, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) bin sabdai hor moh gubaar. Without the Shabad, everything else is the darkness of emotional attachment.
DEFINE	para 58498	sbdy nwmu rKY auir Dwir ] (1342-11, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) sabday naam rakhai ur Dhaar. Through the Shabad, the Naam is enshrined within the heart.
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v7	sbdy giq miq moK duAwru ]7] (1342-11, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) sabday gat mat mokh du-aar. ||7||
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v7	Through the Shabad, one obtains clear understanding and the door of salvation. ||7||
DEFINE	para 58500	Avru nwhI kir dyKxhwro ] (1342-11, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) avar naahee kar daykhanhaaro. There is no other Creator except the All-seeing Lord God.
DEFINE	para 58501	swcw Awip AnUpu Apwro ] (1342-12, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) saachaa aap anoop apaaro. The True Lord Himself is Infinite and Incomparably Beautiful.
RECORD	para 58502	rwm nwm aUqm giq hoeI ] (1342-12, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) raam naam ootam gat ho-ee. Through the Lord's Name, one obtains the most sublime and exalted state.
RECORD	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v8	nwnk Koij lhY jnu koeI ]8]1] (1342-12, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 1) naanak khoj lahai jan ko-ee. ||8||
DEFINE	pRBwqI AstpdIAw mhlw 1 ibBws v8	1|| O Nanak, how rare are those humble beings, who seek and find the Lord. ||8||1||
DEFINE	para 58505	mwieAw moih sgl jgu CwieAw ] (1342-13, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa mohi sagal jag chhaa-i-aa. Emotional attachment to Maya is spread out all over the world.
DEFINE	para 58506	kwmix dyiK kwim loBwieAw ] (1342-13, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) kaaman daykh kaam lobhaa-i-aa. Seeing a beautiful woman, the man is overcome with sexual desire.
RECORD	para 58507	suq kMcn isau hyqu vDwieAw ] (1342-14, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) sut kanchan si-o hayt vaDhaa-i-aa. His love for his children and gold steadily increases.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	sBu ikCu Apnw ieku rwmu prwieAw ]1] (1342-14, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) sabh kichh apnaa ik raam paraa-i-aa. ||1||
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	He sees everything as his own, but he does not own the One Lord. ||1||
RECORD	para 58509	AYsw jwpu jpau jpmwlI ] (1342-14, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) aisaa jaap japa-o japmaalee. I meditate as I chant on such a mala,
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	duK suK prhir Bgiq inrwlI ]1] rhwau ] (1342-15, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) dukh sukh parhar bhagat niraalee. ||1||
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	rahaa-o. that I rise above pleasure and pain; I attain the most wondrous devotional worship of the Lord. ||1||Pause||
RECORD	para 58511	gux inDwn qyrw AMqu n pwieAw ] (1342-15, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) gun niDhaan tayraa ant na paa-i-aa. O Treasure of Virtue, Your limits cannot be found.
RECORD	para 58512	swc sbid quJ mwih smwieAw ] (1342-15, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) saach sabad tujh maahi samaa-i-aa. Through the True Word of the Shabad, I am absorbed into You.
RECORD	para 58513	Awvw gauxu quDu Awip rcwieAw ] (1342-16, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) aavaa ga-on tuDh aap rachaa-i-aa. You Yourself created the comings and goings of reincarnation.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v2	syeI Bgq ijn sic icqu lwieAw ]2] (1342-16, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) say-ee bhagat jin sach chit laa-i-aa. ||2||
DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v2	They alone are devotees, who focus their consciousness on You. ||2||
UPHOLD	para 58515	igAwnu iDAwnu nrhir inrbwxI ] (1342-17, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) gi-aan Dhi-aan narhar nirbaanee. Spiritual wisdom and meditation on the Lord, the Lord of Nirvaanaa
RECORD	para 58516	ibnu siqgur Byty koie n jwxI ] (1342-17, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) bin satgur bhaytay ko-ay na jaanee. - without meeting the True Guru, no one knows this.
RECORD	para 58517	sgl srovr joiq smwxI ] (1342-17, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) sagal sarovar jot samaanee. The Lord's Light fills the sacred pools of all beings.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v3	Awnd rUp ivthu kurbwxI ]3] (1342-18, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) aanad roop vitahu kurbaanee. ||3||
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v3	I am a sacrifice to the Embodiment of Bliss. ||3||
RECORD	para 58519	Bwau Bgiq gurmqI pwey ] (1342-18, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) bhaa-o bhagat gurmatee paa-ay. Through the Guru's Teachings, one achieves loving devotional worship.
RECORD	para 58520	haumY ivchu sbid jlwey ] (1342-18, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) ha-umai vichahu sabad jalaa-ay. The Shabad burns away egotism from within.
DEFINE	para 58522	Dwvqu rwKY Twik rhwey ] (1343-1, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) Dhaavat raakhai thaak rahaa-ay. The wandering mind is restrained and held in its place.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v4	scw nwmu mMin vswey ]4] (1343-1, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) sachaa naam man vasaa-ay. ||4||
DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v4	The True Name is enshrined in the mind. ||4||
RECORD	para 58524	ibsm ibnod rhy prmwdI ] (1343-1, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) bisam binod rahay parmaadee. The exciting and intoxicating worldly plays come to an end,
RECORD	para 58525	gurmiq mwinAw eyk ilv lwgI ] (1343-1, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) gurmat maani-aa ayk liv laagee. for those who accept the Guru's Teachings, and become lovingly attuned to the One Lord.
DEFINE	para 58526	dyiK invwirAw jl mih AwgI ] (1343-2, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) daykh nivaari-aa jal meh aagee. Seeing this, the fire in the water is extinguished.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v5	so bUJY hovY vfBwgI ]5] (1343-2, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) so boojhai hovai vadbhaagee. ||5||
DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v5	They alone realize this, who are blessed by great good fortune. ||5||
DEFINE	para 58528	siqguru syvy Brmu cukwey ] (1343-2, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) satgur sayvay bharam chukaa-ay. Serving the True Guru, doubt is dispelled.
DEFINE	para 58529	Anidnu jwgY sic ilv lwey ] (1343-3, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) an-din jaagai sach liv laa-ay. Those who are lovingly attuned to the True Lord remain awake and aware night and day.
RECORD	para 58530	eyko jwxY Avru n koie ] (1343-3, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) ayko jaanai avar na ko-ay. They know the One Lord, and no other.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v6	suKdwqw syvy inrmlu hoie ]6] (1343-3, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) sukh-daata sayvay nirmal ho-ay. ||6||
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v6	Serving the Giver of peace, they become immaculate. ||6||
RECORD	para 58532	syvw suriq sbid vIcwir ] (1343-4, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) sayvaa surat sabad veechaar. Selfless service and intuitive awareness come by reflecting upon the Word of the Shabad.
RECORD	para 58533	jpu qpu sMjmu haumY mwir ] (1343-4, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) jap tap sanjam ha-umai maar. Chanting, intensive meditation and austere self-discipline come by subduing the ego.
RECORD	para 58534	jIvn mukqu jw sbdu suxwey ] (1343-4, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) jeevan mukat jaa sabad sunaa-ay. One becomes Jivan-mukta - liberated while yet alive, by listening to the Shabad.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v7	scI rhq scw suKu pwey ]7] (1343-5, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) sachee rahat sachaa sukh paa-ay. ||7||
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v7	Living a truthful way of life, one finds true peace. ||7||
DEFINE	para 58536	suKdwqw duKu mytxhwrw ] (1343-5, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) sukh-daata dukh maytanhaaraa. The Giver of peace is the Eradicator of pain.
RECORD	para 58537	Avru n sUJis bIjI kwrw ] (1343-5, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) avar na soojhas beejee kaaraa. I cannot conceive of serving any other.
RECORD	para 58538	qnu mnu Dnu hir AwgY rwiKAw ] (1343-5, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) tan man Dhan har aagai raakhi-aa. I place my body, mind and wealth in offering before Him.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v8	nwnku khY mhw rsu cwiKAw ]8]2] (1343-6, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) naanak kahai mahaa ras chaakhi-aa. ||8||
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v8	2|| Says Nanak, I have tasted the supreme, sublime Essence of the Lord. ||8||2||
ALLOW	para 58541	invlI krm BuAMgm BwTI ryck pUrk kuMB krY ] (1343-6, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) nivlee karam bhu-angam bhaathee raychak poorak kumbh karai. You may perform exercises of inner purification, and fire up the furnace of the Kundalini, inhaling and exhaling and holding the breath.
REQUIRE	para 58542	ibnu siqgur ikCu soJI nwhI Brmy BUlw bUif mrY ] (1343-7, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) bin satgur kichh sojhee naahee bharmay bhoolaa bood marai. Without the True Guru, you will not understand; deluded by doubt, you shall drown and die.
REQUIRE	para 58543	AMDw BirAw Bir Bir DovY AMqr kI mlu kdy n lhY ] (1343-7, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) anDhaa bhari-aa bhar bhar Dhovai antar kee mal kaday na lahai. The spiritually blind are filled with filth and pollution; they may wash, but the filth within shall never depart.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	nwm ibnw Pokt siB krmw ijau bwjIgru Brim BulY ]1] (1343-8, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) naam binaa fokat sabh karmaa ji-o baajeegar bharam bhulai. ||1||
DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	Without the Naam, the Name of the Lord, all their actions are useless, like the magician who deceives through illuions. ||1||
DEFINE	para 58545	Ktu krm nwmu inrMjnu soeI ] (1343-9, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) khat karam naam niranjan so-ee. The merits of the six religious rituals are obtained through the Immaculate Naam.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	qU gux swgru Avgux mohI ]1] rhwau ] (1343-9, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) too gun saagar avgun mohee. ||1||
DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v1	rahaa-o. You, O Lord, are the Ocean of virtue; I am so unworthy. ||1||Pause||
DEFINE	para 58547	mwieAw DMDw DwvxI durmiq kwr ibkwr ] (1343-9, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) maa-i-aa DhanDhaa Dhaavnee durmat kaar bikaar. Running around chasing the entanglements of Maya is an evil-minded act of corruption.
RECORD	para 58548	mUrKu Awpu gxwiedw bUiJ n skY kwr ] (1343-10, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) moorakh aap ganaa-idaa boojh na sakai kaar. The fool makes a show of his self-conceit; he does not know how to behave.
DEFINE	para 58549	mnsw mwieAw mohxI mnmuK bol KuAwr ] (1343-10, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) mansaa maa-i-aa mohnee manmukh bol khu-aar. The self-willed manmukh is enticed by his desires for Maya; his words are useless and empty.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v2	mjnu JUTw cMfwl kw Pokt cwr sINgwr ]2] (1343-11, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) majan jhoothaa chandaal kaa fokat chaar see Ngaar. ||2||
DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v2	The ritual cleansings of the sinner are fradulent; his rituals and decorations are useless and empty. ||2||
DEFINE	para 58551	JUTI mn kI miq hY krxI bwid ibbwdu ] (1343-11, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) jhoothee man kee mat hai karnee baad bibaad. False is the wisdom of the mind; its actions inspire useless disputes.
DEFINE	para 58552	JUTy ivic AhMkrxu hY Ksm n pwvY swdu ] (1343-12, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) jhoothay vich ahankaran hai khasam na paavai saad. The false are filled with egotism; they do not obtain the sublime taste of their Lord and Master.
DEFINE	para 58553	ibnu nwvY horu kmwvxw iPkw AwvY swdu ] (1343-12, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) bin naavai hor kamaavanaa fikaa aavai saad. Without the Name, whatever else they do is tasteless and insipid.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v3	dustI sBw ivgucIAY ibKu vwqI jIvx bwid ]3] (1343-13, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) dustee sabhaa viguchee-ai bikh vaatee jeevan baad. ||3||
DEFINE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v3	Associating with their enemies, they are plundered and ruined. Their speech is poison, and their lives are useless. ||3||
RECORD	para 58555	ey BRim BUly mrhu n koeI ] (1343-13, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) ay bharam bhoolay marahu na ko-ee. Do not be deluded by doubt; do not invite your own death.
REQUIRE	para 58556	siqguru syiv sdw suKu hoeI ] (1343-13, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) satgur sayv sadaa sukh ho-ee. Serve the True Guru, and you shall be at peace forever.
DEFINE	para 58557	ibnu siqgur mukiq iknY n pweI ] (1343-14, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) bin satgur mukat kinai na paa-ee. Without the True Guru, no one is liberated.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v4	Awvih jWih mrih mir jweI ]4] (1343-14, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) aavahi jaa Nhi mareh mar jaa-ee. ||4||
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v4	They come and go in reincarnation; they die, only to be reborn and die again. ||4||
RECORD	para 58559	eyhu srIru hY qRY gux Dwqu ] (1343-14, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) ayhu sareer hai tarai gun Dhaat. This body wanders, caught in the three dispositions.
DEFINE	para 58560	ies no ivAwpY sog sMqwpu ] (1343-15, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) is no vi-aapai sog santaap. It is afflicted by sorrow and suffering.
RECORD	para 58561	so syvhu ijsu mweI n bwpu ] (1343-15, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) so sayvhu jis maa-ee na baap. So serve the One who has no mother or father.
RECORD	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v5	ivchu cUkY iqsnw Aru Awpu ]5] (1343-15, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) vichahu chookai tisnaa ar aap. ||5||
REQUIRE	pRBwqI mhlw 1 v5	Desire and selfishness shall depart from within. ||5||
RECORD	para 58563	jh jh dyKw qh qh soeI ] (1343-16, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) jah jah daykhaa tah tah so-ee. Wherever I look, I see Him.
DEFINE	para 58564	ibnu siqgur Byty mukiq n hoeI ] (1343-16, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) bin satgur bhaytay mukat na ho-ee. Without meeting the True Guru, no one is liberated.
DEFINE	para 58565	ihrdY scu eyh krxI swru ] (1343-16, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) hirdai sach ayh karnee saar. Enshrine the True One in your heart; this is the most excellent action.
