DEFINE	para 58665	AYsy jn ivrly jg AMdir priK KjwnY pwieAw ] (1345-18, pRBwqI, mÚ 1) aisay jan virlay jag andar parakh khajaanai paa-i-aa. How rare are those humble beings in this world, whom the Lord tests and places in His Treasury.
