RECORD	para 58686	hir mMdr mih nwmu inDwnu hY nw bUJih mugD gvwr ] (1346-9, pRBwqI ibBws, mÚ 3) har mandar meh naam niDhaan hai naa boojheh mugaDh gavaar. The treasure of the Naam is within the Temple of the Lord. The idiotic fools do not realize this.
