DEFINE	para 59098	dwnµ prw pUrbyx BuMcMqy mhIpqy ] (1356-5, shsik®qI, mÚ 5) daana N paraa poorbayn bhu Nchantay maheepatay. The kings of the earth are eating up the blessings of the good karma of their past lives.
