RECORD	para 59151	imRq´ü jnm BRmMiq nrkh Aink aupwvM n isD´qy ] (1357-15, shsik®qI, mÚ 5) mitar-yo janam bharmant narkah anik upaava N na siDh-yatai. - these lead mortals to death and rebirth, wandering lost in hell. In spite of all sorts of efforts, salvation is not found.
