RECORD	para 59169	Alp suK Aivq cMcl aUc nIc smwvxh ] (1358-4, shsik®qI, mÚ 5) alap sukh avit chanchal ooch neech samaavneh. But you give only shallow pleasure, while you make the mortals weak and unsteady; you pervade the high and the low.
