RECORD	slok shsik®qI mhlw 5 v48	Save me, save me - I have come to Your Sanctuary, O my Lord and Master; Nanak prays to the Lord. ||48||
RECORD	para 59180	hy jnm mrx mUlµ AhMkwrM pwpwqmw ] (1358-11, shsik®qI, mÚ 5) hay janam maran moola N aha NkaaraN paapaatmaa. O egotism, you are the root of birth and death and the cycle of reincarnation; you are the very soul of sin.
RECORD	para 59181	imqRM qjMiq sqRM idRVMiq Aink mwXw ibsœIrnh ] (1358-11, shsik®qI, mÚ 5) mitraN tajant satraN darirh-aaNt anik maa-yaa bisteerniH. You forsake friends, and hold tight to enemies. You spread out countless illusions of Maya.
RECORD	para 59182	AwvMq jwvMq QkMq jIAw duK suK bhu Bogxh ] (1358-12, shsik®qI, mÚ 5) aavant jaavant thakant jee-aa dukh sukh baho bhognah. You cause the living beings to come and go until they are exhausted. You lead them to experience pain and pleasure.
