RECORD	para 59186	hy sMswr qwp hrxh kruxw mY sB duK hro ] (1358-14, shsik®qI, mÚ 5) hay sansaar taap harnah karunaa mai sabh dukh haro. O Destroyer of the fever of the world, Embodiment of Compassion, please take away all my pain.
