RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v237	He rots and dies in the perplexities of the four Vedas. ||237||
DEFINE	para 59918	hir hY KWfu ryqu mih ibKrI hwQI cunI n jwie ] (1377-8, slok, Bgq kbIr jI) har hai khaa Nd rayt meh bikhree haathee chunee na jaa-ay. The Lord is like sugar, scattered in the sand; the elephant cannot pick it up.
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v238	kih kbIr guir BlI buJweI kItI hoie kY Kwie ]238] (1377-8, slok, Bgq kbIr jI) kahi kabeer gur bhalee bujhaa-ee keetee ho-ay kai khaa-ay. ||238||
