RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v241	kih nwmw ikau pweIAY ibnu Bgqhu BgvMqu ]241] (1377-12, slok, Bgq kbIr jI) kahi naamaa ki-o paa-ee-ai bin bhagtahu bhagvant. ||241||
