RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v43	PrIdw hau loVI shu Awpxw qU loVih AMigAwr ]43] (1380-3, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa ha-o lorhee saho aapnaa too lorheh angi-aar. ||43||
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v43	Fareed, I long for my Lord; you long only for the charcoal. ||43||
RECORD	para 60031	PrIdw ieknw Awtw Aglw ieknw nwhI loxu ] (1380-3, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa iknaa aataa aglaa iknaa naahee lon. Fareed, some have lots of flour, while others do not even have salt.
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v44	AgY gey isM\wpsin cotW KwsI kauxu ]44] (1380-4, slok, syK PrId jI) agai ga-ay sinjaapsan chotaa N khaasee ka-un. ||44||
