DEFINE	para 60037	PrIdw iKMQiV myKw AglIAw ijMdu n kweI myK ] (1380-6, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa khintharh maykhaa aglee-aa jind na kaa-ee maykh. Fareed, there are many seams on the patched coat, but there are no seams on the soul.
