RECORD	para 60081	cil cil geIAW pMKIAW ijn@I vswey ql ] (1381-8, slok, syK PrId jI) chal chal ga-ee-aa pankhee-aa N jin Hee vasaa-ay tal. The birds which lived in the pools have flown away and left.
