RECORD	para 60083	PrIdw iet isrwxy Buie svxu kIVw liVE mwis ] (1381-9, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa it siraanay bhu-ay savan keerhaa larhi-o maas. Fareed, a stone will be your pillow, and the earth will be your bed. The worms shall eat into your flesh.
