RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v69	jo sjx Buie Bwru Qy sy ikau Awvih Aju ]69] (1381-11, slok, syK PrId jI) jo sajan bhu-ay bhaar thay say ki-o aavahi aj. ||69||
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v69	Those friends who were a burden on the earth - how can they come today? ||69||
DEFINE	para 60089	PrIdw by invwjw kuiqAw eyh n BlI rIiq ] (1381-12, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa bay nivaajaa kuti-aa ayh na bhalee reet. Fareed: O faithless dog, this is not a good way of life.
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v70	kbhI cil n AwieAw pMjy vKq msIiq ]70] (1381-12, slok, syK PrId jI) kabhee chal na aa-i-aa panjay vakhat maseet. ||70||
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v70	You never come to the mosque for your five daily prayers. ||70||
RECORD	para 60091	auTu PrIdw aujU swij subh invwj gujwir ] (1381-13, slok, syK PrId jI) uth fareedaa ujoo saaj subah nivaaj gujaar. Rise up, Fareed, and cleanse yourself; chant your morning prayer.
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v71	jo isru sWeI nw invY so isru kip auqwir ]71] (1381-13, slok, syK PrId jI) jo sir saaN-ee naa nivai so sir kap utaar. ||71||
