DEFINE	para 60093	jo isru sweI nw invY so isru kIjY kWie ] (1381-14, slok, syK PrId jI) jo sir saa-ee naa nivai so sir keejai kaa N-ay. That head which does not bow to the Lord - what is to be done with that head?
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v72	kuMny hyiT jlweIAY bwlx sMdY Qwie ]72] (1381-14, slok, syK PrId jI) kunnay hayth jalaa-ee-ai baalan sandai thaa-ay. ||72||
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v72	Put it in the fireplace, instead of firewood. ||72||
DEFINE	para 60095	PrIdw ikQY qYfy mwipAw ijn@I qU jixEih ] (1381-15, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa kithai taiday maapi-aa jin Hee too jani-ohi. Fareed, where are your mother and father, who gave birth to you?
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v73	qY pwshu Eie lid gey qUM AjY n pqIxoih ]73] (1381-15, slok, syK PrId jI) tai paashu o-ay lad ga-ay tooN ajai na pateenohi. ||73||
REQUIRE	cauboly mhlw 5 v73	They have left you, but even so, you are not convinced that you shall also have to go. ||73||
RECORD	para 60097	PrIdw mnu mYdwnu kir toey itby lwih ] (1381-16, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa man maidaan kar to-ay tibay laahi. Fareed, flatten out your mind; smooth out the hills and valleys.
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v74	AgY mUil n AwvsI dojk sMdI Bwih ]74] (1381-16, slok, syK PrId jI) agai mool na aavsee dojak sandee bhaahi. ||74||
