DEFINE	cauboly mhlw 5 v89	With each passing day, your life is being stolen away. ||89||
DEFINE	para 60133	PrIdw qnu sukw ipMjru QIAw qlIAW KUMfih kwg ] (1382-12, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa tan sukaa pinjar thee-aa talee-aaN khooNdeh kaag. Fareed, my withered body has become a skeleton; the crows are pecking at my palms.
