RECORD	para 60139	PrIdw gor inmwxI sfu kry inGirAw Gir Awau ] (1382-15, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa gor nimaanee sad karay nighri-aa ghar aa-o. Fareed, the poor grave calls out, "O homeless one, come back to your home.
