RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v95	PrIdw jy qU myrw hoie rhih sBu jgu qyrw hoie ]95] (1382-18, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa jay too mayraa ho-ay raheh sabh jag tayraa ho-ay. ||95||
