RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v96	PrIdw kcY BWfY rKIAY ikcru qweI nIru ]96] (1382-19, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa kachai bhaaNdai rakhee-ai kichar taa-ee neer. ||96||
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v96	Fareed, how long can water be kept in a soft clay pot? ||96||
DEFINE	para 60147	PrIdw mhl insKx rih gey vwsw AwieAw qil ] (1382-19, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa mahal nisakhan reh ga-ay vaasaa aa-i-aa tal. Fareed, the mansions are vacant; those who lived in them have gone to live underground.
RECORD	para 60149	gorW sy inmwxIAw bhsin rUhW mil ] (1383-1, slok, syK PrId jI) goraaN say nimaanee-aa bahsan roohaa N mal. They remain there, in those unhonored graves.
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v97	AwKIN syKw bMdgI clxu Aju ik kil ]97] (1383-1, slok, syK PrId jI) aakhee N saykhaa bandagee chalan aj ke kal. ||97||
RECORD	cauboly mhlw 5 v97	O Shaykh, dedicate yourself to God; you will have to depart, today or tomorrow. ||97||
RECORD	para 60151	PrIdw mauqY dw bMnw eyvY idsY ijau drIAwvY Fwhw ] (1383-2, slok, syK PrId jI) fareedaa ma-utai daa bannaa ayvai disai ji-o daree-aavai dhaahaa. Fareed, the shore of death looks like the river-bank, being eroded away.
DEFINE	para 60152	AgY dojku qipAw suxIAY hUl pvY kwhwhw ] (1383-2, slok, syK PrId jI) agai dojak tapi-aa sunee-ai hool pavai kaahaahaa. Beyond is the burning hell, from which cries and shrieks are heard.
RECORD	para 60153	ieknw no sB soJI AweI ieik iPrdy vyprvwhw ] (1383-3, slok, syK PrId jI) iknaa no sabh sojhee aa-ee ik firday vayparvaahaa. Some understand this completely, while others wander around carelessly.
