RECORD	para 60210	qnu n qpwie qnUr ijau bwlxu hf n bwil ] (1384-9, slok, syK PrId jI) tan na tapaa-ay tanoor ji-o baalan had na baal. Do not heat up your body like an oven, and do not burn your bones like firewood.
