DEFINE	para 60263	gux gwvih byAMq AMqu ieku iqlu nhI pwsI ] (1386-7, svXy, mÚ 5) gun gaavahi bay-ant ant ik til nahee paasee. Countless are those who sing Your Glorious Praises, but they do not know even a tiny bit of Your extent.
