UPHOLD	para 60289	dyhu drsu min cwau Bgiq iehu mnu ThrwvY ] (1387-1, svXy, mÚ 5) dayh daras man chaa-o bhagat ih man thehraavai. My mind yearns for the Blessed Vision of Your Darshan. This mind abides in devotional worship.
RECORD	para 60290	bilE crwgu AMD´wr mih sB kil auDrI iek nwm Drm ] (1387-1, svXy, mÚ 5) bali-o charaag anDh-yaar meh sabh kal uDhree ik naam Dharam. The lamp is lit in the darkness; all are saved in this Dark Age of Kali Yuga, through the One Name and faith in the Dharma.
