RECORD	para 60293	<> siqgur pRswid ] (1387-3) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
RECORD	para 60294	kwcI dyh moh Puin bWDI sT kTor kucIl kuigAwnI ] (1387-4, svXy, mÚ 5) kaachee dayh moh fun baa NDhee sath kathor kucheel kugi-aanee. This body is frail and transitory, and bound to emotional attachment. I am foolish, stone-hearted, filthy and unwise.
RECORD	para 60295	Dwvq BRmq rhnu nhI pwvq pwrbRhm kI giq nhI jwnI ] (1387-4, svXy, mÚ 5) Dhaavat bharmat rahan nahee paavat paarbarahm kee gat nahee jaanee. My mind wanders and wobbles, and will not hold steady. It does not know the state of the Supreme Lord God.
RECORD	para 60296	jobn rUp mwieAw md mwqw ibcrq ibkl bfO AiBmwnI ] (1387-5, svXy, mÚ 5) joban roop maa-i-aa mad maataa bichrat bikal badou abhimaanee. I am intoxicated with the wine of youth, beauty and the riches of Maya. I wander around perplexed, in excessive egotistical pride.
