RECORD	para 60299	sIl Drm dXw suc nwisœ AwieE srin jIA ky dwnI ] (1387-7, svXy, mÚ 5) seel Dharam da-yaa such naasit aa-i-o saran jee-a kay daanee. I have no humility, faith, compassion or purity, but I seek Your Sanctuary, O Giver of life.
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v1	kwrx krx smrQ isrIDr rwiK lyhu nwnk ky suAwmI ]1] (1387-7, svXy, mÚ 5) kaaran karan samrath sireeDhar raakh layho naanak kay su-aamee. ||1||
DEFINE	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v1	The All-powerful Lord is the Cause of causes. O Lord and Master of Nanak, please save me! ||1||
DEFINE	para 60301	kIriq krn srn mnmohn john pwp ibdwrn kau ] (1387-8, svXy, mÚ 5) keerat karan saran manmohan johan paap bidaaran ka-o. The Praises of the Creator, the Enticer of the mind, are potent to destroy sins.
RECORD	para 60302	hir qwrn qrn smrQ sBY ibiD kulh smUh auDwrn sau ] (1387-9, svXy, mÚ 5) har taaran taran samrath sabhai biDh kulah samooh uDhaaran sa-o. The All-powerful Lord is the boat, to carry us across; He saves all our generations.
RECORD	para 60303	icq cyiq Acyq jwin sqsMgiq Brm AMDyr moihE kq DNau ] (1387-9, svXy, mÚ 5) chit chayt achayt jaan satsangat bharam anDhayr mohi-o kat DhaN-u. O my unconscious mind, contemplate and remember Him in the Sat Sangat, the True Congregation. Why are you wandering around, enticed by the darkness of doubt?
RECORD	para 60304	mUrq GrI csw plu ismrn rwm nwmu rsnw sMig lau ] (1387-10, svXy, mÚ 5) moorat gharee chasaa pal simran raam naam rasnaa sang la-o. Remember Him in meditation, for an hour, for a moment, even for an instant. Chant the Name of the Lord with your tongue.
