RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v2	isK´w sMq nwmu Bju nwnk rwm rMig Awqm isau rNau ]2] (1387-11, svXy, mÚ 5) sikh-yaa sant naam bhaj naanak raam rang aatam si-o ra N-u. ||2||
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v2	Chant and vibrate the Name of the Lord, O Nanak, through the Teachings of the Saints. Meditate on the Lord with love in your soul. ||2||
