RECORD	para 60308	Kwn pwn soDy suK BuMcq sMkt kwit ibpiq hrI ] (1387-12, svXy, mÚ 5) khaan paan soDhay sukh bhu Nchat sankat kaat bipat haree. He eats and drinks, and enjoys pleasures; his pains are taken away, and his suffering is gone.
DEFINE	para 60309	mwq ipqw BweI Aru bMDp bUJn kI sB sUJ prI ] (1387-13, svXy, mÚ 5) maat pitaa bhaa-ee ar banDhap boojhan kee sabh soojh paree. He is given the understanding to recognize mother, father, siblings and relatives.
RECORD	para 60310	brDmwn hovq idn pRiq inq Awvq inkit ibKMm jrI ] (1387-13, svXy, mÚ 5) baraDhmaan hovat din parat nit aavat nikat bikhamm jaree. He grows day by day, as the horrible specter of old age comes closer and closer.
RECORD	para 60311	ry gun hIn dIn mwieAw ik®m ismir suAwmI eyk GrI ] (1387-14, svXy, mÚ 5) ray gun heen deen maa-i-aa kiram simar su-aamee ayk gharee. You worthless, petty worm of Maya - remember your Lord and Master, at least for an instant!
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v3	kru gih lyhu ik®pwl ik®pw iniD nwnk kwit BrMm BrI ]3] (1387-14, svXy, mÚ 5) kar geh layho kirpaal kirpaa niDh naanak kaat bharamm bharee. ||3||
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v3	Please take Nanak's hand, O Merciful Ocean of Mercy, and take away this heavy load of doubt. ||3||
RECORD	para 60313	ry mn mUs iblw mih grbq krqb krq mhW muGnW ] (1387-15, svXy, mÚ 5) ray man moos bilaa meh garbat kartab karat mahaa N mughnaa N. O mind, you are a mouse, living in the mousehole of the body; you are so proud of yourself, but you act like an absolute fool.
RECORD	para 60314	sMpq dol Jol sMig JUlq mwieAw mgn BRmq GuGnw ] (1387-16, svXy, mÚ 5) sampat dol jhol sang jhoolat maa-i-aa magan bharmat ghughnaa. You swing in the swing of wealth, intoxicated with Maya, and you wander around like an owl.
RECORD	para 60315	suq binqw swjn suK bMDp qw isau mohu biFE su Gnw ] (1387-16, svXy, mÚ 5) sut banitaa saajan sukh banDhap taa si-o moh badhi-o so ghanaa. You take pleasure in your children, spouse, friends and relatives; your emotional attachment to them is increasing.
RECORD	para 60316	boieE bIju AhM mm AMkuru bIqq AauD krq AGnW ] (1387-17, svXy, mÚ 5) bo-i-o beej aha N mam ankur beetat a-oDh karat aghnaa N. You have planted the seeds of egotism, and the sprout of possessiveness has come up. You pass your life making sinful mistakes.
RECORD	para 60317	imrqu mMjwr pswir muKu inrKq BuMcq Bugiq BUK BuKnw ] (1387-17, svXy, mÚ 5) mirat manjaar pasaar mukh nirkhat bhu Nchat bhugat bhookh bhukhnaa. The cat of death, with his mouth wide-open, is watching you. You eat food, but you are still hungry.
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v4	ismir gupwl dieAwl sqsMgiq nwnk jgu jwnq supnw ]4] (1387-18, svXy, mÚ 5) simar gupaal da-i-aal satsangat naanak jag jaanat supnaa. ||4||
DEFINE	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v4	Meditate in remembrance on the Merciful Lord of the World, O Nanak, in the Sat Sangat, the True Congregation. Know that the world is just a dream. ||4||
RECORD	para 60320	dyh n gyh n nyh n nIqw mwieAw mq khw lau gwrhu ] (1388-1, svXy, mÚ 5) dayh na gayh na nayh na neetaa maa-i-aa mat kahaa la-o gaarahu. Neither body, nor house, nor love last forever. You are intoxicated with Maya; how long will you be proud of them?
RECORD	para 60321	CqR n pqR n caur n cwvr bhqI jwq irdY n ibcwrhu ] (1388-1, svXy, mÚ 5) chhatar na patar na cha-ur na chaavar bahtee jaat ridai na bichaarahu. Neither crown, nor canopy, nor servants last forever. You do not consider in your heart that your life is passing away.
REQUIRE	para 60322	rQ n AsÍ n gj isMGwsn iCn mih iqAwgq nWg isDwrhu ] (1388-2, svXy, mÚ 5) rath na asav na gaj singhaasan chhin meh ti-aagat naa Ng siDhaarahu. Neither chariots, nor horses, nor elephants or royal thrones shall last forever. In an instant, you will have to leave them, and depart naked.
RECORD	para 60323	sUr n bIr n mIr n Kwnm sMig n koaU idRsit inhwrhu ] (1388-3, svXy, mÚ 5) soor na beer na meer na khaanam sang na ko-oo darisat nihaarahu. Neither warrior, nor hero, nor king or ruler last forever; see this with your eyes.
RECORD	para 60324	kot n Et n kos n Cotw krq ibkwr doaU kr Jwrhu ] (1388-3, svXy, mÚ 5) kot na ot na kos na chhotaa karat bikaar do-oo kar jhaarahu. Neither fortress, nor shelter, nor treasure will save you; doing evil deeds, you shall depart empty-handed.
RECORD	para 60325	imqR n puqR klqR swjn sK aultq jwq ibrK kI CWrhu ] (1388-4, svXy, mÚ 5) mitar na putar kaltar saajan sakh ultat jaat birakh kee chhaaNrahu. Friends, children, spouses and friends - none of them last forever; they change like the shade of a tree.
RECORD	para 60326	dIn dXwl purK pRB pUrn iCn iCn ismrhu Agm Apwrhu ] (1388-5, svXy, mÚ 5) deen da-yaal purakh parabh pooran chhin chhin simrahu agam apaarahu. God is the Perfect Primal Being, Merciful to the meek; each and every instant, meditate in remembrance on Him, the Inaccessible and Infinite.
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v5	sRIpiq nwQ srix nwnk jn hy BgvMq ik®pw kir qwrhu ]5] (1388-5, svXy, mÚ 5) sareepat naath saran naanak jan hay bhagvant kirpaa kar taarahu. ||5||
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v5	O Great Lord and Master, servant Nanak seeks Your Sanctuary; please shower him with Your Mercy, and carry him across. ||5||
RECORD	para 60328	pRwn mwn dwn mg john hIqu cIqu dy ly ly pwrI ] (1388-6, svXy, mÚ 5) paraan maan daan mag johan heet cheet day lay lay paaree. I have used up my breath of life, sold my self-respect, begged for charity, committed highway robbery, and dedicated my consciousness to the love and pursuit of acquiring wealth.
RECORD	para 60329	swjn sYn mIq suq BweI qwhU qy ly rKI inrwrI ] (1388-6, svXy, mÚ 5) saajan sain meet sut bhaa-ee taahoo tay lay rakhee niraaree. I have kept it secretly hidden from my friends, relatives, companions, children and siblings.
RECORD	para 60330	Dwvn pwvn kUr kmwvn ieh ibiD krq AauD qn jwrI ] (1388-7, svXy, mÚ 5) Dhaavan paavan koor kamaavan ih biDh karat a-oDh tan jaaree. I ran around practicing falsehood, burning up my body and growing old.
UPHOLD	para 60331	krm Drm sMjm suc nymw cMcl sMig sgl ibiD hwrI ] (1388-8, svXy, mÚ 5) karam Dharam sanjam such naymaa chanchal sang sagal biDh haaree. I gave up good deeds, righteousness and Dharma, self-discipline, purity, religious vows and all good ways; I associated with the fickle Maya.
