DEFINE	para 61131	mwxU GlY auTI clY ] (1412-6, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) maanoo ghalai uthee chalai. The mortals are sent into the world; then, they arise and depart.
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v24	swdu nwhI ievyhI glY ]24] (1412-6, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) saad naahee ivayhee galai. ||24||
DEFINE	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v24	There is no joy in this. ||24||
RECORD	para 61133	rwmu JurY dl mylvY AMqir blu AiDkwr ] (1412-6, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) raam jhurai dal maylvai antar bal aDhikaar. Raam Chand, sad at heart, assembled his army and forces.
RECORD	para 61134	bMqr kI sYnw syvIAY min qin juJu Apwru ] (1412-7, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) bantar kee sainaa sayvee-ai man tan jujh apaar. The army of monkeys was at his service; his mind and body became eager for war.
UPHOLD	para 61135	sIqw lY gieAw dhisro lCmxu mUE srwip ] (1412-7, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) seetaa lai ga-i-aa dehsiro lachhman moo-o saraap. Raawan captured his wife Sita, and Lachhman was cursed to die.
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v25	nwnk krqw krxhwru kir vyKY Qwip auQwip ]25] (1412-8, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) naanak kartaa karanhaar kar vaykhai thaap uthaap. ||25||
DEFINE	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v25	O Nanak, the Creator Lord is the Doer of all; He watches over all, and destroys what He has created. ||25||
RECORD	para 61137	mn mih JUrY rwmcMdu sIqw lCmx jogu ] (1412-8, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) man meh jhoorai raamchand seetaa lachhman jog. In his mind, Raam Chand mourned for Sita and Lachhman.
RECORD	para 61138	hxvMqru AwrwiDAw AwieAw kir sMjogu ] (1412-9, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) hanvantar aaraaDhi-aa aa-i-aa kar sanjog. Then, he remembered Hanuman the monkey-god, who came to him.
DEFINE	para 61139	BUlw dYqu n smJeI iqin pRB kIey kwm ] (1412-9, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) bhoolaa dait na samjha-ee tin parabh kee-ay kaam. The misguided demon did not understand that God is the Doer of deeds.
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v26	nwnk vyprvwhu so ikrqu n imteI rwm ]26] (1412-10, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) naanak vayparvaahu so kirat na mit-ee raam. ||26||
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v26	O Nanak, the actions of the Self-existent Lord cannot be erased. ||26||
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v27	lwhOr shru jhru khru svw phru ]27] (1412-10, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 1) laahour sahar jahar kahar savaa pahar. ||27||
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v27	The city of Lahore suffered terrible destruction for four hours. ||27||
RECORD	para 61142	mhlw 3 ] (1412-11) mehlaa 3. Third Mehl:
RECORD	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v28	lwhOr shru AMimRq sru isPqI dw Gru ]28] (1412-11, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 3) laahour sahar amrit sar siftee daa ghar. ||28||
DEFINE	svXy sRI muKbwk´ mhlw 5 v28	The city of Lahore is a pool of ambrosial nectar, the home of praise. ||28||
RECORD	para 61144	mhlw 1 ] (1412-12) mehlaa 1. First Mehl:
