RECORD	para 61162	salok mehlaa 3 Shalok, Third Mehl:
RECORD	para 61163	<> siqgur pRswid ] (1413-1) ik-oNkaar satgur parsaad. One Universal Creator God. By The Grace Of The True Guru:
DEFINE	para 61164	AiBAwgq eyh n AwKIAih ijn kY mn mih Brmu ] (1413-2, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 3) abhi-aagat ayh na aakhee-ahi jin kai man meh bharam. Do not call the wandering beggars holy men, if their minds are filled with doubt.
