RECORD	slok mhlw 3 v1	Whoever gives to them, O Nanak, earns the same sort of merit. ||1||
RECORD	para 61166	ABY inrMjn prm pdu qw kw BIKku hoie ] (1413-3, slok vwrW qy vDIk, mÚ 3) abhai niranjan param pad taa kaa bheekhak ho-ay. One who begs for the supreme status of the Fearless and Immaculate Lord
