RECORD	Scope and uncertainty	Scope and uncertainty
RECORD	para 279	This is a synthesis for learning and preliminary modeling, not a substitute for a mission-specific atmosphere product or operational space-weather forecast. Upper-atmosphere values vary substantially with location, local time, season, solar activity, geomagnetic forcing, and chosen scientific definition. Where a single typical number is shown, it is illustrative rather than universal.
